window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3001,"title":"Chapter 3001 Heavenly Tail Manipulation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3001 Heavenly Tail Manipulation!","....","The larger the scale of the World Cleansing triggered by a fey’s evolution, the stronger their potential was. It was so strong to a state that even the world could not tolerate it. Genius was in such a state.","However, with Autumn and Winter by its side, Genius could easily pass the World Cleansing, regardless of how large the scale was.","In the sky, over a dozen black holes appeared, continuously unleashing dark purple thunderbolts. The thunderbolts gave off a very viscous feeling, but Winter took the lead in blocking them.","The long tail behind Genius flashed with a dreamy brilliance. This brilliance was a manifestation of the extreme density of spiritual energy and soul energy. In the past, despite having a tail longer than its body, Genius’s chubby body still gave off a cute vibe. But now, its body suddenly became thinner.","At present, Genius could be described as handsome at a glance, as if he had transformed from a youth into a young man in an instant.","All of this was just the beginning. The long tail behind Genius began to split. Each of its long tails completely shed their previous state between illusion and reality and became an illusory object formed by spiritual and soul power.","At that moment, Genius’ grade and quality had clearly advanced.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check Genius’ grade evolution.","Genius had finally reached Sovereign I/Immortal IX and its new ability was called Heavenly Tail Manipulation.","[Heavenly Tail Manipulation]: Each Heavenly Tail condensed from spirit and soul is like a separate entity, capable of operating like an arm. The operation and usage are almost the same as one’s arm.","Seeing Genius’ newly acquired ability, Lin Yuan couldn’t help but be taken aback for a moment. Then, a look of pleasant surprise spread across his face.","If each of Genius’ tails condensed from spirit and soul was equivalent to an independent entity, then these tails were like smart clones that could concoct potions like Genius.","Previously, Genius was equivalent to a Grade 4 Creator. This time, Genius’ Creator abilities would definitely increase. If Genius reached the level of a Grade 5 Creator, its ability to produce potions would be equivalent to that of over 50 Grade 5 Creators combined.","Lin Yuan examined Genius’ tails and found a total of 54 of them. In the future, as Genius’ spiritual and soul energy increased, the number of heavenly tails condensed behind Genius would also increase. This ability would allow Sky City to have a massive collection of Creator resources, completely solving Sky City’s lack of Creator resources.","Even so, Lin Yuan still had to recruit more high-grade Creators to join Sky City. The ability of a high-grade Creator extended far beyond mere potions concocting.","Lin Yuan continued to check Genius’ new Immortal exclusive skill, Spiritual and Soul Enhancement.","[Spiritual and Soul Enhancement]: Infuse one’s own spiritual and soul energy into the contractor, enhancing the contractor’s inherent spiritual and soul energy. These spirit and soul energy can give the contractor the same analytical ability as oneself for a short period of time.","Genius’ Spiritual and Soul Enhancement was somewhat similar to Spiritual Energy Expansion. However, Spiritual Energy Expansion enhanced Lin Yuan’s mental reserve using his own spiritual energy. When injured, Lin Yuan could rely on this reserve to resist and defend himself. On the other hand, Spiritual and Soul Enhancement involved not only spiritual energy but also soul energy.","In fact, the greatest advantage of Spiritual and Soul Enhancement was not only that it enhanced Lin Yuan’s spirit and soul energy but also gave him the same analytical ability as Genius. When he encountered trouble, Lin Yuan would use it to help him think and solve many problems.","After Zhi Ling realized that more than half of the energy she had accumulated had been used up, she could not help but say awkwardly, “Master, I misjudged the situation. It seems that evolving one grade and quality is the limit!”","Before Lin Yuan could reply, Autumn suddenly spoke. “Young Master, you’ve put away the Business Flourishing Flower in advance. Now, the energy that should have been bestowed upon it is gathering here. This energy is compatible with Genius’s energy. It should be able to be absorbed by Genius. I can try to gather these energies together.","“If Genius can absorb the energy that should belong to the Business Flourishing Flower, even if it is unable to reach World Emperor, it’s still possible for its quality to increase from Immortal to Eternal!”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan’s heart stirred. “Autumn, if you can do this, try to absorb the energy of the Business Flourishing Flower for Genius. It will be of great help to me if Genius’ quality improves again.”","Before proposing this to Lin Yuan, Autumn had already assessed his own abilities. If he wasn’t confident he could do it, he wouldn’t have mentioned it to Lin Yuan.","Autumn circulated the energy in his body and released it into the environment. He separated the energy that should have been given to the Business Flourishing Flower and lured it to Genius.","Winter glanced up at Autumn. The latter acted impulsively but was extremely intelligent; this was something that Winter hadn’t considered before. The energy that should have belonged to the Business Flourishing Flower gathered here as Genius evolved, indicating compatibility between the energies. Perhaps this could indeed help Genius improve!","Winter had always considered himself to have exceptional knowledge, but at this moment, he increasingly felt that he couldn’t fully comprehend Genius. If he had not seen it with his own eyes, Winter would not have believed that such a fey existed. Even if Lin Yuan was the reincarnation of the Saint, nurturing such a fey was truly astonishing.","Lin Yuan could no longer see the upper limit of his growth in this life. This was a good thing for Winter. As a follower, he was excited to witness Lin Yuan’s growth.","The energy that should have belonged to the Business Flourishing Flower was drawn to Genius. Although Genius’ conversion rate of this energy was not as high as the energy released by Zhi Ling, it was still able to absorb the energy.","Zhi Ling released energy that was a mixture of spirit and soul. The energy that should have belonged to the Business Flourishing Flower and pure spirit qi were supplied to Genius in large amounts, allowing Genius to show signs of improvement once again.","As time passed, the energy released from Zhi Ling’s body was depleted. Genius had evolved from Immortal IX to the pinnacle Immortal IX, just a step away from Eternal.","Lin Yuan held his breath, feeling very nervous. He thought that he had to increase the energy of the Business Flourishing Flower and let Genius successfully complete its transformation.","If Genius remained stuck at the pinnacle Immortal IX and could not step into Eternal as he wished, it would be very difficult for Genius to enhance in quality unless it obtained such a huge opportunity in the future again.","Lin Yuan’s expectations were not in vain. The moment the Business Flourishing Flower’s energy was exhausted, Genius attracted the World Cleansing again. This time, Genius did not undergo many changes, but it obtained another exclusive skill that surprised Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check Genius again.","[Fey Name]: Highest Access Fate-Knowing Beast","[Fey Species]: Fantasy-cat-genus/fantasy-cat-species","[Fey Grade]: High Sovereign (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Spiritual/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Eternal","Abilities:","[Memory Deduction]: When recalling something, it will be able to remember every minuscule detail. From this, it will be able to organize the information and infer the truth.","[Crowded Cat]: If it can control cat-species feys and convince the cats to crowd around it, it will be able to become affiliated with all of the cat-species feys’ elements and bodies. Every time the cat-species feys crowded around, it will be weak for some time.","[Spiritual Energy Expansion]: Transfer the spiritual energy into an emergency bank for the contractor. Even though the contractor cannot willfully use Spiritual Energy Expansion to increase his own store of spiritual energy, he can use it to defend himself against spiritual energy damage.","[Master of Cats]: As the new leader of cat-species feys, it can use spiritual energy to form contracts with other cat-species feys, control their lives, and share in their spiritual power.","[Soul Permutation]: Use and change different spiritual energies into soul power.","[Tail Trigger]: When using soul power, a tail can be sacrificed to increase the soul power. Without any tails, Tail Trigger cannot be used.","[True Knowledge Analysis]: Use spiritual energy to envelop an entity and the composition of the entity will be analyzed. Entities that have been combined will be analyzed separately. After the analysis, there will be a confirmation from the heavenly will to ascertain accuracy.","[Comprehensive Deduction]: After using the True Knowledge Analysis to analyze something, it is possible to anchor many things that have been analyzed by the True Knowledge Analysis at the same time and use the revelations of the heavens to infer the corresponding connection between these things.","[Heavenly Tail Manipulation]: Each Heavenly Tail condensed from spirit and soul is like a separate entity, capable of operating like an arm. The operation and usage are almost the same as one’s arm.","Exclusive Skill:","[Tool Transformation]: Capable of transforming into a tool for the contractor to use.","[Tail of Fate]: 1. Connected Tails: According to the number of tails, lives can be connected. The connected lives can share thinking and intention. 2. Highest Access Tail: Combine all the tails into one. If it craves for knowledge enough, it can sacrifice its spiritual energy to communicate with the heavens and request for an answer.","[Sky Fate Attachment]: The affiliation with heavenly will will be deepened and the fate of the heavenly will will be attached to it to elevate its chances of success when concocting spirit fluids or when performing other actions.","[Linked Fate Protection]: Link the fate of the cat-species lifeforms under its control with fortune. A network will be formed that will protect all the cat-species lifeforms. When the cat-species lifeforms under its protection are evolved, its own spiritual energy will increase and its store of spiritual energy will increase as well.","[Spiritual and Soul Enhancement]: Infuse one’s own spiritual and soul energy into the contractor, enhancing the contractor’s inherent spiritual and soul energy. These spirit and soul energy can give the contractor the same analytical ability as oneself for a short period of time.","[Sky Fate Fortune Flood]: When the success rate of concocting the spirit fluid and forging is increased by the Sky Fate Attachment, there is a certain chance that it will be favored by the fortune flood, enhancing the level of the spiritual liquid or item.","Apart from being Sky City’s largest information repository, Genius was also an outstanding Creator and the leader of a Creator organization.","The Sky Fate Fortune Flood directly increased Genius’ Creator-related abilities, giving Genius a chance to create Creator resources that were one grade higher than itself.","The success rate of Sky Fate Attachment was not high, to begin with, so the success rate of Sky Fate Fortune Flood must be even lower. However, it was an exclusive skill capable of transcending grades.","If Genius successfully evolved to a Grade 5 Creator, Genius would have a chance to concoct a potion that only a Grade 6 Creator could concoct and create a precious instrument like the Palm of Blessed Land. There was a possibility it could create a Palm of Blessed Land that could store high-grade blessed lands!","Genius jumped into Lin Yuan’s arms and said excitedly, “Yuan, I feel that my spirit and soul have been greatly enhanced. I plan to enter seclusion for some time to see if I can improve my Creator ability. I’ll have to use more of the resources you collected when I’m in seclusion!”","Lin Yuan rubbed Genius’ head. “Genius, it will be much easier for me to obtain resources in the future. Moreover, there are many resources in this blessed land for you to consume. You can use it however you want. There’s no need to save. This time during your seclusion, I’ll ensure to provide you with a quiet environment. Let me know about your achievements once your seclusion ends!”","Genius had always worked extremely hard on Lin Yuan’s side. This time, its grade had increased by a large level, and its quality had increased by two large levels. There were many things that Genius did not understand before, but now, it could detect and dig into many areas that were previously unknown. This seclusion could take at least a few months or even a few years.","Lin Yuan looked at the time after putting Genius back into the Spirit Lock spatial zone and said, “Zhi Ling, gather all the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. I’ll arrange a place for them to go. Otherwise, it would be too conspicuous for you to follow me like this!”","Lin Yuan knew the value of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. If news of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies spread, the other powerful species would also be able to see their value. Lin Yuan did not want to cause unnecessary trouble because of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. It was better for species like them to stay hidden.","Their growth also required absorbing pure spirit qi. An environment like the Spirit Lock spatial zone with a high concentration of pure spirit qi could help the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to rapidly progress."]},{"number":3002,"title":"Chapter 3002 The Surprised Zhong Zhiyu!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3002 The Surprised Zhong Zhiyu!","....","It wasn’t just Zhi Ling, the Insect Queen, but the entire Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies were Lin Yuan’s core unit. The value of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to the management of the faction was actually not inferior to the Hundred Questions Beasts.","There was nothing wrong with letting the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Zhi Ling received the message from Genius. Not only did she know that the outside world was rich and fantastic, but she also became aware of the dangers of the outside world.","If it wasn’t necessary, Zhi Ling didn’t want to bring unnecessary trouble to the species. Its safety was the primary concern for Zhi Ling as the manager.","As an intellectually gifted individual with a frail physique, Zhi Ling inherently disliked being in the limelight.","“Lord, I’ll listen to your arrangements and let you make the decision. I’ll gather the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies immediately. You only need to give me a few minutes.”","At this point, Zhi Ling paused for a moment before continuing. “Lord, our Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies have many new members who can only grow in the blessed land. Without the nourishment of the blessed land’s environment, I’m afraid that they won’t be able to successfully leave their embryo state.”","Upon hearing her words, Lin Yuan muttered to himself, “When the time comes, I’ll use the Palm of Blessed Land to carry this mid-grade blessed land. Those embryonic Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies can just stay in the blessed land and hatch themselves.","“The environment I provide for you is better than this mid-grade blessed land. It’s more beneficial to your entire species. There’s no need for you to stay in this mid-grade blessed land!”","There was only pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. However, the composition of energy in this blessed land was extremely complex. Lin Yuan was not sure if pure spirit qi alone could induce the hatching of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly embryos.","Lin Yuan did not want to take this risk. Not to mention that if Lin Yuan forced Zhi Ling to bring the unhatched embryos into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, causing them to be unable to hatch, it would affect the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ expansion and would be detrimental to Sky City’s development. Lin Yuan would also lose trust in Zhi Ling because of his decision.","Lin Yuan, who was used to being in a superior position, would consider all aspects of the problem and would not do such one-sided things.","While Zhi Ling gathered the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, Autumn went outside the blessed land to investigate the situation of the factions that had been subdued and returned to Coiling Dragon Mountain.","There were indeed some factions that had returned to Coiling Dragon Mountain, but these factions that had returned were bustling with activity.","As a Grade 5 Creator, Zhong Zhiyu had already arrived at Coiling Dragon Mountain with his men.","After investigating the situation, Autumn said, “Young Master, I don’t know how long it will take for the whole species to return. Zhong Zhiyu has already arrived. Young Master, why don’t you bring Zhong Zhiyu back to Sky City first? I’ll wait here for a while and bring the various species back to Sky City before returning to Treasure City.”","Upon hearing his words, Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows. Zhong Zhiyu was really fast and had returned within less than five days.","Lin Yuan was in a hurry to return to Sky City to hold the Astronomical Parliament. Ever since Wen Yu had contracted the Hundred Questions Beast and continuously nurtured it with the help of the Star Vastness Peony, the Astronomical Parliament had been open for more than 20 minutes.","The Astronomical Parliament was of great strategic importance to Lin Yuan’s development in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. He did not want to delay it.","“Autumn, I’ll have to trouble you to stay here. If a sudden situation or special problem arises in some factions, you can resolve it yourself!”","While Lin Yuan and Autumn were talking, Zhi Ling had already brought the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to stand beside Lin Yuan.","Upon seeing that Lin Yuan and Autumn had finished their conversation, Zhi Ling said, “Lord, including me, a total of 824 people are already standing in front of you, not counting the 93 unhatched embryos in our Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies!”","Before Lin Yuan controlled Zhi Ling, the other members of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly were full of hostility toward Lin Yuan. Now, these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies were fearful, respectful, and curious toward him.","Lin Yuan brought Zhi Ling and the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Zhi Ling was very curious about the better environment that Lin Yuan mentioned. According to the knowledge that Lin Yuan had transmitted to her, mid-grade blessed lands were already the best environment in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Now that she had entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Zhi Ling could not help but tremble when she sensed the extremely pure spirit qi pervading the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","It wasn’t just Zhi Ling, the other Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies also shared the same feelings. Since becoming Lin Yuan’s subordinate, it was the one time when Lin Yuan had given her a huge shock.","Previously, Lin Yuan had used martial force to subdue Zhi Ling. Now, Lin Yuan had used resources to shock Zhi Ling and make her understand more clearly the benefits of following by his side. The benefits that could be seen and touched were often more captivating.","“How is it? The environment here can allow the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to grow quickly, right? From now on, I can promise that every member of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies that has been hatched will be able to enhance their strength to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom here before working as a manager for me.”","Zhi Ling said happily, “Lord, thank you for your reward. I will take good care of the members here!”","Lin Yuan contacted Hu Quan and asked him to arrange accommodations for the 800 Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. After doing all this, Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone and took out the Palm of Blessed Land that Yi He had given him to store the mid-grade blessed land.","Lin Yuan looked at the Palm of Blessed Land in his hand and inwardly thought that he had gained a lot from this trip to Coiling Dragon Mountain.","When he returned to Sky City this time, Lin Yuan’s gains would allow Sky City to undergo a revolution. With two Grade 5 Creators in his hands, Lin Yuan could be considered a powerful faction in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Autumn waited for the factions under Lin Yuan’s control to return to Coiling Dragon Mountain while Winter followed Lin Yuan to see Zhong Zhiyu.","Zhong Zhiyu had changed into a set of clothes. He was as low-key and luxurious as before.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Zhong Zhiyu greeted him.","Previously, it had been very difficult for Zhong Zhiyu to act like a subordinate in front of Lin Yuan. However, in the past few days, Zhong Zhiyu had already adjusted his mentality and obtained an endless lifespan to resolve one of his worries. Moreover, to have his life and death held in someone else’s hands left him with little dignity to uphold.","Zhong Zhiyu had not interacted with Lin Yuan for long, but he could sense that Lin Yuan was not a difficult person to interact with. Moreover, Lin Yuan had not displayed a lofty and arrogant attitude when facing him previously.","Zhong Zhiyu had just returned to Coiling Dragon Mountain and upon learning that Lin Yuan had entered a mid-grade blessed land, he went to investigate the current situation in Coiling Dragon Mountain.","When Zhong Zhiyu realized that the major factions of Coiled Dragon Mountain had either been killed or controlled by Lin Yuan, he could not help but sigh inwardly. Lin Yuan was truly bold. He actually dared to attack numerous factions at the same time.","What kind of confidence did he possess to do such a thing? Even Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator, did not dare to do so!","Lin Yuan smiled when he saw Zhong Zhiyu greet him, “It will take some time to settle the matters here. There’s no need for us to wait here. Follow me back to Sky City. I’ll introduce the core members of Sky City to you when we return.”","Zhong Zhiyu had heard Lin Yuan mention Sky City before and was very curious about it. He had already gathered from Lin Yuan’s words that the Sky City was a faction established by him, who hadn’t even lived for fifty years. This meant that Sky City had only existed for a few decades.","Zhong Zhiyu was very curious about how far a faction that had been around for decades could develop.","“Young Master, when I meet the core members of Sky City, I promise to get along well with them. For the past two to three months, the people from Faerie Institution have been harassing me, asking me to help investigate the information of a lower faerie. Once I leave this time, I can finally hide in peace.”","When he mentioned Faerie Institution, Zhong Zhiyu’s tone was clearly filled with disgust. It was clear that it must have something to do with the overbearing behavior of Faerie Institution.","Faerie Institution didn’t usually operate in the East Universe. This place wasn’t far from the place where the Emerald Lady appeared. Could it be that the lower faerie Faerie Institution sent Zhong Zhiyu to investigate was none other than Emerald Lady? Lin Yuan believed this was highly probable.","This place was very far from North of Lonely River. The people from Faerie Institution should not be able to reach it. Moreover, even if they really found North of the Lonely River, Spring and Summer would not let Faerie Institution cross it.","Winter brought Lin Yuan, Zhong Zhiyu, and Zhong Zhiyu’s retainers along.","Zhong Zhiyu originally thought that the Sky City that Lin Yuan mentioned would be located in a prosperous place, but to his surprise, the destination he rushed toward seemed to be so remote that it could already be considered a barren land. Any factions with dreams should not have set their sights on developing in this place.","Major factions needed resources to develop, so it was impossible for Lin Yuan not to be aware of such common sense.","Although he was curious, Zhong Zhiyu did not ask further. He thought that his curiosity would be easily resolved when they arrived. However, Winter continued to lead them to an even more barren area, the barrenness there could already be described as desolate compared to the outside world. Usually, only those who were ostracized or targeted by powerful enemies would come to such a place to hide.","Zhong Zhiyu could not help but ask Lin Yuan, “Young Master, how far are we from Sky City?”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “We’re almost there. Have you heard of the Lonely River? Sky City is in North of the Lonely River!”","Zhong Zhiyu was shocked when he heard Lin Yuan’s words.","What?! North of the Lonely River?! It was not a place where a faction could stay!?","Zhong Zhiyu harbored no doubts about Lin Yuan’s strength, but he could not approve of North of the Lonely River. Could there be something special about North of the Lonely River?!","Thousands of years ago, Zhong Zhiyu had visited North of the Lonely River. In his impression, there was nothing special about it.","When the retainers behind Zhong Zhiyu heard Lin Yuan’s words, they could not help but start discussing.","Upon hearing the discussions of the retainers, Zhong Zhiyu glared at them.","If any of his retainers offended Lin Yuan and jeopardized the relationship between him and Lin Yuan, Zhong Zhiyu did not mind getting rid of them. In Zhong Zhiyu’s eyes, these retainers that he had nurtured were just tools.","Lin Yuan did not pay much attention to Zhong Zhiyu’s retainers’ discussion. He believed that his arrangements in North of the Lonely River would shock Zhong Zhiyu.","Back then, Lin Yuan had chosen North of the Lonely River because it was the most suitable place for the faith country plan as building a faith country in a remote corner of North of the Lonely River would not attract the attention of other factions. If it had been anywhere else, the news of Lin Yuan building a faith country would have spread.","Even if Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were around, who knew how many factions would harass them every day. Once something happened, it would affect the output of faith power in the faith country. It was not as stable as this area in North of the Lonely River.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had many higher faeries. Coupled with legendary treasures like the Breath Soil, the environment in North of the Lonely River was not as bad as Zhong Zhiyu had imagined.","The moment he arrived at the Lonely River, Zhong Zhiyu narrowed his eyes when he saw the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds planted at the edge of the Lonely River. Zhong Zhiyu had never seen a plant-type fey like Thriving Summer Rising Cloud before.","Its growth power was different from ordinary plant-type feys and it was more like a carcinoma fey. However, it was not as chaotic as the energy in the carcinoma fey’s body.","Lin Yuan’s face also showed a surprised expression upon seeing these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds.","Before Lin Yuan left, Summer started to plant the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds.","He had only walked for a short while, but these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds were climbing towards the sky from underground. Each of them used the branches of other Thriving Summer Rising Clouds as support, winding upwards as if they could touch the sky in the next moment.","Clusters of orange and pink buds bloomed on the tough tree canopy. These flower buds had yet to bloom into gorgeous five-petaled flowers. Once the flowers bloomed and scattered pollen, this Thriving Summer Rising Cloud’s pollen would be able to completely cover the area of North of the Lonely River, allowing North of the Lonely River to hide its figure.","With the growth speed of Thriving Summer Rising Cloud, the flowering should be completed in a few days.","The resources in North of the Lonely River were not enough to nurture these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds.","Zhong Zhiyu thought inwardly that Lin Yuan must have invested a lot in nurturing the Thriving Summer Rising Cloud!","It seemed that Lin Yuan must have modified North of the Lonely River after Sky City took root there.","Just as Zhong Zhiyu was exclaiming in surprise, a beautiful short-haired woman appeared out of thin air in front of Lin Yuan. Zhong Zhiyu had not sensed the aura of this short-haired woman at all, which indicated that she should be an expert of the same level as Autumn and Winter.","Lin Yuan actually had more than two such experts under his command!","At that moment, Zhong Zhiyu felt he had not fully understood Lin Yuan"]},{"number":3003,"title":"Chapter 3003 Higher Faerie!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3003 Higher Faerie!","....","It was not that there were no experts with such strength. Previously, when Zhong Zhiyu met a Grade 6 Creator, he encountered an expert whose strength far exceeded his own.","However, judging from the aura, that expert should be weaker than the three people beside Lin Yuan.","As he had not reached that level, Zhong Zhiyu did not know how weak he was.","However, no matter what, Zhong Zhiyu was shocked that Lin Yuan could have three powerhouses of such strength protecting him at his age!","At that moment, Zhong Zhiyu heard the woman speak to Lin Yuan in a respectful tone, “Young Master, you came back at the right time. I’ve already planted nearly a third of the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds. Because most of these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds are in stock, they can be planted immediately. After that, I want to plant all the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds across two-thirds of the riverbank. It will probably take a few years.","“But luckily, these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds grow extremely quickly. Look, these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds that are planted now will bloom in another day or so. Apart from being able to block the detection of the outside world, the Thriving Summer Rising Cloud’s pollen can also form a dense protective network to prevent the energy inside from dissipating.”","Summer was very satisfied with her results during this period.","During this period, Summer had basically spent all her time cultivating the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds without any rest.","A few days ago, after Spring finished her work, Summer even specially asked Spring to help her.","If Spring had not helped her for a few days, it would not have been so effective!","Summer’s speed could be said to have shocked Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had never thought that Summer would be able to create such a huge scene in just a month!","Lin Yuan had previously thought about bringing the blessed land to North of the Lonely River. The spirit qi and various elemental energies released by a low- and mid-grade blessed land were enough to make the energy in North of the Lonely River higher than that of the outside world!","However, this loss of energy was unavoidable.","Now, Summer was telling him that Thriving Summer Rising Cloud’s pollen could effectively prevent energy from leaking out. This was great news for Lin Yuan!","“Summer, you’ve worked hard during this period. In just a few years, the Thriving Summer Rising Cloud will be able to open the banks of the Lonely River and surround North of the Lonely River. This exceeds my expectations. When you’re done with your work for the next few years, I’ll let you rest well for a while.”","Summer hurriedly said, “Young Master, I’m not tired. Doing these things is nothing to me. You really don’t have to be so polite with me! It’s already my greatest blessing to be by your side!”","When Summer said this, she sounded a little terrified. She felt that Lin Yuan was being distant by saying this to her.","Actually, what Summer was doing now was not as easy as she had said.","However, compared to waiting for Lin Yuan to wake up in Epoch God Palace, her current life was even more fascinating!","When Zhong Zhiyu heard Lin Yuan and Summer’s simple conversation, he had many thoughts. In such a barren place like North of the Lonely River, he actually had to consider the situation of energy leakage. If someone else said this to Zhong Zhiyu, he would definitely think that this person was crazy.","However, this was said by an expert like Summer to Lin Yuan. This made Zhong Zhiyu realize that the environment in North of the Lonely River had been changed by Lin Yuan and it was not simple!","At first, Zhong Zhiyu thought that Summer, Autumn, and Winter were Lin Yuan’s servants and had been sent to protect Lin Yuan. Hence, they addressed Lin Yuan as Young Master. In essence, these people were Lin Yuan’s elders.","However, from their attitudes toward Lin Yuan, it seemed that the actual situation was not that simple. These people treated Lin Yuan with reverence. It was really unusual to treat such a young fellow with such an attitude!","Summer nodded at Zhong Zhiyu after speaking to Lin Yuan.","Summer had an extremely quiet personality and was usually unwilling to speak but she knew that she had to build a good relationship with Lin Yuan’s new retainer.","When Winter saw Summer, he had already explained Zhong Zhiyu’s identity. A Grade 5 Creator was very useful to the current Lin Yuan.","Seeing this, Zhong Zhiyu hurriedly returned Summer’s greeting. In front of Summer, Zhong Zhiyu had no right to be arrogant!","Lin Yuan observed the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds’ growth.","Apart from his Realm Abyss Red Lotus, Lin Yuan had never seen a plant-type creature with such powerful vitality!","After crossing the area with the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds, Lin Yuan summoned Zhi Ling from the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan introduced Zhong Zhiyu and Zhi Ling to each other and prepared to bring them to Sky City.","Coincidentally, they would pass by Four Seasons Mountain on their way to Sky City and would be able to pass by more than half of the faith country. Lin Yuan could use this opportunity to let the two of them understand Sky City’s general situation!","Zhi Ling and Zhong Zhiyu were both smart people. After Lin Yuan took the initiative to introduce them, they quickly became comfortable and tried to figure out each other’s identities.","Lin Yuan looked at the retainers behind Zhong Zhiyu and said to him in an extremely serious tone, “Uncle Zhong, you should have a spatial artifact that can store all your retainers, right?”","Without Lin Yuan saying anything, Zhong Zhiyu understood what he meant. It was obvious that the place that Lin Yuan was going to take him to was not suitable for his retainers.","Zhong Zhiyu patted the brocade bag hanging on his waist and kept all his retainers in it.","After Zhong Zhiyu put away the retainers, Lin Yuan continued to speak to him, “Uncle Zhong, Sky City has many secrets. I believe that your retainers are very loyal to you. I can’t help but worry that they will leak information related to Sky City.","“Therefore, I hope that you will take good care of your retainers in the future. If it is not necessary, even if you leave Sky City to run errands, don’t bring your current retainers with you. You can choose a few members from Sky City that you like and nurture them! There are many outstanding people in Sky City. I don’t think it’s difficult for you to find a few people you like, Uncle Zhong.”","Zhong Zhiyu hurriedly promised, “Young Master, don’t worry. I’ve nurtured these retainers myself. I know their personalities very well. I won’t tell anyone about the situation in Sky City.","“Moreover, you’ve already said that even if I believe that they won’t tell anyone about the situation in Sky City, I won’t let them leave North of the Lonely River! If I can meet someone I like in the future, I will definitely nurture them well! Since I’m already under your command, I won’t do anything to harm you and Sky City!”","Zhong Zhiyu, who had just joined Sky City, felt that he had to make a solemn statement.","With his life in Lin Yuan’s hands, Sky City would become a place that he would serve forever. Zhong Zhiyu was a person who cared a lot about his own interests. He would not do anything that would harm his own interests when he saw reality clearly.","Lin Yuan smiled at Zhong Zhiyu and said, “With Uncle Zhong’s words, I’m relieved! “Sky City has just started. After all, Sky City was founded by me when I was 16 years old. It has only been less than 30 years. Even so, I believe that Sky City will not disappoint you!”","Lin Yuan did not say this to Zhi Ling not because he did not value her, but because Genius had transmitted information to Zhi Ling, and Zhi Ling had a clear understanding of Sky City’s situation!","When they were crossing the faith country, Zhong Zhiyu looked down from the sky. At first, he did not understand the meaning of the faith country and asked Lin Yuan curiously, “Young Master, why did you gather so many wanderers? There’s...”","Before Zhong Zhiyu could finish speaking, he had already probed the situation in the faith country with his spiritual energy.","The people living in the faith country were not troubled by hunger. Everything was in order.","There were even demon insects inside to maintain order! The presence of these demon insects meant that Lin Yuan definitely had a demon insect queen!","Demon insects fed on all species. But in Lin Yuan’s hands, they became tools to help the faction maintain order!","These were all abilities that Lin Yuan had unintentionally revealed.","Now that they had settled the problem of food and shelter, they could produce faith power steadily.","These groups of wanderers from various races coexisted in a complicated manner. Zhong Zhiyu could not estimate how much faith power they would produce!","When Lin Yuan heard Zhong Zhiyu’s sudden stop, he knew that his arrangements for the faith country had once again shocked Zhong Zhiyu.","Lin Yuan turned his head to look at Zhi Ling. Zhi Ling understood the meaning of Lin Yuan’s gaze and began to explain the situation of the faith country to Zhong Zhiyu.","Almost all the major factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were divided into clans. There was no concept of a federation.","The current faith country was very similar to a federation’s situation. However, what appeared now was only the prototype of a federation.","After Zhi Ling’s explanation, Zhong Zhiyu understood Lin Yuan’s grand goal in building the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Zhong Zhiyu was used to seeing the world and was stunned by Lin Yuan’s goal!","It was extremely easy for Grade 5 Creators to obtain faith power. But for Grade 5 Creators, faith power was related to their strength and was extremely precious.","However, if Lin Yuan continued to develop the faith country, they could mass-produce faith power. As long as Lin Yuan was willing, a divine kingdom lifeform could be easily nurtured into a holy spirit!","All of this overturned Zhong Zhiyu’s common sense and understanding!","Zhong Zhiyu asked Lin Yuan in a dry voice,”Has the problem of the acceptance and transmission of faith power been resolved?”","Since Lin Yuan had complete control over Zhong Zhiyu and treated him as a core member of Sky City, there was no need for him to hide Sky City’s secrets from Zhong Zhiyu.","“Uncle Zhong, there was originally a troublesome problem. But a month and a half before we met, this matter had already been perfectly resolved!”","After receiving Lin Yuan’s affirmative answer, Zhong Zhiyu became excited.","After being shocked so many times, Zhong Zhiyu had still underestimated the power behind Lin Yuan and Lin Yuan.","Even if Lin Yuan did not give him an endless lifespan, Zhong Zhiyu would still be willing to join Sky City after knowing about this!","Zhong Zhiyu’s heart had just calmed down because of the faith country. The moment he saw Season Cycle’s main body, it surged again.","“A..a higher faerie? No, this higher faerie has also reached a symbiotic state with the Breath Soil!”","Everything on Four Seasons Mountain was the core of Sky City, but these things were far less shocking than the higher faerie on Four Seasons Mountain and the Cleansing Breath Soil!","Lin Yuan said proudly when he heard Zhong Zhiyu’s gasp, “You’re right. This is Sky City’s own higher faerie! This higher faerie has indeed reached a symbiotic relationship with the Breath Soil. Apart from a higher faerie in Sky City, there are also two intermediate and two lower faeries. They all live on Season Cycle.”","Zhong Zhiyu was already a little numb.","Among the five faeries, there was a higher one. This lineup was similar to the lineup of Faerie Institution stationed in Northern Universe!","Faerie Institution had been looking for faeries everywhere to recruit all of them.","Faerie Institution indeed had the intention to protect the faeries. However, as Faerie Institution developed over the years, it had changed from a force that was spontaneously organized by higher faeries to an armed force. Faerie Institution became more and more domineering and their requirements for the faeries became stricter.","Many faeries were killed by Faerie Institution because they violated the management of Faerie Institution!","This matter caused a huge commotion in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","It was precisely because of this matter that some new faeries were unwilling to join Faerie Institution.","However, Faerie Institution’s approach was too domineering and these newborn faeries could not refuse. These newborn faeries were brought back to Faerie Institution.","Faerie Institution had such strict control over the faeries yet Lin Yuan still had so many of them.","Zhong Zhiyu could not help but wonder if Lin Yuan had any cooperation with Faerie Institution!","If Lin Yuan had cooperated with Faerie Institution, Zhong Zhiyu felt that he had to remind Lin Yuan not to get too close to Faerie Institution.","Lin Yuan was not a faerie and Faerie Institution members would never be sincere in working with him!","Once there was a difference in interests, Faerie Institution would immediately change their attitude. Zhong Zhiyu, who had made a deal with Faerie Institution in the past, had a deep understanding of this!","Zhong Zhiyu did not know the true relationship between Lin Yuan and Faerie Institution so he planned to ask Lin Yuan indirectly when he had the chance. After asking about Lin Yuan’s relationship with Faerie Institution, he would decide what to say to Lin Yuan. He hoped that Lin Yuan would listen to his advice and not think that he was trying to sow discord."]},{"number":3004,"title":"Chapter 3004 Choice for Evolution!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3004 Choice for Evolution!","....","Season Cycle, Begin Lady, Celestial Sight, Emerald Lady, and Gray Pool were all core members of Sky City and enjoyed the best resources in Sky City.","However, the five of them were responsible for production in Sky City and did not manage matters. As a result, none of them attended Sky City’s meeting.","However, Zhi Ling and Zhong Zhiyu would be Sky City’s managers in the future. Lin Yuan would let Zhong Zhiyu manage the other Creators who had been taken into Sky City. Zhong Zhiyu’s Creator ability was undoubtedly the highest among the current Creators in Sky City!","As soon as Lin Yuan entered Sky City’s territory, he used the Thoughts Letter Paper to invite Sky City’s core members for an internal meeting.","Even Bei Xu, who was holding down the presidency at the Lonely River, would attend this meeting.","The purpose of this meeting was to discuss Sky City’s future development and current problems. Secondly, it was to allow Zhi Ling and Zhong Zhiyu to get to know the core members of Sky City as soon as possible so that they could devote themselves to their work.","After Lin Yuan was done with these matters, he would return to being a hands-off boss.","“Young Master, I’d like to meet these faeries first. Will they be willing to meet me?”","Zhong Zhiyu felt that instead of asking Lin Yuan about the faeries, he might as well meet them personally. After meeting these faeries, he would more or less know their backgrounds.","Lin Yuan pointed at the sky in the distance.","“Uncle Zhong, I’ve already informed the core members of Sky City. There will be an internal meeting of Sky City later. You and Ling Dai will both attend this meeting. After the meeting ends, you can meet whoever you want. No one will restrict your freedom!”","When Zhong Zhiyu heard Lin Yuan’s words, many strange emotions arose in his heart.","The fact that he could attend the meeting of Sky City’s core members as soon as he joined Sky City proved his importance. Zhong Zhiyu had already expected Lin Yuan to value him. However, when Lin Yuan truly expressed it, Zhong Zhiyu could not help but feel relieved.","Zhong Zhiyu had thought that since he had just joined Lin Yuan, it was very likely that Lin Yuan would restrict him. It might take a long time to get rid of his wariness.","Unexpectedly, Lin Yuan did not impose too many restrictions on him. Instead, he gave him so much freedom that he could even meet those few faeries at will!","Zhong Zhiyu coughed lightly and said with a smile, “It’s more important to meet the other core members of Sky City first. I’ll prepare a decent meeting gift for every member of Sky City.”","Lin Yuan laughed.","“I believe that Uncle Zhong will be able to build a good relationship with the other members of Sky City. The core members of Sky City are about the same age as me. Even if they’re older, they’re not much older. In front of Uncle Zhong, they’re all juniors. Please take care of them in the future!”","Lin Yuan knew that Zhong Zhiyu could easily see through other people’s lifespans.","Apart from the faeries, the Moon Empress was the oldest among the core members of Sky City.","The Moon Empress was actually not even 100 years old. Her lifespan was not even a fraction of Zhong Zhiyu’s.","The Moon Empress was extremely talented but the best way for ordinary Creators like her to improve their abilities was to obtain the guidance of a high grade Creator.","Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator who was completely under Lin Yuan’s control, would definitely not be the Moon Empress’ Master. Lin Yuan did not want to have another ancestor!","However, Zhong Zhiyu’s ability as a Creator could definitely help the Moon Empress!","Lin Yuan did not doubt Zhong Zhiyu’s financial resources at all when he said that he would prepare a meeting gift for Sky City’s members.","Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator who had just joined Sky City, was willing to take the initiative to express goodwill to the other core members. This could quickly close the relationship between them and help Sky City’s internal unity.","The core members of Sky City were close to each other and they had relationships with each other!","Hearing that Zhong Zhiyu wanted to prepare a gift for the core members of Sky City, Zhi Ling had a similar thought.","However, Zhi Ling quickly dismissed that thought. This was because Zhi Ling did not have many suitable gifts on hand. Furthermore, Zhi Ling felt that as the leader of this organization, she only needed to build a good relationship with Lin Yuan. She would get to know the others sooner or later!","Furthermore, she would be in charge of the management of the faith country in the future. She probably would not have to interact with the core members of Sky City’s other departments!","Even if she used the gift method, firstly, the level of her gift was inferior to Zhong Zhiyu’s.","Secondly, it was very likely that she would attract Zhong Zhiyu’s disgust if she imitated him directly.","Zhong Zhiyu was once again deeply surprised by Lin Yuan’s words.","Why were all the leaders of this faction young people? To a Holy Spirit expert, living for tens of thousands of years was considered young. However, Lin Yuan said that these people were around his age. These two-digit youngsters had actually formed such a large organization together!","Looking in the direction Lin Yuan was pointing at, Zhong Zhiyu could vaguely sense that the clouds in the distant sky were extremely thick.","It was strange that so many thick clouds gathered together and did not disperse.","Zhong Zhiyu had formed such a feeling after intentionally looking in that direction. If Zhong Zhiyu had not specially gone to investigate, the distant sky would not have attracted his attention.","Zhong Zhiyu pondered for a moment and released his aura. However, after releasing his aura, he realized that his aura had been isolated by a barrier before it could touch the clouds.","This barrier did not come from Genius and the Floating Island Whale, but from Spring in Sky City.","Lin Yuan did not ask for Spring, but Spring would usually guard Sky City.","Gray and the Floating Island Whale were both contracted creatures that Lin Yuan had raised since they were young.","When the two sensed Lin Yuan’s aura, the Floating Island Whale and Gray rushed over.","In an instant, Zhong Zhiyu realized that the seemingly harmonious clouds in the sky were actually moving rapidly in his direction. The clouds seemed to be wrapped around a huge creature!","Lin Yuan quickly stopped Genius and the Floating Island Whale.","Lin Yuan was currently standing in the living area of the faith country. If Genius and the Floating Island Whale revealed themselves here, who knew how many people in the faith country would see them!","This might be helpful for the collection of faith power, but the information about Sky City could not be hidden!","Lin Yuan did not want to keep Zhong Zhiyu in suspense so he took out two tentacles of the Ethereal Jellyfish.","He handed one to Zhong Zhiyu and one to Zhi Ling.","“Uncle Zhong, Zhi Ling, the two of you can use this to transport yourselves directly to Sky City. Uncle Zhong, you’ll know Sky City’s location once you reach it! I’ll wait for you at the marked node and then we’ll attend the meeting of the core members of Sky City together!”","Lin Yuan was the first to teleport. Just as he appeared in Sky City, Zhong Zhiyu and Zhi Ling appeared in front of him.","Spring’s detection of auras had always been one-way. Targets from the outside world could not investigate the environment of Sky City.","However, entering Sky City meant that they were on the same side. There were no more restrictions on probing.","The moment Zhong Zhiyu probed the outside world, he knew that he was in a city in the clouds! The city was supported by a giant whale!","Zhong Zhiyu had been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for so many years but this was the first time he had seen such a magical creature!","Such a mystical creature couldn’t be nurtured by a guy who was dozens of years old.","Zhong Zhiyu had a preconceived notion that Lin Yuan definitely had a huge faction behind him, and Lin Yuan’s status in this faction was abnormally noble!","It was rare for such a noble little fellow to not show any temper when communicating with him.","However, Zhong Zhiyu, who had seen how Lin Yuan dealt with the other factions in Coiling Dragon Mountain, knew that Lin Yuan was not hypocritical at all. He was extremely decisive in handling matters but he would not kill the innocent. Instead, it gave every faction a chance to survive.","However, whether they could seize the opportunity depended on how these factions made their choices.","The more Zhong Zhiyu learned about Lin Yuan and Sky City, the more his imagination ran wild.","After thinking about it, Zhong Zhiyu had completely treated himself as a weakling in front of Lin Yuan and his attitude toward Lin Yuan became even more respectful.","Even Zhong Zhiyu himself did not feel much about this.","After being away for more than a month, Lin Yuan missed his companions who had worked with him for decades.","When they entered the meeting room, the Moon Empress, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, and the other core members of Sky City were already seated.","As Lin Yuan had mentioned Zhi Ling and Zhong Zhiyu’s attendance in advance, there were two extra chairs. The two chairs were placed on the left and right sides of the end.","The two of them had just joined Sky City so it was undoubtedly the most suitable place for them to sit!","After Lin Yuan pointed out the locations for the two of them, he walked to the most comfortable chair and sat on it.","After Lin Yuan sat down, he tapped the table twice and looked at everyone in the conference room.","“These two are new partners who have just joined Sky City. The person sitting on the left is called Zhi Ling. She is the leader of the Wisdom Pupil Brainflys. From now on, she will lead the Wisdom Pupil Brainflys to participate in the management of the faith country.","“Wen Yu, Luo Lan, you two have to communicate more with Zhi Ling in the future! Zhi Ling, the two of them are currently in charge of managing the faith country. If you have any problems in the future, you can look for them directly!”","Lin Yuan had already explained Zhi Ling’s situation to Su Yiren and Luo Lan on the Thoughts Letter Paper. Su Yiren and Luo Lan were already feeling powerless to manage the faith country.","No matter how powerful Su Yiren and Luo Lan were, they could not split up.","There was a limit to a person’s energy in a day. Zhi Ling was a special species that Lin Yuan had discovered in the blessed land.","Zhi Ling’s situation was similar to Keira’s.","With Zhi Ling leading the Wisdom Pupil Brainflys into the faith country, Su Yiren and Luo Lan would definitely be able to relax in the future. The faith country could be further expanded!","This made Su Yiren and Luo Lan have a very good impression of Zhi Ling.","Zhi Ling belonged to Lin Yuan and the two of them were destined not to have any competitive relationship with her.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan decided to help Zhi Ling more when she first started managing the faith country.","After introducing Zhi Ling, Lin Yuan also solemnly introduced Zhong Zhiyu.","The other members of Sky City greeted Zhong Zhiyu.","Ever since Lin Yuan entered the meeting room, the Moon Empress’ gaze had been on him.","Lin Yuan could sense that the Moon Empress was seriously interested after hearing that Zhong Zhiyu was a Grade 5 Creator.","Lin Yuan smiled and winked at the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan knew very well how much the Moon Empress wanted to explore knowledge. He would hint to Zhong Zhiyu to guide his master more often.","Now that Zhong Zhiyu had joined Sky City, he would definitely not be stingy with the Moon Empress’ thirst for knowledge.","When the Moon Empress was in the main world, she had lamented Lin Yuan’s growth speed more than once.","Now that he was in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan’s growth was even faster than when he had been in the main world! After being away for more than a month, not only did he discover that he had subdued an intelligent race with higher intelligence, but he had also allowed a Grade 5 Creator to join Sky City.","The Moon Empress felt even more proud of Lin Yuan!","After Lin Yuan introduced the new members, the meeting officially began.","It was Zhong Zhiyu and Zhi Ling’s first time attending Sky City’s meeting, especially since Zhong Zhiyu did not know much about Sky City. Therefore, the two of them focused on listening.","The content of the meeting was still centered on faith country. In short, there had not been any major problems in the past month.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan had solved all the minor problems. As the problem of food and clothing was solved, the operation of faith country became smoother and smoother.","Seeing that the discussion was almost over, Lin Yuan suggested, “Right now, the faith power produced by the faith country is all absorbed and integrated by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus.","“During this period, the faith power accumulated by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus is enough for two divine kingdom lifeforms to step into the Holy Spirit level. I wonder if you have any suggestions about the evolution goal?”","Bei Xu was the first to speak, “Young Master, the improvement of your strength is the most important thing for Sky City! Use this faith power to strengthen your feys. After your feys are strengthened, you can strengthen others!”","Lin Yuan immediately rejected Bei Xu’s suggestion.","“I’m not going to use the faith power I’ve collected during this period to strengthen my feys. It’s far better to use this faith power to increase one’s strength than to use it to improve those feys that have strategic-class significance to Sky City!”","In the past, Liu Jie rarely spoke at Sky City’s internal meetings because he was afraid that he would be too one-sided when he encountered problems.","As he continued to grow during this period, Liu Jie was no longer afraid of such a situation!","He was becoming more and more majestic as part of the iron triangle of Sky City.","“I feel that the feys that need to be upgraded the most are the Floating Island Whale in Sky City and the Elemental Paper that produces Thoughts Letter Paper. Even the Sky Clouded Crane, which is in charge of covering the Floating Island Whale, has lower priority!”"]},{"number":3005,"title":"Chapter 3005 Faith as Currency!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3005 Faith as Currency!","....","Liu Jie expressed his opinion seriously at the internal meeting of the core members of Sky City.","Before saying this, Liu Jie thought very seriously. He knew very well what kind of person Lin Yuan was.","Lin Yuan had always contributed to Sky City and Sky City was completely supported by him.","If Lin Yuan wanted to use the faith power produced by the faith country to strengthen his fey, there was no need for him to take the initiative to mention which fey he wanted to evolve during the meeting.","When Lin Yuan heard Liu Jie’s words, the corners of his mouth curled up. It could be said that Liu Jie’s words coincided with Lin Yuan’s thoughts.","Lin Yuan also felt that in Sky City, apart from the Floating Island Whale, which urgently needed to raise its strength to the Holy Spirit level, it was the Elemental Paper that Wen Yu had contracted that most needed to increase its power.","There was nothing much to say about the Floating Island Whale. Strengthening the Floating Island Whale was equivalent to strengthening Sky City’s foundation.","Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper was used to strengthen the communication between Sky City’s members.","As the faith country continued to expand and develop the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, the range of the Elemental Paper would be limited by the area. After upgrading Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper to the Holy Spirit level, he would no longer have such concerns.","In the face of Liu Jie’s suggestion, Lin Yuan did not immediately express his stance. Lin Yuan wanted to hear the opinions of others.","Zhi Ling and Zhong Zhiyu had just joined Sky City so they couldn’t have any objections. The two of them sat in their seats and prepared to use this discussion to understand the personalities and methods of the core members of Sky City.","Among the core members, there were also differences in status. Zhong Zhiyu only knew that Lin Yuan was Sky City’s City Lord. As for the status of the other members of Sky City, Zhong Zhiyu would have to slowly figure it out!","After all these years of hard work, Bai Qinghuan now had the chance to participate in a meeting of Sky City’s core members.","When Lin Yuan asked this question, Bai Qinghuan had been thinking about the same thing.","“I think Liu Jie’s suggestion is very good. The Floating Island Whale and Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper are indeed the best choices. The second group consists of feys like the Insect Queen and the Sky Clouded Crane. The faith country collects faith power very quickly. Everyone’s feys will be upgraded sooner or later according to their functions.”","This matter involved Wen Yu’s own feys so she did not speak.","Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Gu Lang, Zong Ze, and Listen all agreed with Liu Jie’s suggestion.","After everyone was done discussing, Lin Yuan made the final decision.","“I’ll evolve the Floating Island Whale first, then Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper. However, rather than the Sky Clouded Crane and the Insect Queen, I will prioritize strengthening Wen Yu’s Wind Crystal Bottle if I have extra faith power. This way, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings can be held longer and less frequently.”","Apart from Liu Jie, Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and Bei Xu were also members of the Astronomical Parliament.","They knew very well the strategic significance of prolonging the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings’ convening time and shortening its frequency.","After making the decision, Lin Yuan continued, “Bai Qinghuan was right. Everyone’s contracted feys will be evolved. With the faith country’s rate of production of faith power, all of this will be completed in two years!”","Everyone’s breathing quickened when they heard Lin Yuan’s words.","With Lin Yuan’s help, they managed to elevate their feys to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom not long ago, but they now had the opportunity to elevate their feys to the Holy Spirit level.","His strength was skyrocketing!","The last time Lin Yuan held an internal meeting in Sky City, he had used Genius’ exclusive skill, Connected Tails, to let the core members of Sky City understand the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The core members of Sky City knew very well what the strength of the Holy Spirit level meant in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","At the Holy Spirit level, one could already be considered a genuine expert!","However, to experts who relied on continuous fighting to advance to the Holy Spirit level, the core members of Sky City were extremely lacking in combat skills.","Zhong Zhiyu had been observing the expressions of the people in the meeting as they listened to Lin Yuan’s speech. Unexpectedly, Lin Yuan suddenly mentioned him.","“Uncle Zhong, the strength of your subordinates should have already increased to the Holy Spirit level. A few of them have even surpassed the Holy Spirit level. Uncle Zhong, why don’t you let your subordinates accompany the core members of Sky City for more training so that they can improve their combat skills? What do you think?”","Lin Yuan felt that it was difficult for Sky City’s core members to improve their strength through internal sparring.","Zhong Zhiyu’s subordinates had been tempered thousands of times. There was no doubt that they were powerful in combat skills!","If he used these people to train the core members of Sky City, their combat skills would definitely improve greatly in a short period!","Furthermore, Zhong Zhiyu’s subordinates would be very careful during the battle. They would not really hurt the core members of Sky City. Lin Yuan could be at ease when it came to safety.","Lin Yuan had already finished discussing the matters that needed to be discussed in this meeting and it was time for everyone to speak freely.","Zong Ze was a martial arts fanatic. When he was in the main world, he had already displayed the characteristics of a martial arts fanatic. But when they arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Zong Ze’s martial arts fanatic characteristics were released even more.","Zong Ze led a large number of alien insects to help the faith country open up a path.","After taking over one village after another, Zong Ze would take action to eliminate any rebellious tribes or vicious fellows.","However, as time passed, Zong Ze felt that he had lost the sense of challenge.","Zong Ze also had the thought of going out to train like Lin Yuan. He had never treated Lin Yuan as his superior or subordinate. Instead, he treated him as a friend.","Zong Ze naturally voiced his thoughts to Lin Yuan,","“Ah Yuan, I want to go out and train in the outside world to hone my combat skills.”","Lin Yuan knew Zong Ze very well and knew that he had always had an untamed heart.","Sooner or later, Zong Ze would not be able to endure the days of development in North of the Lonely River.","After experiencing the outside world for some time, Lin Yuan knew very well how dangerous the outside world was!","Even if Lin Yuan arranged a powerful guard for Zong Ze while he was out training, there would inevitably be problems with his safety. After all, Lin Yuan couldn’t send Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter to protect Zong Ze.","Lin Yuan would be going out soon, so he could bring Zong Ze along when he went out. He wanted Zong Ze to improve together with him during the training. Moreover, Zong Ze could help Lin Yuan a lot when they were outside.","“Brother Zong, the Sky Beyond the Clouds is rife with danger. You can’t guarantee your safety if you go out alone! For the sake of your safety, I shouldn’t let you go out to train. But I know that you’ve been longing for the outside world for a long time. I’ll bring you along the next time I leave Sky City. Let’s see the outside world together.”","When Zong Ze heard Lin Yuan say that he was not allowed to go out, his mood was a little gloomy. However, when he heard that Lin Yuan was willing to bring him out the next time, Zong Ze’s heart stirred.","Compared to going out to train, Zong Ze preferred to train with Lin Yuan.","Zong Ze had such thoughts when he was in the main world, but it was a pity that he never had such an opportunity.","Now that he finally had the chance to train with Lin Yuan, Zong Ze was overjoyed. A rare smile appeared on his cold expression.","In the past, the Moon Empress had always heard from Chef Supreme that her little disciple was very diligent. Previously, she had even done something like escaping from the Kitchen Fragrance Palace to go out and train.","At that time, the Moon Empress felt that it was an exaggeration. However, after interacting with Zong Ze, the Moon Empress felt that Chef Supreme’s words had beautified her little disciple.","During this period, the Moon Empress had been paying attention to Zong Ze. Lin Yuan had brought Zong Ze to the Sky Beyond the Clouds and Chef Supreme had handed him over to Lin Yuan. The Moon Empress felt that she had to take care of Zong Ze.","In the Moon Empress’ opinion, it was a good thing for Lin Yuan to bring Zong Ze out to train.","Although Zong Ze was a martial arts fanatic, he was very smart. When Lin Yuan brought Zong Ze out, not only would Zong Ze not bring any trouble to Lin Yuan, but he would also be able to be of great help to Lin Yuan!","Zong Ze’s talent could not be compared to Lin Yuan’s, but compared to Liu Jie and Wen Yu, Zong Ze’s talent was not bad! In terms of combat talent, he was much better than Liu Jie!","Liu Jie’s current strength was mainly due to the Insect Queen’s fortuitous opportunity. He did not walk the same path as Zong Ze.","Liu Jie was rather envious when he heard that Lin Yuan was going to bring Zong Ze out to train.","However, Liu Jie also knew that he had many important things to do in Sky City and it was not suitable for him to go out now.","If he insisted on going out to train, Lin Yuan would probably agree.","However, this was really going against his duty as the leader of the white-clothed followers.","Listen suggested Lin Yuan after Zong Ze finished talking about himself, “Young Master, the business hasn’t been going smoothly and I’ve been gathering information on the possible reasons.","“I think the biggest reason for such a situation is not because there’s a problem with the chamber of commerce’s circulation model but because the others in the faith country don’t have much resources to spend. To change all of this, we should increase the resources and wealth of the residents of the faith country. Only then can the chamber of commerce circulate smoothly!”","Hearing Listen’s words, Luo Lan said at the right time, “Young Master, the problem of food and shelter in the faith country has been resolved. Improving the disposable wealth in the hands of the residents of the faith country and making the wealth work should be able to greatly increase the output of faith power from the residents of the faith country.","“I’m very strict in the management of the faith country. Under our management, even if there’s a large amount of wealth circulating, it won’t cause any hidden danger to the safety of the faith country.”","Lin Yuan turned to look at Sun Ningxiang. Usually, Sun Ningxiang did not participate in Sky City’s core meeting.","Sun Ningxiang’s participation this time was due to the addition of a new core member. Participating in the meeting could be considered a sign of friendliness to the new core member.","Sun Ningxiang nodded at Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, not only can the Soldier Ration Radishes produced on Four Seasons Mountain be supplied to the faith country and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants but there will also be a lot of savings.","“Now that the food problem has been completely resolved, it’s just that it’s too simple to rely on the Soldier Ration Radishes to fill their stomachs. In the future, I suggest planting some high-capacity feys similar to the Soldier Ration Radish on the Four Seasons Mountain.”","Sun Ningxiang’s words made sense. It was indeed not good for the faith country to constantly provide supplies to the faith country through the Soldier Ration Radishes.","The Soldier Ration Radish was only a way to ensure that the residents of the faith country were well fed. However, in the year that Lin Yuan had been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he had never seen a production-type fey comparable to the Soldier Ration Radish!","However, he had also collected many seeds of production-type plant type feys. These production-type plant-type feys were very outstanding. Otherwise, they would not be displayed in Fortune Treasure Palace’s display exhibition.","Lin Yuan planned to distribute these seeds to plant them later. At that time, all kinds of fruits could be circulated through the chamber of commerce.","In addition, when Lin Yuan was building the faith country, he had not built it too densely. Many lands in the faith country could be used for planting and raising livestock.","“Listen has added some seeds of crops and the offspring of animal-type feys to the chamber of commerce in the faith country. If the food is too monotonous, the residents of the faith country can improve it themselves.”","Listen’s eyes lit up when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. If the seeds of those crops and the young feys that produced animal-species feys were added to the chamber of commerce, they would be crazily snatched by the people in the faith country.","Furthermore, after these residents of the faith country had their fields and pastures, they would gain the concept of property. It would strengthen their sense of belonging to the faith country and their happiness in life. Not only was this beneficial to the stability of the faith country, but it could also speed up the production of faith power.","“Young Master, I understand what you mean. I’ll start making arrangements later and test the data.”","Wen Yu had been taking notes with a pen since the meeting. After Listen finished speaking, she put down the pen in her hand and spoke to Lin Yuan seriously, “Young Master, I think it’s necessary to create the universal currency in the faith country, which is faith dollars! The best way to distribute faith dollars in the early stages is to let the residents of the faith country trade with the Soldier Ration Radish in their hands.","“The link between the Soldier Ration Radish and the faith dollars can ensure the fairness of the distribution of faith dollars. After that, regardless of whether those who traded for faith dollars used them to enrich their lives or do business, there would always be a portion of people who would use their reasonable operations to increase the number of faith dollars. At that time, the faith country will gradually develop into a perfect society.”","Wen Yu had wanted to make such a suggestion for a long time, so she took this opportunity to propose it for everyone to discuss.","Lin Yuan was busy obtaining resources for the faith country and had never put in any effort in managing it.","Upon hearing Wen Yu’s words, Lin Yuan felt that Wen Yu’s idea was very good. Moreover, he had just reached the stage where he could issue faith dollars."]},{"number":3006,"title":"Chapter 3006 Elemental Paper (Heavenly Book Vine)!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3006 Elemental Paper (Heavenly Book Vine)!","....","Before this, he could not even satisfy the problem of food and clothing. If he were to issue faith coins at that time, it would be a joke.","Wen Yu’s words made everyone present, including Zhong Zhiyu, ponder.","Lin Yuan’s development of the faith country was based on the template of federations in the main world. Such management and management methods were very novel in Zhong Zhiyu’s eyes.","However, only Honor Absent Palace had the authority to forge currency in the East Universe.","If Lin Yuan were to issue faith dollars within the faith country alone, it would still greatly disrespect Honor Absent Palace! Should they catch wind of this, they would surely take issue with Lin Yuan.","Zhong Zhiyu was prepared to remind Lin Yuan that it was not appropriate for him to publicly mention these words and use Honor Absent Palace to pressure Lin Yuan.","The Moon Empress did not speak much in this meeting. She kept highlighting Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie to weaken her presence while she silently helped behind the scenes.","Wen Yu’s current proposal was something that she had discussed with the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress was the first to receive Listen’s report that there was a problem with the chamber of commerce’s experimental business model.","At that time, before Lin Yuan returned to Sky City, the Moon Empress felt that such a situation had occurred because the residents of the faith country did not have the purchasing power or the right bargaining chips. Furthermore, the chamber of commerce only relied on Sky City to conduct transactions with the residents of the faith country.","Secondly, these transactions could not be done by bartering.","Therefore, the Moon Empress thought of creating an authoritative currency.","Coincidentally, Wen Yu’s thoughts coincided with the Moon Empress’s.","Since Lin Yuan had already sent Wen Yu and the Moon Empress all the information he had found in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Moon Empress and Wen Yu knew the rules of Honor Absent Palace.","However, if they were really afraid of the rules of Honor Absent Palace, then the faith country would not be able to develop.","The faith country resided in North of the Lonely River and was isolated from the world. Honor Absent Palace did not have any channels to obtain information about North of the Lonely River.","If they were really intimidated by Honor Absent Palace’s reputation, Sky City would have no future!","Furthermore, even if Sky City did not break the rules of Honor Absent Palace, as long as news of the faith country spread, it would still cause a bloodbath! Even the real big shots in Honor Absent Palace would covet the faith country!","After some discussion, they finally approved the proposal to forge faith dollars. The forging of faith dollars was put on the agenda.","There were two conditions for creating faith dollars. The first was that the production speed of faith dollars had to be fast enough. The second condition was that the faith dollars could not be replicated.","Lin Yuan would hand this problem to Hu Quan, and the latter would probably be very interested in building a faith country’s currency.","If this matter was handed over to someone else, Lin Yuan was really afraid that Hu Quan would feel upset!","...","After the meeting ended, Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to use the faith power absorbed by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to strengthen Sky Sea. Instead, he called Wen Yu to the training room.","Sky Sea and Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper were in the first tier so Lin Yuan had to prioritize strengthening them.","However, Lin Yuan thought about it and decided to set the matter of Sky Sea’s nurturing aside.","He first evolved Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper and then her Wind Crystal Precious Bottle.","After strengthening Wen Yu, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting could be held again!","Lin Yuan said, “Wen Yu, summon your Elemental Paper. In the past year or so in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, your Elemental Paper should have improved a little.”","Wen Yu raised her hand and a large bouquet of paper flowers appeared in her hand. This was a form of Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper. It was called the Flower Crane Bead.","Originally, there were less than a hundred paper flowers formed from the Elemental Paper. Now, there were clearly more than 100.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Elemental Paper and discovered that it had reached World Emperor VI.","This was fundamentally related to Lin Yuan supplying Wen Yu with large amounts of spirit qi crystals to increase the Elemental Paper’s strength.","However, no matter how pure the spirit qi was, there was no way to strengthen the divine kingdom. Strengthening the divine kingdom required faith power.","Due to her identity as a Radiance Knight, Wen Yu could also obtain a lot of faith power in the main world.","However, Wen Yu had already lost the channel to obtain faith power in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, so the Elemental Paper’s divine kingdom did not improve at all.","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “Wen Yu, your Elemental Paper will reach the Holy Spirit level very soon and will obtain a new divine kingdom ability. At that time, your ability will be strengthened again!”","Wen Yu felt a little uneasy. When she had first followed Lin Yuan, she had felt very inferior. It could be said that the contract with the Elemental Paper had caused a qualitative change to her life.","Wen Yu was afraid that the new divine kingdom would not be able to help her and Lin Yuan and would definitely greatly affect her potential.","Lin Yuan sensed Wen Yu’s nervousness and spoke to her seriously. “Wen Yu, there’s no need for you to be so nervous. When a Divine Kingdom lifeform reaches the Holy Spirit level, there will usually be a certain connection between the two divine kingdom abilities. The newly obtained divine kingdom ability of your Elemental Paper will most likely be related to Battleground Angel.","“As long as it’s an ability related to Battleground Angel, no matter what it is, it will have a strong strategic significance. You don’t have to worry! After I help you evolve the Elemental Paper, I’ll prepare to help you evolve the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle. This way, you’ll be able to bring in at least two members for the Astronomical Parliament.”","Wen Yu knew that Lin Yuan had his own motive for making such a suggestion.","Wen Yu did not hesitate and said according to her actual situation, “Young Master, help me strengthen the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle from the Divine Kingdom to the Holy Spirit level so it can strengthen my Hundred Questions Beast.","” realized that the increase in my spiritual energy caused by the Hundred Questions Beast is greater than the increase caused by the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle.”","Lin Yuan smiled bitterly and said, “I know that the Hundred Questions Beast has greatly improved you, but it’s not that easy to strengthen them. The Hundred Questions Beast you contracted can only grow slowly for the time being!”","Lin Yuan had just strengthened Genius and knew how difficult it was to strengthen a Hundred Questions Beast. Even if the other Hundred Questions Beasts did not want to evolve like Genius, they were destined to be much more difficult than other feys!","Wen Yu blinked twice.","Wen Yu was also a Creator but could barely reach the level of a Grade 2 Creator with her current abilities. Hence, Wen Yu could not see through the Hundred Questions Beast.","Lin Yuan communicated with the Realm Abyss Red Lotus and allowed it to use Illusory Lotus Faith to inject the faith power it had collected into Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper.","The Elemental Paper absorbed such a huge amount of faith power and the divine kingdom was rapidly improving.","As a special elemental lifeform, the Elemental Paper turned into a gorgeous rain of paper flowers during the process of absorbing faith power.","The speed at which the Realm Abyss Red Lotus injected faith power into the Elemental Paper was extremely fast. In just two hours, the Elemental Paper successfully broke through to the Holy Spirit level!","The form of the Elemental Paper had also changed like when it had evolved previously.","The Elemental Paper had transformed into a vine that reached into the sky and hovered in front of Wen Yu. Many branches and leaves grew out of the vines, and each branch and leaf held a thick book.","These books kept flipping through the pages. Occasionally, a few pages would fly out, looking sacred and mysterious.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Holy Spirit level Elemental Paper.","[Fey Name]: Elemental Paper (Heavenly Book Vine)","[Fey Species]: Elemental-species/paper species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (6/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine kingdom grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Dance of Paper]: Transform the body into a piece of paper that is immune to physical attacks. However, it is especially vulnerable to elemental attacks. The paper has a teleporting power. The teleportation can be used every three seconds and has a radius of 20 kilometers.","[Paper Crane’s Promise]: The paper will be stacked to form a paper crane that can send messages. The paper crane will be engraved with the aura of the person receiving the message. If a person other than the receiver touches the paper crane, it will burst into flames. The paper crane has a teleporting power that is 30 times more powerful than that of Dance of Paper.","[Thoughts Letter Paper]: The paper will absorb the target’s blood and form a temporary contract with the target. The people holding the Thoughts Letter Paper will be able to communicate with each other using their thoughts as their thoughts will automatically appear as words on the paper. The people holding the Thoughts Letter Paper will be able to read the words together.","[Faceless Paper]: An imaginary paper will appear in front of the target and it can take the shape of the target[s appearance. As long as the Elemental Paper is not destroyed, the imaginary paper will be undamaged even if the target is killed.","[Paper Flower Funeral]: The paper will be folded into a flower that will form an imprint when it lands on a target. Even if the target is hidden, cloned, or affected by elements, the paper flower imprint can be used to sense the target’s location.","[Paper of Ten Thousand Forms]: The paper can pretend to be a person, fey, mountain, city, sea, or even sky. While in the imitation state, the entities hidden behind the paper can enjoy absolute defense.","[Paper World Carrier]: Its own body will become a carrier for other entities. The entities can be restructured to enter the paper world. When portions of the paper is broken apart, the entities stored within will be released. The paper carrier can be used to transport entities through Paper Crane’s Promise.","[Folded Paper Abundant Entities]: A lifeform’s aura will be imprinted on the paper. The paper will be folded into the shape of the lifeform and will have the ability to think independently (The folded paper will detect and possess the lifeform’s spiritual energy and soul, and gain an imitation fate).","[Absolute Paper World]: A special paper will create a world. The paper world can be used to store various items and will be unaffected by spatial abilities. As long as the paper world is undamaged, the items inside will be absolutely safe.","[Stripped Official Paper]: The official paper will be printed on a lifeform’s body. When the official paper leaves the lifeform’s body, it will take with it the target’s disguise, leaving the target in its original appearance.","Exclusive Skill:","[Hear Heaven’s Secrets]: The contractor will become a book of secrets that is linked to the flying piece of paper. When the book’s pages are turned, it can transfer any knowledge within to the flying piece of paper.","[Truth Form Paper]: While the paper is flying around, soul power can be used to form a piece of paper that can investigate the truth. When questioning a target, the paper will be folded into a flower if the target is telling the truth and it will break apart if the target is lying.","[Floating World Ever-Changing]: One’s body will be separated. As long as a piece of paper still exists, the owner of the paper can be revived through the remaining piece of paper.","[Loading Paper Summon Return]: The paper that has left it will be activated and the energy within them will be burned. The paper and all that are in contact with them will return to it.","[Imperial Paper Blessing]: Sacrifices and paper will be forfeited in order to bless a certain entity. Karma will ensure that the matters go smoothly. The sacrifices will only be used up once it is assured that the matter has been successfully achieved.","[Memorize Paper Coffin]: Official paper will form a paper coffin. The items stored in the paper coffin will be suspended and unaffected by the passage of time.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Battleground Angel]: The paper will form wings. Each piece of paper will be able to uncover any hidden information on a battleground. All information within the battleground will be revealed and orders can be issued with full knowledge of the battleground’s information.","[Heaven-Connecting Book Language]: Connect to heaven and earth, greatly increasing the compatibility range of one’s ability and exclusive skill, and encrypts one’s ability through the heaven and earth powers to prevent detection from the outside world.","Lin Yuan’s eyes widened when he saw Elemental Paper’s new divine kingdom ability.","Even if this new divine kingdom ability and Battleground Angel were not strictly linked, Heaven-Connecting Book Language could amplify the power of Battleground Angel and increase its confidentiality when receiving information. It was indeed connected.","However, the connection between the two sides was too weak.","However, the small connection between the two did not mean that the ability of the divine kingdom was not good. On the contrary, the ability of the divine kingdom gave Lin Yuan a huge surprise.","Heaven-Connecting Book Language could increase the compatibility range of the Elemental Paper’s abilities and exclusive skills. It was equivalent to improving the various abilities of the Elemental Paper, especially the Thoughts Letter Paper!","After Elemental Paper advanced to the Holy Spirit level, the range of the Thoughts Letter Paper’s radiation had indeed increased significantly.","However, once Lin Yuan left North of the Lonely River, it would be difficult for him to cover the area he was heading to.","However, with the enhancement of the Thoughts Letter Paper, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to probe the compatibility range again!","Be it in terms of ability or privacy, the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower was not worthy of carrying the Elemental Paper’s shoes! The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower could only transmit basic information. It was not convenient to use it at all.","If the Elemental Paper could reach the level of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, Sky City would no longer have any weaknesses in communication."]},{"number":3007,"title":"Chapter 3007 The Holy Spirit Sky Sea!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3007 The Holy Spirit Sky Sea!","....","The encryption function of Heaven-Connecting Book Language that prevented detection from the outside world was also very suitable for the Thoughts Letter Paper.","As a private communication ability, the Thoughts Letter Paper had to prevent the outside world from detecting it as much as possible.","Previously, Lin Yuan valued the Thoughts Letter Paper so much because it was very private.","Now that the privacy of the Thoughts Letter Paper had increased again, it undoubtedly increased its value.","Heaven-Connecting Book Language was not only suitable for Thoughts Letter Paper but the other abilities, exclusive skills, and divine kingdom abilities as well.","When Lin Yuan saw the Thoughts Letter Paper’s newly obtained divine kingdom ability, he felt so excited, let alone Wen Yu, its contractor!","“Young Master, I sense that the Elemental Paper will easily be able to use Heaven-Connecting Book Language to cover the entire North of the Lonely River. From now on, Sky City’s core members will no longer be restricted from communicating in North of the Lonely River!","“Even if we leave the range of North of the Lonely River, Sky City’s current position can still reach an extremely far distance. Furthermore, even if the area controlled by Sky City expands in the future, the Elemental Paper can still guarantee Sky City’s internal communications.”","Wen Yu had always been proud of the Elemental Paper’s function. However, as Sky City’s territory continued to increase, the Elemental Paper’s communication function became more and more difficult to maintain. For example, the territory of the Crimson Heaven Falcons was not covered by the Elemental Paper.","Now that the Elemental Paper had reached the Holy Spirit level, Wen Yu had nothing to worry about.","Lin Yuan had always been a very practical person. He had never thought of how far Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper could cover.","Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper only needed to ensure that Sky City’s internal communications met Lin Yuan’s expectations.","“Wen Yu, your Elemental Paper’s new divine kingdom ability has obtained has given it a comprehensive improvement. From now on, your Elemental Paper should be able to completely grasp all the information within the radius of the entire faith country with the cooperation of Battleground Angel and Heaven-Connecting Book Language!”","Wen Yu nodded. “Young Master, it was previously a little difficult for you to Battleground Angel to collect information on the faith country. It should be enough now.”","After evolving Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper, Lin Yuan moved on to evolve her Wind Crystal Precious Bottle.","Back then, Lin Yuan had asked Wen Yu to contract the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle to increase her spiritual power. Apart from helping Wen Yu increase her spiritual energy, the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle had no other use. Neither Lin Yuan nor Wen Yu had any special expectations for it.","For example, the power of the divine kingdom it had obtained after reaching World Emperor/Divine Kingdom was not very useful.","Lin Yuan got the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to inject a large amount of faith power into the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle. Not long after, its grade smoothly increased.","After the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle reached the Holy Spirit level, Lin Yuan did not choose to check its data.","Wen Yu exclaimed, “Young Master, I’ve always felt that the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle’s abilities and exclusive skills are not good and that its divine kingdom ability was unsatisfactory. I didn’t expect it to give me a surprise after reaching the Holy Spirit level!”","Lin Yuan hurriedly used True Data to check the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle.","Lin Yuan understood why Wen Yu had said that.","Its new divine kingdom ability was called Spiritual Overlay.","[Spiritual Overlay]: Nourish its spiritual energy by absorbing things that contain spiritual energy, allowing its spiritual energy to continuously stack. When necessary, it can use the spiritual energy that it has piled up to increase the strength of its spiritual energy.","With Spiritual Overlay, Wen Yu’s spiritual energy would be strengthened by her increased consumption of spiritual-type spiritual ingredients.","It would take some time to accumulate spiritual energy using Spiritual Overlay. This period was coincidentally an opportunity to hold an parliamentary meeting.","Wen Yu had spent her time consuming spiritual ingredients to increase her spiritual energy so that the parliamentary meeting could be held for as long as possible.","“Young Master’s Wind Crystal Precious Bottle has been upgraded to the Holy Spirit level and has increased my spiritual energy by a large amount. I need some time to familiarize myself with the increase in my spiritual energy! Right now, my mental strength is in a state of surging. I’m feeling a little dizzy. It’s as if I’m floating.”","Wen Yu deliberately maintained her composure when she spoke. Otherwise, she would definitely lose her composure in front of Lin Yuan.","No matter who raised a large amount of spiritual energy in a short period, it would take time to adapt.","“Wen Yu, rest well for two days. We’ll hold the Astronomical Parliament after you familiarize yourself with your spiritual energy’s boost!”","When Lin Yuan saw that the Elemental Paper and Wind Essence Treasure Bottle had reached the Holy Spirit level, he thought that he had misjudged the faith power needed for a Divine Kingdom fey to step into the Holy Spirit level.","When the Elemental Paper and the Wind Essence Treasure Bottle entered the Holy Spirit level, they did not even exhaust half of the faith power accumulated by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus.","...","While Wen Yu was resting, Lin Yuan prepared to strengthen Sky Sea. This would enable Sky Sea to undergo a transformation from the Divine Kingdom to the Holy Spirit level. Once Sky Sea’s grade increased, not only would its abilities and exclusive skills improve, but Sky Sea would also become bigger!","Once Sky Sea’s back grew, Sky City would be able to build more buildings.","Lin Yuan left the main city and observed Sky City’s environment.","From the size of the buildings to the size of a blade of grass and a tree, all of this was because Sky Sea’s exclusive skill, Knotted Life Cohabitation, was rooted in Sky Sea’s flesh.","This was because Sky Sea had obtained Whale World Piety after reaching the Divine Kingdom level. During this period, Sky Sea’s faith power had increased.","However, the faith power was not enough to support Sky Sea in evolving its grade.","While Lin Yuan was observing the environment in the north of Sky Sea, Sky Sea’s voice sounded in his mind. “Yuan, I haven’t seen you for some time, but I will enter a deep sleep every once in a while. I heard from Gray that every time I fall asleep, it will last for a long time. Did everything go well for you when you went out to train?”","Through his spiritual energy, Lin Yuan replied to Sky Sea with a smile, “Of course it’s going smoothly. Otherwise, Sky City wouldn’t be developing as well as it is now! I’ll help you increase your grade later and help you reach the Holy Spirit level!”","Sky Sea had always been very enthusiastic about improving its strength. When it heard that Lin Yuan wanted to help it reach the Holy Spirit level, it was exceptionally happy.","Gray stopped beside Lin Yuan and hugged him.","Gray was not envious at all that Lin Yuan wanted to evolve Sky Sea’s grade. Gray knew that Lin Yuan would increase its strength sooner or later, just like how Lin Yuan was doing for Sky Sea today!","Due to their bloodline connection, the relationship between Sky Sea, Gray, and Lin Yuan was like that between a parent and a child.","From a certain perspective, contracting feys through bloodlines was better than contracting feys through spiritual energy!","Lin Yuan sensed Gray’s presence and smiled as he said, “Gray, don’t worry. When Sky Sea reaches the Holy Spirit level and gains faith power, I’ll use this faith power to help you improve.”","Lin Yuan asked Sky Sea, “Are you ready to advance your grade now?”","Sky Sea said excitedly, “Yuan, I’ve been waiting for this day for a long time! I have a feeling that my strength will definitely increase greatly after evolving to the Holy Spirit level!”","Lin Yuan asked the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to inject the existing faith power into Sky Sea’s body.","Lin Yuan was uncertain whether this faith power could allow Sky Sea to evolve smoothly. After all, as a Heavenly Family Fey, Sky Sea was different from ordinary lifeforms. Before reaching the Divine Kingdom level, its grade and quality progressed much slower than ordinary lifeforms did! However, due to Whale World Piety, it was much easier for Sky Sea to increase its strength.","The faith power obtained by the living beings on Sky Sea’s back was enough for Sky Sea to get a portion of it.","With the infusion of faith power, Sky Sea’s aura was steadily increasing.","Due to Sky Sea’s Lashing Spirit Tail Wing, spirit qi automatically gathered on Sky Sea’s back.","The concentration of spirit qi in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was extremely high, making it difficult for Lin Yuan to see his surroundings.","However, the change in Sky Sea’s aura told Lin Yuan that it had already become reached the Holy Spirit level!","[Fey Name]: Floating Island Whale","[Fey Species]: Large-winged-whale-species/island-whale-species.","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Water/Wind","[Fey quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine kingdom grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Whale Blood Screen]: Set fire to the essence blood inside its body and form a screen that can protect everything on its back.","[Water Vapor Whale Feelers]: Transform its feelers into water vapor and use them to gather nutrients from the environment to recover itself.","[Whale Spout Empowerment]: Through the blowhole in its head, it can shoot out energy from its energy and supply it to entities with compatible bodies to replenish their energy or fix them up in other ways.","[Lashing Spirit Tail Wings]: After being nourished by pure spirit qi, the wings and tail will be covered with a skin that can filter out spirit qi. With every movement of the wings and tail, the spirit qi can be directed to its back to increase the concentration of spirit qi on its back.","[Flesh Solidification]: An additional mouth that is connected to the additional stomach will grow below the blowhole. The metal and rocks that enter the additional stomach will strengthen the flesh during the contraction and expansion of the additional stomach. The solidified flesh will not affect the growth of the whale’s bones.","[Whale’s Breath]: Gather energy that is compatible with its body and shoot it out at a target. Before the target escapes the breath’s lock, the breath will lock and track the target.","[Floating Whale Sinks]: When the things and lifeforms on the whale’s back are dying, a mournful cry of grief will be released. The sky will be like the ocean and its body and soul will be the price paid to protect all the beings on its back.","[Sinking Whale Becomes Life]: When Floating Whale Sinks is used, its bloodline will combine with the whale bones. While the whale bones are being upgraded, they will produce a fetus and the fetus will take on its current bloodline.","[Sea Sky Exchange]: Exchange the sea or sky of the current environment to either turn the sky into the sea or the sea into the sky. (The change in the environment is foundationally related to the strength of the world wills’ acknowledgment)","[World Roots Consume]: Consume and digest the world’s root power. The world’s root power will be used to strengthen itself and enable the whale’s back and abdomen’s secret realm to gain the same grade of conception power as that of the world’s roots.","Exclusive Skill:","[Floating Island Secret Realm]: By swallowing wind-elemental energy, a special space will be opened within the whale’s abdomen. The higher the purity of the wind-elemental energy, the larger the space will be. But the space will not exceed twice the size of the body. By swallowing water-elemental energy, the flesh will gain powerful fusion abilities that will enable the fats to stick to any lifeform, dead or alive, and drain nutrients from them. The purer the water-elemental energy, the stronger the fusion ability will be.","[Knotted Life Cohabitation]: Pick a lifeform on its back to fuse and share its life with. Before its life comes to an end, the target will not die. Before the target dies, it will be able to continue living even if it sustains a serious injury.","[Accommodating Territory Transformative Environment]: A territory can be subsumed into its body and the body will become a part of this territory. The entities on its body can also be placed anywhere on this territory. The root power of the surroundings can be used to nourish the body and allow the body to be acknowledged by the environment.","[Sea Sky Stance]: As the ruler of the sea and sky, it will be able to change the stance of the sky and sea. It will use the stance to defend against enemies. When energy is absorbed from the sky and sea, it will be able to continuously recover its injuries (Anything joined to it will also suffer the same damage).","[Whale’s Extension]: When energy is at its maximum, some of the bloodline can be sacrificed in order to produce a fetus with the same bloodline. (The fetus will take on the same characteristics but will not have the same abilities and exclusive skills)","[Faith Gift]: Give some of the accumulated faith power to other lifeforms. If given to whales that it produced on its own, the faith power will not be depleted. If given to targets with unrelated bloodlines, the faith power will be used up at differing degrees.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Whale World Nurturing]: All of the faith power gained by the lifeforms on the space on its back and abdomen will be used to nurture it based on different proportions. The faith power will then either be turned into its own faith power or given to other targets to be absorbed.","[Continued Support]: When the embryo is created through the continuation of the bloodline, the embryo will have the same strength as it. The energy consumed during the enhancement will be paid by the embryo."]},{"number":3008,"title":"Chapter 3008: A Greater Gain Than a Creator!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3008: A Greater Gain Than a Creator!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The second divine kingdom ability that Sky Sea obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level, Continued Support, was obviously linked to Whale’s Extension.","During the process of nurturing Sky Sea, Lin Yuan knew that Whale’s Extension was extremely strategic, but he had never allowed Sky Sea to give birth to an embryo.","Sky Sea produced embryos through its bloodline, so it would not suffer much damage. However, Lin Yuan did not have the resources to nurture these embryos.","The resources required to nurture an embryo were basically the same as nurturing a Floating Island Whale. Lin Yuan could not bear such a consumption of resources.","However, Sky Sea’s Continued Support allowed the embryo that continued its bloodline to have the same strength as itself. This greatly reduced Lin Yuan’s consumption of nurturing the embryo.","Of course, Continued Support did not increase the strength of the embryos out of thin air. The energy consumed by the Island Whale embryos during the Continued Support process had to be paid by Sky Sea.","Lin Yuan was unsure how many Floating Island Whale embryos Sky Sea could augment with its energy absorption speed. Each of these Floating Island Whale embryos was equivalent to a simplified version of Sky Sea. Lin Yuan planned to wait for Sky Sea to recover from its evolution before asking it.","With Lin Yuan acquiring increasingly more resources, he now had two Grade 5 Creators working under him. Including the Moon Empress, Genius, and the members of the Hundred Questions Beasts Army, there were already eight or nine Grade 4 Creators.","At present, Lin Yuan possessed the ability to build war fortresses on these Floating Island Whale embryos. In the future, if Sky City were to start a war with other factions, these war fortresses made from the Floating Island Whale embryo would be able to be deployed immediately.","By the time Sky Sea completed its evolution and no longer needed to activate its Spirit Whipping Tail Wings with all its might, Lin Yuan would be able to finally observe the situation on its back clearly.","Sky Sea’s size had nearly tripled from its original size. Fortunately, Gray’s cloud form was still able to envelop Sky Sea’s body. Otherwise, the residents in the faith country would most likely be able to see Sky Sea’s outline.","As all the buildings on Sky Sea’s back were planted in Sky Sea’s flesh and blood, Sky Sea’s size would not affect the things planted on it.","It had been a while since Hu Quan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone, but he would need to work on the back of Sky Sea in the upcoming period.","“Yuan, I feel the energy within me is more abundant than ever after this grade upgrade. It feels wonderful!”","With that, Sky Sea opened its mouth and swallowed. Boundless energy was absorbed into Sky Sea’s body, making it extremely happy.","Lin Yuan sensed Sky Sea’s happiness and said with a smile, “Next, I’ll find some plant-type feys that can produce faith power and raise them on your body.","This way, it’ll be easier for you to obtain additional faith power.”","Lin Yuan’s expression turned serious as he asked, “With the energy in your body and Continued Support, how many embryos can you simultaneously supply with energy?”","Sky Sea knew its situation the best, so it answered Lin Yuan’s question honestly, “If I keep absorbing energy through Water Vapor Whale Feelers to forcefully provide energy to those embryos,","“I can bear the consumption of eight to ten embryos at the same time through Continued Support. However, this consumption won’t last long. I can only last for a month at most.","“If I only support three to four embryos, I don’t need to activate Water Vapor Whale Feelers. I just need to absorb the energy in the environment daily!","“I support the Sky City, which is rarely active on ordinary days, so the energy within me has basically been in a surplus state. Nourishing three to four embryos is just enough to meet my daily energy consumption. The embryos that I nurtured through Continued Support are completely under my control. Controlling them is basically no different from controlling my own body.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan inwardly thought that since that was the case, he could have Hu Quan work on these four embryos to turn them into Sky Motherships capable of swiftly carrying the Sky City around.","Previously, Hu Quan had complained to Lin Yuan that it was not challenging to forge in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Now, the challenge had presented itself. “Gray, you should be able to create more clouds to cover a wider area, right?”","When Gray heard Lin Yuan’s words, it knew what his intentions were. Lin Yuan clearly wanted Sky Sea to support the embryos but did not want it to be exposed to others.","As a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Heavenly Family Fey in charge of weather, Gray could change the climate of an area. Previously, Gray’s cloud had been in a compressed state and had not been released much.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Gray released the clouds it had transformed into. More than half of the sky above the faith country was shrouded in dense clouds, with half of it displaying blue skies and the other half covered in thick clouds. The overall view was stunning.","However, with so many clouds suddenly filling the sky, these pure white cloud formations were viewed by many lifeforms in the faith country as an auspicious omen.","The faith country was formed by large, medium, and small tribes. The majority of its inhabitants lived in extreme misery, with no guarantee of food or shelter.","While life may not be abundant, it was remarkably stable now. Those ferocious demon beasts no longer evoked fear in the eyes of the vulnerable inhabitants of the faith country. Instead, they treated them as their protectors. Some of the lifeforms that lived in the faith country even contributed their faith to the demon insects.","Once the sudden change in weather was considered an auspicious sign, it would greatly accelerate the output of faith power by the residents of the faith country.","As the Realm Abyss Red Lotus’ contractor, Lin Yuan could sense the subtle changes. However, he did not care much about this. It was because Lin Yuan knew that once the faith dollars were released and the faith country’s trading system was perfected, the faith power produced by the residents of the faith country would increase exponentially.","Upon seeing Gray covering such a large compatibility range, Lin Yuan spoke to Sky Sea. “Use Whale’s Extension to divide the embryos through your bloodline. Then, use Continued Support to strengthen these embryos.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s instructions, Sky Sea’s bloodline surged violently, and a huge piece of flesh was produced from its abdomen right on the heels of that. Under the supply of Continued Support, the newborn embryo grew into a huge creature in just a few minutes.","The Floating Island Whale embryo was slightly smaller than Sky Sea but not by much.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the growth of these embryos.","“Yuan, I can use the Continued Support of my divine kingdom to enhance these embryos at will. However, it takes time for me to produce embryos through Whale’s Extension. I need some time to recover before I can hatch again. Otherwise, it will greatly affect the condition of my bloodline. I can produce an embryo around every six months or so.","“Even if there is an abundance of spirit qi to absorb, forcibly dividing the embryos might affect them negatively, resulting in weaker floating island whales compared to the current robust one that is hatching.”","When Lin Yuan heard that Sky Sea could produce an embryo in half a year, he could not help but be surprised at the speed at which it produced embryos.","For half a year, Hu Quan had not been able to help a Floating Island Whale build the outline of Sky Mothership.","“Sky Sea, you don’t have to be in such a hurry to incubate the embryo. Just slowly incubate it. You must ensure that your bloodline remains unaffected. All the embryos you have blessed should be in their strongest state!”","Sky Sea said seriously, “Yuan, I only need to absorb the spiritual qi in the environment. I don’t need you to provide me with more resources. If there’s a need, I’ll tell you directly. If you’re not in Sky City, I’ll contact Wen Yu or Liu Jie directly! ”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan was relieved and released Hu Quan from the Spirit","Lock spatial zone, “Uncle Hu, didn’t you always say that it’s very boring in the Spirit Lock spatial zone? Now that there’s a brand new project, I guarantee that you’ll think it’s a challenge!”","Hu Quan was still in a daze when Lin Yuan suddenly summoned him from the Spirit Lock spatial zone. However, Hu Quan did not take Lin Yuan’s words seriously. Since following Lin Yuan, Hu Quant s perspective had grown increasingly broad, and now there were few things that Hu Quan considered challenging.","In Hu Quant s heart, the things forged in the Spirit Lock spatial zone could not be considered a challenge. The only thing that could be called a challenge was probably the construction of the Sky City on the back of Sky Sea!","For Lin Yuan to be able to obtain a Floating Island Whale was already considered good fortune. Hu Quan did not think that Lin Yuan would be able to obtain another Floating Island Whale.","However, when Hu Quan followed Lin Yuan’s finger and looked into the distance, he was stunned. Hu Quan was certain that he was standing on the back of Sky Sea, but what was that behemoth not far away! Could it be that Lin Yuan had found another Floating Island Whale?!","Upon seeing the shocked expression on his face, Lin Yuan explained to Hu Quan, “Uncle Hu, this isn’t a real Floating Island Whale. It’s an existence created by Sky Sea’s own abilities as it evolves in grade. In the next three years, three Floating Island Whales with such huge bodies will be hatched. I plan to use these Floating Island Whales as fortresses and Sky Motherships to protect Sky City. At that time, I’ll arrange for a Grade 5 Creator and Uncle Hu to build the Sky Motherships together. I hope you can communicate more with each other!”","Building a Sky Mothership on a body resembling Sky Sea’s clone not only required designing abilities but also sufficient Creator-related knowledge.","Letting Zhong Zhiyu lead the other Creators to invest in the construction of the Sky Mothership could maximize the value of these high-grade Creators. At the same time, it would make Zhong Zhiyu and the other Creators feel valued.","With an expression of astonishment on his face, Hu Quan absorbed every word spoken by Lin Yuan. His face was filled with a delightful expression of surprise.","Hu Quan was pleasantly surprised not only because he could obtain a new challenge, but also because he was about to work with a Grade 5 Creator.","Hu Quan was not a Creator, but every time he came into contact with a Creator, he would obtain a lot of insights.","“Young Master, thank you for giving me this opportunity. I won’t disappoint you!”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Uncle Hu, I naturally trust you. When have you ever let me down during all this time? Uncle Hu, you should communicate more with that Grade 5 Creator. You should be able to obtain a lot of benefits yourself!”","Hu Quan said with a smile, “Of course. Young Master, I want to choose some Spirit Craftsmen first and bring them to Sky Sea’s clone for inspection. There’s no place in the Spirit Lock spatial zone that needs me anymore. My disciples are enough to maintain the construction of the Spirit Lock spatial zone. I want to use this time to think about the design of the back on Sky Sea’s clone!” Naturally, Lin Yuan would not reject Hu Quan’s request. Lin Yuan had always admired Hu Quan’s sense of responsibility. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have handed so much work to him.","After settling Hu Quan down, Lin Yuan went to look for the Moon Empress. Upon returning to the Sky City this time, Lin Yuan hadn’t yet found the time to meet her master.","When he arrived at the Moon Empress’ residence, Lin Yuan saw Wen Yu talking to Mystic Moon.","Mystic Moon was the reason why Wen Yu could grow so much. Even now, Mystic Moon would often guide her.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan’s usually cold face, the Moon Empress smiled and waved at Lin Yuan, “Little Yuan, come and sit. You’ve gained a lot from this trip!”","When she mentioned Lin Yuan’s gains, she could not help but be secretly shocked. Previously, Lin Yuan had talked to the Moon Empress about bringing in a few more high-grade Creators for Sky City.","Unexpectedly, Lin Yuan brought a Grade 5 Creator and four Grade 4 Creators back to Sky City. Among the four Grade 4 Creators, several of them were stronger than him!","Lin Yuan revealed a smile at the mention of such a harvest. He didn’t spend much time outside this time, but the gains he acquired left even him feeling surprised and somewhat surreal.","Before Lin Yuan left, he had never thought that he would be able to obtain such a huge harvest. Only in front of the Moon Empress would Lin Yuan show his childish side.","“Master, my gains this time aren’t just limited to these few Creators. There are other gains that are just as significant!”","Upon hearing that, the Moon Empress revealed a surprised expression. She was very curious about what kind of harvest Lin Yuan had obtained to be able to say that it was not inferior to subduing the Creators.."]},{"number":3009,"title":"Chapter 3009: Evolving the Sentient Being Protective Dragon!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3009: Evolving the Sentient Being Protective Dragon!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Based on the information that the Moon Empress had obtained, the Creators in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were even more respected than Creation Masters in the main world.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there were many lifeforms and major factions, but there were very few Creators. This made it difficult for even those species or factions with decent strength to obtain Creator resources. They could only rely on their bloodline to improve themselves. Under such circumstances, a Grade 3 Creator was already highly esteemed.","The Creator that Lin Yuan had brought back was a Grade 5 Creator. Apart from this Grade 5 Creator, Lin Yuan had also mentioned that another Grade 5 Creator had joined Sky City, but he had not brought them back.","Before the Moon Empress could ask, Cold Moon beat her to it. “Little Yuan, what kind of gains can compare to so many high-grade Creators? Don’t tell me you obtained another high-grade faerie or Breath Soil?!”","Cold Moon’s personality had always been cold, but her cold demeanor was mostly displayed toward outsiders. Once Cold Moon treated you as one of her own and slowly became familiar with you, you would be able to sense the warmth hidden beneath her coldness.","“Aunt Cang, it’s not that easy to obtain a higher faerie and Breath Soil.","However, the things I obtained this time are not inferior to them.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan took out the Palm of Blessed Land, which was filled with low-grade and mid-grade blessed lands, and handed it to the Moon","Empress. “Master, these two Palm of Blessed Lands, which were refined by Grade 5 Creators, contain two blessed lands.","“If these two blessed lands merge with North of the Lonely River, North of the Lonely River will immediately become a fertile land. The resources in these two blessed lands can be mined for at least a hundred years. It will be enough for the faith country to develop for decades!”","Moon Empress received the two Palm of Blessed Lands from Lin Yuan. After inspecting them, a surprised expression appeared on her face. If she had not seen it with his own eyes, it would be difficult for her to understand the true meaning of the word ‘blessed land’ just by imagining it.","If a species with a decent bloodline obtained a blessed land by chance, they would have a chance of becoming the ruler of an area with the resources of the blessed land alone. However, although these blessed lands were magical, they were still incomparable to Grade 5 Creators.","The resources in the blessed land were limited, but Lin Yuan’s Lifespan Mouse could allow a Grade 5 Creator to have an endless lifespan. This Grade 5 Creator could continuously produce advanced Creator resources.","Just as the Moon Empress was thinking this, Lin Yuan raised his hand. A strange flower that had yet to bloom appeared in front of him.","Lin Yuan had summoned the Business Flourishing Flower!","The Moon Empress looked at the Business Flourishing Flower and immediately knew why Lin Yuan had said that. Its ability to promote and amplify other lives was not much different from the Cleansing Breath Soil. Of course, the Cleansing Breath Soil also had functions that Business Flourishing Flower did not have.","However, the Business Flourishing Flower could strengthen the bloodlines of other species. Once this ability was used, the value it could create was immeasurable. With this ability, Lin Yuan could pull many powerful species into Sky City.","“Little Yuan, being able to obtain such a spirit plant is really good fortune. I’ve already nurtured the Sentient Being Protective Dragon that you left with me previously. This little fellow has been sleeping since it was in the main world. Now that its grade has evolved and its bloodline has also undergone a transformation. If it’s raised on the Four Seasons Mountain, it will be able to protect the lifeforms on the Four Seasons Mountain!","“The Sentient Being Protective Dragon, Four Seasons Mountain, Cleansing Breath Soil, and this spirit plant made North of the Lonely River a divine-level residence. No matter how much Sky City and faith country develop in the future, with the four of them around, we won’t have to worry about resources anymore.”","The Moon Empress rarely gave such an outstanding evaluation of lifeforms.","The Moon Empress released the Sentient Being Protective Dragon. The moment the Sentient Being Protective Dragon appeared and saw Lin Yuan, it immediately came to him and circled around him happily.","The Sentient Being Protective Dragon was a lifeform that had evolved from three Myriad Form Carps. Lin Yuan had evolved the three Myriad Form Carps into auspicious fey, the Dragon-Phoenix Landscape Carps. Later on, the","Dragon-Phoenix Landscape Carps evolved into the Mountain River Eternal Life Carps and joined forces to evolve into the Sentient Being Protective Dragon. The three little fellows had become one in the end, and Lin Yuan was like their parents.","At this moment, the Sentient Being Protective Dragon’s aura had clearly reached Suzerain, and its quality had also increased to Myth.","Due to its special bloodline, the Sentient Being Protective Dragon’s grade and quality improved extremely slowly. In just a few years, it went from Platinum/Legend to Suzerain/Myth.","It was obvious that the Moon Empress had spent a lot of effort on the Sentient Being Protective Dragon!","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check on the Sentient Being Protective Dragon.","[Fey Name]: Sentient Being Protective Dragon","[Fey Species]: Fortuitous dragon species/fortuitous dragon genus","[Fey Grade]: Overlord (6/10)","[Fey Type]: Water [Fey Quality]: Myth I","Abilities:","Sentient Being Added Protection:","(Main Body Blessing): Enlighten the intelligence of the lifeforms in the area to increase their intelligence.","(Left Body Blessing): Increase the agility of the lifeforms in the area. By increasing the effectiveness of sleep, the minds of the lifeforms in the area will not become lethargic.","(Right Body Blessing): Improve the bodies of the lifeforms in the area and increase their speed of wound recovery. The lifeforms in the area will not become hungry.","Exclusive Skill:","[Place in the World]: It will protect all the lifeforms in the area. Within this area, the plants will be lush, water will be clean, and all lifeforms will feel utter comfort. The lifeforms in this area will be able to increase the rate at which the power of their roots is replenished.","[Disaster Omen]: Every time a lifeform experiences a negative state, an omen and instructions will be given according to the location of the lifeform. It will discover the arrival of bad luck and disaster in advance.","[Lifeforce Increase]: Every time a lifeform is in a healthy and happy state in an environment, it will affect the other lifeforms in the surroundings, causing them to be in the same state, increasing the speed of their bloodline evolution and growth.","Lin Yuan smiled as he looked at the Sentient Being Protective Dragon’s two new exclusive skills.","Under normal circumstances, the Disaster Omen ability that the Sentient Being Protective Dragon obtained after evolving into a Fantasy Breed was actually useless.","In the future, Lin Yuan would raise the Sentient Being Protective Dragon on Four Seasons Mountain. The lifeforms living on Four Seasons Mountain would not have any illnesses.","Moreover, the bloodline of a faerie had the effect of breaking bad luck. Only in an external environment could the Disaster Omen be effective.","If the Sentient Being Protective Dragon on Four Seasons Mountain gave instructions through Disaster Omen, there would most likely be a huge problem.","Although the Disaster Omen was useless, Lifeforce Increase could be said to be a divine skill. It had the effect of enhancement of the bloodline and growth speed of every lifeform in a blissful state.","[Lifeforce Increase] was the enhancement of the bloodline and growth speed of every living being in a blissful state.","With Lifeforce Increase of the Sentient Being Protective Dragon, the bloodline and growth speed of all lifeforms on the Four Seasons Mountain would increase significantly again.","Upon seeing that Lin Yuan was very satisfied with her nurturing of the Sentient Being Protective Dragon, Moon Empress smiled, “Master, with the new exclusive skill of the Sentient Being Protective Dragon, it’s a blessing for our","Sky City in terms of its foundation.”","The Moon Empress said softly, “Little Yuan, your Sentient Being Protective Dragon being able to obtain such an exclusive skill is fundamentally related to the foundation you built for it. Without a good foundation from the beginning, the Sentient Being Protective Dragon would not have been able to obtain such an improvement.”","Moon Empress paused for a moment before asking Lin Yuan, “Little Yuan, you allowed Zhi Ling to join Sky City and become a member of Sky City’s inner circle. I wonder what plans you have for Zhi Ling from now on?”","When Lin Yuan heard the Moon Empress mention Zhi Ling, he immediately understood what she meant. Every core member of Sky City had their own duties. For example, Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator would be in charge of the Creator team for now on.","However, after opening the core meeting and contemplating for a long time, the Moon Empress had yet to discover Zhi Ling’s irreplaceable value to Sky City. However, the Moon Empress also knew that Lin Yuan would not casually bring someone into Sky City. Since she could not figure it out, the Moon","Empress decided to ask Lin Yuan directly. There was no need for the Moon Empress to hide anything from her disciple.","Lin Yuan hurriedly explained to the Moon Empress, “Master, the opportunity I’m talking about this time is greater than that of a Grade 5 Creator. I’m not only referring to these two blessed lands and the Business Flourishing Flower itself. Zhi Ling is also an important part of this!”","Lin Yuan then told the Moon Empress about the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s situation. The Moon Empress immediately understood why Lin Yuan had said that. At the same time, she was secretly surprised by the mysteriousness and astonishing intelligence of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies.","The Moon Empress had always regarded the management of the faith country as a major challenge that Sky City had to face and shoulder. If Zhi Ling’s","Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies could solve Sky City’s management problem, Zhi Ling was fully qualified to become a core member of Sky City!","The Moon Empress said to Lin Yuan in an extremely serious tone, “Zhi Ling’s sudden appearance in Sky City and her direct management of the faith country is a serious matter. Little Yuan, I happen to be free during this period.","“I’ll focus more on Zhi Ling and observe if the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies led by Zhi Ling are capable of managing the faith country. You said that Zhi Ling is completely under your control. If there are any problems or deviations in her management of the faith country, I will immediately remind Zhi Ling to rectify them!”","Before appointing Zhi Ling, Lin Yuan had seriously reminded and informed her that he Yuan valued her intelligence. However, Lin Yuan overlooked the potential issues that might arise in her thinking.","Zhi Ling had been staying in the blessed land all this while and had yet to truly face the world alone. If there were any issues with her understanding and thoughts on various matters, it would impact Zhi Ling’s concrete decision-making process.","The Moon Empress was able to help Lin Yuan think of these questions that hadn’t crossed his mind, which greatly reassured him.","Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress had lunch at the Moon Empress’ place. At the dining table, Lin Yuan recounted what he had seen and heard on his trip.","The Moon Empress was also an extremely adventurous person. It was difficult for people without an adventurous spirit to achieve anything outstanding.","Although the Moon Empress yearned for the world outside when she first came to Sky Beyond the Clouds, she didn’t propose to Lin Yuan that she wanted to venture out for training.","“This was because the Moon Empress knew that her strength was insufficient to ensure her safety while she was out training. If she had gone out to train, Lin Yuan would definitely have arranged security for her safety.","“As a master, the Moon Empress did not want to cause trouble for her disciple. Furthermore, many of Sky City’s related management tasks were inseparable from her.","As Sky City continued to grow stronger, it was only a matter of time before Sky City clashed with the other factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. When the time came, it would be the best time for her to explore the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","While Lin Yuan was narrating his experiences, a young man in a tribe of less than 200 people in the distant West Universe was roaring crazily. As he roared, tears fell from the corners of his eyes.","“Father, our Forbidden Feather Tribe has so many people. Why should we continue to suffer oppression from the Tail Bind Tribe? Sister is the member with the highest bloodline talent in the tribe.","“Yet, you are going to the Sister over when the Tail Bind Tribe requested for an intermarriage. Don’t you know what the Tail Bind Tribe is planning by making such a request. If Sister goes, she won’t survive five years in the Bound Tail Tribe. 1...","Before the young man could finish speaking, he heard the old man in front of him shout sternly, “Little Yu, could it be that you want the Forbidden Feather Tribe to perish? The leader of the Tail Bind Tribe has just leveled up. His strength is no longer something we can resist!","“Do you know what that means? It means that as long as our Forbidden Feather Tribe doesn’t follow the Tail Bind Tribe’s wishes, they can destroy us at any time!","“The Tail Bind Tribe let us send Little You over because they want to use Little You to control our Forbidden Feather Tribe. In such a chaotic world, weakness is a sin. Do you think I’m willing to let Little You go!?”","At the end of his speech, the old man could no longer hide his emotions. Even his voice was tainted with tears. The man’s words made the young man named Zhou Yu cry in pain, his stern expression melting away as if snow had melted. However, the young man stood tall and straight, evidently not having his pride broken by this.","However, due to the limitation of his strength, there was nothing he could do no matter how unwilling he was. “Little You won’t survive half a year in the Tail Bind Tribe.. What will we do then? Are we going to continue picking people from the tribe and sending them over there?”"]},{"number":3010,"title":"Chapter 3010: Carp Mystic Palace!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3010: Carp Mystic Palace!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When the old man heard the young man’s words, it was as if he had been stabbed in the heart.","“Of course I have to. The continuation of the tribe is more important than a moment of glory and humiliation. What I’m worried about now is not what will happen to Little You when she reaches the Tail Bind Tribe, but whether our","Forbidden Feather Tribe can find another suitable woman to send to the Tail Bind Tribe.”","The old man gritted his teeth and said these words. Looking at the young man’s stubborn and disappointed eyes, the old man sighed softly. “Little Yu, you have to experience the cruelty of this world. As the leader, I am willing to sacrifice myself for the continuation of the tribe!”","Zhou Yu looked at the old man’s palm that was about to cover his head. He turned around and ran out of the tent without looking back. Being in such a world, how could Zhou Yu not know the cruelty of this world!? In this harsh world, for Zhou Yu, the presence of her small family and tribe meant that his living environment was warm.","However, now, his father’s words completely shattered Zhou Yu’s thoughts. His own father actually wanted to send his sister away. Using such a method to perpetuate the tribe was truly a disgrace for the Forbidden Feather Tribe. Zhou Yu hated his father for making the decision, but he also knew that there was nothing his father could do.","Ever since the leader of the Tail Bind Tribe increased in strength, he had been suppressing and controlling the other surrounding species. Many species had been exterminated by the Tail Bind Tribe because they had rejected their control.","There were many such examples. A few factions that were allied with the Forbidden Feather Tribe were exterminated by the Tail Bind Tribe because they were unwilling to send their young women over.","Zhou Yu clenched his fists and roared at the sky. At this moment, compared to hating his father for making the decision, Zhou Yu resented his own weakness more.","In his heart, Zhou Yu couldn’t help but angrily think that if he could prevent his sister from being abused by that old scoundrel of the Tail Bind Tribe and let her live freely and happily, he was willing to use his life and everything in exchange.","Zhou Yu, who had just thought of this, could not help but laugh at himself. His life was not worth anything at all. Even if he really exchanged everything he had, could he really exchange it for anything? Who would be willing to take his useless life!?","With these thoughts, Zhou Yu sighed deeply.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the weaker side had no choice whatsoever, not even in matters of life and death. Zhou Yu himself had no power to decide. If his father had not made such a choice, his sister and he would most likely have died at the hands of the Tail Bind Tribe.","It was a decision that her father had just made, and Little You was still unaware of it.","Zhou Yu was prepared to accompany his sister, but when he reached the tent where his sister lived, he lost control of his emotions. He did not know how to face Zhou You at all. Zhou Yu did not dare to tell his sister about all of this.","In a magnificent hall in the South Universe, a woman in luxurious clothes was hugging a young girl who looked like a pocket-sized doll in her arms. She was clearly smiling, but her eyes could not help but reveal a sorrowful expression.","The girl in the woman’s arms was very obedient. She did not make a fuss and her beautiful eyes were fixed on the incense burner that was burning with wispy smoke. Her beautiful eyes were both ancient and empty, as if she had seen through the ostentatiousness of this world.","The woman in luxurious clothes tried her best to hide the sorrow in her eyes as she lowered her eyes and said to the girl in her arms, “Ru Yi, you can’t do that kind of stupid thing again. You were born in the Carp Mystic Palace and are the little princess in the palace. As the master, you need not concern yourself with the gossip of those servants. Those servants who dared to slander you behind your back have already been cleared out. Their entire families have paid the price for it!","“If any of those servants displease you, you can simply have your personal attendants deal with them directly. Since your two personal attendants failed to take care of you properly, I’ve already punished them by asking them to face the wall in the Torrent Cold Pool.","“Ru Yi, you are my only child. What will happen to her if you die?!”","At this point, the woman in luxurious clothes paused for a moment before continuing, “Your father and I have let you down. When we gave birth to you, we didn’t expect this curse to have an effect on our descendants and even transfer it to you!”","Originally, the woman in luxurious clothes wanted to say that she would do everything in her power to help the girl in her arms remove the curse. However, how could it be so easy to remove the curse? After working hard for so many years and using all the power of the Carp Mystic Palace, and even going so far as to find a Grade 5 Creator, it was still not enough.","This curse was fused with the girl’s bloodline. She would be able to maintain her appearance at about ten years old and would stay that way forever. However, the curse would deplete her lifespan. Even though her daughter hadn’t lived to a hundred, half of her lifespan had already been consumed. In another ten years, would the mother-daughter relationship between her and Ru Yi be severed?!","The woman in luxurious clothes felt increasingly distressed as she thought about it and her eyes could not help but reveal a sad expression. She did not know that the sorrow between her brows had deeply pierced the heart of the girl in her arms.","Ru Yi looked up at her mother. In her memory, her mother had never seemed to smile at her ever since she could remember. Even when she smiled, the smile never reached her eyes.","His parents, uncles, aunties, grandparents, grandparents, and all the elders looked at her with regretful and painful expressions. As she grew older and more experienced, Ru Yi also learned about her body’s condition. Every day, she had to expend massive resources to slow down the depletion of her lifespan.","The servants of the Carp Mystic Palace did not dare to openly discuss her condition in her presence, but it was common for them to talk about it behind her back. It had made Ru Yi feel that she was a burden more than once, leading to thoughts of suicide. Ru Yi felt that if she was not around, her father and mother would not have to spend so many resources on her every day. The other relatives in the family also would not have to worry about her condition.","Ru Yi heard the servants’ discussion about her and they accelerated the thoughts in Ru Yi’s heart.","After experiencing a close brush with death, as well as witnessing the tears of her parents, Ru Yi suddenly had a different emotion. His mother always shed tears because of her condition. However, Ru Yi had never seen her father cry. In Ru Yi’s memory, her father was an extremely serious and resolute man, who never showed any signs of weakness.","Upon seeing her parents facing her imminent death with broken hearts, Ru Yi changed her mind. Despite the curse tormenting Ru Yi’s body and causing her immense pain, she still decided to spend the remaining decades accompanying her parents. It was her way of fulfilling her filial duty and repaying her parents for their lifelong bond. However, no matter what, Ru Yi felt indignant.","If it weren’t for the curse in her body, Ru Yi would have had the freedom to explore the world more, instead of being like a bird in a cage as she was now, confined to glimpsing the world through records in ancient texts.","In such a huge faction, Ru Yi believed that she was a very realistic person. However, in the face of her situation, Ruyi could not help but pray. If she could rid herself of the curse, live like a normal person and not let her parents and family worry about her, Ru Yi was willing to use everything she had in exchange.","With these thoughts in mind, Ru Yi couldn’t help but chuckle at herself, feeling that her ideas were somewhat fanciful. The Grade 5 Creator had examined her condition. If that Grade 5 Creator could not do anything, how could others change her predicament?!","“Mother, you and Father don’t need to blame yourselves. It was foolish of me to do something that worried you both. I won’t do such a thing again in the future. You can be rest assured. I did what I did before by deliberately hiding it from Han Xing and Leng Yun. If you keep them in the Torrent Cold Pool, I’ll lack manpower here. Mother, let Hanxing and Leng Yun come out of the Torrent Cold Pool. I promise I won’t do anything like this again!”","Upon hearing the words of the girl in her arms, the woman still felt a lingering sense of unease, but she knew that her daughter would not lie to her in such a matter, “Ru Yi, since you’ve asked for mercy for the two of them, we’ll do as you say. They’ll be back with you this evening.","“I’ll take you later to use the cinnabar from the Red Carp and the powder of the Ten Thousand Year Mica to help suppress the curse in your body. You’ve injured a lot of the roots in your body this time. You’ll need to replenish them in the next half a year!”","As she said these words, the woman in the luxurious dress couldn’t help but feel a bit anxious, because in the past, her daughter had been very resistant to suppressing the curse.","The cinnabar from the Red Carp refined the body and the powder of the Ten Thousand Year Mica refined the soul. However, they didn’t offer a pleasant sensation when applied. Previously, Ru Yi had a strong aversion to them.","However, Ru Yi had already made up her mind to be filial to her parents for the next few years. After making this decision, she no longer rejected this method of suppressing the curse. Only by living well could she be more filial in front of his father and mother.","“Alright, I’ll try my best to hold on for as long as possible this time. I’ll strive to maximize the effect of this cleansing. Mother, I have to cleanse every day or two. You don’t have to accompany me every time. In the future, I’ll get up every morning to cleanse first. I’ll look for you after I’m done!”","Upon hearing Ru Yi’s words, the woman in luxurious clothes was stunned. She did not expect her daughter to suddenly become so sensible. However, Lan","Xiang was not very happy about it. Instead, she felt a little upset. As a mother, Lan Xiang understood her daughter best. She knew that Ru Yi’s words and actions were influenced by the compromise she made. This compromise made Lan Xiang feel even more indebted to her daughter.","After the Moon Empress finished her meal, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu went to a quiet room, “Wen Yu, let’s start the Astronomical Parliament. This time, you’ll select two members to join the Astronomical Parliament. Let’s see how long you can hold the Astronomical Parliament if you recruit two members. As long as it can last for 20 minutes, it will be enough!”","When Wen Yu heard Lin Yuan’s words, she recalled how he had dragged Jing Bai into the Astronomical Parliament for the first time after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“Young Master, with my current situation and the support of the Star Vastness","Peony, it shouldn’t be difficult for me to pull the two of them into the Astronomical Parliament and let the meeting last for 20 minutes. I should be able to do it. When my Astronomical Parliament’s star level advances again, it can last even longer!”","After saying that, Wen Yu took out a few pieces of rainbow fish coats that Liu Jie had baked and quickly chewed them.","In the main world, the fish coats that Wen Yu had eaten were not of a high grade. Now that Lin Yuan had nurtured them, the fish coats produced by them could perfectly meet Wen Yu’s consumption needs.","Wen Yu closed her eyes and activated the Astronomical Parliament. As the cat-eye-like gem on Wen Yu’s forehead lit up, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu appeared in a place where the constellations were shining brightly. Following closely behind were Liu Jie, Luo Lan, Su Yiren, and Bei Xu.","The four of them had just sat down when Jing Bail s figure appeared on the Ophiuchus constellation seat.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie had investigated Jing Bail s life experiences. In their eyes, Jing Bai was an extremely pitiful little thing.","Even if Jing Bai, who was in North Universe, joined the Astronomical","Parliament, he would only be able to obtain a large amount of resources and support and would not be able to obtain more reliance.","Fortunately, the Alluring Foxes had headed to North Universe and were not far from Jing Bail s location.","Lin Yuan asked Kong Huan to contact Jing Bai and ask her to protect the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Lin Yuan had already provided Kong Huan with the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower’s ramet, so Kong Huan could use it to communicate with Lin Yuan without any obstacles.","According to Kong Huan, the Alluring Foxes had already begun to protect the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes with their status as Snow-covered Foxes. They no longer allowed the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes to oppress the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","The Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes were not afraid of the Alluring Foxes, given their significantly superior overall strength. However, they had no choice but to give the Snow-covered Foxes face.","The Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes treated the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes as their servants. All the members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were laborers of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes.","In the eyes of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes’ ruler, the Alluring Foxes were seizing control of their dependent species. However, due to the reputation and might of the Snow-covered Foxes, the domineering Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes had no choice but to compromise.."]},{"number":3011,"title":"Chapter 3011: New Member of the Astronomical Parliament!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3011: New Member of the Astronomical Parliament!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes’ strength was incomparable to the Snow-covered Foxes.","It was rumored that a Fox leader of the Snow-covered Foxes had publicly announced that Kong Huan had become the mistress of his territory. The ruler of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes did not know how long Kong Huan, who was from the Alluring Foxes, would be doted on by the Fox leader.","During this period when the leader of the Snow-covered Foxes favored Kong Huan, he wouldn’t mind taking action against the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes for her sake.","The Snow-covered Foxes were not the strongest in North Universe, but they were domineering enough. In the past, there were many species stronger than the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes that were directly dealt with by the Snow-covered Foxes because they had angered them.","The overbearingness of the Snow-covered Foxes was not without reason. They needed to assert their dominance to gain respect from other species and establish their power and influence in North Universe.","Kong Huan had always known how to borrow strength. The bloodline of the Alluring Foxes determined their survival method.","Having the Alluring Foxes help protect the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes was the first task arranged by Lin Yuan for Kong Huan since nurturing her. Kong Huan naturally had to do her best to complete this mission.","Therefore, when Kong Huan personally visited the leader of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes, she appeared very unyielding and repeatedly used the dominance of the Snow-Covered Foxes to suppress them.","In less than two weeks, she brought the members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes away.","Kong Huan did not bring the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes to the territory of the Snow-Covered Foxes, as the Snow-Covered Foxes had always rejected foreign species and only had a certain degree of acceptance towards other fox species.","Bringing the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes into the territory of the Snow-Covered Foxes would not provide them with a suitable living environment and could potentially lead to problems for Kong Huan herself.","However, it was not difficult to arrange a decent territory for the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes with the power of the Snow-Covered Fox leaders.","Kong Huan could sense how much Lin Yuan valued the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were best suited to enhance their strength in areas with high concentration of water elements.","Kong Huan spent some resources to buy an extremely wide inland lake and arranged for it to be used by the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. This inland lake was not far from the territory of the Snow-Covered Foxes. If the Purifying","Water Illusion Snakes lived here, the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes would not dare to cause trouble.","When Lin Yuan asked Kong Huan to protect the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, he only mentioned Jing Bai. As a result, Kong Huan only negotiated with Jing Bai when dealing with his species.","Jing Bai’s living environment in the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes was extremely poor. The oppression and domination by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes over the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had made the members of the latter submissive, constantly trying to please the former.","Due to his parents’ background, Jing Bai had been despised by the other members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. But now, because of Kong Huan’s attitude towards Jing Bai, his status within the species had risen.","Kong Huan couldn’t discern what made this young man from the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes so remarkable. However, considering Lin Yuan’s high regard for Jing Bai, his potential for future development would definitely be boundless.","Kong Huan was well aware of the resources and power Lin Yuan possessed. This led her to openly express her intention to actively establish a relationship when interacting with Jing Bai which further changed Jing Bai’s reputation and status within the species.","In the past, those who looked down on Jing Bai and called him a jinx didn’t dare to speak ill of him anymore. Instead, they treated him as the savior of their species.","At first, Jing Bai was thrilled and excited about this development, but soon he realized that such a situation was actually a tragedy for the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. It was unknown how many generations it would take for the bones of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes to grow back.","In his heart, Jing Bai felt an overwhelming sense of gratitude towards Lin Yuan, who had already fulfilled his promise to him. Lin Yuan effortlessly resolved the plight of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes that had lasted for thousands of years.","When he received the resources from Lin Yuan, Jing Bai still harbored some doubts about the sincerity of Lin Yuan’s promises. He was also wondering if","this organization called the Astronomical Parliament could really help him. At present, Jing Bai felt as if he had been reborn.","Just as Jing Bai was about to express his gratitude to Lin Yuan, he heard Lin Yuan speak up. “Jing Bai, how’s the current situation of your Purifying Water Illusion Snakes? I think the predicament of survival should have been resolved!”","Kong Huan was an expert from the Sky Beyond the Clouds that Lin Yuan had taken in when he was in the main world. In terms of ability, Kong Huan, who was previously a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, was stronger than Fan Lou.","Perhaps in terms of adapting to the situation, Fan Lou’s living environment far xceeded that of ordinary people, but in terms of handling and management,","Fan Lou could not compare to Kong Huan at all.","Kong Huan was not strong when she met Lin Yuan, and the Alluring Foxes were weaker overall. However, Kong Huan was able to develop the Alluring","Foxes extremely well with her own abilities. Since Kong Huan had told Lin Yuan that the situation had been resolved, Kong","Huan must have resolved this matter beautifully.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Jing Bai quickly stood up and bowed deeply to him. “I am extremely grateful for your help to my Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. Now, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes have completely escaped the control of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes and will no longer suffer oppression from them. From now on, I will definitely use everything I have to repay you according to the oath!”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “You’re a member of the Astronomical Parliament, and we have to support each other. Try your best to use the resources I gave you to improve your bloodline. There’s no need to say things like repayment or such.”","Lin Yuan changed the topic and asked seriously, “Do you think there’s any suitable development space for the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes?”","Lin Yuan had never gone to North Universe to investigate the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. Even if he had conducted on-site investigations, he would not have been able to grasp many internal matters of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Lin Yuan saved the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, and now that they have broken free from the control of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes, they must ultimately find their own way forward.","Lin Yuan’s question was also a test for him. Strength could be gradually improved through the provision of resources, but intelligence was innate. If Jing Bai could not find a way out of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, Lin Yuan would have to consider whether it was necessary to continue nurturing Jing Bai in the future.","Although Jing Bai was young, he did not have many opportunities to train himself in the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. However, Jing Bai was very intelligent. He knew that when Lin Yuan asked him this question, he had to make every effort to show the value of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","“Leo, the bloodline of our Purifying Water Illusion Snakes is extremely powerful. The reason why we were enslaved by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes previously was because they countered our Purifying Water Illusion Snakes in terms of bloodline talent.","“Now that we have a suitable living environment, without the enslavement of he Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes, the strength of our Purifying Water Illusion Snakes will quickly increase.","“The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes’ ability is mainly healing. We can develop and open medical centers to cooperate with the surrounding factions.","“Furthermore, our Purifying Water Illusion Snakes also possess the ability to search for supplies and excavate them. This is enough for our Purifying Water Illusion Snakes to develop well!”","Upon hearing Jing Bai’s words, Lin Yuan was relieved and nodded with a smile. Jing Bai’s ability to mention the advantages of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes indicated that they were indeed making efforts to find their own way forward.","The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had the intention of working hard t improve. When the time came, he would get Kong Huan to bring the Purifying","Water Illusion Snakes along and give them more opportunities. With this, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes would surely be able to develop further.","Like Kong Huan, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes belonged to the faction that Lin Yuan had planted in North Universe. In the future, when these two factions developed and Lin Yuan had designs on North Universe, these two factions would definitely repay Lin Yuan for helping them.","“Jing Bai, your Purifying Water Illusion Snakes have only recently gained their","independence. The opportunity they have now is entirely due to your efforts. I hope you can become the actual manager of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","“From now on, you can ask Kong Huan for help if you need anything. As long as your request is not overboard, Kong Huan should be able to help you. If you really encounter a problem that you can’t solve, you can contact me directly and let me help you think of a solution!”","If Lin Yuan had said this to him during the Astronomical Parliament, he would not have thought too much about it. However, now that the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had regained their freedom, and the elders within the species regained control, Jing Bai had discovered many shortcomings within the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","The few elders of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had gone overboard in their fight for power. Jing Bai did not believe that he could be the manager of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Jing Bai had never been a conceited person, but he understood a principle.","There was no such thing as gratuitous help in this world. Lin Yuan had saved the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, so he would definitely have expectations from them in return.","If the Elders in the species were allowed to fight for power, it would definitely have a huge impact on the internal dynamics of the Purifying Water Illusion","Snakes. Jing Bai did not want Lin Yuan to be disappointed in the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. Therefore, he wanted to become their manager.","If Lin Yuan was disheartened by the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, there was no need for him to do anything. As long as Kong Huan did not protect the","Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes would immediately regain control of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Jing Bai might not be able to do anything right now, but with Lin Yuan’s support, he would have many opportunities to try and make mistakes. Jing Bai believed that with this opportunity, he would definitely be able to become the leader of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","“Leo, I will make myself a qualified leader of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes in a short period of time. If there are any problems in the future, I will inform Senior Kong Huan. I will definitely develop the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes as soon as possible!”","Upon hearing his reply, Lin Yuan looked at him in satisfaction. In Jing Bai, Lin Yuan saw a glimpse of Bu Po. However, Jing Bai was much more clear-headed and was not as restrained as Bu Po. With some ability and tricks, Jing Bai could easily take control of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes with Kong Huan’s help.","After all, even the Elders of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were well aware of why the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes could escape the control of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes.","“Jing Bai, after this Astronomical Parliament meeting ends, I’ll provide you with more resources. When the time comes, you can use these resources to develop the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. As for how to use these resources, you can decide for yourself. I believe you should be more willing to use these resources to nurture your own people!”","With that, Lin Yuan nodded to Wen Yu, indicating that she could introduce the new members into the Astronomical Parliament.","Wen Yu began to screen the new members. Lin Yuan quickly selected a target and pulled it into the Astronomical Parliament’s meeting.","The moment they pulled this target into the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie began to investigate this target’s life experiences.","The three of them quickly finished investigating the target’s life experience.","Wen Yu and Liu Jie both felt that the experience of the target named Zhou Yu was remarkably similar to that of Ta Lei.","Back then, Ta Lei was also from a small tribe. In order for the tribe to survive, he had joined the Astronomical Parliament with everything he had.","Ta Lei didn’t make any achievements after joining the Astronomical Parliament, especially since not long after Ta Lei joined the Astronomical Parliament, Luo Lan also became a member.","As the successor to the Iron Hammer Federation’s throne, Luo Lan was much more useful than Ta Lei in managing factions.","Although Ta Lei did not make any achievements, he did not choose to follow Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. However, this was not because Ta Lei did not want to do anything for Sky City, but because Ta Lei’s ability was really limited. With Ta Lei’s ability, he had already maximized his value.","As two members of the Astronomical Parliament, Wen Yu and Liu Jie had never disliked Ta Lei because of his abilities. Liu Jie and Wen Yu could not help but miss their old friends in the main world when they thought of the lively","Astronomical Parliament and wondered how those old friends were doing now.","Upon seeing Zhou Yu’s life story and his willingness to stake everything to join the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan couldn’t help but recall his own struggles to make a living in Xia County alongside Chu Ci.","Lin Yuan could understand Zhou Yu’s feelings as an elder brother.","Zhou Yu, who had just entered the Astronomical Parliament, was looking at the starry land in a daze. He had no idea what was going on.."]},{"number":3012,"title":"Chapter 3012 The Source of the Curse!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3012 The Source of the Curse!","....","Zhou Yu remembered that he had gone to visit his sister. In Zhou You’s tent, Zhou Yu could not bear to tell his sister about their father’s decision. He could imagine how sad Zhou You would be if she knew that their father had decided to send her to the Tail Bind Tribe as a gift to their leader.","Even if Zhou You knew about this in advance and caused a ruckus, there was no way to change the outcome. This was because Zhou You was someone the Tail Bind Tribe had specifically asked for. If someone else was sent over, the Tail Bind Tribe would most likely not be able to accept it.","After leaving Zhou You’s tent, Zhou Yu ran around the periphery of the Forbidden Feather Tribe’s territory to vent his frustration. In the end, he fainted in a field.","Before losing consciousness, Zhou Yu couldn’t help but pray. Subconsciously, he felt like he was in a dream, but the sensation felt far too vivid to be just a dream. The sensation Zhou Yu experienced in this dream was completely different from his previous dreams.","Just as Zhou Yu was unsure how to react, he heard a woman’s warm and extremely calm voice ask, “Welcome to the Astronomical Parliament. We’ve sensed your wish. Now, I want to ask you if you’re willing to use everything you have to exchange for your sister’s safety in the Forbidden Feather Tribe!?”","Zhou Yu’s wish was extremely simple. As an elder brother, Zhou Yu was willing to give up everything for his younger sister.","Wen Yu routinely questioned Zhou Yu. She knew very well that if Zhou Yu was willing to join the Astronomical Parliament and offer his loyalty, Zhou Yu would receive much more than what was currently being offered. However, the additional promise to Zhou Yu was Lin Yuan’s business.","In fact, Wen Yu was not very satisfied with Zhou Yu’s situation. He was unlike Jing Bai, who was from the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were quite powerful in terms of bloodline talent and had a lot of room for nurturing. However, Zhou Yu’s bloodline was not very strong, and the Forbidden Feather Tribe could not provide much help to Lin Yuan.","If Zhou Yu hesitated and was unwilling to fulfill his promise, Wen Yu would send him away without hesitation.","Wen Yu had underestimated Zhou Yu’s determination to save his sister.","Even though Zhou Yu could not tell if this was reality or a dream, he still spoke to Wen Yu immediately.","“If I can ensure that my sister doesn’t have to go to the Tail Bind Tribe and can live safely in the Forbidden Feather Tribe, I’ll do anything you want. I can take responsibility for the promises I made!”","As he spoke, Zhou Yu looked around. The more he looked at his surroundings, the more Zhou Yu felt like he was in a dream. Zhou Yu could not help but feel disappointed. He thought to himself that it would be great if everything was real. If all of this was real, then his sister would be saved!","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie could sense Zhou Yu’s thoughts.","Wen Yu looked at Lin Yuan and waited for him to make a decision. It was to see if Lin Yuan wanted to save and fulfill Zhou Yu’s wish.","Liu Jie looked up at Wen Yu and could not help but smile when he saw the way she looked at Lin Yuan. Wen Yu had been by Lin Yuan’s side for so long but did not really understand him. If Wen Yu really understood Lin Yuan, she would definitely know that he would accept Zhou Yu.","Just as Liu Jie had expected, Lin Yuan spoke to Zhou Yu. “Since you can take responsibility for your promise, welcome to the Astronomical Parliament. You can place your palm over the back of the chair behind you and imprint your soul on this seat. From now on, you will officially become a member of the Astronomical Parliament.","“Our Astronomical Parliament can guarantee that your sister can live in the Forbidden Feather Tribe without worry. However, no lifeforms can escape the potential natural and man-made disasters. I can only promise that I won’t let your sister be coerced and influenced by the Tail Bind Tribe. As for the other hidden dangers, I’ll leave them to you, as the elder brother.”","Upon hearing that, an excited expression appeared on Zhou Yu’s face. Although Zhou Yu felt like this was a dream, being able to fulfill his wish in the dream, to be a hero and save his sister, he was more than willing!","Zhou Yu raised his hand and covered the seat behind him with his palm. The constellation suddenly lit up above Zhou Yu’s head. The moment the constellation lit up, a lot of information related to Sky City appeared in Zhou Yu’s mind. The appearance of this information made Zhou Yu once again doubt whether he was in a dream or reality.","After confirming that Lin Yuan had made Zhou Yu a member of the Astronomical Parliament, Wen Yu continued to screen the new members.","On the other hand, Lin Yuan was thinking about how to help Zhou Yu resolve his predicament. He could not possibly send Winter to the West Universe to help Zhou Yu resolve.","With the awakening of the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, Lin Yuan killed a large number of star pirates and collected a lot of willpower and power of law.","The strongest expert in the Forbidden Feather Tribe was only at the spirit fire level.","The Tail Bind Tribe was like a local tyrant, controlling the life and death of other tribes. But in fact, the strongest person in the Tail Bind Tribe had only reached the Divine Kingdom level.","The humanoid weapons that Red Thorn currently had were at the pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Lin Yuan could send a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom humanoid weapon to help Zhou Yu under his control. It would be enough to fulfill Zhou Yu’s wish. It could also allow the Forbidden Feather Tribe to obtain new development in the area they were in.","Lin Yuan did not have any foundation yet in the West Universe. Hence, Zhou Yu would serve as an extension of Lin Yuan’s influence there. Although Zhou Yu was not strong, it would be convenient for Lin Yuan to gradually understand the West Universe through him.","Indeed, replacing Zhou Yu and recruiting a new member of the West Universe might better fulfill Lin Yuan’s needs. However, in Lin Yuan’s opinion, Zhou Yu’s selfless dedication to his sister was extremely rare. Lin Yuan was willing to fulfill the wish of a fellow like him!","While Wen Yu was selecting newcomers to enter the Astronomical Parliament, Liu Jie’s gaze was fixed on Zhou Yu. Zhou Yu’s life was about to change after joining the Astronomical Parliament. However, how far Zhou Yu could go in the future would depend on how hard he worked. If Zhou Yu did not improve after realizing his wish, he would soon be eliminated by the Astronomical Parliament.","The Astronomical Parliament was intolerant of idleness. Liu Jie, in particular, had always criticized Lin Yuan’s nurturing of Peace, noting her tendency to prioritize her own interests. In the future, Liu Jie vowed not to permit individuals like Peace to remain within the Astronomical Parliament.","Wen Yu had conducted several screenings, but the candidates she assessed lacked seriousness. Even individuals like Zhou Yu failed to meet Lin Yuan’s standards.","With time ticking away, each screening session led by Wen Yu drained her energy and heightened her anxiety. If this trend persisted, the Astronomical Parliament would likely struggle to recruit new members.","Then, Wen Yu stumbled upon a unique candidate willing to sacrifice everything to rid themselves of a curse. However, fulfilling the candidate’s demands proved daunting. Furthermore, the candidate hailed from the unexplored South Universe, representing a faction of extraordinary status there.","This candidate evoked memories of Yin Lin, the Astronomical Parliament’s first member.","If Lin Yuan could assist in lifting the curse, this candidate would likely prove invaluable to her cause.","Wen Yu quickly pulled this unique target into the Astronomical Parliament.","Ru Yi was certain that she was lying on the bed in front of the place where the starlight gathered. Her maidservants had just helped her make her bed.","Ru Yi, who had always been cursed, was extremely good at viewing problems with a clear mind.","At this moment, Ru Yi was extremely calm. The experience in front of her was very different from the dream. It was impossible for the scenery in the dream to be as vivid as it was now.","Ru Yi did not speak immediately. Instead, she seriously investigated the surroundings and the people in this environment. The three people sitting on the golden seats shrouded in starlight were clearly the leaders there.","While Ru Yi was observing Lin Yuan and the others, Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu were also trying to understand Ru Yi’s situation based on her memories.","It was the first time Lin Yuan had heard of the Carp Mystic Palace.","Due to the curse afflicting her body, Ru Yi had been exceptionally well protected by her parents since birth. She had basically never left the Carp Mystic Palace. Even if she left, she would have her parents protecting her by her side.","However, the Carp Mystic Palace was definitely not simple. After all, it had once found a Grade 5 Creator to heal Ru Yi’s curse. Even if this Grade 5 Creator had just entered Grade 5, it was still incredibly remarkable.","As far as Lin Yuan knew, even a Bloodian Queen like Qin Yu could not invite a Grade 5 Creator into her territory in the East Universe. If she wanted to meet a Grade 5 Creator, she would usually have to make an appointment in advance. After getting the answer from a Grade 5 Creator, they could then meet in the territory of the Grade 5 Creator.","Yet, Ru Yi’s parents could invite a Grade 5 Creator into the Carp Mystic Palace.","Wen Yu sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, this situation is quite special. I wonder if you could help her lift her curse. If we can remove the curse and bring her into Sky City, it will be of great help to the faction’s development in the South Universe.","“If there is no way to lift the curse, I can directly send her back. If we send her back, she’ll just treat it as a dream. Even if she tells others about the Astronomical Parliament, no one will believe her. She doesn’t know anything about anyone in Sky City.”","Lin Yuan was also a little hesitant. He knew very well how beneficial it would be for Sky City’s development to bring in Ru Yi. However, Lin Yuan was not sure if he could help Ru Yi remove the curse with his current methods.","If Lin Yuan were to agree to allow Ru Yi to join the Sky City now but ultimately could not help her, it could lead to disappointment and distrust.","Lin Yuan asked Ruyi, “Are you still willing to use everything you have in exchange for a chance to remove your curse?”","Ru Yi hesitated for a moment before nodding. “If I can really remove the curse, I’m indeed willing to use everything to exchange for it. However, there’s a prerequisite for my exchange. That is, this exchange can’t affect my parents or harm the interests of the Carp Mystic Palace!”","After saying that, Ru Yi paused for a moment before continuing. “Even if it harms the interests of the Carp Mystic Palace, I hope there will be a chance to compensate the Carp Mystic Palace in the future. As the little princess of the Carp Mystic Palace, I haven’t done anything for the Carp Mystic Palace.”","Although Ru Yi had always been well protected by her family, she was not heartless and na?ve. Ru Yi’s words served to establish her boundaries with Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and Lin Yuan while also revealing her identity to showcase her value.","The Carp Mystic Palace had spent so much effort but was still unable to help her break the curse. Now that she had encountered a new opportunity, she hoped to seize it.","Naturally, the prerequisite for her to hand over everything and join this faction was that the other party could help her break the curse. If the other party could not do this, there was no need for Ru Yi to drag her cursed body into a faction and be controlled by this faction.","The fact that this faction could remove her curse meant that they had access to more resources than Carp Mystic Palace. If that was the case, joining this faction could also be seen as finding a close ally for the Carp Mystic Palace.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Of course. If you join this faction and this faction harms you, how can the faction you joined make you submit?","“Before you leave this time, I’ll prepare some things for you, as well as a ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. If any of these things have any effect on your curse, tell me through the ramet. If these things are of no use to you, I hope you can find out the source of this curse so that I can better help you. I realized that you don’t know the source of this curse.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan waved his hand lightly, and Wen Yu immediately adjourned the Astronomical Parliament.","Wen Yu had expended too much spiritual energy during the screening process, so the Astronomical Parliament could no longer continue. If it continued, Wen Yu’s spiritual energy would be depleted.","At present, there was nothing more to do in the Astronomical Parliament. Before he was sure he could help Ru Yi remove the curse, Lin Yuan could not let her sign a contract with the chair behind her.","This time, even though Wen Yu was constantly selecting members and recruiting two new members to join the Astronomical Parliament, the meeting still lasted for nearly 20 minutes. If he didn’t recruit new members, each Astronomical Parliament would be able to last for half an hour. This was enough time for the Astronomical Parliament to circulate normally.","Now, both Zhou Yu and Ru Yi, who have obtained the items, should be aware that what they just experienced was not a dream but a reality."]},{"number":3013,"title":"Chapter 3013 Zhou Yu’s Choice!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3013 Zhou Yu’s Choice!","....","The moment Zhou Yu’s soul and will returned to his body, he suddenly opened his eyes.","Looking at the darkness and the flickering flames in the tent, Zhou Yu subconsciously touched his forehead and sighed in his heart. What he had just experienced was indeed a dream!","In the dream, Zhou Yu had joined a strange organization that came from the stars and was filled with a high-end mystical aura.","The people of this organization had already given him a promise and fulfilled his wish.","The excitement and happiness in Zhou Yu’s heart turned into endless resentment at that moment.","Zhou Yu slammed his hand down on his bed heavily and groaned, “This damn Tail Bind Tribe, I—”","Before Zhou Yu could finish speaking, he saw a tall human figure standing in the shadows beside his bed.","Zhou Yu got up in a panic. His hand touched something on the bed that looked like a ring.","Zhou Yu suppressed the panic in his heart. He was just a small fry. There was no need for the other tribes to send people to assassinate him.","The humanoid figure did not move at all. It was like a statue.","Zhou Yu reached out to light the oil lamp by the bed and saw the human figure clearly.","This humanoid figure was a bald man with a cold face. His greenish-black skin was unnaturally pale. The bald and cold-faced man remained motionless as if he had been fixed in place.","Examining the ring in his palm, Zhou Yu marveled at its beauty. Adorned with intricate layers of blue-purple crystals and delicate filigree, accented by bright silver metal, the ring boasted a large, captivating gem nestled atop its design—a true marvel of craftsmanship.","Such a treasure was beyond anything Zhou Yu had ever encountered, surpassing even the most formidable artifacts known to the Tail Bind Tribe.","As he pondered the impossibility of this stunning creation materializing out of thin air, Zhou Yu’s mind raced. Could it be that what he had just experienced was not a mere dream?","Recollection flooded back: the figure seated upon the golden throne, crowned with the Leo constellation, had promised Zhou Yu a gift before departing from that magic place.","With a hesitant hand, Zhou Yu reached out to touch the ring, instinctively channeling his spiritual energy.","To his astonishment, a vast space revealed itself within the confines of the ring—a cavernous expanse capable of housing ten of his tribe’s largest tents.","Intrigued, Zhou Yu explored the space, finding only a solitary wooden box nestled in a corner, adorned with a simple card.","Harnessing his spiritual energy, Zhou Yu effortlessly retrieved the box, though he refrained from opening it immediately. Instead, he inspected the accompanying letter.","Confirmation of the existence of the Astronomical Parliament solidified Zhou Yu’s resolve. Yet, it was the contents of the letter that held the key to unlocking the mysteries before him.","Contained within were concise instructions: to imprint his spiritual mark upon the humanoid weapon awaiting outside—a simple act that would grant Zhou Yu complete control over this enigmatic creation.","And this humanoid weapon’s strength had actually reached pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom!","This humanoid weapon was an existence that Zhou Yu had never come into contact with before. The Tail Bind Tribe’s leader had just reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, but he was already able to act as he pleased in this area.","This humanoid weapon had the strength to easily kill the leader of the Tail Bind Tribe.","After reading the letter in his hand, Zhou Yu, this strong guy, could not help but cry.","Zhou Yu knew that his sister would not have to suffer humiliation and be sent to the Tail Bind Tribe. She would not be tortured by the animals of the Tail Bind Tribe. He already could protect her!","Not only could this weapon protect his sister, Zhou You, but it could also allow the Forbidden Feather Tribe to replace the Tail Bind Tribe as the ruler of this area. The other tribes would look up to the Forbidden Feather Tribe and submit to them.","Being looked up to and submitted to by other tribes would allow the Forbidden Feather Tribe to obtain more resources and quickly strengthen the tribe’s foundation.","This weapon could be said to allow Zhou Yu to see his future direction clearly!","Zhou Yu used his spiritual energy to leave a mark on the humanoid weapon beside his bed.","Zhou Yu realized that commanding this humanoid weapon was as easy as drinking water. It was as if this humanoid weapon was a part of his body!","After trying to command the humanoid weapon for a while, Zhou Yu opened the wooden box on the bed. The wooden box was filled with fingernail-sized white crystals and green pearls.","Lin Yuan had checked Zhou Yu’s life experience and knew what kind of resources he needed to increase his strength. These spirit qi crystals and wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were the most suitable for Zhou Yu.","Zhou Yu could use these resources to increase his strength in an extremely short period of time.","Lin Yuan had thought that Zhou Yu might distribute these resources to the other members of the tribe.","Lin Yuan had never thought of interfering with all of this. It was all Zhou Yu’s own choice. However, if Zhou Yu died because of his choice one day, Lin Yuan would not be able to do anything.","In an environment like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the most important thing was to use visible resources to increase one’s strength! If Zhou Yu did not even know this, he would definitely be eliminated!","The Forbidden Feather Tribe’s overall strength was limited. Lin Yuan could not possibly lead the entire Forbidden Feather Tribe to develop for Zhou Yu’s sake. When it came to nurturing the members of the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan also considered the investment and output.","The best way for Zhou Yu to stand out was to leave the Forbidden Feather Tribe and join other tribes after improving his strength.","Just like how Fan Lou had joined the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in the early days, he had first become a dependent species of another tribe. Then, he used the other tribes as a platform to pursue greater development.","This path represented a strategic choice for Zhou Yu, a route promising swift advancement. Failure to grasp its significance would confine him to the confines of the Forbidden Feather Tribe, leaving it vulnerable and undefended.","Moreover, using the humanoid weapon would invariably make him a thorn in the side of neighboring tribes.","It was essential to recognize that the Tail Bind Tribe’s dominance in the region stemmed not only from their leader’s World Emperor/Divine Kingdom power but also from their longstanding accumulation of power.","Even before the Tail Bind Tribe’s leader achieved such lofty status, neighboring tribes harbored deep-seated fear of them.","The sudden elevation of the Forbidden Feather Tribe from a position of subjugation by their predecessors posed a significant challenge for neighboring tribes to accept.","Consequently, it was highly probable that they would subject the Forbidden Feather Tribe to probing and provocation.","Lin Yuan was aware of that but chose not to apprise Zhou Yu. He opted to observe the choices made by Zhou Yu and the Forbidden Feather Tribe firsthand.","If the Forbidden Feather Tribe relied on this pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom humanoid weapon to lord over others, they would not be able to understand their deeper meaning. Then the Astronomical Parliament could only choose new members to join!","After coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan’s thoughts had changed drastically compared to when he was in the main world. The current Lin Yuan was more suitable to be a superior than when he was in the main world.","It was not that Lin Yuan did not have a benevolent heart, but he was currently using it on his own people.","Without the protection of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, Lin Yuan would have died countless times in the Sky Beyond the Clouds! In such an environment where one was at the mercy of others, showing pity thoughtlessly would only lead to one’s death!","Zhou Yu looked at the resources that he did not even dare to think about and fell into deep thought.","Although Zhou Yu was born in a small tribe, this did not mean that he did not have any knowledge. Zhou Yu could recognize the value of the Creator resources in this box.","Zhou Yu was in a dilemma.","Zhou Yu was not conflicted about who should use this box of resources.","He had joined the Astronomical Parliament, a mysterious organization. The resources rewarded by Leo would definitely increase his strength.","If he distributed the resources and his strength and potential did not increase, he would not be able to explain himself to Leo!","Zhou Yu had been the successor of the tribe chosen by his father since he was young, but his sister’s bloodline talent was higher than his.","With Creator resources at this level, it was enough to stimulate his bloodline potential again and enable him to undergo a complete transformation!","However, Leo had helped him so much. How was he going to repay Leo and the Astronomical Parliament?","Zhou Yu fell into deep thought.","Zhou Yu felt that it was not appropriate for him to directly bring this pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom humanoid weapon to his father.","Zhou Yu looked at the weapon for a moment and pondered before taking out a black robe to cover it. The hood of this robe was not big enough, barely covering the face of this weapon. Zhou Yu simply commanded this war weapon to be a passerby who would kindly help the Forbidden Feather Tribe resolve their troubles.","After thinking about it for so long, Zhou Yu who had already calmed down decided not to expose this pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom humanoid weapon after seeing how many resources Lin Yuan had prepared for him.","This could indeed allow the Forbidden Feather Tribe to obtain short-term benefits but would also inevitably put the Forbidden Feather Tribe at the center of the storm! As long as this weapon was secretly protecting the safety of the tribe, all would be fine!","After making his decision, Zhou Yu felt relaxed, but at the same time, an invisible sense of urgency arose in his heart.","Zhou Yu’s sense of urgency came from how to prove his worth to the Astronomical Parliament.","At this moment, Zhou Yu had completely realized that the Astronomical Parliament, a huge and mysterious organization, was his opportunity.","Zhou Yu wanted to seize this opportunity to change his originally bumpy and ordinary life!","...","Ruyi opened her eyes in a gorgeous bedroom.","The glazed roof above the sleeping chamber was like the starry sky that Ruyi had just seen.","Ruyi had a habit of not wanting to be in a dark environment. Therefore, even the environment in her sleeping chamber was bright.","Ruyi, whose consciousness and soul had returned to reality, reached out and groped around the bed. After finding something that should not have appeared on her bed, Ruyi did not immediately pick it up and examine it.","Instead, she sat up and asked the four maidservants standing nearby, “What time is it now?”","One of the maidservants hurried forward. “Miss, it’s only 4:15 a.m. now. There are still nearly three hours before you normally wake up. Do you want to rest for a while?”","Ruyi knew that these maidservants were arranged by her mother. They were there because her mother was afraid she would do the same foolish thing as before.","However, Ruyi had to send these maidservants away so that it would be convenient for her to investigate the things in her hands. She did not want anyone to know about the Astronomical Parliament, not even her parents.","Firstly, the Astronomical Parliament was too mysterious. If her parents found out, they would definitely want to test the Astronomical Parliament.","The Astronomical Parliament was the key to removing the curse in her body.","The Carp Mystic Palace had not been able to remove her curse for decades. It could be said that her parents had no other way.","Secondly, before she left, the woman sitting in the golden main seat reminded her not to reveal any information about the Astronomical Parliament.","Thirdly, it was still unknown if the Astronomical Parliament could help her remove the curse in her body. She had to try it out later!","Telling her parents would not only make them suspicious, but it might also make them happy for nothing.","“I’m a little hungry. The two of you go prepare food for me. The two of you stand guard outside the hall. I want to drink the freshly ground Precious Fruit Jade soup. Help me bring it in when it’s ready.”","These four maidservants did not feel that Ruyi’s request was anything special. Moreover, with two of them guarding outside the hall, they could deal with any special situation.","After the four of them exited her bed-chamber, Ruyi glanced at the string of flower bracelets resting on her bed.","The bracelet featured numerous bright red pomegranate flowers, each adorned with a glaze. Beneath these floral ornaments lay a collection of pomegranates. The glaze coating of both the flowers and fruits was intricately crafted through a complex and innovative process involving grinding the pomegranates and flowers into powder, followed by high-temperature burning.","With her discerning eye honed by years of collecting jewelry, Ruyi still found herself enamored with this particular bracelet.","Taking a moment to study the bracelet, Ruyi, with a solemn expression, used her spiritual energy to extract four brocade boxes nestled within.","She proceeded to examine the contents of each box diligently.","Soon, Ruyi finished experimenting with the items in the first three brocade boxes. The items in the three brocade boxes did not touch the curse in Ruyi’s body.","Once again, her heart clenched with anxiety. She chided herself for placing too much hope in Sky City, recalling the old adage about expectations breeding disappointment. If only she hadn’t set her hopes so high, her heart wouldn’t be in such turmoil now.","Forcing herself to regain composure, Ruyi hesitated before opening the fourth brocade box, holding her breath in anticipation.","Though plagued by the curse since birth, Ruyi couldn’t help but harbor a glimmer of hope, however slim the odds. Her yearning wasn’t solely for her parents’ sake but also for her own aspirations. She refused to be merely a delicate porcelain doll, longing to carve her own path in this vast world."]},{"number":3014,"title":"Chapter 3014: Bloodline Roots","paragraphs":["Chapter 3014: Bloodline Roots","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","If Ruyi wanted to be reborn, the most basic step was to get rid of the curse.","If the curse was not removed, everything else would be empty talk!","Ever since she was born, Ruyi did not have any so-called pride. The little princess of the Carp Mystic Palace had been a piece of trash since she was born.","Such news did not reach Ruyi’s ears, and no one in the Carp Mystic Palace dared to gossip. However, it did not mean that the factions outside the Carp Mystic Palace would not talk about this matter.","Not only did Ruyi want to regain her dignity and pride, but she also did not want to be the person who demeaned the pride and dignity of the Carp Mystic","Palace.","She opened the fourth brocade box with anticipation and a heavy heart.","Ruyi saw a small medicine packet made of moon-white brocade nesting in the brocade box.","Ruyi opened the small medicine packet and saw that there was a sparkling light yellow powder inside.","The moment her hand touched the light yellow powder, Ruyi suddenly felt the curse being triggered!","Ruyi’s entire body was covered in sweat when the curse acted up. A sense of powerlessness attacked Ruyi’s soul. Ruyi felt that her lifespan was actually slowly peeling away from her body.","Her parents had spent so many resources, and she had to take a medicinal bath twice a day to stabilize the curse.","Now that the curse had suddenly acted up, Ruyi was caught off guard.","However, Ruyi did not panic. Instead, she was overjoyed.","The sudden activation of the curse was proof that this yellow pollen-like thing was effective against it! Because her body came into contact with this pollen, the curse was fighting against it.","Ruyi’s hands trembled as she lifted the moon-yellow cloth bag and drew the pollen into her body.","This pollen fought fiercely against the curse.","Ruyi was like a small boat in the middle of the battle. She relied on her willpower to survive.","Before long, the pollen in the cloth bag ran out. Not only did it quell the curse, but it also significantly weakened its potency. With a plentiful supply of this pollen, the curse would cease to impact her life and diminish her lifespan.","However, eliminating the curse likely required more than just this pollen. While it possessed potent suppressive properties against the curse, it was still somewhat lacking in comparison.","Nevertheless, this was undeniably positive news for Ruyi.","At that moment, Ruyi heard a loving, gentle voice coming from the door. “Ruyi, I remember that you rarely lose sleep. Is there something on your mind? If you have something on your mind, why don’t you tell me directly? Perhaps I can help you resolve it.”","When Yu Hongye heard the maids’ report that Ruyi had woken up, she subconsciously thought that Ruyi had yet to break free from her original emotions.","Previously, Ruyi had chosen to take her life. Not only had it scared her, but Ruyi should also have lingering fears about this.","As a mother, she should be the one to enlighten her!","Ruyi had always known that her parents were very nervous about her.","If not for the fact that her father was in seclusion, the two of them would most likely have rushed over when they received the news.","Ruyi pondered for a while and decided not to tell her mother that the curse had been suppressed.","“Mother, I don’t have anything on my mind. You don’t have to worry about me. I’ve already promised you that I won’t do anything stupid again. I suddenly woke up this time because I’m a little hungry. After breakfast, I’ll go wash up first.","With that, Ruyi wrapped her arms around Yu Hongye’s neck and leaned her head against her neck.","This was Ruyi’s subconscious action, which made Yu Hongye’s body stiffen. In Yu Hongye’s impression, her daughter only showed such attachment to her when she was young.","As she grew up and was tortured by the curse, Ruyi became very closed off, including her emotions.","Ruyi did not realize that her mentality had quietly changed after confirming that the pollen could help her. She felt much more relaxed.","Ruyi recalled that Lin Yuan had said that he needed to figure out the source of the curse to help her, and she could only find out from her mother.","“Mother, can I ask you a question? This question is very important to me!”","Ruyi knew that asking this question would likely open up her mother’s scars. But in order to understand the situation and solve her curse, Ruyi had to ask! This was not only to save her but also to break free from the restraints of her parents and help the entire Carp Mystic Palace!","Yu Hongye had never seen Ruyi ask her a question so seriously.","Yu Hongye vaguely guessed what Ruyi wanted to ask.","Yu Hongye pursed her lips and said softly, “Ruyi, I have no secrets from you. Just ask whatever you want to ask. I’ll definitely tell you everything I know.”","Ruyi went straight to the point. “Mother, I’ve been cursed since I was young. This curse has troubled me for many years. I want to know what exactly is going on with this curse.”","Yu Hongye took a deep breath and said, “Ruyi, you should have heard about this a long time ago. This is your own fate. You should know!","“The area where our Carp Mystic Palace is located is called the Heavenly Spring","Lake Sea. It’s the estuary from the Heavenly Spring Lake to the Heavenly Spring Sea. Right now, our Carp Mystic Palace is the only power in this area. No faction can contend with us.","“But before you were born, there was a faction here that was even more powerful than the Carp Mystic Palace. Their name was Cursed Star Evil Palace. They were a faction formed by many species with curse powers.","“Our factions fought for tens of thousands of years. Gradually, we suppressed them and eliminated their foundation before expelling them from the Heavenly Spring Lake Sea.","“At that time, I was pregnant with you. The Cursed Star Evil Palace’s leader was severely injured by your father and hid. In order to take revenge, their leader decided to target you and used the power of his bloodline to curse you. After that, your father risked serious injuries to kill the leader but was unable to stop the effects of the bloodline curse on your body.","“Your father has always blamed himself for this matter. He felt that he shouldn’t have thought of completely eradicating Cursed Star Evil Palace before you were born. If I had given birth to you and protected you well, this wouldn’t have happened!”","As she spoke, Yu Hongye’s tears flowed uncontrollably. Yu Hongye also blamed herself for this matter.","Ruyi’s heart ached when she saw the tears falling from Yu Hongye’s eyes. Who could have expected such a thing?","Ruyi never doubted her parents’ concern for her. If her parents did not really love her, they would not have sacrificed so much for her.","Now that she knew about the curse, she had an explanation for Lin Yuan.","Yu Honzve revealed her thoughts to Ruvi and chatted with her for a lonz time.","In the end, she sent Ruyi to the cleansing spring before leaving.","The cleansing spring’s environment was absolutely private. Ruyi, who was in the spring, took out the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower and sent a message to Lin Yuan.","[Ruyi]: The pollen wrapped in the moon-white brocade has a suppressive effect on my curse but it can’t completely remove the curse in my body. If you’re willing to provide me with more of this pollen, I think I’m willing to join Sky City to fulfill my previous promise!","Ruyi then told Lin Yuan about her curse.","She held the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet in the spring and quietly waited for Lin Yuan’s reply.","At this moment, Ruyi, who was filled with joy, could no longer feel the pain of the spring washing her body.","After the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting ended, Lin Yuan returned to the Floating Island Whale’s back. Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator, had planted many dark golden seeds on the Floating Island Whale’s embryo.","The seeds grew rapidly the moment they landed on the Floating Island Whale’s back.","These layers of golden sprouts covered the Floating Island Whale’s back like a carpet.","Looking at the rapid growth of these sprouts, Lin Yuan could not help but enter a mysterious state of epiphany. A Willpower Rune related to vitality was comprehended by Lin Yuan.","After Lin Yuan withdrew his epiphany state, a pleasantly surprised expression appeared on his face.","Lin Yuan had just contracted the Business Flourishing Flower. The Business Flourishing Flower was an auspicious sign that had been born in a mid-grade blessed land. Before Lin Yuan comprehended the Willpower Rune, there was no way to nurture it. This naturally prevented the Business Flourishing Flower from using its unique effect of auspiciousness.","The grade of a fey would affect the fey’s abilities.","After conversing with Hu Quan and Zhong Zhiyu and confirming that their cooperation was pleasant, Lin Yuan was relieved.","Lin Yuan immediately returned to his breeding room and summoned the Business Flourishing Flower.","Lin Yuan had yet to plant the Business Flourishing Flower on the Four Seasons Mountain because he had not evolved it.","However, during this period of time in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the quality of the Business Flourishing Flower had successfully evolved from Bronze/Flawless to Bronze/Legend.","The current Business Flourishing Flower could absorb the Willpower rune that Lin Yuan had just comprehended and evolve into a Fantasy Breed.","Lin Yuan pointed forward and the Willpower Rune containing boundless vitality landed on the Business Flourishing Flower.","Lin Yuan signaled tor the Business Flourishing Flower to absorb the Willpower Rune. Immediately after, intense energy fluctuations began radiating from the Business Flourishing Flower.","After the Business Flourishing Flower combined with this Willpower Rune that carried endless vitality, four to five red and pink flower buds quietly bloomed.","After the buds of the Business Flourishing Flower bloomed, the color was much richer than when it shone on the stamens. It was a little like the red and dazzling flower king. It was very similar to Lin Yuan’s impression of pomegranate flowers.","However, unlike the two simple petals of the pomegranate flower, the petals of the Business Flourishing Flower were stacked on top of each other. However, these overlapping petals did not hide the stamens inside. The stamens inside extended out and intertwined with the petals. The stamens intersected with each other, forming a mysterious and complicated geometric pattern.","An elegant fragrance wafted out from the stamen, making Lin Yuan feel extremely comfortable.","The Business Flourishing Flower’s size did not change much. Only a few new buds grew between the leaves.","However, the roots of the Business Flourishing Flower had undergone a tremendous change. Every root of the Business Flourishing Flower became thicker than the main stem of the plant.","Hundreds of roots could easily dig a thousand meters into the subterranean ground. The current environment did not give the Business Flourishing Flower a place to take root.","The Business Flourishing Flower could only coil up its roots aggrievedly.","The Business Flower had evolved into a Fantasy Breed lifeform.","After combining the Willpower Runes to evolve to Fantasy Breed, the Business Flourishing Flower could freely increase its strength in the future! Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Business Flourishing Flower.","[Fey Name]: Business Flourishing Flower","[Fey Species]: Peach/Rose [Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10) [Fey Type]: Wood [Fey Quality]: Fantasy I","Abilities:","[Overflowing Domain]: Lets the ground you take root in contain a large amount of vitality. This vitality can increase the strength of all the lifeforms here and increase the speed at which you absorb energy and your bloodline transform.","[Flower Nurturing]: When a flower blooms on its own, the flower can amplify the living beings in the area, making it easier for these living beings to nurture bloodlines. Even if a race that can’t nurture descendants eats a flower that it bears, it can definitely nurture descendants.","Exclusive Skill:","Burning Blossom Amplification]: Use the flower that blooms on its own to let the flower enter the burning state. After entering the burning state, the flower itself will not be consumed, but it will lose the ability to help other species reproduce. Every flower that enters the burning state will enhance the ability Overflowing Domain.","[Bloodline Roots]: If the roots are combined with other natural lifeforms and it give up on its evolution speed, it can transfer its evolution speed to other lifeforms. Moreover, its roots can increase the bloodline of natural lifeforms that have fused with it and accelerate the transformation of their bloodline (When it is at a lower level, it can use its roots to connect with other lifeforms and increase the enhancement of other lifeforms).","The change in the roots of the Business Flourishing Flower originated from the exclusive skill Bloodline Roots that the Business Flourishing Flower obtained after becoming a Fantasy Breed.","As Lin Yuan continued to explore this world, his horizons became more and more advanced.","There were very few exclusive skills that could make Lin Yuan so excited!","However, when he saw the exclusive skill of the Business Flourishing Flower, Bloodline Roots, Lin Yuan fell into an extremely excited and pleasantly surprised mood.","Lin Yuan had long planned to plant the Business Flourishing Flower on the Four Seasons Mountain.","The exclusive skill Bloodline Roots was specially made for the Four Seasons Mountain!","The Four Seasons Mountain had immediately transformed into a higher faerie. There was a possibility that the Four Seasons Mountain would transform into a faerie king.","However, no matter how talented the Four Seasons Mountain was, it still needed time to grow.","It took tens of thousands of years for a higher faerie to transform into a faerie king. For example, it would take the Emerald Lady nearly 90,000 years to evolve from a lower to an intermediate faerie.."]},{"number":3015,"title":"Chapter 3015 Withering Calyx!","paragraphs":["3015 Withering Calyx!","....","As an auspicious sign, the Business Flourishing Flower had an extremely fast growth rate.","By transferring this growth speed to Four Seasons Mountain through the exclusive skill Bloodline Roots, the Four Seasons Mountain would greatly shorten its growth time. Even the auspiciousness of heaven and earth could not compare to the enhancement ability of a higher faerie like the Four Seasons Mountain.","Using the Business Flourishing Flower to increase the speed of the Four Seasons Mountain’s growth was an extremely cost-effective deal.","Furthermore, even if the Four Seasons Mountain was enhanced, it did not mean that Business Flourishing Flower’s strength could not continue to increase.","However, the growth speed of the Business Flourishing Flower would return to the level of ordinary lifeforms.","Lin Yuan had the ability to let the Business Flourishing Flower grow with a large amount of pure spirit qi.","Furthermore, after the roots of the Business Flourishing Flower fused with the Four Seasons Mountain, it could also use its roots to guide the bloodline of Four Seasons Mountain to quickly transform.","This greatly increased the possibility of Four Seasons Mountain becoming a faerie king!","Bloodline Roots would increase the power of natural lifeforms to a greater extent when combined with natural lifeforms of inferior bloodlines,","Lin Yuan used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s ability Node Teleportation to teleport himself to the peak of the Four Seasons Mountain.","The moment Lin Yuan arrived at the peak of Four Seasons Mountain, the spiritual body of Four Seasons Mountain appeared beside him.","“Master, it’s been a long time since we last met. I’ve completely fused with the Cleansing Breath Soil. When I was in the early stage of combining with the Cleansing Breath Soil, I used the energy in the Cleansing Breath Soil to transform myself into a faerie. After my faerie bloodline grew, it also gave back to the Cleansing Breath Soil, allowing it to improve. The two of us mutually promote each other, which is very helpful for the improvement of each other’s bloodlines.”","Season Cycle was very grateful to Lin Yuan for bringing the Cleansing Breath Soil back to combine with it. If not for that, it felt that even if he transformed into a faerie, it might not have been able to obtain the bloodline of a higher faerie.","Lin Yuan smiled at Season Cycle and said, “Nurturing you is also helping Sky City. In the future, I will take out more resources to nurture you so that your bloodline can improve as soon as possible!”","Lin Yuan summoned the Fantasy Business Flourishing Flower and continued speaking to Season Cycle, “The effect of this Business Flourishing Flower on your bloodline is far greater than the Cleansing Breath Soil. Find a place on your main body to root the Business Flourishing Flower so that you can speed up the transformation of your bloodline as soon as possible.”","Season Cycle sensed the Business Flourishing Flower and knew the benefits it could bring it.","Season Cycle bowed to Lin Yuan.","“Master, there are many caves on my main body. The higher you go, the higher the energy contained in the caves. I might as well plant this Business Flourishing Flower in the top cave! Although the Business Flourishing Flower transferred its growth speed to me and caused its growth speed to be much slower, I can give a portion of my energy and a portion of the energy accumulated by the Cleansing Breath Soil to the Business Flourishing Flower! It should be able to raise the Business Flourishing Flower to Myth Breed!”","Lin Yuan’s heart skipped a beat. Currently, the Business Flourishing Flower was only Bronze/Fantasy and only had two abilities.","If it could evolve to Suzerain, it would obtain five new abilities. Upgrading to Myth Breed would give it another exclusive skill. The earlier the Business Flourishing Flower’s grade increased, the more valuable it would be.","“Season Cycle, will evolving the Business Flourishing Flower according to the method you mentioned affect you and the Cleansing Breath Soil?”","Lin Yuan planted the Business Flourishing Flower on Four Seasons Mountain so that he could complete Season Cycle.","If he did this, not only would he not be able to help Season Cycle, but Season Cycle would also have to expend its own roots in order to increase the growth speed of Business Flourishing Flower. That would really be unnecessary!","Even without the feedback from Season Cycle and the Cleansing Breath Soil to the Business Flourishing Flower, it would only take Lin Yuan about a year to raise it to Suzerain/Myth.","Season Cycle hurriedly said, “Master, the Cleansing Breath Soil and I will help the Business Flourishing Flower increase its grade and quality. It won’t affect us at all. Going forward, every once in a while, we will accumulate enough energy to nourish the Business Flourishing Flower! I know my limits. I definitely won’t affect myself when helping others. Don’t worry.”","Lin Yuan brought the Business Flourishing Flower to the cave that Season Cycle had mentioned. Lin Yuan placed the Business Flourishing Flower at the center of the cave, indicating that it could take root.","He also used the exclusive skill Bloodline Roots to connect to the Four Seasons Mountain while taking root.","The Business Flourishing Flower was very picky about the environment. It had existed in blessed lands since it was born. The Business Flourishing Flower, who grew up in such an environment, was like a young master who had been pampered since he was young.","The environment at the peak of Four Seasons Mountain was much better than the environment in mid-grade blessed lands, not to mention that it had the support of the Cleansing Breath Soil.","The Business Flourishing Flower happily let its roots enter the Four Seasons Mountain.","After the roots completely extended into the body of the Four Seasons Mountain, the Business Flourishing Flower became closely connected to Four Seasons Mountain through the exclusive skill Bloodline Roots.","These thick roots were like the blood vessels of the Four Seasons Mountain. A strange energy flowed in the mountain.","Season Cycle could acutely sense that its body seemed to have been reborn and its absorption speed of energy had greatly increased. Moreover, the energy absorbed into its body would nourish its bloodline. This made its bloodline even stronger.","To Season Cycle, personally experiencing the value of the Business Flourishing Flower to himself was completely different from the feeling of investigating the Business Flourishing Flower.","After receiving the benefits from Four Seasons Mountain, Season Cycle contacted the Cleansing Breath Soil.","Together with the Cleansing Breath Soil, the accumulated energy was channeled into the Business Flourishing Flower’s body through the roots of the mountain.","When this energy entered the body of the Business Flourishing Flower, it could be directly absorbed by the Business Flourishing Flower. The grade of the Business Flourishing Flower increased rapidly like an accelerator. In less than five minutes, Business Flourishing Flower had reached Diamond X/Fantasy V.","Suddenly, the aura of the Business Flourishing Flower changed. The new tender branches of the Business Flourishing Flower bore dozens of flower buds. As the aura of the Business Flourishing Flower increased, these buds gradually showed signs of blooming.","At this moment, the Business Flourishing Flower had clearly evolved to Suzerain/Myth.","Lin Yuan would not use the Pure Land of Bliss to absorb the World Grace from his own feys when they evolved.","The auspicious signs of heaven and earth were extremely powerful living beings in this world.","However, because it was favored by the world, it would not need to withstand the World Cleansing when it evolved to the next grade. The World Grace would directly descend.","This was very different from the evolution of a heavenly family fey.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Suzerain/Myth Business Flourishing Flower.","Lin Yuan had many expectations for the Business Flourishing Flower.","[Fey Name]: Business Flourishing Flower","[Fey Species]: Peach/Rose","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Myth I","Abilities:","[Overflowing Domain]: Lets the ground it takes root in contain a large amount of vitality. This vitality can increase the strength of all the lifeforms here and increase the speed at which you absorb energy and its bloodline transforms.","[Flower Nurturing]: When a flower blooms on its own, the flower can amplify the living beings in the area, making it easier for these living beings to nurture bloodlines. Even if a race that can’t nurture descendants eats a flower that it bears, it can definitely nurture descendants.","[Ant Army Transformation]: Choose a colony of ants and modify it explosively. Let this colony of ants have their own bloodline to serve it. The colony of ants is beneficial to its growth and extension of its roots.","[Withering Calyx]: There is a certain probability that the flower it blooms will mutate. The aura released by the mutated calyx ignores energy protection. When sucked into the target’s body, the target will fall into a cursed state of life force stripping.","[Flower Blossoming]: The main trunk can grow more branches, allowing the main trunk and branch to enter a flowering state. The number of flowers that bloom will increase by about 30%.","[Epiphany Pollen]: The moment the pollen completely matures and leaves the stamen, it will turn into a rich purple-red color. The aura emitted by the ignited purple-red pollen can increase the ability of other lifeforms to comprehend nature.","[Life Stop]: When the target is heavily injured and infected with a curse or special poison, causing the vitality in the target’s body to continuously leak out without being able to recover, it can condense the vitality in the target’s body and cause the target to enter a state of time halt for a period of time.","Exclusive Skill:","[Burning Blossom Amplification]: Use the flower that blooms on its own to let the flower enter the burning state. After entering the burning state, the flower itself will not be consumed, but it will lose the ability to help other species reproduce. Every flower that enters the burning state will enhance the ability Overflowing Domain.","[Bloodline Roots]: If the roots are combined with other natural lifeforms and it give up on its evolution speed, it can transfer its evolution speed to other lifeforms. Moreover, its roots can increase the bloodline of natural lifeforms that have fused with it and accelerate the transformation of their bloodline (When it is at a lower level, it can use its roots to connect with other lifeforms and increase the enhancement of other lifeforms).","[Time Fruit]: When the flower is not used and is not amplified, it will bear fruit when it blooms to a certain extent. Feeding the fruit to other living beings can allow other living beings to directly produce resources that would normally take 10,000 years to produce.","Lin Yuan was first attracted to the exclusive skill Time Fruit that Business Flourishing Flower had obtained.","The exclusive skill Bloodline Roots that Business Flourishing Flower obtained from evolving to Epic was already magical enough.","However, the exclusive skill Time Fruit obtained from Four Seasons Mountain’s evolution to Legend was even more shocking than Bloodline Roots! This was because Time Fruit could control time!","As long as he did not use the flowers of the Business Flourishing Flower to use the ability Flower Nurturing and the exclusive skill Burning Blossom Amplification, the fruits of the flowers of the Business Flourishing Flower could allow a production-type creature to directly produce resources that could only be produced in ten thousand years.","If he gave the fruits produced by the Business Flourishing Flower to the Soldier Ration Radish, he would only obtain the production volume of the 10,000-year-old Soldier Ration Radish.","Although they produced a lot, these ordinary items were not very valuable unless they were in short supply.","The production of Soldier Ration Radish was enough to deal with the consumption of the faith country. Not only could it support the consumption of the faith country, but the production of these Soldier Ration Radishes also fed the nearly 1,000 Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","Time Fruit had an extremely high upper and lower limit. If he did not use it on the Soldier Ration Radish, he would invest it on the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia, which had already evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","The nectar produced by the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia could allow hundreds of thousands of living beings to wash away the impurities in their bodies and souls at the same time and enter a pure state.","Although a plant type fey like the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia had an indispensable function, it was not a rare existence. There were many rare items in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and using them would allow Sky City to benefit greatly.","Apart from this exclusive skill, the Business Flourishing Flower’s new ability was also magical.","For example, the Silver ability Ant Army Transformation, Business Flourishing Flower, could transform a huge colony of ants into its servants. These ants would be used to strengthen its roots. This allowed this skill to be linked to the exclusive skill Bloodline Roots.","The length and condition of the roots of the Business Flourishing Flower would directly affect the effect of the exclusive skill Bloodline Roots.","The exclusive skill Bloodline Roots was related to the blood metamorphosis of the Four Seasons Mountain.","Ant Army Transformation was a seemingly unreasonable skill but it directly increased the value of the Business Flourishing Flower.","The Business Flourishing Flower’s Gold ability Withered Calyx could be considered an offensive ability.","The Business Flourishing Flower was a support-type auspicious sign. Under normal circumstances, it was extremely unlucky to have such an offensive ability.","However, in Lin Yuan’s opinion, not only was the appearance of the Withered Calyx not unlucky but it would also be extremely useful at times. The more the Business Flourishing Flower could use its vitality to support other living beings, the more powerful the curse attached to the Withering Calyx]was that could deprive the cursed person of their vitality!","Even if a Holy Spirit Realm expert was cursed by Withered Flower Calyx, it would not be long before the vitality in his body was completely drained!","It would have been fine if it was just a curse, but what was really special about Withered Calyx was that the aura it released could ignore energy protection. This made it impossible for the enemy to escape the fate of being cursed even if they put up all their defenses. This was the most special thing about Withered Calyx!"]},{"number":3016,"title":"Chapter 3016: Su Yiren’s Worries!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3016: Su Yiren’s Worries!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Business Flourishing Flower’s ability Withered Calyx could threaten extremely high-level lifeforms.","In the future, when facing Sky City’s enemies, Lin Yuan could give them a","Withered Calyx condensed by the Business Flourishing Flower. The Business Flourishing Flower could remove the curse effect of Withered Calyx. This allowed Withered Calyx to not only kill the enemy target but also effectively threaten the enemy target.","Take Ruyi, who had been pulled into the Astronomical Parliament by Wen Yu, as an example. If the person who had cursed Ruyi back then had been Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan could use the Business Flourishing Flower to curse Ruyi and threaten her parents to plunder Carp Mystic Palace’s profits.","From this point of view, the strategic significance of Withered Calyx became even greater!","The Platinum ability, Flower Blossoming, allowed the main branch of the Business Flourishing Flower to grow many branches. These branches would enter a flowering state and bloom more flowers.","Flower Nurturing and Burning Blossom Amplification could be linked together. It was very rare.","Flower Nurturing and Burning Flower Amplification were both abilities that reflected the value of the Business Flourishing Flower.","It could be said that the first five abilities of Business Flourishing Flower were very useful.","Business Flourishing Flower’s Diamond and Suzerain abilities Epiphany Pollen and Breath Freezing were even more shocking!","The Business Flourishing Flower was a lotus lifeform to begin with. The stamens could produce a large amount of pollen. The Diamond ability Epiphany Pollen was ignited by the pollen of the Business Flourishing Flower after it matured. This purple-red pollen could increase the comprehension ability of other creatures.","To put it simply, it was to help creatures comprehend Willpower Runes. To put it more deeply, it was to help experts break through their realms.","This realm did not refer to strength, but the increase in the grade and class of professions such as Creators, Weavers, and Spirit Craftsmen.","To a spirit qi professional, being able to comprehend Willpower Runes from heaven and earth was a very lucky and difficult thing.","Back when Sky City was selecting the white-clothed followers as combat and reserve sequence members, the hard requirement was their own comprehension of Willpower Runes.","Many of the white-clothed followers’ combat and reserve sequence members had not comprehended any Willpower Runes after joining Sky City. This greatly restricted the development of these people.","Lin Yuan could not do anything about it. Comprehension was too mysterious and Lin Yuan did not have any spiritual ingredients that could increase his comprehension ability!","Even if Lin Yuan had some spiritual ingredients that could increase his comprehension, it would not be convenient for Sky City members who could not comprehend new Willpower Runes.","As a supervisor, Lin Yuan knew the principle of not worrying about few but worrying about inequality.","After distributing these limited resources, only a small portion of Sky City’s people would be able to obtain them. Those who could not obtain these resources would inevitably have their own opinions. This was not beneficial to Sky City’s stability.","However, Lin Yuan could now use the Business Flourishing Flower’s skill Epiphany Pollen to collect a large amount of pollen and provide it to all the members of Sky City. It would give all the members of Sky City more opportunities to comprehend Willpower Runes!","Not only that, but Lin Yuan could also provide this epiphany pollen to the army of Hundred Questions Beasts and use it to increase their comprehension ability so that they could evolve faster!","Those who had just joined Sky City would also be beneficiaries. This epiphany pollen could be said to be a benefit that Lin Yuan had prepared for Sky City’s high-grade Creators.","The skill Business Flourishing Flower obtained after advancing to Suzerain was called Life Stop. Life Stop was a life-saving ability.","However, Life Stop did not protect the Business Flourishing Flower’s own life, but used the power of time to protect those powerful living beings that could not be healed.","It allowed the vitality in these living beings to condense and enter a state of time freeze.","It gave time for Lin Yuan to find a solution before saving the target!","The evolution of the Business Flourishing Flower made Lin Yuan extremely happy.","As the strength of the Business Flourishing Flower increased to","Suzerain/Myth, its ability to protect other living beings became much stronger.","Lin Yuan said to Season Cycle, who was standing beside him, “Season Cycle, from now on, you’ll take care of the Business Flourishing Flower! The Business Flourishing Flower is my spirit-locked fey. It’s extremely important to me. If anything happens, you must inform me immediately!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s solemn explanation, Season Cycle hurriedly said,","“Master, don’t worry. Nothing will go wrong with your auspicious seed! The Cleansing Breath Soil and I will definitely do our best to protect it!”","Lin Yuan was relieved to hear Season Cycle’s assurance and left the Four Seasons Mountain.","Before leaving, Lin Yuan had specially instructed Season Cycle to help him collect the pollen from the Business Flourishing Flower.","When the pollen of the Business Flourishing Flower was collected to a certain extent, the pollen of the Business Flourishing Flower could be used!","Not long after Lin Yuan returned to his residence, Su Yiren found him.","She said to Lin Yuan very seriously, “The Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies led by Zhi Ling has really exceeded my expectations! I didn’t expect the intelligence of a species to be so advanced!","“With the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies led by Zhi Ling, the management of faith country is no longer a problem. Some members of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies are already invested in the management of Sky City’s faith country!”","Su Yiren was pleasantly surprised when she said this, but at the same time, there was an indescribable feeling in her voice.","Ever since she came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Su Yiren had been in charge of the work related to the faith country.","Luo Lan was also a manager of the faith country. However, when it came to the usual work, Luo Lan was more like Su Yiren’s assistant. Su Yiren was the one who made most of the decisions. After Su Yiren confirmed the plan, Su Yiren and Luo Lan would then carried it out together.","Now that the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies had taken over the management of the faith country, Su Yiren felt a little upset.","Su Yiren was already trying her best to suppress her emotions but Lin Yuan could still sense her thoughts. Lin Yuan felt that he had to comfort Su Yiren.","Lin Yuan did intend to put the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies in an important position. But in Lin Yuan’s heart, the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies were more of a tool.","The members of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, including Zhi Ling, were all managers, not decision-makers. The real decision-makers were still Su Yiren and Luo Lan.","However, it was obvious that Su Yiren had not thought it through.","Lin Yuan asked Su Yiren with a smile, “Yiren, I said to let the Wisdom Eye Brain","Dragonflies take over the heavy work from you and Luo Lan. How do you feel?”","Lin Yuan’s question stunned Su Yiren. She knew that Lin Yuan had asked her this because he had sensed the change in her emotions.","Since Lin Yuan had taken the initiative to ask about her, Su Yiren did not try to hide it anymore. Instead, she spoke very honestly, “Young Master, I left the main world with you and came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. From the moment I arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, I devoted all my energy to the management and construction of the faith country.","“The faith country could be said to have been created from scratch by me and Luo Lan. I’ve invested more effort into the faith country than when I revived the Dark Continent. Therefore, I can’t help but feel a little reluctant to hand it over now!”","Su Yiren paused before continuing, “But Young Master, I can understand many things. The intelligence of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies is enough to manage the faith country. Only by letting the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies manage the faith country can the faith country truly develop rapidly!”","Su Yiren was a very tactful person but she had always been very honest with Lin Yuan. Su Yiren’s words came from the bottom of her heart and she did not act out of spite.","Lin Yuan thought to himself that Su Yiren had misunderstood his original intention. Fortunately, he had asked Su Yiren this question!","“Yiren, ever since you’ve been by my side, you’ve been doing the work of a manager. What do you think is the difference between a manager and a decision-maker?”","Just as Lin Yuan asked this, Su Yiren’s eyes lit up.","With Su Yiren’s talent, she immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant. Lin","Yuan treated the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies as a manager while she and Luo Lan were the decision makers!","Lin Yuan smiled when he saw the change in Su Yiren’s eyes. He knew that Su","Yiren understood what he meant.","“Yiren, you don’t have to think that the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies will pose a potential threat to you. You and Luo Lan were too busy previously and basically didn’t have time to rest. If this continues, not only will your and Luo Lan’s bodies not be able to take it, but it will also affect your judgment as a decision-maker!","“Now that you and Luo Lan are completely liberated, you don’t have to do tedious management anymore. You can freely use your talents to make decisions about the problems encountered in the faith country. I believe that this is best for the two of you!”","Su Yiren was completely enlightened by Lin Yuan’s words, and she could not help but look ashamed.","“Young Master, thank you for always thinking about me and Luo Lan. Previously, it was my thinking that had a problem! With more energy in the future, Luo Lan and I will definitely be more serious and focused on developing faith country!”","Having completely understood the relationship between the manager and the decision-maker, Su Yiren’s complicated feelings and her indistinct hostility towards Zhi Ling were completely eliminated.","Su Yiren was prepared to give Luo Lan some advice when they got back. Luo","Lan was even more worried than he was.","However, before returning, Su Yiren was prepared to send a request to Lin","Yuan.","“Young Master, the current faith country has already reached the point where it can continue to develop. I intend to develop the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons in depth. Before the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies arrived, I had this thought when I found out that the food problem was resolved. Now that we have the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, our development will undoubtedly be smoother than before!","“I’ve already communicated with Listen. Listen said that expanding the size of the faith country would make the market bigger and be beneficial to the subsequent establishment of the chamber of commerce.","“The faith country can now produce a large amount of faith power and solve the problem of collecting it. I think it’s the best time to continue expanding the size of the faith country and enable Sky City to develop rapidly! This is the specific plan of Luo Lan and I to develop the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.”","Su Yiren added, “Apart from contacting Listen, I also contacted Sun Ningxiang. However, Sun Ningxiang has yet to reply to me. If I confirm that there are enough Soldier Ration Radishes, I’m confident that I can develop the original territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.”","Su Yiren’s eyes lit up like the stars in the sky.","Lin Yuan looked at Su Yiren, who was full of energy and reminded her seriously, “The faith country is managed by you and Luo Lan. The two of you have the ability to make decisions on your own. However, you have to remember that the last thing you should do is to go overboard. When you’ve decided, just give the order.”","Su Yiren could feel Lin Yuan’s trust in her from his words.","“Young Master, I understand. Luo Lan and I have discussed many times about expanding the faith country. The two of us have unanimously decided that there is a need to expand faith country. I’ll give the order after I go back and perfect the plan.”","Su Yiren came to look for Lin Yuan with mixed feelings. When she left, the corners of her lips had already curled into a smile.","Lin Yuan looked at Su Yiren’s departing figure and thought about what she had just said.","The faith country was indeed about to enter a state of rapid development. Previously, the development of the faith country had always been equivalent to laying a foundation. Speaking of the foundation of faith country, it was definitely solid enough.","Once he collected a certain amount of faith power, Lin Yuan’s feys and Sky City’s core members’ feys would be upgraded!","For the next three months, Lin Yuan, as Sky City’s City Lord, participated in Sky City’s white-clothed follower competition.","Lin Yuan had also appeared during the preparations for the sequence battle competition.","In these three months of continuous competitions, many people stood out, and those who had failed after entering the Sky Beyond the Clouds were also selected.","Lin Yuan had never been stingy with talents and the rewards he gave were abnormally shocking! Even the Moon Empress was surprised by Lin Yuan’s generous rewards!"]},{"number":3017,"title":"Chapter 3017: Imperial Decree!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3017: Imperial Decree!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan could be said to have taken out all of Sky City’s trump cards to give to the combat sequence members and white-clothed followers.","The reserve sequence members would also be allocated a certain amount of resources but the resources allocated to the reserve sequence members would definitely be lesser than the combat sequence and the white-clothed followers.","However, as long as these reserve sequence members were willing to work hard and take the resources given by Lin Yuan, they would definitely be able to obtain further opportunities.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied after watching the competition for the past three months.","Only around 60 of the combat sequence, reserve sequence, and white-clothed followers failed.","These 60-odd people had been in a mess for a long time. Otherwise, they would not have lost to the others by such a large margin!","Lin Yuan had brought these people from the main world. Even if they did not want to improve, Lin Yuan would not do anything to them. However, these people would be sent out and would not be able to enjoy so many high-quality resources from Sky City in the future!","No matter how many people Lin Yuan recruited in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, these talents that he brought from the main world to the Sky Beyond the Clouds were the foundation of Sky City. This was also the reason why Lin Yuan was willing to distribute so many resources to those competitors.","Although Zhou Luo was the deputy leader of the white-clothed followers, he rarely interacted with Lin Yuan.","Zhou Luo was very nervous when facing Lin Yuan.","However, compared to being nervous, Zhou Luo was more surprised.","“C... City Lord, are you really going to give these guys so many resources? If these resources are distributed at once, I’m afraid these guys will get inflated heads!”","Lin Yuan said to Zhou Luo seriously, “Old Zhou, if these people really become inflated, you can help them vent their anger. If even you can’t appease them, tell me. Even if such a person achieves outstanding results in the competition, I’ll still send him down!”","Sky City’s combat sequence and white-clothed followers did not have much of an advantage.","Apart from selecting a portion of talents for this competition, Lin Yuan also wanted to put some pressure on the reserve sequence, combat sequence, and white-clothed followers.","It was not a problem to be arrogant after achieving results, but if he continued to be arrogant and forgot his duty, Lin Yuan would not use such a person no matter how hard he worked or how talented he was.","“Old Zhou, as the deputy leader of the white-clothed followers, there is no need for you to participate in the competition. These are the resources I’ve prepared for you. Don’t forget to increase your strength while leading them!”","Lin Yuan handed Zhou Luo a simple fey storage box. However, Zhou Luo’s eyes widened when he checked the materials in the fey storage box! Lin Yuan had prepared more than five times the amount for Zhou Luo than he did for the other white-clothed followers. Moreover, the materials prepared for Zhou Luo were of a higher level.","With the resources that Lin Yuan had provided him, Zhou Luo could foresee how he would improve in the future.","“City Lord, thank you for providing me with these resources. With these resources, my strength will increase quickly! I’ll definitely do my best to help Ah Jie in the future. He spends most of his time nurturing feys. I will help Ah Jie more. That way, Ah Jie will have an easier time!”","Zhou Luo knew very well that he had been chosen by Lin Yuan to be the deputy leader of the white-clothed followers because he had gone through life and death situations with Lin Yuan and Liu Jie. Back in the evolving dimensional rift, he had helped Lin Yuan and Liu Jie a lot.","Secondly, he was indeed the first batch of members to join Sky City and had been appointed by Lin Yuan long ago.","However, many white-clothed followers in Sky City were stronger and more capable than him. Zhou Luo was really afraid that Lin Yuan would replace him one day.","Now that Lin Yuan had given Zhou Luo so many resources, Zhou Luo understood Lin Yuan’s intentions.","This made Zhou Luo’s heart feel warm and at the same time, he no longer felt as much pressure as before.","“Old Zhou, Big Brother Liu’s Insect Queen controls so many insect-species carcinoma feys. Big Brother Liu doesn’t have much time to transform them into fairies. I’ll still have to trouble you in the future! When you leave later, remember to help me call Big Brother Liu. I happen to have something to speak to him about.”","Zhou Luo had already reported to Lin Yuan about the competition.","After bowing to Lin Yuan, Zhou Luo left Lin Yuan’s private meeting room and went to Liu Jie. He told Liu Jie that Lin Yuan was looking for him.","After three months, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus collected a large amount of faith power.","In the past three months, the rate at which Sky City produced faith power had increased. Now, the faith power collected by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus was enough for many World Emperor/Divine Kingdom lifeforms to reach the Holy Spirit level.","After confirming that Gray could successfully evolve, Lin Yuan’s first thought was Elegance.","Liu Jie only had Elegance as a fey. Not only could evolving Elegance’s strength increase its control over insect-species carcinoma feys, but it could also transform insect-species carcinoma feys into fairies.","It could also greatly increase Liu Jie’s overall strength.","Liu Jie quickly appeared in Lin Yuan’s private meeting room.","“Lin Yuan, are you looking for me? If not for Zhou Luo’s timely news, I would have already entered seclusion!”","Liu Jie felt a little helpless when he said this. Elegance had too many insect-species carcinoma feys and Liu Jie had too many Firefly Demon Fetuses.","Since there were no restrictions on the Firefly Demon Fetuses, Liu Jie would definitely transform all insect-species carcinoma feys into fairies.","Using the resources that Lin Yuan had given him, he had evolved these insect-species carcinoma feys to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom!","Only a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom fairy could satisfy Liu Jie’s current development in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. If these insect-species carcinoma feys did not evolve to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom they would not be of","much help to Liu Jie in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, once the insect-species carcinoma feys evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, the effects of these fairies would not be inferior to the performance of Holy Spirit experts! In fact, these demons could even do things that many Holy Spirit experts could not.","However, it was not easy to evolve these insect-species carcinoma feys to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. If Liu Jie wanted to increase his strength, he would have to go into seclusion for a long time.","Lin Yuan smiled at Liu Jie and said, “Big Brother Liu, if you want to enter seclusion, you don’t have to spend any more effort on matters related to the white-clothed followers. Currently, be it combat sequence, reserve sequence, or white-clothed followers, their strength is still shallow. They need a long period of accumulation.","“Before there are any external missions, Zhou Luo is enough to manage them. The most important thing is for you to increase your strength!","“Big Brother Liu, summon Elegance first. Previously, I helped Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper evolve to the Holy Spirit level. Now, it’s my turn to help Elegance evolve!”","Liu Jie had never disclosed Elegance’s information to the public and there was no need for him to keep it a secret from Lin Yuan. Thus, he summoned Elegance.","Elegance was still shy and afraid of strangers.","Since it was already familiar with Lin Yuan, Elegance kissed Liu Jie’s cheek and flew around Lin Yuan shyly.","At this moment, Elegance had eight pairs of wings on its back. In terms of bloodline, Elegance was inferior to Silver Corona and Red Thorn.","However, judging from Elegance’s current situation, apart from the fact that it would be suppressed when facing fairies of a higher bloodline level than its own, its abilities and value far exceeded fairies of the same bloodline level. In fact, it was even more functional than fairies with higher bloodlines!","This was because Elegance’s ability originated from the fairies that its insect-species carcinoma feys had transformed into and its ability to absorb special insect-species genes.","Liu Jie thought for a moment and nodded heavily.","“Ah Yuan, I really need to improve my strength. Otherwise, if I don’t improve my strength as soon as possible, it’s equivalent to wasting my potential!”","Lin Yuan agreed with Liu Jie. The most important thing was to increase his strength as much as possible.","The insect-species carcinoma feys that Liu Jie let Elegance control had all been screened. Each of these insect-species carcinoma feys had a certain function. It could be said that each of these insect-species carcinoma feys needed to be nurtured.","“Big Brother Liu, it should take a long time for you to nurture every insect-species carcinoma fey into a fairy, right? I have a lot of resources here.","You should be able to quickly nurture those demons with these resources!","These resources contain a certain amount of fairy bloodline or have an extraordinary effect on fairy bloodlines.”","Liu Jie did not stand on ceremony with Lin Yuan. He really needed resources that could help fairies improve their bloodlines.","However, it was not difficult for Liu Jie to nurture a fey transformed from an insect-species carcinoma fey and raise its strength to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Liu Jie raised his hand and released his sacred source lifeform, the Empress Core of All Insects.","The Empress Core of All Insects on Liu Jie’s palm flickered with a resplendent glass-colored light.","Based on the aura released by the Empress Core of All Insects, Lin Yuan could confirm that the Empress Core of All Insects’ Stars was the same as Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament. They had both grown to their full form.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate Liu Jie’s Empress Core of All Insects.","[Sacred Source Name]: Empress Core of All Insects","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 11 Stars [Sacred Source Type]: Insect-type","Abilities:","[Final Weapon]: Fuse with a lifeform related to insects. The stronger the procreative ability of the lifeform, the stronger the abilities of the fused entity will be. The lifeform’s vitality and procreative ability will be used up to become the final shield of all insects.","[Empress’ Revival]: By using up a large amount of vitality, the lifeform’s genetic model can be triggered to revive the emperor insect’s genetic model and will be used on the final weapon. The empress of insects will descend. Before she disappears, the insect-species lifeform will be able to receive the benefit of the empress once.","[Providing for All Insects]: Once all of the insects in the area that were under the control of the Empress Core of All Insects died, their bodies, souls, and wills will gather around the target that is being boosted. They will eventually turn into energy for the target. The target will become stirred up and its resistance to various elements will be raised.","[Imperial Decree]: Through the Empress Core of All Insects, it can set an identity for the insect-type lifeforms it controls. The insect-type units that have their identities set are called the Empress’ Insect Guard. Every Empress’ Insect Guard can multiply their insect-type skills and allow the Empress’ Insect Guard to choose one of its functions to connect with. When connecting, the Empress’ Insect Guard will not be negatively affected by its own functions (the more Empress’ Insect Guards it sets up, the more energy it will consume).","Lin Yuan discovered that Liu Jie’s Empress Core of All Insects had increased to 11 Stars!","When Lin Yuan had last investigated Liu Jie’s Empress Core of All Insects, it had only been at 7 stars.","The Empress Core of All Insects obtained a new function from its original foundation, Imperial Decree.","Lin Yuan had always felt that although Liu Jie’s Empress Core of All Insects was powerful, there was a certain disadvantage when it was used.","Apart from the ability Providing for All Insects, the Empress Core of All Insects had a lot of restrictions and harsh prerequisites, be it the Final Weapon or Empress’ Revival. This greatly affected Liu Jie’s use of these two abilities.","However, now that Liu Jie was using the new function of the Empress Core of All Insects, he could set up multiple Emperor Insect Guards.","He let these Empress’ Insect Guards use Empress’ Revival, Final Weapon, and Providing for All Insects without paying a price.","The ability of the Empress Core of All Insects no longer only targeted at a certain insect-type lifeform.","The new ability of the Empress Core of All Insects, Imperial Decree, was equivalent to raising the value of the Empress Core of All Insects and greatly increasing its value.","Otherwise, extreme skills like this would cause the Empress Core of All Insects to lose its versatility and become Liu Jie’s shortcoming.","Lin Yuan was very happy for Liu Jie when he saw the new ability of the Empress Core of All Insects.","Liu Jie had summoned his sacred source lifeform, the Empress Core of All","Insects, because there were no secrets between him and Lin Yuan. Not only did Liu Jie not care that Lin Yuan knew about his sacred source lifeform’s abilities but he also hoped to share his growth with Lin Yuan!","Secondly, Liu Jie wanted to tell Lin Yuan why he wanted to enter seclusion.","There were not many fairies that Liu Jie had nurtured to World Emperor/Divine","Kingdom so he did not have much choice when setting up the Imperial Insect Guards.","“Big Brother Liu, before you enter seclusion, I’ll help you increase the strength of Elegance and let Elegance reach the Holy Spirit level. This way, you can choose the fairies you want to nurture based on Elegance’s newly obtained divine kingdom ability. This will make your combat system more abundant..’"]},{"number":3018,"title":"Chapter 3018: Insect Bloodline Transformation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3018: Insect Bloodline Transformation!","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“When I have more faith power in the future, I can also help those insect demons that have evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom evolve to the Holy Spirit level. By then, Big Brother Liu, you will probably become a legend even in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","When Lin Yuan said this, his tone was extremely firm and serious. Although Lin Yuan said this with a smile, he had no intention of joking. Lin Yuan had never been someone who would take the initiative to flatter others. Moreover, given his relationship with Liu Jie, there was no need for him to flatter Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan had been training in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for a period of time and had seen a lot of the world.","Whether it was in Treasure City or the Scarlet Territory controlled and occupied by the Bloodians, Lin Yuan had seen too many young elites and experts of the older generation. However, whether it was the elites of the younger generation or the experts of the older generation, none of them could compare to Liu Jie.","After Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator, joined Sky City and led the Grade 4 Creators to form Sky City’s Creator team, he specially for the core members of Sky City.","Zhong Zhiyu seriously asked Lin Yuan about the core members of Sky City.","It could be said that the situation of every core member of Sky City had exceeded Zhong Zhiyu’s expectations.","However, what really made Zhong Zhiyu’s expression change was when Lin Yuan mentioned Liu Jie’s situation.","Zhong Zhiyu’s evaluation of Liu Jie was that Liu Jie would become the most terrifying natural disaster in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and become a legendary powerhouse in charge of disasters.","Zhong Zhiyu’s evaluation of Liu Jie was very similar to Lin Yuan’s evaluation of Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan believed that as long as Liu Jie could develop step by step, he would definitely become a legend in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","When Liu Jie heard Lin Yuan’s affirmation, he smiled from the bottom of his heart.","Along the way, Liu Jie had endured countless pressures and painstaking efforts to chase after Lin Yuan. Liu Jie no longer had to be afraid of losing Lin Yuan! No matter how strong Lin Yuan was or how he transformed in the future, he would always be able to obtain an indispensable position as Lin Yuan’s retainer!","“Ah Yuan, if any faction offends Sky City in the future, as your retainer, I will finally have a chance to fight for Sky City!”","Liu Jie knew very well that Lin Yuan had just brought Sky City to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Sky City was holed up in North of the Lonely River because Sky City wanted to rely on the faith country to develop.","Moreover, Sky City was still unfamiliar with the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and was in the exploration phase.","After the development, Sky City would eventually make a name for itself.","At that time, he would have a chance to exert his strength!","Back when he, Wen Yu, and Lin Yuan had established Sky City together, Lin Yuan had been the City Lord of Sky City.","Since Wen Yu was in charge of internal affairs, he naturally had to be in charge of external affairs.","Lin Yuan did not object to Liu Jie’s words just now because he would face many dangers when he went out.","To Liu Jie, going out to train was the key to improving his strength.","“Big Brother Liu will depend on you to make the local factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds tremble in fear when they hear the name Sky City!”","Lin Yuan indicated to Liu Jie that he was about to evolve Elegance.","Liu Jie hugged Elegance and said to Lin Yuan, “Ah Yuan, I have a feeling that I’m relying more and more on the insect-species carcinoma feys that Elegance controls to transform into fairies instead of Elegance itself!”","Liu Jie could not help but scratch his head. It could be said that ever since Elegance could control insect-species carcinoma feys, Liu Jie’s combat style and actions had completely changed. This made Elegance’s own ability somewhat useless.","However, such a situation was inevitable.","Firstly, Elegance was only a fey, so it was very difficult for a fey to be omnipotent.","Secondly, Elegance had absorbed insect-species feys to form abilities. The insect-species lifeforms it had absorbed previously were too low-level and came from the main world.","The insect-type genes that generated these abilities could not be replaced, which greatly limited Elegance’s potential. This made Liu Jie less and less dependent on Elegance in battle.","However, the insect-species carcinoma feys controlled by Elegance were actually not a part of Elegance’s abilities. They were indistinguishable.","Lin Yuan said to Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, everyone’s fighting style will change when they grow up. This is very normal. Take me for example. I’ve changed my fighting style countless times along the way. Finding the most suitable fighting style for myself is an extremely challenging matter for an expert. I believe that you will definitely be able to balance it out. Moreover, if Elegance obtains any opportunities in the future, you might have to rely on Elegance itself to fight again!”","Lin Yuan beckoned to Elegance to get ready.","Then, he activated the Realm Abyss Red Lotus and made it inject a large amount of faith power into Elegance.","Elegance absorbed the faith power with all its might. Soon, Elegance’s aura changed and steadily increased.","Liu Jie was extremely nervous. Elegance was an eight-winged fairy.","If everything went smoothly, Elegance’s bloodline would have a chance of advancing further when it reached the Holy Spirit level!","As a spirit qi professional who had contracted a fairy from the beginning, Liu Jie knew very well the importance of bloodlines to fairies.","Even if Liu Jie no longer relied on Elegance in battle, the increase in its bloodline could still bring unimaginable benefits to Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan saw Liu Jie’s nervousness and worry and smiled as he said, “Big Brother Liu, you don’t have to worry about the improvement of Elegance’s bloodline. I’ve prepared a large number of things that can improve the fairy bloodline. These things are enough for Elegance to improve its bloodline with its current bloodline!”","Lin Yuan hurriedly took out all the resources and generously provided them to Elegance.","With the enhancement of these resources, Elegance’s bloodline aura had improved significantly.","Although it was not easy for fairies to improve their bloodlines, they would not suffer much pain. It was not as tragic as when dragon species feys evolved their bloodlines. This made both Lin Yuan and Liu Jie not worry too much about Elegance’s safety during the evolution process.","This was the advantage of fairies. Other feys could not be envious even if they wanted to!","The moment it broke through to the Holy Spirit level, a fifth pair of wings grew out of Elegance’s back as it wished.","This completely transformed Elegance into a ten-winged fairy.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Elegance.","[Fey Name]: Insect Queen","[Fey Species]: Insect-species/fairy-species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10) [Fey Type]: Source/Spiritual [Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit [Divine Kingdom Grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Execution Blade Insect]: Eight hooked insect legs will grow out of the body. The sense of taste, smell and mouth will be degraded. The insect legs have extremely strong sensing ability. The sharp end of the hooked legs has mouths that are connected to the inner organs. When the legs pierce a target, the mouths will emerge and break through anything hard within the target’s body.","[Vibrating Armor Ladybug]: Its back will open and have strong defense against attacks. Its back will also start to vibrate violently and reflect physical attacks. If targeted by elemental attacks, the vibrating back would be able to dodge a portion of the elemental damage.","[Flowing Plasma Electricity Insect]: The insect will spit out large amounts of plasma that will start to flow. The flowing plasma will have strong paralyzing effects. It will cause long-lasting electric-related damage to the target.","[Electromagnetic Chrysalis]: In a chrysalis state, it will be able to speed up the rate of accumulation of the plasma. The plasma will be quickly released. In the moth state, it will be able to use plasma to manipulate electromagnetic fields and control targets from a distance away.","[Lonely Night Hurricane Moth]: Flapping its wings, it will be able to generate strong winds that it can manipulate to attack a target. Its wings will produce special scale powder that will be able to perfectly blend with the night or camouflaged in the day.","[Six Treasures Cloud Dragonfly]: It can boost other insect-species lifeforms and increase their speed, strength, defense, as well as store of energy. When it is necessary, it can become a shield and take on a deadly attack on behalf of one of the feys it has boosted.","[Curse Explosion Brain Insect]: It will be hosted in the brain of an insect and supply energy to that insect’s brain to increase the brain’s intelligence. It will be able to issue orders to the insect-species lifeforms in the vicinity. Once the insect’s brain is no longer active, it will automatically explode. The shocks of the explosion will place curses on the insects in the surroundings, causing them to go into a frenzy.","[Fortress Floating Insect]: An enormous insect body will be able to carry a large number of insects. The light insect body will be able to move rapidly in the air. Insects can be stored and released.","[Protein Millipede]: It will reproduce to create a large amount of insect protein. The insect protein can be supplied to other targets. While it is producing egg protein, it will inject a special venom into the insects. Once it dissolves in the body of other insects absorbing the rich liquid will allow it to recover its depleted energy.","[Revival Death Insect]: When many insects die and their souls have not been used, they can be revived. The dead insects will turn into dead spirits. Although they will not follow Elegance’s orders directly, they will follow the Revival Death Insect’s orders.","Exclusive Skill:","[Blast Recovery]: Elegance will select a portion of the insects it produced and explode them. The explosion timings can be adjusted based on the positions of the insects. After the blast, Elegance will regain some of the protein and spiritual power.","[Swarm Frenzy]: When the insect swarm is in a frenzied state, its speed will skyrocket. In the frenzied state, the insect swarm will be bloodthirsty and be able to replenish their vitality using the blood within the target.","[Death Echo]: Each time an insect dies, an echo will resonate back to Elegance. With every 100 echos, the rate at which Elegance produces protein will be raised, increasing the rate at which insects are produced.","[Main Body Split]: Half of the energy will be depleted to split the body. The split body will possess the same insect-producing abilities as the main body (the current bloodline will only allow for four splits).","[Gene Transform Fairy]: It will use the special insect genes in its body to support the fairy bloodline and nurture fairies. The fairies will be linked to its genes and their bloodlines will boost its own bloodline. The fairies’ bloodlines can be evolved individually. When necessary, the fairy bloodlines can be absorbed in order for its own bloodline to break through.","[Forceful Reincarnation]: When dealt a lethal attack and on the brink of death, it can inject its soul into its muscles to forcefully nurture a fetus. When sufficient energy is supplied to the fetus, the fetus will be reincarnated into a new body.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Unyielding Insect Spirit]: When the insects it nurtures dies, their souls can be collected in the divine kingdom as long as they have fought valiantly in battle. When the divine kingdom’s aura is released, the divine kingdom’s aura will allow the insect spirits to become even braver. These insect spirits will be able to provide Elegance with faith power in the same way lifeforms do.","[Insect Bloodline Transformation]: Change the insect-type bloodline that it controls so that it can change a portion of its insect-type bloodline when it consumes a large amount of insect protein. Every time it changes its bloodline, its divine kingdom will be sealed for a period of time.","Lin Yuan smiled and said to Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, it seems that from now on, Elegance will still be your main method of dealing with enemies! By not relying on Elegance in the past, you made it jealous, right?”","Liu Jie, Elegance’s contractor, had placed all his attention on the transformation of Elegance’s bloodline and had not paid much attention to the changes in its divine kingdom.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Liu Jie hurriedly sensed Elegance’s divine kingdom ability.","After sensing Liu Jie, a pleasantly surprised expression appeared on his face. As Lin Yuan had said, he would have to rely on Elegance in battle in the future!","Elegance’s new ability, Insect Bloodline Transformation, gave Liu Jie a chance to change Elegance’s current ability.","Although Elegance had to pay a certain price to use the Insect Bloodline Transformation, such as a large amount of proteins and the sealing of the divine kingdom, Liu Jie was currently in seclusion to increase his strength.","The closure of his divine kingdom would not affect him in any way. Furthermore, the sealing of the divine kingdom was only temporary. It could be reopened after a period of time.","As for Elegance’s ability Protein Millipede, it could produce a large amount of insect protein. Liu Jie did not have to worry about not having enough insect protein!","Just as Liu Jie was extremely excited about Elegance’s new divine kingdom ability, Insect Bloodline Transformation, Lin Yuan continued, “Big Brother Liu, when I was training outside, I collected many excellent insect-species feys from Fortune Treasure Palace.. These insect-species feys are at a much higher level than the main world’s insect-species feys!”"]},{"number":3019,"title":"Chapter 3019 Disguise of Mirage Weather!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3019 Disguise of Mirage Weather!","....","“I’ve already handed these insect-species feys to Mr. Zhong. You can go to him later and ask for them! As a Grade 5 Creator, Mr. Zhong likes to collect resources. He must have a lot of insect-species feys! When the time comes, you can ask Mr. Zhong more about the selection and combination of Elegance’s new ability!”","Lin Yuan put Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator, in an important position. Apart from basic resources like spirit qi crystals and heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, Lin Yuan basically handed all the other resources to Zhong Zhiyu.","Lin Yuan had given these resources to Zhong Zhiyu so that he would feel that he trusted him and feel a sense of belonging to Sky City as soon as possible.","Secondly, Lin Yuan already controlled Zhong Zhiyu’s holy spirit and could use the Lifespan Mouse to control Zhong Zhiyu’s life and death.","Under such circumstances, it would not be inappropriate for Lin Yuan to put Zhong Zhiyu in an important position. If he handed the resources to Zhong Zhiyu to manage, Zhong Zhiyu would not have to ask Lin Yuan for resources when he needed them in the future when he led the Creator team!","Even though Lin Yuan had Morbius and could produce a large number of Creator resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he having the Moon Empress as his master allowed him to realize how much help a knowledgeable elder would be to him.","In terms of ability, Zhong Zhiyu’s Creator ability was stronger than the Moon Empress’!","With Zhong Zhiyu’s help, Liu Jie knew what he needed more clearly.","Although Liu Jie could use Elegance’s newly acquired divine kingdom ability, Insect Bloodline Transformation, to carry out infinite trials and errors, there was still a cost. Not only would it be a waste of time for Liu Jie to make a mistake, but he might also make a mistake in his choice of insect-type genre and lead to a mismatch in the combination of his other abilities.","Ever since Zhong Zhiyu had joined Sky City, Liu Jie had been looking for an opportunity to interact with him. However, Liu Jie had never found a reason to interact with a Grade 5 Creator like Zhong Zhiyu.","Liu Jie had finally found an opportunity to take the initiative to interact with Zhong Zhiyu, a Class 5 Creator.","Unlike Lin Yuan’s master, who had followed him to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Night Leaning Moon had not.","Liu Jie did not go out to train like Lin Yuan. Thus, Liu Jie did not have the chance to understand things that he did not understand.","Liu Jie could not always disturb the Moon Empress. Liu Jie knew very well how busy the Moon Empress was usually. When Lin Yuan had left Sky City, Sky City had relied on the Moon Empress to support itself. Many decisions had to be made by the Moon Empress.","Now that he had the chance to come into contact with a Grade 5 Creator like Zhong Zhiyu, Liu Jie had never thought of taking Zhong Zhiyu as his master. However, Liu Jie would still do his best to obtain the opportunity to interact with a Grade 5 Creator like Zhong Zhiyu and seek guidance from him!","As a member of Sky City, Zhong Zhiyu should be kind to him, a core member of Sky City.","“Ah Yuan, I’ll go and ask Senior Zhong Zhiyu for guidance now. After I’m done with Senior Zhong Zhiyu, I’ll go into seclusion for a long time! I might have to go into seclusion for a few years this time!”","Previously, Liu Jie had been thinking about his affairs in Sky City. But now, he was no longer going to think about these things. The most important thing now was to increase his strength!","This was because Liu Jie had already sensed from Lin Yuan’s words that he would go out to fight for supremacy in the future.","Since Lin Yuan had this thought, the most important thing for him to do was to increase his strength.","While he spent the next few years in seclusion, Zhou Luo would help him manage the white-clothed followers. With Zhou Luo’s ability, he was completely qualified!","Previously, the matters related to the reserve sequence, combat sequence, and white-clothed followers mostly relied on Zhou Luo’s daily maintenance and circulation. Liu Jie had only made some important decisions.","Liu Jie did not need to be afraid that his seclusion would affect his status in Sky City. Since that was the case, Liu Jie was not prepared to hesitate or delay any longer.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Big Brother Liu’s seclusion to increase your strength is the best decision for you! If you need any resources during your seclusion, you can ask Elegance to assign a fairy transformed from a carcinoma fey to Mr. Zhong!","“In terms of resources, Mr. Zhong will definitely not be stingy with you. It just so happens that you can ask Mr. Zhong’s opinion when you nurture every fairy. Mr. Zhong is a talented person. To be able to pull Mr. Zhong into Sky City is an opportunity for all the members of Sky City!”","When Lin Yuan said this, he did not intend to raise Zhong Zhiyu’s status. With Zhong Zhiyu’s ability, no one in Sky City would not take him seriously.","Lin Yuan’s words came from his emotions.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the results he had achieved in the year since he had come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","While Liu Jie was communicating with Zhong Zhiyu, Lin Yuan contacted Gray.","Gray’s cloud form immediately floated into Lin Yuan’s room.","Gray’s voice rang in Lin Yuan’s ears, “Lin Yuan, am I very useless? I haven’t reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom even after such a long time.”","Gray’s tone was filled with self-blame. Compared to the Floating Island Whale and the other feys that Lin Yuan had nurtured, Gray’s advancement speed was the slowest.","Sensing Gray’s disappointment, Lin Yuan hurriedly said, “Gray, you’re wrong to think that way. There’s an essential difference between your ability and the way you improve your strength compared to others.","“Others advance rapidly through the resources I provide, but you’re different. You rely on your ability to continuously absorb all kinds of weather and use these weather to increase your grade. You’ve already laid a solid foundation for yourself. As the saying goes, there’s no need to worry about a meal being late if it’s a good one. Your strength will increase sooner or later!","“Compared to quickly increasing your strength, what’s more important to you is to continuously strengthen your foundation! If there’s a chance in the future, I’ll find some special weather for you to obtain more abilities!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words of comfort, Gray felt much better.","However, Gray still felt disappointed.","Lin Yuan could understand Gray’s feelings. The others were getting stronger and stronger, but it was stuck here. In particular, Lin Yuan had been trying to help Gray improve its strength and perfect the linkage system between Gray, the Floating Island Whale, and Dark Blue. This put Gray under a lot of pressure.","However, when Gray accumulated strength for a period of time before increasing its strength, Gray could feel the benefits of its current accumulation for its future growth!","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Gray.","[Fey Name]: Sky Clouded Crane","[Fey Species]: Crane species/Red Crane species","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural","[Fey Quality]: Eternal IX","Abilities:","[Cloudy Weather]: The body will present itself as a cloud and will be compatible with any weather. The body can absorb the weather. Once the weather is absorbed into the cloud, it will become a new ability. No new abilities will come from evolution.","[Radiance of a Clear Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after changing the weather to that of clear skies, all the lifeforms in the area will be stamped with a clear weather imprint. Friendly lifeforms’ light-type abilities will be able to generate more damage while enemies will sustain sunstroke. burning, and other negative effects.","[Darkness of a Cloudy Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after changing the weather to that or a cloudy day, all lifeforms in the area will be stamped with a cloudy weather imprint. Friendly lifeforms’ dark-type abilities will be able to generate more damage while enemies will suffer confusion, fear, and other negative effects.","[Frozen Snowy Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after the weather has been changed to become snowy, all lifeforms will be branded with the snowy weather imprint. Friendly lifeforms will be able to produce more powerful ice-type attacks and water-type abilities can also become ice-type. Enemies will be frozen, numbed, and experience other negative effects. Fire-type effects will also become less effective.","[Roar of a Windy Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after changing the weather to windy weather, all the lifeforms in the area will be stamped with a windy weather imprint. Friendly lifeforms’ wind-type abilities will be able to generate more damage while enemies will experience reverse currents, wind pressure, and other negative effects.","[Judgment of Thunder Weather]: An area covered by clouds or has been transformed into cloudy weather will be branded with a thunder weather imprint. When the thunder hits friendly lifeforms, their ability to cause damage will be increased. When the thunder hits enemies, they will feel numbness and other related negative effects.","[Fusion of Rainbow Weather]: Cloudy weather will turn to rainbow weather. The rainbow weather can promote the fusion of other weather and allow them to coexist.","[Foggy Day’s Coverage]: A cloudy weather will change into foggy weather. At the same time, a cloudy weather imprint will be placed on lifeforms in the area. Friendly targets will be able to effectively hide their presence in the fog while enemies will be hit with a series of negative effects such as blindness and dizziness.","[Disguise of Mirage Weather]: The cloud-covered weather changes the original weather to Disguise of Mirage Weather. At the same time, lifeforms in the range will cover gain the Disguise of Mirage Weather Mark. The Disguise of Mirage Weather Mark only works on friendly targets and construction targets. Disguise of Mirage Weather can disguise friendly targets and construction targets. When the enemy investigates their own units, there is a certain chance that the enemy will be in a hallucination state (Units in a hallucination state will not notice their own situation.)","Exclusive Skill:","[Jade Contract]: Condense every type of weather absorbed into a jade. The jade will adorn the feathers. Once the weather turns into the jade decoration, the cloud will no longer carry the aura of that weather. but when the jade decoration is activated, every type of weather will turn into a jade beast.","[Body of Weather]: The body will comprehend the construction of natural phenomena it controls and produce them accordingly. These natural phenomena can be used to aid other targets so they will receive double empowerment regardless of the weather they are experiencing.","[Abandon Weather Reincarnation]: When it is severely injured or in a near-dead state, it will immediately give up one of the weather it controls and instantly return to full health (after the ability is used, the weather can be taken control of again. However, regaining the abandoned weather will require accumulation and will not change the respective ability.","[Weather Transformation Seal]: Gather all the weather it has under its control and create a seal full of weather power. It will be used to suppress a target. Under the weather seal, friendly targets will receive comprehensive boosting from weather-related elemental power.","[Myriad Weather Circulation]: The user enters a dormant state. When the user is in a dormant state, all the weather will enter a high-intensity stimulation state. Moreover, when the user is in a dormant state, the user will not overdraft their energy.","[Weather Extraction]: Extracts high-intensity meteorological energy from one’s own weather energy. After the weather energy is extracted, the elemental energy generated by the weather energy will be integrated into the cloud formed by the body. The energy extracted from the weather energy is very easy for lifeforms to absorb.","Before Gray came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, its strength was at Sovereign X/Creation IX After coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds for more than a year, due to the environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Gray’s advancement in grade was not slow at all.","At this moment, Gray had already become a powerful Sovereign X/Eternal IX lifeform! After some time, Gray would naturally reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","It would not be too late for Lin Yuan to use the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to help Gray evolve after it reached the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","At World Emperor, everything depended on faith power.","Lin Yuan could use the massive amount of pure faith power to directly increase Gray’s strength!","The last time Lin Yuan checked Gray’s data, it had obtained two exclusive skills and one ability.","Lin Yuan did not expect Sky City to have such a rare climate while he was away, allowing Gray to obtain a brand new ability!","In his previous life, Lin Yuan had lived in a seaside city. Every year, when the weather was the hottest, he would occasionally see a mirage.","In this life, Lin Yuan had lived in the Xia Region for so many years, but he had never seen a mirage like this. This made Lin Yuan almost forget about the existence of mirages.","He did not expect such rare weather to appear in an environment like the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","Lin Yuan found it unbelievable."]},{"number":3020,"title":"Chapter 3020 Pouring Fortune Forging Earth!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3020 Pouring Fortune Forging Earth!","....","A mirage was a phenomenon formed by the interaction of water vapor, light, and space. It could indeed be considered a weather phenomenon.","When Lin Yuan had lived in a seaside city in his previous life, he had often seen such a scene. It was mainly related to the unstable spatial energy.","The higher the level of the world’s space, the more stable it would be.","It was really rare to encounter a mirage in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and let Gray create an ability called Disguise of Mirage Weather!","Disguise of Mirage Weather enhanced Gray’s concealment ability.","Gray’s body turned into clouds that enveloped the Floating Island Whale. This was the function that Lin Yuan valued the most.","Disguise of Mirage Weather was equivalent to strengthening Gray’s functions. It could effectively hide the lifeforms and buildings in the clouds. Other than that, when other lifeforms probed the clouds, they could also blind the senses of other lifeforms and make them hallucinate.","Gray used this skill to connect with its exclusive skill Sky-Shading Weather. Even if it was facing the detection ability that was thrown over from an extremely long distance, it still had a way to deal with it.","However, it would be a little difficult for Gray to encounter a mirage again and absorb the mirage to strengthen Disguise of Mirage Weather.","However, it was better to generate one more ability than to not have one.","Gray’s skill Fusion of Rainbow Weather basically did not have much chance of improvement.","“Gray, since you’re ready, I’ll help you evolve now!”","After receiving Gray’s response, Lin Yuan activated the Realm Abyss Red Lotus and poured a large amount of faith power into Gray’s body.","As Gray’s body had always been in a cloudy state, Lin Yuan did not notice Gray’s change. However, Gray did evolve successfully.","According to Lin Yuan’s investigation, Gray had obtained a new divine kingdom ability called Circulation Essence.","[Circulation Essence]: When it enters a dormant state, all its weather will enter a high-intensity stimulation state. Without overdrafting its energy, it will undergo high-intensity extraction of the weather. After extraction of the weather, it will integrate the elemental energy produced by the extraction of the weather into the cloud body that it has transformed into. The energy extracted from the weather is very easy for lifeforms to absorb.","Circulation Essence allowed Gray to activate its abilities to the greatest extent when it was in a dormant state.","The high-intensity weather circulation made Gray’s physical ability stronger.","On the other hand, Circulation Extraction could also produce pure elemental energy from weather and nourish the lifeforms within the range of the clouds.","This ability could be linked with Gray’s many abilities and exclusive skills. Circulation Extraction was not as stunning as All Weather Dependency.","However, it was undeniable that this divine kingdom ability was extremely outstanding.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with Gray’s newly obtained divine kingdom ability after reaching the Holy Spirit level. Gray was also very satisfied with its newly obtained divine kingdom ability.","“Lin Yuan, my ability to absorb weather in a dormant state will become stronger, which will help me strengthen my ability. Lin Yuan, don’t worry. I won’t be arrogant after reaching the Holy Spirit level. I will definitely accumulate even more!","“However, can you help me prepare more plant-type feys that can generate weather? The weather generated by these plant-type feys is no longer enough for me to absorb!”","Gray had grown up by Lin Yuan’s side, and it had always lived a life of being able to eat and clothe. Gray did not feel any pressure when it asked Lin Yuan for resources.","In the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan had already allowed the Hundred Questions Beast army to nurture a large number of plant-type feys that could produce weather.","However, Lin Yuan had yet to plant these weather plant-type feys on the Floating Island Whale’s back.","In a while, Lin Yuan would arrange for Sky City’s reserve sequence members to plant these plant-type feys on the Floating Island Whale’s back.","Not only that, but Lin Yuan also felt that he needed to increase the strength of these plant-type feys that could produce weather.","Previously, when Gray was in the divine kingdom, these plant-type feys that could generate weather were already insufficient.","Now that Gray had stepped into the Holy Spirit level, the demand for weather had become much higher than before. Gray’s weather needs could not be met simply by increasing the number of plant-type feys.","The Hundred Questions Beast army had accumulated more than a million bottles of potions in the Spirit Lock spatial zone over the past few decades.","Lin Yuan only needed to take out a small portion of the Hundred Questions Beast army’s store of potions to fulfill his needs.","“Gray, I’ll prepare it for you soon. You’ve just stepped into the Holy Spirit level. You should stabilize your realm first! I’ll get the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to provide you with more faith power to prevent your realm from becoming unstable!”","Lin Yuan instilled a massive amount of pure faith power to allow feys to step into the Holy Spirit level from the divine kingdom realm. Although this method would not affect the fey’s potential, it had its drawbacks.","This way, the evolved fey did not go through so much training to gain enlightenment in life and death. Therefore, there would be some instability in their realm and it would be easy for them to fall.","The diminishing of a Holy Spirit expert would leave the holy spirit in the divine kingdom in a weakened state for a long time. However, in order to prevent such a situation from happening, Lin Yuan only needed to provide some pure faith power to avoid it.","If other factions knew about Lin Yuan’s regular behavior, they would definitely think that he was extravagant. After all, such pure faith power was extremely rare.","All the experts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds needed faith power to improve their strength.","Lin Yuan played with Gray for a while. After Gray left, Lin Yuan muttered to himself.","Lin Yuan would definitely go out to train in the future. When Lin Yuan went out to train, the Moon Empress would still be the person presiding over Sky City.","Lin Yuan had helped Liu Jie and Wen Yu evolve their main feys, as well as the Floating Island Whale and Gray.","Lin Yuan was prepared to help all the Moon Empress’ feys undergo a comprehensive evolution!","Especially Zixi, who had always been called the Rabbit Emperor by the Moon Empress.","Zixi’s bloodline was extremely special. After stepping into the divine kingdom realm, Zixi displayed astonishing potential.","However, if Zixi wanted to increase its strength, it had a huge need for all kinds of resources, especially faith power.","However, the faith power that the Realm Abyss Red Lotus had accumulated through the faith country for such a long time was definitely enough for Zixi to use!","Lin Yuan headed to the Moon Empress’ residence and explained his thoughts and plans to her.","After knowing Lin Yuan’s decision, the Moon Empress wanted to refuse, but when she thought about how important she was to Lin Yuan when he went out to train, she did not say anything else.","As Lin Yuan’s master, she was indeed a little weak among Sky City’s cohorts. At the very least, she had to be stronger than juniors like Liu Jie and Wen Yu!","Furthermore, Sky City was gaining faith power much faster than before.","As Lin Yuan’s master, it would seem too distant if she was still polite to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had stayed with the Moon Empress for a full week. When he left, the Moon Empress had already become a Holy Spirit contractor.","The Moon Empress could benefit from the increase in her feys’ strength. Only five days had passed. Compared to her previous self, her strength had increased by who knew how many times!","Now, the Moon Empress felt that she only needed to raise her finger to kill her previous self.","Lin Yuan had not used up all of his faith power at the Moon Empress’ place. The faith power he had accumulated was enough for him to upgrade a fey from a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom to the Holy Spirit level.","Previously, Lin Yuan had been thinking about others, so he felt that he had to think more about himself!","Among all of Lin Yuan’s feys, the one with the least presence was undoubtedly the Death Demon Concubine Beast!","Merciful Soul did not have much of a presence, not because it was not strong, but because its abilities were too evil and not suitable to be used. Especially back when they were in the main world. Using the abilities of Merciful Soul in the main world would affect the fate of the main world.","Lin Yuan did not want this to happen at all.","However, now that he was in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan no longer had to worry so much.","Lin Yuan summoned Merciful Soul.","In the past, Merciful Soul liked to appear in its original form. However, Merciful Soul had unknowingly started to like to appear in human form.","In terms of appearance, Merciful Soul could be said to be the most beautiful female humanoid lifeform Lin Yuan had ever seen.","It surpassed the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil whose bloodline had reached Major Satan.","However, compared to Purple Afterglow, there was still a gap.","Although Merciful Soul was beautiful, it was extremely calm. It bowed to Lin Yuan and stood obediently beside him.","Lin Yuan did not exchange too many pleasantries with Merciful Soul. Instead, he injected a massive amount of faith power into its body.","Soon, Merciful Soul successfully stepped into the Holy Spirit level!","[Fey Name]: Death Demon Concubine Beast","[Fey Species]: Demon concubine beast species/faceless beast species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Curse/Spiritual/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine kingdom grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Death]: Make judgment on the target’s willpower, soul, spirit, and mind power. If the judgment decides that combined power of the four powers is weaker than it, the lifeform will not be able to attack it.","[Heart Words Cross Disaster]: Placing a voiced curse on the target. The strength of the target’s spiritual energy will determine the strength of the curse. Under the influence of the curse, if another curse is placed on the target’s mind, the effects of the curse will multiply and the target’s soul will start to corrode.","[Demon Concubine’s Promise]: The Death Demon Concubine can turn its heart into a pill that can be gifted to a target. The target will become the Death Demon Concubine’s dependant and their lives will be tied together.","[Heart Stolen Soul Photographed]: After Disaster Heart curses the target’s soul, it can enter the target’s body and use its soul to control the target’s body.","[Deepened Curse Imprint]: Magnify the effects of the curse on the target and bewitch the target’s mind, soul, and spiritual energy simultaneously.","[Steal the Fate of a Nation]: If it can influence the fate of a country that sits upon a certain area of the earth, the fate can be stolen. The price of this ability is the burning up of one’s lifespan.","[Demon Concubine’s Chaos]: When affecting the fate of the nation that the territory belongs to, a chaotic destiny can be injected into the territory. The chaotic destiny will cause all the lifeforms on the ground to be afflicted by bad luck. The effects of the bad luck will be linked to the strength of the chaotic destiny.","[Calamity Gathering]: Calamity will be absorbed from the environment. When the calamity is gathered, the curse effects faced by other lifeforms in the environment will be removed and cleansed.","[Calamity Trigger]: This will target calamity in the bodies of lifeforms. The calamity in tatgets will be triggered and their fortune value will be lowered. They will encounter accidents and mistakes both in life and in combat.","[Adversity Growth]: At necessary moments, the calamity can be transformed and used as lifespan to elongate its own lifespan. When its calamity is used up and its lifespan is about to come to an end, the calamity can be fully depleted (the fully depleted calamity will need 100 years to be replenished).","Exclusive Skill:","[Faceless Appearance]: Set a target and absorb its bloodline, spiritual energy, and soul. It will then assume the appearance of the target and obtain all of its abilities.","[Fate of Chaos]: Absorb the fate of the ground it is present on. The fate can be used to enhance the effects of its abilities.","[Payment in Life]: Use its lifespan to investigate the lifespans of other targets. If its own lifespan is sacrificed, it can take away another’s lifespan by touching the target.","[Disaster Fortune Application]: A disaster fortune imprint will be applied on the target. The disaster fortune imprint will measure its own calamity to the fortune in the target. If the calamity in its own body is greater than the fortune in the target, it will absorb the fortune in the target while injecting calamity into the target.","[Shared Affection]: The damage suffered can be shared with targets that feel affection for it. The targets that feel affection for it will share the damage it suffers.","[Demon Concubine’s Control]: Each of its eyes carries the ability to control lifeforms. As long as the target’s divine kingdom grade is not more than two grades above its own and the target has less calamity in its body, the Death Demon Concubine Beast will be able to take hold of the mind and spirit of the target that feels affection for it and become its puppet.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Hardship Transformation]: The calamity and fortune in the divine kingdom can be transformed. The calamity eye and fortune eye will be formed on the Fortune Calamity Tablet in the divine kingdom. The calamity eye can enable calamity to accumulate continuously in the target’s body. The fortune eye will enable fortune to accumulate continuously in the target’s body.","[Pouring Fortune Forging Earth]: Treat the ground under its feet as a sword tomb. Every lifeform that is charmed by it and attracted to it can be refined into a sword of fortune that can suppress luck. Let the sword of fortune be rooted in a piece of land. This piece of land can transfer the luck of the land where the other swords of fortune are to you, affecting the luck of all lifeforms in the entire land."]},{"number":3021,"title":"Chapter 3021: Yi He’s Invitation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3021: Yi He’s Invitation!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The circumstances surrounding Merciful Soul and Gray’s evolution to the Holy Spirit level were completely different.","Gray did not suffer much when it stepped into the Holy Spirit level and naturally completed the transformation of its grade. Unlike Merciful Soul, which had its body reconstructed when it stepped into the Holy Spirit level.","During the process of reconstructing its body, Merciful Souls had always been very unyielding in remaining in its human form.","The beautiful skin of Merciful Soul, from complete to badly mangled to complete, underwent several transformations.","However, Merciful Soul did not make any sound. It allowed its body to disintegrate continuously and slowly perfect itself as it disintegrated again and again.","Merciful Soul seemed to be enjoying this feeling.","Lin Yuan was secretly amazed by the tenacity of Merciful Souls. Only creatures with exceptional tenacity could use their abilities to control the souls of other creatures.","Merciful Soul said softly to Lin Yuan after it had completed its advancement, “Master, thank you for nurturing me. You’ve nurtured me to such a powerful state. I hope to have a chance to display my strength in the future so that I can unleash my abilities like your other feys!”","Lin Yuan knew that Merciful Soul was somewhat dissatisfied with his previous arrangements, or rather, helpless.","Previously, Lin Yuan had indeed not given Merciful Soul a chance to display its abilities. However, Lin Yuan would not be like before. Lin Yuan was very willing to allow Merciful Soul.","Now that Lin Yuan had brought in a low-grade and mid-grade blessed land, North of the Lonely River had become a rich and prosperous place.","In addition, with Season Cycle, Cleansing Breath Soil, Business Flourishing Flower, and other legendary presences, even top factions would want to fight for North of the Lonely River.","Lin Yuan had gone to nurture Merciful Soul so early because he wanted it to increase North of the Lonely River’s luck through Steal the Fate of a Nation.","The increase in the region’s luck would allow all the lifeforms in this area to obtain benefits. Not only could the members of Sky City be strengthened by the increase in luck, but most importantly, the lifeforms in the faith country would also be affected by the increase in luck.","At that time, there would definitely be some extremely outstanding prodigies in the faith country!","The members of the faith country could also be considered direct descendants of Sky City. They were worthy of Lin Yuan’s future nurturing!","Since Lin Yuan had come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he couldn’t mobilize manpower from the main world to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The faith country had basically become the only way for Lin Yuan to select members for Sky City.","“Merciful Soul, it’s true that I didn’t give you any chance to showcase your abilities previously, but from now on, I can let you continue to showcase your talents! In a while, I’ll specially arrange an area for you. You can transfer the luck of the land outside the plains of North of the Lonely River to this area.","“You’ve reached the Holy Spirit level and obtained a new divine kingdom ability to channel and forge the land. This divine kingdom can allow you not to only rely on your ability to steal luck to obtain luck. Even if you have the exclusive skill Payment in Life to offset it and the Lifespan Mouse can always provide you with lifespan, your lifespan is still not enough when you frequently steal luck.","“In North of the Lonely River, you can’t use Pouring Fortune Forging Earth. When I go out to train in the future, I’ll bring you out with me. At that time, you can use the living beings you charm and control to refine the swords of fortune to steal the luck of the world to strengthen North of the Lonely River.”","The power of Merciful Soul’s divine kingdom ability Pouring Fortune Forging Earth brought Lin Yuan a pleasant surprise.","With the power of Merciful Soul’s divine kingdom ability Pouring Fortune Forging Earth, North of the Lonely River was destined to have more and more luck!","It was very easy for Merciful Soul to charm a lifeform. Furthermore, Merciful Soul’s refinement of the swords of fortune did not cause much damage to itself.","When it heard that Lin Yuan was going to bring it out, Merciful Soul looked exceptionally happy.","As Lin Yuan’s contracted fey, Merciful Soul had a very deep relationship with him.","However, Merciful Soul was too reserved and did not reveal its emotions.","However, Merciful Soul wanted to stay by Lin Yuan’s side.","After staying in Sky City for nearly four months, Lin Yuan felt that he should go out and train for some time.","In the past few months, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting had been held a few more times and Lin Yuan had given more Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen to Ruyi.","Ruyi had officially become a core member of Sky City!","However, because the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds had yet to break through to World Emperor, the effects of the divine kingdom pollen were limited. It was not enough to completely remove the curse in Ruyi’s body.","However, after Lin Yuan explained the situation to Ruyi, he promised Ruyi that he would help her remove the curse within half a year.","Originally, Ruyi did not trust Lin Yuan. After all, both Lin Yuan and the Astronomical Parliament had appeared too suddenly.","However, after Lin Yuan provided Ruyi with the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen for the second time, which was stronger than the first time, Ruyi believed Lin Yuan.","Neither her parents nor the Carp Mystic Palace could do anything about the curse in her body. Lin Yuan was the only way out.","Ruyi was prepared to wait until the curse in her body was completely removed before finding a suitable reason to tell her parents about the situation.","Since Lin Yuan had his own people, he did not allow Wen Yu to recruit new people during the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings.","Now that everything was in the development stage, there was no need to rush.","The species that Lin Yuan had subdued in the Coiling Dragon Mountain had all moved to North of the Lonely River.","North of the Lonely River became lively and prosperous.","Sky City had deliberately held an internal meeting with the core members of the hundreds of powerful species to consider how to settle them down.","If these species were allowed to occupy land as kings in various parts of North of the Lonely River, even if these species all listened to Lin Yuan’s orders, it was inevitable that there would be some problems in the future. If the territorial consciousness of these species was preserved, it would be very difficult for these species to eliminate their wildness.","This was because these species living in North of the Lonely River were not only facing Lin Yuan but also the core members of Sky City, as well as the other races and the residents living in the country of faith.","After some discussion, Lin Yuan felt that the best way to eliminate the wildness of these races was to disperse them and integrate them into the faith country as family clans.","Changing the way of life of these communities was indeed a process.","It was very likely that some accidents would happen during this period. If these species that were already under Lin Yuan’s control could not fuse perfectly in the faith country, they would always cause trouble. Then, these species that existed in the form of family clans would be eliminated!","Lin Yuan’s decision did not exploit the interests of these species. These species would integrate into the faith country in the manner of family clans and become famous families in the faith country.","At this moment, the faith country was gradually opening up the chamber of commerce and the trade chain of resources.","Having these species was very helpful for the development of the faith country.","Now that he had made the decision, it was up to him to carry it out.","Lin Yuan would only bring Winter with him when he went out. Spring and Summer would remain in Sky City.","Even if these species were unwilling, they could not cause any trouble!","Ling Muzhuo had contacted Lin Yuan several times during this period of time. He had contacted Lin Yuan to invite him to attend a private trade fair organized by the Fortune Treasure Palace for special honor guests.","Lin Yuan was not interested in such a private trade fair at all.","Given Lin Yuan’s current relationship with the Fortune Treasure Palace, if he wanted any resources, even if Lin Yuan did not participate in this so-called trade fair, the Fortune Treasure Palace would still trade resources with him.","The core purpose of participating in this trade fair was actually to deepen the connection between Fortune Treasure Palace and the special honor guests. It also provided a channel for communication between the special honor guests.","Lin Yuan had lost interest in getting to know more people in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Unless Ling Muzhuo introduced the Creators whose lifespans were reaching their end, Lin Yuan was not prepared to accept Ling Muzhuo’s invitation.","Lin Yuan did not agree to Ling Muzhuo’s request, but he made a huge transaction with him.","Lin Yuan had been using spirit qi crystals during the transactions.","Morbius had been helping Lin Yuan collect spirit qi crystals. As the number of members in the faith country increased, Lin Yuan also provided a stable living environment for the citizens of the faith country. As a result, there were often people who broke through in the faith country.","Even though these people from the faith country would gather together to increase their strength, Morbius was still a little busy.","Lin Yuan had so many spirit qi crystals that the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was so tired that it rolled its eyes.","After such a long time, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was still responsible for the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan had never intentionally increased the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s strength. As usual, he fed it two wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls every day.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was only a step away from reaching Immortal.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope absorbed pure spirit qi every day. Coupled with top-notch resources like heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, it took decades to reach the peak of Creation Breed. The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope seemed to be improving very slowly, but in fact, its speed of improvement was much faster than other feys.","There were already hundreds of thousands of boxes of spirit qi crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Each box contained six-figure spirit qi crystals. These resources were the reason why Lin Yuan dared to develop his faith country!","Without these resources, even if Lin Yuan had Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter by his side, he probably would not even have the embryonic form of a faith country.","He could not produce resources and relied on plundering to obtain resources. He would be destined to have a large number of enemies. With too many enemies targeting Sky City, it was inevitable that some accidents would happen over time.","Just as Lin Yuan was thinking about where to train, Yi He, a Grade 5 Creator, contacted him through the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","The moment the call connected, Lin Yuan heard Yi He say, “Young Master, you previously told me that you’re preparing to gather more Creators under your command. I happen to be attending a Creator’s academic conference. Are you interested in attending?","“There will be at least three Grade 5 Creators participating in this meeting of","Creators, including Creators who have already fallen into the curse of lifespan.”","Before Yi He and Lin Yuan parted ways, he had addressed Lin Yuan as ‘young friend’. Now, when he contacted Lin Yuan, he called him ‘Young Master Lin Yuan’ because Yi He had completely straightened out his position after this period of time.","Yi He remembered how Winter addressed Lin Yuan, so he simply addressed him the same way.","Lin Yuan’s expression changed when he heard Yi He’s words. The Creators’ meeting that Yi He mentioned was much more attractive to Lin Yuan than the private transaction held by Fortune Treasure Palace.","Sky City had indeed introduced new Creators, but there were still too few of them.","The creation of the Floating Island Whale embryo alone took up almost all the time of Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator, and the other four Grade 4 Creators.","If they could recruit more advanced Creators for Sky City, Sky City’s development in advanced resources would definitely be much faster than it was now!","With the recommendation of a Grade 5 Creator like Yi He, it should be easier to pull other Creators into Sky City.","Lin Yuan decided to head to Yi He’s location and participate in the academic conference with him.","“Senior Yi He, I will arrive at the coordinates you gave me in two days. Thank you for thinking of me when something like this happens!”","Yi He’s way of addressing Lin Yuan had changed, but Lin Yuan’s attitude toward him did not change at all. He still gave Yi He enough respect, which made Yi He very happy.","“Young Master, I’m also a member of a faction now. It’s my duty to think for our faction! A few of the people participating in this meeting are my old friends. I’ll invite them. The probability of them joining is very high. There’s no need to use any methods. As for the others, I think it’s better to use some methods. Otherwise, such a precious opportunity will be wasted!”","Yi He was a very straightforward person. After confirming his position, all his actions would follow his position.","Ever since Yi He had joined Sky City under Lin Yuan’s command, all of Yi He’s actions were in line with Sky City’s interests.","If a few Creators could join Sky City during this academic conference, it would be a gift in return for Lin Yuan’s help in resolving the problem of lifespan!","“Senior Yi He, I will naturally make preparations. However, it’s not appropriate for me to forcefully pull them into Sky City. I’m still more inclined to those Creators with insufficient lifespans. Because joining Sky City is a mutually beneficial thing.”","Yi He was somewhat surprised by Lin Yuan’s words. He did not expect Lin Yuan, who had less than 50 years of lifespan, to be so reliable and not be blinded by the benefits in front of him.","Only with such a temperament and structure could he achieve great things.."]},{"number":3022,"title":"Chapter 3022 Chu Ci’s Training!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3022 Chu Ci’s Training!","....","Yi He believed that with Lin Yuan’s power, he could force those Grade 4 Creators or even Grade 5 Creators to submit.","If he stayed by Lin Yuan’s side, he would be Lin Yuan’s accomplice.","By doing so, Lin Yuan could maximize the short-term benefits.","Lin Yuan could target all the Creators participating in this academic exchange.","However, there were two disadvantages to doing so. One was that even if those who were forced to join Sky City by Lin Yuan’s martial force were to join Sky City’s and become under Lin Yuan’s control, they would still be an unstable factor. Not only would these people not serve Sky City well, but they might also secretly think of ways to take revenge on Sky City.","Many Creators were tough nuts to crack. Only when they truly felt the effects of the depletion of their lifespan and experienced the process of their bodies and souls decaying because of aging would they soften.","For example, in the tens of thousands of years that Yi He had been searching for a way to increase his lifespan, his bones were no longer as hard as before.","Otherwise, Yi He would not have willingly submitted to Lin Yuan after he took out the Lifespan Mouse.","Secondly, there was no way that the secret would remain hidden. Once the news got out, Lin Yuan’s Sky City would be targeted by the Creator factions. Even Honor Absent Palace, which controlled the East Universe, would ask about this matter.","“Young Master, I’ll make the preparations first so you can take action when you come! I will use my connections to invite more Creators to participate in this academic exchange.”","Yi He paused for a moment before speaking to Lin Yuan. “Young Master, after our meeting this time, I’ve decided not to continue developing outside like before. I want to return to Sky City with you. Didn’t you say that Sky City is currently in the construction phase? I can bring some people over to help!”","Yi He’s idea did not appear out of nowhere. It was something that he had thought of not long after he became Lin Yuan’s subordinate.","He looked carefree and free and could still live like before.","However, doing so was equivalent to leaving Sky City’s center of power.","He had contracted the Lifespan Mouse. From now on, he would be a member of Sky City in life and a ghost in death.","If he only had a few thousand years left to live, Yi He would definitely choose freedom.","However, the current Yi He had an unlimited lifespan. Compared to his current freedom, he had to consider his future development.","Although Yi He didn’t venture to Sky City, Lin Yuan still disclosed some information about it to him. Lin Yuan informed Yi He of the existence of Zhong Zhiyu, a Grade 5 Creator, whose presence sparked a sense of danger in Yi He.","In terms of Creator abilities, Zhong Zhiyu surpassed him. Lingering outside too long might jeopardize Yi He’s future access to Sky City’s core!","Initially, Lin Yuan had urged Yi He to explore outside because he recognized Yi He as the founder of a Creator group, surrounded by many others of his kind. Lin Yuan aimed to leverage Yi He’s influence and the resources of his Creator network.","Yi He had intentions to align his Creators with Sky City.","Yet, Lin Yuan no longer relied on Yi He’s influence; Yi He had stretched it to its limits during their gathering. Despite Yi He’s silence on the matter, Lin Yuan intended to dispatch him back to Sky City to collaborate with Zhong Zhiyu on refining the development of the Floating Island Whale embryos.","The combined intellect of two Grade 5 Creators would undoubtedly enhance the construction and layout of the Floating Island Whale embryos!","“Senior Yi He, it’s great you’re willing to return to Sky City. The leader of Sky City’s Creator department has been set up. When you return, I’ll give you the position of deputy leader. The deputy team leader and the team leader have the same authority. You can communicate more.”","Lin Yuan had already appointed Zhong Zhiyu, so upon his return, Lin Yuan couldn’t make Yi He the team leader immediately, thus ensuring Zhong Zhiyu and Yi He were on equal footing.","This decision not only affected Zhong Zhiyu’s authority in Sky City’s Creator department but also likely sparked opinions from Zhong Zhiyu.","The principle of “first come, first served” applied there. While Zhong Zhiyu excelled in Creator abilities compared to Yi He, he couldn’t object to Yi He being the deputy team leader.","Lin Yuan granted Yi He and Zhong Zhiyu equal authority. In case of disagreement, Zhong Zhiyu couldn’t use his team leader status to compel Yi He.","Yi He likely brought numerous Grade 4 Creators to Sky City. As a deputy team leader, he could effectively manage them.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s arrangement, Yi He raised no objections. It was clear Zhong Zhiyu had no issue being the deputy team leader under Yi He.","With Lin Yuan possessing the Lifespan Mouse, Yi He was confident more Grade 5 Creators would join Sky City in the future.","By holding the position of deputy team leader, even if he encountered stronger Grade 5 Creators in the future, he’d maintain managerial status.","It seemed returning to Sky City wasn’t too late for him!","After concluding the call with Yi He, Lin Yuan briefed Winter and readied to depart.","Lin Yuan intended to use this trip near Treasure City to meet with Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang.","It was unknown how many star pirates Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang had hunted recently.","With Autumn around, he could support Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang in terms of martial force.","In terms of harvest, it all depended on Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang’s management and operations!","The star pirates roaming around Treasure City should have been hunted down in the past few months.","After Lin Yuan went to collect the harvest, Fu Mi, Yun Qingyang, and the rest could bring the poachers to another area to hunt star pirates.","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang both possessed remarkable abilities, particularly Yun Qingyang, who had recently joined Lin Yuan with a determination to establish his reputation. Though he might not surpass Fu Mi, he was determined to demonstrate his worth to Lin Yuan, propelling him to work diligently.","In the bustling hub of Myriad Treasures City, the chambers of commerce had experienced minimal losses among merchant groups over the past few months.","Traditionally, each chamber of commerce dispatched 1,000 merchant groups annually, with 20% falling victim to star pirates and 10% facing outright attack.","Remarkably, there had been no reported losses among merchant groups in recent months. Even if news of valuable cargo leaked, it failed to attract the attention of the covetous star pirates.","Being a commercial hub, Myriad Treasures City naturally attracted more star pirates compared to other urban centers.","Previously, Li Feng, the City Lord, attempted to eradicate the star pirates surrounding Treasure City with hired experts, albeit with limited success.","Since the inception of Treasure City, star pirates had entrenched themselves in the vicinity. The local chambers of commerce tacitly accepted their presence, as they had become integral to the city’s infrastructure development.","However, the sudden disappearance of these seemingly indomitable star pirates puzzled Li Feng.","Unbeknownst to Li Feng, Lin Yuan was quietly eliminating the star pirates. There was no advantage in divulging this information to Li Feng.","Lin Yuan understood that Li Feng would inevitably publicize this achievement to bolster trade and attract more support to Treasure City.","Yet, such publicity was not in Lin Yuan’s best interest and could potentially alert the remaining star pirates. Lin Yuan preferred to amass wealth discreetly!","Since there were no more star pirates around Myriad Treasure City, it was very difficult for the hunting team to gain anything by staying here.","Lin Yuan and Qin Yu would occasionally communicate. Lin Yuan had also been to the Scarlet Territory and knew that the Bloodian territory was extremely chaotic.","There were a large number of star pirates outside the Scarlet Territory. These star pirates were very strong, and many of them were made up of Bloodians.","It would undoubtedly be more beneficial for Lin Yuan to hunt these powerful star pirates. It would also make it easier for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to choose holy maids from the holy spirits of these star pirates’ divine kingdoms.","...","Winter brought Lin Yuan all the way to Treasure City.","At that moment, Lin Yuan received a message from Chu Ci on his Thoughts Letter Paper.","[Chu Ci]: I’m done with my seclusion. I asked Genius and was surprised to learn that I was seclusion for a few years! I didn’t even know that you went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","Lin Yuan smiled from the bottom of his heart when he saw Chu Ci’s message.","While Chu Ci was in seclusion, Lin Yuan had not completely lost contact with her. It was just that she was focused on improving her strength and no longer interacted with the outside world.","During this period, Lin Yuan had helped Chu Ci increase her strength.","Not only that, but Chu Ci had also met her master, Cold Moon, several times.","However, Chu Ci was in seclusion, so they did not tell her about their trip to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Now that Chu Ci had ended her seclusion, she no longer needed to slowly improve her strength.","Lin Yuan decided that he might as well bring Chu Ci out to train and let her understand more about the Sky Beyond the Clouds so that she could make up for her lack of vision after more than 10 years of seclusion.","Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone and brought Chu Ci out.","Chu Ci had grown accustomed to residing in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Despite leaving it now, she remained unsurprised, even as she noted the heightened energy concentration in the Sky Beyond the Clouds compared to the main world.","Ironically, she found the environmental energy there somewhat lacking.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but smile at Chu Ci’s reaction, seeing it as a testament to his effective upbringing, ensuring her comfort.","However, Chu Ci’s uncertainty about the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ environment concerned Lin Yuan. He intended to ask Genius to help her clarify the situation for her.","Chu Ci said in a serious tone, “Big Brother, you’ve worked hard to nurture me all these years! I know very well that if you hadn’t provided me with the best environment after Mom and Dad left, my feys would only be at Diamond at best. It would have been very difficult for me to become a king-class expert.”","To Lin Yuan, king-class had become an unfamiliar term because he had transcended this level for too long!","Before Lin Yuan could speak, Chu Ci continued. “Big Brother, don’t be in a hurry to deny what I said. If not for you, I would have most likely chosen to contract that Gray Beetle. I wouldn’t have been able to find such a good teacher.”","Chu Ci reached out to hug Lin Yuan. Even though her parents had died when she was very young, the care and love she received was no less than that of her peers. Sometimes, she received even more than they did!","When Chu Ci hugged him, Lin Yuan reached out to hug her shoulder.","Lin Yuan had spent a lot of effort nurturing Chu Ci, giving her the best he could!","After being nurtured by Lin Yuan, Chu Ci surpassed even the younger generation cultivated by the leading factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. She stood as a top genius both in the main world and in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“Chu Ci, your current growth is inseparable from your own efforts. You don’t have to belittle yourself. With your current strength and level, you’re still the top prodigy of this generation even in a huge environment like the Sky Beyond the Clouds! In the future, you have to train more to make your character worthy of your strength.”","Lin Yuan summoned Genius and had it use Connected Tails on Chu Ci, sharing all the knowledge and information that Lin Yuan had obtained while she was in seclusion.","Chu Ci’s knowledge greatly improved in a short period.","However, the improvement of one’s knowledge was not equivalent to one’s character. Chu Ci’s character could only be improved through continuous training.","After Chu Ci digested everything, she was shocked. She did not expect so many things to happen while she had been in seclusion.","Not only had Lin Yuan explored a world that was countless times larger than the main world, but he had also established a strong foundation in this world.","Chu Ci had admired Lin Yuan since she was young. In her heart, Lin Yuan, who had been weak back then, was like an omnipotent giant.","Now that she knew Lin Yuan’s results, Chu Ci was extremely proud.","“Big Brother is in such a vast world. If you bring me around to train, my character will quickly improve. You happen to be going out to train this time. Why don’t I stay by your side?”","As Chu Ci spoke, she observed Lin Yuan’s expression. She knew that the Sky Beyond the Clouds was extremely dangerous. If she saw a hint of distress in Lin Yuan’s eyes, she would obediently return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone and not cause trouble for him!"]},{"number":3023,"title":"Chapter 3023 She’s My Sister!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3023 She’s My Sister!","Chu Ci did not see any awkwardness in Lin Yuan’s eyes.","She heard Lin Yuan say with a smile, “It’s naturally good for you to train with me. Speaking of which, we’ve never trained together. This time, you’ll definitely gain a lot from following me. At the very least, you’ll be able to understand the rules of survival in this world.”","If Lin Yuan had the chance, he was very willing to bring his younger sister along for growth opportunities. Chu Ci was still Lin Yuan’s greatest concern in this world. She was Lin Yuan’s only relative with a bloodline connection.","In the past, Lin Yuan had rejected Chu Ci’s offer to train with him because he could not guarantee Chu Ci’s safety during the training. However, with Winter by his side now, Chu Ci’s safety could definitely be guaranteed.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, survival followed harsher, bloodier rules compared to the main world. Despite Chu Ci’s wealth of knowledge and experience, grasping this reality without firsthand experience proved daunting.","Upon seeing that Lin Yuan was willing to bring her along, Chu Ci jumped up excitedly. Although Chu Ci had been in seclusion in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for decades, she was still a child in front of Lin Yuan.","“Chu Ci, this is Winter. You’ve met him before. In a while, Winter will bring us to the vicinity of Treasure City. I’m going there to collect a group of star pirates. I’ll also introduce Sky City’s hunting group to you.”","As Lin Yuan’s younger sister, Chu Ci might not care about Sky City’s affairs, but she was still one of Sky City’s core members. Now that Chu Ci had ended her seclusion, it was necessary to introduce her to everyone in Sky City.","When Chu Ci heard Lin Yuan’s arrangements, she felt refreshed. At present, Chu Ci could be said to lack experience in venturing outside. During Chu Ci’s years in the main world, she had ventured out with Cold Moon, and they mostly engaged in battles with various feys in the wilderness. There were hardly any opportunities for interaction with people.","Cold Moon felt that Chu Ci was too young at the time, having just entered high school, and there was no need for her to fight with other spirit qi professionals at such a young age. Now, Lin Yuan was bringing Chu Ci around to interact with others. Compared to fighting feys, Chu Ci preferred interacting with people.","Chu Ci, who had been by Lin Yuan’s side since she was little to help him manage the fey store, was not an introvert. Having to support herself in society from a young age, if she was too introverted, she would have starved to death long ago.","At present, Chu Ci was very curious about the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, including the environment.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan mention Winter, Chu Ci obediently greeted him, “Hello, Grandpa Winter. We meet again!”","Chu Ci did not feel there was anything wrong with how he addressed Winter, who looked like an elderly man. Moreover, with Winter’s strength, it was difficult to know how many years he had lived.","However, Winter felt uneasy when he heard Chu Ci address him as such. While it may be fitting for a young girl at Chu Ci’s age to refer to him as ‘Grandpa Winter’, it shouldn’t come from Chu Ci herself. If Chu Ci addressed him as Grandpa Winter, wouldn’t that mean he would also become a grandpa to Lin Yuan? If that was the case, it was absolutely unacceptable.","Just as Winter was about to correct Chu Ci’s way of addressing him, Lin Yuan shook his head. Chu Ci’s manners were a trait that she had cultivated since she was young, so there was nothing wrong with addressing him that way.","There was no need for him to let Chu Ci know about his relationship with Winter. The bond between Chu Ci and Winter and between himself and Winter were separate matters. Nobody disliked someone who understood manners, and Winter was no exception.","Winter smiled at Chu Ci. “Little Chu Ci, it’s been three or five years since I last saw you. You’ve grown into a young lady now!”","Winter said that Chu Ci was a young lady simply because of her age. In terms of looks, Chu Ci had long reached the level of a king-class expert. Coupled with the fact that Chu Ci had contracted the Lifespan Mouse and obtained an endless lifespan, she would naturally not age at all. Chu Ci still looked like a 16 or 17-year-old girl, and she was younger than Lin Yuan.","...","Soon, Lin Yuan and Chu Ci arrived in a small county near Treasure City.","The hunting team led by Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang usually operated in this small county. In the past, due to its proximity to Treasure City, there were often star pirates stationed there, causing almost all the natives in the small county to flee.","Most of the people who came here were wicked individuals who engaged in shady business. Without exception, these people were all eliminated by the hunting team. Now, this small county had become the safest place within a few hundred kilometers. Gradually, many people had chosen to settle there. Due to the presence of the hunting team, the small county had become prosperous.","Although this county may be an inconspicuous county to Treasure City and did not even qualify to appear on the regional map in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was already prosperous enough for Chu Ci as it was much more prosperous than a large city in the Radiance Federation.","“Lin Yuan, this place is huge. There are shops everywhere along the way. It’s just that the people here don’t strike me as particularly strong. However, they carry a heavy murderous aura. I reckon that everyone’s body is stained with a lot of lives. Otherwise, there shouldn’t be such a heavy murderous aura.”","Chu Ci felt as though her eyes were being opened for the first time. Her reaction was exactly the same as Lin Yuan’s reaction when he first came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","After walking in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for some time, Chu Ci realized how insignificant the city was to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Moreover, regardless of whether they were good or evil, everyone in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was basically filled with a murderous aura. It was impossible to survive there without taking some lives.","When Lin Yuan heard Chu Ci’s sigh, he did not explain to her because he felt that there was no need to. Soon, Chu Ci’s knowledge would expand rapidly, and the experiences gained through observation and listening would be the greatest wealth for her.","Apart from selling all kinds of spiritual ingredients and feys, the surrounding shops also sold many special delicacies.","Lin Yuan did not lack these spiritual ingredients and feys. To him, their grades were somewhat low. Hence, Lin Yuan did not think much of it.","Regardless of whether it was from the Creators or Fortune Treasure Palace, the resources Lin Yuan had traded for were of a much higher level than these resources.","Still, Lin Yuan and Chu Ci were especially interested in the special delicacies sold there. Every time Chu Ci was interested in a delicacy, Lin Yuan would help her buy it and let Winter investigate the delicacy. Chu Ci would only eat these delicacies after it was confirmed that there were no problems. Lin Yuan would also taste the delicacies that he was interested in.","As he savored the delicacies, Lin Yuan contacted Fu Mi.","Soon, Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang respectfully appeared in front of Lin Yuan.","When Winter only saw Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang but not Autumn, an unexpected expression appeared on his face.","To Winter’s knowledge, Autumn would not let go of an opportunity to appear before Lin Yuan.","Winter asked Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang, “Isn’t Autumn with you?”","Upon hearing Winter’s question, Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang hurriedly said, “Mr. Autumn went to Cold Mountain City to deal with the few star pirates entrenched there. We have already gathered them together.","“Mr. Autumn has only left for half a day, so it should take another half a day for him to return. We’ve already informed Mr. Autumn of your arrival. I believe Mr. Autumn will be able to return faster!”","On regular days, Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang typically addressed Autumn as Lord. However, in the presence of Lin Yuan, only Lin Yuan received this title. This rule was set by Autumn.","Upon hearing this, Winter nodded. Cold Mountain City, situated adjacent to Treasure City, loomed large. Although not a trading hub like Treasure City, Cold Mountain City surpassed it in size and overall strength. However, the star pirates in Cold Mountain City were significantly fewer than in Treasure City.","With Autumn venturing to Cold Mountain City to pursue star pirates, it was likely that nearby pirate groups had been largely eradicated. Even if some pirates remained, they would exercise greater caution. Given this scenario, the hunting team would find it challenging to yield substantial results in this area.","Lin Yuan introduced Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang to Chu Ci, “Chu Ci, this is the leader of the hunting team, Fu Mi. This is the vice leader of the hunting team, Yun Qingyang. They can be considered members of Sky City now!”","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang were very respectful to Chu Ci on the surface, but in reality, they did not care much. They did not dare to use their spiritual energy to probe Chu Ci. Firstly, it was extremely impolite to use spiritual energy to investigate right away. Hence, the two of them did not know that Chu Ci was younger than Lin Yuan.","Chu Ci politely greeted Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang, and Lin Yuan introduced Chu Ci to them, “This is my sister, Chu Ci.”","Lin Yuan’s words immediately sent shivers down Yun Qingyang and Fu Mi’s spines, and they quickly suppressed any disdain they held for Chu Ci.","Chu Ci didn’t resemble Lin Yuan much. Rather, one resembled their father while the other resembled their mother. However, the word ‘sister’ was not used as casually in the Sky Beyond the Clouds as in the main world. Only those who were truly related by blood would address each other as siblings. Chu Ci was obviously from the same huge and mysterious faction as Lin Yuan.","Chu Ci was very polite to Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang, which made them feel flattered and flustered.","After introducing Chu Ci, Lin Yuan asked “How have you guys been in the past few months?”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s question, Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang looked a little awkward. “Lord, to be honest, we have only captured six large star pirate groups recently, but we have captured many small star pirate groups. However, the strength of these small star pirate groups is too low. Mr. Autumn has already dealt with them.”","In fact, there was a limit to the number of powerful star pirates in a region. If there were too many star pirates in a region, there would definitely be intense competition between the star pirates.","At present, the star pirates in this area had basically been hunted down. Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang were afraid that Lin Yuan would be dissatisfied with their achievements. If Lin Yuan blamed them, it would be inappropriate for them to explain themselves to him. There was no way Autumn could cover up such a matter.","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang were extremely nervous. They had just gotten the chance to prove themselves in front of Lin Yuan, but unfortunately, they hadn’t seized the opportunity.","Lin Yuan was not as angry as they had expected. Instead, he said, “I don’t think there are many star pirates around Treasure City anymore. If you continue to hunt here, you will only get fewer and fewer star pirates. Why don’t I find another place for you so you can hunt star pirates in a different environment?”","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang felt relieved. Lin Yuan’s words indicated not only his decisiveness in killing but also his reasonableness as a leader. Unlike others who might unfairly blame their subordinates without considering the circumstances, Lin Yuan stood out. This quality was more valuable than any resources he had provided.","In the hands of a leader prone to anger and outbursts, one’s safety became paramount. There was a real risk of being punished, or even killed, for any perceived failure. As the saying went, “Accompanying a ruler is akin to walking alongside a tiger.”","“Lord, we don’t know where you intend for us to hunt star pirates. If you inform us in advance, it will be easier for us to prepare!”","Yun Qingyang, standing beside Fu Mi, uttered these words. He believed that even if he didn’t seek attention, he should aim for an opportunity to communicate with Lin Yuan.","If he couldn’t speak directly to Lin Yuan and allowed Fu Mi to be the spokesperson, competing for the vice leader position would be pointless.","Upon hearing Yun Qingyang’s question, Lin Yuan asked, “Don’t you think that with Autumn by your side, you won’t have a chance to attack when hunting other star pirates? You just need to set up and operate. Autumn possesses ample strength to resolve nearly all challenges.","“Thus, I am inclined to send you to a place like the Scarlet Territory, which is considerably more perilous. The star pirates entrenched there are both stronger and more numerous, ensuring greater spoils. Conveniently, I am acquainted with a Bloodian Queen in that region.","“With this Bloodian Queen’s aid, your operations there will undoubtedly be facilitated. Essentially, every Bloodian clan in the area embeds its agents among the star pirates. You can leverage the star pirates loyal to the Bloodian Queen to subdue the surrounding factions.”"]},{"number":3024,"title":"Chapter 3024 Easily Allocated Grade 5 Creator Resources!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3024 Easily Allocated Grade 5 Creator Resources!","Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to pointing out the direction for Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang, which shocked them greatly.","....","The Bloodians, an ancient and domineering species, held a very high position in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Many species were very cautious of their existence.","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang were surprised to learn that Lin Yuan had even infiltrated a faction like the Bloodians and that there was a Bloodian Queen under his command.","The hunting team was the gathering of many star pirate groups, all of which operated in the vicinity of Treasure City, and their range of activity typically would not exceed the ten large cities nearby.","For example, Fu Mi’s star pirate group had targeted Jin Chen on the spur of the moment previously.","If they rashly changed their operating environment, Fu Mi, Yun Qingyang, and others would essentially lose their accumulated experience. In a new environment, everything had to start over.","A foreign star pirate group like theirs could hardly gain the local star pirate groups’ trust. If they could use the resources of the local star pirates, their operation would be much easier.","With Autumn’s martial force as support, they would be able to obtain benefits very quickly.","After each operation, Autumn would take out a portion of the captured resources and distribute them to the hunting team, making it easier for them to increase their strength.","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang were used to living a life of bloodshed and were very willing to accept challenges in new environments.","“Lord, if you can cooperate with a Bloodian Queen in the Scarlet Territory, we will soon be able to open up new opportunities. However, after some time in the Scarlet Territory, the number of star pirate groups there is bound to decrease. When the time comes, we will need to move to a new environment to hunt those star pirates.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan pressed his lips together, his mind haunted by the atrocities committed by star pirate groups, a scene he had witnessed more than once.","Every time Lin Yuan ventured out, he bore witness to the star pirates’ ruthless slaughter of various species. They were like locusts crossing the border, sparing few survivors in their raids on species and merchant groups.","The root cause of their existence lay in the scarcity of resources. Many who fancied themselves formidable eventually turned to piracy to amass wealth, resorting to plunder and bloodshed to swiftly increase their power.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds remained unchanged. Despite the eradication of this current batch of star pirate groups, fresh ones would inevitably emerge. Complete eradication of these pirates proved an elusive goal. Without the constraints imposed by the hunting team, star pirates near Treasure City would undoubtedly resume their havoc in a few short decades.","“You don’t have to worry about that. I don’t plan to let you stay in the Scarlet Territory for long. When the density of the star pirates there decreases, I’ll have you move elsewhere.","“In the future, the development area of the hunting team will not be limited to the East Universe. I can guarantee that if you can move to other universes in the future, you can quickly integrate into the local environment.”","Lin Yuan’s words seemed ordinary but struck a chord.","When Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang heard them, they understood that Lin Yuan’s faction was not limited to the East Universe. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have made such a promise.","Standing beside Lin Yuan and listening to his conversation with Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang, Chu Ci didn’t find Lin Yuan’s attitude toward the star pirate groups cruel. Instead, she felt exceptionally supportive from the bottom of her heart.","Along the way, Chu Ci witnessed two star pirate groups committing evil deeds. These star pirate groups were not very strong and were considered inferior existences. Their leader had just reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. However, when these star pirate groups robbed those small tribes and merchant groups, they were no less ruthless than those large star pirate groups.","After a long period of killing and plundering, the minds of these star pirates had become somewhat psychologically warped. They were exactly the same as the bandit groups that Chu Ci had encountered when she was training in the main world.","Chu Ci hated evil, to begin with. If Lin Yuan had not gotten rid of these star pirates, she would most likely have made relevant suggestions to him.","In a short while, Autumn returned. When Autumn knew that Lin Yuan had arrived, he quickened his pace. Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Autumn bowed to him and promptly handed over the star pirates he had detained. “Young Master, I placed the members of the star pirates who had reached the Holy Spirit level in these three leaves. I have sealed the energies in their bodies and they are currently in a dormant state. You can clean them up at any time. As for those star pirates who aren’t even at the Holy Spirit level, I’ve sealed them up after killing them so that you can use them at any time.","“Your two fairies need the bodies of experts to increase their strength as they contain extremely pure and abundant flesh and blood energy. Therefore, they’re exactly what your two fairies need.”","Lin Yuan nodded. In the beginning, Lin Yuan’s purpose in massacring the star pirates was to get rid of evil and save the fate of those weak lives. Apart from that, it was to provide resources for the awakened Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would produce high-quality resources by absorbing the will laws, spirit fire, divine kingdoms, and even holy spirits of these experts. However, as more and more star pirates were killed, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could no longer absorb the number of star pirates in Lin Yuan’s hands quickly enough.","Under such circumstances, it was certainly an excellent choice to let Red Thorn and Silver Corona devour the bodies of these World Emperor/Divine Kingdom experts, increasing their strength in an extremely short period. It would also be quite helpful for their bloodline transformation.","Lin Yuan informed Autumn of his plan to move the hunting team to the Scarlet Territory and asked him to take the initiative to contact Qin Yu upon his arrival at Scarlet Territory.","Lin Yuan rushed to Yi He’s location after making the arrangements. If Lin Yuan could recruit more Creators to join Sky City, he would not have to worry about recruiting Creators for a long time to come.","Before journeying to Yi He’s region, Lin Yuan reached out to Qin Yu and disclosed his decision to dispatch a hunting team to the Scarlet Territory. Qin Yu was Lin Yuan’s subordinate, so he had no reason to withhold any information from her.","Previously, Qin Yu hadn’t held much animosity toward the star pirates. Despite their rampant activities in the Scarlet Territory, they had never dared to encroach upon the Elisa clan. Qin Yu had even arranged for some branch members of the Elisa clan to establish a star pirate group, recognizing the potential benefits they could bring to their species.","However, since her bloodline advancement, these star pirates had begun targeting the Elisa clan, sparking deep disgust within Qin Yu.","While Qin Yu understood that the star pirates’ audacity stemmed from Lin Yuan’s influence, her loyalty and respect toward him differed greatly from her disdain toward the pirates.","Learning of Lin Yuan’s intent to eradicate them, Qin Yu offered her full support.","Qin Yu had long entertained the notion of eradicating the star pirates. However, after careful deliberation, she refrained from action for several reasons.","Firstly, such a move would disrupt the Scarlet Territory’s ecology. Despite her status as a Bloodian Queen, there would be no tangible benefits. Moreover, rival Bloodian clans, led by their respective queens, coveted the Elisa clan’s position.","Secondly, Qin Yu feared that eliminating the star pirates would be misconstrued by Lin Yuan as an act of retribution for past grievances. The potential fallout outweighed any potential gains.","“Young Master, I’ll make arrangements preemptively. We’ll act swiftly upon your men’s arrival in the Scarlet Territory, well ahead of the Creator Conference.","“The Honor Absent Palace’s focus has shifted to the upcoming Creator Conference. Consequently, many members have forgone regular meetings.","“I’ve successfully enhanced Fan Lou’s bloodline, propelling his strength to the pinnacle of the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom level. Given his robust lineage, transitioning to the Holy Spirit level shouldn’t pose significant challenges.","“After the Creator Conference, I’ll propose Fan Lou as a member of the Honor Absent Parliament. The groundwork has been laid, and I’m confident in his acceptance. However, once he assumes this role, my influence will wane.","“The members of the Honor Absent Parliament maintain a delicate balance of power. I won’t pressure Fan Lou to align with our interests. His autonomy within the parliament is crucial for our plans to bear fruit.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan recognized Qin Yu’s dedication to advancing Fan Lou’s prospects, a task he had entrusted to her. Fan Lou’s networking prowess made him a valuable asset, and Qin Yu’s strategy aimed to maximize his potential within the parliament without coercion. Her insights into Fan Lou’s capabilities underscored her commitment to the task.","“I only provided some resources for Fan Lou. Speaking of painstaking arrangements for Fan Lou, you spent more effort. I think Fan Lou will definitely owe you a favor. You did well in this matter.","“This time, my people will bring you a batch of Creator resources. Apart from the spirit qi crystals I gave you previously, there are also more than ten bottles of potions to improve the bloodline of a Bloodian Queen. There are a few bottles of potions that can also increase your comprehension of blood-type laws.”","Lin Yuan had accumulated the spirit qi crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and Zhong Zhiyu had given Lin Yuan the 10 bottles of potions that could enhance a Bloodian Queen’s bloodline. Only Grade 5 Creators could concoct this potion.","Zhong Zhiyu joined Sky City and gave Lin Yuan all the potions he had previously stored. If he had not given Lin Yuan these potions, Lin Yuan would not have had any other channels to obtain and give them to Qin Yu.","It hadn’t been long since Lin Yuan had provided Qin Yu with resources. In the long lifespan of the Bloodians, one or two years were merely a blink of an eye. In order to increase her bloodline, Qin Yu would have to enter seclusion for at least 1,000 years. However, in the blink of an eye, Lin Yuan had already provided her with resources twice.","Moreover, the resources were getting more and more high-end. The potion specifically tailored for the queen’s bloodline was definitely the work of a Grade 5 Creator. Qin Yu was extremely touched that Lin Yuan was willing to use his Grade 5 Creator resources to concoct potions for her.","Qin Yu didn’t think that these potions were previously stored in the warehouse. Resources from a Grade 5 Creator were exceedingly rare, making it impractical for one to craft potions without intending to use them.","Zhong Zhiyu had amassed numerous potions tailored for Bloodian Queens due to his intimate relationship with one. They had been lovers for millennia, and Zhong Zhiyu had willingly expended energy on his beloved.","Tragically, his partner’s luck ran thin, leading to her demise during a ruin exploration. Consequently, the potions remained sealed. Zhong Zhiyu preferred exchanging the finished potions for needed resources rather than hoarding them.","Qin Yu felt touched, yet her conviction grew stronger that Lin Yuan’s subordinates possessed ample high-grade Creator resources, even capable of easily allocating Grade 5 resources.","In the past, due to the resources Lin Yuan provided, those who were recruited under his command would guess about his strength and abilities. Such conjectures often led to speculation.","However, Qin Yu found no need for much speculation this time. With two Grade 5 Creators under Lin Yuan’s command, his abundant Grade 5 Creator resources were undeniable. Lin Yuan might even recruit more Grade 5 Creators during this trip.","“Young Master, your gift is appreciated. These resources will facilitate strengthening my influence in the Scarlet Territory. Presently, Bloodian clans with queens in the territory covet the Elisa clan. With increased strength, I can deter these clans from targeting us.","“Our Elisa clan has already enlisted four powerful Bloodian clans with king bloodlines. Oh, and Young Master, the Andra clan has been obliterated.”","Lin Yuan harbored little interest in the Elisa clan’s progress in the Scarlet Territory.","Qin Yu had ascended as the Bloodian Queen. Even if other clans coveted the Elisa clan, they would hesitate to provoke direct conflict.","As for the Andra clan, Lin Yuan lacked the capacity to invest in such an insignificant faction.","“Qin Yu, oversee the Scarlet Territory’s development. If you face challenges, inform me directly for assistance. For other matters, consult with Fan Lou more. His insights may spark new ideas for you!”"]},{"number":3025,"title":"Chapter 3025 The Land of Bloodian Ancestors!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3025 The Land of Bloodian Ancestors!","When Qin Yu heard Lin Yuan’s words, the smile on her face could no longer be concealed. Lin Yuan clearly showed that he did not care about her plans for the Scarlet Territory, allowing Qin Yu to do whatever she wanted in it. Moreover, Lin Yuan would back her up, which made Qin Yu even bolder.","As for going to negotiate with Fan Lou and having Qin Yu help him, Qin Yu was willing. However, Qin Yu wouldn’t go to negotiate with Fan Lou on matters related to the management of the Scarlet Territory.","Fan Lou had now become a pureblood Bloodian, but Qin Yu did not intend to let Fan Lou focus on the Scarlet Territory. Both Qin Yu and Fan Lou had already reached a consensus on this. Ruling the entire Scarlet Territory was Qin Yu’s dream. In the past, Qin Yu could not see any hope of realizing it, but now, she could see hope. All she needed to do next was to continue working on it.","Suddenly, Qin Yu thought of something. While she considered it a core secret of the Bloodian clans, she believed these matters were far-reaching, and it was necessary to inform Lin Yuan. If she told Lin Yuan, he might be able to help her in this matter.","“Young Master, have you heard of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors? The Land of Bloodian Ancestors has already appeared. Every Bloodian whose bloodline has reached the level of a queen has received a revelation.","“I wonder if Young Master is interested in it? Every Bloodians with a queen-level bloodline can bring four units in. Young Master, if you’re interested, I can bring you in.","“There are many treasures buried in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Even experts who have surpassed the Holy Spirit level and reached the Domain Mountain/Spirit Territory will be tempted and go crazy because of it.”","When Lin Yuan was a guest in the Andra clan, he had flipped through many books in the Andra clan’s territory and gained a certain understanding of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","It was the birthplace of the Bloodians countless eras ago. In the beginning, all the Bloodian clans lived in the Land of the Blood Ancestors.","The Land of the Bloodian Ancestors had witnessed the glory of the Bloodians for billions of years.","At their peak, the Bloodians had once ranked in the top ten of the Species Ranking, even higher than the Snow-Covered Foxes, which was currently ranked ninth.","The Bloodians had a very long history. Even after experiencing great calamities, it was difficult for these bloodlines to be completely wiped out.","The ancient books of the Andra clan did not specify the calamity that the Bloodians had encountered. They only mentioned that the Land of Bloodian Ancestors had been banished into the void by a terrifying force. It was only possible for them to form a connection with the Sky Beyond the Clouds once every tens of thousands of years.","The banishment of The Land of Bloodian Ancestors back then was completely an accident. No Bloodians had expected this. It could be said that the Bloodians had left all their wealth in The Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","How could Lin Yuan not be interested in such a place?","When Lin Yuan saw Qin Yu’s message, he did not reply immediately. Instead, he addressed Winter, who was standing beside him.","“Winter, have you heard about the situation in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors?”","Upon hearing that, Winter looked surprised. Then, a pleasantly surprised expression appeared on his face.","Winter had already guessed that Lin Yuan’s sudden question about the Land of Bloodian Ancestors must have been prompted by something Qin Yu said. It was very likely that she had sensed the location of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Even Winter was extremely interested in the resources stored in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. With some resources, it was possible for Winter to improve.","“Young Master, I’ve naturally heard of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. If there is an opportunity for you to enter, it will definitely be a great fortune. There are many restrictions in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. If you want to explore it, I suggest that you bring another person in. Otherwise, if one person is trapped by the restrictions, there’s no way to guarantee your safety.”","Winter’s words were very clear. He was encouraging Lin Yuan to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. However, The Land of Bloodian Ancestors was definitely rife with danger. Otherwise, Winter wouldn’t have suggested choosing one among Spring, Summer and Autumn to enter together.","Lin Yuan had arranged for Autumn to clean up the star pirates while Spring guarded North of the Lonely River. Summer was in charge of planting Thriving Summer Rising Clouds in North of the Lonely River, so Lin Yuan could only choose between Spring and Autumn. After thinking about it, Lin Yuan felt that Autumn was the most suitable choice.","The hunting team had hunted enough star pirates recently, and Lin Yuan could not consume them all in a short period. Lin Yuan could temporarily suspend the hunting team’s work. Compared to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, the job of the hunting team was nothing.","“Winter, since you’ve said so, when the Land of Bloodian Ancestors is opened, I’ll use my relationship with Qin Yu to bring you and Autumn there.”","After Lin Yuan and Winter finished discussing, Lin Yuan replied to Qin Yu, “I’m very interested in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Apart from me, I’ll also bring three people in. You’re our guide to the Land of Blood Ancestor. I’ll give you a portion of the benefits I obtain there and ensure your safety.”","Lin Yuan immediately asked for the seats without a hint of embarrassment. This was because Lin Yuan was the ruler of the Elisa clan. Back then, Lin Yuan had spent many resources to save Qin Yu and pull her out of death. He had even made her a genuine Bloodian Queen.","It was true that Lin Yuan had his own agenda. Apart from bringing Autumn and Winter along, Lin Yuan was also prepared to bring Chu Ci along.","The Land of Bloodian Ancestors was undoubtedly an excellent training ground for Chu Ci, and she would benefit greatly from it. After Chu Ci ended her seclusion, Lin Yuan would definitely give her all the good things he had.","Qin Yu didn’t mind Lin Yuan asking for all the slots because she didn’t have any suitable candidates. For example, the two Bloodian kings, Lhalu and Fan Qia, could make an impact in the Scarlet Territory, but they would merely be cannon fodder in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Qin Yu was originally worried about her safety, but now that Lin Yuan said he could guarantee her safety, she was completely relieved. Qin Yu had seen how powerful Lin Yuan’s guards were. With such a person by her side to protect her and Lin Yuan, she only needed to be a good guide.","“Young Master, there’s no problem. In that case, I don’t have to arrange for people. At present, I am not sure when is the best time to enter the Land of Blood Ancestor. The thinner the barrier, the longer we can stay inside. However, it will definitely not be opened in the next half a month.","“Still, I hope that you can wait in the Scarlet Territory in advance, just in case the opportunity to enter the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors arises.”","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s reminder, Lin Yuan thought that half a month was enough for him to participate in the academic conference.","With Winter’s guidance, it wouldn’t take much time to travel from there to the Scarlet Territory at full speed.","Lin Yuan ended his communication with Qin Yu and said, “Chu Ci, I’ll bring you to meet some Creators later. After meeting them, we can explore a mystic realm together. You might be able to find a suitable fey in this secret place!”","Up until now, Chu Ci had only contracted four feys, and her spiritual power had been much stronger thYi Her peers since she was young.","Now that Chu Ci had become a proper Divine Kingdom expert, she could already contract a few more feys. This exploration could allow Chu Ci to choose her own feys, and Lin Yuan’s plan to turn his sister into an iron bucket could be restarted.","Chu Ci was filled with anticipation for Lin Yuan’s itinerary. She was very interested in both high-grade Creators and exploring the secret places.","“Brother, will I be able to follow you almost every time you go out to train in the future?!”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “As long as it’s not an emergency, you can naturally follow me. You’ll only understand the Sky Beyond the Clouds better if you see more of them!”","Upon hearing his words, Chu Ci pursed her lips. She felt that Lin Yuan was treating her like a child.","Chu Ci said seriously, “Actually, it’s not that difficult to understand the Sky Beyond the Clouds. To put it bluntly, the Sky Beyond the Clouds is a world where everything is based on martial force. The stronger the individual or faction, the more authority they have. Only those factions with comparable strength and experts can have power against another.","“I think such a world is much more comfortable than a world with so many rules. As long as we strive to become stronger to conquer this world, that’s all that matters. I’ve seen so many conflicts along the way, but I’ve never seen anyone trying to be reasonable.”","Upon hearing her words, Lin Yuan looked at Chu Ci in surprise. He had thought that Chu Ci had just come into contact with this world and that it would take some time for her to integrate with it. He did not expect Chu Ci to have such a thorough understanding of this world.","That’s right. The best survival laws in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were to continuously become stronger and conquer this world. Those lifeforms who were truly capable were all doing so. Only people like Fan Lou, who had limited potential, no background, and no resources, would work so hard.","“Chu Ci, work hard to conquer this world like you said!”","Lin Yuan’s words were very serious, and he did not seem to be joking at all. Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Chu Ci was more like that of a father figure than a brother. Lin Yuan had been doing his best to nurture her. He hoped that Chu Ci could grow to the point where she could conquer the world. During this process, Lin Yuan would always be Chu Ci’s backing and give her strength.","Chu Ci said in all seriousness, “Brother, I’ll work hard!”","Chu Ci only said the first half of her words to Lin Yuan, but she did not say the second half. ‘Brother, one day, I also hope to stand in front of you and become an umbrella to shelter you from the wind and rain, instead of having you stand in front of me every time to protect me.’","Upon seeing the interaction between Lin Yuan and Chu Ci, Winter felt a sense of warmth. In this life, the Lord Saint had more restraints. He was no longer as lonely as the drifting clouds in the mountains in his previous life.","With an existence like the Lifespan Mouse that broke the rules of time and lifespan, no matter how high stood in this life, there would always be these shackles accompanying him. It’s truly wonderful!","...","Along the way, Lin Yuan brought Chu Ci around to admire the scenery and took in many special feys. Lin Yuan would hand these feys over to the Hundred Questions Beast army to be nurtured as resources to expand their foundation. When the white-clothed followers’ Combat Sequence and Preparatory Sequence members grew up and needed to contract new feys, they could choose from among them.","Every time she saw a small star pirate group plundering and killing those weak tribes and species, Chu Ci would stop them and start a fight with them.","Winter stood guard on the side to ensure that even if Chu Ci was no match for the star pirates, she would not be injured. Such a battle was the most effective way to increase one’s strength. The murderous aura emitted by the star pirates during the battle was the best training for Chu Ci’s combat skills.","...","When Lin Yuan saw Yi He again, he noticed that Yi He was wearing a set of clothes that were far more gorgeous than Zhong Zhiyu’s when he first met him. Zhong Zhiyu’s dressing style exuded a sense of luxury with a touch of simplicity, while Yi He’s style involved skillful weaving techniques to layer materials in a fluid manner.","Lin Yuan was surprised by the change in Yi He’s dressing style.","Yi He explained to Lin Yuan with a smile, “This is actually my original style of dressing. Previously, when my lifespan was about to end, I had no intention of spending any effort on dressing up. Now that everything has been resolved thanks to you, Young Master, I’m naturally alive. I believe dressing more extravagantly to meet you, Young Master, is a sign of respect toward you.”","Yi He was satisfied with his dressing style. He felt that only such a dressing style was worthy of his Grade 5 Creator status.","“I’m very honored to be able to make Senior Yi He feel like you’re alive again. When you return to Sky City with me, I will introduce you to an outstanding Weaver. She is also a core member of Sky City and is in charge of managing the core affairs of Sky City. Every piece of clothing he designed is extremely charming. I think Senior Yi He will definitely like it!”","Lin Yuan was referring to Wen Yu in his conversation. His motive wasn’t to merely facilitate a connection between Wen Yu and Yi He but rather stemmed from his genuine admiration for Wen Yu’s skill as a Weaver.","While Lin Yuan traded resources at Fortune Treasure Palace, he observed many renowned Weavers utilizing premium materials for their designs. However, Lin Yuan found most of their creations to pale in comparison to Wen Yu’s craftsmanship.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s praise, Yi He chuckled, remarking, “Young Master, I must acquaint myself with such talent!”","Yi He’s interest wasn’t solely in Wen Yu’s weaving prowess. Rather, it was sparked by Lin Yuan’s mention of Wen Yu’s forthcoming management of Sky City’s core operations. Recognizing Wen Yu’s pivotal role among Sky City’s key figures, Yi He saw the potential benefits of establishing a connection for his future endeavors within the city.","Though uncertain if Zhong Zhiyu viewed him as competition, Yi He already considered Zhong Zhiyu a rival."]},{"number":3026,"title":"Chapter 3026: Species Ranking Target!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3026: Species Ranking Target!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan had maintained communication with Yi He all along. Usually, Yi He would ask Lin Yuan about Sky City through the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","Lin Yuan was willing to tell a Grade 5 Creator like Yi He about the situation.","Yi He would ask Lin Yuan about Zhong Zhiyu. Every time he talked about","Zhong Zhiyu, Lin Yuan could sense Yi He’s indistinct hostility toward him.","Lin Yuan knew that Yi He treated Zhong Zhiyu as his potential opponent as his Creation Master abilities were stronger than Yi He’s. It wasn’t a bad thing for Yi He to regard Zhong Zhiyu as a competitor because it would help the latter improve his abilities.","Lin Yuan trusted Zhong Zhiyu enough, but he was unwilling to let Zhong Zhiyu become the sole decision maker in the entire Creator team. There might not be any problems in the short term, but in the long term, Zhong Zhiyu’s authority in the Creation Master team would not be able to be controlled. If Zhong Zhiyu made any mistakes in his decision, it would have a serious impact on Sky City.","Yi He’s hostility toward Zhong Zhiyu would not only encourage himself to grow, but also allow Zhong Zhiyu to grow.","“Senior Yi He, I’m going to the Scarlet Territory in the next few days. The academic exchange should be completed in five days, right?”","Yi He hurriedly said, “Apart from a Grade 5 Creator, Young Master, everyone else is here. The meeting can be held once this Grade 5 Creator arrives. This Grade 5 Creator is called Si Xue. She’s a female Creator. We’re old acquaintances. She is late because she went to capture an extremely special fey. She contacted me yesterday and said that she would arrive this afternoon.","“Calculating the time, it should be within an hour or two. Every time the academic exchange is convened, discussions on the topics often span several years. However, three to five days are enough for you to achieve your goal, Young Master.”","Upon hearing his words, Lin Yuan asked, “Senior Yi He, you will be the one to lead this academic exchange. Will it affect you if I do this?”","Yi He hurriedly waved his hand when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. “Young Master, the impact, of course, will be there. However, as long as we strive to ensure that they all submit to Sky City, the impact will be minimal. At first, I didn’t think it was a good idea to attack these Creators, but now, I don’t think it’s necessary to only recruit Creators with limited lifespans under Sky City. Other Creators can also be encouraged to join Sky City. Otherwise, if we miss out on this opportunity, it will be difficult to bring together so many Creators again!”","After saying that, Yi He said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, the reason why so many people are here, including Si Xue, is because I said that I want to share my method to increase my lifespan.”","Yi He had not told Lin Yuan about this before, so now he was revealing them to him to give him a pleasant surprise. Yi He was showing his value to Lin Yuan before returning to Sky City. With more Creators joining Sky City because of him, it would be more convenient for him to compete with Zhong Zhiyu.","Upon hearing Yi He’s words, Lin Yuan was a little moved. Yi He had tried his best to gather the Creators together. Furthermore, Yi He had used his own lifespan restoration as bait. It was indeed difficult to recreate such an opportunity once it had been missed.","After pondering for a moment, Lin Yuan asked, “Senior Yi He, how many Creators did you send to participate in the academic exchange this time? Apart from Si Xue, you said that everyone else has arrived. I think you must have done some statistics.”","Yi He lowered his voice. “Originally, there weren’t many people, but ever since I put out the announcement about increasing lifespan, not only those in the East Universe, but the Creators I know in other universes also chose to go to the East Universe.","“There are 32 Grade 4 Creators. Including Si Xue, there are 5 Grade 5 Creators. Four of them are low Grade 5 Creators like me, but Si Xue has reached pinnacle intermediate Grade 5 and is only a step away from high Grade 5.","“Young Master, if Si Xue can join Sky City, I hope you can let her be a vice leader like me and join the Creator team of Sky City.”","Lin Yuan was rather surprised. Yi He really had a lot of tricks up his sleeve. He had actually caused such a huge commotion. Six Grade 5 Creators including Yi He and 32 Grade 4 Creators were an unimaginable force even for Lin Yuan and it was indeed a little difficult to recruit these Creators. However, where there was a will, there was a way. Lin Yuan would certainly make an effort.","Apart from Winter, Lin Yuan felt that he had to bring Autumn along. With Autumn and Winter, it would be easier for them to hold their ground.","“It’s remarkable how you have created such a huge scene. All these people have come for the method to restore lifespan. It might be somewhat challenging to handle if you don’t reveal this method. When the time comes, I’ll assess the situation and decide how to proceed. You just stick to the original plan and host the meeting as planned. You mentioned Si Xue just now. I believe you must have a good relationship with a Grade 5 Creator like Si Xue.”","Upon hearing his words, Yi He chuckled. “Young Master, she and I have been friends from a young age. At this moment, she doesn’t have much lifespan left. I’ve already sent her an invitation. She’s willing to join Sky City. If there’s an emergency that arises, Si Xue and I can help out!”","Lin Yuan looked at Yi He’s expression and roughly understood the relationship between Si Xue and Yi He. Even if they weren’t lovers, they must have been close friends for many years.","Since Si Xue had decided to join Sky City, Lin Yuan did not have to invite her again. “Senior Yi He, I will remember your kindness in bringing a Grade 5","Creator to Sky City. Since Senior Si Xue will arrive in an hour or two, why don’t I go with you to welcome her? Coincidentally, I’ll send another person over.”","Lin Yuan took out the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower and sent a message to Autumn.","Autumn gave Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang some instructions, indicating that the two of them should lead the hunting team to the Scarlet Territory first.","Autumn came to Lin Yuan excitedly. Compared to leading the hunting team, Autumn was more willing to follow Lin Yuan.","Zhong Zhiyu had only met with Winter before but not Autumn. He couldn’t see through Autumn’s aura, just as he couldn’t see through Winter’s aura. The tall and handsome man was most likely an expert whose strength far exceeded his own like Winter. It was already extremely rare to have one such expert, but Lin Yuan had two such experts by his side.","When Zhong Zhiyu was communicating with Lin Yuan, he had already noticed","Chu Ci, who was standing beside him. Chu Ci’s lifespan was comparable to Lin","Yuan’s. In just a few decades, she had advanced her strength to the Divine Kingdom level. Yi He was a little curious about what kind of faction could nurture so many young prodigies.","As he looked at Chu Ci, Lin Yuan noticed the surprise in Yi He’s eyes.","Humans, like those feys, were intelligent species. However, their body compositions were much weaker than those beast tamers. However, the probability of a spirit contractor appearing among humans was extremely high, far higher than other beast tamers.","In addition, it was very easy for humans to increase their strength through the resources as if there was no upper limit. To a certain extent, humans had very great potential and it was not something other species could compare to. If there was a chance in the future, Lin Yuan could even bring humans to break through to the Species Ranking.","It was said that every time the Species Ranking changed, the species ranked at the top would obtain immense benefits. In particular, the leaders of the species could benefit by the providence of the Species Ranking. At the same time, they could choose resources of different levels according to their ranking in the Species Tower.","Lin Yuan had learned about the Species Ranking’s topics from fragments of ancient books. However, Lin Yuan wasn’t too sure about the Species Ranking’s rotation, and he had no intention of inquiring about it at the moment. If Lin Yuan wanted to lead the humans to break through to the Species Ranking, it would not be an easy task and would require long-term accumulation to achieve.","Yi He brought Lin Yuan to the top of Green Rock Mountain and waited. Autumn and Winter stood behind Lin Yuan, while Chu Ci stood beside him and surveyed the scenery around Green Rock Mountain.","While viewing the scenery, Chu Ci could not help but exclaim. The environment on Green Rock Mountain was simply too beautiful. It was even better than the environment in Chu Ci’s dream.","Upon hearing Chu Ci’s exclamation,Yi He smiled. “Miss, the environment here is not bad, right? I’ve occupied Green Rock Mountain for tens of thousands of years. When I first came here, this could only be considered decent. I brought my servants to modify this place. Now, the environment here is already comparable to an ordinary blessed land.","“Furthermore, I have raised many cute little fellows on this mountain. Miss, if you like such an environment, I can help you create such an environment when I reach Sky City!”","After learning that Chu Ci was Lin Yuan’s younger sister, Yi He observed Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Chu Ci and was very respectful to her. He directly addressed her as Miss.","Apart from Chu Ci’s identity, the reason why Yi He called her that was also because of her likable personality. Chu Ci had manners similar to Lin Yuan.","Under normal circumstances, the younger generation nurtured by more powerful species tended to be more arrogant. However, the faction behind Lin Yuan and Chu Ci not only put importance on strength but also their character, which was truly remarkable and rare.","“For me, Grandpa Yi, just appreciating the scenery is enough. Besides, the environment in Sky City is already good enough, so there’s no need for you to trouble yourself for me.”","Just as Chu Ci and Yi He were conversing, a few soft sounds were heard. Lin Yuan saw that the sky outside suddenly lit up with multicolored hues. Nine agile birds with a dozen colors on their bodies soared by, and each of them had a long zither-like tail. Every time the end of the zither swayed during the flight, it would play a pleasant tune. The nine gorgeous birds with zither-like tails were riding on a fey carriage that was embedded with a large number of blue gems.","Lin Yuan recognized the blue gems on the fey carriage. They were the Eternal Life Crystal Jade and the Grand Sea Tourmaline.","These two things were hard to find outside. The Eternal Life Crystal Jade could keep a seriously injured person alive. It was an item that could prolong one’s life and was equally effective for Holy Spirit experts.","The Grand Sea Tourmaline was a holy object for water-type cultivators. It had the effect of absorbing the surrounding water-elemental energy and purifying the surrounding water-elemental energy. It was a waste to embed these two precious items in the fey carriage as decorations.","However, this was just enough to show the handiwork of a top Creator. It was likely that the Creator Si Xue, who was at the pinnacle of Grade 5, was sitting in this fey carriage. When they got close, the door of the fey carriage opened from the inside, and a pretty woman with long snow-white hair walked out.","Although this woman’s attire wasn’t as exaggerated as Yi He’s, the magnificence of her attire was the same as Yi He’s.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he roughly understood how these Creators and the others dealt with things in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Creators tended to conduct themselves in a highly conspicuous manner. They did it not only to show their strength and status, but also to intimidate others. This behavior had nothing to do with their personality, but was influenced by the environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Lin Yuan thought to himself that it seemed necessary for him to conduct himself in a more high-profile manner in the future.","Previously, Yi He had engaged in a very serious and detailed conversation with Si Xue. Upon seeing Lin Yuan, she did not put on any airs and instead bowed deeply to him.","“Mr. Lin, I’ve heard a lot about you. We’re finally fated to meet today. I’m old friends with Yi He. I accepted Yi He’s invitation to join Sky City. I wonder if Mr. Lin is willing to accept me?”","Since she had decided to join Sky City, Si Xue no longer put on airs in front of Lin Yuan. Given her relationship with Yi He, it was highly unlikely that his earnest invitation to join Sky City would be misguided.","Yi He’s mouth was very tight. No matter how she asked Yi He about the solution to her lifespan, Yi He remained silent. He only told Si Xue that as long as she joined Sky City, she would not have to worry about her lifespan in the future. Yi He’s respect for Lin Yuan made Si Xue certain that Lin Yuan had a powerful background. Otherwise, given Yi He’s personality, why would he show such an attitude?!","When Lin Yuan heard Si Xue’s words, he quickly expressed his goodwill and sincerity, “Senior Si Xue, it is Sky City’s great fortune that you are willing to join us. I heard from Senior Yi He that you’re also busy with your lifespan problem. Now that you’ve joined Sky City, the issue of your lifespan will no longer trouble you. I’ll help you resolve it after this exchange.. No matter what decision I make at the exchange, I hope Senior Si Xue can cooperate with me!”"]},{"number":3027,"title":"Chapter 3027 You Have No Right to Speak!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3027 You Have No Right to Speak!","Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to giving Si Xue the assurance that she needed and also verifying Yi He’s promise to her. Even though Si Xue wasn’t as anxious as Yi He back then, she was already starting to worry about her lifespan. As long as Lin Yuan could solve the problem of her lifespan, Si Xue was willing to help him with other matters.","....","Si Xue was not like Yi He, who would still restrict herself to various rules even though she had become a Grade 5 Creator. She had always been unrestrained, to the point that she could even be described as crazy.","“Of course, I will definitely cooperate with you!”","After speaking to Lin Yuan, Si Xue raised her hand and knocked on Yi He’s shoulder, “Yi He, you’re really impressive. You managed to gather so many Grade 5 colleagues and host an exchange in your own name.","“I think this time, we can properly study the topic that troubled us previously. Who knows, with so many people around and everyone pitching in ideas, these topics might just spark some inspiration.”","Si Xue not only acted without constraints, but she was also very willing to study the path of Creator. Moreover, this pursuit of knowledge far surpassed other Creators. This was the reason why Si Xue’s talent was similar to Yi He and she had advanced to the intermediate Grade 5 Creator earlier than Yi He despite being younger than him.","Upon hearing her words, Yi He didn’t dare to claim credit and hurriedly said, “I have quite a bit of influence, Si Xue, don’t you know? Just with my influence alone, having two Grade 5 Creators including you here is already quite impressive.","“The reason why so many people came was that I used the topic of lifespan as bait. And all of this was bestowed by Young Master. Young Master should be the one with real influence.”","Si Xue was taken aback by Yi He’s words, finding it hard to imagine that such flattering words would come from him. It was worth noting that Yi He was very wild and rarely bowed down, even in front of her. Yet now, he sounded more like Lin Yuan’s servant. However, Lin Yuan addressed Yi He as ‘Senior’ and clearly did not treat him as a servant.","Lin Yuan waved his hand and smiled at Yi He. “Senior Yi He, you used your resources and channels for this academic exchange. I won’t dare to take credit. Since Senior Si Xue has arrived, why don’t we set off immediately?”","Yi He led the way and brought Lin Yuan to the conference hall. He was very nervous because he knew very well that a huge change was about to happen. The moment Yi He led Lin Yuan’s group of four into the conference hall, a woman with an aged face but abundant vitality said unhappily, “Yi He, why did you go out to meet someone for such a long time? It’s really rude to let the rest of us wait here like idiots. Yi He, are you looking down on the other Grade 5 Creators?”","This old woman was clearly talking to Yi He, but her gaze was fixed on Si Xue, who was a few steps behind Yi He.","As the host, Yi He naturally had to receive every guest because this was Yi He’s venue. Even for these Grade 4 Creators who came here, Yi He would have to spend time to receive them. Even if Yi He and Si Xue didn’t have any personal relationship, Yi He still needed to welcome Si Xue.","The old female Grade 5 Creator wasn’t targeting Yi He, but Si Xue. She was unhappy that Si Xue was late. Zhuo Yan and Si Xue had been at loggerheads for a long time. There were many conflicts of interest between them. During the exploration of the ruins, they had formed quite a feud. If it weren’t for the fact that the purpose of this academic exchange meeting was to help Lin Yuan gather more Creators, Yi He definitely wouldn’t have invited Zhuo Yan.","Yi He was very surprised by Zhuo Yan’s attack. Even when Si Xue was still a low Grade 5 Creator, Zhuo Yan had always been at a disadvantage when fighting with Si Xue. When Si Xue advanced to an intermediate Grade 5 Creator, she kept a low profile.","There was no reason for Zhuo Yan not to be aware of this. If she continued to provoke Si Xue at this time, it meant that Zhuo Yan might have successfully advanced to the intermediate Grade 5 Creator. Otherwise, Zhuo Yan would not have the guts to do so.","Grade 4 Creators were not qualified to interfere in the dispute between Grade 5 Creators. Those who could become Creators were all clear-minded people and had already speculated that Zhuo Yan’s ability had most likely improved. In an instant, Zhuo Yan surpassed the other Grade 5 Creators and reached a level where she could compete with Si Xue.","Before Yi He could say anything, Si Xue snorted. “Zhuo Yan, do you have a problem with my timing? Don’t tell me you think you can do whatever you want just because you’ve made a breakthrough in your Grade 5 Creator abilities, or even because I’m on equal footing with you? Don’t forget how you became a Grade 5 Creator. We became Grade 5 Creators through our own effort, unlike you, who relied on external means to break through.","“You broke through by relying on external means. Are you qualified to sit in the top position like us at the Creator Conference? You can only sit in the middle seats like those Grade 4 Creators. Even if you can be at the front, it won’t be as glorious as sitting in the top seat!”","Si Xue had never been the kind of person who would let others off easily. Even if others didn’t provoke her, Si Xue would take the initiative to find trouble with those she didn’t like. Now that someone had provoked her, how could Si Xue just let it go? She didn’t give Zhao Yan any face in front of the Grade 4 Creators and directly pointed out the flaws in her evolving to Grade 5 Creator. It was like touching a sore spot in Zhao Yan’s heart.","Creators were the most respected profession in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. This made the classification of Creators extremely strict. In fact, there was not much difference in ability even if one advanced to a Grade 5 Creator through external means. However, there was a huge difference in their style.","In the North, South, East, and West Universes, Creators were all divided according to their abilities. No matter which universe Zhuo Yan went to, she would encounter the same discrimination.","The official organizations of the four universes defined Creators this way because Creators who relied on external means to advance their grade would find it very difficult to advance in the future, unless they encountered a huge opportunity. It was clear that Zhuo Yan must have encountered a great opportunity recently to advance further after becoming a Grade 5 Creator.","Upon hearing Si Xue’s words, Zhuo Yan almost lost control of her breath and started fighting with Si Xue.","As the saying went, you should not expose your opponent’s shortcomings when scolding them. Yet, not only did Si Xue expose Zhuo Yan’s shortcomings, but she also ridiculed Zhuo Yan about the seating issue of the Creator Conference.","However, Zhuo Yan was still rational. If she fought with Si Xue now, no matter who won or lost, he would definitely offend the host, Yi He. If it affected the academic exchange and Yi He was unwilling to disclose the method of increasing his lifespan, it would likely lead to hostility from the other Grade 5 Creators towards her. No matter how she looked at it, it was not worth it to make a move now.","Since she could not do anything, Zhuo Yan did not want to suffer such a loss. Zhuo Yan was certain that Si Xue would not dare to make a move if she did not dare to.","Si Xue exposed her shortcomings as if she didn’t know about the thorns buried in Si Xue’s heart.","“Si Xue, I used some special methods to become a Grade 5 Creator, but I’m still a Grade 5 Creator now. In terms of Creator abilities, it’s no different from yours. It’s not a bad thing that I have the ability to take advantage of the situation. On the other hand, you were hunted down by your enemies when you advanced to Grade 4 Creator and in order not to give up the opportunity for comprehension, you caused trouble for your family.","“I heard that more than half of your family clans have died. If I were you, I would definitely give up on the opportunity for comprehension to protect my family. With your strength at that time, you should be able to defeat a powerful enemy if you give up on your comprehension.”","If what Si Xue had said just now was just a stab in Zhuo Yan’s heart, then what she said now was equivalent to cutting open the scar in Si Xue’s heart that had yet to heal. This matter had always been Si Xue’s nightmare or regret.","At that time, Si Xue had indeed placed too much importance on her own comprehension of the will of heaven and earth. At that time, Si Xue had been too eager to become a Grade 4 Creator. When Si Xue was not even a Grade 1 Creator, her species had already made enemies due to mining disputes and conflicts with other factions. From then on, the species hid everywhere, and the members of the species did not have a day of peace.","The reason why Si Xue decided to seize this opportunity and do her best to become a Grade 4 Creator was because she knew that only by improving her Creator abilities could she better protect her species.","Si Xue seized the opportunity and successfully became a Grade 4 Creator. However, without her protection, her species fell victim to an enemy faction. All the direct descendants of her bloodline perished in the encirclement of the enemy faction.","After Si Xue broke through, she almost wiped out all the enemy factions. However, even so, her dead relatives could no longer be revived.","Zhuo Yan had touched Si Xue’s sore spot by using her family’s grudge. However, Si Xue refrained from taking action. Instead, she turned to Lin Yuan. After meeting Lin Yuan’s gaze, Si Xue shrugged and gestured to him. For the sake of Lin Yuan’s plan, she had endured what Zhuo Yan had said.","Lin Yuan noticed the situation but did not intervene in Si Xue’s emotions. He felt somewhat helpless. It seemed that the enmity between Si Xue and Zhuo Yan was deep, but it did not stop Lin Yuan from letting them join Sky City. At most, he would just not let Si Xue and Zhuo Yan work together in the same team. If Si Xue and Zhuo Yan encountered that kind of irreconcilable conflict in the future, at most, the two of them would fight. After the fight, it would naturally stop.","As one of the top people in the world, which Grade 5 Creator did not have a temper?","Lin Yuan had initially planned to wait for the academic exchange to proceed for some time before taking action. At the very least, he wanted Yi He to put forward the method of obtaining endless lifespan. This would certainly make his movements much more convenient.","Some things were better left unknown. If they knew, they would either join the same faction and become true allies, or he would have to clean up the people who knew the secret and make it a secret forever.","The Creators were aware of this because they would do the same to others in order to keep a secret. However, now that the conflict has arisen, it will take quite some time to address it.","Lin Yuan did not have that much time to waste because he still had to explore the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Exploring the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was equally beneficial to Lin Yuan and the entire Sky City. Therefore, Lin Yuan was prepared to achieve his goal as soon as possible.","Lin Yuan did not respond to Si Xue’s expression, which caused her expression to become solemn. However, Si Xue felt that she was already giving face to Lin Yuan. Otherwise, with Si Xue’s temper and personality, she would have definitely fought with Zhuo Yan and wouldn’t care about the impact of the conflict. As a traditional Grade 5 Creator, she was more confident than Zhuo Yan.","Si Xue had tolerated Zhuo Yan’s remarks, but she was surprised that Lin Yuan didn’t acknowledge her feelings.","Si Xue was able to treat Lin Yuan with such an attitude because Yi He had told her a lot about how powerful and mysterious Lin Yuan and Sky City were.","Ignored, Si Xue turned to look at Yi He, her gaze conveying her dissatisfaction. In Si Xue’s perspective, she believed that she had already shown more than enough goodwill towards Lin Yuan from the moment she first encountered him.","Upon seeing the look in Si Xue’s eyes, Yi He inwardly muttered that things were not looking good. Si Xue had a temper, and there were many things Yi Xue couldn’t openly discuss with her. If there was a conflict between Si Xue and Lin Yuan, Yi He really would not know what to do.","The moment Yi He contracted the Lifespan Mouse, he was already under Lin Yuan’s control. Therefore, Yi He did not have any autonomy and could only stand on Lin Yuan’s side. Yi He didn’t want to lose his close friend, Si Xue, just like that. He was prepared to say something to calm Si Xue down.","At that moment, Yi He heard Lin Yuan speak. “Everyone, you must have come here to obtain a way to increase your lifespan. Since it’s about finding a way to increase lifespan, there’s really no need for any disputes between us. It’s really difficult for me to handle when you’re all fighting each other here!”","Apart from Yi He and Si Xue, all the Creators present were very curious about Lin Yuan’s identity.","Lin Yuan, Autumn, and Winter’s auras could not be detected. The Creators present could not detect their auras because they were extremely powerful and far surpassed the Creators present.","The reason why they could not detect Lin Yuan’s aura was that Autumn and Winter had used their own auras to protect him. It was also largely related to the recovery and increase in strength of Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform, Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","There was nothing special about Autumn and Winter, but the Creators present could discern the age disparity between Lin Yuan and Chu Ci.","Chu Ci had reached the Divine Kingdom level at such a young age, which really surprised the Creators. However, the Creators present were not ordinary people and they all had the ability to nurture such a prodigy.","Where did this little fellow, who had been alive for decades but whose aura couldn’t be detected come from? There’s no way someone so young should have a say here!"]},{"number":3028,"title":"Chapter 3028: Control the Situation Then!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3028: Control the Situation Then!","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhuo Yan’s talent had just been belittled by Si Xue. Zhuo Yan had used Si Xue’s background to attack Si Xue, but Si Xue was indifferent. This made Zhuo Yan feel no sense of accomplishment at all. The anger in her heart could not be appeased at all.","Now that Lin Yuan had suddenly jumped out and said such words, Zhuo Yan treated Lin Yuan as an outlet for her to vent her anger. It was not good for her to offend Si Xue, but she did not have to worry about offending such a little fellow. Especially since this little fellow came with Si Xue.","“Yi He, where did you bring this junior from? How can you be so impudent? Don’t you know what event this is? The other colleagues have yet to speak, but this little fellow has already spoken. Yi He, the person you brought here must learn to discipline himself. Is this situation happening because your people spent too much time with Si Xue and learned her bad temper?”","Zhuo Yan used Lin Yuan’s words to point the spearhead at Si Xue again.","Zhuo Yan was not interested in making things difficult for a little fellow like Lin Yuan. Making things difficult for a little fellow who had only lived for a few decades was really embarrassing for Zhuo Yan.","Didn’t Si Xue want to avoid her? She would lure Si Xue out again and see if she could tolerate it this time! No matter what, she would not allow Si Xue to talk about her becoming a Grade 5 Creator through external means again.","With the opportunity she had obtained this time, she had a possibility of advancing further in the future. She might even be able to walk ahead of Si xue!","Initially, Si Xue did not flare up because she wanted to give Lin Yuan respect. But it was obvious that Lin Yuan did not accept her favor.","Now that Zhuo Yan was provoking her again, Si Xue could no longer hold it in.","Just as Si Xue was about to flare up, she heard a gust of wind.","“I told you that it would be difficult for me if you had a dispute with each other because it would waste my time. Autumn and Winter, you two control the situation. Yi He, you’ll explain the situation later.”","When Lin Yuan said the first half of his sentence, the Creators and even Si Xue had the same thought—Lin Yuan was too arrogant. Waste your time? Your time is nothing! How can your time be more precious than the time of us Creators?","These words were indeed arrogant. But before these people could carefully grade Lin Yuan’s words, Autumn and Winter released their auras. Autumn and Winter’s auras surged out and pressed down fiercely on the Creators present.","The Grade 5 Creators, including Yi He, froze under the pressure. Not only were they unable to move, but even breathing became a little difficult.","But soon, Yi He felt the pressure ease because Autumn and Winter no longer used their auras to target Yi He.","This sudden change shocked all the Creators present. They realized that this meeting led by Yi He was very likely to be targeted at everyone present.","Yi He had been trying his best to invite Creators to participate in this academic discussion.","Everyone was very surprised when they received the invitation. Why did Yi He share this method of increasing his lifespan with everyone? This method that could increase one’s lifespan was extremely precious. Was Yi He really so However, in the environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds, these respected","Creators had never thought that they would one day become prey for others.","Yi He saw that Lin Yuan had asked Autumn and Winter to control the situation and asked him to explain the situation.","Yi He did not retreat. He knew very well that doing such a thing would definitely cause an extremely bad impact. He would completely lose the trust of the Creators present. Not only that, but the Creators would also bear a grudge against him. Even if they joined Lin Yuan, they might be unhappy with him for a long time.","However, there were people who would remember his good deeds. At the very least, Lin Yuan would appreciate his kindness.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had also given him the position of Creator deputy team leader. If he wanted to obtain this position, he had to pay a price!","Many of the Creators present were tough cookies. However, when faced with the choice of life and death, these Creators would definitely make the right decision.","On one hand, they could obtain endless lifespan to continue living, and on the other hand, they could die. Even a fool would know how to choose.","Even the Creators who did not have any problems with their lifespan began to worry about it. This was because the Creators had no pressure to survive at all.","Even a Grade 4 Creator would be treated as a distinguished guest no matter where he went. His status in the various large cities was even more prominent than that of a City Lord.","A person with such an advanced status was most afraid of death, because once he died, he would not be able to enjoy these comforts anymore!","No matter what, what happened here would not spread.","There had never been a case involving many Grade 5 Creators and more than 30 Grade 4 Creators in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Yi He cleared his throat and spoke in a serious tone. “I said that I would announce my solution to the problem of lifespan during this academic exchange. I won’t go back on my word. As long as you join Lord Lin Yuan and contract a special fey, you will be able to completely resolve the problem of lifespan and obtain eternal lifespan! I have now become an eternal lifeform with endless lifespan.”","With that, Yi He released his aura and let the other Creators present sense his lifespan.","Originally, Yi He’s vitality was weak and his lifespan was exhausted.","If Yi He’s body was like a rice paddy, then his lifespan was like a waterway that swept across the rice paddy.","Previously, Yi He’s rice fields were like a desert, and the waterways had already dried up. Only by using a hoe can one touch the oozing water at the bottom of the waterway.","But now, the water channel in Yi He’s paddy field was already filled with water and the water in this water channel nourished the entire paddy field. It allowed Yi He’s old body, which could not even maintain its appearance, to completely return to normal!","After checking Yi He’s physical condition, everyone knew that Yi He was telling the truth. Yi He had indeed shared his method.","What did he mean by asking them to join this young man called Lin Yuan?","It was impossible for Yi He not to know how terrible his actions were.","Si Xue and Yi He communicated very closely, but Yi He did not reveal the situation of the Lifespan Mouse to Si Xue.","She only knew that Yi He had obtained a large amount of lifespan and did not need to worry about it anymore, but she did not know that Yi He’s lifespan had already reached an unlimited level.","Si Xue could not help but look at Lin Yuan. Not only did this youth have the ability to grant one endless lifespan, but he also had two experts who were much stronger than them.","Facing the aura released by Autumn and Winter, Si Xue knew very well that she had no room to resist.","Si Xue hated it the most when others threatened her. With Si Xue’s fiery temper, she would settle scores with anyone who threatened her.","However, now that her martial force was suppressed and the other party daringness to do this, it was obvious that they would not let the news here spread.","Si Xue was angry at Lin Yuan just now, but she did not show it. She did not verbally offend Lin Yuan.","Si Xue had already made it clear that she wanted to join Sky City, so she was prepared to take advantage of the situation.","As the saying went, he who understood the times was a wise man. If she showed extreme resistance now, her previous good impression of Lin Yuan would be swept away.","In the process of communicating with Yi He, Yi He promised to help her obtain benefits and status. Yi He had just given her a look. That benefit and status had most likely already been obtained.","“Lord Lin Yuan, I’m willing to join you. I hope you can give me a way to extend my lifespan!”","After saying that, Si Xue summoned her holy spirit and brought it before her. This indicated that Lin Yuan could mark her holy spirit at any time.","Si Xue was very smart and knew that what Lin Yuan wanted was definitely not just verbal submission. Words of submission were meaningless.","She might as well be more proactive. It could be considered a hint to the other Creators present.","This was the only way to truly help Lin Yuan!","Lin Yuan smiled at Si Xue and controlled her holy spirit without any hesitation.","Lin Yuan took out the Lifespan Mouse and told Si Xue, “This is the way to let you obtain endless lifespan. Return him to me after you contract it. I’ll help you feed it.’","Si Xue couldn’t help but reveal a shocked expression when she saw the Lifespan Mouse. This shocked expression mirrored Yi He’s expression when he saw the Lifespan Mouse.","Even a Grade 5 Creator had never seen a strange object like the Lifespan Mouse.","Si Xue saw through the Lifespan Mouse and knew what Lin Yuan meant by taking away her contracted Lifespan Mouse.","This Lifespan Mouse was both an opportunity for her and a rope to tie her down. If the Lifespan Mouse died after signing the contract, she would also die.","However, as the saying went, all gifts had a hidden value. If it were Si Xue, she would also take the Lifespan Mouse into her hands.","Lin Yuan intended to take in so many Creators and many of them had grudges against each other.","If he did not use this method to control the situation, there would inevitably be chaos.","After figuring everything out, Si Xue contracted the Lifespan Mouse and willingly handed it over to Lin Yuan.","“Lord, from now on, I will do my best under your command. If there’s anything wrong, feel free to tell me. I’ll correct it immediately. Lord, please forgive me if I make any mistakes in the future!”","Si Xue bowed deeply to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan took the Lifespan Mouse from Si Xue and went forward to help her up.","“It’s my honor that Senior Si Xue is willing to join me and become a member of Sky City. I won’t mistreat you in the future. In the future, there might be a chance for me to help Senior Si Xue’s Creator ability improve further and try to touch the threshold of a Class 6 Creator. At that time, I will provide Senior Si Xue with the corresponding resources. At the very least, I will give you the resources of a Class 6 Creator. You can also use them to increase your strength.”","The Lifespan Mouse that Lin Yuan had just taken out exploded in the hearts of the other Creators like a thunderclap.","Even a pinnacle intermediate Grade 5 Creator like Si Xue had never seen such a magical thing like the Lifespan Mouse, let alone the other low-class Grade 5 and 4 Creators.","This Lifespan Mouse itself was extremely attractive. Many Creators present had already begun to have no choice but to face the problem of insufficient lifespan.","However, although they were tempted, it was still very difficult to suddenly make these Creators with high statuses and extraordinary statuses lower their heads.","Even though Si Xue had already put on a good show, most of the Creators present still found it difficult to accept.","However, Lin Yuan’s promise to Si Xue made the Creators present think about it.","Everyone present did not believe that Lin Yuan had promised to let Si Xue become a Grade 6 Creator.","If a Grade 4 Creator wanted to become a Grade 5 Creator, it was not something that could be done by humans. He needed opportunities to facilitate this, much less moving from a Grade 5 Creator to a Grade 6 Creator!","There were indeed Grade 6 Creators in this world, but there were very few of them.","Currently, there were only six known Grade 6 Creators in the entire East Universe. Three of them presided over Honor Absent Palace.","They occupied three of the five Speaker positions in Honor Absent Palace.","Two of the three Grade 6 Creators outside held down, presided over their own race, and one often left the East Universe to travel to other universes or to adventure in the abyss. He was like a roaming poet who was romantic to the extreme. Usually, one could not see his shadow at all.","How could the words ‘Grade 6 Creator’ come out of Lin Yuan’s mouth so easily?","The more powerful a person was, the more respectful and fearful they would be towards a Grade 6 Creators.","However, the two experts by Lin Yuan’s side gave him a lot of credibility.","This was because it was very difficult to nurture a Grade 5 Creator. Moreover, Lin Yuan had promised Si Xue that he would provide her with Grade 6 Creator resources. He wanted Si Xue to use these Grade 6 Creator resources to increase her strength.","These resources could not be faked. Even if a superior had complete control over his subordinates, it was impossible for him to go back on his word. Otherwise, it would be impossible to make his subordinates submit. Therefore, the words of this young man who only had a few decades of lifespan were not lies!","If the Lifespan Mouse alone was enough to tempt the Creators, then Lin Yuan’s promise to Si Xue was enough to make them yearn for it!","Many Grade 4 Creators would join the factions formed by Grade 5 Creators in order to seek breakthroughs and accumulate experience. If a Grade 4 Creator was lucky enough to receive the guidance of a Grade 5 Creator, the Grade 4 Creator would have more opportunities to improve their Creator abilities.","This was the reason so many Grade 4 Creators gathered around Yi He to form an academic exchange organization. Yi He would provide some help to these Grade 4 Creators. Although the Grade 4 Creators in Yi He’s organization were not his servants, they were indeed subordinates.."]},{"number":3029,"title":"Chapter 3029 Even Geniuses Have to Bow Their Heads!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3029 Even Geniuses Have to Bow Their Heads!","If a Grade 4 Creator had such thoughts, so would a Grade 5 Creator.","....","However, Grade Creators were too rare, and they were both mysterious and noble. Even if a Grade 5 Creator wanted to follow this Grade 6 Creator, it was basically impossible to meet these Grade 6 Creators.","There was only a thin line between Grade 6 and Grade 5 Creators, but there was a world-shaking difference between them. The difference between a Grade 6 Creator and a Grade 5 Creator was even greater than the difference between a Grade 5 Creator and a Grade 3 Creator.","The faction of this young man in front of him could obtain Grade 6 Creator resources and was willing to give them to his subordinates. This meant that the faction behind this young man most likely had a Grade 6 Creator presiding over them.","At the thought of this, three Grade 5 Creators and more than ten Grade 4 Creators expressed their willingness to join Lin Yuan.","On the surface, joining Lin Yuan’s faction would only give him endless lifespan. Since this faction had a Grade 6 Creator presiding over it, joining this faction would bring them many benefits.","Si Xue had no choice but to surrender. After all, Autumn and Winter had already taken control of the situation.","Si Xue’s surrender was because she wanted to gain more benefits for herself after understanding the situation. But she did not expect to receive such a big surprise.","“Young Master, thank you for thinking so highly of me. If you’re willing to give me the resources of a Grade 6 Creator, I’ll definitely use them well. I won’t let you down.”","After saying that, Si Xue knelt on one knee and bowed to Lin Yuan as a retainer would.","No one would believe that a Grade 5 Creation Master was kneeling on the ground as a retainer. However, such a thing had really happened.","The other Creators at the side did not think that this scene was unreasonable. However, they did not think that they could submit as recklessly as Si Xue had.","Lin Yuan looked at Si Xue who was kneeling on one knee and the reactions of the other Creators around him. He knew that he had met his goal. His goal could proceed smoothly.","Lin Yuan had never been a boastful person. He could not make such a promise to Si Xue.","However, Morbius’ grade and quality would soon be evolved. Lin Yuan’s new spirit-locked fey, the Business Flourishing Flower, would soon be evolved under the nourishment of the Four Seasons Mountain and Cleansing Breath Soil.","Morbius had already told Lin Yuan that it would undergo another transformation once it evolved another grade.","At that time, the Creator resources produced by the Spirit Lock spatial zone would definitely increase by a large level.","More importantly, with Lin Yuan’s current accumulation, he could allow Morbius to break through to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","At that time, Morbius would undergo a transformation.","At that time, the resources produced by the Spirit Lock spatial zone should be able to reach the level of a Grade 6 Creator!","Lin Yuan had always paid attention to the nurturing of feys. This was especially true for Morbius.","Lin Yuan had to invest a lot of resources in this cultivation method but he would not be able to obtain much benefits in the short term.","Very few people could be as patient as Lin Yuan, but he insisted on doing so. Soon, Lin Yuan would receive rewards.","In the past, Morbius’ output of resources had always been Lin Yuan’s trump card and it was the same now!","Zhuo Yan looked at Si Xue, who was kneeling beside Lin Yuan, and could not help but be dazed. A proud person like Si Xue would actually do such a thing!","Zhuo Yan tried to move her body under the envelopment of the Autumn and Winter auras. However, even though she used a lot of strength, she still could not break free from the shackles of the two auras on the energy in her body. This made Zhuo Yan feel like a deflated ball.","Zhuo Yan did not say anything, but when the Grade 4 Creators saw that Si Xue had already submitted to Lin Yuan, they quickly expressed their attitude to him.","In just a few hours, apart from the two Grade 5 Creators including Zhuo Yan and the three Grade 4 Creators, everyone else joined Lin Yuan and contracted a Lifespan Mouse.","The Creators who had joined Lin Yuan later watched as he distributed Lifespan Mouse after Lifespan Mouse. They were afraid that Lin Yuan would run out of the Lifespan Mouse.","When every Creator was given a Lifespan Mouse as they wished, it meant one thing. The faction behind Lin Yuan, Sky City, had the ability to cultivate the Lifespan Mouse.","This ability could allow every important member of this faction to have an endless lifespan.","Lin Yuan looked at the five Creators who were unwilling to submit to him and pulled over a chair to speak to Chu Ci.","“Chu Ci, sit here and wait for me for a while. It seems that the plan today is not going well. I need to spend some time on these people.”","Lin Yuan took two steps forward, clenched his fist, and knocked on the table a few times.","“Have the five of you made up your minds not to join Sky City? I’ll invite you again. If you’re still unwilling to join, I think you can guess the consequences!”","When Lin Yuan said this, a condensed aura gushed out. This aura had nothing to do with strength. Instead, it was the noble dignity and pride of a person who had been in a high position for a long time. This kind of aura could only be displayed by people in this position.","Zhuo Yan felt Lin Yuan’s aura and her heart tightened. Zhuo Yan had not expected that a little guy at such a young age could actually give her such a sense of oppression.","Although Zhuo Yan had just fought with Si Xue because she had broken through to become a Grade 5 Creator, she was still very aggressive.","But now, Zhuo Yan was already terrified. Zhuo Yan did not doubt that Lin Yuan would deal with her if she refused.","However, Zhuo Yan needed a way out. Otherwise, it would be really difficult for Zhuo Yan to express her willingness to join a faction with Si Xue in front of so many people.","Just as Zhuo Yan was about to wait for a segue, Lin Yuan retracted his aura and spoke sincerely, “I would like to invite the five Creators to join Sky City and become members. I wonder if you are willing to give me a chance?”","The young Grade 5 Creator standing not far from Zhuo Yan said, “You’re forcing us to join Sky City, an unheard-of faction, and deprive us of our freedom. Do you know what that means? You actually dare to attack so many Creators. Aren’t you afraid of becoming the enemy of the entire East Universe and even the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds?","“You’re provoking the rules set by Honor Absent Palace by doing this. You’re also wantonly trampling on the dignity of the Creator. I—”","Before the Grade 5 Creator could finish speaking, Lin Yuan interrupted him, “Don’t spout nonsense if you don’t have any evidence. You have to be responsible for what you said. You said I attacked many Creators. Who have I attacked?”","Lin Yuan turned to look at the Creators who were under his control and asked with a smile, Did I do anything to you?”","The Creators hurriedly said, “Lord Lin Yuan, how could you attack a Creator? We all volunteered to be your subordinates. We have to thank you for giving us such an opportunity!”","What a joke. These Creators who had joined Lin Yuan for whatever reason had their lives in Lin Yuan’s hands. How could they not follow Lin Yuan’s words?","Moreover, this was a rare opportunity to show their loyalty. Expploore ??ptod??te stories at no/??el/bin(.)c??m","After these Creators expressed their stance, Lin Yuan said to the Grade 5 Creator, “I’ll say it again. Evidence is what matters when you speak.”","Lin Yuan ignored the Grade 5 Creator and gave Winter a look before turning to Zhuo Yan and the other Grade 4 Creators and asking, “I’ve invited you again. Now you can tell me your decision.”","As Lin Yuan spoke, the Grade 5 Creator who had doubted Lin Yuan suddenly let out a scream. A few leaves filled with a withering aura shot into the Grade 5 Creator’s body.","The skin of this Grade 5 Creator, who was originally very young, seemed to be dehydrated. He quickly aged and shriveled. Most of the vitality in his body disappeared in an instant.","This Grade 5 Creator had been invited by Yi He, who had already informed Lin Yuan of the Grade 5 Creator’s situation.","The reason this Grade 5 Creator was so resistant was largely related to his age. This Grade 5 Creator was the youngest among all the Grade 5 Creators present. His young age meant that there was no need to worry about his lifespan. Therefore, the Lifespan Mouse was not very attractive to this Grade 5 Creator named Sun Yin.","To be able to achieve such outstanding results at such a young age meant that Sun Yin had extremely high potential.","Zhuo Yan and Sun Yin were very close. In Zhuo Yan’s eyes, Sun Yin’s potential had always been greater than Si Xue’s.","This was despite the fact that Si Xue had become a pinnacle intermediate Grade 5 Creator first.","If Sun Yin could advance to intermediate within a hundred years, Sun Yin would most likely be able to advance further in Honor Absent Parliament. He might even be recognized by the five Speakers and be chosen by a Grade 6 Creator, who would then take him in as a disciple.","This was the path that Sun Yin had always been trying to take. This made Sun Yin have a pride that far exceeded that of ordinary Creators.","Sun Yin originally thought that even if the other party had confidence and trump cards, his words would more or less make the other party wary and reconsider.","From the bottom of his heart, Sun Yin was unwilling to join an unfamiliar faction. Unexpectedly, he had only raised his doubts and had not gone overboard but Lin Yuan had actually ordered his subordinates to attack him!","The rich lifespan in his body had actually been sucked away by the two dead leaves in just a few breaths of time. His lifespan really only had a few years left. However, these two leaves did not stop absorbing his lifespan. They were still crazily extracting it from his body.","The extreme weakness made Sun Yin’s body hunch down. His head was dizzy and he could not even stand steadily.","Sun Yin was locked onto by Autumn’s aura and did not have the ability to open his mouth even if he wanted to beg for mercy. In just a few breaths, Sun Yin felt the end of his life and the call of death.","Just as Sun Yin thought that he was about to die here, Autumn’s fingers moved gently and the two withered leaves left Sun Yin’s body.","Two bloody holes appeared on Sun Yin’s body.","However, Sun Yin’s body did not have much blood that could flow out of the two bloody holes. The two withered leaves had already turned into an emerald green color and were extremely plump.","The two emerald green leaves looked like two works of art but no one present admired them. These two leaves contained the majestic vitality in Sun Yin’s body.","Sun Yin was considered a genius, but he had instantly fallen into dire straits. This contrast made everyone understand Lin Yuan’s methods.","Fortunately, they had made the right choice. Otherwise, they would definitely end up like Sun Yin.","Autumn said in an extremely calm tone, “I’ve preserved your lifespan for a day. But due to the injuries on your body, you have at most an hour to live. Of course, you might not be able to last more than an hour and only have dozens of minutes. If you don’t want to join Sky City, my young master won’t force you. You’ll be completely free in an hour!”","After saying that, he played with the leaf in his hand and locked his aura on Zhuo Yan and the other three Grade 4 Creators.","At that moment, the three Grade 4 Creators hurriedly summoned their holy spirits to submit to Lin Yuan.","The three Grade 4 Creators were completely terrified.","Zhuo Yan no longer cared about the so-called segue and hurriedly bent down to say to Lin Yuan, “Lord, I’m willing to serve under you. As one of your subordinates, I will contribute to Sky City in the future!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he heard Zhuo Yan’s words.","Lin Yuan signaled to Autumn to tell him to teach this Grade 5 Creator named Sun Yin a lesson. At such a time, the best way was to make an example out of him.","Sun Yin, who had taken the initiative to jump out, was the example used to warn the other Creators. However, Lin Yuan did not expect Autumn to use such a fierce method.","Lin Yuan had never taken the initiative to understand the abilities of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. It was likely that stripping the lifespan of a living being was a way for Autumn to fight an enemy.","Apart from Sun Yin, all the Creators were under Lin Yuan’s command after he took control of Zhuo Yan and the others.","Lin Yuan ignored Sun Yin, who only had a few dozen minutes left to live.","Lin Yuan would stay there for a while.","If he wanted to take someone like Sun Yin, who had shown strong resistance, under his wing, the most basic thing was to wash away his temper and arrogance. If Sun Yin could see the situation clearly, he would naturally lower his head to him.","If Sun Yin was unwilling to lower his head until his death, there was no need for Lin Yuan to take such a fellow under his wing.","If Sun Yin really died, Lin Yuan would bring Sun Yin’s body back to Sky City and let Red Thorn control Sun Yin through the Tongue of Relinquish.","Although Red Thorn could not control Sun Yin’s body in a short period of time with its current strength, Sky City would have a Grade 5 Creator who would never betray them when Red Thorn’s strength increased and took control of Sun Yin’s body. Moreover, this Grade 5 Creator was more handy than other Grade 5 Creators!"]},{"number":3030,"title":"Chapter 3030 Sun Yin’s Epiphany!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3030 Sun Yin’s Epiphany!","In any case, Lin Yuan had Sun Yin in his grasp.","....","Sun Yin had never interacted with Lin Yuan before and he had never offended him.","Lin Yuan’s actions were equivalent to forcing Sun Yin, making him look like a villain.","Lin Yuan had never done such a thing in the main world.","In fact, in an environment where the law of the jungle prevailed, there was no need for Lin Yuan to stick to the bottom line of his previous life. In a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, where the environment was even harsher, Lin Yuan naturally changed.","Lin Yuan looked at the six Grade 5 Creators and the 32 Grade 4 Creators under his command and said solemnly, “Since everyone has joined me and become a member of Sky City, as Creators with endless lifespans, you will definitely be able to achieve new breakthroughs in the future. In the future, be it in terms of improving the abilities of Creators or resources, I will provide them for you. I hope you can work for me well.”","All the Creators present were actually waiting for Lin Yuan’s promise. Since Lin Yuan had given Si Xue such good benefits, there was no reason for him not to give them some as well.","Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to a bowl of water for the Creators who had submitted to him.","After these Grade 5 Creators joined Lin Yuan, they used his words to express their loyalty to him.","While these Grade 5 Creators were expressing their loyalty to Lin Yuan, the other Grade 4 Creators had no chance to speak.","Twenty minutes had passed while everyone was talking.","In these 20 minutes, Sun Yin struggled violently. In the end, he supported his old body and knelt on the ground. He placed his forehead heavily on the ground and used his actions to express his attitude.","Lin Yuan was somewhat surprised to see Sun Yin prostrating on the ground. Lin Yuan was not surprised that Sun Yin would submit to him, but he was surprised that Sun Yin had taken such a long time. It seemed that Sun Yin was more stubborn than he had expected.","Even so, due to the circumstances, Sun Yin still became one of his subordinates.","Lin Yuan was not afraid that Sun Yin would resent him because of his dissatisfaction.","Firstly, Lin Yuan would have complete control over Sun Yin and would not give him such an opportunity.","Secondly, the fact that Sun Yin could make such a choice meant that he wanted to live more than die.","It was not easy for him to obtain the chance to live and obtain an endless lifespan. Sun Yin was destined to be even more unwilling to die.","An old, helpless, and fearful voice sounded in Lin Yuan’s ears, “Lord, I was blind previously. I hope you can give me a chance to work under you. From now on, I will pledge all my loyalty to you. I will never have any disloyal thoughts!”","After saying that, Sun Yin touched the ground with his forehead again. Sun Yin, who had his forehead on the ground, could already feel that his lifespan was completely exhausted. It was very likely that if he had agreed a second later, he would have died.","Sun Yin anxiously needed to plead with Lin Yuan.","Zhuo Yan stood beside Lin Yuan and looked at Sun Yin. She felt a little upset, and she had the thought of pleading on Sun Yin’s behalf.","In Zhuo Yan’s opinion, Sun Yin did not do anything overboard to Lin Yuan. It was just that when Lin Yuan wanted to take these Creators under his wing, Sun Yin raised his doubts.","Now, Sun Yin was willing to join Lin Yuan. Regardless of whether Lin Yuan knew about Sun Yin’s talent, a living Grade 5 Creator was more valuable than a dead one.","At that moment, Sun Yin’s lifespan had been drained by the two leaves in an unknown manner, causing his lifespan to be exhausted.","Even if the lifespan that was extracted could not be returned to Sun Yin, as long as Sun Yin contracted the Lifespan Mouse, he could continue to live.","Sun Yin had a good relationship with him to begin with. However, Sun Yin was more or less wary of others.","Although they were close, there was still a barrier between them, unlike the sincere relationship between Yi He and Si Xue.","If she could help Sun Yin plead for leniency now, Sun Yin would definitely thank her after Lin Yuan decided to take her under her wing.","Apart from having her own plans, Zhuo Yan did not want Sun Yin, her extremely talented friend, to die.","Zhuo Yan said tentatively, “Lord Lin Yuan, Sun Yin was just confused just now. Now that he has figured it out, I hope you can give him a chance. To be honest, Sun Yin’s talent should be the strongest among all of us here!”","After saying that, Zhuo Yan bent down and put on a pleading posture.","Zhuo Yan’s posture was not only for Lin Yuan, but also for Sun Yin.","Lin Yuan chuckled and said, “I remember that your name is Zhuo Yan, right? Since you’ve asked, I’m willing to give you respect.”","Lin Yuan waved his hand gently, and the two leaves immediately returned to Sun Yin’s body.","Time was basically stuck at the moment when Sun Yin’s lifespan was about to end.","The moment the two leaves returned to their withered state and left Sun Yin’s body, the lifespan that was absorbed in Sun Yin’s body was replenished. Sun Yin returned to his original young state.","In his original healthy state, Sun Yin did not feel that his body condition was that rare. However, after sensing the weakness of his lifespan, Sun Yin completely understood how important health was. Sun Yin personally experienced the importance of lifespan to a life.","After understanding this, Sun Yin entered a mysterious state of epiphany.","Lin Yuan immediately fell silent. He was a little surprised that Sun Yin would have an epiphany at such a time. What a powerful comprehension ability!","Comprehension was extremely important to a Creator. Every epiphany would increase their Creator abilities to a certain extent.","All the Creators present looked at Sun Yin enviously. It was too rare to enter such a state of epiphany. Some Creators might not be able to enter such a state for the rest of their lives.","The Creators present restrained their auras to prevent their auras from leaking out and affecting Sun Yin.","There were indeed a few Class 5 Creators present who did not have a good relationship with Sun Yin, including Si Xue.","However, no one dared to use any methods to interrupt Sun Yin’s epiphany. Sun Yin was now one of Lin Yuan’s subordinates and Sun Yin’s potential was equivalent to a portion of Lin Yuan’s assets. If someone interrupted Sun Yin’s epiphany and harmed Lin Yuan’s interests, how could Lin Yuan let this go?","Five hours later, Sun Yin recovered from his epiphany. If Sun Yin had submitted to Lin Yuan because he had no choice, then he had lowered his head and knelt on the ground because he had no choice but to think of a way to survive.","Now, Sun Yin was sincerely thanking Lin Yuan.","“Lord Lin Yuan, thank you for giving me an excellent opportunity to have an epiphany and being willing to create an epiphany environment for me. I’ve gained a lot from this epiphany. It’s now more convenient for me to serve you!”","After saying that, Sun Yin prepared to prostrate himself on the ground again to express his gratitude to Lin Yuan.","It was usually the hardest for a person to overcome the hurdle in their heart when they bent down for the first time. However, after bending down once, they would not have so many worries.","Lin Yuan took a step forward and pulled Sun Yin up from the ground.","“Previously, when you were unwilling to join Sky City, I had to use some tricks on you. I think you should be able to understand this! After all, I have to ensure that the information does not leak out.”","When Sun Yin heard Lin Yuan’s words, he could not help but shiver. Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to telling Sun Yin that if he was unwilling to submit, he would indeed die.","Just as Sun Yin was about to express his loyalty to Lin Yuan again, he heard Lin Yuan say, “I heard from them that you are the most talented among all the Creators present. I wonder if you agree with this statement?”","Sun Yin looked gratefully at Zhuo Yan, who had just pleaded for him. After this glance, Zhuo Yan and Sun Yin had already gone through life and death together.","Sun Yin replied proudly to Lin Yuan’s question, “Lord Lin Yuan, I am indeed the youngest among all the Creators present. With my age, it is not impossible for me to become a Grade 6 Creator’s subordinate.”","When he talked about his talent, Sun Yin could not help but reveal a condescending attitude. Sun Yin had always been proud of his talent.","Sun Yin felt that there was really no need for him to be too humble in front of Lin Yuan. The more he displayed his strength, the more Lin Yuan would value him.","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows. It was a good thing that Sun Yin’s talent was so powerful.","Lin Yuan actually did not have much of a concept of talents that could be recruited by a Grade 6 Creator.","Lin Yuan had actually intended to choose a Creator with the strongest potential to nurture. Now, it seemed that Sun Yin was the most suitable one.","“In that case, follow me from now on. I need a Grade 5 Creator by my side.”","Lin Yuan raised his hand and handed a Lifespan Mouse to Sun Yin, indicating that he could contract it directly.","When Sun Yin heard that Lin Yuan wanted him to follow him, he could not help but feel excited.","Since he had already decided to join Sky City, he would undoubtedly be able to obtain the most benefits and resources by following Lin Yuan.","This was different from the treatment of other Creators.","Now that Lin Yuan had placed the opportunity in front of him, he definitely had to cherish it.","Sun Yin immediately contracted the Lifespan Mouse before giving it back to Lin Yuan and saying seriously, “My Lord, it’s my honor to be by your side. I’ll definitely improve my ability as soon as possible to share your burdens!”","Lin Yuan did not hide his preferential treatment of Sun Yin at all.","Everyone had thought that Lin Yuan might make Sun Yin suffer because he was dissatisfied with Sun Yin’s previous attitude. They did not expect Lin Yuan to place Sun Yin in such an important position.","Firstly, no one dared to question Lin Yuan’s actions. Secondly, they knew that their talents could not be compared to Sun Yin’s.","The person Lin Yuan kept by his side would definitely be the most talented Creator.","Even though Sun Yin’s Creator abilities were not the strongest, he was definitely the one with the most potential.","Yi He looked at Sun Yin with a complicated expression. He could sense how much Lin Yuan valued Sun Yin.","Lin Yuan keeping Sun Yin by his side instead of placing him in Sky City’s Creator’s team was a good thing for Yi He.","Yi He knew very well that Sun Yin would run ahead of him sooner or later. With Sun Yin’s talent, he would not be able to form a competitive relationship with Sun Yin.","If he allowed Sun Yin to stay in this group, he would be in an extremely awkward position as the deputy team leader.","With Sun Yin by Lin Yuan’s side, the pressure on him would be much less as he was not in the group.","Lin Yuan took over Sun Yin’s Lifespan Mouse and controlled Sun Yin’s holy spirit. Then, he looked at all the Creators under his command and said, “I know that freedom is very important to you. I have no intention of restricting your freedom by taking you in as my subordinates. Therefore, I’ll give you a choice. You can decide whether you want to follow me back to Sky City or return to your own living environment. Enjoy your transcendent status as freely as you used to.”","All the Creators present were stunned when they heard Lin Yuan’s words. They had never thought that Lin Yuan would give them their freedom.","However, Lin Yuan did not finish his sentence.","There was definitely a difference between choosing to return to their original living environment and obediently submitting to Lin Yuan.","No one present was in a hurry to make a statement. Instead, they waited for Lin Yuan to continue.","Lin Yuan promised to give Grade 6 Creator resources. Under such circumstances, no one would not be tempted by Grade 6 Creator resources.","Most of these Grade 6 Creator resources could only be obtained by people who followed Lin Yuan to Sky City.","After being chosen by Lin Yuan to stay by his side, Sun Yin had lost the right to make decisions.","Sun Yin had suffered so much previously because he was fighting for his freedom from Lin Yuan.","In the end, Lin Yuan did not intend to control them at all. However, his suffering was not in vain.","If not for the torture, he would not have been able to enter a state of epiphany to understand the essential relationship between lifespan and life.","Seeing that no one reacted immediately, Lin Yuan continued after a while. “All of you have invested in Sky City so you are now a part of Sky City. I will not exploit your benefits. You can rest assured about this! Even if you return to your original environment, I don’t need you to contribute anything. You only need to provide a portion of Creator resources to Sky City on a regular basis.","“I will use the pure spirit qi to exchange for these Creator resources. When the time comes, it will be convenient for you to befriend more Creators outside. You can find an opportunity to lure these Creators into Sky City! Every time a Creator above Grade 4 is brought into Sky City, you will receive a certain amount of merit. When the time comes, you can use these merits to exchange for Grade 6 Creator resources.”"]},{"number":3031,"title":"Chapter 3031 Special “Insect”!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3031 Special “Insect”!","Lin Yuan would not directly bestow Grade 6 Creator resources to those Creators who did not plan to head to Sky City.","....","Instead, they needed these people to introduce new Creators to Sky City in exchange.","Obtaining Grade 6 Creator resources was not a difficult task for Lin Yuan in the future. He only needed to wait for Morbius to reach the Divine Kingdom level, and it would be able to produce a large number of Grade 6 Creator resources.","Even so, it was still impossible for Lin Yuan to nurture all these Creators.","The higher the strength of any lifeform, the more resources would be consumed. Apart from these Creators, Lin Yuan also had to provide these Grade 6 Creator resources to the core members of Sky City as well as the white-robed followers and combat sequence members.","Every Creator paid attention to different things. There must be some people who did not like to be restricted in Sky City.","Since that was the case, Lin Yuan was willing to give these people a chance to make the best use of their resources.","If possible, Lin Yuan still hoped that more Creators would join Sky City. Every Creator was a foundational powerhouse to Sky City.","In any case, these Creators were already under Lin Yuan’s control. No matter where they went, they were his own people.","As soon as Lin Yuan finished speaking, more than ten Grade 4 Creators responded.","“Lord, can we really move freely outside? I know many Creators and can try to contact them. Lord, even if we are outside, we will definitely work hard to produce Creator resources. When the time comes, it will be convenient for you to trade for them! How can we contact you and Sky City if we’re outside, Lord?”","There were indeed many people who loved freedom more than being restrained. Even if these Creators knew that they could only obtain more benefits by following Lin Yuan back to Sky City and developing in Sky City, many Creators were very satisfied with their current situation.","Back in their own territory, there were people who flattered them, especially now that they had endless lifespan to fall back on, they could enjoy the life of local tyrants. If they went to Sky City, they would not be able to live the same life as before. The Creators who were stronger than them would all lord over them.","These Creators who expressed their desire to develop outside were all Grade 4. Not a single Grade 5 Creator expressed this desire.","Even Zhuo Yan, who was at odds with Si Xue, was determined to follow Lin Yuan to Sky City.","Zhuo Yan knew very well that following Lin Yuan to Sky City to develop was a rare opportunity for her.","She could indeed live a more relaxed life outside.","However, when it came to recruiting high-grade Creators to join Sky City and obtaining Grade 6 Creator resources, she could indeed gather a portion of Creators by relying on her connections to set up such an exchange in the early stages. However, after a few exchanges, her connections would be exhausted and it would be very difficult for her to obtain the Grade 6 Creator resources.","Zhuo Yan did not want to see these people in front of her again in the future. These people would suppress her again.","Lin Yuan looked at the Creators who had the intention to stay outside and did not speak immediately. He only spoke when there were no more Creators responding to him.","“If the Creators who follow me back to Sky City do not have any special missions in the future, they will basically stay in Sky City’s territory and rarely have the chance to go out. As for those Creators who have decided to develop outside, they will continue to develop outside and will no longer be able to obtain the opportunity to develop in Sky City.","“Also, don’t spread any information about Sky City outside. Otherwise, I’ll deal with it according to the rules of Sky City. Those who have still decided to develop outside, go and register with Winter.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused the atmosphere to fall into a dead silence. The ten-odd Creators who wanted to develop outside also fell silent.","After choosing to develop outside, they would lose the chance to return. This was equivalent to being marginalized in Sky City. It was not a good thing to be marginalized in a faction.","With the power that Lin Yuan had displayed, there would definitely be Creators joining Sky City in the future.","Lin Yuan said with a smile as he sensed the deathly silence, “Everyone, there’s no need to feel that you’ve become abandoned by Sky City. It’s true that there are fewer opportunities to develop outside than in Sky City, but I won’t mistreat anyone who joins Sky City and contributes to us! Every once in a while, I will provide you with a portion of Grade 6 Creator resources. Consider it my recognition of your value.”","Lin Yuan’s words stunned the Creators again. At first, they thought that they could only obtain Grade 6 Creators by recruiting Grade 4 and above Creators into Sky City. It turned out that there was a guarantee that they could receive rewards after an interval.","This made the Grade 4 Creators, who were originally prepared to go outside, excited again. Some Creators who had no intention of going outside also had the same thought.","Zhuo Yan could not help but reveal a look of disdain on her face as she looked at the tempted Creators. What a bunch of stupid fellows! The benefits to be received outside paled in comparison to the benefits of returning to Sky City to develop.","A total of 13 Grade 4 Creators had registered with Winter. The other 19 Grade 4 Creators, Si Xue, Yi He, and the five Grade 5 Creators had all decided to head to Sky City’s headquarters to develop.","Ever since Lin Yuan had asked Zhong Zhiyu to forge the Island Whale embryo, Zhong Zhiyu had been complaining to Lin Yuan about the lack of manpower and hoped that Lin Yuan could send more assistants.","Now that so many Grade 5 and 4 Creators had joined Sky City, even with Zhong Zhiyu’s lazy personality, he would definitely feel immense pressure.","Only by exerting pressure on these Grade 5 Creators could they maximize their value.","In the future, Lin Yuan would provide a large amount of resources to these Creators who returned to Sky City to develop.","It would be a good thing for these Creators to compete with each other in a healthy way.","Seeing that everything was settled, Yi He heaved a sigh of relief.","Yi He had set up such a huge trap to lure so many Creators into it. Yi He was very nervous and afraid that there would be a problem.","If this operation was leaked, both Lin Yuan and himself would become the public enemy of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“Young Master, now that everything has been resolved and you’ve made your arrangements, do you think I should bring these Creators who have decided to develop in Sky City to the faction? You’ve already told me the location of Sky City. I can bring them directly to Zhong Zhiyu.”","Yi He’s main purpose was to show off his relationship with Lin Yuan. He needed the other Creators know that their relationship with Lin Yuan was extremely close. This would greatly reduce the hostility of the other Creators towards him.","These people did not dare to offend Lin Yuan. But if they played tricks behind his back or refused to cooperate with him in Sky City in the future, his life would be difficult. As the deputy team leader of the Creator team, not to mention having to compete with Zhong Zhiyu, he would probably even lose his position soon!","Lin Yuan told Yi He in an extremely serious tone, “Senior Yi He, you’re the leader of Sky City’s Creator team. I originally wanted you to bring them to Sky City. I have other things to do. It’s not convenient for so many of you to travel with me. You’ve worked hard this time.”","Lin Yuan gave Yi He the bow of a junior, showing him sufficient respect.","It made the other Creators present, including Zhuo Yan, who had already reached intermediate Grade 5, look at Yi He differently.","Lin Yuan’s words basically eliminated the hostility of the Creators toward Yi He.","Knowing that Lin Yuan valued Yi He so much, these Creators hoped to build a good relationship with Yi He.","At the same time, he knew that Lin Yuan was not an unreasonable, arrogant, and unreasonable person.","From Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Yi He, the other Creators knew that as long as they worked hard in Sky City, they would definitely be able to obtain Lin Yuan’s respect.","Zhuo Yan knew Zhong Zhiyu. The latter was a veteran advanced Grade 5 Creator with extremely strong abilities, but he did not like to interact with other Creators. She did not expect Zhong Zhiyu to become a member of Sky City!","However, she had never heard of Sky City before. There were no rumors about it.","For the first time, Zhuo Yan began to doubt her own status. Could it be that her level was too low for her to reach Sky City’s level?","Zhuo Yan had no idea that Sky City had only come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds from a Class 2 world this year.","Chu Ci stayed by Lin Yuan’s side and did not say a word, but her brain was spinning rapidly.","Through Genius, Chu Ci knew very well what status Grade 4 and 5 Creators had in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Chu Ci also understood how powerful the energy under Lin Yuan’s command was.","This discovery did not make Chu Ci feel smug. Instead, it made her feel a little anxious and eager to improve her strength.","Chu Ci knew very well that the higher Lin Yuan stood, the stronger the enemies he would face in the future.","After Lin Yuan made the arrangements, he brought Sun Yin, Autumn, Winter, and Chu Ci to the Scarlet Territory.","After knowing Lin Yuan’s destination, Sun Yin frowned slightly. He did not have a good impression of the Bloodians. In Sun Yin’s heart, the Bloodians were a very predatory and violent species.","They treated the other flesh and blood species as food. It was difficult for such communities to cooperate with other communities.","Many Creators who cooperated with the Bloodians suffered losses at the hands of the large clans of the Bloodians.","When Sun Yin was still a Grade 4 Creator, he had been taken advantage of by a Bloodian clan.","Although this Bloodian clan was not in the Scarlet Territory and was a queen clan that developed outside the Scarlet Territory, Sun Yin felt that the Bloodians were basically the same deep down!","Now that Lin Yuan had brought him along to nurture him, he naturally had to show his value to Lin Yuan.","Thus, Sun Yin told Lin Yuan what he thought of the Bloodians.","Sun Yin did not forbid Lin Yuan from collaborating with the Bloodians. It was Lin Yuan’s own business who he collaborated with, so there was no room for discussion. He only reminded Lin Yuan seriously, “Young Master, in the future, when you work with the Bloodians, you must be more forceful. Although the Bloodians are an ancient species, they actually don’t have much sincerity. I suffered when I interacted with the Bloodians before!”","Lin Yuan knew that Sun Yin was reminding him out of goodwill, but it was obvious that Sun Yin was not clear about his relationship with the Bloodians.","“Sun Yin, I was invited to the Scarlet Territory by a Bloodian queen who is also a member of Sky City. So there’s no such thing as what you’re saying. Moreover, even if I suffer a loss in the transaction with the other Bloodian clans, I think I’m not the one who needs to worry. It’s that Bloodian clan. It’s not easy to take advantage of me!”","Sun Yin was relieved when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. Lin Yuan was indeed not the kind of person who would be easily taken advantage of. Moreover, if any Bloodian clan really wanted to take advantage of Lin Yuan, the two guards by his side were not to be trifled with.","Until now, Sun Yin had yet to see through Autumn and Winter’s strength. This meant that Autumn and Winter’s strength were far above his own level and was much higher!","When Autumn and Winter did not reveal their auras, they were like ordinary people in front of him.","Lin Yuan had taken in nearly 40 Creators, but he had never asked them to hand over their resources.","The resources that each Creator had accumulated previously were still in their hands.","Sun Yin had acquired a uniquely extraordinary fey. While it didn’t directly amplify Sun Yin’s Creator ability, it significantly enhanced his comprehension.","Yet, this fey posed a peculiar challenge. Being a spirit contractor, Sun Yin found himself unable to form a contract with it. Consequently, his capacity for comprehension through this fey had dropped.","Sun Yin felt that since this fey was no longer useful to him, he might as well give it to Lin Yuan.","Even if Lin Yuan could not form a contract with this fey, the increase in comprehension that this fey would give Lin Yuan was enough for him to owe him a favor.","Sun Yin could tell that Lin Yuan, this little fellow who had only lived for a few decades, had an extremely broad view. Otherwise, he would not have doubted him.","Lin Yuan was still willing to keep him by his side to nurture him because of his talent.","Sun Yin took out the container containing the fey from his spatial equipment.","Just as Sun Yin took out the container containing the fey, Lin Yuan suddenly smelled a strange fragrance.","Right on the heels of that, a melodious neigh sounded from the incense burner-like object. The sound was extremely crisp and pleasant.","Before Lin Yuan could wonder what kind of insect-species fey was in the incense burner, he felt his mind clear up.","Lin Yuan immediately entered a mysterious state!"]},{"number":3032,"title":"Chapter 3032 Master of Light and Sound!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3032 Master of Light and Sound!","In this mystical state, Lin Yuan felt that his thoughts were processing much faster.","....","He looked at things more clearly than before.","To be able to achieve such an effect just by the smell and sound, the fey in the container that Sun Yin took out must not be of extraordinary quality.","Autumn and Winter shrugged their shoulders. They looked at each other and saw the surprise in each other’s eyes. They had not expected Sun Yin to obtain such an opportunity! The insect-species feys in the incense burner were even more valuable than Sun Yin, a Grade 5 Creator!","Under normal circumstances, a person would definitely not be willing to share such an opportunity with others.","Sun Yin did this not because he was loyal to Lin Yuan, but because he could not control such a lifeform by himself.","After possessing such a lifeform for so long, Sun Yin still could not obtain any benefits from it without contracting it.","When Sun Yin saw the expression on Lin Yuan’s face, he knew that Lin Yuan had sensed the uniqueness of the insect-type lifeform in the incense burner.","Sun Yin released his aura and enveloped the small incense burner. The chirping of the insect in the incense burner became more intense with a hint of struggle.","After confirming that he had controlled the insect-type creature in the incense burner, Sun Yin opened the lid.","Lin Yuan saw a small cicada that was half golden and half crimson inside the incense burner. The cicada’s wings were hidden under the membrane on its back and would occasionally be revealed as it shook. This cicada’s wings were also made of two colors, gold and red. The gold and red colors were not fixed on the cicada’s body. Instead, they were constantly blending and combining to reveal different states.","When Lin Yuan saw the continuous combination of the gold and red colors, he felt that many things that he did not understand in the past were beginning to form answers.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the cicada.","[Fey Name]: Enlightenment Cicada","[Fey Species]: Transparent-winged species/Spotted-winged species","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Comprehension Enlightenment]: Through the smell emitted by the target and its cry, it can temporarily increase the target’s comprehension of nature and the target’s own comprehension ability, greatly increasing the target’s comprehension.","[Enlightenment Protection]: During the process of enlightenment, the target can be prevented from suffering the backlash of external forces.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Indestructible Cicada]: When your body is damaged by external forces and dies, its antenna will integrate into the natural environment and become a part of it. After a period of time, it can be reborn in this environment.","Lin Yuan looked at the data with a surprised expression.","This insect-species fey called Enlightenment Cicada had a higher life rank than the Business Flourishing Flower that Lin Yuan had obtained previously.","The Enlightenment Cicada had not used the ability Comprehension Enlightenment to enhance him, yet he had already obtained such a high level of comprehension.","If the Enlightenment Cicada used its ability, Lin Yuan felt that he could easily comprehend Willpower Runes in the natural environment.","This Enlightenment Cicada was simply a good companion for the Creator!","When a Creator reached Grade 4, they needed to comprehend everything in the world. However, no matter how talented they were, their comprehension ability was still limited.","With the help of the Enlightenment Cicada, those Creators who were stuck at their grades had a chance to break through the threshold and reach a new level.","The Enlightenment Cicada’s cicada song and scent did not consume much energy. In other words, this Enlightenment Cicada could help many Creators increase their comprehension at the same time.","The first thing Lin Yuan thought of was his Hundred Questions Beast army.","Under Lin Yuan’s nurturing, the Hundred Questions Beast could indeed become a Creator. However, after becoming a Grade 3 Creator, its comprehension ability would reach the threshold, and it would be extremely difficult for it to break through. It was far more difficult for those talented Creators to raise their grades! This was the fundamental reason why the Hundred Questions Beast army had not been able to nurture Grade 4 Creators in such such a long time.","With the Enlightenment Cicada, the restriction would eventually be broken.","Apart from the skill Comprehension Enlightenment, Enlightenment Protection was a perfect combination with Genius’ exclusive skill, Highest Access Tail.","Genius obtained enlightenment from the heavens through Highest Access Tail. During the process of obtaining enlightenment from the heavens, it had to bear risks.","Once Genius suffered backlash, it would be extremely dangerous. No matter how many tails it condensed, it was still possible for it to be seriously injured or even die from the backlash.","This made Lin Yuan not dare to let Genius use Highest Access Tail.","Genius had tried to persuade Lin Yuan several times, but Lin Yuan had rejected it.","If Lin Yuan could control the Enlightenment Cicada and let it use its ability Enlightenment Protection on Genius, when Genius used Highest Access Tail, it could obtain a powerful guarantee.","The exclusive skill of the Enlightenment Cicada, Indestructible Cicada, was an extremely powerful life-saving ability. Even if the Enlightenment Cicada died, it could still use this special method to revive.","Lin Yuan was very interested in the Enlightenment Cicada but did not say anything and turned to look at Sun Yin.","Lin Yuan was a little puzzled. The Enlightenment Cicada was such an outstanding insect-species fey, so why had Sun Yin not contracted it?","Lin Yuan remembered that Sun Yin had said that he was a spirit contractor. Basically, those who had the ability to become Creators had a much higher spirit than ordinary people. Basically, all of them were spirit contractors.","Sun Yin hurriedly said when he saw Lin Yuan looking at him, “Young Master, this Enlightenment Cicada is a strange object I discovered at the edge of the abyss and the Sky Beyond the Clouds when I followed a team to explore the abyss. Speaking of which, it’s a coincidence that I discovered this Enlightenment Cicada because this Enlightenment Cicada had just awakened and happened to be controlled by me. I wonder if you’re interested in this Enlightenment Cicada? If you’re interested, I’m willing to offer this Enlightenment Cicada to you!”","Lin Yuan did not immediately reach out to take the small incense burner containing the Enlightenment Cicada. Instead, he asked Sun Yin, “Why didn’t you contract an outstanding fey like the Enlightenment Cicada yourself? As a spirit contractor, contracting the Enlightenment Cicada should be extremely helpful to you!”","Sun Yin’s expression turned bitter when he heard that. He really wanted to contract the Enlightenment Cicada but it was not that easy. Sun Yin did not have the ability to form a contract.","“Young Master, you might not know this, but this Enlightenment Cicada is connected to the world and can fuse with the surrounding environment at any time. If you want to contract the Enlightenment Cicada through spiritual energy, it’s equivalent to contracting a world. Even a Grade 6 Creator can’t contract a piece of heaven and earth with spiritual energy alone, much less a Grade 5 Creator. If I could contract the Enlightenment Cicada, I would have done so long ago. I wouldn’t have waited until now!”","Lin Yuan’s face revealed a look of understanding. So that’s what happened. No wonder the Enlightenment Cicada could reach his hands!","However, judging from the Enlightenment Cicada’s level, Sun Yin had been restricting the increase in its level.","This meant that Sun Yin had always had the idea of contracting the Enlightenment Cicada. However, as he continued to try, this idea was finally destroyed!","Apart from using his spiritual energy, Lin Yuan could also use Morbius to use Spirit Lock to contract feys.","Morbius could spirit lock this Enlightenment Cicada, and Morbius happened to have a suitable spirit lock position.","Lin Yuan did not have a Willpower Rune that was compatible with the Enlightenment Cicada but it should not be difficult for him to comprehend a Willpower rune that was compatible with it.","Lin Yuan reached out and took the small incense burner containing the Enlightenment Cicada from Sun Yin’s hand.","Sun Yin could not help but give him a reminder, “Young Master, this thing in my hand that looks like a tripod and an incense burner is made of ebony and gold threads. The Enlightenment Cicada can’t break free from the incense burner’s lid and fly out.","“However, when the lid is opened, I have to use my aura to suppress the Enlightenment Cicada. Otherwise, once the Enlightenment Cicada escapes and blends into the environment, it will be very difficult to catch it again!”","Lin Yuan smiled and extended his index finger into the small incense burner to tap the Enlightenment Cicada’s gold and red wings.","Morbius spirit locked the Enlightenment Cicada and made it Lin Yuan’s contracted lifeform.","Sun Yin sensed the connection between Lin Yuan and the Enlightenment Cicada and looked at Lin Yuan in shock. Lin Yuan had contracted the Enlightenment Cicada so easily when he had failed to do so?","Sun Yin knew that Lin Yuan could contract this Enlightenment Cicada because he had a special trump card.","It was definitely not appropriate for him to ask about Lin Yuan’s trump card.","After Lin Yuan contracted the Enlightenment Cicada, he immediately felt a sense of intimacy from it.","The first thing Lin Yuan thought of when he saw the Enlightenment Cicada was actually Chimey.","Chimey had already evolved from Sovereign/Creation VIII to Sovereign X/Eternal XII.","Lin Yuan had obtained a large number of higher-level strange flames in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and he had given them to Chimey.","Chimey’s evolution in grade became a guaranteed matter.","Lin Yuan summoned Chimey and immediately used True Data to check on it.","[Fey Name]: Command Phoenix Dawn Day Sparrow","[Fey Species]: Sound sparrow genus/sound sparrow species","[Fey Grade]: High Sovereign (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Sound/Light","[Fey Quality]: Eternal XII","Abilities:","[Phoenix Cry]: The power of main phoenix will combine the phoenix cry into musical notes that will turn into birds. The birds will be able to pass through almost anything. After coming into contact with a target, the phoenix cry within the musical notes will stun and disturb the target. When the musical notes are attacked or blocked, they will separate into more birds.","[New Day of Light]: The exquisite main phoenix blood and sunlight will solidify into a sun. Under the light of the sun, its abilities will rapidly be absorbed by light. When the light is used up, it can replenish phoenix blood and soul.","[Phoenix Breed Input Sound]: By tempering the phoenix-species fey’s soul into phoenix breed and injecting it into the body of an avian fey, the avian fey will gain the intelligence and partial abilities of the phoenix-species fey. By setting the phoenix breed will be set alight and increase the power of the musical notes that had transformed into birds.","[Falling Sky New Day]: Drop the sun in its body to create a territory full of sun energy. When the sun energy depletes, it will temporarily be immune to most physical and elemental damage.","[Speak Spirit Singer]: Enter song into the soul. By using up the phoenix breed’s ability to bring song into reality, the willpowers and effects in the song can be an advantage or disadvantage to bless its friends or curse its enemies.","[Clear Zither Change Voice]: Place an anchor on something that could release light-type energy. By controlling this entity or whatever was connected to this entity, one’s voice or voice-type ability can be applied to this entity and dispersed with this entity at the center.","[Sun Projection]: Its bloodline will be transformed into a rising sun and projected onto that world’s original sun. The sun power will provide it with an overall boost. During this process, it will be closely linked to the sun. Once over, it will enter a very weak state.","[Nine Suns Cry]: When the suns formed within oneself resonates with the celestial body, the suns will extract energy from the celestial body to form nine suns. The nine suns can project their clear cries and create a domain filled with solar energy for themselves.","[Sound Reversal Galaxy]: Let the birds formed by every note inherit the power of the celestial body. These birds carry the power of the celestial body to form the milky way and use the power of the milky way to wash over the target. Every bird formed by every note has the effect of eclipsing the enemy’s energy.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Double Sun Reins]: The stronger the power of the sun it controls, the stronger its ability to communicate with other suns. According to the strength of the reins, it can offer a song to the sun and lend energy from the other suns to replenish itself.","[New Sun Body]: Fuse with the sun it produces and enter the Non-Burning Nirvana World Sparrow. Its abilities will not change but it will be able to switch attributes.","[Sound Spirit Sacred Hall]: Its own musical notes will form a sacred hall. Within the sacred hall, all of the phenomena contained in sound will become reality. When the main body enters the sacred hall, the effects will be able to spread outwards by using the energy in one’s body.","[Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree]: Separate a portion of its soul and bloodline from the parasol tree it resides in. When it accidentally dies, the soul and bloodline left on the platane wood will be activated, forming an embryo for it to reincarnate. After absorbing enough energy, it will revive in a new form.","[Rising Sun Majesty]: When the new sun body transforms into the human form of the Non-Burning Nirvana World Sparrow, the human form has a powerful deterrent effect on other living beings. It will eliminate the resistance and stubbornness of other units. It will deter the target while tempting the target to develop faith in itself.","[Master of Light and Sound]: Use light and sound in all aspects, allowing light to support the conduction of sound, allowing sound to have the characteristic of emitting light. When one type of energy increases, the other type of energy will also increase."]},{"number":3033,"title":"Chapter 3033 Chimey’s Opportunity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3033 Chimey’s Opportunity!","....","When Chimey was in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it liked to exist in its original form. In an environment like the Spirit Lock spatial zone, which Chimey was especially familiar with, Chimey felt more at ease in its original form.","However, once Chimey went out to meet strangers, it would transform into its human form and appear in the most perfect form.","Chimey was not as good-looking as Purple Afterglow, but it was not inferior to the Death Demon Concubine Beast. Chimey was on par with the Death Demon Concubine Beast in terms of appearance. They just had different flavors.","The Death Demon Concubine Beast was naturally charming. Every frown and smile was enough to charm all living beings. It was like a concubine that could bring disaster to the country and the people.","On the other hand, Chimey’s facial features were exquisite to the extreme. It looked very beautiful and had a hint of youth and invincibility. It was just like a beautiful girl who could achieve full marks in both temperament and appearance. It was extremely energetic, but also extremely steady and elegant.","Chimey’s appearance was completely compatible with Chimey’s voice. Chimey was wearing a gold-blue dress with feathers on its head. It was unforgettable.","If there was no outsider like Sun Yin around, Chimey would have jumped on Lin Yuan.","After interacting with Chimey for such a long time, Autumn and Winter were already completely familiar with each other. Because Chimey was Lin Yuan’s contracted beast, they treated Chimey very well. It was like how an elder would treat its own child.","Chimey raised its beautiful eyes and looked at Sun Yin. When it saw Sun Yin nod at it politely, it reached out and tugged at Lin Yuan’s sleeve.","“Yuan, it’s been a while since you played with me in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Genius is especially busy now. Previously, Genius still had time to accompany me. Now, Genius has spent all its time on the Hundred Questions Beast army. My grade is stuck at Sovereign/Eternal XII.","“Because I need to improve my comprehension of sound and light to advance, I’m afraid it’ll be very difficult for me to obtain a chance to evolve in a short period of time! Why don’t you let me stay by your side and accompany Chu Ci in the future? Chu Ci used to play with me every day in the Spirit Lock spatial zone!”","Chimey sounded like it was wheedling to Lin Yuan, but Lin Yuan knew that it was really complaining that he had called Chu Ci away.","In the past, Chimey had stayed on the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree’s nest that was surrounded by branches to increase its strength.","When Chimey was busy, it did not care if there was a playmate accompanying it. Now, Chimey was completely free. Without a playmate, Chimey was about to die of loneliness.","Lin Yuan had brought Chu Ci out to train her and Chimey clearly did not need such training.","Lin Yuan raised his hand to touch Chimey’s hair and said to it, “Chimey, I have a way to improve your comprehension of light and sound. You will be able to complete your evolution very soon. After your grade advances, I don’t plan to let you stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone anymore.","“At that time, I’ll plant the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree on the Four Seasons Mountain. Don’t you like singing and going to concerts? At that point, hundreds of millions of people will be listening to you every day!”","Lin Yuan originally had the idea of using Chimey to increase the faith power produced in the faith country.","Chimey could gain a large number of fans by singing in the faith country. While these fans loved Chimey, they would also produce more faith power because of Chimey’s existence.","Lin Yuan intended for Chimey to become the spokesperson of the faith country, especially since Chimey had obtained a new exclusive skill called Rising Sun Majesty. It allowed Chimey to dispel the stubbornness and resistance of the listeners during the singing process as long as it transformed into the human form of the Non-Burning Nirvana World Sparrow. It could also induce the target to believe in it.","The faith country looked harmonious because Lin Yuan had arranged for a large number of demon insects to patrol the faith country.","These patrolling demon insects could ensure the safety of the faith country to the greatest extent.","The stability that was obtained through this method was actually not reliable. Without these demon insects and control methods, the stability of the faith country would collapse in an extremely short period of time.","Lin Yuan was very clear about this but he did not have a suitable solution at the moment.","However, now that Chimey had the Rising Sun Majesty, Chimey could sing under the circumstances of using the Rising Sun Majesty. It could give psychological hints to those restless fellows in the faith country and eliminate their resistance and stubbornness.","This kind of hint was carried out subtly. If it was induced for a long time, the safety of the faith country would definitely increase steadily!","Apart from Rising Sun Majesty, Chimey also obtained a skill called Sound Reversal Galaxy.","Unlike Rising Sun Majesty, a functional exclusive skill, Sound Reversal Galaxy was an extremely pure offensive ability.","Every note that Chimey released could transform into birds. Chimey would use these birds to transform into notes to attack.","However, Sound Reversal Galaxy allowed these birds to inherit the power of the celestial body and use the power of the celestial body to enhance these birds, making them form a galaxy of stars to wash away the enemy.","These birds had extremely powerful combat abilities. Apart from being able to cause damage to the enemy, they could also use their unique celestial eclipse skill to reduce the energy in the enemy’s body, thus depriving the enemy’s target of the chance to engage in a prolonged battle.","As for the other exclusive skill, Master of Light and Sound, Chimey could enhance the conductivity of sound through the light elements it controlled and use sound to create light.","It allowed Chimey to obtain more light elements and notes during the battle.","Whether it was the light elements or the notes, Chimey’s control over another type of energy would also increase.","This ability could increase the upper limit of Chimey’s abilities as Chimey’s abilities continued to increase.","Chimey’s evolution path was not chosen by Lin Yuan, but by Chimey itself.","Not only did Chimey not give up on sound-type, but it also formed a perfect link between sound-type and light-type.","Actually, Lin Yuan had always treated Chimey as his daughter. He did not have much expectations for Chimey as long as it was healthy and happy!","Chimey’s eyes lit up when it heard Lin Yuan’s words. Chimey actually liked to interact with people outside more than in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","In particular, Lin Yuan had promised Chimey that it could freely pursue its singing career outside.","All the songs that Chimey sung in the beginning had been taught by Lin Yuan. However, as Chimey became more and more proficient in music knowledge, it could now compose lyrics and compositions on its own!","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, Chimey’s music was actually not inferior to the music created by the heavenly king and queen from his previous life.","“If that’s the case, Yuan, that’s great! I haven’t seen Wen Yu in a long time. Will I always be able to see Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Red Thorn, and Elegance over there?”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Of course. When you get there, you’ll always have a chance to meet them. When we get there, no matter how busy I am, you won’t feel bored anymore! But before that, Chimey, you have to increase your strength first.","“If you can reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, your bloodline will probably undergo a transformation. Once your bloodline transforms, all your abilities will be enhanced from their original foundation!”","Chimey said confidently, “Yuan, actually, I can already feel that my bloodline is at a critical point and can undergo a metamorphosis at any time. If I advance to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, my bloodline transformation will basically become a sure bet. There won’t be much uncertainty. The changes during my evolution this time might be greater than the previous changes and I’ll most likely suffer a lot.”","After saying that, Chimey stuck out its tongue.","It could be said that Chimey and Genius had to endure the reorganization of their bodies due to the transformation of their bloodline every time they reached the juncture of major bloodline metamorphosis.","Although this process could not be considered a narrow escape, it was indeed abnormally difficult.","Every time he saw Genius and Chimey evolve, Lin Yuan’s heart would ache for them.","“Chimey, you will definitely suffer a little. But with the resources I’ve provided for you, you don’t have to worry about your safety. As long as you survive the transformation of your bloodline, you will definitely have better development in the future!”","Lin Yuan asked the Enlightenment Cicada to use its ability Comprehension Enlightenment on Chimey.","Chimey was already at the juncture of evolution. It was only one layer of comprehension away from evolving in grade and quality.","The Enlightenment Cicada let out a soft cry, and right on the heels of that, a golden-red aura enveloped Chimey.","Chimey entered a state of epiphany in an instant. Chimey felt that its mastery of light and sound had increased by another level in a short period of time! The thin barrier seemed to be about to collapse at any moment.","Sun Yin summoned Chimey from Lin Yuan and looked at it. The best way to see a spirit contractor’s foundation was to see the quality of the feys contracted by the spirit contractor.","Through the quality of the feys contracted by the spirit contractor, one could understand the foundation of a spirit contractor to the greatest extent.","The moment Sun Yin saw Chimey, he realized that it was extraordinary.","A sound and light-type dual-element fey like Chimey did exist in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. However, their bloodlines were not as powerful as Chimey’s.","Chimey’s bloodline suppressed the phoenix bloodline. Chimey’s bloodline allowed Chimey to use the phoenix bloodline as its servant.","Apart from the bloodline, Sun Yin could also tell that Chimey had been nurtured very well. Only those feys that had used top-notch resources since they were young could refine their bodies to such an extent. This also allowed their bodies to accomodate so much energy.","“Young Master, the fey you contracted is preparing to break through to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. If it can have light-type and sound-type treasures, not only will it suffer less during the bloodline transformation process, but it can also further strengthen some of its abilities during evolution!","After saying that, Sun Yin took out two items from his spatial equipment. One of them was a few fragments that emitted light. They looked like the eggshells of some avian species. It emitted an extremely powerful bloodline power above the main phoenix.","The other thing was a dark silver tree stump with many ripples on it. When the wind blew on the tree stump, it immediately played an extremely psychedelic sound.","Lin Yuan used True Data to examine the two items and immediately knew what they were.","The eggshell that was emitting light was the remnant body of the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix that had been forcefully wiped out during its nirvana.","It was not just an eggshell formed by the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix after it hatched. The Holy Light Lofty Phoenix was a fey of legend. Its bloodline basically stood at the peak of the light-type ancestral phoenixes.","With Sun Yin’s strength, he did not have the ability to forcefully kill a Holy Light Lofty Phoenix. This eggshell should be a treasure that Sun Yin had obtained by chance.","As for the dark silver wooden stake, it was left behind by the energy gathered in Imagination Suzuki body when it died.","The Imagination Suzuki’s level was not as high as the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix, but it was not much weaker either.","Resources of this level were not something that could be obtained with strength. Instead, it depended on opportunities.","These two items were beneficial to Chimey’s bloodline transformation, grade, and quality.","Lin Yuan quickly thanked Sun Yin, “Senior Sun Yin, thank you for giving these resources to me so that I can use them to improve my fey.”","Sun Yin’s heart warmed when he heard Lin Yuan’s gratitude. The fact that Lin Yuan would thank him when he took out these two spiritual ingredients meant that Lin Yuan did not treat him as a servant. Otherwise, he would not have been so polite to him!","Sun Yin thought to himself that with Lin Yuan treating him with such an attitude, as long as he did his best by Lin Yuan’s side, he would definitely benefit greatly in the future.","“Young Master, you’re too polite. I happen to have resources that your feys can use. How can I not take them out?”","Sun Yin suddenly sensed an intense energy fluctuation coming from Chimey’s body.","“Young Master, your fey’s bloodline has already begun to transform. Now is the best time to give your fey the tree stump of the Imagination Suzuki and the eggshell of the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix.”","When Sun Yin spoke, Lin Yuan had already thrown the wooden stake and the eggshell to Chimey.","Lin Yuan then took out a large number of spirit qi crystals.","After being enveloped by the energy emitted from Chimey’s body, the tree stump and the eggshell started to dissolve into Chimey’s body.","Chimey expressed its desire for pure spirit qi. Light elements and sound elements created elemental storms around Chimey.","This was convenient for Chimey to crush these spirit qi crystals to absorb the pure spirit qi inside.","Chimey could no longer maintain its human form and transformed into its main body. A sun appeared in the sky above Chimey’s head and resonated with the celestial bodies in the sky dome.","Chimey’s feathers were blue-gold in color. At this moment, Chimey’s golden feathers, which were undergoing a bloodline metamorphosis, emitted a bright light. Blue feathers began to appear in different shades. At the end of each feather, there were faint light spots that resonated with the rising sun above Chimey’s head."]},{"number":3034,"title":"Chapter 3034 Nirvana Phoenix Sacred Nest!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3034 Nirvana Phoenix Sacred Nest!","Chimey’s feathers were changing because its bloodline was transforming.","....","Chimey could have successfully transformed even without the Imagination Suzuki’s tree stump and the eggshell of the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix. Now, with these two precious spiritual ingredients to support Chimey’s bloodline advancement, Chimey’s bloodline metamorphosis was a sure bet.","Lin Yuan could feel Chimey’s pain in the light.","Chimey’s body was constantly disintegrating and recombining. However, Lin Yuan could not help Chimey with its bloodline metamorphosis. He could only provide it with resources.","Sun Yin knew that there was a Grade 6 Creator presiding over Sky City but was unaware that the Grade 6 Creator resources that Lin Yuan had promised were actually produced by himself.","Sun Yin could tell that Lin Yuan was nervous about Chimey’s evolution.","“Young Master, although I’m only a beginner Grade 5 Creator, my foundation is extremely solid. With me around, it won’t be a problem for your fey’s grade to evolve! If there’s an emergency later, I’ll help. In addition, I have a lot of potions here. They should be useful.”","Lin Yuan did not reject Sun Yin’s good intentions. Chimey’s journey today could be said to be a path that Lin Yuan had helped Chimey to find.","No one had walked this path before, so it was very likely that there would be serious problems if there was a mistake when walking down this path.","With the help of Sun Yin, a traditional Grade 5 Creator, it would be much more convenient to deal with it.","“The possibility of an accident is not high. But if there really is an accident, we still need your help!”","Sun Yin smiled when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. He did not need Lin Yuan to affirm him. Sun Yin knew very well how capable he was.","Lin Yuan had many Grade 5 Creators under his command, and there were even intermediate Grade 5 Creators among them.","No matter how talented he was, there was still a gap in ability between him and those Grade 5 Creators.","Sun Yin did not need Lin Yuan’s affirmation. What he really needed was Lin Yuan’s willingness to help him. This was the most important thing to him.","Now that he had the chance to help Lin Yuan’s fey bloodline evolve, it meant that Lin Yuan trusted him.","“Young Master, don’t worry. I will pay attention to your fey’s condition. Speaking of which, Young Master, your fey is truly outstanding. I have rarely seen such an outstanding fey before.”","Lin Yuan knew that with Sun Yin’s ability, he could see through Chimey with a single glance. A fey that had not even reached the Divine Kingdom level had no secrets in front of a Grade 5 Creator.","Lin Yuan had not interacted with Sun Yin for long, but he knew that Sun Yin was extremely arrogant and would not lie through his teeth.","In Sun Yin’s eyes, Chimey was indeed outstanding. This made Lin Yuan feel proud.","Chimey had yet to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. It still had a lot of potential in the future. Lin Yuan believed that Chimey would definitely have a bright future.","When it came to Chimey’s newly obtained divine kingdom ability, Lin Yuan hoped that Chimey would either obtain one that could increase its strength or one that could accelerate the acquisition of faith power.","Of these two divine kingdom abilities, one was extremely beneficial to Chimey and the other was extremely beneficial to Sky City.","Chimey’s willpower was extremely strong, but it had added two things—the tree stump of the Imagination Suzuki and the eggshell of the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix.","These two things caused Chimey’s bloodline to improve further. This caused the bloodline changes to intensify. The restructuring of its body was even more exquisite than before.","Chimey relied on its strong willpower to persevere. It did not let out a miserable cry that worried Lin Yuan.","Chimey only hoped that it could sing a happy song.","Sun Yin originally thought that he needed to provide Chimey with a few bottles of potions that could temporarily increase its mental strength and stabilize its mind.","The tree stump of the Imagination Suzuki and the eggshell of the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix were extremely high-level spiritual ingredients. These two spiritual ingredients were extremely effective in promoting the transformation of the sparrow-species bloodline.","However, the sparrow that Lin Yuan had contracted managed to survive with its own strength and successfully completed its transformation.","Lin Yuan saw that the new sun produced by Chimey’s head was much brighter than before, and its resonance with the main celestial body was getting stronger.","The light spots at the ends of Chimey’s feathers made it look even more luxurious. Chimey’s feathers were at least twice as long as before. Its body shape was even more elegant than before.","However, Chimey’s sparrow bloodline was still forcefully suppressing the main phoenix bloodline in its body. It did not allow Chimey’s bloodline to be below the phoenix bloodline because of the addition of the eggshell of the Holy Light Lofty Phoenix.","Sensing the successful transformation of Chimey’s bloodline, Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Chimey.","[Fey Name]: Command Sacred Sun Sparrow","[Fey Species]: Sound sparrow genus/sound sparrow species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Sound/Light","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Phoenix Cry]: The power of the main phoenix will combine the phoenix cry into musical notes that will turn into birds. The birds will be able to pass through almost anything. After coming into contact with a target, the phoenix cry within the musical notes will stun and disturb the target. When the musical notes are attacked or blocked, they will separate into more birds.","[New Day of Light]: The exquisite main phoenix blood and sunlight will solidify into a sun. Under the light of the sun, its abilities will rapidly be absorbed by light. When the light is used up, it can replenish phoenix blood and soul.","[Phoenix Breed Input Sound]: By tempering the phoenix-species fey’s soul into phoenix breed and injecting it into the body of an avian fey, the avian fey will gain the intelligence and partial abilities of the phoenix-species fey. By setting the phoenix breed will be set alight and increase the power of the musical notes that had transformed into birds.","[Falling Sky New Day]: Drop the sun in its body to create a territory full of sun energy. When the sun energy depletes, it will temporarily be immune to most physical and elemental damage.","[Speak Spirit Singer]: Enter song into the soul. By using up the phoenix breed’s ability to bring song into reality, the willpowers and effects in the song can be an advantage or disadvantage to bless its friends or curse its enemies.","[Clear Zither Change Voice]: Place an anchor on something that could release light-type energy. By controlling this entity or whatever was connected to this entity, one’s voice or voice-type ability can be applied to this entity and dispersed with this entity at the center.","[Sun Projection]: Its bloodline will be transformed into a rising sun and projected onto that world’s original sun. The sun power will provide it with an overall boost. During this process, it will be closely linked to the sun. Once over, it will enter a very weak state.","[Nine Suns Cry]: When the suns formed within oneself resonates with the celestial body, the suns will extract energy from the celestial body to form nine suns. The nine suns can project their clear cries and create a domain filled with solar energy for themselves.","[Sound Reversal Galaxy]: Let the birds formed by every note inherit the power of the celestial body. These birds carry the power of the celestial body to form the milky way and use the power of the milky way to wash over the target. Every bird formed by every note has the effect of eclipsing the enemy’s energy.","[Phoenix Imagination]: Strengthens the phoenix seed through musical notes, causing the phoenix seed to materialize into a phoenix beast of the same grade as itself. It will also stimulate the bloodline of these phoenix beasts and control them to fight for it (During the process of casting Phoenix Imagination, it will be unable to move).","Exclusive Skill:`","[Double Sun Reins]: The stronger the power of the sun it controls, the stronger its ability to communicate with other suns. According to the strength of the reins, it can offer a song to the sun and lend energy from the other suns to replenish itself.","[New Sun Body]: Fuse with the sun it produces and enter the Non-Burning Nirvana World Sparrow. Its abilities will not change but it will be able to switch attributes.","[Sound Spirit Sacred Hall]: Its own musical notes will form a sacred hall. Within the sacred hall, all of the phenomena contained in sound will become reality. When the main body enters the sacred hall, the effects will be able to spread outwards by using the energy in one’s body.","[Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree]: Separate a portion of its soul and bloodline from the parasol tree it resides in. When it accidentally dies, the soul and bloodline left on the platane wood will be activated, forming an embryo for it to reincarnate. After absorbing enough energy, it will revive in a new form.","[Rising Sun Majesty]: When the new sun body transforms into the human form of the Non-Burning Nirvana World Sparrow, the human form has a powerful deterrent effect on other living beings. It will eliminate the resistance and stubbornness of other units. It will deter the target while tempting the target to develop faith in itself.","[Master of Light and Sound]: Use light and sound in all aspects, allowing light to support the conduction of sound, allowing sound to have the characteristic of emitting light. When one type of energy increases, the other type of energy will also increase.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Nirvana Phoenix Sacred Nest]: When killing lifeforms with pure-blooded phoenix bloodlines, the ability of lifeforms with pure-blooded phoenix bloodlines to undergo nirvana will be stripped away. In turn, these living beings with pure-blooded phoenix bloodlines will be transformed into embryos in their divine kingdoms. The phoenix embryos in these divine kingdoms can increase their strength and the strength of their phoenix seeds through the strength of their bloodlines.","Chimey had successfully evolved from Suzerain X/Eternal XII to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Under True Data, Chimey’s name changed from Command Phoenix New Day Sparrow to Command Sacred Sun Sparrow. It obtained a new ability and the ability of a divine kingdom.","Chimey’s abilities and divine kingdom abilities would increase its strength. Chimey could use Phoenix Breed Input Sound to refine the soul of a phoenix-species fey into a phoenix seed. These phoenix species would inherit the intelligence and some abilities of phoenix-species feys.","Phoenix Imagination was a further application of these phoenix seeds, allowing them to materialize into phoenixes of the same grade as themselves.","The phoenix bloodline was as elite as the dragon-species bloodline. Many species with pure-blooded phoenix bloodlines were in high positions on the Species Ranking all year round.","These phoenixes were extremely powerful, but Chimey could use Phoenix Imagination to stimulate the bloodlines of these phoenixes and strengthen them.","There was a special mineral vein in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that could produce a crystal called the Soul Capturing Crystal. The Soul Capturing Crystal could be used to seal the soul of a lifeform, as long as the soul of this living being died and was in an ownerless state. The Soul-Capturing Crystal was able to detain this soul in a stable manner.","For example, the souls of living beings with powerful bloodlines had always been a popular trading resource. There were many phoenix-species feys for sale in Fortune Treasure Palace.","It was very easy for Chimey to condense a phoenix seed.","If Chimey condensed tens of thousands of phoenix seeds, it could really strengthen the phoenix seeds with musical notes like the name of the ability, forming the scene of tens of thousands of phoenixes flying in the sky.","This ability allowed Chimey to lord over opponents of the same level.","Of course, Chimey needed to expend a lot of resources to do this.","Not to mention that the souls of phoenix-species feys were extremely expensive, Lin Yuan would also need to invest numerous resources in Chimey to refine these phoenix seeds.","Nirvana Phoenix Nest was also a powerful suppression ability against phoenix-species feys. Chimey could deprive those phoenix-species feys of their nirvana powers with the divine kingdom ability. The pure-blooded phoenixes were most proud of their nirvana powers.","Every time the Species Ranking was rearranged, those pure-blooded phoenix species relied on their rebirth abilities to ascend to high positions step by step.","This made many more powerful species unwilling to fight with species with pure-blooded phoenix blood. Those pure-blooded phoenixes who had been at a disadvantage many times could still exhaust their opponents to death.","However, when those pure-blooded phoenixes came face to face with Chimey, not only would they be stripped of their nirvana powers, but they would also be transformed into embryos in Chimey’s divine kingdom after they died. The stronger the bloodline of these embryos, the greater the increase in Chimey’s strength. At the same time, it could strengthen those phoenix seeds.","Lin Yuan looked at Chimey, which had just completed its bloodline transformation, and thought, Back then, Chimey was a little fellow that would rather die than submit to the Luan bloodline. Now, it has become a nemesis of phoenixes.","While Lin Yuan was observing Chimey, Sun Yin was also observing Chimey.","As he observed Chimey, Sun Yin could not help but reveal a shocked expression. He did not expect Chimey’s divine kingdom to be able to suppress the phoenix species so much. If the powerful phoenix species on the Species Ranking knew of Lin Yuan’s fey, they would definitely chase after it."]},{"number":3035,"title":"Chapter 3035: Etiquette of the First Bite","paragraphs":["Chapter 3035: Etiquette of the First Bite","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Sun Yin knew that Lin Yuan had only lived for a few decades. Even if he was from a large faction, it was likely he did not know much about the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Sun Yin felt that he had to supervise Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, this fey of yours has a special ability. Once its divine kingdom’s ability is discovered by those powerful pure-blooded phoenixes, they will definitely take some targeted actions. You need to avoid arousing suspicion. There’s no need to start a conflict with those pure-blooded phoenixes because of a fey you contracted.”","Sun Yin’s words let Lin Yuan know that he was really thinking from his own standpoint.","If those pure-blooded phoenixes knew of Chimey’s existence, they would definitely choose to attack Chimey.","Lin Yuan had already thought of this, and Autumn and Winter had already reminded him as well.","“Thank you for your information. I will pay attention to this in the future and won’t let Chimey appear in front of pure-blooded phoenixes easily. However, in order to help Chimey increase its strength in the future, we have to hunt pure-blooded phoenixes with powerful bloodlines so that its divine kingdom can form more embryos.”","After Chimey completed the bloodline transformation, it reverted to its human form. At that moment, Chimey was much more exquisite than before, and its aura had changed quite a bit.","When one’s appearance reached a certain level, their aura was the best catalyst for charm.","Chimey skipped over to Lin Yuan and happily looked up at him.","“Yuan, I’m much stronger than before. Moreover, when I sing, I can use my new ability to create an especially good stage effect.”","Lin Yuan could not help but pinch Chimey’s cheeks helplessly.","When he looked at Chimey’s new abilities and divine kingdom abilities, he wanted to use them in battle. However, Chimey was thinking about the stage effects that these abilities could show.","Chimey treated Phoenix Imagination as a way to create special effects.","After speaking to Lin Yuan, Chimey came to Chu Ci’s side and played with her arm.","It seemed to want to stay by Chu Ci’s side and not return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan knew that Chimey had suffocated in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, so he said with a smile, “Chimey, if you want to train outside with us, there will only be four spots when you enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors in the","Scarlet Territory.","“You’ll still have to return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone. The Land of Bloodian Ancestors is too dangerous. Autumn and Winter can’t take care of so many people.”","Chimey had stayed in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for a long time and was very curious about the outside world. Especially now that its grade and bloodline had just increased, it was very suitable for it to travel outside and take a look.","Chimey was neither insensible nor disobedient. At critical moments, Chimey would not cause trouble for Lin Yuan.","“Yuan, I heard you say that humans in the Sky Beyond the Clouds are no different from us feys. Don’t worry. I won’t cause you any trouble. When necessary, I will enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Furthermore, if we encounter those pure-blooded phoenixes, I might be able to help you!”","Chimey had just heard Sun Yin’s words and had a good impression of the person who took out those two high-end spiritual ingredients for it.","Lin Yuan also instructed Chimey to try its best to hide its abilities.","However, Chimey was still willing to meet those powerful pure-blooded phoenixes from the bottom of its heart. That was because every time Chimey encountered a pure-blooded phoenix and killed it, it could use the power of its divine kingdom to increase its own strength.","Lin Yuan turned his attention back to the Enlightenment Cicada.","Before comprehending the Willpower Rune suitable for the Enlightenment Cicada, Lin Yuan had no way to nurture it.","While Lin Yuan and the others rushed to the Scarlet Territory, Qin Yu presided over the Elisa clan’s territory.","Lhalu and Fan Qia, Qin Yu’s two right-hand men, had already ended their seclusion. Lhalu and Fan Qia’s lifespans were about to end, but Qin Yu had bestowed them with her queen’s essence blood, allowing them to extend their lifespans.","Lin Yuan had not provided Qin Yu with a Lifespan Mouse yet, so she had her own considerations.","Even if it was someone that he had already controlled and who submitted to him, Lin Yuan would not casually reward them with Lifespan Mouse. Lin Yuan only intended to provide the Lifespan Mouse to Sky City’s core members and the Creators.","If Lin Yuan gave the Lifespan Mouse to Qin Yu and she gave it away as a reward it, the news would inevitably be leaked.","After Qin Yu’s bloodline broke through and she became a queen, she took over the affairs of the Elisa clan, overseeing all the matters.","Not only were Lhalu and Fan Qia not unhappy that Qin Yu had taken away the management rights of the Elisa clan, but they were very happy. Even now, they were still immersed in the joy of being transformed by Qin Yu’s bloodline.","“Lordess, your bloodline has successfully transformed this time. Our Elisa clan has also become a clan with a Bloodian Oueen. Our Elisa clan has a chance to snatch the opening of the Land of the Blood Ancestor this time.","“I wonder if you have any thoughts of snatching it, Lordess? If you’re interested in competing for it, Fan Qia and I can help you!”","Every time the Blood Ancestor’s Land opened, it presented endless opportunities, including a wealth of spiritual ingredients capable of enhancing the Bloodian bloodline.","Apart from being loyal to Qin Yu, Lhalu and Fan Qia had basically invested all their efforts into the Elisa clan.","Lhalu and Fan Qia really hoped that the Elisa clan could develop better and better. The opening of the Blood Ancestor’s Land could be said to be the best opportunity.","Previously, the Elisa clan did not have a chance to compete, but now, they did.","Lhalu and Fan Qia knew that doing so might be very risky, but Lhalu and Fan Qia were both willing to risk their lives for the development of the Elisa clan.","Qin Yu knew Lhalu and Fan Qia’s intentions but did not agree to their request and suggestion.","“The opening of the Land of the Blood Ancestor this time is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for the Elisa clan. We definitely have to fight for it. It’s just not right to send just you two. With your abilities, there’s a high chance that you’ll encounter danger in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","“I don’t know if you remember that I told you that I was able to break through my bloodline and become a Bloodian Queen because I was lucky enough to obtain the help of a Lord. I contacted this Lord when the Land of Bloodian Ancestors opened this time.","“This Lord will send someone to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors with me to explore it. With this Lord’s help, we will definitely gain a lot in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. You only need to stay in the territory of the Elisa clan and manage the situation of the Elisa clan while I’m away.","“Throughout this time, the Elisa clan has welcomed numerous dependent species into our territory, embracing them as part of our own. However, I suspect that among them may be spies from rival species. The other clans with queen bloodlines are closely monitoring us, so we must investigate our internal members.","“My absence presents the ideal opportunity for this investigation. You must seize this chance!”","Lhalu and Fan Qia had heard Qin Yu mention the big shot that had helped Qin Yu’s bloodline transform more than once.","Be it Lhalu or Fan Qia, they were very grateful to that person.","Lhalu and Fan Qia did not consider it a bad thing for Qin Yu to seek help from outsiders to explore the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors.","The various Bloodian clans had always been extremely selfish, and the Elisa clan was no exception.","Rather than worrying about outsiders dividing the overall benefits of the Bloodians, they were more concerned about whether the Elisa clan could obtain significant gains. As long as the Elisa clan acquired something valuable, they did not mind the loss of the Bloodians’ overall benefits.","“Lordess Qin Yu, if you don’t need us to go to the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors, let us stay with the Elisa clan. We will definitely complete the mission you gave us. We are already familiar with managing the Elisa clan!","“However, catching the spy requires careful consideration and is not easy. We will do our best to find ways to ensure the spy is caught! If these spies belong to a powerful species and it’s not convenient for us to attack them, we will confirm their identities so that you can take subsequent actions.”","Lhalu and Fan Qia had always been reliable. Qin Yu was relieved to hear their words.","This time, Qin Yu actually did not expect the Elisa clan to obtain any benefits in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","The Elisa clan’s fortuitous opportunity had never been in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Instead, Lin Yuan had invested in the Elisa clan.","As long as the trip to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors ensured that Lin Yuan would gain a lot, the Elisa clan would not have to worry about not having a future.","“Remember, investigating spies is the first priority of the Elisa clan. If these spies can’t be discovered, the Elisa clan will no longer have any secrets in the eyes of the other clans with the queen bloodlines. The Lord who has helped me many times is very low-key. This Lord definitely doesn’t want to expose himself to other Bloodians. Lhalu, Fan Qia, that Lord is the foundation of our Elisa clan’s rise.”","Qin Yu thought for a moment and decided to inform Lhalu and Fan Qia of this situation. She did not hide anything from them.","Lhalu and Fan Qia would be her most important right-hand men for a long time to come.","Letting Lhalu and Fan Qia understand the situation would make it easier for the Elisa clan to develop in the future.","Qin Yu was very glad she had Lhalu and Fan Qia, two subordinates she could completely trust.","“Lhalu, Fan Qia, you two will follow me to meet this Lord later.”","Qin Yu had mentioned Lhalu and Fan Qia to Lin Yuan more than once. She felt it was time for them to meet him.","Lhalu and Fan Qia both recognized this meeting as a significant opportunity.","Neither Lhalu nor Fan Qia were the types to show off. They were focused on making a good impression on this influential figure. As long as they succeeded, they would be content.","Beyond that, they had no grand expectations. In the future, it would be Qin Yu who would primarily communicate with Lin Yuan.","Qin Yu had not seen Lin Yuan for a long time. This time, she was determined to make a strong impression.","Qin Yu was eager to eliminate the spies planted by other queen clans in the Elisa clan, not because she feared they would hinder its development.","The Elisa clan had also planted spies in other Bloodian clans over the years.","Before Qin Yu became the current Bloodian Queen, the clan had already been doing this.","With Qin Yu now leading, the Elisa clan had become even more aggressive in planting spies.","It had become an unspoken rule among the clans to infiltrate each other with spies.","Qin Yu chose to break this unspoken rule because she didn’t want other Bloodian clans to know about Lin Yuan.","She feared the other Bloodian Queens would try to approach Lin Yuan.","These queens could offer Lin Yuan similar value. If Lin Yuan took them under his command, he might no longer need her for other matters in the Scarlet Territory. Qin Yu wanted to limit Lin Yuan’s interactions with the other Bloodian Queens as much as possible.","Instead of waiting at the Elisa clan’s main residence, Qin Yu led Lhalu and Fan Qia to the periphery of the Scarlet Territory.","It was extremely rare for a Bloodian Queen to welcome someone in the Scarlet Territory. Qin Yu’s trip was highly secretive, and she eliminated all the Bloodians she encountered along the way.","Lin Yuan returned to the Scarlet Territory after many days. Everything was the same as before, so he was not surprised.","A few months felt like a long time to him, but it was only a blink of an eye for the Bloodians.","Lin Yuan had activated his Bloodian bloodline through his Body of All Spirits and was now a genuine pure-blooded Bloodian.","Despite this, Lin Yuan continued to use his Black Elise identity.","Autumn and Winter served as Lin Yuan’s guards, while Chu Ci acted as his blood servant.","Chimey had already returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Chimey disliked the smell of blood in the Scarlet Territory and was very particular about its environment. Upon arriving and smelling the blood, Chimey abandoned the idea of training.","When they reached the agreed meeting place, Qin Yu immediately strode forward to welcome Lin Yuan.","In front of Lhalu and Fan Qia, she elegantly bowed to Lin Yuan with folded hands in the manner reserved for pure-blooded Bloodians.","This kind of etiquette was not commonly used by low-level Bloodians toward high-level Bloodians. Typically, it was reserved for those who had just received the first bite and showed their respect to the Bloodian who had bitten them.","Qin Yu bowed to Lin Yuan to thank him for giving her a new life.."]},{"number":3036,"title":"Chapter 3036: Qin Yu l s Arrangement!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3036: Qin Yu l s Arrangement!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At the same time, she used her actions to inform Lhalu and Fan Qia of Lin Yuan’s status.","After Lin Yuan helped Qin Yu become a Bloodian Queen, he provided her with many resources. As a result, Qin Yu’s strength increased once again. Lhalu and Fan Qia also received resources from Lin Yuan.","Qin Yu was confident that if she led the Elisa clan to align closely with Lin Yuan, the entire clan would be protected.","Lhalu and Fan Qia were surprised by Qin Yu’s actions. Logically, as the actual manager of the Bloodian Queen Elisa’s clan, Qin Yu should not have such a subordinate status.","However, Qin Yu’s actions demonstrated the power of Lin Yuan’s background and his importance to both Qin Yu and the entire Elisa clan.","Lhalu and Fan Qia had never interacted with Lin Yuan before, but seeing Qin Yu’s respect for him, they knew they couldn’t remain passive observers.","Lhalu and Fan Qia looked at each other and followed Qin Yu to Lin Yuan. To distinguish themselves from Qin Yu, they bowed to Lin Yuan with the etiquette of servants, indicating that their status was below Qin Yu’s.","Autumn and Winter, who stood beside Lin Yuan, watched this scene expressionlessly. They felt fortunate to be able to establish a relationship with","Lin Yuan.","Chu Ci observed the scene curiously, fascinated by the Bloodians.","Sun Yin was not surprised that a Bloodian Queen would show such humility to","Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s faction included a Grade 6 Creator. The Bloodian Queen and her clan were supported and controlled by Sky City.","Sensing Qin Yu’s aura, Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Qin Yu, not only has your strength stabilized after becoming a Bloodian Queen, but you’ve also become stronger. It looks like you’ve been working hard!","“Stand up. There’s no need to be so formal with me. The two people behind you must be key members of the Elisa clan. Seeing them today, I can see they’re worth nurturing.”","Lin Yuan understood why Qin Yu had brought Lhalu and Fan Qia to meet him.","Qin Yu was both capable and loyal. Lin Yuan was willing to nurture and support someone like her. Qin Yu stood up excitedly when she heard Lin Yuan’s words.","“Both becoming a Bloodian Queen and becoming stronger in the future are all thanks to you, Lord! If not for your nurturing, how would I have such an opportunity?”","With that, she said to Lhalu and Fan Qia, who were kneeling on the ground, “Lord said that you’re worth nurturing. Hurry up and thank him!”","Now, Qin Yu could finally trust the resources that Lin Yuan had given her to Lhalu and Fan Qia.","Lhalu and Fan Qia stood up and thanked Lin Yuan. Although they were very respectful to Lin Yuan because of Qin Yu, they were still suspicious because they did not know Lin Yuan’s strength.","Among the group of people following Lin Yuan, Qin Yu only knew Winter. Previously, it was a woman who had protected Lin Yuan with Winter.","Lin Yuan had brought out another expert with such strength.","Qin Yu could tell that Chu Ci was about the same age as Lin Yuan, and she had advanced to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom at such a young age!","This woman was standing beside Lin Yuan, and Autumn and Winter’s auras also enveloped her. This was enough to prove the woman’s identity.","As for the young man standing beside Lin Yuan, Qin Yu could not see through him. This meant that this person was also stronger than her.","When Lin Yuan saw Qin Yu’s gaze fall on Chu Ci and Sun Yin, he took the initiative to introduce them, “This is my sister. She will enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors with me this time. This is a Grade 5 Creator that I have with me.”","Qin Yu, Lhalu, and Fan Qia were not surprised that Chu Ci was Lin Yuan’s younger sister.","However, Qin Yu and the others did not expect Sun Yin to be a Grade 5 Creator. Moreover, Lin Yuan had introduced him as a Grade 5 Creator who was by his side, meaning that Sun Yin would only serve Lin Yuan.","For a moment, Qin Yu only felt she could not wrap her head around it. Would a large faction really treat the younger generation like this? Qin Yu found it unbelievable.","On the way back to the Elisa clan’s territory with Lin Yuan, Qin Yu had yet to digest this news.","Qin Yu realized that not only did this Grade 5 Creator not have any temper when facing Lin Yuan, but he did not treat him like an elder would treat a junior. Instead, he treated Lin Yuan very similarly to her. This was the attitude of an inferior to a superior. To put it bluntly, this Grade 5 Creator was also Lin Yuan’s servant.","“Lord Lin Yuan, the opening of the Land of Blood Ancestors might be delayed for a few days. After observing the other Bloodian Queens, they are prepared to pay the smallest price to open the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. This way, they can ensure that it will stay open for a longer time.”","Lin Yuan replied indifferently, “It’s not necessarily a bad thing to delay the opening of the cave in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors by a few days. A later opening will allow the other Bloodian Queens more time to prepare. Qin Yu, many Bloodian clans are likely seeking external help to gain an advantage in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Lin Yuan was certain a Bloodian clan would do this.","The opening of the Blood Ancestor’s Land presented a significant opportunity for the Bloodians, but even clans with Bloodian Queens found it challenging to seize it alone. The risks were too high. These clans needed external experts to support them.","They couldn’t afford to risk their lives exploring the Land of Bloodian Ancestors without backup.","Qin Yu pondered for a moment and said, “Lord, the Elisa clan has just risen and now sits among the Bloodian clans with incumbent queens. While I have planted spies in other clans, they can’t uncover everything. Just as you and I explored the Land of Bloodian Ancestors together without being discovered, the spies planted in the Elisa clan by other Bloodian Queens are also unlikely to know everything.","“However, several scouts I placed in the Bloodian clans with king bloodlines reported a noticeable increase in activity. Some outsiders even reside within these clans. I suspect these individuals are being invited to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Qin Yu observed Lin Yuan’s expression and continued, “Lord, during the last opening of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, several Bloodian kings perished, and a Bloodian Queen was severely injured, damaging her roots. Moreover, the previous exploration yielded no significant results. It’s reasonable for the major Bloodian clans to seek external assistance this time. These outsiders will need to stay vigilant!”","When Qin Yu discovered that the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was opening, she immediately shared the news with Lin Yuan, not considering him as external help but as a trusted ally. She simply wanted to inform him and prevent any misunderstandings.","Hearing Qin Yu’s words, Lin Yuan’s interest in exploring the Land of Bloodian Ancestors grew.","Previously, the hunting team had captured numerous star pirates, among whom were many experts. However, despite their strength, their bloodlines were impure, making them unsuitable for Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits to absorb.","The Bloodians highly valued their own bloodlines and those of their allies. Experts invited by the Bloodians typically came from large clans with extremely pure bloodlines, making them ideal candidates for Lin Yuan to absorb into the Body of All Spirits.","Over the past few days, Lin Yuan had been staying in the bedroom that Qin Yu had specially prepared for him. Chu Ci was the same.","Chu Ci had learned too much along the way and needed some time to digest it.","After following Lin Yuan for a few days, Chu Ci realized that the benefits of training outside were much better than studying combat skills in the Spirit Lock spatial zone!","Qin Yu continued gathering information. During this time, the Bloodians held several internal meetings, and Qin Yu participated in them.","Recently, Qin Yu had been recruiting other Bloodian clans to join the Elisa clan, making her actions very high-profile. This prompted her to maintain a low profile at these Bloodian meetings. She refrained from making suggestions and remained non-confrontational when other Bloodian Queens mentioned her.","Conversely, a few Bloodian Queens were eager to showcase their abilities, drawing Qin Yu’s special attention.","After the internal meeting concluded, leaders of several clans that had already joined the Elisa clan approached Qin Yu, seeking her approval. Among them were a few Bloodian clans with king bloodlines who had gained the opportunity to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Qin Yu looked at these eager petitioners and displayed a playful expression.","These clans had recently joined the Elisa clan. Despite promising to accept the Elisa clan’s leadership, they had ulterior motives.","They approached her hoping to gain more resources in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors through the Elisa clan’s protection.","But why should they get more just because they were under the Elisa clan’s protection? It was unreasonable.","Furthermore, even if Qin Yu intended to protect these Bloodian clans and increase the Elisa clan’s influence over them, it wasn’t appropriate for her to discuss this with Lin Yuan.","As the leader, Qin Yu couldn’t ignore them either.","After some thought, Qin Yu said, “Each of your clans has two spots to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. It’s challenging for two people to look out for each other in such a place. Why don’t you cooperate and form a team to explore together? I will then distribute the resources equally among you. That way, you can all be at ease.”","Her words tempted the Bloodian clan leaders from king bloodlines.","However, they wanted more.","“Lordess Qin Yu, why don’t we act as your subordinates? Just give us a small portion of the resources you obtain. This way, we can both serve you and receive your protection! ”","If Qin Yu hadn’t allied with Lin Yuan, she might have been swayed by this offer.","However, Qin Yu had become one of Lin Yuan’s subordinates. With Lin Yuan supporting her during the exploration, she didn’t need to worry about her safety.","Moreover, she was Lin Yuan’s loyal follower. The amount of resources she could acquire in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors depended on Lin Yuan’s decisions.","Thus, Qin Yu declined and said, “The Elisa clan plans to explore the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. If you follow me, I can’t ensure your safety.","Are you sure you want to stay by my side?”","Her words were cold and carried a hint of killing intent.","Qin Yu was certain these leaders wouldn’t dare follow her into the dangerous depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. They, like her, knew the risks involved.","Hearing Qin Yu’s words, the leaders of the king bloodline clans looked at her in disbelief, puzzled by her decision. The depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors were perilous. Had she not considered her safety?","Even though Qin Yu had become a Bloodian Queen, she knew a previous Bloodian Queen had been severely injured before even reaching the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","The depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors could be described as a forbidden area. Someone as arrogant as Qin Yu would most likely die there.","These Bloodian clans had just joined Qin Yu and had no relationship or benefits with her.","If Qin Yu died, their Bloodian clans would be able to escape the control of the Elisa clan. This was not a bad thing. At the thought of this, these Bloodian clans all retreated and no longer had any thoughts of following Qin Yu.","They were dissatisfied with Qin Yu’s arrangements but there was nothing they could do.","Qin Yu sent a soul message to the leader of the Allen clan Shi Mei, indicating for her to leave with the other Blood clan leaders present. Then, she would secretly return to her side.","Among all the Bloodian clans under her command, Qin Yu valued the Allen clan the most.","A large part of the reason she valued the Allen clan was the leader, Shi Mei.","Shi Mei’s leadership ability was outstanding and smart enough. Qin Yu intended to nurture Shi Mei and the Allen clan.","During this period, she had already invested a lot of resources in Shi Mei. The latter had also done very well what she had asked her to do.","If it was any other time, Shi Mei would definitely be extremely excited and happy to be summoned by Qin Yu alone.","However, now that Qin Yu had said that she was going to explore the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Shi Mei could not help but feel a chill run down her spine.","Could it be that Qin Yu wanted her to follow her into the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors?"]},{"number":3037,"title":"Chapter 3037: Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3037: Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","If Qin Yu really made such a request, could she really reject it?","After Qin Yu, a new Bloodian Queen, confirmed that she was supporting the Allen clan, she planted many people in the Allen clan. She had also publicly stated that the Allen clan was subordinate to the Elisa clan.","Shi Mei felt caught between a rock and a hard place.","Shi Mei only hoped that Qin Yu would really bring her to the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and not treat her as cannon fodder.","Shi Mei did not care if the Elisa clan had any trump cards. She knew very well that even if the Elisa clan possessed a life-saving trump card, they would never use it on her.","Following Qin Yu’s instructions, Shi Mei left with the other clan leaders. She took a detour to ensure she was not detected and then returned to Qin Yu’s side.","Otherwise, I won’t be able to explain to the other clans.”","Qin Yu had asked Shi Mei for this spot not for Lhalu and Fan Qia, but for Sun Yin, who was beside Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had told her that he would definitely do her best to fulfill his request.","Sun Yin, a Grade 5 Creator, was deeply interested in the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors. Therefore, she was doing Sun Yin a favor by fulfilling this request.","She definitely needed to inform Shi Mei about Sun Yin’s identity. Qin Yu intended to use Sun Yin’s status to intimidate Shi Mei, ensuring her loyalty to the Elisa clan.","“Shi Mei, I have invited a significant figure to explore the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors this time. The person who will accompany you and take the Allen clan’s quota is a servant of this Lord. He will act alongside you once you enter the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors. You just need to cooperate with him.”","Shi Mei speculated about the person Qin Yu had arranged to accompany her, assuming he was a member of the Elisa clan.","However, she did not expect Qin Yu to openly state that she had enlisted a prominent figure to assist. Coincidentally, he was this Lord’s servant!","This significant figure Qin Yu mentioned had likely occupied all the slots in the Elisa clan except for Qin Yu’s own. If even Qin Yu had to curry favor with him, this figure was certainly extraordinary. Despite being a servant, Shi Mei knew she must handle him with care.","“Lordess Qin Yu, rest assured. I will follow his instructions and carry out the operation.”","Qin Yu responded casually, “Shi Mei, this is an opportunity I’m giving you. As far as I know, one of the spots in the Allen clan is occupied by a Grade 5 Creator. If you can serve this Lord well and earn his appreciation, you can imagine the future benefits for the Allen clan.”","Qin Yu’s words served a dual purpose: to intimidate Shi Mei and to ensure she didn’t neglect Sun Yin. If Shi Mei slighted Sun Yin and incited his dissatisfaction, Sun Yin might vent his frustration on Qin Yu instead of confronting someone as insignificant as Shi Mei.","As the saying goes, accompanying a ruler is like accompanying a tiger. Qin Yu felt this way whenever she faced Lin Yuan. Shi Mei was simultaneously pleasantly surprised and unusually nervous.","She vividly remembered that Qin Yu had mentioned the Grade 5 Creator occupying the Allen clan’s quota was the subordinate of a significant figure.","The fact that this figure could command a Grade 5 Creator was astonishing! Shi Mei was adept at seizing opportunities, and now that one was in front of her, she was determined not to let it slip away.","Kneeling on one knee, Shi Mei gratefully told Oin Yu, “Thank you, Lordess Oin","Yu, for this opportunity. I will take good care of this Grade 5 Creator and cooperate with him!”","Qin Yu looked at the kneeling Shi Mei and said earnestly, “You know how much I value you. Don’t disappoint me in this operation! Otherwise, I won’t be able to trust you anymore.”","Shi Mei made several more assurances.","After Shi Mei left, Qin Yu immediately reported the situation to Lin Yuan, informing him that she had arranged a position for Sun Yin. Sun Yin sensed Oin Yu’s intention to befriend him. He could tell that Lin Yuan valued Qin Yu. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have helped her improve her bloodline and become a genuine Bloodian Queen.","Normally, if someone like Qin Yu tried to curry favor with him, Sun Yin wouldn’t have responded. But now, Sun Yin was also quite enthusiastic toward Qin Yu.","Since he had just joined Lin Yuan, it was beneficial for him to build good relationships with Lin Yuan’s other subordinates. Additionally, Lin Yuan would be displeased if he behaved arrogantly in front of people Lin Yuan had introduced.","“Qin Yu’s matter was arranged by you. Why don’t you communicate more with Senior Sun these few days? You can also decide when Senior Sun goes to the Allen clan.”","Qin Yu agreed to Lin Yuan’s orders and did not linger, knowing Lin Yuan would make the necessary arrangements for Sun Yin.","Sun Yin knew Lin Yuan had initially planned to enter the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors himself. Sun Yin had essentially begged Lin Yuan for this opportunity.","Sun Yin told Lin Yuan seriously, “Young Master, thank you for allowing me to enter the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors. Do I need to find a way to meet up with you once I enter?”","Lin Yuan had already made arrangements for Sun Yin.","“Senior Sun, I’m preparing to head to the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. The depths are also rife with danger for you. I don’t want you to be in danger.","“Furthermore, Autumn and Winter have to take care of my sister and meduring the operation. They have no time to care about you. Why don’t you follow the Bloodians who are going to remain in the periphery and collect more resources? We’ll meet again after we leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Lin Yuan’s words seemed to look down on Sun Yin’s strength but it was the truth, which made Sun Yin feel rather depressed.","“Young Master, I’ll stay at the periphery of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and help you gather information about the Bloodians. Also, I’ll be careful to hide my identity and not expose it.”","After Lin Yuan made all the necessary arrangements, he stayed in the room with Chu Ci.","Lin Yuan reached out to help Chu Ci press down the strand of hair on her head and asked, “Chu Ci, do you have any thoughts about your new fey?”","Chu Ci was already a mature expert so she definitely had her own thoughts about the fey she wanted to contract. Lin Yuan would fully respect Chu Ci’s decision when it came to fey contracts.","In the beginning, Chu Ci was very troubled about her position as adefense-type spirit qi professional because she was more interested in power offense-type feys than defense-type feys.","As she grew up, Chu Ci had already suppressed this thought. Moreover, the defensive-type feys that Lin Yuan had prepared for her actually had extraordinary offensive methods.","“My feys are very good at physical defense, but they lack the capabilities to defend against energy. If possible, I want to contract a fey that can help me increase my energy defense! It’s best if this fey has the ability to remove control restrictions and curses!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he heard how clear Chu Ci was about the fey she wanted to contract.","Lin Yuan had two similar feys, one of which he had exchanged for Creator resources in Fortune Treasure Palace. The other was what Zhong Zhiyu had given Lin Yuan when he told him about Chu Ci’s situation.","These two feys were not bad and met Chu Ci’s requirements.","Lin Yuan took out the two feys from his spatial equipment.","Chu Ci looked at the two outstanding feys that Lin Yuan had summoned and gave him a questioning look. She was not a Creator, so she could not identify feys at first glance.","Lin Yuan began introducing them. “Chu Ci, this avian-type fey with red, yellow, and green wings is called the Curse-Breaking Light Swallow. Its ability to break curses is excellent, and it can use light elements to resist other types of elemental energy. It meets your requirements.","“The biggest challenge with the Curse-Breaking Light Swallow is its bloodline transformation, which is extremely difficult. However, with me around, youdon’t have to worry about that. To ensure it retains its greatest potential during evolution, its strength will increase relatively slowly.","“This jellyfish is called the Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish. It’s not a traditional aquatic fey. Like the Sky Sea, it can live in both water and air. It utilizes three elements: water, air, and darkness.","“The special energy formed by these elements causes the target to fall into an illusion, making it difficult to extricate themselves. This energy can effectively isolate and suppress the elemental skills of other elements.","“The Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish can’t isolate curses directly, but it secretes a special liquid that can eliminate curse effects. In terms of potential and strength, the Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish doesn’t have any shortcomings.”","There were many feys that could satisfy Chu Ci’s requirements, but these two were the most suitable for her other feys.","Chu Ci looked at the Curse-Breaking Light Swallow and then at the Mirror","Flower Nether Jellyfish, feeling conflicted. She didn’t know which to choose.","She glanced at Lin Yuan but didn’t ask for his help.","For her combat system, the ability to protect elemental energy was more important than breaking curses.","“If I don’t find a suitable fey in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, I plan to contract the Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish. It’s more suitable for me than the Curse-Breaking Light Swallow.”","Upon seeing Chu Ci make her choice, Lin Yuan put away the Curse-Breaking Light Swallow and let her store the Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish in her spatial equipment.","“Actually, even if you find a suitable fey in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, you can still consider contracting this Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish. As a three-element defensive fey, it is very rare. It uses the special energy from water, wind, and darkness to create illusions, confusing the enemy and making it easier for you to fight.”","Lin Yuan was highly inclined toward the Mirror Flower Nether Jellyfish, but ultimately, the decision was up to Chu Ci.","Two days passed quickly. A day ago, Sun Yin had followed Lhalu to the Allenclan. Qin Yu immediately went to meet Lin Yuan.","“Lord, I’ve already sensed the location of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. After entering it, I’ll head to the Scarlet Corridor in the core area of the Scarlet Territory. There’s a secret treasure passed down by the Bloodian ancestors in the Scarlet Corridor. The energy stored in this secret treasure can help us teleport. All the Bloodian clans that are qualified to enter the Blood Ancestor’s Land will head there.","“There are many blood feuds between the Bloodian clans. When the time comes, there will definitely be some disputes. If there are any conflicts, I hope that you can bear with it. Otherwise, it might affect the timing of entering the","Land of Bloodian Ancestors!","“I can solve all the problems that arise before entering the Land of Bloodian Ancestors!”"]},{"number":3038,"title":"Chapter 3038 Vine Snakes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3038 Vine Snakes!","Qin Yu did not say it explicitly, but the meaning of her words was to tell Lin Yuan not to be in a hurry to take action. Although she had a Bloodian bloodline, she was not a native of the Scarlet Territory. If she intervened, it was very likely that something would happen.","....","Being targeted by other Bloodian Queens would naturally hinder Lin Yuan’s trip to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. While Lin Yuan was powerful, it was not always the best choice to rely solely on force.","“Qin Yu, since that’s the case, I’ll leave everything before entering the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to you. If you encounter something you can’t resolve, just inform me.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Qin Yu was relieved and hurriedly replied, “Lord, the other Bloodian Queens should be looking for external help too. There shouldn’t be any trouble at this time because if the other Bloodian Queens cause trouble, they will also be affected.","“Don’t worry. I’ve become a Bloodian Queen, after all. I can take care of everything outside. Lord, please follow me to the Scarlet Corridor!”","As Qin Yu spoke, she took out five large robes with a dark red hue and many six-petal blood bamboo patterns on them. These robes could perfectly cover the body, including the facial features.","The six-petaled blood bamboo was the Elisa clan’s emblem. Wearing these four blood-red robes could hide Lin Yuan and the others, as well as prove Lin Yuan’s identity.","However, Qin Yu had no right to decide if she wanted to wear these robes. Lin Yuan would be the one making the decision.","Qin Yu was aware of her position in front of Lin Yuan. He was very polite to her, but the entire Elisa clan was nothing but an inconspicuous dependent species to him.","Autumn and Winter despised the robes that Qin Yu had brought over, especially since they had the emblem of the Elisa clan.","However, Lin Yuan did not care. His purpose for entering the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was to make a fortune. As a competitor of the other Bloodian clans, it was naturally better for him to keep a low profile under such circumstances.","Moreover, Lin Yuan was still training his younger sister, so it was even more difficult to cause a commotion as some Bloodian clans were aware of Lin Yuan’s appearance as Black Elise. For example, the Allen clan that Qin Yu had recruited and nurtured.","Lin Yuan distributed the four robes with six-petal blood bamboo embroidery and asked, “Qin Yu, you said that there are many powerful souls wandering in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Is that true?”","Ever since Qin Yu had mentioned that there were numerous souls in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Lin Yuan had been thinking about them.","Pure soul-type feys like the Praying Universe Soul Whale could feed on souls. If there were huge souls for it to absorb, Rememberling could directly absorb and digest them with Gather Soul Conversion. By converting these souls into faith power, it could increase his strength.","Lin Yuan had been training in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for some time, but he had not found a place where many souls gathered. In advanced worlds like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there existed their own set of laws in which their souls would quickly dissipate after death. Therefore, there were very few places with large amounts of souls for Rememberling to absorb.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s question, Qin Yu hurriedly replied, “There are indeed numerous souls in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. These souls are divided into two types.","“One is the violent soul. These souls are the ancestors of the Bloodians who died tragically in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. These violent souls have already lost their minds over the long years. They will wantonly attack all lifeforms they encounter and are also extremely powerful. Hence, every time we encounter these violent souls in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, it will cause a lot of trouble.","“Fortunately, there are some ancestral items left behind in every Bloodian clan, which have the ability to drive away these violent souls.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes flickered when he heard Qin Yu’s words, but he did not immediately interrupt. Instead, he waited for Qin Yu to introduce the second type of soul.","“Lord, the other soul is formed by numerous souls devouring each other. This type is more aggressive but possesses a certain level of intelligence. Before encountering such a soul, our method has always been to try to communicate with it and then trade with it by taking out some soul-type spiritual ingredients.","“These souls that have been wandering in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors for a long time have a high chance of knowing where the opportunities and treasures are. Of course, because these souls have intelligence, they are divided into good and evil. The path these souls lead might not be real.","“In a previous exploration of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, the Bloodian Queen who suffered injuries to her roots did so because she followed the guidance of these souls. Therefore, if you really encounter such a soul, I don’t recommend you to trade with them, Lord.”","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s introduction, Lin Yuan was enlightened. Lin Yuan had no intention of trading with these souls, but he would be able to obtain the information he desired from them. It was because those violent souls or souls that had developed intelligence in the Bloodian territory were all food to Rememberling.","After Rememberling devoured those souls with a certain level of intelligence, it could use them to obtain useful information. Regardless of whether Lin Yuan could gain anything from this trip to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Rememberling would definitely gain a lot.","After finishing her introduction, Lin Yuan did not bring up the topic of souls again. Hence, Qin Yu did not initiate further conversation about it with him.","Qin Yu was the first Bloodian Queen to appear in the Scarlet Territory. Hence, the Elisa clan was currently emphasizing grandeur and display.","Qin Yu’s carriage was drawn by eight Holy Spirit Blood Scaled Dragons, rare blood-type dragon-species lifeforms. Qin Yu had exerted significant effort to obtain these Blood Scaled Dragons.","Before becoming the Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu had refrained from being too ostentatious. However, now she openly displayed her status with a carriage pulled by Blood Scaled Dragons. Her carriage was unique in the Scarlet Territory, and when it passed by, all the other Bloodians would bow and make way.","In the distance, a cold-looking, short-haired female Bloodian, riding in a carriage pulled by nine Blood Tigers, sneered at the sight of Qin Yu’s carriage. “Qin Yu has just become a Bloodian Queen and is already so arrogant. She’ll be taught a lesson sooner or later!”","Four other people sat in the carriage pulled by the nine Blood Tigers. Only two of them had obvious Bloodian characteristics. They sat quietly, not daring to speak, their eyes revealing fear not of the short-haired Bloodian, but of the two individuals outside the carriage.","A hoarse, sharp voice spoke from within the carriage. “Jiang Ying, you’re an experienced Bloodian Queen. There’s no need to argue with these newly crowned queens. Even if they are arrogant, they won’t dare disrespect you.","“Focus on building alliances with the other Bloodian Queens. Strive for cooperation between our Vine Snake species and the Bloodian clans to secure practical benefits for us. This way, our Vine Snakes can reward you more generously.","“Weren’t you recently complaining about the lack of resources from our Vine Snakes? It’s because you haven’t been putting in enough effort. Look, after you shared the news of the opening of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors with us, didn’t the king generously grant you those Blood Jade Snakeberries you’ve been asking for?”","The short-haired Bloodian Queen’s expression remained unchanged, but she felt disgusted and repulsed.","Recently, the Vine Snakes had become stingier with her. They had traded with her too many times and wanted to manipulate her. However, she couldn’t escape their control.","Firstly, the Blood Jade Snakeberries were extremely useful for improving her bloodline. Secondly, the Vine Snakes’ strength had increased rapidly in the past few hundred years, far surpassing that of the Bloodian clan she belonged to. Otherwise, with the Vine Snakes becoming increasingly greedy and controlling, she would have ended the cooperation long ago.","“Some Bloodian clans led by other queens have different factions backing them. I’ve invited you to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, giving you a chance to engage with them directly. Each of these Bloodian clans will have their queens leading the way. This operation will reveal the depth of the other clans.","“I’ve done my part to bring you into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Don’t forget your promise to me. This time, I want not just Blood Jade Snakeberries but the entire Blood Jade Snakeberry plant.”","Upon hearing that, a man with long gray-green hair inside the carriage revealed a sinister smile. The more he looked at the Bloodian Queen in front of him, the more he found her interesting. She was truly a combination of beauty and greed. However, her greed was naive.","The Blood Jade Snakeberries required watering with venom produced by the Vine Snakes to mature. The berries themselves were not valuable—the true value lay in the Vine Snakes’ venom. Since this beautiful but foolish Bloodian Queen wanted it, he would just give her one.","“There’s no problem if you want the entire Blood Jade Snakeberry plant. When we reach the Scarlet Corridor, don’t forget to introduce us to the other Bloodian Queens.”","Jiang Ying frowned. “Gu Rong, don’t go overboard. You want to interact with the other Bloodian Queens in the Scarlet Corridor. Aren’t you afraid of causing trouble that might affect our entry into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors? When you enter and meet the other Bloodian Queens, I will introduce them to you then.”","Jiang Ying really hoped that the Vine Snakes could build a relationship with the other Bloodian Queens. That way, they wouldn’t keep looking for her. As the saying went, inviting a god was easy, but sending them away was difficult. At that moment, Jiang Ying felt exactly that way.","It was not that Jiang Ying was afraid of conflict with the Vine Snakes. The Linus clan resided in the Scarlet Territory. No matter how rapidly the Vine Snakes developed, their strength was not sufficient to invade the Scarlet Territory.","Most importantly, many transactions between Jiang Ying and the Vine Snakes were shady. Once they were exposed, it would have a huge impact on the entire Linus clan and would directly affect their reputation among the Bloodians. This was what Jiang Ying was afraid of!","Upon hearing that Jiang Ying was willing to introduce the other Bloodian Queens to him, the grayish-green-haired man named Gu Rong did not bring up the matter of interacting with the other Bloodian Queens in the Scarlet Corridor anymore.","Gu Ying did not want to anger Jiang Ying. He had also come with a mission this time. If he did not do this well and that Lord blamed the Vine Snakes, wouldn’t he become a scapegoat for the Vine Snakes?","...","When they arrived at the Scarlet Corridor, Lin Yuan, Chu Ci, Autumn, and Winter followed behind Qin Yu, who wore robes embroidered with the Andra clan’s emblem.","Lin Yuan silently observed the situation in the Scarlet Territory. He realized that in this Scarlet Corridor, Bloodian clans with king bloodlines would group together. Typically, these small groups were led by a Bloodian clan with a queen bloodline.","However, Bloodian clans with Bloodian Queens generally existed in a state where one queen wouldn’t acknowledge the authority of another. Hence, they typically didn’t communicate with one another.","Qin Yu didn’t have the desire to interact with the other Bloodian clans, but some clans with king bloodlines would take the initiative to greet her.","Coincidentally, Lin Yuan recognized one of them, the leader of the Allen clan, Shi Mei.","Lin Yuan had interacted with Shi Mei before, and these interactions were almost as frequent as those with Qin Yu.","In Lin Yuan’s impression, Shi Mei was very smart. Since Shi Mei had approached Qin Yu on such an occasion, the Allen clan must have publicly submitted to the Elisa clan.","Being under the command of a Bloodian clan led by a Bloodian Queen was an excellent opportunity for the Allen clan, which only possessed a king bloodline.","Sun Yin used a brilliant disguise to change his appearance and followed beside Shi Mei. He did not wear the robe that represented the Allen clan. It wasn’t that Sun Yin was unwilling to wear it; rather, Shi Mei truly didn’t dare to give such clothes to Sun Yin, a Grade 5 Creator.","Shi Mei was very careful in front of Sun Yin and tried her best to win his favor.","If Sun Yin weren’t under Lin Yuan’s command, he wouldn’t even bother to interact with someone like Shi Mei. If a Grade 5 Creator wanted to make connections with experts and factions, those experts and factions would flock to them.","However, due to Shi Mei’s relationship with Qin Yu, and Qin Yu being Lin Yuan’s subordinate, Sun Yin restrained his temper in front of Shi Mei and was relatively polite to her.","Sun Yin noticed that not only Bloodian factions with Bloodian Queens were seeking outside help, but also many Bloodian factions with Bloodian Kings were doing the same."]},{"number":3039,"title":"Chapter 3039 Soul Level Blessing!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3039 Soul Level Blessing!","In the North, South, East, and West Universes, it was said that the East Universe’s Bloodian factions were declining. From the looks of it, that was indeed the case.","....","If it were the Bloodian factions from the other three universes, they wouldn’t have invited so many external factions to help with the Land of Bloodian Ancestors’ opening.","Furthermore, the Bloodians in the East Universe were really not united with each other, especially those clans with Bloodian Queens in charge. They simply didn’t take the other Bloodian clans seriously.","When Sun Yin saw the four long-robed figures behind Qin Yu, he knew Lin Yuan was among them. Sun Yin did not greet Lin Yuan brazenly in front of so many people. He only nodded at Qin Yu.","Initially, Lin Yuan had anticipated conflicts with so many Bloodian factions gathered in the Scarlet Corridor. However, the major Bloodian clans showed remarkable restraint towards one another, clearly not wanting to forfeit the opportunity to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","In the center of the Scarlet Corridor stood an altar, with a female statue carved from blood-colored crystal at its heart. This statue bore distinctive Bloodian features. Suddenly, it emitted a bright red light and unleashed a powerful energy. This energy connected directly to the floating Land of Bloodian Ancestors in the void, linking it with the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Winter immediately sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan. “Young Master, I hadn’t realized the extraordinary nature of this statue before. I thought it was merely an offering to the Bloodians’ ancestors. Now, it seems that’s not the case. There appears to be a powerful Bloodian’s body within the statue, as the energy emanated from it.","“To connect to the floating Land of Bloodian Ancestors through physical energy, this Bloodian’s body must be at least at the pinnacle Holy Spirit level, possibly even surpassing the Domain Mountain class.","“This statue must have been created during the Bloodians’ heyday. If you can obtain it, Young Master, you will transcend to the level of the top and most ancient Bloodian bloodlines.","“The queen bloodline is top-notch for the current Bloodians, but to the ancient Bloodians, it is insignificant. Above the queen is the empress bloodline, and beyond that, the legendary great empress bloodline.”","Winter’s tone turned regretful. “Young Master, seizing this statue won’t be easy. It is connected to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, which likely means there are restrictions. To break this connection, we would have to sever the link between the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and the statue.","“However, this would cause the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to drift in the void, preventing any future direct contact with the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Losing this statue would likely mean the Bloodian clans would no longer be able to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Upon hearing Winter’s words, Lin Yuan’s gaze instinctively focused on the statue. He didn’t care if the Bloodians could access the Land of Bloodian Ancestors again. What concerned him was the risk involved in obtaining the Bloodian body. To break the connection between the body and the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, he would need to find a way inside the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Lin Yuan was uncertain how much time he had to explore the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. If he had enough time, he would thoroughly explore the entire place to witness the glory of the Bloodians’ heyday.","The moment the statue released the red light, all the Bloodians present turned pale.","Qin Yu took out a bright red blood crystal and held it in her hand. Immediately, the aura emitted by the statue resonated with the blood crystal in Qin Yu’s hand.","Qin Yu took a step back, allowing the blood crystal’s aura to envelop Lin Yuan and the others behind her.","Lin Yuan realized that every Bloodian leader present was holding a blood crystal, but there was a difference in the size of these blood crystals. For example, the largest blood crystal in Qin Yu’s hand could envelop Qin Yu and the four targets beside her.","The smaller blood crystals were in the hands of the Bloodian factions that had the queen bloodline but were only Bloodian Kings. Apart from the leader, they could also bring two people along into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","The lowest grade of blood crystals was like the one in Shi Mei’s hand, which could only bring along one person.","People kept using blood crystals to teleport into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, but Qin Yu didn’t teleport. It was because people who were teleported at the same frequency would appear in the same area. Qin Yu didn’t want to be teleported to the same area as the other Bloodian Queens.","Qin Yu only teleported after the other Bloodian Queens were done.","Lin Yuan, who was enveloped by the blood crystal aura, felt that he had arrived in a world with extremely dense blood energy in just half a minute. Breathing in such rich blood energy,","Qin Yu could not help but let out a light moan of joy.","At that moment, several berserk souls had already pounced on Lin Yuan and the others. However, after sensing the blood crystal’s aura, these berserk souls did not continue to attack. Instead, they scattered into the distance.","Lin Yuan realized that the blood crystal Qin Yu was talking about was a treasure that could stop the berserk souls from attacking.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and released the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Rememberling.","After Rememberling sensed the violent souls, the horn on its head tapped lightly, and dozens of violent souls in the distance were sucked into its body.","After absorbing the souls, Rememberling communicated with Lin Yuan through the souls, “Yuan, the strength of these souls is very high, and they have greatly improved me. If I can absorb a few thousand more of these souls, not only will my strength increase, but the effects of my Divine Kingdom soul will also be strengthened.”","Seeing that Rememberling could indeed absorb these violent souls, Lin Yuan said, “Qin Yu, put this blood crystal away. You’ve already witnessed that my contracted fey can deal with these violent souls.","“Based on my observation, your blood crystal has become one size smaller than the original size after the teleportation just now. It seems that resisting these violent souls will also consume the energy of the blood crystal. These blood crystals should have other uses, right?”","Qin Yu hurriedly said, “Lord, you’re right. These blood crystals can be used to avoid any risks encountered in the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors. Each time we avoid danger, the blood crystals shrink. Typically, once the blood crystal disappears, the exploration of the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors will cease to help reduce casualties.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan couldn’t help but think to himself that the ancestors went to great lengths for their survival. However, the existence of these blood crystals had caused the Bloodians to lose their adventurous spirit when entering the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors, which was detrimental to their growth. It was precisely because they had lost this spirit that the Bloodians didn’t gain much from their explorations.","“In that case, I’ll save these blood crystals for when I need them!”","Lin Yuan then instructed, “Rememberling, freely absorb all the souls in this world. If you manage to extract any useful information from these souls, inform me directly.”","The moment Qin Yu put away the blood crystal, she lost its protection and sensed the presence of living beings. Violent souls quickly gathered around.","Rememberling, delighted at the easy prey, flapped its tail happily and absorbed all the souls. Using Gather Soul Conversion, it quickly transformed the absorbed soul energy into faith power, rapidly increasing its strength.","Lin Yuan thought that if Rememberling continued to grow at this rate, its strength would likely surpass the Holy Spirit level easily.","Even a Grade 5 Creator was just a servant by Lin Yuan’s side. Therefore, Qin Yu was not surprised that Lin Yuan could summon such a fey. She carefully put away the blood crystal.","Autumn and Winter were mainly responsible for protecting Lin Yuan and Chu Ci. In times of danger, it would be hard for them to ensure Qin Yu’s safety. This blood crystal could protect her if danger arose.","Large amounts of blood-type spiritual ingredients could be found almost everywhere in the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors. Lin Yuan gave a portion of these ingredients to Qin Yu while keeping some for Blood Love. These ingredients would be very helpful in improving Blood Love’s strength.","...","Less than three hours after entering the Land of the Bloodian Ancestors, intense energy fluctuations surged from Rememberling’s body, and it successfully advanced to the Holy Spirit level.","Upon reaching that level, Rememberling’s horn grew a few inches longer, but there were no other obvious changes. At present, Rememberling’s bloodline was extremely high, making further transformations during its grade advancement process very difficult.","Lin Yuan immediately used True Data to investigate the Holy Spirit Rememberling.","[Fey Name]: Praying Universe Soul Whale","[Fey Species]: Soul whale-species/single-horned whale-species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Soul","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Soul Knot]: When faced with the body of a dead target, singing the whale song will combine all the hidden souls in the body and awaken the soul within the target. If there is enough soul in the target’s body, the memories in the soul will be activated.","[Whale Fantasy]: When faced with an attack, the body can be turned into soul power and spread out into the surroundings. This will be able to dodge any attack. When heavily injured, the soul will attach itself to the closest object. Once out of danger, the soul can re-solidify into its original form.","[Singing Soul]: The soul energy will be spent and the soul’s past experiences will be recited. This will help to recover the soul’s memories.","[Whale Soul Tears]: After consuming the fragments of the soul and draining the energy within them, the energy can be released through eyes as sacred items and be used to heal and nourish souls.","[Sacred Whale Song]: When the sacred whale song is sung, curses placed on the soul will be broken. The impurities in the soul will also be cleansed.","[Whale Horn Piercing Crystal]: The whale horn will pick out souls hidden within non-lifeforms. The Remembrance Soul Whale’s soul energy will begin to mold the soul pieces until they solidify into crystals that cannot be returned back into the main body.","[Soul Universe Guide]: The whale horn can communicate with and make prayers to the universe. The collected souls can be guided to its side and universe power will be used to guide the souls while protecting them and preventing them from dissipating.","[Soul Ability Protection]: The whale horn will be used to plead to the universe for power that will add to its own soul power. Its soul power will be used to protect the target’s soul and soul body to prevent the soul body from being destroyed and dissipating.","[Soul Spirit Extraction]: Evaluate a lifeform’s soul energy. With the sacrifice of the same grade and type of bloodline as the other party, their soul can be extracted and contained.","[Restricted Soul Sensing]: Disset the imprisoned soul of the living or dead in order to use the aura to locate a lifeform with a similar bloodline.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Burning Soul New Life]: By using spiritual ingredients full of soul power, the soul energy can be directed to and solidified in the soul. The soul energy can be used to recover damaged souls and return them to whole.","[Soul Remember Gift]: By combining with the collected dead souls, the dead souls will eventually become soul imprints once they are completely absorbed. When the soul imprint is applied on a lifeform of the same species, the lifeform’s comprehension ability will be raised and they will be able to comprehend willpowers and laws more easily.","[Universe Prayer]: Cry out in unison with the universe space through its own bloodline. This will earn the chance to communicate with the universe space. After sincerely praying, the whale’s tears will be the guide that calls the universe’s thoughts and wills to it as a form of direct compensation.","[Gather Soul Conversion]: A type of energy will be fastened. The absorbed soul will be converted into this type of energy. The body can then absorb this type of energy and use it to strengthen itself.","[Soul Tide Whirlpool]: Its soul will form a high-speed whirlpool. This whirlpool will be able to increase the response rate of its own soul and increase the concentration of soul power.","[Soul Level Blessing]: Once the soul of an expert is obtained, the expert’s soul can be used to bless a lifeform of the same type. The lifeform will be able to increase its level quickly and its soul will be strengthened.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Soul Spirit Harbor]: It will merge with the environment. Once merged, it will be able to gather all the soul energy in the environment and store the soul energy in its own sea of souls.","[Soul Leaping Tide Spring]: Uses a massive amount of soul energy to nurture a spring in the divine kingdom. Once this spring is activated, it will spew out a tide of souls. After the tide of souls spews out, the spring that it condenses will disappear. The tide of souls spewed out from the spring can allow the soul of life to soar, exceeding its current soul level (Every lifeform can only withstand one cleansing of the tide of souls).","Lin Yuan was overjoyed when he saw Rememberling’s newly obtained divine kingdom ability after stepping into the Holy Spirit level.","Soul Leaping Tide Spring was a purely functional divine kingdom ability and would not increase Rememberling’s strength at all. However, it could support other lifeforms and allow their souls to undergo transition. It could be said that Rememberling’s Soul Leaping Tide Spring had a very important effect on every lifeform."]},{"number":3040,"title":"Chapter 3040 Ancient Water Pythons!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3040 Ancient Water Pythons!","A lifeform’s body composition, mind, spirit, and soul were four different levels of power. They were mutually independent but shared a connection.","....","The stronger a lifeform was, the more important their soul was to them.","The soul and spirit were closely related to the power of comprehension. The increase in spiritual energy made it easier for a lifeform to gain comprehension. The improvement of the soul would increase the level of comprehension of the lifeform.","Rememberling’s divine kingdom ability, Soul Leaping Tide Spring, could be said to be the best ability for Creators to advance. It was comparable to the so-called ‘opportunities’ mentioned by these Creators.","All the Creators who received Soul Leaping Tide Spring’s cleansing found it easier to enhance their abilities. In addition to these Creators, entities like the Hundred Questions Beast army were also able to make progress.","Even if non-Creators received Soul Leaping Tide Spring’s cleansing, it would be easier for them to advance to a higher level.","Besides faith power, the evolution of lifeforms also required a certain level of comprehension.","However, it would not be easy for Rememberling to use Soul Leaping Tide Spring to nurture a spring in the divine kingdom, as condensing one required absorbing numerous souls.","Lin Yuan was not preoccupied with the joy of Rememberling obtaining Soul Leaping Tide Spring. Instead, he asked seriously, “Rememberling, how long will it take for you to condense a spring in the divine kingdom?”","Rememberling sensed carefully before speaking. “Yuan, it’s very difficult for me to condense a spring outside because there aren’t many souls for me to absorb. Moreover, even if I can absorb some souls, their level and quality would not compare to the ones in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","“In the outside world, it might take me a year or two to condense a spring. However, here, where I can absorb souls freely, I can condense a spring every few minutes.”","Lin Yuan usually did not have the chance to bring Rememberling along to collect souls. Staying in North of the Lonely River, it rarely had the opportunity to absorb many souls. Therefore, Lin Yuan had to seize the opportunity while Rememberling was in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to let it condense more springs in the divine kingdom.","The faith country could produce a large amount of faith power continuously. The faith power produced there was enough for Rememberling to advance in the future. Under such circumstances, it would be a waste for Rememberling to use Gather Soul Conversion to convert soul power into faith power.","Lin Yuan changed his plan. He no longer allowed the Holy Spirit Rememberling to continue trying to increase its strength in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Instead, he directed Rememberling to use the souls there to condense more springs in the divine kingdom.","Autumn and Winter were pleasantly surprised by the new exclusive skill Rememberling had obtained after reaching the Holy Spirit level. It was equally effective for both of them.","Lin Yuan did not let Rememberling stray too far from him. The Land of Bloodian Ancestors had many restrictions, and if he was not careful, he might not be able to protect Rememberling, potentially causing it harm.","After Autumn and Winter entered the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, they frequently took action. However, they had not ventured deep into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and had yet to encounter significant danger.","Rememberling did not need to search for souls in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. The fresh aura emitted by Lin Yuan and the others naturally attracted those souls.","After Rememberling spent some effort to absorb a soul that clearly had extraordinary intelligence, it hurriedly shared the useful information it had just obtained. “Yuan, there’s a blood forest two kilometers ahead to the right. There’s something in this blood forest that I’m very afraid of. There might be treasures there.","“Before I absorbed the soul, it had already tricked a group of people into heading to the blood forest. Is there a need for us to head to this blood forest and see what’s inside?”","Rememberling knew Lin Yuan’s goal in coming to the Blood Ancestor Land was to seek treasures, so he would definitely go wherever there was a treasure.","Rememberling had a very good relationship with the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, which made it more or less addicted to money.","There were indeed many resources there, but their quality was too low to interest Lin Yuan. Since Rememberling had found a place where treasures might be hidden, Lin Yuan decided to investigate. He wasn’t concerned about whether other Bloodian teams were also heading there.","Qin Yu’s development in the Scarlet Territory was fraught with challenges. Controlling the territory alone was nearly impossible for her.","The other Bloodian Queens did not take Qin Yu seriously for one simple reason: she wasn’t strong enough. If she could meet promising Bloodian Queens from a powerful clan and gain control over them, it would be extremely beneficial for Qin Yu.","After bringing Lin Yuan to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Qin Yu was no longer useful there.","Previously, Qin Yu had entered the Land of Bloodian Ancestors twice. The first time, she was forced to escape in less than a day. The second time, she spent two to three days exploring it.","However, as a Bloodian King back then, she only dared to explore the outermost areas. Moreover, the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was vast, and the location of each teleportation was not fixed. Even more powerful Bloodian clans than the Elisa clan were unlikely to possess a map of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Since Qin Yu couldn’t assist Lin Yuan directly, she obediently followed him, working as a collector to help him gather blood-type spiritual ingredients. Regardless of whether Lin Yuan needed these ingredients, she made sure to be useful.","Lin Yuan was now close to the blood forest. Upon arrival, he saw two Bloodian teams confronting each other. One team consisted of six Bloodians, indicating a coalition of two or three Bloodian clans.","The opposing team had only three members: two Bloodians and one individual emitting a strong water elemental aura. It was clear this person was an outsider brought in by a Bloodian King with a queen bloodline.","Lin Yuan and his companions had detected these groups.","Autumn and Winter had been blocking Lin Yuan, Chu Ci, and Qin Yu’s auras, so the opposing parties had not noticed their presence.","Qin Yu couldn’t help but remark as she watched the two Bloodian teams face off, “Lord Lin Yuan, I didn’t expect the Dolores clan to be allied with the Ancient Water Pythons. I wonder if the Dolores clan or the Ancient Water Pythons will lead this cooperation. The Ancient Water Pythons are quite cunning to collaborate with the Bloodians to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Qin Yu’s words clearly showed her displeasure toward the Ancient Water Pythons. As a Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu actually didn’t like other factions infiltrating the Bloodians.","The Wave Heavenly River where the Ancient Water Pythons resided was on the south side of the Scarlet Territory, not far from it. Ultimately, the Ancient Water Pythons were only as powerful as a Bloodian clan with a queen bloodline. It was not strength that could instill fear in Qin Yu’s heart.","On the other side were three Bloodian clans with king bloodlines. These three Bloodian clans had always been on good terms, so it was not surprising for them to appear here together.","Although there were many people on this side, the Bloodian clans with king bloodlines usually wouldn’t dare to provoke the Bloodian clans with a queen bloodline. Bloodian clans with the queen bloodline possessed a depth of foundation that Bloodian clans with king bloodlines couldn’t match. Therefore, it was not difficult to tell which side these two groups were looking for trouble.","Among the three Bloodian clans that had the king bloodline, one of them had once taken the initiative to express his loyalty to Qin Yu.","Qin Yu had made contact with them before. However, Qin Yu did not explicitly take this clan under her command like the Allen clan, so she did not react when the two sides confronted each other.","Her main goal this time was to accompany Lin Yuan to seek treasures in the Scarlet Territory. Lin Yuan’s schedule should not be affected by the internal affairs of the Bloodians.","At that moment, Qin Yu heard a rough voice. It was a voice that would never come out of an elegant Bloodian.","“He Duo, don’t hesitate anymore. We can handle the three Bloodian clans opposite you. If you can make them submit to the Dolores clan, there will be countless benefits for your clan in the future. This way, it will be more convenient for your clan to trade with our Ancient Water Pythons.","“In the outside world, the price of a Bloodian has been raised to 800,000 Honor Absent dollars. A pure-blooded male Bloodian can be sold for 1 million Honor Absent dollars, while a pure-blooded female Bloodian can be sold for about 1.1 million Honor Absent dollars.","“After taking control of these three Bloodian leaders, will you still say that you don’t have a source of resources in the future? The Dolores clan will benefit the most from our cooperation. You know very well about your friendship. I’ve always protected your interests in our trades.","“He Duo, if you continue to hesitate, it will be troublesome if you encounter other Bloodian teams later.”","This rough voice made the six Bloodian members turn pale with fright","“He Duo Dolores! As the leader of the Bloodian clan, you’re actually involved in selling Bloodians. Aren’t you afraid of being expelled and exiled from the Scarlet Territory? Recently, some young Bloodians have been missing. It turns out that it’s actually your Dolores clan’s doing!”","When He Duo heard Hen Tao’s words, she couldn’t help but curse in her heart. Selling lifeforms as goods was prohibited for any species.","For various reasons, the Dolores clan had formed a relationship with the Ancient Water Pythons to develop further. They kept tempting her with significant benefits, so she chose to cooperate with them.","However, as time passed, the Ancient Water Pythons grew increasingly greedy. They demanded more Bloodians and even began to require pure-blooded ones. Naturally, the rewards given to the Dolores clan also increased.","The Dolores clan frequently abducted Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory, so it was inevitable that they would eventually be discovered. Many Bloodian clans had already sent out patrol teams.","Despite this, the cooperation between the Dolores clan and the Ancient Water Pythons was too close. The Ancient Water Pythons had leverage over the Dolores clan, making it impossible for He Duo to stop the collaboration.","He Duo hated the feeling of being threatened. Hen Tao’s words left her no choice but to comply with him and attack the three Bloodian clans.","The Ancient Water Pythons had obtained too many benefits from selling the Bloodians and were unwilling to relent. However, Hen Tao was too bold. If the Bloodian Queen clans heard of this, they would certainly demand an explanation from the Ancient Water Pythons. The latter were not strong enough to deal with those clans with Bloodian Queens.","Hearing the stern shouts from the Bloodians, He Duo knew she had no choice but to act.","Lin Yuan listened with interest. He had long witnessed the chaos in the Scarlet Territory. He wasn’t surprised that these prestigious Bloodians were selling their kind as goods while claiming to be noble.","Qin Yu was furious when she heard this. If Lin Yuan weren’t there, she would have already taken action.","Lin Yuan said, “Qin Yu, this matter is probably not as simple as you think. From what the Ancient Water Pythons said, it’s clear they regard the sale of Bloodians as an industrial chain. It’s not possible to open up this chain by working with just one Bloodian clan.","“Furthermore, the Ancient Water Pythons are not as strong as the Bloodians, yet they dare to discuss this so brazenly. Either the Ancient Water Pythons collaborate with other stronger Bloodian clans, or they have a backer that makes them fearless of the Bloodians.","“Otherwise, the Ancient Water Pythons would be digging their own grave. A species with a death wish wouldn’t have survived until now.","“We don’t need to interfere and cause trouble now. These three people won’t kill us if they want to control the three Bloodian clans. The leaders of the Bloodian clans will submit when they’re no match for them. They won’t just die in vain. When we leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, I will help you resolve this matter.”"]},{"number":3041,"title":"Chapter 3041 Conflict and Lan Ling!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3041 Conflict and Lan Ling!","Lin Yuan’s words made Qin Yu’s heart skip a beat. She realized that her thoughts were too simple.","....","The Wave Heavenly River was not far from the Scarlet Territory. The Ancient Water Pythons that resided there had always seemed very courteous to Qin Yu.","Qin Yu did not recognize the member of the Ancient Water Pythons standing beside He Duo, which could only mean that he was not a core management member of the Ancient Water Pythons. However, his strength had reached the high-grade Holy Spirit level.","It would be understandable if the Ancient Water Pythons had a backer. However, if they were to collaborate with a faction led by a Bloodian Queen and rely on their power to get those with king bloodlines to carry out deeds, then the internal affairs of the Scarlet Territory would truly be rotten.","Lin Yuan’s first half sentence clearly indicated he did not want to deal with the matter now. If Lin Yuan didn’t want to get involved, then Qin Yu wouldn’t intervene either.","However, when Lin Yuan said that he would help her resolve this matter after they left the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Qin Yu was delighted. At the same time, she felt a sense of dependence on Lin Yuan.","There were three reasons why Lin Yuan wanted to solve the business chain behind the Ancient Water Pythons.","The most fundamental reason was that Lin Yuan hated human trafficking. He held the values of a modern person with a sense of judgment regarding right and wrong. Trafficking would only bring misfortune even in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The second reason was that Lin Yuan had to take care of Qin Yu’s emotions. Ever since Lin Yuan had taken Qin Yu under his wing, she had never done anything that displeased Lin Yuan. On the contrary, Qin Yu had been consistently handling the tasks entrusted to her by Lin Yuan very well. Hence, Lin Yuan completely acknowledged and regarded her as a member of Sky City. Since Qin Yu was helping Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan naturally would not mistreat her.","The third reason was that Lin Yuan intended to control the Scarlet Territory. As the saying went, ‘A king would never allow others to steal his profits without putting up resistance.”","This faction was deliberately using the Bloodians as a tool to accumulate wealth and went against Lin Yuan’s belief. Therefore, whether it was the Ancient Water Pythons or the other factions behind them, Lin Yuan would find them.","If this faction was willing to submit to Lin Yuan, he would arrange a new livelihood for the faction. However, if they were unwilling to do so, Lin Yuan did not mind getting rid of them.","In any case, from Lin Yuan’s perspective, he would definitely not engage in human trafficking-related businesses.","Over the course of his journey, Lin Yuan had indeed grown tougher in heart, especially when dealing with many matters. However, Lin Yuan’s bottom line had never changed.","“Lord Lin Yuan, thank you for your help. If you hadn’t asked me to deal with this faction myself, it would have been very difficult for me to do so.”","Qin Yu wasn’t trying to curry favor with Lin Yuan, but the latter’s reminder had prompted her to realize the situation. As opposed to the collaboration between the Ancient Water Pythons and a certain Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu hoped that a faction other than the Bloodians was plotting something.","Lin Yuan did not intend to care about this matter now but was not in a hurry to leave. He was prepared to see what choice the Bloodian clans involved in this dispute would make.","It was clear that the leader of the Dolores clan had been swayed by the Ancient Water Pythons. However, she had yet to make a decision. Nevertheless, for a member of the Ancient Water Pythons to dare to treat He Duo in such a manner meant he must have been thoroughly prepared.","He Duo glared at him and told the Bloodians questioning her, “Is it so important whether or not our Dolores clan is involved? Have your clans never done anything to harm the Bloodians?","“Now that you’ve run into me, it’s your misfortune. I’ll give you a chance to join the Dolores clan. From now on, your three clans will benefit greatly. Your three clans haven’t seen much development over these past few centuries. Don’t you desire a chance to change the status quo?”","He Duo’s words were skillfully crafted. Although her intent was to control the three clans, when spoken by He Duo, it sounded like she wanted to support them.","One of the Bloodian clan leaders was obviously persuaded. However, the two other leaders shouted angrily, “He Duo, don’t make it sound so pleasant. This person beside you has already said he’s controlling our clans to obtain the Bloodian population and then sell them. Don’t even think about using my species as a cradle for your human trafficking!”","Among all the leaders, this one understood the situation. He Duo and her companions weren’t giving them a chance. Boarding this pirate ship would turn their clan into a breeding ground for Bloodian populations, depleting their foundation.","Pure-blooded Bloodians wouldn’t casually give their first bite. Every time they did, they were extremely cautious. Casually giving the first bite affected their bloodline. To put it bluntly, giving the first bite meant that the pure-blooded Bloodian had injected their bloodline into the bodies of other lifeforms to help them transform into pure-blooded Bloodians.","When He Duo tried to persuade the three Bloodian leaders, Hen Tao revealed a displeased expression. “He Duo, why are you talking so much nonsense? They will eventually find out your secret anyway. Lord Lan Ling has promised that if you develop this industry well, he will help you try to break through to the queen bloodline.","“The organization chose you because of your bloodline talent. Don’t deceive yourself now. You know what happens if you’re rejected by the organization. You’ve been secretly trafficking Bloodians. If the news gets out, the other Bloodian clans led by Bloodian Queens won’t let you off either!”","Upon hearing that, He Duo trembled in anger, but there was nothing she could do. If He Duo had known this was the case, she would never have boarded this pirate ship.","He Duo forced herself to calm down and said coldly, “Hen Tao, you don’t have to keep threatening me like this. I’m well aware of the assurances I was given when I joined the organization. You’re only in charge of cooperating with me. Don’t say such threatening words to me, or don’t blame me for attacking you!”","Hen Tao shrugged his shoulders indifferently. He Duo was no match for him, and she knew this very well.","He Duo’s words clearly sounded a little angry from embarrassment. At this time, Hen Tao did not continue to provoke her. If He Duo was provoked and did something irrational, he would be punished by the organization.","After speaking to Hen Tao, He Duo took a deep breath. Then, she started fighting with the Bloodians opposite her. He Duo needed to vent her anger, and the few Bloodians who were unwilling to submit happened to be targets for her anger. For a moment, the two groups fought.","Lin Yuan did not leave immediately. Instead, he observed their movements to find out some secret information.","The Ancient Water Pythons clearly didn’t take these Bloodian clans seriously, making Lin Yuan think an organization was behind them. This organization hid behind the Ancient Water Pythons and most likely had nothing to do with the other Bloodian Queens.","They chose to cooperate with the Dolores clan because they had taken a fancy to He Duo’s potential and intended to nurture the partner they could control into a genuine Bloodian Queen. Then, through He Duo’s influence, they would further expand the Bloodian trafficking industry. What a good plan!","He was uncertain how truthful their promises were. If the Lan Ling mentioned by the Ancient Water Python wasn’t a Grade 5 Creator, he wouldn’t have the ability to help He Duo become a Bloodian Queen.","Lin Yuan, having assisted Qin Yu into becoming a Bloodian Queen, was well aware of the extensive resources required. Only someone indifferent to pure spirit qi, like Lin Yuan, would entertain such a deal.","Instead of grooming He Duo to become a Bloodian Queen, it made more sense for the organization to ally with an existing Bloodian Queen. The temptation for the Bloodian Queens was considerable. However, He Duo’s acceptance of the offer indicated her belief in Lan Ling’s capabilities.","Lin Yuan found this faction intriguing.","After He Duo engaged in battle, Hen Tao joined the fray. Bloodian clans with queen bloodlines were indeed stronger than those with king bloodlines. Additionally, the purer the bloodline of a Bloodian, the more formidable it appeared to other Bloodians.","The three leaders of the Bloodian clans facing He Duo and Hen Tao were in retreat—one was severely injured and had nearly lost the ability to fight. Yet, He Duo and Hen Tao did not relent.","Lin Yuan surmised their intent. They likely planned to eliminate the accompanying members of the three leaders who had ventured into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and then coerce the leaders into submission. By recruiting the two Bloodian clans with king bloodlines, they would secure resources for an extended period. Thus, He Duo and Hen Tao executed their deadly maneuvers.","Now aware of the situation, Lin Yuan, seeing the Bloodians on the brink of death, turned to Qin Yu and instructed, “Why don’t you save those three Bloodians now? Kill that member from the Ancient Water Pythons and discipline those two from the Dolores clan. However, ensure at least the leader of the Dolores clan survives. I need him to convey the message to his backers.”","Qin Yu was infuriated by He Duo and Hen Tao’s actions, gritting her teeth.","Lin Yuan intended to address the matter later. Had he not issued such an order, Qin Yu would have intervened herself. Initially, Qin Yu was puzzled by Lin Yuan’s directive to kill the Ancient Water Pythons yet spare the Dolores clan.","Upon reflection, Qin Yu understood Lin Yuan’s strategy. He aimed to provoke the faction behind the Ancient Water Pythons to target her, drawing them out. If she refrained from killing the Ancient Water Pythons’ member, she wouldn’t be able to justify it to the other three Bloodian clans. Moreover, He Duo would have to accurately report the situation.","Should that faction dare to confront Qin Yu, it would indicate their readiness and confidence in defeating her in a single strike.","As the intended prey, Qin Yu felt no anxiety. Now part of Lin Yuan’s strategy, she trusted him to ensure her safety.","Qin Yu immediately unleashed her aura.","Hen Tao and He Duo, sensing Qin Yu’s presence, were visibly alarmed. They had not anticipated encountering a Bloodian Queen so soon in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, particularly during their assault on other Bloodians.","Typically, a Bloodian Queen would ignore clan conflicts in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","However, if the opposing Bloodians sought help and highlighted trafficking issues, a Bloodian Queen would not remain indifferent.","Unless the Bloodian Queen was complicit with the organization!","He Duo dismissed the likelihood of such a coincidence. If this organization had access to a Bloodian Queen, why would they expend so much effort on him?","Originally, the three Bloodians had despaired, aware they could be killed at any moment. Yet, they hadn’t anticipated such a dramatic turn of events.","They called for help toward Qin Yu.","Hen Tao, using all his strength, prepared to execute them.","In the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, seeking external assistance was permissible, especially for Bloodian clans led by a Bloodian Queen.","As long as the deaths remained unreported, the two could easily downplay the incident.","However, the disparity between the two sides wasn’t vast enough for a direct overpowering.","Qin Yu raised her hand and unleashed a blood whip, striking Hen Tao forcefully.","The blow nearly cost Hen Tao his life.","Following Qin Yu’s lead, another blood whip lashed out, restraining the eight Bloodians present.","Feigning ignorance, Qin Yu inquired with a frown, “I heard mention of a trafficking situation involving Bloodians. Have you discovered anything? Recently, many Bloodian clans have disappeared, including members from our Elisa clan.”","Hen Tao, reeling from the whip’s impact, lay on the ground struggling to breathe and unable to speak.","He Duo stared at Hen Tao in disbelief.","Had this organization truly attacked a Bloodian clan led by a Bloodian Queen?! They must be incredibly audacious to undertake such an act!","Hen Tao was equally astonished. His organization only sold the Bloodians for income. They were rather careful and wouldn’t attack the members of the clans with Bloodian Queens.","Could it be that other factions were also selling the Bloodians?!"]},{"number":3042,"title":"Chapter 3042: Blood Curse!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3042: Blood Curse!","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","If that were the case, his faction wouldn’t be implicated.","Hen Tao knew that He Duo didn’t trust the organization to begin with. The Bloodian Queen’s words probably made He Duo suspect that the organization was secretly taking action.","The three members of the Bloodian clans were very respectful to Qin Yu. Like a bamboo tube spilling beans, they told Qin Yu about He Tao and He Duo’s coercion against them.","Upon hearing this, Qin Yu immediately dealt with He Tao and raised her hand to whip He Duo. The whip hit He Duo’s face hard, and blood instantly dyed most of her face red.","“I still have to explore the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. I don’t have time to pass judgment on you now. When we get out, we’ll inform the other Bloodian clans of this matter along with the factions behind you. Then, all the Bloodian clans will jointly pass judgment on your Dolores clan. As a Bloodian, it’s a serious crime to sell Bloodians.”","Upon hearing Qin Yu say that she would judge He Duo and the Dolores clan after leaving the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, the three Bloodians couldn’t say anything. They greeted Qin Yu respectfully and immediately left. They were afraid that He Duo would attack them after Qin Yu left.","Having lost her helper and being severely injured, He Duo might not be a match for them. However, if He Duo went crazy and sacrificed her bloodline, she could still take away two of their members.","The leaders of the three Bloodian clans did not want to suffer unnecessary casualties, as the members who had followed them into the Land of Bloodian Ancestors were all top combatants in their clans, and the clans could not afford to lose any one of them.","After the other Bloodians left, Qin Yu first walked toward the blood forest","before returning to Lin Yuan in a roundabout manner.","Qin Yu said softly, “Lord, are there any drawbacks to what we’re doing? What if He Duo doesn’t inform the faction behind her, or if the faction behind her receives He Duo’s report but doesn’t do anything?”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan said firmly, “He Duo is probably in a mess now. She won’t just wait around for judgment to be passed on her. She’s bound to take action before that.","“The faction behind her is the only one that can protect her. If the faction behind her doesn’t interfere in this matter, it will be equivalent to abandoning the Ancient Water Pythons and theie industrial chain. It’s impossible for this faction to be willing to suffer such a huge loss!","“If I haven’t guessed wrongly, He Duo will not continue exploring the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Instead, she will immediately leave and report the situation to the faction behind her. When you and the members of the three Bloodian clans leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, you will most likely be targeted immediately!","“If I’m wrong, at most, I’ll let Autumn and Winter dig deeper into the faction behind it through the Ancient Water Pythons. We have a lot of interrogation methods at our disposal. It’s very easy to pry open their mouths.”","After he finished speaking, Lin Yuan waved at Qin Yu. “We’ve already been delayed for dozens of minutes. Let’s head straight to the blood forest now. Rememberling discovered another good place after devouring the souls. There might be some Bloodian inheritance there. If you can obtain the ancient heritage of the Bloodians, you will most likely have a chance to improve your bloodline.","“The queen bloodline is already the pinnacle for the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory, but it is only ranked in the upper-middle tier in the Bloodians’ heritage. Above the queen are the two bloodlines of the empress and the great empress.","“You’ve devoted yourself to working for me. You can continue transforming your bloodline in the future. If you can find anything in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors that can improve your bloodline, I’ll give it to you first.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Qin Yu was exhilarated. If others heard Lin Yuan’s words, they would think he looked down on the queen bloodline and was biting off more than he could chew.","How could Qin Yu obtain the empress’ bloodline and the great empress’ bloodline so easily?","On the contrary, Qin Yu did not feel that way at all when she heard Lin Yuan’s words. Just the fact that Lin Yuan could bring along a Grade 5 Creator as an attendant proved that his words were not empty boasts.","However, Qin Yu did not have much confidence in herself and doubted her ability to undergo transformation. After all, she had spent a lot of effort to become the Bloodian Queen.","“Young Master, thank you for your love. I’m just afraid that my limited talent will let you down and waste this rare opportunity.”","Qin Yu felt that she had to say what she needed to say first. At present, Qin Yu was already very satisfied that she could follow Lin Yuan and obtain his resources. If she let Lin Yuan down because of bloodline evolution and Lin Yuan no longer invested as many resources in her in the future, then her loss would outweigh her gain.","Qin Yu had an extremely clear understanding of her own talent. Even though her words might disappoint Lin Yuan, it was still better than enduring the inexplicable pressure.","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan smiled and encouraged Qin Yu, “Being able to become a Bloodian Queen by yourself is already an extremely rare feat. Resources are more important than talent in improving bloodlines. With resources, even those with mediocre talents can easily achieve significant improvements.","“Currently, in the Scarlet Territory, I’ve only taken you, a Bloodian Queen, under my wing. Naturally, resources will be prioritized for you.”","While Lin Yuan and Qin Yu were talking, they had already arrived at the entrance of the blood forest. The blood forest was formed by strange red trees. These trees contained extremely dense blood-colored energy, making them extremely outstanding blood-type spiritual ingredients.","Qin Yu told Lin Yuan in an extremely serious tone, “I can even absorb the energy in this blood forest, Lord. There must be treasures underground that can provide nourishment for its growth. I can sense that someone has already begun to absorb the blood-type energy in this blood forest. Judging from the speed of absorption, the person absorbing it is most likely a Bloodian Queen. I’m just not sure who it is.","“This time, every Bloodian clan with a Bloodian Queen has found helpers to enter the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Therefore, if we want to enter, we will definitely have to go against these Bloodian Queens. At that time, you will have to make a move, Lord. I’m most likely no match for the Bloodian Queens.”","Qin Yu didn’t mean that she didn’t want to contribute, but she was speaking the truth. She was a Bloodian Queen for less than a year. In terms of strength, she was no match for the other Bloodian Queens. This was also the reason Qin Yu didn’t dare to provoke the other Bloodian Queens even though she acted high-profile in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Lin Yuan was very enthusiastic about meeting a Bloodian Queen in the blood forest. “Qin Yu, how did the Blood Curse that I asked you to condense before turn out?”","Condensing Blood Curse was something only a Bloodian could do when they reached the level of a queen. It required expending their own bloodline energy, which would waste their bloodline potential, making it an extremely unprofitable transaction.","The Blood Curse’s purpose was to control those Bloodians who had the same bloodline as oneself. In other words, a Bloodian Queen could use the Blood Curse to control another Bloodian Queen.","Qin Yu knew Lin Yuan’s intentions when he first asked her to condense the Blood Curse. He wanted to quickly control the Scarlet Territory by controlling the other Bloodian Queens.","Lin Yuan had the intention to establish himself as the leader of the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory. In comparison, the bloodline expended to condense the Blood Curse seemed completely insignificant.","“Young Master, how could I dare not take seriously the tasks you entrusted to me? I’ve already condensed four Blood Curses during this period. I’ve basically used all the Creator resources you provided me to condense them, which was why my strength has not improved much. If you have any instructions, I can use the Blood Curse at any time.”","Looking at the expectant expression on Qin Yu’s face and the four Blood Curses she had condensed during this period, Lin Yuan could sense Qin Yu’s ambition.","Lin Yuan did not dislike Qin Yu’s ambition at all. In his opinion, only ambitious people could achieve great things. He didn’t want his subordinates to start slacking off.","“Let’s go in and take a look. We can’t let them absorb all the energy in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. It’s also a good opportunity to assess the capabilities of these helpers recruited by the Bloodian clans.”","In addition to intentionally hunting down the Bloodian clans with Bloodian Queens to control the Scarlet Territory, Lin Yuan harbored intentions to control the allies recruited by them. Through this trip to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Lin Yuan wanted to control more factions. It was the only way for Sky City to develop rapidly in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Qin Yu had just released her aura when she heard a stern shout, “Can’t you sense someone is collecting resources here? This blood forest belongs to our Adana clan. You have no right to access the resources within a radius of 500 kilometers. Otherwise, I won’t hesitate to show you our strength!”","The Adana clan was a very ancient clan in the Scarlet Territory. Their current queen was an old fellow who had lived for hundreds of thousands of years. The queen of the Adana clan usually lived in seclusion and did not reveal much of her sharpness. In the Scarlet Territory, the queen of the Adana clan displayed her domineering side for the sake of resources.","If Qin Yu were alone, she would never dare to compete with her. However, with Lin Yuan there, there was really nothing to be afraid of. Moreover, there was a high chance that she could control this queen of the Adana clan through the Blood Curse.","The other party could sense her aura and recognize her identity. Despite acknowledging who she was, the other party still spoke in such a disrespectful manner and didn’t give her any face at all.","Qin Yu shouted, “This is the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. The resources were jointly left behind by our ancestors for our various Bloodian clans. Why should this blood forest belong exclusively to your Adana clan?","“Furthermore, your Adana clan wants to claim the resources within a 500-kilometer radius. Tina, you’re too domineering. Such behavior will only bring trouble to your Adana clan!”","Qin Yu’s words were full of attack, stunning Tina for a long time.","When Qin Yu revealed her aura, Tina immediately recognized her. If there was someone who did not abide by the rules, then the person should be Qin Yu and not herself.","The resources in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors could indeed be snatched, but for Bloodian Queens, there was no need to compete for resources as the resources within it were not scarce. Everyone could just search for their own resources. There was no need to snatch them from each other.","Even though the blood crystals in the hands of the Bloodian Queens were much larger, they still wouldn’t be able to stay in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors for too long. If they still fought over resources under such circumstances, wouldn’t that be equivalent to becoming a fool?","Tina’s strength was much higher than Qin Yu, who had just become a Bloodian Queen. When Qin Yu sensed her aura, she should have left immediately.","She had never restrained her aura. It was Qin Yu’s fault for revealing her aura and fighting over the resources when she was collecting them. It was already good enough that she did not find trouble with Qin Yu.","The elderly man standing beside Tina, with many strange black patterns on his body, exclaimed, “You should be one of the strongest among the queens in the Scarlet Territory. Why is it that someone wants to snatch resources from you? “It will take some time for you to absorb this blood forest. I’ll help you chase this Bloodian Queen away. Atter you leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and return to the Scarlet Territory, you can explain it to her properly. She has to pay a price for being so insensible! ”","Upon hearing that, Tina said gratefully, “I’ll have to trouble you. You’ve helped me this time in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. In the future, when the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks initiate your trial, I will also help you sincerely.”","Tina had been staying in the Scarlet Territory with the Adana clan, but her mind was no longer on the Scarlet Territory itself. Tina had always wanted to bring the Adana clan out of the Scarlet Territory. She believed it would be very difficult for a clan to develop in the Scarlet Territory.","The few Bloodian clans that had left the Scarlet Territory previously had always been in contact with her. Those clans weaker than the Adana Clan back then were now much stronger than them. With her strength and charisma, Tina had been on good terms with many powerful species.","After Tina had her helper reprimand Qin Yu, she planned to use the Blood Curse to control her.."]},{"number":3043,"title":"Chapter 3043: Curse Tattoo Demon Mink!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3043: Curse Tattoo Demon Mink!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Among all the queens in the Scarlet Territory, Qin Yu was undoubtedly the easiest to control. Having been a Bloodian Queen for less than a year, she couldn’t have any significant trump cards.","This Curse Tattoo Demon Mink Elder was not afraid of Qin Yu. Approaching her, he said playfully, “A newly promoted Bloodian Queen dares to compete with a veteran Bloodian Queen for resources?","“Looks like your brain isn’t too good. If I were you, I would have hidden far away when I sensed the auras of the other Bloodian Queens!”","Qin Yu did not waste her breath on this powerhouse from the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks. She knew about them.","The Curse Tattoo Demon Minks had always been on good terms with the Adana clan, and their relationship was unusually close. It was rumored that the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks had sent some of their descendants to the Adana clan, allowing Tina to bite them.","There was once a rumor that the leader of the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks had a crush on Tina. Qin Yu believed this to be true.","For example, Qin Yu herself had many admirers from other species. However, admiration alone could not strengthen the relationship between two species. More importantly, their interests had to align.","Lin Yuan intended to use the Blood Curse to control Tina and the Adana clan. The Curse Tattoo Demon Minks, who were on good terms with the Adana clan, were also resources for Lin Yuan.","The Curse Tattoo Demon Minks and Ancient Water Pythons all had territories near the Scarlet Territory. Perhaps the Curse Tattoo Demon Mink Elder in front of him would become his colleague in the future.","“Hehe, you think my brain isn’t good, but I think you’re pitifully stupid! Is Tina the only one who can call for help? Do you think I can’t call for help?”","With that, Qin Yu circulated the energy in her body and began to absorb the blood energy contained in the blood forest.","Just as the Curse Tattoo Demon Mink Elder was about to speak, he felt a murderous aura envelop him.","Tina was also enveloped by this murderous aura. She felt as if she had fallen into a quagmire and had completely lost the ability to move.","Lin Yuan’s figure appeared in front of Tina and the Curse Tattoo Demon Mink Elder.","Lin Yuan told Tina, “Now, you can be considered my prisoners. You are the current queen of the Adana clan, right? If you want the Adana clan to continue to develop, accept the control of Qin Yu’s Blood Curse. Otherwise, I’ll lock you up until you say yes. I don’t want to use too much force. I hope you won’t give me this chance.”","After speaking to Tina, Lin Yuan turned to the Curse Tattoo Demon Mink Elder.","“I wonder what kind of status you have in the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks. If you can speak up for the species, I will spare your life. If you can’t, you can join the Adana clan and become one of the Bloodians bitten by Tina.”","When Lin Yuan said this, his tone was very relaxed, as if he were an inexperienced young master from a large faction.","However, Lin Yuan’s seemingly ridiculous claims could be executed when he displayed his strength.","For example, Tina and Ke Bachi were no longer able to control their own fates. As long as Lin Yuan gave the order, this expert whose aura Tina and Ke Bachi could not even sense, would eliminate them.","Tina and Ke Bachi’s emotions were very complicated. Tina had originally planned to use the Blood Curse she had created to control Qin Yu. However, she now realized that Qin Yu’s Blood Curse was about to control her.","Qin Yu did not threaten to kill her if she refused to comply. Instead, he warned that if she did not agree, he would force her into submission, subjecting her to humiliation and torture until she complied.","Tina had little choice. If she, a Bloodian Queen, died here, the Adana clan would fall into desolation. Even without Qin Yu’s intervention, other Bloodian Queens would covet the Adana clan’s resources.","If Lin Yuan were only threatening Tina and making her future seem bleak, she might not necessarily obey him. However, when Lin Yuan mentioned giving Ke Bachi the first bite, it indicated that he had placed an expert within the Adana clan, which could greatly benefit them.","Tina knew this was unlikely because Ke Bachi was a core Elder of the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks and ranked among the top three. Based on her understanding of Ke Bachi, she knew he would sensibly choose to submit.","With Ke Bachi already deciding to submit, Tina knew that refusal would lead to dire consequences. She sensed a killing intent from Autumn, accompanied by an abnormally cold aura. The handsome man before her did not care about her life; if the young man opposite him gave the order, she would likely be dealt with.","For species living in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the fear was not of being controlled by stronger forces but of their species’ extinction.","Ke Bachi observed Tina’s hesitation and knew she was struggling to resolve the situation.","While Ke Bachi had a good relationship with Tina, he was unwilling to become a Bloodian by her bite. The pressure high-level Bloodians exerted on lower-level ones was too great, and Ke Bachi would not allow himself to become Tina’s subordinate.","Gritting his teeth, Ke Bachi said, “I am the core Elder of the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks and hold significant influence among them. What orders do you have, Lord?”","He immediately adjusted his attitude towards Qin Yu and lowered his head.","Lin Yuan was pleased with Ke Bachi’s response. His quick adaptation showed his intelligence.","“The Curse Tattoo Demon Minks have a good relationship with the Adana clan. I hope you can persuade the Bloodian Queen beside you to be controlled by Qin Yu through the Blood Curse and become one of my subordinates. Otherwise, the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks will become a dependent species of the Elisa clan. ”","Ke Bachi quickly turned to Tina, urging her to comply. Even if the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks became a dependent species of the Adana clan due to the youth before them, their friendship with Tina would mitigate the situation. However, becoming dependent on the Elisa clan would be far worse.","Though he had never interacted with Qin Yu before, Ke Bachi’s previous attitude toward her indicated that she might hold a grudge.","Seeing that Tina had yet to make a decision, Ke Bachi helplessly sent her a voice transmission. “Tina, you don’t want to suffer before agreeing, right? Do you think Qin Yu will only control you when there are so many Bloodian Queens in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors?","“The faction that Qin Yu has joined is powerful. We can’t resist it. If this faction helps Qin Yu control the other Bloodian Queens, your current attitude will make the Adana clan’s position extremely awkward! A faction like this won’t give you an out. You have to know how to give yourself an out. My attempt to persuade you now can be considered a step-down! ”","Tina agreed with Ke Bachi’s words. If not for having no choice, she would not have chosen to submit.","However, Tina was somewhat unwilling to give up. If someone used a Blood Curse to control her, she would be at their mercy. Once the Blood Curse entered her body, Qin Yu would be able to strip away her bloodline and even control her life and death. Such a life was not easy to live!","Tina knew that if she did not agree now and angered this youth, it would be too late.","She could only lower her head and say, “Lord, I, Adana Tina, am willing to submit to you. I just don’t know if you can give me a chance. Don’t let Qin Yu control me through the Blood Curse. My bloodline and talent are much stronger than Qin Yu’s. I can do whatever Qin Yu can do under you. I can even do it better than Qin Yu! I hope you can fulfill my wish!”","Tina immediately knelt on the ground and looked at Lin Yuan with a pleading gaze.","Lin Yuan was surprised to see this, but Ke Bachi was relieved. He knew very well that Tina was willing to fight and would never submit to anyone easily. Therefore, Tina would fight for herself.","Ke Bachi hoped that Lin Yuan would fulfill Tina’s wish. If he agreed to Tina’s request, it would raise her status in Lin Yuan’s eyes, improving the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks’ situation.","Qin Yu did not expect Tina to have such a trick up her sleeve. She was extremely nervous. She knew that Tina’s talent was far greater than her own. As a subordinate, Tina was more qualified and suitable to control the Scarlet Territory. Qin Yu feared that Lin Yuan might choose to abandon her if he had a better option and allow Tina to control her instead. If Lin Yuan decided to do this, Qin Yu would have no choice but to obey.","Lin Yuan could sense Qin Yu’s nervousness. When he looked at Qin Yu, she did not even dare to meet his gaze.","Tina was extremely smart and knew how to fight for opportunities. However, Lin Yuan had promised Qin Yu that he would not go back on his word. As a","leader, breaking his word would undermine the trust of his subordinates. Lin Yuan could not afford to do that.","Thus, Lin Yuan gave Qin Yu a reason to feel secure.","“Qin Yu joined my army a few months earlier than you. Everything is first come, first served. I’m sure you don’t want the Bloodian Queen who joined my army later to surpass you! It’s still Qin Yu controlling you through the Blood Curse.","“Qin Yu has only condensed four Blood Curses and can only control four Bloodian Queens. If Qin Yu cannot control more candidates, I can hand them over to you. Since you’re a veteran queen, I trust you to assist Qin Yu without any issues.”","Lin Yuan’s words touched Qin Yu. Besides being extremely generous to his subordinates, he was a man of his word. Unlike other leaders, he did not focus on short-term gains and losses.","Tina was slightly disappointed by Lin Yuan’s words. It had become her fate to be controlled by Qin Yu, and there was no possibility of changing it. However, she was also surprised by Lin Yuan’s revelation that Qin Yu had only joined him a few months ago.","Lin Yuan’s attitude toward his subordinates made Tina realize that leading the Adana clan in submitting to Lin Yuan was not impossible.","Several clans in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors had a Bloodian Queen. By assisting Qin Yu, she had a chance to use the Blood Curse to control other","Bloodian Queens, potentially becoming Lin Yuan’s second-in-command in the Scarlet Territory.","Tina was not afraid of Qin Yu’s opinion of her. After all, she was more powerful than Qin Yu. The latter would definitely want the situation to improve if she worked for Lin Yuan, so she would rely on Tina in the future. With her reputation and status among the Bloodians, her influence was much higher than Qin Yu’s.","However, Tina had no intention of undermining Qin Yu. If she subtly manipulated Qin Yu, it would be equivalent to defying Lin Yuan’s orders.","Tina obediently accepted the control of Qin Yu’s Blood Curse before standing behind her. She did not continue to fight with Qin Yu for the dense blood energy in the blood forest.","Since she had arrived at the blood forest first, Tina knew more about its situation. She told Lin Yuan, “Young Master, there’s a blood beast that’s likely to have surpassed the level of the Spirit Territory buried under this blood forest.","“However, due to the passage of time, the energy in the blood beast’s body has almost completely dissipated, leaving only a few bones. These bones have completely turned into jade and look like dark red blood jade. The changes in the bones must be because the bone marrow inside hasn’t been lost.”","Tina had an awkward expression on her face. “Actually, when I first came to the blood forest, I had already started digging. If it weren’t for the fact that Ke Bachi and I couldn’t break through this blood bone with our strength, I would have most likely absorbed the bone marrow by now.","“Why don’t we leave these blood bones to Sister Qin Yu? If these blood bones can be broken, the advanced blood energy inside will definitely allow Sister Qin Yu’s bloodline and strength to improve further!”"]},{"number":3044,"title":"Chapter 3044: Untitled","paragraphs":["Chapter 3044: Untitled","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Tina had just offended Qin Yu because she wanted to compete for power with Qin Yu when she was under Lin Yuan’s command. But right now, power still belonged to Qin Yu and she was only Qin Yu’s assistant. Tina was very willing to curry favor with Qin Yu under such circumstances.","Qin Yu did not appreciate Tina’s kindness. On the contrary, she felt that Tina was being too presumptuous.","Tina was used to being the queen of her clan so she always spoke as if she was the decision maker.","However, Tina was only one of her assistants even Qin Y rarely had the chance to get close to Lin Yuan, let alone Tina.","All the resources Lin Yuan obtained after entering the Land of Bloodian Ancestors belonged to him.","Lin Yuan could reserve and allocate these resources at will, and Tina’s suggestion was more like a decision-making stance. She definitely should not take such an attitude when facing Lin Yuan.","Qin Yu did not choose to watch from the sidelines at a time like this because Tina was not her enemy. Instead, she would be a great help in controlling the Scarlet Territory.","Qin Yu hurriedly said, “Tina, it’s not up to you to decide to whom Master should give these resources. It’s not up to you to interfere. Hurry up and apologize to Master!”","Qin Yu acutely sensed Autumn and Winter, standing beside Lin Yuan, had displeased expressions when Tina spoke. The way they looked at Tina also became sharper.","The two of them were Lin Yuan’s staunch supporters. If Tina continued to treat","Lin Yuan like that, it was very likely that she would be dealt with. After all, Lin Yuan had not taken Tina in as his subordinate. He had only used the Blood Curse that Qin Yu had condensed to control Tina.","Tina immediately realized that she had overstepped her bounds upon hearing Qin Yu’s reminder and hurriedly switched from kneeling to kowtowing as she spoke in a terrified voice. “Lord, I have no intention of using of these resources, nor do I dare to make a decision for you. I only made a suggestion. I hope you can understand, Lord!”","Lin Yuan was not dissatisfied with Tina’s attitude. It was normal for a veteran Bloodian Queen like Tina to be unable to change her attitude after being taken under his wing.","If these jade-shaped blood bones came from a blood beast whose strength surpassed Domain Mountain class, these blood bones would be extremely useful to all blood-type feys.","Compared to letting Qin Yu, a Bloodian, absorb them, these blood bones were undoubtedly much more useful to Blood Love!","“I have my own arrangements for these blood bones. I’ll collect them later. Let Qin Yu absorb the blood energy in this blood forest!”","Qin Yu was not displeased at all that she did not obtain these blood bones. In Qin Yu’s opinion, Lin Yuan had given her enough.","Being able to absorb the blood energy in this blood forest was enough to increase Qin Yu’s strength.","As long as she worked hard for Lin Yuan, she would definitely receive a lot of rewards in the future!","Qin Yu had experienced Lin Yuan’s charity more than once. While Qin Yu had gone to collect the blood energy in this blood forest, Lin Yuan had already picked up six blood bones.","Winter could not help but say with a sigh, “Young Master, only a place like the Land of Bloodian Ancestors can give birth to such a strange object. If not for the fact that the blood energy is so dense, even if a blood-type creature with strength that surpasses Domain Mountain class died in the outside world, such a blood bone would not have condensed.","“These blood bones contain a portion of the bloodline of this blood beast when it was alive. Young Master, you can absorb this bloodline through the Body of All Spirits. This is quite beneficial to you!”","To a certain extent, this blood beast’s strength represented the strength of its bloodline. The stronger the bloodline that Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits absorbed, the greater the enhancement it would provide when activating the bloodline.","Lin Yuan looked at the blood bones and could not help but think of the Realm Abyss Red Lotus Seed’s effects.","Its lotus seeds could revive living beings through their bloodlines. In other words, if Lin Yuan wanted to, he could use these blood bones to revive this blood beast!","He could even use the Business Flourishing Flower to cultivate the Realm Abyss Red Lotus.","Many of the functional feys in Lin Yuan’s hands seemed to be incompatible, but in fact, they could interact with each other in terms of abilities.","Lin Yuan did not intend to waste too much time in this blood forest.","Lin Yuan had a pure Bloodian bloodline. When he activated the Body of All Spirits, he was no different from a traditional Bloodian.","Qin Yu’s information was limited, so there was no need for Lin Yuan to insist that she stay by his side.","However, if he wanted to leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, he needed to use the blood crystal.","Qin Yu had not used her blood crystal much. As a Bloodian Queen, Tina definitely had blood crystals on her.","Lin Yuan felt that it was better to let Qin Yu and Tina work together. With their strength, they could control the other Bloodian Queens.","At that time, it would undoubtedly be much more convenient for Lin Yuan to move by himself if he had a blood crystal. Otherwise, he would waste a lot of time bringing Qin Yu around with him!","Lin Yuan shared his thoughts with Autumn and Winter.","Autumn couldn’t help but say, “Young Master, you should have decided to act alone a long time ago. Bringing Qin Yu along won’t help you at all! Entering the Land of Bloodian Ancestors is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Let’s move quickly.","“Winter and I will protect you and the Young Lady while we sweep the battlefield alone. With Rememberling, we can even explore the entire Land of Bloodian Ancestors! The deeper we go, the more blood energy there will be.","“The Land of Bloodian Ancestors is a mystic realm dedicated to the Bloodians. For it to have existed for so long, there must be a huge secret. There might even be an ancient heritage related to the revival of the Bloodians! You also have their bloodline. If the other Bloodians can take it, so can you!”","Autumn looked down on the Bloodians of the East Universe. As the largest gathering place of the Bloodians in the East Universe, the strength of the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory was too weak.","From the moment he entered the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, he felt that Qin Yu was a burden.","Lin Yuan had no problem controlling the Scarlet Territory, but there was no need to waste so much time on the Bloodians.","Winter agreed with Autumn. “Young Master, I can crush three soul crystals. Each soul crystal contains the power of my attack. Give them to Qin Yu, and they’ll be enough for her and Tina to deal with the other Bloodian Queens.”","Winter was more meticulous than Autumn when thinking about things. Autumn could see the problem clearly, but Winter knew what Lin Yuan was worried about.","Due to the fact that every Bloodian clan with a queen had invited external help, the situation contained too many uncertainties.","With just Qin Yu, Tina, and the Curse Tattoo Demon Minks, there was a high chance that something would happen to them if they were to fight against the people from the queen clans.","As long as he gave Qin Yu insurance, Lin Yuan would naturally not have to worry about her safety.","Lin Yuan was relieved to hear that. He knew how strong Winter was. Winter’s insurance was enough for Qin Yu and Tina to recruit the other Bloodian Queens as their subordinates.","Lin Yuan gave Qin Yu some instructions.","Qin Yu had no complaints about Lin Yuan wanting to act separately from her. Instead, she was very happy. Qin Yu had always had a clear understanding of her own abilities. If she followed Lin Yuan, not only would she be a burden but would also slow down Lin Yuan’s progress.","If Lin Yuan wanted to explore the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and encountered danger, Qin Yu was not sure if she could survive.","Controlling the other Bloodian Queens to unify the Scarlet Territory was something that Qin Yu did not even dare to dream of in the past. Now, there was finally a chance to realize it.","Moreover, Winter had given her three insurance policies.","“Master, since that’s the case, I don’t have to rush to absorb the energy in the blood forest. If I absorb the blood energy here in such a hurry, it will cause considerable waste. After I’m done absorbing the blood energy, I’ll work with Tina. Before we leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Tina and I will strive to control all the Bloodian Queens.”","Qin Yu, a newly promoted Bloodian Queen, did not have much authority or power among the Bloodians. But Tina was different. Tina was on good terms with many Bloodian factions. If Tina was willing, she could contact many Bloodian factions. With Tina’s connections, it would be very easy for her to trick the other Bloodian Queens into completing Qin Yu’s plan.","Qin Yu had always been a highly strategic individual, with her own plans to use Tina’s connections to attract and entice the other Bloodian Queens.","Tina held significant prestige among the Bloodians. Although she was involved in managing the Scarlet Territory as Qin Yu’s assistant, it was likely that the other Bloodian Queens would recognize only Tina, not Qin Yu.","If Tina were to be manipulated, it would prove to Lin Yuan that Qin Yu was inadequate.","To prevent this, the best approach was to diminish Tina’s status and reputation among the other Bloodian Queens.","Qin Yu believed that Tina could sense her intentions.","At this moment, Tina looked at Qin Yu with a hint of resentment. This was because Qin Yu had just sent her a voice transmission to explain her thoughts.","No matter how reluctant Tina was, she had to obey Lin Yuan’s orders.","Lin Yuan had already set off again and arrived at a mountain valley following Rememberling’s instructions.","In the past, this mountain valley must have been an extraordinarily magnificent construction. However, now, more than 95% of it had turned to dust, leaving only a small portion of the wreckage. The remaining fragments were also deteriorating.","Lin Yuan sensed a faint, obscure energy fluctuation in the area. This energy had a hint of temptation.","When Lin Yuan activated the Bloodian bloodline in his body through the Body of All Spirits, the temptation became especially evident, stimulating his Bloodian bloodline’s desires.","Lin Yuan felt that this loss of control was abnormal.","Rather than a resource for Bloodian descendants, it seemed more like a trap.","Autumn had already assessed the situation and exclaimed in surprise, “Young Master, Winter and I once witnessed the peak of the Bloodians and visited the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","“Back then, the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was called the Sacred Red Blood Abyss, where the Bloodians resided.","“Outside the Sacred Red Blood Abyss, on the Dark Blood Plains, lived numerous dark races that depended on the Bloodians. In my memory, the Land of Bloodian Ancestors faced two major crises.","“The first was an intense internal strife. Three peak Bloodian Empresses conspired against the Bloodian Great Empress, whose lifespan was nearing its end. Ultimately, the three Bloodian Empresses perished, and the Blood Great Empress used their energy to extend her own lifespan.","“The second crisis involved a war with a demon insect empire. Both sides engaged in a prolonged conflict. This demon insect empire conquered the Dark Blood Plains, and the Bloodians’ dependent species were nearly annihilated. However, the Bloodians managed to defend the Sacred Red Blood Abyss.","“In the end, the Bloodians emerged victorious, destroying the demon insect empire and flourishing once more. That’s our recollection of the Bloodians. It must have been an unforeseen event that led to their downfall.","“An impressive figure has indeed appeared among the Bloodians, managing to prolong her soul’s existence for such a long time. Even now, her soul hasn’t completely perished. Instead, she’s preparing to be reborn through a new body.","“However, after such a long time, this blood soul has become extremely weak, acting only on instinct. Otherwise, as we approached this area, we would have been attacked by this blood soul!","“Previously, the Bloodians who entered the Land of the Blood Ancestor were fortunate not to have discovered this area. Otherwise, the Scarlet Territory would have long been unified by the Bloodian ancestor who escaped!”","Lin Yuan was visibly shocked.","He was astonished by the longevity of Autumn and Winter, realizing that they had visited the Land of the Blood Ancestor in the void in the past. This meant that even then, Autumn and Winter were already formidable beings!","While Lin Yuan was in shock, he couldn’t help but feel curious about his previous life.","Autumn and Winter had always been his followers. In his previous life, he must have been an extraordinary figure.","Secondly, Lin Yuan was shocked that a lifeform’s soul could exist for such a long time.","This Bloodian expert was no longer as simple as being powerful. This Bloodian expert could even attempt to create life for herself during the calamity.","The Bloodians were an extremely selfish species. It was possible for them to use their descendants to extend their lives.","If this was a trap, there should not be much to gain.","Winter could tell what he was thinking from his expression and quickly said, “Young Master, this place is both a trap and a true treasure trove. That Bloodian was able to make preparations here because she wanted to borrow a body to return to life. Then this Bloodian expert will definitely consider her growth and improvement after reincarnating..”"]},{"number":3045,"title":"Chapter 3045: Soul Nourishing Spiritual Crystal!’","paragraphs":["Chapter 3045: Soul Nourishing Spiritual Crystal!’","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“After they reincarnate, if they want to ensure that their body and soul are perfectly integrated, they need to disperse the energy in their body and increase it again. If they want to increase their strength in a short period, they have to prepare a huge amount of resources and secret treasures.”","Lin Yuan revealed a look of understanding.","It was true that a Bloodian would need many resources to regain their strength after exhausting it all. It would not be an exaggeration to say that this place was a treasure vault!","This Bloodian expert’s soul was dangerous to Rememberling when it had a certain degree of autonomy.","The Bloodian ancestor’s soul level was too high, far exceeding Rememberling’s ability to control souls.","However, once Autumn and Winter took control of the Bloodian ancestor’s soul and allowed Rememberling to absorb it, it would be a huge opportunity for Rememberling.","Not only could this allow Rememberling to condense a spring through its divine kingdom ability, but it could also strengthen some of Rememberling’s abilities.","If the Bloodian ancestor’s soul wanted to reincarnate, her target would definitely be a pureblood Bloodian.","Lin Yuan had been using the Body of All Spirits to activate his bloodline ever since he entered the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Lin Yuan happened to be the perfect target for the Bloodian ancestor’s soul.","Chu Ci’s strength was at World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, which meant she was extremely powerful.","Chu Ci had been rather satisfied with her own abilities.","However, during this period of training, Chu Ci had completely realized her shortcomings. This made her put away the complacency in her heart.","Chu Ci had heard what Autumn and Winter had just said, so she worriedly asked Lin Yuan, “Big Brother, is it really okay for you to activate your Bloodian bloodline and make yourself the target of that Bloodian’s soul?”","Chu Ci was very worried about Lin Yuan’s safety. She had not had much contact with Autumn and Winter before. Even though she had seen Autumn and Winter display their strength along the way, she still did not know much about their strength levels.","If someone else had said this, Autumn and Winter would have already shown their displeasure. Chu Ci’s words were equivalent to questioning their abilities.","However, because Chu Ci was the one who said it, they definitely could not pursue the matter.","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Chu Ci, don’t worry. You know my personality. I won’t get involved recklessly! Autumn and Winter will ensure my safety. You don’t need to be nervous. This trip to the Bloodian territory is a great opportunity to expand our knowledge. After this journey, our horizons and experience will grow significantly.”","This was a rare opportunity. Otherwise, with Lin Yuan’s previous disposition, he would never have let Chu Ci participate in such a dangerous situation.","As Lin Yuan and Chu Ci conversed, three arrays lit up in the ruins.","More than ten nine-meter-tall magic stone statues appeared in each array.","These statues, products of alchemy technology, had different postures and intricate designs.","From the energy they emitted, these statues had all reached the Holy Spirit level, with a few even at pinnacle Holy Spirit level.","Lin Yuan was intrigued by these statues.","Indeed, Spirit Craftsmen would use their skills to create puppets. However, puppets made by Spirit Craftsmen could only perform simple tasks and usually lacked combat abilities.","Yet, these man-made objects were so powerful that nearly 40 stone statue puppets emerged from the three arrays and attacked Lin Yuan’s group without warning.","Lin Yuan asked Autumn and Winter, who were guarding him and Chu Ci,","“Autumn, Winter, can we keep these puppets? I think they would be very useful to Sky City!”","If these combat puppets could be installed on the backs of the Floating Island Whales and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, they would greatly aid in constructing the war fortress.","These puppets had endured countless years in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and still possessed formidable combat abilities. Developing the means to create these puppets would be worthwhile, regardless of the resources required.","Building a puppet with Holy Spirit strength should not consume more resources than nurturing a Holy Spirit expert.","Winter raised his hand and shot out a layer of ice crystals, which landed on the stone statue puppets, freezing them immediately.","Winter explained, “Young Master, these stone statues were created by Alchemists, a rare branch of Craftsmen. In the past, there were many Alchemists among the Bloodians. Creating these puppets required a large amount of materials and fresh bodies. The power sources inside these stone statues are actually corpses.","“Alchemy was once considered an evil profession. A Spirit Craftsman needs significant resources to become an Alchemist, and the investment often outweighs the output. Fresh remains are difficult to obtain, which led to the decline of Alchemists. However, some large Bloodian clans likely still have Alchemist inheritances.","‘Young Master, after we leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, you can ask Qin","Yu to help investigate! I’ve frozen these stone statues. If we can find the main body controlling them, we can take these puppets and use them. If not, they will be mere decorations. Once the ice melts, these stone statues will resume attacking us as before.”","This was the first time Lin Yuan had heard of the Alchemist profession.","It would be ideal if there were Alchemists among the Bloodians. If not, Lin Yuan intended to nurture a group of Alchemists.","According to Winter, Alchemists gradually lost their inheritance because resources were difficult to obtain.","The hunting team was constantly tracking down star pirates, and their bodies were always fresh. These bodies were left for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, who clearly couldn’t digest them all!","If given to Red Thorn and Silver Corona, they wouldn’t need these bodies even with an endless supply of Tooth Rats.","Using the bodies of these star pirates to nurture Alchemists was the best option.","With so many stone statue puppets around, it was likely that the Bloodian who had set up this place was an Alchemist.","Lin Yuan wondered if there was an Alchemist’s inheritance here.","Autumn could sense Lin Yuan’s thoughts.","“Young Master, although the Alchemist legacy has mostly been lost, some books on Alchemy still exist. You’ve been trading with Fortune Treasure Palace before. An organization like that probably hides the complete inheritance of Alchemists. Even if they don’t have a perfect inheritance, they must have many books about Alchemy.","“The best profession to become an Alchemist isn’t a Spirit Craftsman, but a Creator. You have many Grade 4 and Grade 5 Creators under you. If you like, you can train them to become Alchemists. Only advanced Alchemists can maximize the effects of those materials, creating war puppets with many abilities. The puppets refined by some Alchemists I’ve met were even stronger than when the main material was alive.”","Lin Yuan didn’t lack materials. He felt it was better to recruit experts to guard the Floating Island Whales and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants than to use puppets.","Normal powerhouses found it hard to withstand the loneliness of being a tool. The experts guarding the Floating Island Whales and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were essentially no different from tools.","The Bloodian who had set up this place probably had two motives for leaving behind these stone statue puppet guards.","The first goal was to test if the Bloodian juniors who came here were strong enough.","This Bloodian ancestor didn’t want her soul to be attached to a weakling.","The second goal was to drain a lot of energy from the Bloodians who came here to prevent them from resisting when their bodies were occupied.","However, Lin Yuan felt that there were too many guards.","There were more than 30 Holy Spirit stone statue guards, and a few had reached pinnacle Holy Spirit.","The Bloodian Queens in the Scarlet Territory were most likely incapable of handling this.","This was probably the main reason the Bloodian ancestor’s soul had never successfully occupied a body.","After Winter froze the stone statue guards, Lin Yuan and the others entered the depths of the ruins.","Along the way, Lin Yuan found many spiritual ingredients but wasn’t in a hurry to collect them.","After dealing with the Bloodian ancestor’s soul, Lin Yuan released a few Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form from the Spirit Lock spatial zone to gather the resources.","The Bloodian bloodline in Lin Yuan’s body was very pure. In terms of bloodline strength, his current bloodline was not inferior to Oin Yu’s.","Even though the Bloodian ancestor’s soul had lost most of its consciousness and become a bit chaotic, it still targeted Lin Yuan directly and pounced on him.","Before the Bloodian ancestor’s remnant soul could get within 100 meters of Lin Yuan, it was captured by two yellow leaves.","The energy from the yellow leaves firmly imprisoned the Bloodian ancestor’s soul. Its violent struggle vaguely revealed the appearance of the Bloodian ancestor when she was alive.","This Bloodian ancestor was exceptionally beautiful, and she possessed the pride and nobility unique to high-level Bloodians. She completely overshot Qin Yu, Tina, and the other Bloodian Queens. This meant that this Bloodian ancestor’s bloodline had already surpassed the queen level!","The strength of a Bloodian’s bloodline could be somewhat reflected in their appearance.","However, using one’s juniors as vessels for revival was certainly not the trait of a good person. “Autumn, help Rememberling devour this Bloodian ancestor’s soul. Once Rememberling absorbs the soul, I should understand the calamity the Bloodians faced and what transpired in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","“It’s fortunate that this Bloodian ancestor made these arrangements.","Otherwise, it would have been challenging to obtain these valuable items while wandering the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Autumn and Winter nodded in agreement with Lin Yuan.","If the Bloodian had not forcibly preserved her soul, and if Lin Yuan didn’t possess a fey capable of reading her memories through his soul, there would be no chance to delve into the history of the Bloodians or understand the situation in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","To preserve her soul, this Blood ancestor had made numerous arrangements. The ruins housed many billion-year-old Mystic Ice crystals, and even Ice Hearts were present.","Though the 100-million-year-old Mystic Ice and Ice Hearts had mostly disappeared over time, traces still remained.","The leaves of the Soul-Retaining Grass had withered, but this resilient plant-species fey could last millions of years.","These hundred-million-year-old Mystic Ice and Ice Hearts helped extend the lifespan of the Soul-Retaining Grass. Without them, the Bloodian ancestor’s soul would have dissipated long ago.","Autumn nodded at Lin Yuan’s instructions and said, “Young Master, it’s easy for you to control this Bloodian’s soul and let your feys devour it. Under my control, this Bloodian’s soul won’t be able to resist. However, I need to separate her soul first. The force controlling the stone statue puppets outside is hidden in the soul of this Bloodian ancestor. I was curious why those stone statue puppets followed orders so precisely, but now I understand.”","With that, one of the fallen leaves burrowed into the Bloodian’s soul and extracted a translucent crystal.","Autumn presented the crvstal to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, this is a Soul Nourishing Spirit Crystal, a high-end treasure that can enhance soul power. This crystal has already fused with the Bloodian ancestor. Removing it now will make it lose its nurturing effect. However, it controls the thirty-odd stone statue puppets frozen by Winter outside.”","Lin Yuan examined the transparent crystal, smaller than half his fingernail, and thought to himself that if it fell to the ground, very few would notice it.","Using this tiny crystal to control over thirty Holy Spirit-level puppets would be a significant advantage for Lin Yuan.","If any Bloodian Queen could control these stone statue puppets, her clan would dominate the other Bloodian clans.","The Bloodian Queens had transcended the Holy Spirit level, but the strength at the Holy Spirit level matched that of the Bloodian kings.","No matter how prosperous the Bloodian clans in the Scarlet Territory were, there were usually no more than ten Bloodian kings. For instance, there were only two Bloodian kings in Qin Yu’s Elisa clan.","Rememberling happily absorbed the Blood ancestor’s soul. With Autumn’s assistance in suppressing the Bloodian ancestor’s soul, the absorption process went smoothly.."]},{"number":3046,"title":"Chapter 3046: Pinnacle Bloodian Empress!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3046: Pinnacle Bloodian Empress!","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As it absorbed the Blood ancestor’s soul, Rememberling transmitted its content to Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan now knew why the Land of Bloodian Ancestors had been exiled and why the map and resources had been hidden.","Autumn and Winter had previously come to the Sacred Red Blood Abyss and interacted with the Bloodians when they were at their peak. However, they did not know what kind of combat power the Bloodians had at their peak.","At that time, the Bloodians had been in the top 100 of the Species Ranking many times. Although they had never been in the top 10, the fact that they could enter the top 100 of the Species Ranking every year was enough to show the strength and status of this species.","Lin Yuan was not sure if this Bloodian had been present during that peak. When she was alive, she was a pinnacle Bloodian Empress. With such strength, she could summon the wind and rain in the current territory and control the highest authority of the Bloodians.","The pinnacle Bloodian Empress, Tirosi, had always been suppressed in the Sacred Red Blood Abyss because of the presence of two Bloodian Great Empresses.","These two Bloodian Great Empresses were the true rulers of the Sacred Red Blood Abyss.","The decline of the Bloodians was largely due to their cruelty. They treated other species as food and gave them no way out. At least 1,000 species would disappear from the Sky Beyond the Clouds every hundred years because of this.","The Bloodians’ actions caused widespread panic. Many weaker species had strong alliances behind them.","The Bloodians were abnormally domineering and disregarded these alliances, causing many powerful species to become their enemies.","Additionally, the decline of the Bloodians was linked to the power struggle between the two Bloodian Great Empresses.","At that time, the Bloodians were divided into two factions, each led by a Bloodian Great Empress. The ensuing battle greatly damaged the foundation of the Bloodians.","This internal conflict gave other species the opportunity to launch a war against the Bloodians.","Without this infighting, the other species would not have dared to attack the Bloodians and start the so-called holy war.","Tirosi had been suppressed by the two Bloodian Great Empresses. However, as long as she did not anger them, she had significant authority, allowing her to make arrangements to revive the Bloodians at the last moment.","Lin Yuan thought that by receiving Tirosi’s memories, he would understand the history of the Bloodians and obtain many treasures in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Unexpectedly, the Bloodians were utterly defeated and suffered a crushing loss in their battle against other species.","The treasures in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors were mostly plundered by the invading species.","The only legacy in the inner sea of the Bloodian land was a blood pool created by the two Bloodian Great Empresses using their bloodlines before realizing the fall of the Bloodians.","At that time, most Bloodian powerhouses were thrown into the blood pool after dying in battle. That blood pool should have been Tirosi’s home.","Tirosi not being in the blood pool was a violation of the orders of the two Bloodian Great Empresses.","Fortunately, Tirosi violated these orders. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have known the entire history of the Bloodians or discovered the blood pool hidden in the depths of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","This blood pool was hidden by a restriction. Without knowing its exact location, one could only sense it after becoming a Bloodian Empress.","The two Bloodian Great Empresses who set up this blood pool never imagined that few Bloodians could become a Bloodian Queen, let alone a Bloodian Empress.","Since this blood pool was crucial for the future of the Bloodians, it likely contained inheritances that could enhance bloodlines and energy, and possibly even alchemical knowledge!","There was no reason for the Bloodians not to keep such an ability that they were so proud of.","Lin Yuan summoned Genius and synchronized the information he had obtained with Autumn. Winter. and Chu Ci. allowing them to see the entire history of the Bloodians.","Autumn could not help but say, “The Bloodians were really too arrogant back then. Furthermore, there was a conflict between the Bloodian Great Empresses back then. No matter how powerful a faction was, it could have been disintegrated.","“It’s said that when one is at the peak of their power, they will definitely decline. The essence of being at the peak of their power often means that the internal structure of this huge force has already decayed.","“If these two Bloodian Great Empresses hadn’t fought each other back then and instead worked together to develop the Bloodians, no matter how many factions the Bloodians offended, those species would not dare to start a holy war. The essence of this holy war is a plundering operation initiated by those factions when they saw that the Bloodians’ foundations were depleted because of the battle between the two Bloodian Great Empresses!","“All operations seek a return that is greater than the cost, especially when this operation involves multiple factions. If they pay a huge price just to take revenge on the Bloodians, not to mention that it’s impossible for those factions to combine together, even if they do, they will fight with each other and cause the operation to fail.”","Autumn’s words were emotional. He had witnessed too many powerful forces being destroyed because of internal problems.","This made Autumn extremely supportive of Lin Yuan’s control over the Creators.","Through the Lifespan Mouse, he controlled those Creators’ life and death. He could completely prevent those Creators from having any disloyal thoughts. Otherwise, with so many Creators in a faction, there would inevitably be hidden dangers.","Rememberling still needed some time to absorb Tirosi’s soul. Lin Yuan played with the Revival Spirit Crystal in his hand.","Lin Yuan could sense waves of soul fluctuations from the Rejuvenating Soul Spirit Crystal. It was likely that these energy fluctuations were the special energy circuits that had been carved.","This method of drawing energy circuits happened to be one of the inheritances of Alchemists.","Rememberling had asked Lin Yuan many times to evolve its grade, but Lin Yuan had rejected it.","Compared to evolving, Lin Yuan wanted Rememberling to use Soul Leaping Tide Spring to condense more springs.","Lin Yuan had many Creators under his command. The springs that Rememberling had condensed through the Soul Leaping Tide Spring was not only useful to these Creators but also to the core members of Sky City and the Hundred Questions Beast army.","Faith power was nothing to Lin Yuan. He could understand Rememberling’s desire to evolve.","However, it was really a waste to waste so much soul energy here just to evolve. After absorbing Tirosi’s soul energy, at least dozens of springs could be condensed!","It would take some time for Morbius to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, and Lin Yuan could not provide Grade 6 Creator resources for the Creators under his command.","However, if he wanted these Creators to work hard and create value for Sky City, he must give them some benefits.","The spring provided by Rememberling was the best benefit for these Creators.","Lin Yuan had given Qin Yu a Thoughts Letter Paper, and they could communicate through it In the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Although the greatest inheritance was the blood pool, there were many other resources stored elsewhere.","Lin Yuan did not have time to collect these resources himself, so he simply shared them with Qin Yu. After Qin Yu and Tina took control of the other Bloodian Queens, they would lead them in sweeping through these resource points.","Lin Yuan would not ask Qin Yu for the resources obtained from these points. He would leave them for Qin Yu to develop the Elisa clan and the Scarlet Territory.","This trip had solidified the Scarlet Territory as a faction under his absolute control.","While Lin Yuan was developing in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Sky City was entrenched North of the Lonely River. The Scarlet Territory acted as an external tentacle for Sky City, allowing Lin Yuan to obtain resources and communicate effectively with the outside world.","Compared to the ramets of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, the Thoughts Letter Paper was much more convenient.","Since Lin Yuan knew the topographic map of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, he spent time marking the blood forest on the Thoughts Letter Paper, providing Qin Yu with an accurate reference point.","With Qin Yu’s abilities, she could certainly handle this task well.","If she could not, she would be unable to help Lin Yuan control the vast Scarlet Territory.","Qin Yu moved quickly, fearing that some Bloodian Queens would escape from the Land of Bloodian Ancestors if they felt endangered.","If that happened, she would lose the chance to control the Bloodian Queens in the Scarlet Territory. Once outside, accidents were inevitable if she tried to control them again.","Qin Yu did not want similar rumors to spread.","If the outside world knew that the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was under her control, surrounding factions would certainly harbor bad intentions.","Lin Yuan likely wanted her to manage these tasks in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to prevent any rumors from spreading.","Qin Yu had no intention of asking how Lin Yuan knew about the various arrangements for the Bloodians.","The first time Qin Yu saw Lin Yuan, he had used his Bloodian bloodline.","Lin Yuan claimed to come from a clan called Elise. At that time, Qin Yu had believed he was a member of the Bloodians. However, she gradually suspected that the Bloodians were just a cover for Lin Yuan’s true identity. Now, Qin Yu couldn’t help but question his identity as a Bloodian.","If Lin Yuan were a pureblood Bloodian from the Scarlet Territory, he would know some of the secrets of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Since he came to the Scarlet Territory to obtain the inheritance in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, everything made sense.","Qin Yu controlled the Bloodian Queens through the Blood Curse and used the soul jade that Winter had given her for protection.","Neither the Bloodian Queens nor the factions invited by the queens to help had truly submitted to her. Qin Yu needed to establish her authority.","Now was the perfect opportunity to do so.","After Qin Yu took control of these Bloodian Queens, she brought them to sweep the resources in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Lin Yuan had already promised in the Thoughts Letter Paper that these resources would be handed over to Qin Yu for use.","The meaning behind Lin Yuan’s actions was obvious. Lin Yuan was delegating authority to her so that she could manage the Scarlet Territory.","Lin Yuan had praised her so much so she definitely could not disappoint him.","Qin Yu was the first to inform Tina. Tina was Lin Yuan’s designated assistant and she had put a lot of effort into helping him control the other Bloodian Queens.","Tina’s prestige among the Bloodians was even higher than hers, so it would be effortless for her to drag Tina along with her to do many things.","Tina did not have authority now, but these Bloodian Queens were not fools. Firstly, these Bloodian Queens were controlled by her Blood Curse. Secondly, these Bloodian Queens would soon know that there was a behemoth supporting them.","Qin Yu was not worried at all about her controlling the Scarlet Territory.","Tina was astonished to receive Qin Yu’s information and could not help but ask, “Qin Yu, is Lord Lin Yuan really a Bloodian? I saw that the guards beside him didn’t have a Bloodian bloodline. I thought that Lord Lin Yuan’s Bloodian identity was a disguise!”","Qin Yu gently shook her head. “There are some things I can’t reveal. Do you think I can unravel Lord Lin Yuan’s secrets? Whether Lord Lin Yuan is a","Bloodian or not, having Him control the Scarlet Territory benefits the East Universe’s Bloodians!","“If someone else controlled the Scarlet Territory, they would likely exploit its resources. But Lord Lin Yuan has invested in the Scarlet Territory and is taking responsibility for its development.","“Lord Lin Yuan will provide us with the resources obtained from the Bloodian Territory. I believe these resources will be sufficient to produce several more Bloodian Queens in the Scarlet Territory!","“You and I must restrain the other Bloodian clans to prevent them from doing things that Lord Lin Yuan disapproves of, ensuring the future of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. ”","Tina nodded with a serious expression. Qin Yu’s words might make the other Bloodian Queens feel like she was overstepping her bounds.","However, Tina had interacted with Lin Yuan and knew him well. She understood that Qin Yu was speaking the truth.","“Don’t worry. Since I’ve submitted to Lord Lin Yuan and become one of his subordinates, I’ll remember the mission he gave me and assist you!","“Qin Yu, you know me well. I’ve always valued benefits. In the future, when you use this batch of resources to develop the Scarlet Territory, please don’t deliberately suppress the development of the Adana clan.","“I’m not disloyal to you! Your Blood Curse has a hold on me. I believe you trust me. As the newest Bloodian Queen, it’s natural for the other queens to be wary of you. I’ll use your methods to elevate your status.”","Ever since Tina had been controlled by Qin Yu’s Blood Curse, they hadn’t communicated much.","Tina’s heartfelt words were for both herself and the Adana clan.","A person who valued benefits would always adapt to their environment in their own way.","Qin Yu turned to Tina, her expression serious as she gently stroked Tina’s cheek.. “I will not mistreat the Adana clan if you show such determination!”"]},{"number":3047,"title":"Chapter 3047 Lin Yuan’s Bloodline Transformation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3047 Lin Yuan’s Bloodline Transformation","....","“You’re not the only one with selfish motives for the Adana clan. I have my own motives for the Elisa clan. Instead of investing this batch of resources in other Bloodian clans, why don’t our two clans split them? Let’s aim to produce one or two new Bloodian Queens after us.","“We can also use these resources to increase our strength. Our power determines our control over the other Bloodians. The stronger we are, the more the other Bloodian Queens will fear us, and the less they’ll dare to disobey.”","Tina was overjoyed at Qin Yu’s words. She didn’t mind Qin Yu’s selfishness, as long as the Adana clan benefited as well.","The Elisa clan had to take a larger share of these resources.","In the future, the Elisa clan would surpass the other Bloodian clans in the Scarlet Territory in overall strength. Tina was sure of it.","Tina sensed that Qin Yu also wanted to befriend her. With this intention, Qin Yu would definitely give the Adana clan substantial resources.","However, Tina still had some concerns about Qin Yu’s resource allocation method.","“Lord Lin Yuan asked us to strengthen the Scarlet Territory with these resources. Will he really have no objections if we give them to our two clans?”","Qin Yu replied firmly, “Tina, Lord Lin Yuan has only interacted with us two Bloodian Queens in the Scarlet Territory. He has never dealt with any other Bloodian Queens.","“Lord Lin Yuan is extremely busy. After this trip to the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, he’ll most likely leave. He doesn’t have time to waste here. As long as we work hard for him, he won’t mind if we develop our own clans. He asked us to collect these resources ourselves, which tacitly allows us to distribute them as we see fit.","“I still have one Blood Curse left. I can control only one Bloodian Queen. No matter who the next Bloodian Queen is, I’ll be in control. I’ll leave the rest to you.”","Tina had been cooperating with Qin Yu from the start, and now their common interest had brought them even closer.","...","As Lin Yuan advanced toward the blood pool, Rememberling was getting tired of absorbing souls.","Fortunately, Rememberling used Soul Leaping Tide Spring to transform its soul energy into a spring. This way, it didn’t need to consume its own energy. Otherwise, Rememberling would have given up long ago.","For the first time since it was born, Rememberling felt that absorbing souls had become a burden.","Winter noticed Rememberling’s reluctance and chuckled. “Little fellow, you don’t know how lucky you are! How many other soul-type feys are treated like you? It might be annoying to absorb these souls now, but once you leave this place, you won’t have the chance to absorb souls so freely. Enjoy it while you can!","“At this rate, it will only take another day or two to absorb all the souls in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Although absorbing these souls didn’t convert them into faith power to evolve your grade, this soul power isn’t just about condensing springs for you.”","Winter felt that only Lin Yuan’s feys would have such thoughts when faced with fortuitous opportunities.","When Rememberling heard Winter’s words, it realized that there was something wrong with its attitude and hurriedly corrected it. It was indeed as Winter had said. Absorbing this soul energy would also increase the prosperity of its divine kingdom while condensing springs.","The prosperity of Rememberling’s divine kingdom was increasing at breakneck speed. This was very helpful for Rememberling’s future growth.","From Tirosi’s memory, Lin Yuan would not have discovered the restriction if he had not known in advance.","If he wanted to enter the blood pool, he would need Autumn and Winter’s help!","Autumn and Winter released their auras and sent their spiritual power into the surrounding environment.","Soon, they discovered something special about this place.","At the very least, one of the two Bloodian Great Empresses was a powerful Alchemist. This was because she had used the methods of an Alchemist to conceal the blood pool.","A playful expression appeared on Autumn and Winter’s faces.","Tirosi had the intention of reincarnating through the arrangement of her Alchemist abilities. Who knew if these two Bloodian Great Empresses had similar thoughts?","If the souls of these two Bloodian Great Empresses were still around, they would definitely have existed for much longer than Tirosi, a pinnacle Bloodian Empress.","Both Autumn and Winter were on high alert, fearing that Lin Yuan and Chu Ci might fall into the Bloodian Great Empresses’ trap. When facing such formidable experts, even Autumn and Winter had to be serious. Otherwise, they risked failure.","They shared their concerns and thoughts with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan believed that if the inheritances left by these two Blood Great Empresses were full of schemes, the Bloodians would be inferior.","After some thought, Lin Yuan explained the situation to Chu Ci.","Even Autumn and Winter had to be cautious in the current situation. Lin Yuan did not want Chu Ci to be involved as she lacked the life-saving trump cards he possessed.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Chu Ci obediently entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone. She did not want to cause trouble for Lin Yuan and knew he would provide her with any treasure that suited her.","Autumn and Winter examined the broken bones stored there. Once these broken bones’ energy circuits were activated, a huge blood pool appeared before Lin Yuan. The blood pool contained majestic and shocking blood energy.","If a Bloodian Empress were to enter this place, she could probably become a Bloodian Great Empress with the energy in this blood pool!","Many blood-type spiritual ingredients floated in the blood pool, each an incomparable treasure to blood energy.","There was a display rack beside the blood pool with over ten pieces of spatial equipment. This was clearly the arrangement of the Land of Inheritance.","The dozen or so spatial devices likely contained the foundation the Bloodians had accumulated over thousands of years.","Since the blood pool appeared, Autumn and Winter had been investigating the environment. After some investigation, Winter said, “Young Master, the souls of the two Bloodian Empresses have already perished. Everything here was set up by the two Bloodian Empresses for the Bloodians’ inheritance. Autumn and I can’t sense any soul auras here.","“The two Bloodian Great Empresses set up a restriction to prevent Bloodians below empress-class from entering because their bloodlines aren’t at empress-class. If they rashly enter the blood pool to absorb its energy, their bodies might explode and die.","“However, this has no restrictive effect on your Body of All Spirits. You can directly enter the blood pool and absorb the Bloodian bloodline power abundant in the pool to strengthen the Bloodian bloodline that your Body of All Spirits controls!","“Although the bloodline energy in this blood pool is strong, it won’t take long for your Body of All Spirits to absorb it. Autumn and I will check the supplies left by the two Bloodian Great Empresses while protecting you. We will reorganize these supplies for you to investigate later.”","Winter and Autumn had always been considerate. With their help in organizing these supplies, Lin Yuan could save a lot of effort.","Autumn and Winter’s investigations were definitely accurate. It seemed the two Bloodian Great Empresses truly wanted to leave a legacy for the Bloodians. They had not left any other means in the blood pool.","“Autumn and Winter, I’ll have to trouble you. After absorbing the bloodline in the blood pool, I’ll use the Bloodian bloodline to strengthen myself. I think my strength will increase.”","With Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter protecting him, Lin Yuan did not have to worry about his safety.","Apart from ensuring his safety, Lin Yuan prioritized enhancing his strength. Having someone to protect him and being strong on his own were entirely different things.","Lin Yuan was curious about the extent of his strength after absorbing the energy from the blood pool.","Now that he had arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he was no longer just an ordinary spirit qi professional reliant on conventional methods to increase his power, which would take considerable time.","Lin Yuan jumped into the blood pool. Since his Bloodian bloodline had been active all this time, the energy in the blood pool did not reject him.","The moment he entered the blood pool, Lin Yuan felt the Bloodian bloodline energy surging toward him.","He activated the Body of All Spirits, allowing the bloodline energy to flow into his body.","Lin Yuan had expected absorbing the Bloodian bloodline would be painful, as any bloodline transformation usually caused significant changes in one’s physique.","However, he was surprised to find that the bloodline energy was obediently controlled by the Body of All Spirits, causing no pain. It seemed as if the Body of All Spirits was superior to the Bloodian bloodline, even suppressing the Bloodian Empress’ heritage.","While absorbing the bloodline power, Lin Yuan realized that the abundant vitality in the blood pool was not what he needed. It would be a waste to stay there without a way to utilize it.","Lin Yuan summoned the Jasmine Lily.","The Jasmine Lily, never one to reject vitality, could potentially transform its bloodline with the majestic vitality present there. It had been some time since its last transformation.","When Lin Yuan summoned the Jasmine Lily into the blood pool, it sensed the environment and became extremely excited. It communicated with Lin Yuan through their spiritual connection.","Despite the vitality’s benefits, the Jasmine Lily awaited Lin Yuan’s command before absorbing it.","Sensing its excitement, Lin Yuan said, “Jasmine Lily, this blood pool is a great opportunity for you. Absorb the vitality and blood energy here. Your red crystallized flower head is particularly attuned to this blood energy. See if absorbing it can complete your bloodline transformation.","“You’ve always said you were at the threshold of transformation, lacking only the right opportunity or external force. Now that the opportunity and external force are here, it’s up to you to seize it!”","The Jasmine Lily was the first fey Lin Yuan had spirit-locked, and he had high hopes for it. Since contracting the Jasmine Lily, he hadn’t contracted another healing-type fey.","Genius and Chimey had indeed created a legend in fey history, and to a certain extent, the Jasmine Lily had too. It had grown from an ordinary, disregarded fey in a Class 1 world to a significant force, a legend created by Lin Yuan and the Jasmine Lily.","“Yuan, the vitality and blood energy in this blood pool are incredibly abundant. Absorbing all this blood energy will not only improve my bloodline but might also trigger new changes.","“You’ve previously infused me with a lot of faith power, allowing me to reach pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. I’m only a step away from the Holy Spirit level. I’ll use this opportunity to try to evolve directly to the Holy Spirit level, maximizing my bloodline transformation!”","Since the Jasmine Lily had a clear plan, Lin Yuan decided not to interfere, supporting its idea instead. The faith power he had provided was sufficient for its evolution.","“Jasmine Lily, since you have a plan, work hard. I also need to improve my bloodline here. If you need anything, let me know. While there’s rich vitality and blood energy here, the spirit qi is limited. Make sure the lack of spirit qi doesn’t hinder your transformation!”","Lin Yuan and the Jasmine Lily began absorbing the energy in the blood pool.","Lin Yuan’s absorption of bloodline energy was much faster than the Jasmine Lily’s absorption of blood energy and vitality.","In less than three minutes after entering the blood pool, Lin Yuan’s Bloodian bloodline had reached the queen level. In terms of strength, it was now comparable to the highest Bloodian bloodline in the Scarlet Territory.","When encountering a Bloodian, Lin Yuan would hide his energy fluctuations. If a Bloodian sensed his aura, they would likely regard him as a true Bloodian Queen.","The improvement of Lin Yuan’s bloodline was only the beginning. As his Bloodian bloodline reached the queen level, it continued to improve rapidly, causing significant changes in his Bloodian form."]},{"number":3048,"title":"Chapter 3048 Immortal Spirit Jump!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3048 Immortal Spirit Jump!","When a Bloodian’s bloodline reached the level of a queen, their gender would change. Once a male Bloodian King took this step, he would transform into a female Bloodian.","....","This was very similar to the situation of the mermaids. There were almost no mermans among the high-grade mermaids, but there were occasionally mermans for special reasons. However, there were no male Bloodians above the queen bloodline.","At present, Lin Yuan’s facial features were more beautiful, and it was difficult to determine his gender from his appearance. However, in terms of appearance, Lin Yuan’s looks were already above those Bloodian Queens.","Lin Yuan’s appearance was outstanding, and it was related to the enhancement bestowed by the Bloodian bloodline. In particular, Lin Yuan had a natural aura and a noble temperament. Unlike the fierce arrogance often displayed by other high-level Bloodians, Lin Yuan was calm and composed.","As they watched Lin Yuan absorb the bloodline energy in the blood pool, even Autumn and Winter could not help but be dazed.","Autumn couldn’t help but whisper to Winter, “I’m afraid only the Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly that Young Master contracted can compare to Young Master’s appearance. With his enhanced aura, even the butterfly pales in comparison.”","Although Winter strongly agreed, he frowned and said, “Autumn, is it our place to judge Young Master’s appearance? You’re overstepping. Remember your place!”","Autumn’s heart skipped a beat, and he quickly lowered his head. Lin Yuan’s attitude toward him had significantly changed their interactions compared to their previous lives. Shocked by Lin Yuan’s appearance, Autumn hadn’t been careful with his words. Nonetheless, his respect for Lin Yuan remained unwavering.","Winter glanced at Lin Yuan and thought that the two Bloodian Great Empresses must be concerned about issues with the Bloodian inheritance, leading them to integrate their bloodlines into the blood pool. Several Bloodian Empresses had also contributed their bloodline energy.","Lin Yuan’s Bloodian bloodline was likely at the pinnacle Empress level, and he might even acquire the Great Empress bloodline. Each evolution of his Bloodian bloodline affected his appearance, but this change was only evident when his Body of All Spirits activated the bloodline. Normally, Lin Yuan’s appearance remained unchanged.","Now, Lin Yuan’s long golden hair cascaded past his shoulders to his waist, ending in a bright red color. His skin had become exceptionally fair, and his perfect bone structure had undergone changes due to the bloodline enhancement. Any Bloodian seeing him now would likely lose their composure.","Lin Yuan was focused on absorbing the bloodline energy in the blood pool and didn’t notice Autumn and Winter watching him.","As his Bloodian bloodline broke through to Empress, he heard the Jasmine Lily’s voice. “Yuan, I will likely undergo a significant bloodline transformation this time. I will need a large amount of spirit qi, and the transformation might take considerable time.”","Lin Yuan immediately took out numerous spirit qi crystals and poured them into the blood pool. The Jasmine Lily could use these spirit qi crystals as needed. After absorbing the blood pool’s energy, Lin Yuan could reclaim any remaining spirit qi crystals.","Lin Yuan’s limited knowledge of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors came from Qin Yu. From her, he learned that the blood crystals served as a means of exiting the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and also provided protection for the Bloodians within it.","After absorbing the soul of the pinnacle Bloodian Empress, Lin Yuan gained a deep understanding of the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","While the Land of Bloodian Ancestors was indeed floating around in the void, in fact, every time it was connected to the Scarlet Territory, it would remain connected for a long time. However, these Bloodians didn’t have the ability to explore the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, so they were invaded by brutal souls and had no choice but to leave. Therefore, the Jasmine Lily had plenty of time to transform in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","In short, with so much vitality and blood energy in the blood pool, it should be sufficient for the Jasmine Lily’s bloodline transformation needs.","“Jasmine Lily, it doesn’t matter how long it takes. You just have to transform in peace. It will take me a long time to absorb the blood energy in this blood pool.”","Upon hearing that, the Jasmine Lily felt relieved and buried its entire body into the blood pool.","A huge vortex formed above the Jasmine Lily. Then, vast amounts of vitality and blood energy poured into the Jasmine Lily’s body.","After absorbing the blood energy, the Jasmine Lily’s Crystallized Main Flower began to steadily expand. Originally, Lin Yuan could lift it with a single palm, but now, it grew dozens of times in size, resembling a small rockery in a short period.","Lin Yuan noticed the changes in the Crystallized Main Flower. Every time the Jasmine Lily’s bloodline transformed, its body would change. The change in its main body was good news for the Jasmine Lily.","The Jasmine Lily’s genetic model was very simple. The improvement of its abilities depended on the breakthroughs brought about by each transformation.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to observe the Crystallized Main Flower, it suddenly began to reassemble. The huge flowers began to grow in groups, turning from a huge main flower into thousands of palm-sized red crystallized flowers. These flowers were stacked together and arranged in a very harmonious manner. They had the unique beauty of succulent plants.","These crystallized flowers kept adjusting their positions during the assembly process, and the color became increasingly red. It could be said that the blood energy in the blood pool had basically been absorbed by them.","While the external changes were evident, there were successive fasciations occurring that remained unseen. The fasciations made the Jasmine Lily’s head even more closely connected.","Observing the Jasmine Lily, Lin Yuan thought that the addition somewhat made the Bud of Mountain Jade, which originally only had one main flower, appear somewhat monotonous.","As soon as Lin Yuan had this thought, he saw the thousands of Crystallized Main Flowers producing the Bud of Mountain Jades one after another. These tender and delicate Bud of Mountain Jades bloomed in each crystallized flower group, adding a dazzling beauty to the Jasmine Lily. From afar, it looked like a blooming hydrangea.","The Bud of Mountain Jade was the part of Jasmine Lily’s body, containing the strongest healing ability. The appearance of thousands of Buds of Mountain Jade allowed the Jasmine Lily’s healing ability to increase greatly.","The Jasmine Lily had already met Lin Yuan’s expectations, but its bloodline metamorphosis did not stop.","Lin Yuan heard the Jasmine Lily say in embarrassment, “Yuan, I might need more spirit qi crystals. I realized that the Bud of Mountain Jades nurtured in the Crystallized Main Flowers have developed their own independent consciousness. I can feel that I can completely control them. However, when I don’t give them orders, they can act on their own.","“In order to strengthen this autonomous consciousness, a large amount of energy must be used to nourish them. Furthermore, I can sense that these Buds of Mountain Jades will undergo new changes.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan took out more spirit qi crystals. He had always been very generous when it came to his feys’ evolution needs.","The blood energy and vitality in the blood pool had indeed created extraordinary transformations for the Jasmine Lily.","...","After two full days, the moment the Jasmine Lily’s aura transformed and it stepped into the Holy Spirit level, a fey made of wood elements and vitality was born from the Bud of Mountain Jade. This fey was very similar in size to a fairy but did not have wings on its back and existed in an elemental form.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the evolved Jasmine Lily.","[Fey Name]: Jasmine Lily (Jade Flower Immortal Spirit)","[Spirit-Lifeform Species]: Crassulaceae genus/Aeonium genus","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Heal]: (Fasciated Flower Stand): Its Heal ability will reverse-heal the target, absorbing its vitality and letting it experience extreme comfort at the same time.","(Crystalized Flower): When the Crystallized Main Flower uses Heal, it will perform reverse Heal on the target and absorb a large amount of vitality from the target for a short period of time.","– Bud of Mountain Jade: Its Heal ability will heal the target and channel rich vitality into it through its Bud of Mountain Jade, restoring the target’s damaged vitality.","[Jade Flower Immortal Spirit]: Every Immortal Spirit that is born can guide vitality to heal the target. Immortal Spirits have the same healing method as the main body. They have the effect of breaking curses and poisons while healing the enemy’s injuries. After healing, there is a certain chance that the target will become a fanatic of the Immortal Spirits.","[Mountain Jade Imprint]: The Mountain Jade Imprint will compress the pollen and vitality within the Bud of Mountain Jade to combine the two. A special imprint will be formed. When applied to a target, the healing effects will be greatly raised.","[Healing Transfer]: When the Mountain Jade Imprint is healing a target, if the vitality being injected into a target exceeds the amount that the target requires, the vitality will explode and heal the other lifeforms in the area. Alternatively, it can transfer the vitality to other targets that have the Mountain Jade Imprint applied on them.","[Life Protecting Soul]: When a target is being healed, the vitality can form a protective layer over the soul to help the targets’ soul defend against external attacks.","[Red Crystal Jade Drain]: When using the Crystallized Main Flower to carry out reverse healing on a target, the effects of draining vitality and the negative impacts to the spirit senses will be magnified. If the enemy target has the Mountain Jade Imprint applied on it, it can drain the target’s vitality.","[Mountain Jade Prayer]: Once the Fasciated Flower Stand is activated, layers of jade will be produced and the vitality within the body will be rapidly released. There is no distance limit and the targets with the Mountain Jade Imprint on them will receive healing. This will enable the friendly targets with the Mountain Jade Imprint on them to recover their vitality to the maximum level.","[Revived Muscle and Bone]: If the target’s body has lost its genetic model, the mountain jade fluid in the Buds of Mountain Jade can use the target’s damaged body to analyze and create a replica of its genetic model.","[Life Healing Flower Eye]: Flower eyes will be left on the body of targets. Before the flower eyes are activated, the targets’ injuries will be healed. After the flower eyes are activated, the vitality in the flower eyes will spread outwards like a fountain and heal the area around the target.","[Healing Resonance]: Each time a target is being healed or recovered, the Jasmine Lily receives a certain amount of energy replenishment. If the Jasmine Lily’s energy limit is reached during the resonance process, the healing will achieve explosive effects!","[Spirit Restoration]: The combination of faith power and healing energy will recover the divine kingdoms of other targets. The targets’ divine kingdoms will be nourished and restored.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Recovery Imprint]: It accumulates the healing energy that is released by the Jasmine Lily during normal times. The contractor can activate the imprint to release the accumulated healing energy.","[Severed Limbs Growth]: It comprehends the arcana of plant growth. Even if one’s gene template is damaged, the rich vitality can allow one to continue to grow slowly.","[Generated Wedge]: Vitality will be poured into the target’s body and used to bless the target. Before the vitality is used up, the target will not die regardless of how serious the injuries it sustains are.","[Imprint Creation]: All the energy in the Jasmine Lily’s body will be used to create an imprint. The imprint’s effects will be multiplied momentarily.","[Extending Life Returning Light]: A few of its obstinate leaves will be sacrificed. The energy in the obstinate leaves will enable the target to return to its prime state even if it started on the brink of death. However, the target will also be filled with the Jasmine Lily’s poison and their vitality will be continuously depleted until it dies.","[Mountain Jade Protection]: The Bud of Mountain Jade will bless and protect the target. When the target is attacked, it will only undertake a small amount of damage while most of the damage will be blocked by the energy in the Bud of Mountain Jade. The blessing state will be weakened as time goes on. Accordingly, the damage suffered by the target will continuously increase until the target eventually takes on the full extent of the damage.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Postponed Birth]: The target will be put into a birth state. After the target dies, it will be able to be revived for a temporary period. When the birth state is activated, the target will be drained in various ways and its potential will also be affected.","[Immortal Spirit Jump]: For every 50 Immortal Spirits born, an attempt can be made to combine them in the divine kingdom, allowing these Immortal Spirits to evolve to a higher level of life. They can accumulate their own abilities exponentially and spread the plague of faith to the target of healing to infect the feys around them to become their fanatics."]},{"number":3049,"title":"Chapter 3049: Complete Alchemist Inheritance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3049: Complete Alchemist Inheritance!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Upon seeing the new ability emerging from the Jasmine Lily’s basic ability, Heal, due to the transformation of its main body, Lin Yuan found himself momentarily unsure of what expression to make.","When the Jasmine Lily underwent its first bloodline metamorphosis, it was still normal. Ever since the Jasmine Lily underwent fasciation, it went from a pure healing-type fey to being able to absorb the vitality in the target’s body.","At that time, the Jasmine Lily’s ability was already a little unorthodox. However, it was not necessarily a bad thing as it made the Jasmine Lily stronger, forming a unique offensive method that was difficult to expel.","Now, the Bud of Mountain Jade represented a strengthening of the Jasmine Lily’s healing ability.","Lin Yuan initially thought that after the Jasmine Lily exhibited some unorthodox traits, it would continue along the path of healing thereafter.","However, the Jade Flower Immortal Spirit born from the Jasmine Lily’s Bud of Mountain Jade turned out to be a fey that manipulated faith.","Just as the Jasmine Lily had said, every Jade Flower Immortal Spirit had its own intelligence and could think and act independently. During the battle, these Jade Flower Immortal Spirits would wander around the battlefield, allowing the Jasmine Lily to support the healing work of a large-scale battle on its own. This was an extreme expansion of the Jasmine Lily’s healing ability.","At the same time, because every Jade Flower Immortal Spirit could move independently and listen to the Jasmine Lily’s orders, she could simply issue orders like a general, and these Jade Flower Immortal Spirits would be able to execute them effectively.","However, for a faction, this enhancement of healing capabilities within a certain range paled in comparison to the ability of the Jade Flower Immortal Spirit to manipulate faith.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was a common knowledge that everyone was aware of. It was that the faith contributed by fanatics was the largest and purest. Faith power could be bought in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The pure faith power produced by fanatics was more than 15 times the price of faith power produced by ordinary believers.","Even if the price was exorbitant, the vast majority of factions and experts were unwilling to sell the faith power produced by fanatics because of the difficulty in nurturing these fanatics. There might not even be a fanatic in the entire faith country despite having been established for so long.","Moreover, besides being able to dispel curses during healing, these Jade Flower Immortal Spirits also had a certain probability of converting the healed target into becoming their fanatic.","The faith power produced by all lifeforms in the faith country was absorbed by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus. After absorbing the Continent Vein Core of North of the Lonely River, it represented the supreme law there.","People were often injured in the faith country. Despite the demon insects managing it, friction was inevitable. Additionally, the people had to work in various professions to earn resources. Once the Jasmine Lily cultivated more Jade Flower Immortal Spirits, it could station them in temples to provide free healing for the injured.","Lin Yuan wasn’t sure about the exact conversion rate for fanatics during the healing process, but regardless of how low it might be, with a large enough healing base, it was bound to produce a considerable number of fanatics and greatly increase the output of faith power from the faith country.","If the Jade Flower Immortal Spirits used healing to nurture fanatics and instructed them to manipulate and harvest faith, Immortal Spirit Jump would further enhance their faith-harvesting capabilities. This ability could only be used when the Jasmine Lily gave birth to more than 50 Jade Flower Immortal Spirits.","Immortal Spirit Jump could fuse a total of 50 Jade Flower Immortal Spirits in the divine kingdom, evolving them into a higher-level lifeform. This ability would greatly increase the upper limit of the Jasmine Lily’s strength. These combined entities would possess stronger healing abilities.","With Immortal Spirit Jump, the Jade Flower Immortal Spirits could transform healed targets into fanatics. Moreover, the transformed fanatics could carry the faith plague to infect other targets, turning them into fanatics as well.","Immortal Spirit Jump was exceptionally powerful. If the Jasmine Lily was allowed to use it freely in an area, the lifeforms there might soon become fanatics of the Jasmine Lily.","Corrupting faith was a forbidden method in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. If a lifeform was discovered to possess such a capability, they were likely to be killed by other factions before they could develop it further.","Honor Absent Palace had once given clear instructions that once any litetorm was discovered to have the means to corrupt faith power, a large amount of rewards would be given to the person who reported them to Honor Absent Palace. They would then personally send experts to eliminate such lifeforms to prevent the major crisis of faith corruption from taking place.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was once a large-scale crisis resulting from faith corruption. When such crises occurred, it was very likely to cause chaos in the faith of the lifeform in the entire area. It often took several generations to eliminate the hidden dangers caused by faith corruption after the crisis was resolved.","Many large species had disappeared from the territory of the Sky Beyond the Clouds because of the faith corruption.","The Jasmine Lily, which had always been honest and obedient, had now grown into a taboo that the Sky Beyond the Clouds could not tolerate. However, Lin Yuan was indifferent to this matter.","Lin Yuan watched as tens of thousands of Bud of Mountain Jades bloomed.","At present, the Jasmine Lily had produced four Jade Flower Immortal Spirits. Lin Yuan could already see the great future of the faith country with the Jasmine Lily’s help.","Now that North of the Lonely River had become Lin Yuan’s territory, he would not allow other factions to approach it. If a faction accidentally entered North of the Lonely River, it would most likely be impossible for them to leave in the future to ensure that the outside world had no way of knowing that the Jasmine Lily had produced fanatics in the faith country.","The Jasmine Lily had already reached the Holy Spirit level, but nearly half of the blood energy and vitality in the blood pool had not been completely absorbed. Hence, it could use this energy to give birth to more Jade Flower Immortal Spirits in the Bud of Mountain Jade.","As time passed, the Jasmine Lily grew steadily, and Lin Yuan’s Bloodian bloodline matured at an extraordinarily fast pace.","Unbeknownst to him, Lin Yuan’s Bloodian bloodline had reached the pinnacle of Empress and was beginning to break through to Great Empress.","Lin Yuan could truly feel the power of the Body of All Spirits through this bloodline upgrade.","Noticing that the blood pool had little energy left, Lin Yuan realized that breaking through to Great Empress would be challenging. This difficulty was partly due to the insufficient resources prepared by the two Bloodian Great Empresses.","Additionally, a significant portion of the bloodline energy had dissipated by the time Lin Yuan arrived. Nonetheless, Lin Yuan was very satisfied to have achieved pinnacle Empress bloodline.","After absorbing all the energy in the blood pool, Lin Yuan intended to test his strength to see what level he could reach. To do this, he needed to find Autumn and Winter, who were always willing to be his sparring partners.","When Autumn and Winter sensed that Lin Yuan’s bloodline was stuck at","pinnacle Empress, they couldn’t help but show regretful expressions, though","these quickly faded.","Lin Yuan would have to deal with the Bloodians in the future. While the","Bloodians in the East Universe lacked resources, those in the South and West","Universes were extremely powerful and had accumulated significant strength.","In the future, Lin Yuan would still have the possibility of evolving beyond the Empress bloodline. No matter how well the Bloodians in other universes developed, they couldn’t reach the level of the Bloodians in their prime. Now that Lin Yuan had inherited the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, his bloodline was among the best of all current Bloodians.","The Bloodians placed great emphasis on bloodline strength. With Lin Yuan’s current bloodline, he had a good chance of recruiting Bloodian factions from other universes.","Autumn and Winter were exceptionally pleased with Lin Yuan’s growth.","After the bloodline energy in the blood pool was completely exhausted, Lin Yuan walked out of it.","Lin Yuan looked at his raised palm and eagerly said, “Winter, come and help me test my current strength!”","Upon hearing this, Winter raised his hand to create an ice wall and said respectfully, “Young Master, please attack and reconcile with this ice wall. I can judge your strength through the attacks on the ice wall. The ice wall I created will not reflect your strength. You can test your strength without worry.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan raised his hand and delivered a full-force blow. Having spent so much time with Autumn and Winter, Lin Yuan didn’t feel the need to hold back his strength in front of them.","After Lin Yuan unleashed his attack, Winter spoke seriously. “Young Master, your attack just now should have reached the full-power attack of the high-grade Holy Spirit level. It’s still a distance away from the pinnacle of the Holy Spirit level. However, it’s not a big difference. If your Bloodian bloodline reaches the level of Great Empress, the strength you display through the Body of All Spirits will very likely surpass the Holy Spirit level.”","Winter described Lin Yuan’s strength in a very objective manner and did not praise Lin Yuan excessively just to make him happy.","After hearing Winter’s words, Lin Yuan had a clear understanding of his current strength. As for the defensive ability of his Body of All Spirits, Lin Yuan did not intend to test it out. In any case, Lin Yuan would bring at least one person among Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter with him when he went out in the future.","Autumn said at the side, “Young Master, the two Bloodian Great Empresses didn’t survive the calamity when the Bloodians suddenly faced it. However, they have accumulated abundant heritage for the Bloodians. One of them is the complete alchemy heritage.","“If you randomly choose a Creator above Grade 4 to study this inheritance, it shouldn’t be long before they become a qualified Alchemist. When we return to Sky City, you can let these Creators make their own choices based on their interests. There should be Creators who are willing to become Alchemists.”","As time passed and the inheritance of Alchemists was almost cut off, the current Sky Beyond the Clouds was no longer as hostile to Alchemists as before.","“The puppets refined by Alchemists can be sold for a very high price in the auction houses of some large cities in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Many large factions are willing to equip their descendants with puppets refined by Alchemists.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan’s face lit up. Sky City had more Creators now, and there were already more than 50 Creators above Grade 4. There were only so many core members in Sky City. The resources of high-grade Creators that were scarce in the outside world were already overflowing for Sky City.","Furthermore, more and more Creators would join Sky City in the future.","Lin Yuan believed that he could nurture at least 20 Creators into Alchemists to keep up with the speed at which the hunting teams hunted the star pirates. When many puppets were nurtured, Sky City’s defensive capabilities would rise to another level.","Many orthodox Creators rejected the Alchemist profession, but all Creators who joined Sky City had to obey Lin Yuan’s teachings. Lin Yuan would not force these Creators to do things they were unwilling to do. If he forced them, these high-grade Creators would only distance themselves. Instead of coercion, Lin Yuan would entice them. The spiritual springs still growing in Rememberling’s body were the best way to do so.","“Autumn, since all the resources and inheritances here have already been sorted out, I’ll leave them all with you. When we return to Sky City, hand them over to Wen Yu and let her do the statistics. We can probably leave this Land of Bloodian Ancestors now. I wonder how things are going on Qin Yu’s end.”","Autumn had been out for a long time now. Before leaving Sky City, Summer had said that she needed some help to nurture Thriving Summer Rising Cloud. After this operation, he would let Autumn return to North of the Lonely River first. After Autumn finished helping Summer, he could then leave to lead the hunting team. When he returned to Sky City, Lin Yuan would give a portion of the resources to Autumn so that he could use them to improve himself.","Upon seeing that he was interested in Qin Yu’s situation, Winter said, “Young Master, Qin Yu only used the soul crystal twice and didn’t use all her life-saving methods, so I assume everything went smoothly.","“Qin Yu should have reported the results of the operation to you through the Thoughts Letter Paper. If she really encounters trouble, it’s impossible for Qin","Yu not to use life-saving methods. Even if you don’t reply to her through Thoughts Letter Paper, she will still find you through the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower!”","Just as Winter had said, Qin Yu’s journey in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors had been very smooth. There were only a few queens in power among the","Bloodians, and they were all under the control of Qin Yu and Tina through their Blood Curse.","Qin Yu, the weakest Bloodian Queen, had become the manager of the Scarlet Territory.. After millions of years, the Scarlet Territory was finally united once again!"]},{"number":3050,"title":"Chapter 3050 Scarlet Secrets!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3050 Scarlet Secrets!","All the Bloodian Queens controlled by Qin Yu and Tina through their Blood Curse were still in a daze.","....","Previously, Tina’s Adana clan and Qin Yu’s Elisa clan had little interaction and seemed to have conflicts over resources. At that time, Qin Yu had not yet become the Bloodian Queen, and the Elisa clan could not compete with the Adana clan. Fortunately, the Adana clan had not acted against the Elisa clan. Otherwise, they would have suffered heavy losses.","Now, these two Bloodian Queens had formed a team, with Qin Yu as the leader and Tina as her second-in-command.","In terms of strength and clan size, Tina and the Adana clan had completely surpassed Qin Yu and the Elisa clan. Tina’s attitude toward Qin Yu was exceptionally respectful, though, treating her almost like a superior, akin to how a Bloodian King would treat a Bloodian Queen.","Unusual occurrences often had reasons. Therefore, there was likely a powerful faction behind Qin Yu, suppressing and forcing Tina to submit.","When Qin Yu entered the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, she had four people by her side, but now they were all gone. Furthermore, when facing the rebels, Qin Yu used an extremely special method to eliminate them. These rebels were from factions related to the Bloodian Queens, which were now all suppressed by Qin Yu. When the time came, Lin Yuan would decide how to deal with these factions.","Seeing the other Bloodian Queens looking at her in awe and fear, Qin Yu smiled. She had never thought she would see such a day. It was an honor bestowed upon the Elisa clan by Lin Yuan. Without Lin Yuan, even if she had successfully evolved to Bloodian Queen, she would still be subject to the control of clans with reigning Bloodian Queens.","At present, Qin Yu was not the only one who felt lucky. Shi Mei, the leader of the Allen clan who had joined Qin Yu, also felt extremely fortunate.","In Shi Mei’s eyes, it was a blessing to form an alliance with a Bloodian Queen, even if this particular one was the least powerful among them all.","Shi Mei did not expect the weakest Bloodian Queen to suddenly become the leader of all the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory. However, this would definitely ensure the rise of the status of the previously obscure Allen clan.","From the moment she became Qin Yu’s subordinate, Shi Mei had announced to the outside world that the Allen clan was now under the authority of the Elisa clan. Qin Yu had even entrusted her to negotiate with the other Bloodian Queens and arrange missions for them.","Now, all the Bloodian leaders who possessed the king bloodline were currying favor with Shi Mei. Some Bloodian Queens who had previously not even considered speaking to her were now seeking her friendship. Shi Mei knew that spring had arrived for the Allen clan!","Just as Shi Mei was envisioning the future, she heard Qin Yu say, “Shi Mei, relay my orders immediately upon leaving this place. Instruct all Bloodian leaders who are not eligible to enter this place to gather in the Scarlet Corridor.","“A meeting will be held within the Bloodians, and no excuses for absence will be accepted. All leaders must be present, regardless of the circumstances. Any clan whose leader fails to attend will be expelled, and all members of that clan will become servants, ranking below even the dependent species.”","Qin Yu’s tone was grave, leaving no room for negotiation. As the manager of the Scarlet Territory, she needed to establish her authority swiftly and decisively. Setting an example was the best course of action in such times.","For the first time in many years, the Scarlet Territory was unified. Being a leader was not easy, and any misstep would severely impact Qin Yu’s status.","Tina was ambitious but would not challenge Qin Yu due to Lin Yuan’s order. However, if anything happened to Qin Yu, Tina would undoubtedly seize the opportunity.","Qin Yu’s orders gave Shi Mei authority, presenting a good opportunity for her and the Allen clan to rise in prominence. As the messenger, Shi Mei would earn respect from the Bloodian clans who were not qualified to enter this place, especially given the changes in the Scarlet Territory.","...","After leaving the Scarlet Territory with the Bloodians, Qin Yu waited patiently for Lin Yuan. His absence at two consecutive meetings in the Scarlet Corridor made her nervous. However, considering the influence of Autumn and Winter, she believed Lin Yuan was not in danger within the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Even if Lin Yuan was in danger, the Blood Empresses were under her Blood Curse. The Scarlet Territory would remain under her control for the foreseeable future.","However, Qin Yu knew that without Lin Yuan, the Blood Curse alone would not be enough to make the other Bloodian Queens acknowledge her as their leader. She couldn’t eliminate all disobedient Bloodian Queens.","Qin Yu prayed that Lin Yuan would successfully leave the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","Qin Yu was not the only one waiting for Lin Yuan; Tina was also anxiously awaiting his return. Tina feared that something might happen to Lin Yuan. She had already accepted her role.","To the other Bloodian Queens, this turmoil was caused by Qin Yu and Tina. If anything happened to Lin Yuan, the Scarlet Territory would surely fall into chaos.","Tina did not know Lin Yuan as well as Qin Yu did. Therefore, she was in a state of panic and had approached Qin Yu multiple times to gather more information about Lin Yuan.","Qin Yu understood Tina’s concern and shared her worries. However, Qin Yu must firmly support Lin Yuan under all circumstances. She couldn’t afford to show any lack of confidence, especially in front of Tina. If Tina sensed any doubt from Qin Yu regarding Lin Yuan, she would likely convey it to him later.","“Tina, we just need to follow Lord Lin Yuan’s instructions and do our own things. You know how strong the two experts on Lord Lin Yuan’s side are. The Land of Bloodian Ancestors only opens once every few years. Lord Lin Yuan will definitely take some time to explore it after entering. The later he comes out, the richer Lord Lin Yuan’s harvest will be. Tina, you can’t possibly hope that Lord Lin Yuan won’t stay in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors for long, right?”","While saying that, Qin Yu did not have much confidence as well. However, when she thought of the fey that could absorb violent souls by Lin Yuan’s side, she felt a little more at ease.","Tina didn’t sense any suspicion from Qin Yu, and finally, she was able to let go of her worries. “Qin Yu, I didn’t ask you to inquire about Lord Lin Yuan’s situation because I don’t trust him. However, the helpers brought in by the other Bloodian Queens are all under our control now. If these people don’t return to their factions soon, trouble is bound to arise. Do you think we should make some preparations?”","During this period, Qin Yu had been worried about these experts. The factions the Bloodian Queens sought help from were all powerful, many of them equal to the Bloodians. These situations were not something she could resolve alone. Without Lin Yuan’s intervention, Qin Yu had no means of handling these matters on her own.","“We just need to wait for Lord Lin Yuan’s arrangements, Tina. Let’s follow the plan I mentioned earlier.”","Qin Yu had always avoided disturbing Lin Yuan unnecessarily, but now she felt that she should contact him through the Thoughts Letter Paper and the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet. At the very least, she needed to know if Lin Yuan was dead or alive.","Just as Qin Yu had this thought, her face lit up. She sensed Lin Yuan’s summoning and knew he had already left the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","“Tina, Lord Lin Yuan has left the Land of Bloodian Ancestors and summoned me. Why don’t you come with me to meet him?","“I’ve noticed you’ve been questioning Lord Lin Yuan’s authority here. I won’t report this matter to him, but I hope this won’t happen again in the future. As Lord Lin Yuan’s servant, you need to trust him. Without that trust, it’s very difficult for you to progress on this path!”","Although Qin Yu was taking advantage of Tina’s situation, most of her words were sincere. She knew Tina was smart and would understand her message.","Tina hurriedly bowed to Qin Yu in panic. “Qin Yu, it’s my fault this time. Please don’t tell Lord Lin Yuan about this. I’ll listen to you in the future and won’t dare to defy you.”","Tina had indeed doubted Lin Yuan earlier. If these words reached his ears, it would be difficult for her to regain his trust and be valued by him again.","During this period, Tina felt she had performed well and shown Qin Yu a lot of respect. Therefore, she hoped Qin Yu wouldn’t take drastic measures against her. If she did, it would be hard for Qin Yu to find an assistant like her. Moreover, Lin Yuan probably did not like a subordinate who complained and stirred up trouble all day long.","...","The moment Qin Yu and Tina saw Lin Yuan, they felt an aura that made them want to kneel and submit to him. Previously, they had never felt this way when meeting Lin Yuan.","After leaving the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Lin Yuan did not use the Body of All Spirits to activate his pinnacle Bloodian Empress bloodline as it would be too shocking for the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory. Despite that, Lin Yuan still emitted an overwhelming aura that could suppress low-level Bloodians due to his bloodline.","His aura deeply affected Qin Yu and Tina.","Lin Yuan tried his best to restrain his aura, but it was still ineffective.","Upon sensing Lin Yuan’s aura, Qin Yu and Tina, the two Bloodian Queens, were unable to communicate with him freely.","Autumn and Winter hurriedly released their auras to block Lin Yuan’s bloodline aura, allowing Qin Yu and Tina to recover.","Qin Yu and Tina looked at each other in shock. Lin Yuan’s transformation must have something to do with the harvest in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors. Even though they knew this, Qin Yu and Tina didn’t ask too many questions. The two of them reported the recent situation in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to Lin Yuan seriously.","Lin Yuan was somewhat surprised that Qin Yu and Tina had acted fast. They had actually completed their control over the Scarlet Territory while he was absorbing the blood pool’s energy. Naturally, he was very satisfied with Qin Yu and Tina’s abilities.","Lin Yuan hadn’t checked the Bloodians’ heritage resources but had given his instructions to Autumn and entrusted him with organizing a portion of the resources to help Qin Yu develop the Scarlet Territory.","Lin Yuan definitely had to repay the Bloodians after taking so many inheritances.","Lin Yuan tossed the resources that had been selected to Qin Yu and said, “Qin Yu, I’ve gained a lot after exploring the Land of Bloodian Ancestors for such a long time. Since I’ve taken control of the Scarlet Territory, I naturally have to be responsible for its development. These resources should be enough for you to develop the Scarlet Territory for a long time.","“The Scarlet Territory will soon witness the emergence of at least ten Bloodian Queens, and there might even be a few additional Bloodian Empresses among them. You’ll help me manage the Scarlet Territory, and Tina will be your assistant.","“Apart from prioritizing your own use of these resources, you can also use some of them to nurture Tina. As for the other Bloodian Queens, you can decide for yourself.","“I’ll leave the Scarlet Territory in a few days. When I leave the Scarlet Territory, you can contact me through the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower as usual.”","After exploring the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, Lin Yuan’s heart was no longer in the Scarlet Territory.","Originally, Qin Yu had planned to report to Lin Yuan about her and Tina’s achievements during this period. However, she hadn’t expected Lin Yuan to prepare to leave immediately after providing resources.","Qin Yu did not check the resources in the spatial equipment. Since Lin Yuan said that these resources could allow the Scarlet Territory to have 10 more Bloodian Queens and possibly even a Bloodian Empress, she knew the resources were substantial.","On the other hand, Tina was completely shocked by Lin Yuan’s words.","What? Not only would there be at least ten more Bloodian Queens, but there might even be Bloodian Empresses? Wouldn’t this completely change the predicament of the Bloodians in the East Universe?","It would give them the capability to contend with and even overpower the Bloodians from the other three universes.","Previously, Qin Yu had told Tina more than once that Lin Yuan was extremely generous, but Tina had always been skeptical. Superior clans typically seized the resources of inferior clans, and very few were willing to distribute resources to them.","However, it seemed that Lin Yuan was indeed very generous today. He was even willing to give the resources he had obtained in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to the Bloodians to develop their territory.","Although the Bloodians in the East Universe had become a species under Lin Yuan’s control, it was their fortune to be able to rise!"]},{"number":3051,"title":"Chapter 3051 Target: Diverse City!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3051 Target: Diverse City!","Even if Lin Yuan had not asked Qin Yu to allocate the resources to the Elisa clan, she would have done so.","....","Qin Yu did not harbor many emotions for the entire East Universe’s Bloodians. Her emotions were all invested in the Elisa clan.","If Lin Yuan had not given the instructions, Qin Yu would still have done her best to use the resources that Lin Yuan had given her to develop the Elisa clan.","However, now that Lin Yuan had personally said that the Elisa clan would be prioritized for development, Qin Yu naturally would not hold back.","As Qin Yu’s assistant, Tina was the second Bloodian Queen in the entire Scarlet Territory to come into contact with Lin Yuan, and she likewise received preferential treatment.","Had Tina not understood her identity and position, she would have likely immediately expressed her gratitude to Lin Yuan when he promised resources to the Adana clan. However, Lin Yuan made it clear that he was only communicating with Qin Yu, completely ignoring her.","She would just be a supporting role by Qin Yu’s side. Otherwise, not only would she not be able to gain Lin Yuan’s favor, but it might even affect the good cooperation between her and Qin Yu.","“Lord Lin Yuan, there are nine powerful faction experts locked up in this corridor now. They are all members of the factions that entered the Land of Bloodian Ancestors with the other Bloodian Queens. What do you think we should do with these people?","“If these people stay in the Scarlet Territory for too long without communicating with the factions they’re from, those factions will definitely dispatch more people to the Scarlet Territory again. If we can’t give a good explanation, those factions will most likely start a war with the Bloodians.”","After Qin Yu explained the situation to Lin Yuan, she stood there quietly and waited for him to make a decision.","Lin Yuan had not forgotten these members of the various factions who had established ties with the Bloodian clans. Among them were the members of the Ancient Water Pythons who helped a mysterious faction in trafficking the Bloodians, as well as the so-called Lord Lan Ling behind this faction. All of these issues needed to be addressed, but it was certain that Lin Yuan wouldn’t be able to handle them all by himself.","The Scarlet Territory was now unified under Qin Yu’s control. However, the current unification was just a facade enforced through strength. There were still many obstacles to overcome in order to bring about complete unity in the Scarlet Territory.","This battle between the Bloodians and the other factions was the best way to win the hearts of the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory. There were still many things that had to be done to make the Scarlet Territory completely loyal.","This battle between the Bloodians and the other factions was the best way to win the hearts of the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory. There were still many things that had to be done to make the Scarlet Territory completely loyal.","“Qin Yu, this Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet allows you to not only communicate with me but also with others in the surrounding area with you as the center. This ortet I gave you has already grown two ramets.","“For the time being, hand one to me and the other one to Autumn. If you encounter any powerful enemies that are difficult to resist in the Scarlet Territory in the future, contact Autumn. He will help you solve the problem. As for the rest, you can handle it yourselves. Now that the Scarlet Territory has just been unified, this blade needs to be sharpened before it’s truly sharp.”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before continuing. “In a few days, I’ll arrange for a few Grade 4 Creators to come to the Scarlet Territory and help it develop. With these Creators joining the Scarlet Territory, it will be much more prosperous than it is now!”","Upon hearing that Lin Yuan had asked Autumn to help solve the problem, Tina and Qin Yu were completely relieved.","Currently, Qin Yu and Tina were both planning to reform the Bloodian clans. They aimed to gradually eliminate those clans unwilling to follow their orders and allocate more resources to those willing to comply. This strategy would ensure a growing number of Bloodians supporting their rule.","The best way to update the current Bloodian composition was through initiating a war.","If Lin Yuan seeking Autumn’s help reassured Qin Yu and Tina, then Lin Yuan sending Creators to the Scarlet Territory provided a vibrant source of motivation for its development.","The Bloodians were excellent fighters but did not produce Creators. There were fewer than 300 Creators among the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory, and 95% of them were below Grade 3. There were no Grade 5 Creators and only five or six Grade 4 Creators.","Fortunately, the Bloodians only needed fresh blood and did not require extensive Creator resources. Otherwise, they would have long declined and wouldn’t possess such powerful might in the East Universe.","With the addition of a Grade 4 Creator and the abundant resources provided by Lin Yuan, the East Universe’s Bloodians would undoubtedly develop better than before, no longer subject to ridicule by Bloodian factions in the other three universes.","After Lin Yuan made the necessary arrangements, he no longer concerned himself with the Scarlet Territory.","Lin Yuan summoned Sun Yin, who had been with Shi Mei.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Sun Yin bowed respectfully and, with a somewhat resigned tone, said, “Lord Lin Yuan, the dimensional space in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors is extremely mystical. However, the blood-red crystal in the Bloodian King’s hand was too small to last long. I’m not at liberty to use too many means, or else it would have raised suspicions. Otherwise, I would truly want to explore the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.”","Sun Yin was extremely curious about everything, which was one of the reasons he had achieved such high accomplishments in the Creator field. His rapid growth wasn’t solely due to his talent.","Lin Yuan looked at Sun Yin’s interested expression and said confidently, “Senior Sun, when you reach the area where Sky City is located, you will definitely find that it is even more mystical than the Land of Bloodian Ancestors.","“Didn’t you say that the Traveling Dragon Palace in Diverse City is going to publicly sell the blessed land in their hands and the resources that have reached the blessed land level to gather the resources of Creators above Grade 4? Why don’t we go to Diverse City and see how many outstanding resources the Traveling Dragon Palace has put forth? I’m very interested in these blessed lands.”","Lin Yuan had obtained two blessed lands and integrated them into North of the Lonely River. At present, the environment there was much better than before.","It was impossible for Lin Yuan to move Sky City away from North of the Lonely River. Establishing Sky City on the back of Sky Sea made relocation quite simple. However, the faith country could not be moved.","The stronger a fey, the higher the quality of faith power produced. Improving the environment of North of the Lonely River through the blessed land could strengthen and develop the faith country more effectively.","Lin Yuan’s original intention in establishing the faith country was indeed to obtain faith power, but he did not treat the lifeforms living in it as tools. Instead, he did his best to increase their happiness and improve their living environment.","The lifeforms in the faith country were like refugees in North of the Lonely River, living a precarious life. Now, not only were these lifeforms able to sustain themselves in the faith country, but they also had access to a wider variety of food. In addition, they could save up resources to construct their own homes. There was even no need to worry about diseases now.","When Su Yiren and Luo Lan were building and managing the Faith Country, they allocated more than 40% of their resources to the construction of public facilities.","Since Sun Yin joined Lin Yuan, he had been very curious about Sky City. Hearing Lin Yuan’s words only intensified his curiosity about the situation there.","Sun Yin wondered how Yi He and the other Creators were faring in Sky City. As Lin Yuan’s personal Creator, he imagined that Yi He and the others must be extremely envious of him.","Diverse City was considered a supercity in the East Universe, ranking in the top 30 of all cities.","Sun Yin had visited Diverse City a few times but never had a favorable impression of it.","When Sun Yin went to Diverse City, he was only an intermediate Grade 4 Creator. Generally, an intermediate Grade 4 Creator would be respected wherever he went. However, due to Sun Yin’s social circle and the numerous powerful factions in Diverse City, he encountered some trouble. He was defeated despite his status and had to leave Diverse City dejectedly.","This happened hundreds of years ago. This time, his identity had changed, and he was accompanied by Lin Yuan, who had a formidable background.","It was often said that even a powerful dragon didn’t oppress the local snake, but Lin Yuan, this formidable giant, could probably extract the dragon tendons and strip off the dragon scales if faced with a true dragon.","The Traveling Dragon Palace was a native faction in Diverse City, deeply rooted and developed within the city, but its influence extended beyond just Diverse City. It had branches in many supercities, although its development in these cities was not as strong.","It was said that the Traveling Dragon Palace had a conflict with one of the top three factions in Extreme Wood City, Gray Smoke Stronghold.","The Traveling Dragon Palace invested many resources in Extreme Wood City, aiming to develop it into their second headquarters, like Diverse City. As a result, they had to resist attacks from Gray Smoke Stronghold with all their might.","The conflict between these two huge factions involved not only martial battles but also significant resource expenditure.","The Traveling Dragon Palace had released so many resources in exchange for Creator resources of Grade 4 and above, most likely to fight Gray Smoke Stronghold to the end. However, the Traveling Dragon Palace wouldn’t willingly relinquish those blessed lands that were accumulated after many years of development unless they were at a critical point of competition.","Sun Yin quickly introduced Diverse City to Lin Yuan and told him about the Traveling Dragon Palace.","Lin Yuan had not previously encountered such large-scale factions, and during his visit to Diverse City, he also had no intention of forming alliances with these factions.","Lin Yuan only wanted to use this trip to Diverse City to obtain resources to develop the region governed by North of the Lonely River’s Sky City. For a long time to come, Lin Yuan’s influence wouldn’t likely extend to supercities like Diverse City.","Of course, this was only Lin Yuan’s current thought. He did not know what would happen when he arrived at Diverse City.","Lin Yuan did not want to befriend other factions in Diverse City, nor did he want to cause trouble. However, if any faction provoked Lin Yuan, he would not hold back no matter how much he did not want to cause trouble.","Lin Yuan would only bring Sun Yin and Winter along for this trip to Diverse City. Autumn would probably have to stay near the Scarlet Territory for a long time.","Lin Yuan had already sent the hunting team to the Scarlet Territory. Apart from being in charge of the Bloodians, Autumn was also in charge of helping the hunting team hunt star pirates.","When Autumn first joined Lin Yuan, he had stayed by his side with Spring, Summer, and Winter. However, after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Spring and Winter had obviously spent more time by Lin Yuan’s side, which made Autumn feel somewhat insecure. He was afraid that Lin Yuan would abandon him.","However, after following Lin Yuan for some time, he could sense that Lin Yuan treated everyone equally. Even if he did not follow by Lin Yuan’s side, staying in the Scarlet Territory was also helping Lin Yuan share his burdens.","Autumn could sense that Lin Yuan cared deeply about the Scarlet Territory. Under his protection, the Scarlet Territory would definitely not encounter any problems.","Lin Yuan kept a low profile as he set off for Diverse City.","Chu Ci, who had returned to Lin Yuan’s side, said helplessly, “Brother, I’m too weak. Besides fighting those star pirates, I hardly have any chances to take action by your side. I might as well let Little Iron Block and Chimey train their combat skills in the Spirit Lock spatial zone!”","Lin Yuan replied seriously, “Chu Ci, it’s not just you. Even I don’t have many opportunities to take action. Compared to fighting, increasing your knowledge is also beneficial to your growth. Sometimes, gaining knowledge and experience is more important than honing combat skills.","“There weren’t any suitable feys for you in the Land of Bloodian Ancestors, but don’t be in a hurry to contract the two feys you have now. We might find something during this trip to Diverse City. Even if the Traveling Dragon Palace auction doesn’t offer suitable feys, we can still search in a big city like Diverse City. I’m also looking for a suitable fey there.”","Previously, Lin Yuan had not deliberately searched for feys suitable for Spirit Lock. The feys he obtained for Spirit Lock mostly depended on fate. However, Lin Yuan wanted Morbius’ grade to increase quickly so that the Spirit Lock spatial zone could produce Grade 6 Creator resources.","When Chu Ci heard that Lin Yuan was interested in contracting a new fey, she asked with interest, “Brother, do you have any goals or plans for choosing feys this time?”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before shaking his head. Typically, spirit qi professionals needed a clear goal when contracting feys. A spirit qi professional without a clear goal could not be considered mature. However, this rule didn’t apply to Lin Yuan because he had contracted so many feys.","From a battle perspective, Lin Yuan no longer had any shortcomings, so he only needed special functional-type feys."]},{"number":3052,"title":"Chapter 3052: Sun Yin’s Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3052: Sun Yin’s Plan!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Functional feys like the Business Flourishing Flower and Enlightenment Cicada did not have any so-called connection with Lin Yuan’s other feys. However, they could significantly increase Lin Yuan’s strength and abilities.","Before Lin Yuan contracted the Business Flourishing Flower and Enlightenment Cicada, he had never thought there would be such mystical feys in the world.","Although Lin Yuan did not have any thoughts, he would know if the target fey was what he wanted once he encountered it.","Lin Yuan did not want to set a bad example for Chu Ci, so he simply said, “I have a clear goal regarding the types of feys. As for the rest, like you, I need to see them first before making a decision. Chu Ci, if you see anything that interests you during your trip to Diverse City, just use this crystal card to pay for it.”","Lin Yuan handed a crystal card to Chu Ci, which had been provided by Fortune Treasure Palace and contained a significant amount of Honor Absent dollars. Fortune Treasure Palace managed these cards.","The card Lin Yuan gave to Chu Ci had a total of 50,000,000 Honor Absent dollars, allowing her to buy most of what she desired without needing to inform Lin Yuan every time.","Previously, Chu Ci did not go out for training, so Lin Yuan did not need to make any preparations for her. Now that Chu Ci had started training, Lin Yuan felt it was necessary to prepare a small treasury for her. This treasury would enable her to purchase suitable resources or even engage in resource plundering, which was a form of capability.","Chu Ci did not stand on ceremony with Lin Yuan. If she did, it would be equivalent to breaking his heart.","Chu Ci happily put away the crystal card Lin Yuan had given her and prepared to go to Diverse City to purchase useful resources. At the same time, she planned to use the money on her card to buy gifts for Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu, who usually treated her very well.","Sun Yin watched the interaction between Lin Yuan and Chu Ci, feeling the flow of kinship in their interaction.","During the time Sun Yin had been by Lin Yuan’s side, he could sense that Lin Yuan valued relationships very much.","Lin Yuan’s attitude toward relationships made Sun Yin certain that Lin Yuan was worth befriending. Even as a servant, there was a possibility of forming a strong bond with Lin Yuan, his superior.","“Young Master, the Traveling Dragon Palace is not the only faction in Diverse City. Even though we came to Diverse City for this trade fair hosted by them, we can communicate with more than just the Traveling Dragon Palace.","“No matter what, I’m a Grade 5 Creator. As long as I reveal my identity, even in a super big city like Diverse City, the other factions will definitely give me some face. Besides, we have resources in our hands. We’re not reaching out to those factions for no reason. These factions should be very willing to trade with us.","“Young Master, if it’s not convenient for you and these two Lords to reveal your identities, leave this matter to me. I’ll handle this matter in a splendid manner and won’t let you down, Young Master.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “I really have to trouble you to do this. It’s indeed inconvenient for others to handle this. It just so happens that you can accumulate some connections in Diverse City this time. Perhaps these connections will be useful at some point.”","At first, Sun Yin did not understand what Lin Yuan meant. What was the use of establishing connections in Diverse City? However, Sun Yin quickly understood what Lin Yuan meant.","Lin Yuan wanted him to establish connections to facilitate his future control over Diverse City. At the very least, it would make it easier to obtain resources from there. This was similar to how Lin Yuan had gained full control of the Scarlet Territory by controlling a clan with a royal bloodline.","“Young Master, you can rest assured. When we reach Diverse City, I’ll leverage my status as a Grade 5 Creator to network and see if we can find any species that will be useful to us. Even in a large city like Diverse City, there are many weaker species eager to obtain the support of a powerful entity and seek opportunities to change their fates and rise to prominence.","“Although the Sky Beyond the Clouds is vast, very few species are capable of providing such opportunities. Young Master, if you are willing to help, these species will be deeply grateful.”","Upon hearing Sun Yin’s words, Winter looked at him with admiration. Sun Yin’s insight showed his intelligence. He immediately grasped the implication behind Lin Yuan’s words. Indeed, someone like him was worth nurturing. Without intelligence, even great abilities would not help one progress far alongside Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan praised Sun Yin, “I once asked you what you need as a Creator. You said that, apart from exploring the evolution of life, you also seek recognition, fame, and fortune.","“I’ll give you a chance to pursue fame and fortune in Diverse City. If you perform well, I will entrust you with all future dealings between Sky City and Diverse City. This will allow you to use Sky City’s influence to become a distinguished guest throughout Diverse City.”","If someone else had said that to Sun Yin, he would most likely have sneered and dismissed it. However, these words were spoken by Lin Yuan.","Despite the decline of the East Universe’s Bloodians, they were still not ordinary individuals. Lin Yuan’s ability to effortlessly take control of the entire Scarlet Territory at the first opportunity, without fearing the factions equal to the Bloodians, showcased his confidence.","If Sun Yin could rely on Sky City and his Grade 5 Creator status, he would be able to make a name for himself in Diverse City. Otherwise, achieving such an opportunity as a Grade 5 Creator would be very difficult for him.","After all, as a Grade 5 Creator without a faction, he was merely someone with some ability. Compared to the truly powerful top-tier factions, he was just a skilled individual. The large factions respected him but didn’t necessarily fear him.","In a large city like Diverse City, there had to be at least three to five Grade 5 Creators presiding. These Grade 5 Creators in Diverse City were quite opposed to those coming from outside. If he caused trouble in Diverse City alone, he would definitely be targeted by these Grade 5 Creators.","However, with Lin Yuan’s support, the Grade 5 Creators and the factions behind them were insignificant. Sun Yin knew that Sky City had five Grade 5 Creators and a Grade 6 Creator presiding.","Previously, Sun Yin had suffered losses in Diverse City. This time, he was confident he could make up for all the losses he had previously endured.","Among the local factions in Diverse City, a few had feuds with Sun Yin. However, Sun Yin would not proactively seek trouble with these factions. He hoped that none of these factions would provoke him first.","“Young Master, if you’re interested in cultivating your own faction in Diverse City, I have a good recommendation. This faction has a certain level of strength and is not considered a bottom-tier one in Diverse City. Because their leader died some time ago and this faction has always relied on him, this faction is no longer sustainable.","“The last time I went to Diverse City, I formed a rather good friendship with the heir of this faction. I trust his character. Do you think I should inform him about my trip to Diverse City this time? With him as the local tyrant of Diverse City, it will be more convenient to deal with some things.”","Lin Yuan shrugged. “Since I’ve handed this matter to you, I won’t interfere. If you think it’s necessary to contact him, then contact him. If you don’t think it’s necessary, then forget it. As for whether to support this faction, you can investigate when we arrive in Diverse City and then inform me later. Time has passed, and I believe you may not be as familiar with the current situation in Diverse City as you were before!”","Upon hearing that, Sun Yin immediately realized he had said something wrong. It had indeed been a long time since he had visited Diverse City. What he had just Lin Yuan was completely based on his impression of Diverse City. In the past few hundred years, Diverse City must have gone through countless changes.","Sun Yin realized that it seemed a little irresponsible for him to give such a suggestion so easily. “Young Master, when we arrive at Diverse City, I will first investigate the factions I mentioned just now and then choose the best. At that time, we will definitely choose a faction that is most suitable for us to support.”","Lin Yuan could sense that Sun Yin was eager to show off as his desire to do so was extremely obvious. When an individual was eager to prove themselves, mistakes were inevitable. Having the ability to recognize mistakes promptly and make corrections were a rare quality, and it was obvious that Sun Yin had such potential.","“Sun Yin, if you need anything, you’re free to go as you need. You don’t have to worry about me. Having Winter by my side is enough. It won’t be too late for you to return to my side after you’ve investigated everything. I have given you the Thoughts Letter Paper and the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. You can contact me through them at any time.”","Recently, Lin Yuan had been exceptionally busy and had not rested for a long time. This trip to Diverse City gave Lin Yuan the feeling of taking his sister on a vacation, which was quite pleasant.","There were many large chambers of commerce in Diverse City. At the same time, there were also branches of Fortune Treasure Palace. Lin Yuan intended to stay in that branch. As a special honor guest, he could live in Fortune Treasure Palace and use its channels in Diverse City.","Chu Ci was exceptionally excited upon their arrival to Diverse City. When Chu Ci was in the main world, she rarely had the chance to travel, let alone travel with Lin Yuan.","After arriving at Diverse City, Lin Yuan finally understood why Diverse City was called a mega city. A trading city like Treasure City was not even qualified to be compared to Diverse City.","From the scale of the city, Treasure City was like a mud house in the countryside, while Diverse City was a garden castle built in a blessed land.","Only World Emperor/Divine Kingdom lifeforms could pass through the main entrance of Diverse City. Those who were not could only go through the thousands of corners of Diverse City.","Even without any major events to attract people, the daily foot traffic in Diverse City reached billions.","In such a densely populated city, only powerful factions had a presence.","The moment Chu Ci saw Diverse City, she was stunned by its vastness.","Chu Ci muttered to herself, “Brother, if I hadn’t come here, I would never have believed there could be such a huge city in this world. Even hundreds of our royal capitals would pale in comparison to the magnificence of Diverse City.”","Lin Yuan looked at Diverse City and felt Chu Ci was being too conservative. Even thousands of royal capitals would likely pale in comparison to Diverse City.","Sun Yin had already left when they were still half a day away from the city. He preferred to act alone in Diverse City, not wanting anyone to discover his relationship with Lin Yuan. He feared it might affect Lin Yuan’s future actions and bring unnecessary trouble. Otherwise, Sun Yin would have been shocked by Chu Ci’s naïve reaction. In Sun Yin’s eyes, both Chu Ci and Lin Yuan were from a super powerful faction, so they should not have such an outlook.","Over time, Lin Yuan’s perspective gradually expanded. Having ventured through the Sky Beyond the Clouds for so long, he wasn’t overly surprised by the bustling atmosphere of Diverse City.","After recovering from her shock, Chu Ci would undoubtedly become much more powerful in the future.","“Chu Ci, the Sky Beyond the Clouds is a higher-level world than the one we were in before. We’re only in one universe of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. There’s also an enormous abyss outside the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“Do you remember what Sun Yin said about large cities like Diverse City? In the East Universe alone, there are no fewer than 30 such cities. Being in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, you must look at this world with a broader perspective. Let’s go into the city. Once we settle into Fortune Treasure Palace, you can truly enjoy the kind of service appreciated in this world.","“There’s a special beverage for honor guests in Fortune Treasure Palace. Drinking it deeply relaxes the soul, which is very helpful for comprehending Willpower Runes. It’s already evening. Have a meal and rest well for the night. Tomorrow, we’ll explore Diverse City together.”","Chu Ci nodded excitedly. “Brother, there should be many delicacies in the Sky Beyond the Clouds too, right? We can go shopping tomorrow and find special snacks in Diverse City!”","Lin Yuan knew his sister well—Chu Ci was undoubtedly a true glutton."]},{"number":3053,"title":"Chapter 3053 Wan Ying and Dragon Plum Family!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3053 Wan Ying and Dragon Plum Family!","Since Chu Ci wanted to look for delicacies in the city tomorrow, Lin Yuan did not disappoint her by telling her that all the delicacies in the city could be ordered in Fortune Treasure Palace. It was not an exaggeration to say that Fortune Treasure Palace treated top-notch guests of honor as well as their biological parents!","....","There were actually many factions like Fortune Treasure Palace in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and those who could become guests of honor of these factions were either top experts or came from powerful factions.","And factions like Fortune Treasure Palace could often provide services to these experts in terms of channels. Since there was no difference between everyone’s convenience here, the defining point came in the standard of service.","In Fortune Treasure Palace, as long as you wanted to enjoy something, it could be provided.","The status of Fortune Treasure Palace in Diverse City was far less imposing than in Treasure City, but they still occupied a considerable territory.","The person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace in a mega-city like Diverse City was of a higher rank than Zhan Lu, second only to the three leaders of Fortune Treasure Palace.","Lin Yuan’s visit was low-key. However, upon showing his special honor guest card at Fortune Treasure Palace, the person in charge promptly approached him.","With great warmth and respect, she said, “I didn’t know Young Master Lin would honor us with your presence. Please forgive me! I am Wan Ying, the person in charge here at Fortune Treasure Palace.”","The manager of the branch in Diverse City was a woman with stunning dark purple hair that flowed down to her waist. Her fair and delicate face featured striking pink and purple eyes, adding a unique and exotic charm to her appearance.","Lin Yuan smiled at Wan Ying’s warm reception.","“Manager Wan, you’re too polite. My sister and I are here in Diverse City to attend the auction held by Traveling Dragon Palace. I wonder if you could secure three spots for us at the trade fair?”","Lin Yuan directly expressed his purpose for coming to Diverse City. As a newcomer, obtaining a spot in Traveling Dragon Palace’s auction would be challenging without assistance.","However, Fortune Treasure Palace was likely capable of helping.","As a special honor guest, Lin Yuan could make any request of Fortune Treasure Palace, and the faction would strive to fulfill it.","Lin Yuan’s past transactions with Fortune Treasure Palace had brought them significant benefits. Few factions had as many high-class Creator resources to trade with them as he did.","Fortune Treasure Palace was well aware of this. This was why Ling Muzhuo, one of the three leaders, had personally formed a friendship with Lin Yuan.","Wan Ying appreciated Lin Yuan’s straightforward nature. Compared to other special honor guests who required her to guess their needs, Lin Yuan was undoubtedly easier to assist.","“Young Master Lin, many people have come to Diverse City for Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair. The trade fair only has 1,000 slots. Fortune Treasure Palace only has 15 spots. Each spot represents one person. If it were any other special honor guest asking me for a spot, I would definitely hesitate. However, you’re the one asking me for this spot. There definitely won’t be any problems. You have three people here. I can reserve three spots for you.”","Wan Ying did not say that to curry favor with Lin Yuan but because she knew how important Lin Yuan was to Fortune Treasure Palace.","Every special honor guest card issued by Fortune Treasure Palace was labeled with the corresponding identity information.","If it was an ordinary special honor guest, Wan Ying would not personally appear to receive them. She would only arrange for a reception officer.","Wan Ying had 30 receptionists under her. With the traffic in Diverse City, special honor guests would basically come every day. However, Wan Ying only personally received no more than two people every month.","Fortune Treasure Palace had three leaders, so it was impossible for a faction with multiple leaders not to have internal competition. It was the same for Fortune Treasure Palace.","Wan Ying was on Ling Muzhuo’s side, so she treated Lin Yuan warmly.","When Wan Ying received the news of Lin Yuan’s arrival, she quickly informed Ling Muzhuo. She had a feeling that if Lin Yuan stayed in Diverse City long enough, Ling Muzhuo might come personally to meet him.","As she spoke to Lin Yuan, Wan Ying’s gaze landed on Chu Ci.","Lin Yuan had just introduced Chu Ci as his younger sister. In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, where all species valued bloodlines, only those with the same father and mother would address each other as siblings.","If they were cousins of the same species, they would address each other as cousins. Out of respect for their bloodline, there was no such thing as a god-sister.","Chu Ci did not have the ability to conceal her aura, nor did she deliberately try to.","Chu Ci was about the same age as Lin Yuan. She had only lived for a few decades but had already reached World Emperor/Pinnacle Divine Kingdom. This surprised Wan Ying.","Chu Ci, who was standing beside Lin Yuan, had an extremely close relationship with him. This was enough to prove that Chu Ci was highly favored in Lin Yuan’s faction.","This realization made Wan Ying understand that she needed to show the same respect to Chu Ci as she did to Lin Yuan.","Wan Ying did not pay much attention to Winter, who was standing behind Lin Yuan. No matter how strong Winter was, he was only Lin Yuan’s guard, responsible for protecting him. There was no need for her to make friends with such a person.","She might be misunderstood by Lin Yuan if she took the initiative to befriend his subordinates.","As the manager of such a huge city, Wan Ying was much smarter than Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Manager Wan, thank you very much. The Diverse City branch will definitely accumulate more resources than Treasure City. I hope to trouble you later to let me use my Grade 4 and above Creator resources to exchange for a batch of supplies.”","Wan Ying had treated them very well and clearly shown him respect, so Lin Yuan was naturally willing to repay her.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had come to Diverse City with the intention of obtaining some gains from Fortune Treasure Palace.","He could fulfill Wan Ying’s wish!","When Wan Ying heard Lin Yuan’s words, her face lit up. She had heard from Ling Muzhuo about Lin Yuan’s magnificent feat in the Treasure City branch.","Subsequently, Zhan Lu made use of that event to brag. Even the people in charge who were of a higher grade than Zhan Lu were extremely envious of this.","Zhan Lu had relied on Lin Yuan’s extensive acquisition of resources to surpass his old rival in Fortune Treasure Palace’s evaluation, with his ranking rising by more than 160 places.","The officials at Fortune Treasure Palace were well aware of Zhan Lu’s capabilities. The primary reason for his sudden rise was Lin Yuan, a special honor guest.","Now, she was essentially receiving the same dividends as Zhan Lu.","The Diverse City branch had always ranked below the other major cities’ Fortune Treasure Palaces, and in recent decades, its ranking had been steadily declining. A few years ago, it had plummeted to third from the bottom.","Traveling Dragon Palace had been developing rapidly in Diverse City, leading to frequent conflicts among the city’s major factions.","The commotion in Diverse City affected the flow of people. While the powerful special honor guests with influential backgrounds in Fortune Treasure Palace were unaffected, the number of ordinary customers was halved.","The true profits of Fortune Treasure Palace came primarily from these ordinary customers.","Wan Ying could do nothing about the disputes and conflicts in Diverse City. She was already prepared for her ranking to drop again.","However, Lin Yuan’s words presented an opportunity for Wan Ying.","Wan Ying personally arranged accommodations for Lin Yuan and Chu Ci, assigning a total of four receptionists to receive Lin Yuan, Chu Ci, and their companions.","The four receptionists were very surprised by her arrangements. Four receptionists for three guests, and these three guests were in cahoots? This had never happened before!","It wasn’t that there hadn’t been extremely distinguished special honor guests staying at Fortune Treasure Palace before, but those guests could not bring as many benefits as Lin Yuan could. There were even so many benefits that they could help Wan Ying turn things around.","Chu Ci had never seen such a scene before. The residences arranged by Fortune Treasure Palace for special honor guests were all built like paradise, and the facilities inside were extremely luxurious.","Chu Ci touched the sofa made of some unknown animal skin and said, “Big Brother, I didn’t expect you to be doing so well in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","As she spoke, Chu Ci gave Lin Yuan a thumbs up.","Lin Yuan raised his brows. In fact, even before encountering the Epoch God Palace, he had already confirmed the existence of higher-class worlds above the main world.","Lin Yuan had always both yearned for and feared these higher-class worlds. He wasn’t worried about his own safety but was concerned that those around him might suffer calamities.","At that time, Lin Yuan believed it would be difficult for him to explore a higher-class world with only his current resources in the main world.","However, after meeting Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, who became his followers, everything changed drastically. With their strength, almost all problems could be resolved.","This allowed Lin Yuan to develop Sky City rapidly and even create a faith country!","Without the four of them, even if Lin Yuan had the ability to create a faith country, he wouldn’t have been able to develop it so quickly.","Previously, Lin Yuan had sent Jin Chen to Fortune Treasure Palace in Treasure City to trade, which had attracted a small hunting team. Without Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, this hunting team would have been enough to overthrow Sky City.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds was filled with danger, but the presence of the four followers gave Lin Yuan the confidence to face these challenges.","Upon hearing Chu Ci’s words, Lin Yuan smiled and told her seriously, “Chu Ci, it’s all thanks to Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter that I was able to develop in the Sky Beyond the Clouds so quickly. Otherwise, even with the resources accumulated in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, we wouldn’t have reached this stage even in a thousand years!”","Winter hurriedly said, “Young Master, the four of us are your followers. It’s our honor to share your burdens! We must thank you for giving us the chance to follow you! Your Spirit Lock spatial zone will soon transform. How could you develop slowly with the Creator resources you have in your hands?”","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were aware of Morbius’ situation and knew that Lin Yuan would soon be able to control Grade 6 Creator resources. Even Class 5 Creators would have to submit to such power.","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “Winter, you’re saying this because you’ve been looking at the problem from the perspective of an expert. Even if I really have Grade 6 Creator resources, without you, how would I dare to use these resources? Without a strong martial force as support, as long as the Grade 6 Creator resources are slightly revealed, they will attract the covetous eyes of powerful factions. We don’t even have to talk about the Lifespan Mouse.","“If you hadn’t been by my side and intimidated others, it would have been impossible for me to subdue those Grade 5 Creators through the Lifespan Mouse.","“Even if we really hid and developed slowly, we would have no choice but to face the powerful enemies we might encounter in the outside world!”","Lin Yuan was really grateful to Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. Otherwise, he would not have said such words.","One had to know that Lin Yuan was not a sentimental person. Indeed, Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter had given Lin Yuan the confidence to develop recklessly.","...","Ever since Sun Yin had parted ways with Lin Yuan, he had contacted him regarding his previous relationships in Diverse City.","The last time Sun Yin visited Diverse City, he had been a Grade 4 Creator. The factions that had come into contact with Sun Yin had tried their best to recruit him and invited him to join Diverse City. However, Sun Yin ultimately declined their offers.","Sun Yin knew very well that with his talent, he could indeed secure the support of a faction. However, this support would come with restrictions. Even if he was not directly constrained, he would still be entangled in the karma associated with that faction.","Sun Yin cherished his freedom. Otherwise, he would not have endured so much when he first met Lin Yuan.","The Dragon Plum Family was thrilled to receive Sun Yin’s correspondence. Centuries passed in the blink of an eye for World Emperor/Divine Kingdom lifeforms.","However, many events had transpired in Diverse City over the past hundred years.","Although the Dragon Plum Family was not directly involved, they were significantly affected.","Everyone living in Diverse City felt as if a lifetime had passed.","Six years ago, the Grade 4 Creator in the Dragon Plum Family had died of old age. Without this Grade 4 Creator and another who eventually left, the family clearly felt they were on an irreversible decline.","There were quite a number of pinnacle Grade 3 Creators in the Dragon Plum Family, eight to be exact.","However, none of these eight pinnacle Grade 3 Creators showed potential to become Grade 4 Creators within the next hundred years.","Only powerful factions in Diverse City were qualified to enjoy high-quality resources. Given the current situation of the Dragon Plum Family, it would likely be difficult for them to protect their territory.","At this moment, Sun Yin took the initiative to interact with the Dragon Plum Family. One could imagine how excited they were.","However, the Dragon Plum Family did not know that Sun Yin was no longer a Grade 4 Creator but had become a genuine Grade 5 Creator!"]},{"number":3054,"title":"Chapter 3054 A Grade 6 Creator!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3054 A Grade 6 Creator!","Behind Honor Absent Mall on Ninth Street in Diverse City, in an ancient residence on the south side of Ancient Bells Garden, over 200 people sat in a meeting hall.","....","For an aristocratic family in a super large city like Diverse City, having only 200 people in a meeting hall was considered a small number.","The leader was an old man with white hair and a beard. One of his eyes was extremely cloudy, with a scar running across half of his face. This blind eye gave him a somewhat ferocious appearance. However, to the other members of the Dragon Plum Family, this one-eyed old man was the kindest elder.","“Su Li, where are you meeting Master Sun? When you do, I’ll accompany you to welcome him. We must not let Master Sun feel neglected. Remember to prepare a few bottles of Cherry Plum Wine. When Master Sun Yin visited us before, he praised the Cherry Plum Wine more than once!”","Su Li quickly responded to her grandfather’s words, “Grandfather, I’ll bring a few core members of the family to receive him myself. There’s no need for you to go personally. I’ve already prepared two jars of Cherry Plum Wine. I’ll bring them to meet Master Sun.”","Su Li had not met Sun Yin in Diverse City; she met him while training elsewhere and invited him to develop his skills in Diverse City.","When Sun Yin arrived, Su Li invited him to stay with her family for a few days.","Su Li intended to invite Sun Yin to be a guest of the Dragon Plum Family. However, after learning that Sun Yin valued his freedom and could not stay with them, she refrained from making the request.","At that time, her grandfather had advocated keeping Sun Yin in the family, but he was somewhat of a snob. The Dragon Plum Family was trying to align itself with the Warm Water Palace and was closely connected to a pinnacle Grade 4 Creator.","For some reason, this pinnacle Grade 4 Creator had a conflict with Sun Yin. Consequently, her grandfather decided not to rope Sun Yin in and even kept a deliberate distance from him. This left Su Li feeling very helpless.","When Sun Yin left, her grandfather was unwilling to use a few jars of Sun Yin’s favorite Cherry Plum Wine to send him off. It had not been easy for her to obtain a few jars to avoid ruining Sun Yin’s mood.","Now that her grandfather had changed his mind, she felt a little vexed.","The current Dragon Plum Family was no longer as powerful as before.","During the period when the Dragon Plum Family had successfully become acquainted with the Warm Water Palace, they had been completely glorious.","Unfortunately, during Traveling Dragon Palace’s hundred years of rapid development, Warm Water Palace offended Traveling Dragon Palace and was wiped out.","Although the Dragon Plum Family had successfully gotten rid of their relationship with Warm Water Palace and was not destroyed because of this, the Dragon Plum Family had still been severely affected.","If the Dragon Plum Family wanted to rise, they would most likely not have another chance.","This was because too many factions in Diverse City wanted to curry favor with Traveling Dragon Palace. These factions were suppressing the Dragon Plum Family not because they had a grudge against the Dragon Plum Family, but because they wanted to use this opportunity to gain Traveling Dragon Palace’s favor.","Traveling Dragon Palace had been using this method to get rid of dissidents all these years, tacitly allowing this to happen.","Su Li knew very well why her grandfather was doing this. Now that the Dragon Plum Family no longer had a Grade 4 Creator, they urgently needed a Grade 4 Creator to support them.","However, Sun Yin’s motive for coming to Diverse City this time was most likely to revisit his old place or to settle some matters.","Given Sun Yin’s yearning for freedom, it was impossible for him to stay in Diverse City forever. Her grandfather would most likely be disappointed!","“No, Little Li. I have to go with you! This is the only way to show my respect for Master Sun!”","Everyone present was family. There was no need to say anything insinuating.","Su Zhongshan told Su Li in an extremely serious tone, “Little Li, you’re a smart child. You know very well what I want to say. Give me a definite answer. Do you think it’s possible for Master Sun to stay in the Dragon Plum Family and become a guest elder?”","Su Li looked at the expression on her grandfather’s face and really could not bring herself to say that it was impossible.","“Grandfather, I haven’t seen Master Sun in a long time. I’m not sure if I can invite Master Sun to be the Dragon Plum Family’s guest elder. However, with my understanding of Master Sun, the possibility is not high.","“If Master Sun doesn’t have the intention to become a guest of the Dragon Plum Family, forcefully inviting him will most likely affect our relationship with him. That’s why we have to be careful before making a decision!”","Su Zhongshan knew very well that the Dragon Plum Family had reached the end of its rope. In order to revive the Dragon Plum Family, he was willing to do anything.","Just because the possibility was small did not mean that there was no chance. As long as there was a chance, Su Zhongshan would work hard.","“Little Li, I’m well aware of the situation. When we go to see Master Sun, I won’t invite him directly. In the future, when the time is right, I’ll let you speak with him.”","After finishing his words to Su Li, Su Zhongsan turned to the rest of the family and said in a stern tone, “Master Sun will likely stay at the Dragon Plum Family’s old residence. You all must be respectful when you see Master Sun Yin! If anyone offends him for selfish reasons, I will remove them from the family and they will be condemned as a sinner, forever shamed.”","Sun Yin was unaware that his contacting Su Li to complete Lin Yuan’s mission had made the Dragon Plum Family hold him in such high regard.","To be honest, Sun Yin would never join the Dragon Plum Family.","After becoming a Grade 5 Creator, the Dragon Plum Family meant nothing to Sun Yin.","However, Sun Yin was not willing to help the Dragon Plum Family rise unless they agreed to become his pawns in return.","In a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, where the strong preyed on the weak, such opportunities were rare.","If not for his good relationship with Su Li, Sun Yin would not have offered such an opportunity.","Sun Yin looked at the familiar surroundings in Diverse City and stretched.","His mentality on this trip to Diverse City was completely different from before.","Sun Yin visited the famous old shops in Diverse City for a good meal before waiting for Su Li at the agreed location.","In Sun Yin’s experience, Su Li was always punctual. Sun Yin had never liked dealing with people who were not timely.","He did not wait long before he saw Su Li, though she was accompanied by a large group.","Sun Yin looked at Su Li, who spread her hands helplessly, indicating she had no choice but to bring her family.","At this moment, Su Li did not know that Sun Yin had become a Grade 5 Creator. Her attitude towards him remained rather nonchalant.","If not for Lin Yuan’s mission, Sun Yin would have frowned.","He had never liked interacting with unfamiliar people, but to complete Lin Yuan’s mission, he needed to engage with the other members of the Dragon Plum Family, not just Su Li.","Su Li greeted Sun Yin warmly, “Brother Sun, I haven’t seen you in over 100 years. You look even better than before!”","Su Li only intended to greet Sun Yin, but she did not expect him to respond to her words.","“My condition is indeed much better than before. Otherwise, wouldn’t I have become a Grade 5 Creator for nothing?”","Sun Yin’s words stunned Su Li and the members of the Dragon Plum Family standing beside her.","Su Zhongsan’s breathing quickened as he looked at Sun Yin, as if he was looking at hope.","In just a hundred years, Sun Yin had transformed into a Grade 5 Creator. Sun Yin’s talent was simply too astonishing!","It was impossible for Sun Yin to lie about such things. In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, no Creator dared to lie about their Creator grade. Once a Creator lied about their grade, their reputation would be ruined.","“Brother... Brother Sun, have you really become a Grade 5 Creator?” Realizing she was doubting Sun Yin, Su Li hurriedly changed her words. “Brother Sun, I mean to say that you’ve finally fulfilled your dream. Congratulations!”","At this point, Su Li couldn’t help but think of the current situation of the Dragon Plum Family. She looked a little sad.","Sun Yin did not put on the airs of a Grade 5 Creator in front of his old friend. Instead, he reached out and patted Su Li’s shoulder.","“Didn’t you say that you brought me Cherry Plum Wine? I miss the Dragon Plum Family’s Cherry Plum Wine so much! The last time I left, I drank two jars and still couldn’t drink to my heart’s content! The Cherry Plum Wine you brought this time should be enough for me to drink, right?”","Before Su Li could speak, her grandfather spoke up loudly, “Master Sun, no, Lord Sun, it is the Dragon Plum Family’s honor that you enjoy our Cherry Plum Wine. Naturally, you can drink as much as you want! If you don’t mind, why don’t you come to the Dragon Plum Family for a drink? We’ve brewed a lot of plum wine over the past thousand years. If you like it, you can drink it freely!”","If Su Li treated Sun Yin as a friend or elder brother, then Su Zhongsan’s attitude towards Sun Yin could only be described as bootlicking.","However, the other members of the Dragon Plum Family were not dissatisfied with Su Zhongsan’s attitude. They were, in fact, very enthusiastic.","There were very few Grade 5 Creators in Diverse City. In Diverse City, Grade 5 Creators were equivalent to the ceiling! In the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds, as long as a Grade 6 Creator did not appear, a Grade 5 Creator could be considered a supreme person. Even a faction like the Traveling Dragon Palace had to be respectful to Grade 5 Creators.","A Grade 5 Creator was the wealth of the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds. As long as the Dragon Plum Family could secure a Grade 4 Creator, they would not fall and would be able to maintain their current glory.","If they could establish a relationship with a Grade 5 Creator, the Dragon Plum Family would be qualified to become a true upper-class faction in Diverse City!","However, at this moment, Su Zhongsan was somewhat afraid of Sun Yin.","Su Zhongsan dared to invite a Grade 4 Creator to the Dragon Plum Family but he did not dare to invite a Grade 5 Creator. A Grade 5 Creator was too noble.","Sun Yin laughed out loud.","“Since the Dragon Plum Family is so enthusiastic, I won’t stand on ceremony. I’ll visit them later! But before that, I want Su Li to accompany me around Diverse City. I haven’t been here for hundreds of years and am no longer familiar with the city. I came this time intending to buy some resources. With Su Li’s help, I should quickly get reacquainted with Diverse City.”","After saying this, Sun Yin ignored the reactions of the other members of the Dragon Plum Family and pulled Su Li away.","Su Zhongsan was all smiles, surprised by the relationship between Sun Yin and Su Li. He had thought they were merely acquaintances but now realized they were very good friends.","If he wanted the Dragon Plum Family to connect with a Grade 5 Creator like Sun Yin, he needed to act quickly and strategically.","As Sun Yin and Su Li explored Diverse City, he asked her about the city’s developments over the past hundred years.","Su Li was always candid. Keeping her grandfather’s intentions in mind, she said directly to Sun Yin, “Brother Sun, my grandfather wants you to become a sponsor of the Dragon Plum Family. I know you dislike being constrained. If their future invitations bother you, I’ll explain to them now! I don’t want this to affect our relationship. I’ve never been highly valued in the family. If you hadn’t contacted me this time, I wouldn’t even have been qualified to attend a family meeting.”","Su Li spoke openly, not out of naivety, but because she was extremely smart.","Whether her family could align with Sun Yin was uncertain, but she knew she could. As a direct descendant who wasn’t valued, she didn’t need to sacrifice her future for the family. If she succeeded with Sun Yin, it would benefit the family.","As long as she didn’t betray the Dragon Plum Family, their interests would be aligned.","Sun Yin pondered Su Li’s words before replying, “Su Li, I can’t become a guest of the Dragon Plum Family because I’ve already joined a faction.”","Su Li had anticipated Sun Yin’s rejection and guessed his reasons. However, she never imagined that someone like Sun Yin, who cherished his freedom, would join a faction and accept its restrictions. This was unlike the Sun Yin she knew.","Before Su Li could express her surprise, Sun Yin continued, “The faction I joined has a Grade 6 Creator. Su Li, I’m sure you understand the significance of this faction.”"]},{"number":3055,"title":"Chapter 3055: Bizarre Plant Demon Hall!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3055: Bizarre Plant Demon Hall!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Su Li spoke directly to Sun Yin, who did not hide anything from her.","Lin Yuan needed a family he could use as a tool. If he chose the Dragon Plum Family, he had to make this clear to them. He released such a message to intimidate both Su Li and the Dragon Plum Family.","Sun Yin was not worried about whether the Dragon Plum Family would spread this matter. Even if they did, it wouldn’t matter. Sun Yin had already confirmed this with Lin Yuan.","If the news spread, it might not be a bad thing. Sky City’s roots were far away in the North of the Lonely River, and those with ulterior motives would not be able to find any traces of Sky City through the Dragon Plum Family.","If this news spread, it would definitely attract powerful factions or experts who needed Grade 6 Creator resources.","Lin Yuan was willing to trade with such powerful experts and factions. This was because trading with these factions and experts would allow Lin Yuan to obtain great benefits.","When Su Li heard that Sun Yin had become a Grade 5 Creator, she was extremely surprised. She knew that Sun Yin was an exceptionally talented Creator. Even so, he became a Grade 5 Creator too quickly.","If Sun Yin was fortunate enough to join a faction with a Grade 6 Creator and obtain guidance, it would all make sense.","Amidst her shock, Su Li’s imagination ran wild. She did not know that Lin Yuan had nothing to do with Sun Yin becoming a Grade 5 Creator.","No wonder Sun Yin was willing to give up his freedom to join this faction!","There were only a few Grade Creators in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds. If such a big shot could come to Diverse City, the City Lord and the major factions would probably kneel to welcome him.","Sun Yin’s status as a Grade 5 Creator was already very precious. But now, Sun Yin represented a faction with a Grade 6 Creator.","The famous Traveling Dragon Palace in Diverse City would probably immediately put down their arrogance and treat Sun Yin as a distinguished guest if they knew about his situation.","Su Li was very good at seizing opportunities. When she first met Sun Yin, it was she who seized the opportunity.","She had a good relationship with Sun Yin. Otherwise, Sun Yin would not have thought of her immediately upon coming to Diverse City.","Su Li mustered her courage and said, “Brother Sun, I’ve always treated you as my good brother. I wonder if you can bring me along if there’s a chance in the future and give me a chance to be your retainer? If you allow me to follow you, you don’t have to worry that the Dragon Plum Family will affect your work.”","Sun Yin looked up at Su Li, whose eyes were filled with anticipation and caution. He thought to himself that Su Li was really a smart person.","However, in Sun Yin’s opinion, Su Li’s actions were somewhat abrupt. His relationship with Su Li was indeed good, but it was far from the extent where he could change Su Li’s fate at will.","Su Li was desperately creating an opportunity for her future.","Sun Yin was still thinking about how to guide Su Li. But now, he even skipped the leading words.","“Su Li, do you know how many people want to work for me since I became a Grade 5 Creator? But until now, I haven’t had a retainer by my side. You should still remember Ronnie, right? I’ve been communicating with Ronnie for more than 100 years. Ronnie wanted to stay by my side as a retainer, but I rejected her.”","When Su Li said those words just now, she already realized that she had been a little abrupt.","However, since she had already said it, there was nothing she could do even if she was rude.","Su Li was afraid that Sun Yin would think she was going to do something wrong and, because of what he said just now, he would pull away from her.","Ronnie and Sun Yin’s relationship was closer than hers and Sun Yin’s. Moreover, she had not contacted Sun Yin many times in the past few years. Sun Yin had even rejected Ronnie, so he naturally could not agree to her request.","Just as Su Li was contemplating how to steer the conversation away from the awkward topic, she heard Sun Yin change the subject. “Actually, it’s not impossible to bring you along. Coincidentally, I plan to develop some projects in Diverse City in the future. However, I won’t stop you from continuing to stay with the Dragon Plum Family.”","Su Li was a very smart person, which was the main reason Sun Yin valued her.","Sun Yin observed Su Li’s shifting expressions and knew she had understood his implications.","Su Li hesitated for a moment before speaking solemnly, “Brother Sun, I’ll say it again. As long as you’re willing to guide me, I will do whatever you ask in the future. I’ll do my best! If you need anything, the Dragon Plum Family will support you as well!”","Sun Yin’s words made it clear that he wanted to use the Dragon Plum Family as a foundation to develop in Diverse City. This was a huge opportunity for the Dragon Plum Family.","She wondered how happy her grandfather would be when he found out.","A direct descendant like her, who was not valued, could use Sun Yin’s connections to become an even more important figure in the Dragon Plum Family than her grandfather!","And power was what Su Li had always pursued. She had just never had the chance to express her ambitions to the outside world.","Sun Yin patted Su Li’s shoulder.","“Alright, I’ll ask you to help me with my responsibilities in Diverse City from now on. We’ll be having dinner together later. Come and introduce the situation in Diverse City to me. I heard that Traveling Dragon Palace is planning to use resources like blessed lands as exhibits for the trade fair. Do you know about Traveling Dragon Palace’s situation?”","Su Li had been wondering why Sun Yin would go to Diverse City. It turned out the catalyst was the trade fair organized by Traveling Dragon Palace.","“Brother Sun, I know a little about Traveling Dragon Palace, but only superficial matters. The Dragon Plum Family is not qualified to come into contact with a faction of Traveling Dragon Palace’s level. The news we heard is just hearsay. We can’t guarantee that it’s true!”","Su Li was cautious by nature. Now that she had just joined Sun Yin, she was even more so.","She feared she might give Sun Yin false information that could affect his judgment.","“Just say it. I need to come into contact with Traveling Dragon Palace in the future. I heard that Traveling Dragon Palace has basically defeated all the factions of the same level in Diverse City and even suppressed Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.”","When it came to Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, Sun Yin’s expression did not change, but Su Li felt suffocated.","The last time Sun Yin came to Diverse City, he had become enemies with a Grade 4 Creator from Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. This Creator had cornered Sun Yin twice, causing him public humiliation.","Otherwise, Sun Yin would not have left Diverse City in such a hurry. To a certain extent, he had been chased out of Diverse City by Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","“Brother Sun, you’re right. Among all the factions in Diverse City that fought against Traveling Dragon Palace, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall suffered the most.","“Even one of the three Evil Eye Ghost Curse Trees had its trunk broken by Traveling Dragon Palace. Two of the six Elders of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall died in the battle with Traveling Dragon Palace.","“Now, with the current strength of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, they are one of the top five factions in Diverse City. However, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall has already completely shrunk. They have given all their resources in Diverse City to Traveling Dragon Palace.","“There’s a rumor in Diverse City that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall might leave to develop in another city.”","At this point, Su Li paused and said in a low voice, “Brother Sun, I think this is just a rumor. Bizarre Plant Demon Hall should not leave Diverse City, which has been developed for hundreds of thousands of years. Bizarre Plant Demon Hall is a very special faction. Leaving Diverse City is equivalent to losing their foundation.","“I keep feeling that the shrinking of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall is the calm before the storm. It will eventually clash with Traveling Dragon Palace. Especially now that Traveling Dragon Palace is clashing with Gray Smoke Stronghold, Traveling Dragon Palace is at a disadvantage in Extreme Wood City. Sixty percent of the experts from Traveling Dragon Palace in Diverse City have been sent to Extreme Wood City.","“Now, it can be said to be the best opportunity for Bizarre Plant Demon Hall to snatch back the resources from Traveling Dragon Palace! I think the people from Bizarre Plant Demon Hall have most likely already contacted the people from Extreme Wood City’s Gray Smoke Stronghold.”","Su Li knew that Sun Yin had not been to Diverse City for a long time and did not know the situation there. Otherwise, he would not have asked about this kind of information that all the factions in Diverse City knew.","Su Li analyzed the situation in Diverse City. In the past, when Su Li and Sun Yin were together, Su Li talked more. At that time, when Su Li was analyzing something, Sun Yin was listening, so Su Li was not afraid that Sun Yin would dislike her analysis.","When Sun Yin heard Su Li mention Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, her tone was extremely careful. He knew that Su Li was thinking about the conflict between him and Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","Sun Yin indeed hated Bizarre Plant Demon Hall in the past, especially the Grade 4 Creator of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","If Sun Yin had not bet on Lin Yuan, he would have definitely beaten up the Creator of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall as a Grade 5 Creator in Diverse City to regain his dignity!","However, now that Sun Yin had joined Lin Yuan and seen a higher perspective, he no longer cared about Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","Sun Yin was not willing to affect Lin Yuan’s plan because of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. Of course, the prerequisite was that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would not cause trouble for him.","“When I was still in Diverse City, I remember that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall wanted to suppress Traveling Dragon Palace. Traveling Dragon Palace couldn’t surpass Bizarre Plant Demon Hall in a short period of time.","“Traveling Dragon Palace has been accumulating for at least tens of thousands of years to rise. They have been holding back all this while, and they only showed their prowess in the past hundred years.","“With my understanding of the people of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, they must have contacted Gray Smoke Stronghold. I’ve heard about the situation in Gray Smoke Stronghold. They can be considered a top faction in Extreme Wood City.","“Gray Smoke Stronghold is so angry about the expansion of Traveling Dragon Palace. With Bizarre Plant Demon Hall taking the initiative to make contact, they will definitely be very willing to cooperate with Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","“If they can defeat Traveling Dragon Palace, all of Traveling Dragon Palace’s arrangements in Extreme Wood City will belong to Gray Smoke Stronghold. It seems that Traveling Dragon Palace is in trouble this time!”","When Sun Yin informed Lin Yuan about the situation in Diverse City, Winter mentioned that the Traveling Dragon Palace’s circumstances were far from optimistic. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have sold their blessed land, even if they wanted to expand their power.","Traveling Dragon Palace had the strength to become a local tyrant in Diverse City. However, despite years of accumulation, they were not satisfied with their current status. Overreaching could lead to a significant backlash.","This was something Sun Yin had not considered before. Compared to his talent as a Creator, Sun Yin was not adept at scheming, developing a faction, or strategic planning.","As Sun Yin pondered over discussing this with Lin Yuan, he heard Su Li say, “Brother Sun, if you want to attack Gray Smoke Stronghold, you could collaborate with Traveling Dragon Palace. But this might offend Gray Smoke Stronghold, who is opposing Traveling Dragon Palace, so it may not be worth it.","“However, this would certainly earn Traveling Dragon Palace’s friendship. If you plan to develop in Diverse City, building a good relationship with Traveling Dragon Palace would be highly beneficial.”","Su Li continued to devise strategies for Sun Yin, aware that Sun Yin would not easily let go of the schemes and insults from the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","Sun Yin solemnly responded to Su Li’s words, “Su Li, remember that I’m no longer independent. I’ve joined a faction and can’t do anything that would implicate it. You are now my retainer, and I hope you can act accordingly.”","After their conversation, Sun Yin and Su Li arrived at the old residence of the Dragon Plum Family. Sun Yin requested the Dragon Plum Family to keep his situation confidential.","He then returned to the room that Su Zhongsan had personally prepared for him in the old residence. He took out the Thoughts Letter Paper and reported the situation to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had already asked Wan Ying, the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace, for relevant information.","Wan Ying’s information for Lin Yuan was more detailed and precise than what Sun Yin had obtained from Su Li.","Su Li suspected that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Gray Smoke Stronghold had joined forces to resist Traveling Dragon Palace, and Wan Ying confirmed this.","Bizarre Plant Demon Hall was likely to attack Traveling Dragon Palace during the trade fair. Disrupting this transaction would impact Traveling Dragon Palace’s fundraising.","Lin Yuan’s eyes flickered when he saw Sun Yin’s message.","Lin Yuan typically kept a low profile, influencing those around him to do the same. However, there were times to be high-profile.","Even if Lin Yuan chose to remain low-profile, those around him should not.","[Lin Yuan]: Sun Yin, I authorize you to reveal your Grade 5 Creator status. Use it to gain qualifications to attend Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair and bring a few important figures from the Dragon Plum Family. There is solid information that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Traveling Dragon Palace will clash at the trade fair.","Initially, Lin Yuan was only interested in the blessed lands and treasures that Traveling Dragon Palace intended to sell. Now, understanding the situation in Diverse City, he was even more interested in Traveling Dragon Palace itself.","Through Sun Yin, Lin Yuan controlled the Dragon Plum Family, but it would be challenging for the Dragon Plum Family to stand out in Diverse City."]},{"number":3056,"title":"Chapter 3056: The Need for Gourmets!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3056: The Need for Gourmets!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Once the Dragon Plum Family took out a large amount of resources in Traveling Dragon Palace, the Dragon Plum Family would become the focus of the major factions in Diverse City. Moreover, in the face of the sudden rise of the Dragon Plum Family, there would most likely be many factions targeting the Dragon Plum Family.","Since Lin Yuan was not prepared to invest too much manpower and resources in Diverse City, it would be very difficult for him to protect the Dragon Plum Family which had become the target of public criticism.","Compared to the Dragon Plum Family, Traveling Dragon Palace which was already the most superior-class faction in Diverse City, had long stood out and had a dominant position in Diverse City.","Furthermore, Traveling Dragon Palace had a strong intention to expand and they had already opened up their territory in Extreme Wood City. This showed that Traveling Dragon Palace was very ambitious and aggressive.","Traveling Dragon Palace’s attitude toward the outside world was already clear. If Lin Yuan could be the driving force behind Traveling Dragon Palace, the outside world would only pay attention to Traveling Dragon Palace itself and not Sky City behind it.","If Traveling Dragon Palace was in a thriving state, it would be difficult for Lin Yuan to reach an agreement with it.","But now that Traveling Dragon Palace was in a difficult situation, Traveling Dragon Palace needed a strong teammate. It was very easy for Lin Yuan to come into contact with the upper echelons of Traveling Dragon Palace.","Whether it was through Sun Yin, who had already become a Grade 5 Creator or Wan Ying, the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace and Diverse City, Lin Yuan could do it.","However, Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to interact with Traveling Dragon Palace because he only knew about the Traveling Dragon Palace’s predicament and did not know anything else about it.","Lin Yuan needed to understand Traveling Dragon Palace before making a decision.","Sun Yin smiled when he saw Lin Yuan’s message. It was great that Lin Yuan wanted him to expose his Grade 5 Creator identity. This way, he could be more high-profile.","If Lin Yuan did not expose his identity as a Grade 5 Creator, he would have to be as cautious as possible.","In the evening, Lin Yuan bought a large batch of resources from Fortune Treasure Palace. He used spirit qi crystals and heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls of various types.","Diverse City’s Fortune Treasure Palace had more collections than Treasure City’s Fortune Treasure Palace and the level of resources was also higher.","Wan Ying’s authority was higher than Zhan Lu’s, so she could make the decision to take out more precious resources.","Compared to producing faith, hundreds of thousands of people evolved in grade every day in faith country, allowing Morbius to collect a large number of spirit qi crystals.","Lin Yuan now had billions of spirit qi crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. He spent nearly 10 million spirit qi crystals on Wan Ying this time.","However, this was nothing to Lin Yuan.","Wan Ying said to Lin Yuan excitedly, “Young Master Lin, thank you for being so willing to support me and use Creator resources to trade for so many resources. If there’s anything you want me to do in the future, just ask. I’ll definitely do my best to satisfy your request. When he heard that you had come to Diverse City, Lord Ling decided to meet you here. He instructed me to treat you well. If you have any requests, just let me know!”","With that, Wan Ying instructed the four receptionists she had sent over to move many rare flowers and plants to the room and prepare many superior-class delicacies.","Chu Ci said while drinking the rose-pink juice that Wan Ying had just brought over,","“Big Brother, I don’t know what kind of heavenly treasures are added to this fruit juice but I feel much clearer after taking the first sip. The fatigue in my soul has also been washed away. The key is that this fruit juice tastes extremely good. It’s been a long time since I’ve drunk such delicious fruit juice!”","Chu Ci enjoyed the fruit juice very much. Previously, she had always felt that as long as she worked hard, she would be able to help Lin Yuan sooner or later. But now, she gradually gave up on this idea.","Firstly, Lin Yuan was living too well in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. No one was looking for trouble with him so she had no chance to help Lin Yuan.","Secondly, Chu Ci realized that the gap between her and Lin Yuan was too big. No matter how hard she tried, she could not make up for it.","Chu Ci understood this but she would still work hard to improve herself. She would not embarrass Lin Yuan by falling behind among Sky City’s core members.","If Lin Yuan knew what Chu Ci was thinking, he would definitely be very gratified.","Lin Yuan had worked so hard to develop Sky City in order to create a good living environment for Chu Ci. As such, Lin Yuan did not wish for Chu Ci to suffer so much. All she had to do was enjoy life under his protection!","“Chu Ci, if you like this fruit juice, I’ll get Wan Ying to prepare more for you when we leave Diverse City. I think even if we ask Wan Ying for the formula of this fruit juice, she will probably give it to us. You can drink as much as you want in the future! We can also hire Gourmets who are good at using spiritual ingredients to cook delicacies and bring them to North of the Lonely River to improve the food of the core members of Sky City.”","There were many professions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and Gourmet was one of them.","Gourmets could use many spiritual ingredients to make delicacies with many benefits, but these Gourmets were fundamentally different from Creators who concocted potions.","“As these Gourmets could not stimulate the effects of these ingredients to the greatest extent like Creators, they could only stimulate the taste of the ingredients and make them more delicious.","This made the Gourmet’s status in the Sky Beyond the Clouds not high. They were far inferior to Creators.","However, an outstanding Gourmet was definitely very rich because outstanding Gourmets served experts and large factions.","After the initial stage of Sky City’s development, Lin Yuan felt that he had to seek more benefits for the core members of Sky City.","Chu Ci was moved by Lin Yuan’s words.","“Big Brother, I see that Diverse City is very modern. I think there should be a talent market. We can go to the talent market and see if we can find a more outstanding Gourmet! Apart from Gourmets, we can also recruit more lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals like Spirit Craftsmen and Weavers.","“When I was in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, I always heard Uncle Hu complaining that he had too few Spirit Craftsmen under him and that there were many things he could not do. Why don’t we take this opportunity to help Uncle Hu solve the problem?","“Moreover, there are so many people in Sky City that we can’t rely on Sister Wen Yu alone to make clothes. I know that as long as we speak to Manager Wan, she can help and recommend many people to us. But how can someone recommended by others be better than someone we choose ourselves?”","Lin Yuan nodded. Indeed, Lin Yuan preferred his own choices over those recommended by others.","“In any case, we’re going to walk around Diverse City tomorrow. When the time comes, get Wan Ying to arrange for someone to bring us to the talent market in Diverse City to take a look.There are many talent markets in Diverse City. It’s very difficult for us to find a suitable talent market ourselves. At that time, we can get the people from Fortune Treasure Palace to bring us directly to the highest-end talent market and choose talents there.","“There are a few feys from Fortune Treasure Palace that you can contract. Since you’re not in a hurry to contract a fey, why don’t you wait a little longer?","“Apart from selling the blessed land, Traveling Dragon Palace has also taken out many foundation-grade feys. If one of these foundation-grade feys is suitable for you, it will greatly increase your limit in the future.”","Chu Ci knew that Lin Yuan would always make the best arrangements for her so she was not worried about the fey she was going to contract.","Tomorrow, Lin Yuan would bring Chu Ci to Diverse City’s high-end talent market to apply for a job. This made Chu Ci feel very excited and novel.","Wan Ying basically served Lin Yuan the entire day and appeared in the special honor guest’s living area many times.","This caused quite a stir in Diverse City’s Fortune Treasure Palace.","Because of the trade fair held by Traveling Dragon Palace, there were quite a number of large faction members who went to Traveling Dragon Palace recently.","Many of these large factions’ members lived in Fortune Treasure Palace and Wan Ying’s attitude toward them was far less enthusiastic than her attitude toward Lin Yuan.","Everyone knew very well how the people from the Fortune Treasure Palace usually handled things. These factions did not feel dissatisfied because of Wan Ying’s attitude. Instead, they knew that a big shot must have come to the Fortune Treasure Palace to make Wan Ying behave like this.","These special honor guests all wanted to befriend a faction that Wan Ying valued so much.","Relying on the fact that they usually got along well with Wan Ying, many factions looked for Wan Ying and hoped that she could help introduce them.","If these special honor guests were to find Wan Ying for help, Wan Ying would be willing to help them no matter what.","However, Lin Yuan’s identity was too special so Ling Muzhuo had deliberately instructed her to receive him well. He could not let Lin Yuan feel even the slightest discomfort.","Wan Ying could tell that Lin Yuan was not keen on socializing. It would not be good if she rashly led these special honor guests to interact with Lin Yuan and made him unhappy!","Wan Ying could only reject the requests of the other special honor guests. However, Wan Ying’s actions made the other special honor guests even more curious.","The next morning, Lin Yuan found Wan Ying and asked her to arrange for two people to be his and Chu Ci’s guides.","Wan Ying immediately sent two receptionists to entertain Lin Yuan and Chu Ci and asked them to act as guides.","The receptionists were in the middle of Fortune Treasure Palace. In Fortune Treasure Palace, receptionists were second only to Wan Ying, the person in charge.","If Wan Ying usually asked the receptionists to be the guides on any other day, these receptionists would definitely not be willing.","However, the receptionists Wan Ying had sent had witnessed Lin Yuan’s trade with Fortune Treasure Palace yesterday. Hence, when Wan Ying was assigning this task this morning, the four receptionists had fought for it right in front of Wan Ying.","Wan Ying looked at the four extremely arrogant receptionists under her and thought to herself.","Although these receptionists are arrogant, they’re not stupid at all.","They knew that receiving Lin Yuan was an opportunity.","Since it was an opportunity, Wan Ying would definitely arrange such an opportunity for her subordinates who were closer and more obedient to her.","Wan Ying looked at the two happy receptionists in front of her and said seriously, “Ah Qian, Ah Tao, the two of you are my trusted aides. Among all the receptionists, I value the two of you the most and treat you the best. This opportunity has been given to the two of you. The two of you must seize this opportunity and serve Young Master Lin as well as possible. Young Master Lin is someone that even Palace Master Ling has to show some respect to—especially you, Ah Tao.","“You have to be careful in front of Young Master Lin. Don’t speak nonsense and make Young Master Lin unhappy! Otherwise, if Palace Master Ling blames you, I won’t be able to protect you!”","Wan Ying had always been kind to Ah Qian and Ah Tao and treated them as though they were her younger sisters.","Hearing such serious instructions for the two of them, Ah Qian and Ah Tao hurriedly promised Wan Ying, “Sister Wan, Ah Tao and I know our limits. We definitely won’t do anything that will make Young Master Lin unhappy. Sister Wan, you’ve always known that I’m a timid person. How would I dare to displease Young Master Lin? It’s just that this Young Master Lin is strange. Why is he going to a talent market for no reason? If Young Master Lin has any needs in terms of personnel, just tell us. We’ll recommend someone to him!”","Wan Ying was already a little worried about Ah Tao. Now that she heard what Ah Tao said, Wan Ying frowned tightly.","“Ah Tao, you can’t say this in front of Young Master Lin. You just have to do what Young Master Lin asks you to do. We don’t need to make any suggestions. The two of you should start preparing. If you do well this time. I’ll put in a good word for you on Palace Master Ling’s side.","“If the two of you can be evaluated as A-rank, the two of you can go to the local area to be the managers of Fortune Treasure Palace and manage the area yourselves. It’s much better than the two of you following me as receptionists! I’ve always treated the two of you as my younger sisters.","“Naturally, I hope that the two of you can develop better. Good luck. If the two of you don’t get the evaluation this time, you probably won’t have another chance in the next thousand years.”","When Ah Tao and Ah Qian heard Wan Ying’s words, they could not help but feel ardor and zeal coursing through their blood.","The ultimate goal of all the receptionists in Fortune Treasure Palace was to become the manager of a branch of Fortune Treasure Palace. However, only one percent of the receptionists had such an opportunity.","Ah Qian and Ah Tao did not have such an opportunity previously. Apart from Wan Ying’s nurturing and Ling Muzhuo’s appreciation, they also had to thank Lin Yuan for coming here.","Otherwise, Ah Qian would have a chance to become the manager of the Fortune Treasure Palace while Ah Tao would not have such a chance at all.","Ah Tao and Ah Qian were now treating Lin Yuan with the utmost importance.","Seeing that Ah Qian and Ah Tao were a little nervous, Wan Ying smiled in satisfaction.","Wan Ying really hoped that Ah Qian and Ah Tao would become the managers of Fortune Treasure Palace."]},{"number":3057,"title":"Chapter 3057: Shocking Needs!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3057: Shocking Needs!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Although Ah Qian and Ah Tao could no longer stay by her side and Wan Ying had lost two outstanding helpers, Ah Qian and Ah Tao becoming the managers of Fortune Treasure Palace would be of greater help to Wan Ying in the future.","Not only were there competitions between the three Palace Masters of Fortune Treasure Palace but there were also many competitions between the managers of the various cities.","Fortune Treasure Palace had sent two receptionists as his guides and Lin Yuan was very grateful to them. He took out dozens of spirit qi crystals and rewarded them to Ah Qian and Ah Tao.","The receptionists liked to receive charity from special honor guests. Once they served the special honor guests well, the rewards given by the special honor guests would sometimes be more than the commission earned as receptionists.","If it was something bestowed by someone else, Ah Tao would definitely accept it without hesitation. However, Wan Ying had repeatedly reminded Ah Tao to treat Lin Yuan well. This reception was related to her future evaluation. For a moment, Ah Tao did not know if she should take these spirit qi crystals!","Ah Qian saw Ah Tao’s hesitation and took the spirit qi crystals before thanking Lin Yuan respectfully.","She also used her eyes to signal Ah Tao not to be rude. The spirit qi crystals that Lin Yuan casually took out were not meant to show off his status in front of the two of them. Lin Yuan had already taken out tens of millions of spirit qi crystals yesterday to trade. These spirit qi crystals were nothing to him. If Ah Tao was shy and refused to accept it, it would make people think that she was rejecting Lin Yuan’s kind intentions.","Seeing Ah Qian accept these spirit qi crystals, Ah Tao also followed suit.","Ah Qian said softly to Lin Yuan, “Young Master Lin, there are a total of three high-end talent markets in Diverse City. Which one are you planning to go to? If you don’t know the difference between these three talent markets, Ah Tao and I can introduce them to you one by one!”","When Lin Yuan had traded resources with Fortune Treasure Palace yesterday evening, he made it clear that he had never been to Diverse City before. Therefore, it was impossible for Lin Yuan to have any understanding of Diverse City’s talent markets.","If it were not for the huge difference between these three top talent markets, Ah Qian would have made the decision herself.","Before Lin Yuan could say anything, Chu Ci’s interest was piqued when she heard that there were three areas in the high-end talent market. She asked, “What’s the difference between these three talent markets?","“The functional professions we’re looking for today are more complicated, and there might be a lot of people. However, there are requirements for these people’s abilities.”","Ah Qian’s attitude toward Chu Ci was the same as Lin Yuan’s. She was exceptionally respectful.","“Miss Chu Ci, the first of these three talent markets is controlled by the officials of Diverse City. It’s located southwest of the City Lord’s residence. The people here are all nurtured by the officials of Diverse City. There are all kinds of people inside and they accept employment.","“A portion of the commission earned by these people needs to be handed over to the City Lord’s residence. The officials of Diverse City will also be responsible for these people to ensure the interests of these employers.","“The second place is at the foot of the Dust Abyss Mountain. It’s not far from here. The people here are usually from various mercenary guilds. They can take on missions as a team. Most of the people inside have extraordinary combat strength. There are relatively few lifestyle-class professionals.","“Thirdly, there’s a riverside nearly 1,000 kilometers away from Diverse City. This talent market is different from the other two talent markets. The other two talent markets are mainly for hiring, but this place is completely for business. Everyone’s talent is clearly priced. They can be bought by the boss they like. The abilities of these people will be clearly marked.","“The major factions all have shares in this talent market. When the major factions capture prisoners during expeditions, they will be sent here after they’re tamed. Therefore, the people here are the most mixed. It’s far from being as safe as Diverse Talent Market.","“Of course, there are always surprises here because some important captives won’t show their true abilities. However, this rarely happens. Most of the captives on sale have hidden injuries on their roots. Because it’s difficult to heal and too many resources are needed to heal them, these captives are all waiting to be chosen.”","After introducing the three talent markets, Ah Qian did not say anything else and waited for Lin Yuan and Chu Ci to make a decision.","She and Ah Qian received Lin Yuan together, but Ah Qian had been doing all the talking. Not only did Ah Tao not show any dissatisfaction, but she also heaved a sigh of relief.","“Ah Tao was very clear about her position. She just had to follow Ah Qian and strive to complete this mission well. With Wan Ying’s help, she could obtain a good rating.","Chu Ci did not make the decision herself. Instead, she turned to look at Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan thought, really found the right person from Fortune Treasure Palace to arrange for a guide. Among the three talent markets, the talent market located by the riverbank is more in line with my needs.","Compared to hiring these talents who lived in Diverse City, it was better to choose those capable captives to bring back to North of the Lonely River.","“Ah Qian, take us to the third talent market you mentioned. Since Fortune Treasure Palace also has some shares in this talent market, I think you can make some arrangements. Take us to choose 3,000 Spirit Craftsmen first. These Spirit Craftsmen have to be at least Class 3.”","Lin Yuan directly stated his request.","The rating of a Spirit Craftsman in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was very different from the rating of a Spirit Craftsman in the main world. The beginner Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen in the main world could only be considered pinnacle Class 2 in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Only advanced Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen could be considered beginner Class 3.","For example, Hu Quan could already be defined as a Class 6 Spirit Craftsman according to the rating of the main world. However, he was only an intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Sky City indeed had too few Spirit Craftsmen under their command. It was rather difficult for Hu Quan to command these hundred over Spirit Craftsmen to do many things.","There were many places in Sky City that needed to be built. Even if Lin Yuan found another 3,000 Spirit Craftsmen to join Sky City, these Spirit Craftsmen would not be enough.","However, it should not be difficult to find 3,000 Spirit Craftsmen above Class 3 in a talent market as big as Diverse City. If he could not even find 3,000 or more Spirit Craftsmen, Lin Yuan would be too disappointed!","Ah Qian and Ah Tao were surprised when they heard Lin Yuan’s request.","Although Spirit Craftsmen were lifestyle professions, Spirit Craftsmen above Class 3 were not cheap at all.","According to the spirit qi crystals that Lin Yuan had traded yesterday, the price of each Class 3 Spirit Craftsman differed among beginner Class 3 to pinnacle Class 3, ranging from 1,000 to 30,000 spirit qi crystals. Nurturing a Spirit Craftsman also required a lot of resources. 3000 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen would at least sell for three million spirit qi crystals.","Ah Qian and Ah Tao felt that Lin Yuan would not only choose beginner Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen.","This huge expenditure shocked receptionists like Ah Qian and Ah Tao, who were used to seeing the world in Fortune Treasure Palace.","“Young Master Lin, you will definitely be able to find 3,000 Class 3 and above Spirit Craftsmen in this talent market. In the past, even a severely injured Class 5 Spirit Craftsman had appeared. It’s just that many of these captives are not tamed well. If you buy them, they might not be able to work for you wholeheartedly.","“You still need to subdue these Spirit Craftsmen yourself in the future. Some of these Spirit Craftsmen come from factions that have already been destroyed and they still feel some loyalty to those factions. It will be very difficult to tame them.”","After Ah Qian’s reminder to Lin Yuan, she did not say anything else.","The Fortune Treasure Palace indeed had shares, but there were very few shares.","All she could do was to give all the resources to Lin Yuan and let him choose. The other situations were not something she could determine or bear.","Ah Qian’s words were both a reminder and a disclaimer.","“I only want to see if these Spirit Craftsmen can meet my requirements. I’ll take responsibility for subduing these Spirit Craftsmen.”","Lin Yuan still had to hire Gourmets, Weavers, and other talents, but the Spirit Craftsmen were the most important among them.","At first, Lin Yuan thought that this talent market was built so far away from Diverse City by the banks of the river because it was very chaotic.","Now, it seemed like that was not the case.","This talent market occupied an extremely wide area and had a beautiful environment. The furnishings inside were not inferior to the furnishings outside Fortune Treasure Palace.","Presumably, this talent market was most likely not tolerated by the City Lord of Diverse City.","Because many large factions in Diverse City had shares in this talent market, the City Lord could not target this talent market too much.","While communicating with Ah Qian and Ah Tao, Lin Yuan had already gained a certain level of understanding of Diverse City.","More than 50% of the profits of the City Lord’s residence, excluding taxes, came from the Diverse Talent Market. This talent market by the riverside largely affected the profits of the Diverse Talent Market.","This talent market did not have a specific name. There were many people coming and going at the entrance, be it people transporting captives or trading talents.","However, most people were not qualified to be received by the attendants at the door.","These attendants did not know Lin Yuan, Chu Ci, and Winter. The three of them were unfamiliar faces to Diverse City.","However, these waiters knew Ah Qian and Ah Tao. Six or seven attendants quickly greeted them the moment they saw Ah Qian and Ah Tao.","“Your Excellencies Feng Qian and Ding Tao, I wonder what wind blew you two ladies here. Does anyone from Fortune Treasure Palace want to sell something here? If that’s the case, we will contact Manager Sun and properly label the item from Fortune Treasure Palace.”","Feng Qian and Ding Tao were very cautious in front of Lin Yuan.","However, Feng Qian and Ding Tao were exceptionally arrogant in front of these attendants.","“Fortune Treasure Palace doesn’t do such a thing as taming and selling captives. However, we really have to trouble Manager Sun this time to get him to bring out all the high-quality Spirit Craftsmen you have. We’re here to accompany the esteemed guest of Fortune Treasure Palace, Young Master Lin, to choose talents.","“If it weren’t for Lordess Wan Ying needing to hold down the fort at Fortune Treasure Palace, we wouldn’t be the ones bringing Young Master Lin here this time. Instead, Lordess Wan Ying would have personally brought Young Master Lin here!”","Feng Qian knew very well that her words would definitely reach Manager Sun’s ears. On one hand, Feng Qian’s words were meant for Manager Sun to value Lin Yuan. On the other hand, it was also to let Lin Yuan know how much Fortune Treasure Palace valued him.","The attendants were shocked when they heard Feng Qian’s words. What? The Fortune Treasure Palace had actually sent two receptionists for the sake of this distinguished guest in front of them! This had never happened before! Since when did the receptionists of Fortune Treasure Palace become guides to the outside world?","The man and woman with outstanding looks in front of him looked young. The old man behind him seemed to be a guard.","The three of them must come from an extraordinary faction. Such a figure must have come to Diverse City from outside.","If they were local figures in Diverse City, they should have heard of them.","A few of the attendants immediately reported the situation to Manager Sun, while the other attendants led Lin Yuan and the others in.","Not long after entering the market, Lin Yuan saw a meatball rolling toward him from afar. Looking closely, it quickly grew into a chubby figure.","This fatso was dressed like a nouveau riche. It was as though he wished he could wear rings on all ten of his fingers.","This fatso was accompanied by the few attendants who had just left. This fatso should be Manager Sun.","Sun Youcai was quite surprised when he heard the attendants’ report. He knew that an extraordinary person had arrived.","Sun Youcai had always liked to befriend such people.","Sun Youcai did not greet Feng Qian and Ding Tao first. Instead, he bowed to Lin Yuan warmly.","Regardless of whether he knew Lin Yuan or not, he immediately said, “Welcome, Young Master Lin. I heard that you’ve come here to choose talents. We will definitely bring out the best batch of people here! If you hadn’t come here, Young Master Lin, I wouldn’t have released so many talents with potential!","“Haha, these talents with potential are high-quality resources for any faction. These resources can only be used at critical moments. If not for that, Young Master Lin, it would probably be very difficult for you to obtain what you want.","“Young Master Lin, please follow me to the room and wait for a moment. I’ll get someone to bring over all the talents you need! Ordinary talents are all available for people to choose from. If you go to the exhibition area, you won’t be able to see those high-quality guys.”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows. This Manager Sun really knew how to suck up to others. Lin Yuan could sense that Manager Sun was trying to please him.","Manager Sun did not hide his thoughts. Instead, he openly expressed them.","Not only would Lin Yuan not be dissatisfied with this behavior, but he also liked Manager Sun’s directness.","“Since that’s the case, I’ll have to trouble you to arrange it! However, I think you’re wrong about one thing. Those high-end talents indeed need to be sold carefully. However, these high-end talents are expensive. Only those buyers who can afford the price can support them.”"]},{"number":3058,"title":"Chapter 3058: The Perfect Choice!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3058: The Perfect Choice!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Manager Sun, bring out all the quality people you have. As long as they are capable, price is not an issue. I will take them all without exception!”","Lin Yuan could tell that Manager Sun wanted to curry favor with him, and he was willing to accept it. However, Manager Sun’s motive for currying favor with him was actually to cooperate more with him in the future.","Lin Yuan’s words might appear a little arrogant, but in reality, he was telling Manager Sun that he had plenty of resources. If Manager Sun had high-quality talents to offer, Lin Yuan was more than capable of affording them.","On the way here, Ding Tao had briefed Lin Yuan on the regulations of this talent market. It prohibited bargaining and offered no discounts regardless of the quantity purchased. All transactions were simple and had a fixed price policy.","Therefore, it would ultimately depend on the buyer’s judgment to decide who to buy. However, generally, the prices set for all talents sold as commodities wouldn’t be too unreasonable.","When selling talents as commodities, apart from ability, looks and some external performance also became criteria for measuring their value. This led to many good-looking commodities being heavily marked up.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s rather arrogant remarks, Sun Youcai instinctively glanced toward Feng Qian and Ding Tao. If Lin Yuan had not been brought here by them, Sun Youcai would have chased him away long ago.","Sun Youcai came from a hidden faction and was not a native of Diverse City. He had collaborated with many factions in Diverse City to establish this talent market. He was even willing to negotiate with the City Lord Manor of Diverse City without hesitation, all for the sake of profit. However, many potential buyers were hesitant to purchase high-end talents due to their reluctance to pay the high prices set by Sun Youcai.","This talent market had operated for hundreds of thousands of years. Some high-end talents had died because they had not been able to sell them. Despite that, Sun Youcai was still unwilling to lower the price.","It was because Sun Youcai knew that once the precedent of lowering prices was set, it would become difficult to sell talents at high prices in the future. Moreover, his non-negotiable rules might be broken by the sale of high-end talents at a lower price.","If such a situation were to occur, not only would his reputation decline, but the customers who were previously rejected for bargaining would also feel offended.","Upon hearing Feng Qian and Ding Tao nod at him subtly to express their approval of Lin Yuan’s words, the way Sun Youcai looked at Lin Yuan changed.","Sun Youcai listened to his subordinate’s report and felt that if it weren’t for the fact that Wan Ying, the person in charge of the Fortune Treasure Palace, had other matters to attend to, she would have personally welcomed this Young Master Lin as a guide.","However, judging from Feng Qian and Ding Tao’s attitudes, the authenticity of their words was very high. What kind of person was this young man before him, that even someone like Wan Ying, responsible for overseeing the Fortune Treasure Palace within this mega city, felt compelled to please him?","Originally, Sun Youcai had many high-end talents that he had not prepared to take out, but now, Sun Youcai felt that there was a need to take out these talents. In any case, the price he set would not decrease. If the young man in front of him was unwilling to accept this price, he could just reject it. By presenting all the high-quality talents, Sun Youcai had also made his stance clear.","The VIP room of the talent market was located on the top floor. Along the way, Chu Ci restrained her original personality and frowned.","Chu Ci discovered that this talent market was, in fact, a place where various lifeforms were traded, all of them were priced here. She found it hard to accept this situation.","However, Chu Ci did not say much because she knew that this was a common occurrence in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Otherwise, it would not have been rationalized in Diverse City, a mega city. There were so many large factions that were shareholders of this place.","In the main world, geniuses would often receive preferential treatment. For example, Lin Yuan had been taken in as a disciple by the Moon Empress because of his talent. However, in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, talent was not worth mentioning at all. Regardless of how talented an individual was, without the protection of a powerful faction, these so-called geniuses would most likely end up as commodities, bought and sold like slaves.","The rampaging star pirates did not make Chu Ci feel the cruelty of the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but upon arrival here, she fully experienced the harshness and indifference of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Chu Ci could not help but clench her fists, rekindling her determination to quickly improve her strength.","Lin Yuan had seen much more than Chu Ci, and his mentality had long changed from when he was in the main world.","Among the talents sold here, a portion of them exuded an aura of despair, and there was no hope for the future and life in their eyes. Another portion was desperately trying to prove their worth, striving to prove their worth in the hopes of catching the eye of a buyer and gaining a new opportunity as a servant.","Compared to the former, the latter was undoubtedly more intelligent and more compatible with Lin Yuan’s personal will. In Lin Yuan’s opinion, as long as a person was alive, there would always be opportunities.","Sun Youcai followed Lin Yuan with a big belly and a smile on his face, “Young Master Lin, our hospitality here is definitely not comparable to Fortune Treasure Palace. After all, our functions here are different from Fortune Treasure Palace.","“If there’s anything I can’t do well, I hope you can forgive me. I wonder what kind of talent Young Master Lin wants to buy? Since you have mentioned bringing out all the good things, I won’t hold back either. Even if you want Class 5 professionals, I can get them for you!","“However, I must make it clear in advance that once you’ve paid and I’ve handed over the person to you, the transaction is considered complete. If anything happens to the person in the subsequent transaction, even if they die as soon as they’re in your hands, it will not be our responsibility.”","Sun Youcai knew that Feng Qian and Ding Tao would tell Lin Yuan about the rules here, but this was his first time doing business with Lin Yuan and it was better to make some things clear in advance.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “I need Spirit Craftsmen above Class 3. Since Mr. Sun doesn’t intend to hold back, kindly bring all the Spirit Craftsmen above Class 3 here. I’ll make my selection and buy anything that catches my eye as long as the price is reasonable.”","Lin Yuan noticed Sun Youcai’s displeased expression and guessed the reason. When conducting business, it was impossible for Sun Youcai to showcase all the goods in one go. Just like Lin Yuan had previously managed his fey store, each batch of showcased goods had both prime items and less desirable ones.","He would bring out a batch at a time, selling the prime items first, then the less desirable ones, and finally replenishing with new prime items. If all the goods were showcased at once, the prime items would be chosen and only the less desirable ones would remain for future sales. This would greatly affect the subsequent sale of the goods.","Lin Yuan ignored Sun Youcai’s displeasure and had no intention of changing his words. Instead, he added lightly, “All the talents I bought today will be compensated with Grade 4 and above Creator resources as bargaining chips. Even if Mr. Sun puts all the outstanding talents in front of me and I choose them, you won’t suffer a loss.”","Since meeting Lin Yuan, Sun Youcai had been shocked multiple times. At this moment, he once again descended into a state of shock. What? Using Grade 4 Creator resources to exchange for these talents? How generous!","Sun Youcai could foresee how terrifying the faction that could spend Grade 4 Creators’ resources casually was. He immediately put away all his dissatisfaction and bounced up and down excitedly like a big ball.","“With Young Master Lin’s words, I am reassured. I’ll go make the preparations right away. Apart from those Spirit Craftsmen, you are also free to select talents with different life professions, Young Master Lin!”","Sun Youcai mobilized his men and made arrangements. Soon, an attendant began leading in one lifeform after another, each with different appearances but all capable of assuming human or humanoid forms.","These people were all wearing black collars covered in golden patterns on their necks. The collars could be considered a kind of precious instrument, forged by Creators. It had an extremely humiliating name and was called the Captivity Ring.","When hunting star pirates, each star pirate group would usually have some captives in their hands. When these star pirates targeted other factions or species, they would sell the outstanding talents of these factions as resources.","Once the Captivity Ring was put on, as long as the wearer activated the energy in their body to a certain extent, the Captivity Ring would shrink and a blade would spin out from the inside.","The fact that these Spirit Craftsmen, with the Captivity Ring, were willing to accept the fate of being sold as commodities indicated their strong desire to survive.","Sun Youcai said warmly to Lin Yuan, “Young Master Lin, this VIP room can only accommodate 300 commodities at a time. The information of these commodities is recorded on their Captivity Ring. You can probe this information by infiltrating these Captivity Rings with your spiritual energy. The information I’ve provided here has always been very objective. You can use this information as a reference to make your choice.”","Lin Yuan turned to look at Chu Ci, who had been looking forward to coming to the talent market so much. Lin Yuan wanted Chu Ci to choose with him, but she shook her head in rejection.","Upon witnessing this, Lin Yuan knew that Chu Ci’s values had not completely changed. She had not completely adapted to the environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan did not force Chu Ci. He stood up and infused his spiritual energy into the Captivity Ring on the neck of the tall man at the front.","[Fu Dao]: An intermediate Class 3 Spirit Craftsman. He comes from the Spirit Monkey species and has no potential for evolution in his bloodline.","When Lin Yuan was investigating Fu Dao’s Captivity Ring, he could see the strong desire in Fu Dao’s eyes. Fu Dao was clearly hoping to be bought by Lin Yuan. As a Spirit Craftsman, the treatment he received when working in the faction wouldn’t be too poor.","Being a servant in another faction would definitely be better than being displayed as a commodity here, waiting indefinitely to be noticed. Fu Dao had been sold here as a commodity for more than 600 years. He was afraid that he would be forced to sink here.","Lin Yuan didn’t linger too long on Fu Dao. Instead, he quickly gathered information about more than 200 Spirit Craftsmen. Lin Yuan discovered that due to the difference in bloodline and age, the prices of Spirit Craftsmen of the same level and class varied greatly. He planned to choose the Spirit Craftsman here to add to Sky City’s construction.","Although Lin Yuan was a savior, he would not use spirit qi crystals to save everyone. Sky City did not accept mediocre talents. Only exceptionally outstanding talents had the opportunity to become part of Sky City.","Lin Yuan asked Sun Youcai, “How many Class 3 and above Spirit Craftsmen do you have here? I need to know the general number to make my choice. Otherwise, if I’m too picky and can’t even choose the number of people I want after choosing all the Spirit Craftsmen here, I’ll have to choose again. It will be a waste of my time.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Sun Youcai could not help but roll his eyes in his heart. Lin Yuan’s words clearly meant that he wanted to choose the best Spirit Craftsman. Lin Yuan’s straightforwardness made Sun Youcai somewhat uncomfortable.","Seeing that Lin Yuan was using Class 4 Creator resources to exchange for these talents, Sun Youcai called a few subordinates over to verify. After checking, Sun Youcai laughed out loud when he heard his subordinate’s report.","“I have a total of 42 groups of such quality here. There are more than 8,000 Spirit Craftsmen above Class 3. Young Master Lin, feel free to make your selection!”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan inwardly lamented that it seemed his wish to select intermediate Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen or higher was going to be dashed. More than half of these 200 individuals were intermediate Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen, while less than 30% of them were above intermediate Class 3.","Lin Yuan quickly tapped on the selection device in his hand, and the Captivity Rings lit up. Those whose Captivity Rings did not light up were taken away by the attendant.","Lin Yuan chose them to pass through the long corridor of the VIP room and send them to the martial arts hall that was connected to the VIP seats.","Every VIP room here had a special martial arts hall. In this talent market, warriors were always the best sellers.","The best way to gauge a warrior’s strength was to provide them with a spacious arena, allowing them to fully unleash their abilities.","After the first batch was selected, the second batch was quickly sent in. It only took Lin Yuan five minutes to choose the second batch of 200 Spirit Craftsmen, which surprised Feng Qian and Ding Tao.","This time was too short. Lin Yuan couldn’t possibly choose a Spirit Craftsman solely according to the information here, right? Lin Yuan had to pay a sum of spirit qi crystals for every Spirit Craftsman he chose. It would be a huge loss if he chose according to the labels here.","Initially, Sun Youcai had assumed that Lin Yuan was making random selections. As a young man from a large faction, Lin Yuan did not care about the faction’s resources and was recklessly squandering them to flaunt his status. This suited Sun Youcai’s impression of these core members of the major faction’s direct line of descent.","Sun Youcai had been this arrogant when he was young.","Since Lin Yuan had come through the Fortune Treasure Palace, these Spirit Craftsmen had to meet the standards even if it was to give face to Fortune Treasure Palace. Even if Lin Yuan chose randomly according to the labels, nothing would go wrong.","Sun Youcai understood his commodities the best. When Lin Yuan finished selecting the fifth batch of Spirit Craftsmen, he could not help but think that something was wrong. Lin Yuan’s seemingly quick and casual selections were, in fact, the most perfect choice. Sun Youcai did not believe that Lin Yuan had chosen it randomly."]},{"number":3059,"title":"Chapter 3059: Rich Harvest!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3059: Rich Harvest!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan’s choices were mostly focused on intermediate Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen and higher. As long as there were no major problems, Spirit Craftsmen above Class 3 and higher would be selected by Lin Yuan.","Among the five batches, there was a pinnacle Class 3 Spirit Craftsman whose soul possessed a type of soul worm. Once this soul worm wandered around in his soul, this Spirit Craftsman would go crazy and would require a long time to recover. Before the soul worms acted up, it was impossible to see any problems from the outside. However, Lin Yuan did not choose this particular pinnacle Class 3 Spirit Craftsman.","Those low Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen that were chosen either possessed excellent bloodlines or exhibited some exceptional qualities beyond the ordinary. It could be said that Lin Yuan had indeed chosen all the outstanding targets.","It was indeed strange. Sun Youcai even entertained the suspicion that there might be a traitor among them who had provided Lin Yuan with detailed information about the commodities in advance. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have been able to see through the situation of these Spirit Craftsmen. However, Sun Youcai quickly dismissed this thought as soon as it arose in his mind.","All the employees who had access to comprehensive information about the commodities here are individuals Sun Youcai brought from his own family. It was impossible for these people to betray him. Moreover, even if Lin Yuan obtained the complete information of the commodities, the batches of Spirit Craftsmen that were sent over were all randomized.","If he did not investigate them one by one, it would be impossible to match them. Could it be that Lin Yuan had talent in detection? It seemed to be the only reason that made sense.","If Lin Yuan had not promised to trade with Grade 4 Creator resources, Sun Youcai would have immediately called for a halt.","At that moment, Lin Yuan had already chosen the 16th batch of Spirit Craftsmen. In this batch, he encountered an early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsman for the first time. This early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsman was extremely expensive, more than ten times more expensive than a pinnacle Class 3 Spirit Craftsman.","If Lin Yuan were to use spirit qi crystals to trade, he would need hundreds of thousands of them. If not for the fact that this early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsman had a lifespan problem, he would have been sold for a higher price.","A Spirit Craftsman with the bloodline of an earth-bending Land Imp was very good at constructing the main structure of buildings, and they possessed fine skills in sculpting as well. Lin Yuan chose this earth-elemental Land Imp with a lifespan of less than 600 years without hesitation. In terms of ability, this early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsman with the earth-bending Land Imp bloodline was comparable to Hu Quan.","However, as a local Spirit Craftsman of the Sky Beyond the Clouds, his skills and forging style must be very different from Hu Quan’s. Communication between the two could allow them to grow tremendously.","Using True Data, Lin Yuan could see the lifespan of this early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsman with the earth-bending Land Imp bloodline. In fact, his Captivity Ring’s information did not mention the issue of lifespan at all.","Feng Qian and Ding Tao obviously knew this early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. Those factions that had invested in this talent market, they could rent people from Sun Youcai in large quantities. The Fortune Treasure Palace had rented this Spirit Craftsman before. Feng Qian and Ding Tao were aware that this Spirit Craftsman did not have much lifespan left.","The two of them knew very well that reminding Lin Yuan was equivalent to breaking the rules. However, when they recalled Wan Ying’s instructions, Feng Qian and Ding Tao looked at each other and Ding Tao spoke first.","“Young Master Lin, if you buy this Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, he shouldn’t be able to serve you for long. At most, it will only be a few hundred years. I’m sure you prefer to buy Spirit Craftsmen who don’t have any problems with their lifespan.”","Ding Tao’s reminder to Lin Yuan was not subtle. When Sun Youcai heard Ding Tao’s words, he looked displeased, “Ding Tao, isn’t that a little against the rules? Others might not know the rules here, but as the receptionists of Fortune Treasure Palace, you should be aware.”","Ding Tao was aware that her actions just now might have displeased Sun Youcai. However, compared to Sun Youcai’s dissatisfaction, Ding Tao was more concerned about whether Lin Yuan would think that the Fortune Treasure Palace and Sun Youcai had teamed up to deceive him. To a certain extent, reminding Lin Yuan was equivalent to expressing goodwill to him.","“Sir Sun, Young Master Lin was brought here by our Fortune Treasure Palace and he has already conducted a large transaction. Hence, we’re responsible for Young Master Lin and your reputation. Otherwise, if Young Master Lin wants to purchase talents again in the future, he won’t even consider you, Sun Youcai!”","Despite his dissatisfaction, Sun Youcai did not express it. The only possible reason for the Fortune Treasure Palace to protect Lin Yuan like this was that, in the eyes of Wan Ying, Lin Yuan held more importance than Sun Youcai himself.","Wan Ying was a sly old fox. Sun Youcai did not want Wan Ying to be dissatisfied with him in the future.","Lin Yuan thanked Ding Tao politely.","When chosen by Lin Yuan, Wang Xuan was stunned for a moment before his face lit up with excitement. Having been trapped here for more than 400 years, Wang Xuan’s lifespan was less than a thousand years when he was forced to wear the Captivity Ring.","At that time, he was not considered a high-quality commodity yet. He had only made a breakthrough in his Spirit Craftsman ability after being captured. It wasn’t until Wang Xuan broke through to become a Class 4 Spirit Craftsman that he had the opportunity to be put up for sale despite having less than six hundred years left in his lifespan.","Wang Xuan was afraid that the young man who had just selected him might lose interest upon learning that he only had a few hundred years left to live. A few hundred years of lifespan meant that there was no potential left. A laborer with such a limited lifespan wasn’t worth selling at such a high price.","When Ding Tao pointed out the problem of his lifespan, a bitter expression appeared on Wang Xuan’s face. He thought that the young man who had chosen him would now abandon him. Unexpectedly, the young man said with a calm expression.","“It’s fine. I have some means to increase lifespan here. A Class 4 Spirit Craftsman is already qualified for me to use such methods to increase his lifespan. If Manager Sun has talents with outstanding abilities who don’t have much lifespan left, you can sell them all to me. Apart from me, I don’t think anyone else would approve of the high price you set. On the other hand, I’m willing to accept everything without deliberately asking for the price to be lowered.”","Ever since encountering Lin Yuan, Sun Youcai, Ding Tao, and Feng Qian were often surprised. All of them knew very little about Lin Yuan’s situation and only knew that Lin Yuan’s faction must be extremely powerful.","Moreover, Lin Yuan was not the only prodigy nurtured by this faction. The quiet girl accompanying Lin Yuan, despite her young age, had reached such a level making her equally outstanding in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, where she was considered among the top talents.","There were basically methods to increase lifespan in the hands of every powerful person with an inheritance. However, which faction would be willing to use such a method for a servant that they had bought?","Sun Youcai said excitedly, “Sir Lin Yuan, I have a lot of such talents. If you don’t mind, I can show you all of them. It’s just that there aren’t many Spirit Craftsmen among them.”","This conversation was just a small interlude. After Lin Yuan confirmed his choice, Wang Xuan was brought away. Wang Xuan heard everything Lin Yuan just said. The fact that this young man not only chose him but also intended to increase his lifespan left Wang Xuan pleasantly surprised. Lin Yuan had invested resources in him, so he would only value him in the future.","Apart from Wang Xuan, Lin Yuan also had new gains in the selection of Spirit Craftsmen. Among these Spirit Craftsmen, there was also a high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. For some reason, this high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman’s body was incomplete and was unable to recover. The physical impairment would affect his work. Without both hands and both feet, at most, he could only use their teeth to hold a pen and sketch a design.","The high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman could tell from the wound on his arm that there was still poison in his body that had not been removed, causing the wound to still be festering. From the wound visible at the severed part of the arm of this high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, it was apparent that there were toxins remaining in his body, preventing the wound from healing and causing it to fester.","Sun Youcai explained to Lin Yuan, “Young Master Lin, his design ability is extremely strong, especially in designing large-scale buildings and mechanisms. You’ve bought so many Spirit Craftsmen, so you should understand how important design is in the use and construction of mechanisms.","With his design, even if a pinnacle Grade 3 Creator forges it, they will be able to construct mechanisms at high Grade 4 quality. I’ve experimented with that before. If not for the fact that cleaning up the poison and maintaining his roots requires spirit qi, I would have raised his price even higher.","Besides here, in other talent markets, it’s practically impossible to purchase a Spirit Craftsman of this level. Even if you plan on hiring one, you will have to make an appointment in advance.”","When Lin Yuan used Morbius’ Omniscient Eyes to examine this high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, Lin Yuan confirmed that he had the ability to heal him. Not only that, but he could also use the Jasmine Lily, which had already reached the Holy Spirit level, to regrow the limbs of this high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman after removing the effects of the poison.","This was something that others might find difficult to accomplish, but Lin Yuan only needed to pay a small price to do it. With this high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, many things that Hu Quan could not resolve with his own abilities in Sky City could be easily resolved.","Lin Yuan ignored Sun Youcai’s sales pitch and walked over to the high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, “You’re called Zhu Shoudan right? In the future, if you work diligently under me, I will give you a chance to stand up again despite your severed limbs. Are you willing?”","Zhu Shoudan was Lin Yuan’s most powerful Spirit Craftsman. Apart from Hu Quan, Lin Yuan placed the most importance on the Zhu Shoudan. This was also the reason why Lin Yuan was willing to spend time communicating with Zhu Shoudan.","When Sun Youcai mentioned Zhu Shoudan’s injuries, his expression turned gloomy. It was obvious that Zhu Shoudan was very concerned about his injuries.","Lin Yuan had bought Zhu Shoudan and did not want him to lead a muddle-headed life under his command. Therefore, Lin Yuan made a promise to Zhu Shoudan. Certainly, Lin Yuan would also request a promise from Zhu Shoudan in return for the promise he made.","Zhu Shoudan was not very happy. To him, leaving this place meant simply exchanging one location of discrimination for another. The fact that a high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman could only draw designs was truly a mockery! If it weren’t for being betrayed and having his species wiped out, losing two legs and an arm, with his talent, he would probably have already become a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman by now.","When Zhu Shoudan was first captured and brought here, he had used his talent and ability to fight for Sun Youcai. He wanted to see if Sun Youcai could help him get rid of the remaining poison in his body and help him regenerate his broken limbs after removing the remaining poison in his body. It was not that there were no methods to regrow limbs in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but the price to regrow limbs was often very high.","If Zhu Shoudan was a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman, Sun Youcai would be willing to invest in it. However, he was only a disabled high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. Sun Youcai had no way to verify Zhu Shoudan’s potential. As a businessman, Sun Youcai would never engage in a deal that would incur losses. Hence, Sun Youcai directly rejected Zhu Shoudan and did not give him any preferential treatment. Instead, he treated him as an inferior product that was extremely difficult to sell.","From Sun Youcai’s perspective, lowering the price of selling talent was simply not an option. Without lowering the price, Zhu Shoudan knew just how difficult it was for him to be sold off. Those buyers would basically give up on buying Zhu Shoudan just by looking at his appearance.","Zhu Shoudan sensed Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Sun Youcai and knew that Lin Yuan was definitely a big shot from a large faction. There was no need for such a big shot to lie to him. This place was called the talent market in the outside world, but in fact, they could not be considered talents here at all. He was just a servant that was sold at will!","When Zhu Shoudan saw that Sun Youcai had rejected him and even told him about his market price in disdain, he was already in despair. However now, he could see hope. If he could grow back his limbs, he would still have a chance to become a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman.","“Master, even if you don’t give me a chance to regrow my limbs, I will do my best for you. Moreover, you have given me this opportunity, and I am determined not to let you down. In the future, I will definitely strive to create value for both you and the faction I am loyal to!”","Zhu Shoudan knew that this was a rare opportunity for him. If he did not seize this opportunity quickly, the young man in front of him might immediately change his mind. Zhu Shoudan had an extremely high EQ and had always been good with words.","Upon hearing Zhu Shoudan’s words, Lin Yuan was in a very good mood. He turned around and said to Sun Youcai, “Mr. Sun, I’ve already chosen all the Spirit Craftsmen. I wonder if I should pay the price of these Spirit Craftsmen first or continue choosing Gourmets and Weavers?”","Sun Youcai did not expect Lin Yuan to need Gourmets and Weavers. He had been counting, and Lin Yuan had chosen more than 3,600 Spirit Craftsmen.","If he wanted to trade for all these Spirit Craftsmen, he would need to pay an extremely huge amount of resources. Sun Youcai felt that even the Fortune Treasure Palace would find it a little difficult to fork out so many resources at once.","Under such circumstances, the Fortune Treasure Palace would no longer be able to vouch for Lin Yuan."]},{"number":3060,"title":"Chapter 3060: 100,000,000 Spirit Qi Crystals!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3060: 100,000,000 Spirit Qi Crystals!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Sun Youcai said seriously, “Your Excellency Lin Yuan, you have chosen more than 3,000 Spirit Craftsmen from me. If this deal is successful, you will be my biggest customer. From now on, I’ll make an exception and give you a 10% discount on all talents. I’ve never given such a discount to any faction before!”","Feng Qian and Ding Tao, who were well aware of Sun Youcai’s personality, were extremely surprised by his words. Sun Youcai was actually willing to give up the profits. It was like seeing the moon in broad daylight! Sun Youcai was not lying.","Lin Yuan was indeed the first person to receive such treatment. Of course, the prerequisite for Lin Yuan to receive this treatment was that this transaction could proceed smoothly.","Sun Youcai seemed to be genuinely interested in forging a serious relationship with Lin Yuan. For Diverse City, Lin Yuan appeared exceptionally mysterious, but in truth, Sun Youcai was equally mysterious. It was said that Sun Youcai came from a hidden faction and his approach to befriending Lin Yuan differed from his usual method of connecting with clients.","Sun Youcai had not taken the initiative to give discounts to Lin Yuan because he wanted to maintain a customer relationship. Instead, it was an attempt to befriend Lin Yuan with his identity as a member of a hidden faction.","Lin Yuan sensed Sun Youcai’s thoughts and said with a smile, “In that case, I’ll thank Mr. Sun in advance. The price of these 3,000 plus Spirit Craftsmen has already been marked in advance, so it shouldn’t be difficult to calculate. Since we’re prioritizing the transaction before selection, let’s complete the delivery as soon as possible.”","When Lin Yuan mentioned the payment, he was very straightforward and dispelled the last trace of doubt in Sun Youcai’s heart. It also strengthened Sun Youcai’s desire to befriend Lin Yuan.","“Young Master Lin, since you’re so straightforward, I also feel that we hit it off very well. Therefore, I’ll also give you a 10% discount on this batch of Spirit Craftsmen. Master Lin, don’t let the modesty of my discount fool you.","“When you consider it carefully, it amounts to a significant sum. Essentially, it’s like I’m gifting you over 70 Spiritual Craftsmen. These over 70 Spirit Craftsmen are almost equivalent to the value of treasure that has been passed down for generations!”","Sun Youcai’s heart ached as he made the decision to offer Lin Yuan a discount. However, if he could befriend Lin Yuan, it would be a price he was willing to pay.","Giving away over 70 Spirit Craftsmen all at once was too much even for Sun Youcai to endure.","Upon seeing Sun Youcai’s pained expression, Lin Yuan felt amused, “Brother Sun, since you’re being so generous, I feel I should make some gesture in return. Let’s forgo the discount for these Spirit Craftsmen, shall we? We can apply discounts to the talents I trade with later.","“Brother Sun, as long as you bring out those hidden treasures for me to trade when the time comes, I’ll be satisfied.”","Lin Yuan’s address of Sun Youcai changed from ‘Mr. Sun’ to ‘Brother Sun’ which showed his attitude and willingness to befriend Sun Youcai.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Sun Youcai smiled so much that his eyes narrowed. He waved his hand enthusiastically, “Brother Lin, since I’ve offered this discount, rest assured I can afford it. You must be new to Diverse City, right? If there’s anywhere you want to go, I can be your guide. I guarantee that I’ll be more professional than the receptionists of Fortune Treasure Palace.”","Upon hearing Sun Youcai’s words, Feng Qian and Ding Tao’s expressions changed. What did Sun Youcai mean by this? Why was he fighting with Fortune Treasure Palace for no reason?","Fortune Treasure Palace was now Lin Yuan’s guide. Even if Sun Youcai wanted to befriend Lin Yuan, he wouldn’t go so far as to snatch Fortune Treasure Palace’s connections, right? Moreover, it was Fortune Treasure Palace that had recommended Lin Yuan to come here to purchase talents.","Sun Youcai had completed such a large transaction largely because of Fortune Treasure Palace. Sun Youcai’s lack of gratitude was one thing, but to behave in such a shameless manner was truly beyond acceptable. Feng Qian and Ding Tao were furious about this matter and they would definitely report it to Wan Ying.","Just as the hot-tempered Ding Tao was about to speak up, Feng Qian grabbed her by the sleeve. Feng Qian shook her head at Ding Tao. It was true that Sun Youcai had done something immoral and even though their statuses were not on par with his, they could still confront him for the sake of Fortune Treasure Palace.","In matters of interest, they were not just receptionists for Fortune Treasure Palace and they could represent the interests of Fortune Treasure Palace itself. However, if conflict were to occur, it would definitely impact Lin Yuan’s shopping experience regardless of how Sun Youcai reacted.","Lin Yuan had yet to finish his shopping at Sun Youcai’s place. Their top priority was to serve Lin Yuan well. Everything else was not as important as serving Lin Yuan well. If the conflict between Ding Tao and Sun Youcai displeased Lin Yuan and made him dissatisfied with Fortune Treasure Palace, he and Ding Tao would still be punished regardless of their motives, even if it was to protect Fortune Treasure Palace’s interests.","For Lin Yuan, Sun Youcai’s invitation had no drawbacks whatsoever. In Diverse City, Sun Youcai’s reputation was much higher than Fortune Treasure Palace’s manager, Wan Ying.","Lin Yuan addressed Sun Youcai as Brother Sun, which meant that he was willing to accept Sun Youcai’s goodwill.","Feng Qian had always been very tactful, and this was where Feng Qian was stronger than Ding Tao.","Sun Youcai’s invitation had two intentions. Firstly, he genuinely wants to invite Lin Yuan to strengthen their relationship. If he relied on this transaction alone, he and Lin Yuan could only work together and not become friends. Sun Youcai was aware that he was poaching from Fortune Treasure Palace. If Wan Ying heard about this, she would definitely settle scores with him.","Sun Youcai was not afraid of Wan Ying. He and Fortune Treasure Palace’s interests were tied together. No matter how dissatisfied Wan Ying was, they would have to cooperate. Otherwise, Fortune Treasure Palace would suffer more losses than him.","Right now, there were many factions in Diverse City that wanted to join them, and the Traveling Dragon Palace even proposed to invest more in exchange for shares. It was just that the Traveling Dragon Palace had been expanding too much recently and did not have the ability to invest. Sun Youcai did not want to be trapped in the Traveling Dragon Palace, as the relationship may become too close for comfort.","The Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Traveling Dragon Palace had reached a point where they would not rest until one of them died. The local tyrant of Extreme Wood City, Gray Smoke Stronghold, had seized the opportunity and firmly latched onto the Traveling Dragon Palace and was determined to drive them out of Extreme Wood City.","While the overall strength of Traveling Dragon Palace was indeed stronger than Gray Smoke Stronghold, the latter’s influence ran deep within Extreme Wood City and was not something Traveling Dragon Palace, an outsider who barged in, could deal with.","If Traveling Dragon Palace did not insist on taking such a big step, Sun Youcai would have been very willing to get closer to them.","Lin Yuan did not reject Sun Youcai’s good intentions. From Lin Yuan’s point of view, he only needed to choose for his own benefit. Fortune Treasure Palace was only a faction that served him. If Fortune Treasure Palace really had the intention to control him, Lin Yuan would strip away his relationship with it without hesitation.","“Brother Sun, I’ll have to trouble you in the future. I have to disturb you.”","While Sun Youcai and Lin Yuan were conversing, Sun Youcai’s subordinates had already calculated the price.","Lin Yuan gave Sun Youcai the spirit qi crystals beforehand and instructed him to convert the prices into spiritual energy crystals. The exchange ratio between Honor Absent dollars and Class 4 Creator resources was very transparent. There was no possibility of tampering with it in secret. Looking at the price calculated by his subordinate, Sun Youcai’s expression changed.","Sun Youcai first asked his subordinate. “Have you applied the 10% discount?”","The man, who was as round as Sun Youcai, hurriedly replied, “Master, I’ve already completed the discount and even calculated the price on both sides. If there’s a problem, I can take responsibility!”","Upon hearing this, Sun Youcai turned to Lin Yuan and said, “Brother Lin, according to the spirit qi crystals you just took out, you need 27,634,372. If you think it’s too much, I can help you arrange an installment payment. Moreover, I won’t charge you any interest during the installment period.","“However, you won’t be able to take all these Spirit Craftsmen away at once. You have to take these Spirit Craftsmen away in batches according to the installments. Dozens of factions in Diverse City have invested in this place. Otherwise, I won’t be able to explain myself. I hope you understand.”","Based on Sun Youcai’s understanding of Grade 4 Creators, obtaining these spirit qi crystals required 300 Grade 4 Creators to work for decades. It was difficult for a Grade 4 Creator to produce these resources even over a lifetime. Sun Youcai was afraid that Lin Yuan would feel pressured if he took out such a large number of spirit qi crystals.","Previously, Sun Youcai had never offered installment plans when dealing with any faction or individual. This was the second time Sun Youcai had given Lin Yuan preferential treatment.","Lin Yuan smiled and shook his head, “Brother Sun, I prefer to settle transactions in one go rather than opt for installment plans. Over 20,000,000 qi crystals is not a significant sum for me. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have used these spirit qi crystals to trade for Spirit Craftsmen. However, it will be a little troublesome to count these spirit qi crystals.”","Lin Yuan took out his spatial equipment and handed it to Sun Youcai, “Brother Sun, I have 100,000,000 spiritual qi crystals of the same standard as before here. Get your subordinates to count the spiritual qi crystals that need to be paid from inside and return this spatial equipment to me.","“Apart from Spirit Craftsmen, I’m also interested in Gourmet and Weavers. However, I don’t need that many of them, hence I’ll be extremely picky about their abilities. Brother Sun, I hope that the Gourmets and Weavers you provide for me are above Class 4. If not, I’ll have and choose from the Gourmets and Weavers who are at the pinnacle of Class 3.”","When Sun Youcai received the spatial equipment from Lin Yuan, he felt that his hands were heavy. The moment Sun Youcai received the space equipment, he immediately probed it with his spiritual power and indeed found stacks of spirit qi crystals piled up like mountains. These spirit qi crystals in the space equipment hadn’t even been sorted much.","Sun Youcai looked at the exquisite spatial equipment in his hand as if he was holding the lives of the five Grade 4 Creators in his hands. Originally, Sun Youcai had already held Lin Yuan in high regard, but now, Lin Yuan’s status in his mind has undoubtedly risen even further.","Sun Youcai’s hidden faction would never allow the younger generation to wander around with so many spirit qi crystals. However, Lin Yuan was indifferent to these spirit qi crystals and did not take them seriously. Lin Yuan’s nonchalant attitude could not be faked. If it was, Lin Yuan would most likely not dare to give this spatial equipment containing 100,000,000 spirit qi crystals to him.","Sun Youcai handed this spatial equipment to his subordinates. His subordinates had the same bloodline as him and were his trusted right-hand men. There shouldn’t be any issues with having these subordinates count the spirit qi crystals.","Even though Feng Qian and Ding Tao had witnessed Lin Yuan exchanging spirit qi crystals for spiritual ingredients in Fortune Treasure Palace, they were still extremely shocked by Lin Yuan’s actions.","From last night until now, Lin Yuan had spent more than 40.000,000 spirit qi crystals. After spending 40,000,000 spirit qi crystals, Lin Yuan did not stop spending. Instead, he excitedly prepared to spend more.","At that moment, Feng Qian and Ding Tao understood why even Ling Muzhuo, one of the three Palace Masters, treated Lin Yuan with such an attitude.","If Sun Youcai had only wanted to befriend Lin Yuan previously, he now wanted to latch onto Lin Yuan’s coattails. Now, he would not hide the talents in his hands at all.","After a brief inquiry, Sun Youcai addressed Lin Yuan directly, “Brother Lin, I only have three Gourmets above Class 4 and six Weavers above Class 4. However, there are significant problems with one of the Gourmet and three of the Weavers. If it were anyone else, I definitely wouldn’t say anything.","“However, I wouldn’t dare to hide anything from you. The Gourmet and the three Weavers came from the same faction. The young master of this faction blinded a young girl when he was traveling. This girl’s faction took revenge after the incident and blinded everyone in that faction. Therefore, the Gourmet and the three Weavers had lost their sight, which greatly affected the four of them. The other two Gourmets and Weavers’ roots were more or less injured. I didn’t spend any resources to heal them.","“Haha, I’m a businessman. I won’t engage in anything without cost-effectiveness. What if I cure them, but then they can’t be sold? Won’t I be in trouble? How about this? I’ll bring you the two Gourmets and three Weavers who aren’t blind. I really don’t recommend you buy the other four!”","Feng Qian and Ding Tao were surprised by Sun Youcai’s attitude toward Lin Yuan. Sun Youcai had never advised others not to buy talents from him. No matter how big the problem was with his subordinates, Sun Youcai would always brag.","Lin Yuan had the Jasmine Lily, whose recovery ability was not just regrowing severed limbs. Instead, it could activate the genetic model to repair the missing parts of the body. Even if the Gourmets and Weavers were blinded by some special means, Lin Yuan was confident that their injuries could be healed.","Three Class 4 Gourmets and six Class 4 Weavers were enough to serve the core members of Sky City.","“Brother Sun, regardless of whether I will choose them or not, bring all nine of them up here so I can take a look!”"]},{"number":3061,"title":"Chapter 3061: Traveling Dragon Palace’s Chance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3061: Traveling Dragon Palace’s Chance!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Although the Jasmine Lily’s abilities were astonishing, Lin Yuan was not sure if he could use the blind Gourmet and the three Weavers without checking them for himself.","Sun Youcai had already reminded Lin Yuan, so when Lin Yuan said so, Sun Youcai naturally did not refuse.","While Lin Yuan was selecting these Weaver and Gourmets, Sun Yin, who was also in Diverse City, had already come into contact with Traveling Dragon Palace.","Traveling Dragon Palace’s current predicament was extremely obvious. All the members were striving to the utmost to overcome the challenge and working hard for the expansion and development of Traveling Dragon Palace’s factions.","Traveling Dragon Palace only had one backbone, and it was controlled by the Burning Sea Soaring Dragons. This caused Traveling Dragon Palace’s internal affairs to remain undisturbed despite such a huge incident.","If Sun Yin was still a Grade 4 Creator, Traveling Dragon Palace’s attitude toward him in times of trouble would not be as warm as it was now. However, Sun Yin was a Grade 5 Creator, an existence that was enough to be the pillar of a top faction.","If Sun Yin was willing to help Traveling Dragon Palace, there was a chance that the faction would be able to break through the current predicament.","Traveling Dragon Palace’s Great Palace Master was not in Diverse City; he presided over Extreme Wood City.","The Great Palace Master of Traveling Dragon Palace, accompanied by 16 attendants, remained in Extreme Wood City and did not dare to leave. He was afraid that powerful individuals from Gray Smoke Stronghold might attack Traveling Dragon Palace’s branch in Extreme Wood City as soon as they left. The two sides had already clashed a few times with their martial forces, and they no longer cared about their dignity.","After Sun Yin revealed his identity as a Grade 5 Creator, You Di, the Second Palace Master of Traveling Dragon Palace, personally received Sun Yin. It was obvious how much You Di valued Sun Yin.","Sun Yin did not accept You Di’s invitation. Instead, he lowered himself and raised Lin Yuan’s status. “I’m sorry, but I’m accompanying my Young Master to Diverse City. I already have a faction that I’m loyal to, hence I can’t join Traveling Dragon Palace.","“Moreover, Mr. You Di, there are many situations that I don’t have the authority to decide. I need my Young Master to make the decision.”","A Grade 5 Creator came to Diverse City, and this Grade 5 Creator made contact with Traveling Dragon Palace through the Dragon Plum Family. As one of the Palace Masters, You Di naturally harbored many thoughts in his mind. However, You Di did not expect this Grade 5 Creator to have joined another faction as a servant.","If Sun Yin was willing to join Traveling Dragon Palace, let alone a guardian, he could even become a Palace Master there. It was rare for a Grade 5 Creator to be willing to join a faction and submit to the people of that faction.","However, such a situation could prove one thing—the faction that made this Class 5 Creator willingly submit must be extremely powerful. Most likely, this faction was stronger than Traveling Dragon Palace. As for whether it was stronger than Gray Smoke Stronghold in Extreme Wood City, You Di was not sure.","Traveling Dragon Palace’s rush to expand its influence in Extreme Wood City had been a mistake. Extreme Wood City’s veteran faction, Gray Smoke Stronghold, was stronger than Traveling Dragon Palace had imagined.","Furthermore, they were extremely low-key. It was not until Traveling Dragon Palace and Gray Smoke Stronghold had a conflict that they found out that there was a Grade 5 Creator presiding over Gray Smoke Stronghold.","However, Traveling Dragon Palace was stuck there, with resources already invested in Extreme Wood City that could not be taken back.","Initially, Gray Smoke Stronghold refrained from taking action against Traveling Dragon Palace, allowing them to expand their influence without restraint. The purpose was to absorb the resources invested by Traveling Dragon Palace after driving them away.","At present, Traveling Dragon Palace could barely hold on, and if this dragged on, they would definitely lose.","Since inviting Sun Yin to join Traveling Dragon Palace as a guardian was not feasible, You Di immediately changed his direction. “Sir Sun Yin, may I know why your Young Master is heading to Diverse City?","“Although the current situation of my Traveling Dragon Palace is unfavorable and the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall has been casting covetous glances at us, all factions in Diverse City are aware that the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall is merely a subordinate of Traveling Dragon Palace. If your Young Master has something to do in Diverse City, I think our Traveling Dragon Palace can handle them on his behalf.”","You Di had always been straightforward in nature. He did not know Sun Yin before and there was no emotional connection between them. There was naturally no need to engage in that kind of emotional bonding. If he tried to befriend Sun Yin, it would seem too fake. If he wanted to befriend Sun Yin and the Young Master that Sun Yin mentioned, it would be better to express it directly.","Sun Yin must have his own motives for taking the initiative to contact Traveling Dragon Palace through the Dragon Plum Family.","Sun Yin did not immediately respond to You Di. Instead, he said with a faint smile, “The Bizarre Plant Demon Hall is indeed not Traveling Dragon Palace’s match. Traveling Dragon Palace has already proven this in its confrontations with the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","“However, according to what I know, the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Gray Smoke Stronghold have been secretly communicating and have become allies. I think it won’t be long before the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall attacks Traveling Dragon Palace. If I were the leader of the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, I would definitely set the time at the upcoming trade fair in Traveling Dragon Palace.","Sun Yin had been communicating with Lin Yuan and obtained some information from him. This information came from Fortune Treasure Palace, they were all confidential information. Sun Yin couldn’t obtain this information from the Dragon Plum Family. Sun Yin did not expect the situation in Diverse City to be so complicated and the seemingly calm city to be filled with undercurrents.","Sun Yin had thought that Lin Yuan would be displeased that he had recommended him to such a place, but he did not expect Lin Yuan to have the intention to participate in this dispute.","This was the main reason Sun Yin came to see You Di. Otherwise, if Sun Yin wanted to participate in Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair, there was no need for him to meet You Di at all. As long as he revealed his identity, Traveling Dragon Palace would take the initiative to invite him.","While the members of the Dragon Plum Family were unaware of the information Sun Yin mentioned, You Di was well aware of it.","You Di looked at Sun Yin and guessed Sun Yin’s intentions. In the end, You Di, who could not tell anything from Sun Yin’s face, said frankly, “That’s right, the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall has indeed contacted Gray Smoke Stronghold in Extreme Wood City. The two sides might have reached a certain cooperation to target our Traveling Dragon Palace. May I know what advice Sir Sun Yin has for me? If you are willing to help our Traveling Dragon Palace get through this crisis, we will be extremely grateful. I hope that you can inform your Young Master of our request. Once Traveling Dragon Palace survives this crisis, we’ll find a way to repay you, no matter what!”","While You Di was speaking these words, he adopted a very humble attitude, indicating his sincere desire to seek help. It would be foolish to adopt an arrogant attitude in front of a Grade 5 Creator as it served no purpose whatsoever. It was best to set aside his pride. Even if he did not get the help he wanted, establishing a good relationship with Sun Yin would still be advantageous.","The worst outcome for Traveling Dragon Palace would be to give up all investments in Extreme Wood City and return to Diverse City. It was equivalent to wasting tens of thousands of years of development.","However, even if Traveling Dragon Palace was at its lowest, it wouldn’t be defeated by the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall in Diverse City. The Bizarre Plant Demon Hall did not have the qualifications to defeat Traveling Dragon Palace. If Traveling Dragon Palace was really so easy to defeat, they would not have suppressed the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall until they almost disappeared from Diverse City in the first place.","Sun Yin had expected You Di to engage in some negotiation, but he was surprised by You Di’s straightforwardness.","Sun Yin said seriously, “It won’t be difficult for my Young Master to help your Traveling Dragon Palace in overcoming this crisis. If he decides to lend a hand, not only can he ensure your Traveling Dragon Palace’s survival and flourishing in Diverse City and Extreme Wood City, but he can also eliminate Gray Smoke Stronghold as an obstacle to your Traveling Dragon Palace.","“However, my Young Master has never been one to engage in unprofitable deals. If he were to help your Traveling Dragon Palace to such an extent, what could you offer in return for my Young Master?”","At this point, Sun Yin coughed twice and continued. “Don’t assume that my Young Master is doing this to target Traveling Dragon Palace. With his capabilities, there’s no need for him to engage in such speculative endeavors. This kind of opportunity isn’t easily obtained. Those struggling factions would be eager for such a chance, yet no one comes to their aid. Now that your Traveling Dragon Palace finally has this opportunity, it is best to seize it!”","With that, Sun Yin did not choose to stay any longer. He left You Di a contact number and prepared to leave. He would wait until You Di had established his bottom line and contact him. Then, he would inform Lin Yuan about You Di’s bottom line and let Lin Yuan make the decision. You Di was a smart person. At this moment, he already understood Sun Yin’s intentions and goals.","You Di believed that the faction behind Sun Yin was extremely powerful, powerful enough to help Traveling Dragon Palace resolve their predicament.","However, the goal of this faction was already extremely obvious. This faction did not seek any benefits from Traveling Dragon Palace. Their sole interest lay in acquiring Traveling Dragon Palace itself. You Di could not make a decision on such a big matter.","You Di solemnly received the communication fey that Sun Yin had given him and spoke respectfully. “Sir Sun Yin, I will contact you before tonight. Regardless of the outcome, our Traveling Dragon Palace hopes to form a deep friendship with you!”","Sun Yin smiled and shook his head. “If your Traveling Dragon Palace is willing to accept my Young Master’s help, we will become a family from now on. If you reject my Young Master’s offer, he won’t say much more.","“Nonetheless, there will be no further communication between us and Traveling Dragon Palace. Even without Traveling Dragon Palace, my Young Master would not mind nurturing another faction in Diverse City. How can a faction with a Grade 6 Creator lack the help of a faction?!”","Sun Yin could see the conflict in You Di’s heart. Before he left, Sun Yin added fuel to the fire and revealed two extremely useful pieces of information. One was that even if Traveling Dragon Palace did not agree, they would support a new faction in Diverse City. When the time came, this new faction supported by Diverse City might form a competitive relationship with Traveling Dragon Palace.","The other was that they had a Grade 6 Creator. It was impossible for Traveling Dragon Palace not to know what benefits they could obtain by relying on a Grade 6 Creator. If Traveling Dragon Palace wasn’t foolish, they would know how to make the right choice.","Especially given Traveling Dragon Palace’s current predicament. With no one to lend support, their plan to expand into Extreme Wood City has failed. Eventually, they might only become a second-rate faction within Diverse City. At that time, perhaps the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would not be able to suppress Traveling Dragon Palace, but the other factions in Diverse City would.","Sun Yin’s words made You Di’s expression change drastically, especially when he heard the words ‘Grade 6 Creator’. You Di knew very well what a Grade 6 Creator signified. In the entire East Universe, there were only a few Grade 6 Creators after all. No matter which one it was, they were all existences that ruled over a region and suppressed all species.","You Di didn’t believe that Sun Yin would lie about such matters. If Traveling Dragon Palace truly wished to submit to the power behind Sun Yin, any falsehoods Sun Yin uttered would eventually be exposed. After joining the faction, they would immediately be able to sense if this faction had the foundation of a Grade 6 Creator.","After Sun Yin left, You Di couldn’t calm down for a long time. Once he regained his composure, he immediately contacted his elder brother.","You Tao had just finished a meeting that left him both infuriated and powerless. During this meeting, You Tao and the eleven guests from Traveling Dragon Palace discussed the current situation, forcing him to acknowledge the failure of his decisions.","Knowing he was destined to fail, You Tao no longer wanted to struggle. He aimed to maintain dignity, ensuring that Traveling Dragon Palace wouldn’t be disgraced like a homeless dog upon their return to Diverse City. There were no other benefits; as the faction’s leader, You Tao found it difficult to make such decisions directly.","You Tao regretted taking such a big step back then. If he had listened to You Di’s advice and avoided such a bold move, Traveling Dragon Palace would have been much more prestigious in Diverse City now. Even the officials at City Lord Manor would probably have retreated in fear.","Just as You Tao was in a difficult situation and about to take full responsibility, he received a message from You Di.","You Tao’s previous style was almost completely opposite to You Di’s. Back then, You Tao was very dissatisfied with You Di’s conservative approach, but now, he felt that You Di might actually be more suitable to lead Traveling Dragon Palace. Could something have happened in Diverse City for You Di to contact him now?","You Tao had just connected when he heard You Di’s trembling voice. “Brother, I might have found a way to get Traveling Dragon Palace out of this predicament and defeat Gray Smoke Stronghold. However, if we use this method, Traveling Dragon Palace will have to pay the price of freedom. Do you think we should seize this opportunity?”"]},{"number":3062,"title":"Chapter 3062 Decision and Cleanup!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3062 Decision and Cleanup!","Before You Di contacted You Tao, he had thought about it seriously. You Di believed that asking Traveling Dragon Palace to give up their freedom to join this faction was not a bad thing. On the contrary, it was an opportunity. This was because there was a Grade 6 Creator in this faction. Even if Traveling Dragon Palace was not in a predicament, they could still consider making such a choice just to obtain the protection of this Grade 6 Creator.","....","No matter how he looked at it, this matter was a win-win situation. Hence, he took the initiative to contact You Tao. Otherwise, as the second-in-command, You Di would not have easily decided to let Traveling Dragon Palace join another faction.","Upon hearing this, You Tao frowned. After a while, he asked You Di in an unfriendly tone, “Is this faction a local faction of Diverse City?”","You Tao’s first reaction was that Diverse City’s local factions intended to leverage Traveling Dragon Palace’s current predicament to threaten them. There were factions in Diverse City that were comparable to or even stronger than Traveling Dragon Palace.","However, Traveling Dragon Palace couldn’t possibly resort to joining them just to survive this crisis. Doing so would immediately make them a laughing stock in Diverse City. Could it be that the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen, had taken the initiative to contact You Di?","The City Lord Manor of Diverse City was the undisputed strongest faction in Diverse City. Apart from being the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen was also born into a powerful species and had many connections.","Zhao Chen had interacted with You Tao a few times before. During Traveling Dragon Palace’s heyday, Zhao Chen had attempted to recruit You Tao and proposed a joint development under the leadership of the City Lord Manor. At that time, Traveling Dragon Palace was in the limelight, so You Tao rejected Zhao Chen without hesitation.","You Di knew You Tao very well and understood that You Tao had asked such a question because he didn’t agree with his idea. You Tao most likely felt that some faction in Diverse City wanted to take advantage of this opportunity to exploit Traveling Dragon Palace.","You Di said without holding back, “Brother, a Grade 5 Creator came to me through a small faction called the Dragon Plum Family. At first, this person didn’t express anything. It was when I attempted to recruit this Grade 5 Creator to join Traveling Dragon Palace that they directly mentioned our predicament. He then asked if Traveling Dragon Palace needed protection and claimed that the faction behind him could help us survive this crisis.","“I haven’t agreed to it. I came to you immediately to discuss it. You just asked if this faction is a local faction of Diverse City. I can confirm that it’s not because Diverse City can’t handle such a huge fish!”","When You Tao heard that a Grade 5 Creator had found You Di, his expression softened. This meant that You Di was not taking desperate measures out of desperation.","“Second Brother, it’s not impossible for the factions in Diverse City to hide a Grade 5 Creator. Why would you say that Diverse City can’t accommodate this faction? Could it be that this Grade 5 Creator has shown exceptional qualities?”","Upon hearing this, You Di surmised that You Tao was quite concerned about Traveling Dragon Palace joining a local faction in Diverse City. You Di could not help but feel helpless. Even at this point, You Tao was still acting impulsively.","“Brother, this Grade 5 Creator didn’t show any exceptional qualities. He only revealed that he came to Diverse City with his Young Master. It shouldn’t be long before they leave. No faction in Diverse City can hide a Grade 6 Creator. If it were possible, then the City Lord Manor wouldn’t be the sole dominant faction in Diverse City. More than half of the City Lords in the other mega cities are suppressed by other factions.”","You Tao trembled when he heard You Di’s words. What faction actually had a Grade 6 Creator presiding over it? Moreover, their Grade 5 Creator had the identity of a servant.","You Di’s guess was right. You Tao indeed disliked Traveling Dragon Palace being controlled by Diverse City’s local factions. However, if Traveling Dragon Palace relied on a faction with a Grade 6 Creator, it might not necessarily be a bad thing even in their peak days.","“Second Brother, the matter of Traveling Dragon Palace has always been decided by the two of us. If we make a decision on this matter, we don’t need to discuss it with the others in the faction. To tell you the truth, I have already made up my mind to give up on Traveling Dragon Palace’s investment in Extreme Wood City and return to Diverse City like a stray dog.","“Our Traveling Dragon Palace can no longer hold on. Since this Grade 5 Creator is in contact with you, you’ll have full authority to communicate with him. If we can really rely on this faction with a Grade 6 Creator, will this faction be able to give Traveling Dragon Palace some resources to suppress Gray Smoke Stronghold?","“As long as Traveling Dragon Palace can gain a firm foothold in Extreme Wood City, the subsequent benefits will be much greater than the initial investment!”","Upon learning that this faction had a Grade 6 Creator presiding over it, You Tao no longer considered whether Traveling Dragon Palace would submit to this faction, but whether this faction would still be willing to take Traveling Dragon Palace under their wing after understanding their current predicament.","You Di said after a moment of silence, “Big Brother, the entire Traveling Dragon Palace is in a state of panic now. Once this matter is confirmed, it will give our core members a lot of strength. Wait for me to contact this Grade 5 Creator. If everything is confirmed, why don’t we announce this to boost the cohesion of Traveling Dragon Palace?”","Upon hearing this, You Tao did not speak immediately. Instead, he pondered for a moment before responding. “Second Brother, you should have already sensed that our Traveling Dragon Palace has been infiltrated by other factions. Many factions have already planted people in Traveling Dragon Palace.","“Apart from that, there are also many individuals within Traveling Dragon Palace who have become disloyal. They act against the interests of Traveling Dragon Palace and take the initiative to contact other factions. These individuals are only a small fraction that has surfaced. Many others remain hidden in the shadows and haven’t revealed themselves.","“I think it is necessary to get rid of these individuals from Traveling Dragon Palace to ensure the survival of all our members after this calamity. Otherwise, if our Traveling Dragon Palace is really under the command of this Grade 6 Creator, internal problems are bound to arise. If this affects future operations, the gains will not make up for the losses.”","In the past, You Tao had always believed that Traveling Dragon Palace was extremely united under his leadership and there was no discord. However, after this incident, You Tao realized how many shortcomings existed within Traveling Dragon Palace. He might as well take this opportunity to get rid of all these shortcomings once and for all.","You Di had previously suggested this to You Tao, but the latter had consistently refused to acknowledge any internal issues within Traveling Dragon Palace. This time, You Di decided not to divert the topic. Now that You Tao had come to this realization on his own, it was truly the best outcome.","“Brother, I know what to do. I’ll contact this Grade 5 Creator and discuss the matter of affiliation with him. I’ll carefully consider and agree to the other party’s requests and conditions, without informing you of every detail.","“You stabilize the development of Traveling Dragon Palace in Extreme Wood City first, and then you’ll also be responsible for cleaning up the remaining factions.","“Big Brother, I know everything you have done has been for the good of Traveling Dragon Palace. This failure has indeed caused a lot of losses for us. However, this does not mean that your management is problematic. I believe that Traveling Dragon Palace will become better and better under your leadership.”","With that, You Di ended the call. He took a deep breath and prepared to contact Sun Yin.","On the other end of the line, You Tao could feel his brother’s concern for him. Although he did not know if the faction that You Di mentioned was really willing to help Traveling Dragon Palace, You Tao’s heart was much more at ease than before.","Since the other party took the initiative to contact You Di, as long as Traveling Dragon Palace met their demands, they should be willing to help Traveling Dragon Palace. Traveling Dragon Palace might have fallen into a predicament, but it still had a lot of potential.","...","At present, Lin Yuan had already selected the Gourmets and Weavers. Three Class 4 and above Gourmets and Weavers had been chosen. The eyes of the three Gourmets and Weavers could be healed.","Facing Lin Yuan’s choice, Sun Youcai tried to persuade Lin Yuan again. However, seeing Lin Yuan determined to proceed with the trade, Sun Youcai turned to Feng Qian and Ding Tao and said, “I’ve already reminded you, Brother Lin. Don’t let Wan Ying come looking for trouble with me later.”","Sun Youcai said this with a smile, but Feng Qian and Ding Tao both understood that there was more to his words. Sun Youcai was trying to tell them that anyone would take the initiative to rope in someone like Lin Yuan and ask for Fortune Treasure Palace not to target him because of this matter.","After joking with Feng Qian and Ding Tao, Sun Youcai asked Lin Yuan, “Apart from these Weavers, Gourmets and the Spirit Craftsmen you just chose, do you have any other needs? Apart from Weavers and Gourmets, I also have many niche lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals. If it were anyone else, I wouldn’t sell these spirit qi professionals at all.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan asked curiously, “Brother Sun, may I know what these niche lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals are referring to? I’m interested in those functional talents. To be honest, I’m out to establish a faction and don’t lack resources, but I urgently need high-quality talents. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have bought so much right from the start.”","Lin Yuan’s words were very sincere, and Sun Yin revealed a look of understanding.","Sun Yin had always speculated about Lin Yuan’s identity. Now, it seemed clear that Lin Yuan belonged to a hidden faction with deep foundations. As a direct descendant, Lin Yuan needed to prove himself by establishing his own faction. Currently, he was in the early stages of doing so. The more Sun Yin helped him now, the more Lin Yuan would owe him.","Soon, Sun Yin brought a large group of niche lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals. To put it bluntly, they were actually captives of species with special bloodlines. These individuals could use their unique bloodlines to perform tasks that ordinary lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals could not. They were much more valuable than the average professionals.","Lin Yuan selected a portion of these talents, resulting in a fruitful harvest. After completing the talent transaction, Lin Yuan didn’t stay any longer. The newly acquired talents were stored in spatial equipment. Although they were completely under Lin Yuan’s control, they were not yet qualified to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Gourmets would not be directly controlled by Lin Yuan; the Spirit Craftsmen would be under Hu Quan’s supervision, while the Weavers would be managed by Wen Yu. Sun Ningxiang would oversee the lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals with special functions.","Among the Spirit Craftsmen, some possessed abilities stronger than Hu Quan. Lin Yuan’s decision to recruit them indicated his intent to use them extensively.","However, he didn’t want Hu Quan to feel undervalued. Lin Yuan recognized Hu Quan’s capabilities, particularly his management and learning abilities. He preferred to nurture Hu Quan, who had been with him since the early days of Sky City, rather than placing these newly recruited craftsmen in significant positions.","...","After Lin Yuan left with Chu Ci, he didn’t immediately return to Fortune Treasure Palace. Instead, he took Chu Ci to Diverse City to taste various delicacies.","Noticing Chu Ci’s solemn expression, Lin Yuan said seriously, “Chu Ci, you’re still uncomfortable because those professionals were sold, right? This goes against the rules of the Radiance Federation where we lived. However, it’s completely acceptable in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and is tacitly approved by all factions.","“Being tacitly approved by all factions doesn’t necessarily mean it’s right, but this set of rules has been in place for a long time here. Even if you completely control the Sky Beyond the Clouds, you can’t stop it. Explicit prohibitions will only drive it underground.","“Don’t forget that factions in the Scarlet Territory trade Bloodians as commodities right under the Bloodian clans’ noses. You need to adapt to the Sky Beyond the Clouds and do as the Romans do!”","Chu Ci nodded. “Brother, I do feel uncomfortable about this, but it won’t affect me. Instead, it helps me understand the Sky Beyond the Clouds better. Now, I have another reason to work hard: to ensure that neither I nor those dear to me will be treated as commodities and sold at will.”","Lin Yuan saw the determination in Chu Ci’s eyes and felt gratified.","In Diverse City, due to its diverse population, there were all sorts of peculiar foods, some with excellent flavors, though their preparation methods were hard to stomach. The delicious food eased Chu Ci’s emotions, and by the time they returned to Fortune Treasure Palace, it was evening.","...","When Feng Qian and Ding Tao returned to Fortune Treasure Palace, they immediately sought out Wan Ying to report everything that had happened that day."]},{"number":3063,"title":"Chapter 3063 Diverse City’s Auction!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3063 Diverse City’s Auction!","During the day that Feng Qian and Ding Tao accompanied Lin Yuan out, Wan Ying was very worried that Feng Qian and Ding Tao would not be able to serve Lin Yuan well.","....","Feng Qian and Ding Tao were Wan Ying’s trusted subordinates. However, Wan Ying knew that the higher a person’s status, the higher their requirements.","If Feng Qian and Ding Tao’s service did not satisfy Lin Yuan, he would inevitably be dissatisfied with Fortune Treasure Palace.","Seeing the concern on Wan Ying’s face, Ding Tao hurriedly said, “Sister Wan Ying, our operation with Young Master Lin today went very smoothly. Young Master Lin gained a lot and has returned to his residence in Fortune Treasure Palace. Feng Qian and I have completed our mission perfectly.”","Wan Ying relaxed at this but did not fully trust Ding Tao’s words. Instead, she turned to look at Feng Qian.","After Feng Qian nodded in confirmation, Wan Ying smiled and said, “The two of you have done well today. I will inform Palace Master Ling about your successful completion of the mission. Palace Master Ling has been paying close attention to this matter.","“Your ratings will be confirmed in three months. At the beginning of next year, as long as nothing goes wrong, you will become the person-in-charge of other cities’ Fortune Treasure Palaces.","“Since it’s your first time serving Young Master Lin and he’s satisfied with your work, I’ll leave the subsequent reception to the two of you until he leaves Diverse City. After receiving Young Master Lin, I can make the decision to let you rest until the handover of the managers next year.”","Ding Tao was overjoyed, but Feng Qian felt a wave of pressure.","During her time with Lin Yuan, Feng Qian sensed that he was easygoing, but serving someone of his stature was not easy.","Moreover, Sun Youcai had invited Lin Yuan. Even if Ding Tao and she wanted to continue receiving Lin Yuan, they might not always have the chance.","After much consideration, Feng Qian told Wan Ying about how Sun Youcai had tried to recruit Lin Yuan in front of her and Ding Tao.","When Feng Qian mentioned this, Ding Tao also recalled Sun Youcai’s provocation and said unhappily, “Sister Wan Ying, you don’t know how arrogant Sun Youcai was when he invited Young Master Lin. He didn’t consider that the people from Fortune Treasure Palace were still present.”","Although Wan Ying was a little displeased, she had expected Sun Youcai to recruit Lin Yuan. Sun Youcai was not an idiot. He was a disciple of a large faction, adept at speculating and seeking opportunities. As soon as Sun Youcai came into contact with Lin Yuan, he realized his value. Wan Ying was surprised that Sun Youcai hadn’t recruited Lin Yuan sooner.","Lin Yuan’s influence was not in Diverse City, so he wouldn’t stay there long.","Lin Yuan had definitely come to Diverse City to interact more with its factions. If Fortune Treasure Palace forcefully stopped Lin Yuan from interacting with other factions, they would be at a disadvantage.","Wan Ying only needed to provide the best service to Lin Yuan and not worry about anything else. Ling Muzhuo had reminded Wan Ying of this, fearing she might try to interfere with Lin Yuan’s interactions with other factions.","“I understand the situation you’re talking about. Based on my understanding of Sun Youcai, he will send a large number of resources later to thank us for recommending such a good client. We have a cooperative relationship with Sun Youcai.","“Moreover, Young Master Lin’s actions are not something we can control. Just allow Sun Youcai to do what he wants. The two of you can continue serving Young Master Lin. If there’s anything you need to do, I’ll inform you.”","Feng Qian knew that Lin Yuan intended to participate in Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair, so she told Wan Ying about this.","“Sister Wan Ying, Fortune Treasure Palace has a good relationship with Traveling Dragon Palace. Do you think we should contact Traveling Dragon Palace and help Young Master Lin obtain the resources he saw there?”","When Wan Ying heard Feng Qian’s words, she first looked hesitant before frowning.","Fortune Treasure Palace was indeed connected to Traveling Dragon Palace. Previously, when Traveling Dragon Palace was in a predicament, their second leader, You Di, had sought her out, hoping Fortune Treasure Palace could help them overcome the crisis.","Wan Ying had rejected Traveling Dragon Palace without thinking.","Firstly, Wan Ying felt that Traveling Dragon Palace was taking too big a step. They had already invested a lot of resources, making it impossible to escape unscathed.","Furthermore, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Fortune Treasure Palace were in a cooperative relationship. If Fortune Treasure Palace helped Traveling Dragon Palace, it would completely antagonize Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","After careful consideration, Wan Ying gave up on improving her relationship with Traveling Dragon Palace. She had already rejected You Di previously. What would happen if she clashed with them now?","Lin Yuan was very capable. Even without the help of Fortune Treasure Palace, he could still trade for what he wanted.","Since Fortune Treasure Palace couldn’t help Lin Yuan much, it was better not to do anything unnecessary.","Feng Qian was indeed very smart, but sometimes being too smart wasn’t a good thing.","“Feng Qian, you just told me how much Young Master Lin spent on Sun Youcai. Do you think Young Master Lin needs our help? Traveling Dragon Palace organized this trade fair to gather resources to resolve the crisis we are facing now.","“If Fortune Treasure Palace helps, it will just mean we’re helping Young Master Lin provide resources to Traveling Dragon Palace. Traveling Dragon Palace has put all their trump cards up for sale. How can we afford these things?","“Let’s not talk about this anymore. We cannot take the initiative to contact Traveling Dragon Palace. The purpose of Fortune Treasure Palace is to avoid participating in the disputes of other factions.","“Once Fortune Treasure Palace gets involved in these disputes, we will no longer be able to do business with all the factions in the future!","“Feng Qian, when you’re in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace in the future, don’t forget its foundation.”","With that, Wan Ying waved her hand, indicating that Feng Qian and Ding Tao could leave.","Actually, before Ding Tao mentioned this matter, Wan Ying had already asked Lin Yuan if he had any intention of interacting with Traveling Dragon Palace.","Back then, Lin Yuan had not responded. It seemed that even if Lin Yuan wanted to contact Traveling Dragon Palace, he would most likely not want to use Fortune Treasure Palace’s channels.","...","After Chu Ci returned, she entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone and prepared to reorganize her direction.","Lin Yuan counted the talents he had traded and had higher expectations for Sky City’s future development.","These 3,000 Spirit Craftsmen allowed Sky City’s development to proceed quickly, and many war fortresses could be constructed.","Winter couldn’t help but say, “Young Master, your companion Lord Totem God is able to produce resources. Otherwise, no matter how powerful you are, without the Creator methods, it would be difficult to obtain many resources. The only way to obtain resources with strength is to become a star pirate or plunder other factions. Only with so many resources can Sky City develop so quickly.”","Winter’s words sounded like flattery, but in reality, he had no intention of flattering at all. Instead, he was genuinely impressed.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Winter, no matter how many resources I can produce here, I can’t spend them without the four of you. This trip to Diverse City has greatly improved Sky City. This time, I intend to support Traveling Dragon Palace to achieve control over Diverse City and its surrounding cities. This will enable Sky City to extend a tenacious tentacle to the outside world. But if we decide to support Traveling Dragon Palace, we will inevitably face conflicts.”","Winter’s tone was extremely serious when he replied, “Young Master, since you’ve decided to develop Sky City externally, conflicts are inevitable. Traveling Dragon Palace is an excellent choice for you to control Diverse City. There are not many factions in the entire city that suit your needs.","“Sun Yin has already helped you get in touch with the leaders of Traveling Dragon Palace. If Traveling Dragon Palace wants to submit, we can begin to understand their situation. Whether to support Traveling Dragon Palace or not depends on your wishes.”","While Winter was talking to Lin Yuan, Sun Yin sent a message on the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Lin Yuan smiled when he saw Sun Yin’s message.","Traveling Dragon Palace was already willing to submit. It was just that Sun Yin was not clear about Traveling Dragon Palace’s current predicament.","You Di wanted to meet Lin Yuan, but Lin Yuan rejected him.","Now was not the best time to meet You Di. Lin Yuan replied to Sun Yin through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","[Lin Yuan]: Since you’ve finished discussing with Traveling Dragon Palace, why don’t you stay there for the next few days? Traveling Dragon Palace is in a predicament. We can’t just sit back and do nothing. Tell Traveling Dragon Palace to announce that they’ve recruited a Grade 5 Creator.","Lin Yuan had asked Sun Yin to do this in response to Traveling Dragon Palace.","If Traveling Dragon Palace announced to the public that a Grade 5 Creator had joined them, their enemies would probably not be able to handle this news. Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would definitely take new actions!","Tomorrow, Sun Youcai would invite him to participate in a talent auction held by the Diverse Talent Market supported by Diverse City.","The talent auctions held at Diverse Talent Market usually consisted of criminals who had offended the power of the City Lord. Such auctions would only appear once every few hundred years.","Lin Yuan had arrived just in time, so it could be considered a coincidence.","Lin Yuan’s original intention for going to Diverse City was to buy Traveling Dragon Palace’s blessed land. Since he had the opportunity to obtain more high-end resources, Lin Yuan would definitely not reject it.","...","The next morning, Feng Qian and Ding Tao prepared breakfast for Lin Yuan on time and asked if he wanted them to show him around Diverse City. However, Lin Yuan declined their offer.","Feng Qian and Ding Tao had not mentioned to Lin Yuan that the Diverse Talent Market was about to hold an auction, which had specific entry requirements. Fortune Treasure Palace did not have the right to enter, but Sun Youcai did.","Sun Youcai was waiting for Lin Yuan at the entrance of Fortune Treasure Palace. When he saw Lin Yuan, he smiled and reached out to give him a big hug.","Seeing that Lin Yuan had no intention of reciprocating, Sun Youcai did not feel embarrassed.","“Brother Lin, this trade fair organized by the Diverse Talent Market is the most grandiose one I’ve seen since I came to Diverse City. Many of the goods are not local but obtained from other places by the City Lord.","“At that time, there will probably be many people competing for them. Moreover, the purchasing power of different resources will vary in this competition. Brother Lin, if you keep trading with Grade 4 Creator resources, the other factions won’t be able to compete with you.”","At this point, Sun Youcai put away his usual kind smile and spoke in a serious tone. “The City Lord of Diverse City is not a good person. He doesn’t have any real business acumen, but he has a lot of tricks up his sleeve.","“There will definitely be people who will raise the price maliciously in this auction. They will only stop when the City Lord is satisfied.","“Brother Lin, I suggest you don’t get too carried away. Most of the factions in this auction are here to have fun unless they have resources they really value. Basically, the final transaction price of the auction will be comparable to, or even higher than, the actual purchase price.”","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but think.","The City Lord of Diverse City had given Sun Youcai a bad impression. Of course, Sun Youcai might have said that because of his competitive relationship with the City Lord and his inclination to discredit him.","Lin Yuan and Sun Youcai had only made one transaction, so he could not use this alone to determine Sun Youcai’s character.","Lin Yuan had his eyes on the top talents, so price was nothing to him.","Sun Youcai had too few high-end talents. If Sun Youcai had sufficient high-end talents, Lin Yuan would be willing to buy them even at a higher price.","Lin Yuan did not mind the City Lord raising the price maliciously. As long as it was a talent that caught his eye, Lin Yuan would choose to buy it even if he had to spend more.","Of course, this was only if the price was not too ridiculous. If it was, Lin Yuan would not be a sucker.","When Lin Yuan arrived at the Diverse Talent Market, he realized it was completely different from Sun Youcai’s talent market.","The Diverse Talent Market was guarded by a large number of factions belonging to the City Lord. There were people standing guard everywhere. In contrast, apart from the attendants at the entrance, there had been hardly any security at Sun Youcai’s place.","Sun Youcai looked at the lineup of the Diverse Talent Market and said disdainfully, “Heh, Zhao Chen really likes to show off. These people standing guard here are just for decoration. Other than that, they have no other use. The real security is carried out by top experts. Zhao Chen most likely sent the three worshippers from the City Lord’s residence over.”"]},{"number":3064,"title":"Chapter 3064: Poison Bee Wine and Fire Spirit Wine!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3064: Poison Bee Wine and Fire Spirit Wine!","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","From Sun Youcai’s words, Lin Yuan gathered that Sun Youcai was very familiar with Diverse City’s City Lord, Zhao Chen. Moreover, his words were filled with disdain for Zhao Chen.","This disdain came with a hint of fear.","This indicated that Zhao Chen could suppress Sun Youcai. Otherwise, Sun Youcai’s talent market would not be so far away from Diverse City!","As the City Lord of a mega-city, it was not a bad thing to be particular about ostentation. If he did not show off at all, it would weaken his authority.","Lin Yuan joked with Sun Youcai, “Brother Sun, from what you’re saying, it sounds like you have some enmity with the City Lord of Diverse City. If you take me there, will the two of us be chased out of the City Lord Manor?”","Sun Youcai hurriedly replied, “Brother Lin, my relationship with Zhao Chen isn’t that bad, but we’re competitive in business. Privately, we have a mutual understanding. If I had a grudge against a narrow-minded guy like Zhao Chen, why would he invite me? After all, Fortune Treasure Palace didn’t receive Zhao Chen’s invitation.","“Rumor has it that Zhao Chen had vouched for a faction and wanted Fortune Treasure Palace to support this faction. Wan Ying rejected this, making Zhao Chen feel embarrassed. Otherwise, under normal circumstances, Fortune Treasure Palace should have been given a few spots!”","Sun Youcai was showing Lin Yuan his connections and telling him that his relationship with the City Lord was extremely close and not as bad as the rumors suggested.","At the same time, he was proving to Lin Yuan that it was better for him to guide them than for Fortune Treasure Palace.","As soon as Sun Youcai finished speaking, he heard a sharp voice say, “Mr. Sun, long time no see. In Diverse City, only you dare to speak ill of City Lord Zhao like this. The last time I visited, you said you liked my Poison Bee Wine. A new batch has been brewed recently. Here are 20 bottles. Please accept them, Mr. Sun!”","The middle-aged man with long dark green hair and a pale face warmly handed a spatial equipment to Sun Youcai.","To get close to Sun Youcai, this man had occupied the space beside Lin Yuan, which made Lin Yuan frown.","Seeing that Winter was about to make a move, Lin Yuan signaled him to stop. This middle-aged man with long, dark green hair was clearly ignoring Lin Yuan. The latter was there for the talent auction and did not want to cause trouble and expose his presence.","Sun Youcai always enjoyed being praised and receiving gifts. This was why people from various factions treated him with such respect.","The main reason Sun Youcai was there was to accompany Lin Yuan. If Sun Youcai had not known that Lin Yuan intended to buy high-end talents, Lin Yuan would have bought all the high-end talents himself.","Sun Youcai would not have attended such an occasion to support a competitor like Zhao Chen.","This person had already affected Lin Yuan in order to please him. Although Lin Yuan did not say much, he was clearly dissatisfied. If it were him, he would not be happy either!","The person giving the Poison Bee Wine was the Third Elder of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, responsible for handling their external affairs.","Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had always been in conflict with Traveling Dragon Palace and had been suppressed by them in Diverse City.","Now, with the conflict between Traveling Dragon Palace and Gray Smoke Stronghold, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall finally had some breathing space.","It was obvious that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall’s Third Elder, Chan Jing, had not come to curry favor with him. Sun Youcai could clearly see who was more important between Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Lin Yuan.","Ever since he had come to Diverse City to open the talent market, the talents that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had bought from him were less than one-thirtieth of what Lin Yuan had bought.","Bizarre Plant Demon Hall usually bought World Emperor/Divine Kingdom experts with no combat ability and whose roots were injured and without healing value.","Although Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had also invested some shares in him, such a small shareholder was dispensable to Sun Youcai.","Sun Youcai coughed heavily. One of the guards behind him immediately raised his hand and pushed away the Third Elder of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","Sun Youcai said coldly, “Chan Jing, your Poison Bee Wine does have some flavor, but this is not a reason for you to stop my friend! Take these 20 bottles of Poison Bee Wine back.”","Sun Youcai’s words stunned Chan Jing. Sun Youcai did not give Chan Jing a chance to speak and continued. “If you’re sorry for your actions just now, you can give these 20 bottles of Poison Bee Wine to my friend.”","Sun Youcai had always been tactful. Bizarre Plant Demon Hall recently had a chance to rise, and Sun Youcai did not want to become enemies with them because of Lin Yuan.","Sun Youcai mentioned a way to salvage the situation. If Chan Jing was smart, he might use this opportunity to get close to Lin Yuan.","Chan Jing took the initiative to befriend Sun Youcai but was treated like this. This made Chan Jing’s expression turn very ugly. In his opinion, he had already lowered himself to befriend Sun Youcai, yet Sun Youcai treated him like this.","Could it be that Sun Youcai had reached some kind of agreement with Traveling Dragon Palace to help them?","You Di, the second leader of Wandering Dragon Palace, indeed had a better relationship with Sun Youcai than Bizarre Plant Demon Hall did.","This time, he had only brewed less than 300 jars of Poison Bee Wine.","Sun Youcai did not accept his goodwill. Instead, he asked him to give the Poison Bee Wine to this young man. Chan Jing felt insulted.","This young man’s lifespan was less than 100 years. He was just trying to curry favor with Sun Youcai and occupy this young man’s position. Was there a need for him to compensate with 20 bottles of Poison Bee Wine?","Chan Jing took a deep breath. He was not going to continue standing there and embarrassing himself. There were already many people watching from the sidelines.","“Since Mr. Sun doesn’t like to drink the Poison Bee Wine anymore, leave this Poison Bee Wine to those who like it! In the future, if Bizarre Plant Demon Hall brews any new wine, we will send it to Mr. Sun for him to grade!”","With that, he turned around and left, preparing to contact the other factions to send out the Poison Bee Wine.","Lin Yuan looked at the middle-aged man with long dark green hair in surprise. He realized that the man was from the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall!","The Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had always been on opposing sides with Lin Yuan’s enemies since he started preparing to take the Traveling Dragon Palace under his command. They were considered adversaries.","This member of the Demon Hall tried to curry favor with Sun Youcai, but Sun Youcai’s reaction showed that he genuinely considered Lin Yuan a friend.","Sun Youcai watched Chan Jing leave without a care. He was not concerned about offending Chan Jing as long as Lin Yuan did not misunderstand his intentions.","The Third Elder of the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall was really short-sighted. How could someone Lin Yuan valued so much not have any status?","“Brother Lin, the people from the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall are always like this. They are all a bit uptight. The faction is formed by a few special plant species, which are either extremely bloodthirsty and need a large amount of blood or contain violent venom and curse powers. If it’s not necessary, don’t get involved with this faction.","“However, the Poison Bee Wine brewed by them is still delicious. Drinking this wine, which is brewed with special bee venoms, can activate the blood energy in your entire body and give you a unique feeling. I still have a few bottles. If you’re interested, I can bring them out for you to try after the talent auction!”","Lin Yuan was not interested in the so-called Poison Bee Wine at all.","Besides being good at making clothes, Wen Yu was also an expert at brewing wine. Wen Yu had used spiritual ingredients from the Spirit Lock spatial zone to brew seven or eight outstanding wines. Lin Yuan rarely drank, but Liu Jie loved the excellent wines Wen Yu had brewed.","Sun Youcai’s preference for Poison Bee Wine indicated that he likely enjoyed hard liquor.","Lin Yuan took out a bottle of Fire Spirit Wine from his spatial equipment and handed it to Sun Youcai.","This Fire Spirit Wine was brewed with high concentrations of spiritual qi, heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that had already turned into elemental dolls, and dozens of fire-type spiritual ingredients. It was considered the best grade of hard liquor.","The spiritual ingredients used to brew this wine all came from Grade 4 and above Creators, with some reaching the level of Grade 5 Creator resources.","Creator resources above Grade 4 were extremely precious. Using these resources to brew wine was extremely extravagant. Even Grade 5 Creators would hesitate to do so.","Sun Youcai was experienced. When he saw the bottle of Fire Spirit Wine, he struggled to maintain his calm expression.","In Sun Youcai’s eyes, wine was a beverage with certain medicinal value, making it quite expensive. The Poison Bee Wine was already a good wine to him, but compared to the Fire Spirit Brew Lin Yuan casually took out, the Poison Bee Wine seemed low-end.","Sun Youcai couldn’t help but wonder if Lin Yuan regularly drank such exquisite wine.","Using Grade 4 Creator resources to brew wine was a huge waste. The taste of the wine was the focus, and compared to potions brewed by Creators, its effects were minimal.","Such a precious item was casually given to him, aligning perfectly with his image of Lin Yuan, who had many spirit qi crystals.","“Brother Lin, I’m truly surprised by the wine you brought out! I’ve learned something new today. If it were anything else, I wouldn’t accept it, but this bottle of wine really tempts me. I’m very curious about its taste. I won’t stand on ceremony with you. From now on, if I have any professionals above Class 4, I’ll contact you directly through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet you gave me. If you don’t want them, I’ll offer them to others!”","This interaction had brought Lin Yuan and Sun Youcai closer together.","Everyone had already seen how Sun Youcai protected Lin Yuan. Anyone else wanting to greet Sun Youcai would have to consider Lin Yuan’s presence.","“Brother Lin, the trade fair organized by the Diverse Talent Market is divided into three venues. The floor we’re on now is selling low-end resources that won’t interest you. The real auction will be held on the third floor, featuring outstanding Class 3 professionals and those above Class 4. There are less than two hours before the auction officially begins.","“Let’s go to the top floor and wait! Shortly, the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen, will likely come to see me. I can introduce Zhao Chen to you. Although Zhao Chen is selfish and a little jealous, once he acknowledges you, he’s a good partner.","“Zhao Chen and I are cooperating is because I also acknowledge him. If you like Zhao Chen, you can interact more with him. If not, I’ll send him away. Anyway, don’t let him affect our relationship!”","Sun Youcai would never compliment someone who lacked power. Lin Yuan was surprised that Sun Youcai would recommend someone like this.","“Brother Sun, I’ll inspect this Zhao Chen you mentioned. If he’s an outstanding partner, I’m very willing to work with him.”","Lin Yuan was a bit surprised that Sun Youcai would introduce Zhao Chen to him.","Lin Yuan was very willing to meet Zhao Chen because he had already decided to develop in Diverse City through Traveling Dragon Palace.","Getting to know Zhao Chen was a good move for Lin Yuan’s development in Diverse City.","Otherwise, if Traveling Dragon Palace developed too quickly in Diverse City and attracted Zhao Chen’s attention, Zhao Chen would definitely take action to prevent it.","Of course, whether he would form a good relationship with Zhao Chen would depend on their interactions.","Sun Youcai didn’t say anything else. He was just building a bridge. It didn’t matter if it succeeded or not. If it did, both Lin Yuan and Zhao Chen would owe him a favor.","When Sun Youcai saw the delicacies placed in the guest room by the attendants, he took out the bottle of Fire Spirit Wine Lin Yuan had given him and said with some heartache, “Rather than waiting here, why don’t we taste this wine you gave me? I’m looking forward to its flavor!","“Brother, if you don’t mind, can we let Zhao Chen try this wine later? He probably hasn’t tasted anything this good before. Zhao Chen has very good tea. When he drinks it, ask him to let you taste it!”","Lin Yuan immediately understood what Sun Youcai meant.","Sun Youcai took out this bottle of Fire Spirit Wine to help him show his value in front of Zhao Chen.","Sun Youcai had said that Zhao Chen was an extremely powerful person. If Lin Yuan did not display his foundation immediately, it would be very difficult for Sun Youcai to think of befriending him."]},{"number":3065,"title":"Chapter 3065 Bring Me Along!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3065 Bring Me Along!","After understanding Sun Youcai’s intentions, Lin Yuan smiled and took out three more jars of wine.","....","“Brother, it’s too dull to drink just one type of wine. Which one do you prefer among these three jars? I’ll give you ten jars later so you can drink to your heart’s content when you go back!”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan placed the three types of wine on the table. Each one exuded a unique elemental aura, distinct from the Fire Spirit Wine, and was top-notch. Sun Youcai, who always considered himself a connoisseur, realized he was far behind Lin Yuan. Not only did Lin Yuan present such excellent wines, but he also generously offered ten jars. This gesture made Sun Youcai recognize Lin Yuan’s extreme generosity.","Initially, Sun Youcai intended to befriend Lin Yuan, but now his desire to do so had grown even stronger.","“Brother Lin, ten jars are too much. Any one of these jars could be exchanged for a few pinnacle Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen. I’ll just taste them here. Even if you give me these wines, I wouldn’t bear to drink them myself.”","Sun Youcai’s words were sincere, not merely polite. He knew that even if he desired the wine, he would only gaze at it if it were brewed with Creator resources. It wasn’t that he couldn’t afford it, but he knew Creator resources were rare and shouldn’t be wasted.","Sun Youcai managed a large talent market, and many areas required resource allocation. As a faction aiming for healthy development, the larger it grew, the wider the gap in Creator resources tended to become.","Even with many Creators in the faction, wasting Creator resources was rare. Creators were proud and would be displeased by such waste. Sun Youcai and his faction couldn’t suppress the Creators, so avoiding waste was essential. If the ruling power could suppress the Creators, individuals like Lin Yuan, who were direct descendants, might get away with wasting resources.","Lin Yuan waved his hand. “Brother Sun, the discount you’ve given me extends beyond these few bottles of wine. Don’t hesitate to drink them. I’ll send you ten jars every year, Brother Sun. You’ll have plenty to drink.”","Lin Yuan took out a few jade pots and elegantly poured the wine. The mixed scents created a unique fragrance. The waiter at the door couldn’t help but sniff the aroma flowing from the VIP room.","Lin Yuan aimed to establish a firm foothold in Diverse City by controlling Traveling Dragon Palace. Maintaining a good relationship with Sun Youcai allowed him to acquire talents and ensure support if Traveling Dragon Palace faced problems.","Although befriending Sun Youcai had significant benefits, given the powerful backing behind Sky Beyond the Clouds, both parties first considered whether their identities matched before forming connections.","If Lin Yuan hadn’t displayed wealth that shocked Sun Youcai and an attitude of not valuing Creator resources, Sun Youcai wouldn’t have made an effort to befriend him. Lin Yuan was well aware of this fact.","Sun Youcai grabbed Lin Yuan’s hand seriously. “Brother, befriending you is the luckiest thing since I came to Diverse City. If you need anything in the future, just tell me. I’m well respected here!”","As Sun Youcai spoke, a handsome man in luxurious black and gold armor walked in. He had short hair and a tall figure. While his appearance was outstanding, his features were slightly inferior to Lin Yuan’s. Both had noble temperaments, but this man’s nobility had a strong sense of aggression, unlike Lin Yuan’s peaceful aura.","The man laughed and teased Sun Youcai, “Sun Youcai, you claim to be respected in Diverse City. Why haven’t I heard of this? I’m the one with the reputation here. With such fine wine, I have snacks that pair well with it. Would you let me have a few glasses?”","Zhao Chen had invited Sun Youcai only as a formality, not expecting him to come. Sun Youcai had never been interested in the auction of talents. This time, he came and brought someone with him.","Zhao Chen was intrigued by Sun Youcai’s companion and went to greet them, hoping to befriend them if they were qualified. Initially, Zhao Chen didn’t think much of Lin Yuan. However, upon catching the scent of wine at the door, he carefully discerned the fragrance.","Zhao Chen immediately became serious. Through the fragrance of the wine, Zhao Chen could smell the Grade 5 Creator’s resources. Sun Youcai probably did not possess such resources. Even if Sun Youcai had such resources, it would be impossible for him to bring them here. Therefore, the only source of this wine could only be from the guest brought by Sun Youcai.","Just as Sun Youcai had said, Zhao Chen was an extremely snobbish person. He was extremely indifferent towards those of lower status, showing no interest in befriending them whatsoever.","However, once Zhao Chen had the intention to befriend someone, he would immediately take action. For example, in order to befriend Lin Yuan and show him his value, Zhao Chen had deliberately taken out these high-end snacks to pair with the wine.","Zhao Chen’s heart ached when he took out these snacks made from Grade 4 Creator resources.","Zhao Chen had made his intentions clear to Lin Yuan that if Lin Yuan was not interested, Zhao Chen would not insist on befriending him.","Lin Yuan was a little surprised by Zhao Chen’s friendly personality. He could sense that Zhao Chen wanted to befriend him.","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “It’s a pity that there was only wine here but no snacks. Now that you’ve brought these snacks to complement our wine selection, it’s only fitting for you to have a few drinks here!”","Sun Youcai was well aware of Zhao Chen’s personality and his approach to things. He had expected that Zhao Chen would definitely do this after smelling the fragrance of the wine at the door. However, whether or not the two of them could successfully establish a friendship was not up to Zhao Chen, but Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan responded to Zhao Chen and allowed him to stay at the table, it indicated that both of them showed an interest in befriending each other.","Sun Youcai rolled his eyes at Zhao Chen, “Why, don’t you agree that I have some influence in Diverse City? Besides you, who don’t show me any respect in Diverse City, most others do offer me some level of respect. As long as you don’t make things difficult for me, there are very few things in Diverse City that I can’t do. Don’t let Brother Lin think that I’m bragging when you say that.”","Zhao Chen knew that Sun Youcai’s remark wasn’t intended to offend him. Outsiders assumed that their relationship was extremely poor. Yet in fact, Zhao Chen and Sun Youcai were good friends. Moreover, Sun Youcai had shares in his talent market. The two of them were not only friends, but also good business partners.","Sun Youcai’s words served as an introduction of Lin Yuan, at least providing Zhao Chen with his name.","Zhao Chen said to Lin Yuan in a friendly manner, “Brother Lin, if it is his own business, I might hinder it, but if what he’s doing involves you, I’ll lend a hand. I won’t stand in the way, instead, I will also put in some effort to help you.”","When Lin Yuan heard the way Zhao Chen addressed him, he raised his eyebrows. He felt that the current interaction with Zhao Chen bore some resemblance to the worldly affairs he had experienced in his past life.","Lin Yuan said to Zhao Chen, “Brother Zhao, I’m afraid I have to thank you in advance. I’ll have to trouble you in the future.”","The three of them engaged in conversation one after another, creating a very pleasant atmosphere. If an outsider were here, they would never have thought that this was Lin Yuan’s first time meeting Zhao Chen. They would even find it more unbelievable that Zhao Chen, the City Lord of Diverse City, was sitting here in his own establishment, chatting and laughing with a young man.","During the conversation, Zhao Chen learned that Lin Yuan had the intention of purchasing high-end talents, and he jovially remarked on it, “Brother Lin, if you want to purchase high-end talents, you’ve really come to the right place this time. Apart from the Creator auction, there will be auctions lasting two days where you can find what you’re looking for.","“These talents don’t actually belong to the East Universe. I obtained them from the battlefield in the South Universe through my species’ strength. These people basically have very serious injuries on their bodies. Many of the auction items’ roots have been severely injured. I didn’t heal them, but disguised their condition instead","” I can cheat others, but I definitely won’t cheat you, Brother Lin. In a moment, I’ll summon the person in charge of organizing this auction. If there are any issues with any of the items, I’ll have him tell you truthfully so that you can make your choice.”","Zhao Chen didn’t shy away from disclosing the source of these auction items to Lin Yuan, as it was his way of showcasing his capabilities to Lin Yuan. His bold approach to handling matters might appear ostentatious, but given his capabilities and talents, it facilitated his friendships with others who shared similar strengths.","Of course, Zhao Chen’s personality was not without drawbacks. Once Zhao Chen encountered someone whose background and strength surpassed his own, but harbored hostility towards him, it was very likely that he would cause big trouble given his personality.","Upon hearing Zhao Chen’s words, Lin Yuan’s interest was piqued. It did not matter to Lin Yuan whether these talents were injured or not. Even without using his own strength, Lin Yuan still had so many Grade 4 and Grade5 Creators under him. As long as Lin Yuan wanted to, he could basically recover from the injuries of these talents.","However, Zhao Chen only disclosed the injuries of these talents to him, and other factions participating in the auction were unaware of this information. If Lin Yuan wanted these talents, their prices would still be bid up high. However, Zhao Chen’s actions were enough to show his sincerity.","Lin Yuan did not intend to accept Zhao Chen’s good intentions. If he did, it would be equivalent to owing Zhao Chen a favor, “Brother Zhao, there’s no need to summon someone in charge. I’d rather not have the auction later interfere with the three of us enjoying our drinks. Whether or not I want to bid for these talents will depend on my judgment. If I like someone, I can help you push up the price a bit.”","Sun Youcai knew that Zhao Chen was very good at giving favors, and these favors often left no trace. When Sun Youcai first interacted with Zhao Chen, he inexplicably owed Zhao Chen a few favors, yet only realizing it later.","Sun Youcai initially thought that Lin Yuan would also end up being at a disadvantage in his interactions with Zhao Chen, but to his surprise, it was Zhao Chen who ended up at a disadvantage instead of Lin Yuan.","There were not many opportunities to see Zhao Chen suffer. Zhao Chen had originally wanted Lin Yuan to owe him a favor, but it had subtly become Zhao Chen owing Lin Yuan a favor.","Zhao Chen had lived for tens of thousands of years. Although his bloodline might indicate that he was only in his prime, his experience was something that accumulated over time. On the other hand, Lin Yuan had only lived for a few decades, but he was already so outstanding in such matters.","Sun Youcai became increasingly curious about the faction behind Lin Yuan. However, he knew very well that it was best not to speculate casually. It was impolite to speculate and pry into Lin Yuan’s privacy, and Sun Youcai did not want Lin Yuan to misunderstand him. As for Zhao Chen, he knew his limits even after getting to know Lin Yuan.","Sun Youcai was pleased to see the expression of defeat on Zhao Chen’s face. Since Lin Yuan didn’t need his help, Zhao Chen naturally wouldn’t insist on doing so.","Soon, the jars of wine that Lin Yuan took out were finished. Zhao Chen had initially thought about offering some of his own wine to entertain Lin Yuan, but he saw Lin Yuan bringing out several more bottles of wine. It was as if the wine itself was nothing to Lin Yuan.","Zhao Chen once again realized Lin Yuan’s foundation. It turned out that Lin Yuan had taken out so much wine not just to entertain him, but because Lin Yuan was likely to drink these things on a daily basis. Otherwise, since he had already successfully socialized with Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan bringing out these wines to entertain him would not further enhance their relationship.","Despite having known Lin Yuan for only a short time, Lin Yuan’s place in Zhao Chen’s heart was already higher than Sun Youcai’s.","Zhao Chen had basically figured out the exact situation of the hidden faction behind Sun Youcai."]},{"number":3066,"title":"Chapter 3066: Proof of Grade Six!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3066: Proof of Grade Six!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The hidden faction behind Sun Youcai was very strong, but Zhao Chen was not weak either. In fact, the faction behind Zhao Chen was stronger than the one behind Sun Youcai.","If Lin Yuan’s current display of resources was genuine, then the power backing Lin Yuan was likely much stronger than the faction Zhao Chen currently belonged to.","Zhao Chen had initially planned to meet Sun Youcai before catching up with his other old friends. However, he abandoned this idea and decided to stay with Lin Yuan until the auction ended.","Currently, those being auctioned were all pinnacle Class 3 lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals, who appeared very outstanding on the surface. However, their aptitude was not very impressive.","Lin Yuan looked at Zhao Chen and thought that if Zhao Chen had truly recruited these individuals from the South Universe battlefield, their talents shouldn’t be this poor.","After contemplating momentarily, Lin Yuan deduced that these people had likely been pre-screened. The truly outstanding talents were not with Zhao Chen. Based on his understanding of Zhao Chen, it was not that Zhao Chen did not want those talents, but he could not sell them even if he did acquire them.","Lin Yuan speculated that there was likely significant competition within Zhao Chen’s faction. He hadn’t asked Sun Youcai about Zhao Chen’s specific circumstances, but Lin Yuan felt his guess was close to the mark.","Lin Yuan refrained from deliberately displaying his superior detection abilities in front of Zhao Chen. Having already traded numerous talents, he no longer harbored any intention to purchase individuals who didn’t meet his standards. He also had no interest in raising prices for individuals he had no intention of buying.","Sun Youcai was surprised to see Lin Yuan’s lack of interest. In Sun Youcai’s impression, Lin Yuan was someone who craved talents. Now that these pinnacle Class 3 lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals were in front of him, Lin Yuan had no reason to refrain from choosing.","Considering Lin Yuan’s exceptional investigative abilities, Sun Youcai wondered if Lin Yuan sensed something amiss with these auctioned talents.","In Lin Yuan’s view, an intermediate Class 3 lifestyle-class professional with potential was much more important than these pinnacle Class 3 professionals. If Lin Yuan were to purchase them, he would have to invest resources to nurture them. Conversely, if they were Class 4 lifestyle-class professionals, their abilities would already be there. Hence, Lin Yuan wouldn’t inquire about their potential and would only value their abilities.","Zhao Chen had heard that Lin Yuan had purchased numerous talents from Sun Youcai. Yet, he hadn’t participated in Zhao Chen’s auction. Whether or not Lin Yuan won the bid was one matter, but his lack of involvement raised questions. Could it be that Lin Yuan was dissatisfied with the quality of the individuals Zhao Chen was auctioning off?","Having established a connection with Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen noticed Lin Yuan’s reluctance to participate in the auction. Therefore, he addressed Lin Yuan directly, “Brother Lin, do you not like these individuals? If you don’t like them, just wait a bit. The talents up for auction later will likely be much more exceptional. The later stages of this auction will likely feature even more outstanding talents.”","Upon seeing that Zhao Chen had initiated a conversation with him, Lin Yuan said, “I have specific requirements regarding the potential of the talents I purchase. Brother Zhao, the talents being auctioned here have limited potential. After I buy them, I won’t be able to further nurture them. I prioritize individuals with potential and talent, even if they come at a higher cost.","“Brother Zhao, given that you can obtain resources from the battlefield in the South Universe, I believe you can acquire talents with potential. No matter how severely damaged their roots may be, as long as they’re alive, I’m willing to trade for them. Brother Zhao, do you want to help me with this?”","Upon hearing this, Zhao Chen felt somewhat embarrassed. It turned out that Lin Yuan’s lack of participation in the auction was for this reason.","Lin Yuan’s guess was correct. The faction behind Zhao Chen was not only limited to the East Universe, but also spanned across the South Universe. In the South Universe, they were more open-minded than in the East Universe, and over 20 factions maintained a competitive relationship with Zhao Chen.","Zhao Chen ranked only in the middle among these individuals. However, the top-ranking members in the faction had already claimed most of the top resources. Zhao Chen could only use those who had been left behind to benefit himself. As for those who could not compare to Zhao Chen, they did not even have these resources.","If Zhao Chen wanted to strive for talented individuals on behalf of Lin Yuan, he had the ability to do so. However, doing so required him to compete with those stronger than him within the faction, which made Zhao Chen hesitant.","While Zhao Chen was high-profile outside, within the faction, he adopted a more reserved and cautious approach.","Lin Yuan saw Zhao Chen’s hesitation and was even more certain of his guess.","Lin Yuan said, “Brother Zhao, I’m not asking you to help me get these resources for no reason. If you can help me get those outstanding Class 4 talents, I’ll use all the Grade 4 Creator resources to trade. If you can provide me with Class 5 talents, I can use all Grade 5 Creator resources to trade. Every time you trade a Class 5 talent, I will provide you with a channel to trade for Grade 6 Creator resources, so that you can trade for Grade 6 Creator resources through me.”","Lin Yuan would not take the initiative to display Grade 6 Creator resources, but he would not hide them either. He was saying this to provide Zhao Chen with leverage that could help him obtain these resources.","Grade 6 Creator resources were extremely rare for Zhao Chen’s faction. It was even possible that the faction behind Zhao Chen did not have the ability to obtain them. After all, there were only a limited number of Grade 6 Creator resources available, and most of the resources produced by them were in Lin Yuan’s hands. The remaining resources were not enough for those top factions to split.","Zhao Chen’s original intention for establishing a connection with Lin Yuan was to see if he could make more deals with him in the future. However, Lin Yuan was no longer just doing business with Zhao Chen. Instead, he was investing in and nurturing Zhao Chen.","After Lin Yuan said this, both Zhao Chen and Sun Youcai looked at Lin Yuan differently. They had both stretched their estimations of Lin Yuan to the limit, yet they never anticipated that the faction supporting him would possess a Grade 6 Creator. If it wasn’t a faction with a Grade 6 Creator, they wouldn’t have casually taken out Grade 6 Creator resources to trade.","The hidden faction behind Sun Youcai had never obtained the resources of a Grade 6 Creator. The faction behind Zhao Chen did manage to acquire Grade 6 Creator resources in the past, but it came at a great cost, as the elders of the faction sacrificed a great deal of prestige for it.","If he could obtain a channel to trade Grade 6 Creator resources from Lin Yuan, his status within the faction would definitely rise in an instant. Of course, this was on the premise that Lin Yuan’s words were true.","Otherwise, if he were to disclose this information to the faction and ended up not obtaining Grace 6 Creator resources from Lin Yuan, the elders would think Zhao Chen was deceiving them and he would be in trouble.","Originally, Sun Youcai was still treating Lin Yuan as an equal, but after Lin Yuan said this, Sun Youcai immediately lowered his attitude.","When Lin Yuan controlled Traveling Dragon Palace, he had used the name of a Grade 6 Creator. The fact that Traveling Dragon Palace was willing to be controlled by Lin Yuan was directly related to this. In the future, this news would definitely leak out and let Zhao Chen and Sun Youcai know.","If Zhao Chen and Sun Youcai were to learn about the news from Traveling Dragon Palace rather than from Lin Yuan directly, they would likely feel that Lin Yuan was not forthright with them. Lin Yuan might as well just disclose the information directly to the two of them here.","By saying these words in front of Sun Youcai, Lin Yuan was informing Sun Youcai that he could also acquire Grade 6 Creator resources through him. However, if he wanted to trade for Grade 6 Creator resources, he needed to have enough leverage. Otherwise, he would not be able to trade anything with Lin Yuan.","Having been the City Lord of Diverse City for so many years, Zhao Chen was extremely steady. However, after hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Zhao Chen found it difficult to calm down. “Brother Lin, is what you said true? If you can guarantee to trade Grade 6 Creator resources with me, even if it’s just a few trades, as long as my faction knows that there is a chance to trade Grade 6 Creator resources, I can help you secure Class 5 professionals.”","Lin Yuan looked at the excited Zhao Chen and said calmly, “It’s inconvenient to display the resources of a Grade 6 Creator, but these few drops of the essence blood of a pinnacle Bloodian Empress should be enough to prove to you that I have Grade 6 Creator resources.”","Lin Yuan took out a crimson crystal bottle. There were three drops of blood with a hint of rose-red color in it. He opened the bottle cap, and Zhao Chen and Sun Youcai could smell the essence blood of the pinnacle Bloodian Empress.","While this essence blood may not be a resource directly created by a Grade 6 Creator, only Grade 6 Creator resources poured in abundance could facilitate a Bloodian’s growth to this extent.","The two of them were completely unaware that these three drops of Bloodian Empress’ essence blood were actually released by Lin Yuan himself.","Recently, Lin Yuan had been showing off that he had Grace 6 Creator resources and leveraging the influence to establish connections with multiple factions. He remained entirely calm about this matter.","After Lin Yuan had placed the elemental doll in the Element Well, the elemental potion that had been purified by the Element Well’s water had reached pinnacle Grade 5 Creator. Lin Yuan had already verified this with Sun Yin. In other words, as long as Morbius advanced further, producing Grade 6 Creator resources was already a sure bet.","To those experts, the potions produced by Grade 6 Creators were as precious as the spirit qi potions. Those factions were not qualified to be picky at all as being able to trade from them was already not bad.","As long as Lin Yuan contracted another fey, he would be able to evolve Morbius and transform the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After contracting the Enlightenment Cicada, Lin Yuan’s comprehension ability had greatly improved.","In such a short period, he had comprehended a new willpower rune related to illusions, which allowed Lin Yuan to target a functional fey with abilities related to illusions. By contracting this fey and using resources to nurture it, Morbius’ grade and quality would quickly increase and its evolution would be a matter of course.","Zhao Chen forced himself to suppress the excitement in his heart, but his voice was still trembling. “Yes, yes. The essence blood of these pinnacle Bloodian Empresses can naturally prove it. From now on, I, Zhao Chen, will rely on you to nurture me, Brother Lin!”","After speaking to Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen looked at Sun Youcai gratefully and remembered the huge favor he had done for him. If Sun Youcai had not taken the initiative to introduce Lin Yuan to him, it would have been very difficult for him to get to know Lin Yuan.","Looking at Zhao Chen’s grateful gaze, Sun Youcai was still a little stunned. Sun Youcai had no idea that Lin Yuan had a Grade 6 Creator backing him. Even now, he was still inexplicably shocked. At the same time, he was pleasantly surprised. Now that he had gotten to know Lin Yuan, he would also be qualified to exchange for Grade 6 Creator resources in the future.","Sun Youcai would reveal this news to the hidden faction behind him. For a faction that had never obtained the resources of a Grade 6 Creator, it was obvious how shocking the news was. His status in the family would be greatly improved.","If the elders in the faction could obtain the resources of a Grade 6 Creator, it was likely that their strength would have the potential to advance even further. Once the strength of the elders increased, the reputation and status of the hidden faction he belonged to would also advance further.","Lin Yuan was certain of one thing, and that was that the Sky Beyond the Clouds was the same as the main world. Those with high-grade Creator resources had absolute authority. Of course, this was also very related to the resources and strength of high-grade Creators.","Lin Yuan did not know how fast Grade 6 Creators could produce resources. In any case, Grade 5 Creators produced resources very slowly. Once Morbius’ grade advanced, it would be able to produce Grade 6 Creator resources very quickly. The Grade 4 Creator resources that were originally produced would directly become Grade 6 Creator resources.","By that time, Lin Yuan could use these Grade 6 Creator resources not only to enhance the strength of his own people but also to trade with the outside world, acquiring resources that Lin Yuan couldn’t obtain originally and quickly strengthen Sky City. For a long time to come, Sky City would be developing at a rapid pace. It wouldn’t be long before Sky City could truly join the struggle for supremacy in the Sky Beyond the Clouds with the resources of a Grade 6 Creator.","This auction lasted for a full day before Lin Yuan discovered a target that was worthy of his attention.","Zhao Chen hurriedly told Lin Yuan when he saw him suddenly bid, “Brother Lin, this intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman that you are auctioning is indeed very outstanding, but his spiritual veins have already been severed. Now, I’ve managed to sustain them with medicinal ginseng, but they’ll certainly perish in two days. It’s better to leave such an auction item for others to bid for!”"]},{"number":3067,"title":"Chapter 3067: Class 5 Breeder!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3067: Class 5 Breeder!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Zhao Chen spoke, he couldn’t help but feel a bit regretful. This intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, now up for auction, belonged to the Agile Hand Brocade Monkey species and had a highly esteemed emperor bloodline.","Furthermore, he was still young and had significant potential for future development. If not for his imminent death and lack of healing prospects, Zhao Chen’s faction would not have let go of such talent.","Zhao Chen wouldn’t have been willing to use that valuable medicinal ginseng if it weren’t for the worth of this Spirit Craftsman.","He felt no remorse about deceiving those participating in the auction because it was a place where everyone relied on their judgment. Even if someone felt tricked, they wouldn’t dare confront him.","Initially, Zhao Chen’s warning to Lin Yuan was just an attempt to establish a connection. Now, his reminder was motivated by self-interest. If Lin Yuan suffered a loss in this deal, he might not treat Zhao Chen favorably in the future.","After careful consideration, Lin Yuan determined that the intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman could indeed be treated, though it would require some effort. He could manage it.","In Diverse City, Sun Yin could assist. With Sun Yin’s help, healing this Spirit Craftsman wouldn’t be difficult.","Sun Yin had a medicinal pill called the Heart Stabilizing Pill. Dissolved in spirit fluid transformed from pure spirit qi, it became a potion capable of restoring spiritual veins. This pill could heal the Spirit Craftsman’s injuries.","The Heart Stabilizing Pill was refined using a strange flame, an unconventional method among Creators. Many Grade 5 Creators specialized in traditional potion concoctions and couldn’t refine pills with strange flames, making the Heart Stabilizing Pill a high-level resource.","Zhao Chen’s faction had Grade 5 Creators, but their resources were reserved for the faction’s Elders. They wouldn’t provide such resources to a captive, regardless of his talent.","“Brother Zhao, I’m very interested in the auction items now. I have many ways to heal spiritual veins. I’m going to purchase him. If he can be cured, I’ll keep him by my side. If he can’t be cured, it’s fine.”","Lin Yuan prepared to bid.","Zhao Chen hurriedly reminded him, “Brother Lin, even Grade 5 Creator resources might not be enough to recover his spiritual veins. Besides, he doesn’t have much time left.”","When Lin Yuan expressed his intent to buy, Zhao Chen reiterated his warning. Lin Yuan could spend his Creator resources freely, but Zhao Chen didn’t want to be blamed if things went wrong.","“I brought a Grade 5 Creator with me to Diverse City. With their help, I can definitely heal him.”","Upon hearing this, Zhao Chen’s face displayed shock, and Sun Youcai beside him reacted similarly. Could it be that Lin Yuan traveled with a Grade 5 Creator as his servant? If so, Lin Yuan might indeed heal the Spirit Craftsman.","Zhao Chen seized the opportunity to curry favor with Lin Yuan and immediately placed a bid.","Despite organizing the auction, Zhao Chen couldn’t directly pull items from the auction process without affecting his reputation in Diverse City. Thus, to please Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen had to bid himself.","Watching Zhao Chen bid, Sun Youcai thought even someone as shrewd as Zhao Chen could be confused. Zhao Chen wasn’t smart in this matter.","Lin Yuan had already made a deal with Zhao Chen: provide Lin Yuan with talents, and Zhao Chen would receive Grade 6 Creator resources. Given this, Zhao Chen’s attempt to curry favor this way might cause Lin Yuan to misunderstand his intentions. Sun Youcai wouldn’t have done the same.","Sun Youcai wanted to remind Zhao Chen that despite Lin Yuan’s youth, he was astute. However, reminding Zhao Chen might be perceived as biased. In the end, he kept silent.","Lin Yuan said, “I know how to bid for things that interest me, Brother Zhao. I appreciate your kindness.”","With that, Lin Yuan began to bid.","Many factions valued this intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. Zhao Chen highlighted his merits, especially his emperor Agile Hand Brocade Monkey bloodline.","Every piece of equipment crafted by a Spirit Craftsman from this species was a work of art and could be sold for a high price.","Ultimately, Lin Yuan had to bid at least twice the base price to win this intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, leaving Zhao Chen somewhat intimidated.","Zhao Chen felt that he had tricked Lin Yuan and was afraid that he would be displeased. However, Lin Yuan continued to drink as though nothing had happened. Later on, he bid for many talents that he was quite interested in.","Lin Yuan had successfully implanted the image of taking Creator resources lightly into Zhao Chen’s mind. At the same time, it also increased Sun Youcai’s understanding of Lin Yuan.","Although Lin Yuan’s actions seemed like a waste, he had actually exchanged a lot of resources for Sky City’s development. These high-end resources were not so easy to obtain, and they were exactly what Sky City lacked the most. At the same time, Lin Yuan also wanted to show off his skills to Zhao Chen and Sun Youcai so that he could obtain a stable channel to trade talents.","Zhao Chen looked at the time and said, “Brother Lin, the final three pieces of the auction are about to be auctioned. These three final items are all Class 5 professionals. I think you should be interested in these three items, so I asked the auctioneer to highlight the shortcomings of these three items. This will reduce the bidding on these items and prevent you from overspending!”","Upon hearing this, Sun Youcai thought that Zhao Chen’s approach was indeed quite clever, but perhaps not thorough enough. If it were him doing this, Sun Youcai would only take action without deliberately emphasizing anything. When Lin Yuan saw the description of these items, he would naturally know his intentions. Zhao Chen’s actions were a little lacking in consideration. However, it was most likely because Zhao Chen had not tried to please others before.","This time, Lin Yuan did not reject Zhao Chen’s favor. “Brother Zhao, thank you for your consideration!”","While Lin Yuan was talking to Zhao Chen, he saw the Class 5 Gourmet being auctioned off. This Class 5 Gourmet looked intact, but Lin Yuan could sense many bloodthirsty energy fluctuations from her body, indicating there were many parasitic lifeforms in her body.","This Gourmet was an ordinary-looking woman with shoulder-length chestnut-colored hair. She was pressing her chest with a frown as if she was enduring the intense pain in her body.","The auctioneer kept introducing the Class 5 female Gourmet. This Class 5 Gourmet had been parasitized by the Bloodline Corroding Insects’ Insect Queen.","Although the Insect Queen was already dead, there were still many insect offspring left in her body. These insects escaped the control of the Insect Queen and ran amok in the Class 5 Gourmet’s body. If not for the chains made of Insect Suppression Stones that wrapped around the female Class 5 Gourmet’s body, the insects in her body would have eaten this Class 5 Gourmet long ago.","The Heart Corroding Blood Thread’s Insect Queens were extremely valuable insect-species feys. After the Insect Queen died, every offspring had the chance to transform into an Insect Queen. However, if these offspring wanted to successfully transform, they needed to consume a large amount of blood energy.","The Heart Corroding Blood Thread was a functional insect-species fey. The insect molting it produced had the ability to fuse insect-species feys.","After this Class 5 Gourmet’s Heart Corroding Blood Thread’s offspring were taken out, Lin Yuan could use the blood-type spiritual ingredients he had obtained from the Land of Bloodian Ancestors to nurture several Insect Queens.","These spiritual ingredients that could fuse bloodlines were of great research significance to Creators.","Without sufficient blood-type spiritual ingredients, these Heart Corroding Blood Thread’s offspring were worthless. It was also extremely difficult to lure the insects out of this Class 5 Gourmet’s body.","Despite being a Class 5 professional, there were fewer bidders now and it was not as intense as it was when bidding for Class 4 professionals.","Many factions were very curious at this moment. Could it be that the City Lord of Diverse City had changed his ways and was now pointing out the shortcomings of the auction items himself? In the past, no matter how big a problem there was with his items, Zhao Chen would never reveal it.","When they saw that Lin Yuan had been bidding non-stop, the factions quickly gave up on bidding as Lin Yuan’s previous bids had been crazy. This allowed Lin Yuan to bid for this female Class 5 Gourmet at a very reasonable price.","The female Gourmet glanced at Lin Yuan’s VIP room with a hopeful expression. She wondered if the person who bought her could help her cleanse the Heart Corroding Blood Thread in her body.","The second finale item was also a Gourmet. This Gourmet was good at making raw food. None of the core members of Sky City had the habit of eating raw food. However, many of the Creators who joined Sky City later were interested in raw food due to their different bloodlines.","Lin Yuan bid for the Gourmet, whose soul had been injured and was a little silly. When the final item was brought up, the scene became lively. Many factions were unconcerned about the various injuries on this professional’s body because this Class 5 professional was a rare and precious Breeder.","Breeders were very good at cultivating plants. Apart from knowledge, specific bloodlines were required to become this kind of professional.","Breeders were even stronger than Creators of the same level when it came to helping plant-type lifeforms reproduce. They had some methods that even Creators could not compare to.","Zhao Chen said, “This Breeder is someone I fought hard to acquire from my faction, all to boost the reputation of the Diverse Talent Market. Otherwise, this talent market opened by me, the City Lord, will be inferior to Sun Youcai’s.","“In order to fight for the sale rights of this Breeder, I competed with my cousin. This Breeder is an outstanding existence in the entire South Universe battlefield. Grade 4 Creator resources will be able to heal his injuries. Brother Lin, if I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have put this Breeder up for auction at all. Instead, I would have exchanged resources with you.”","The Breeder on the stage was a short but sturdy old man. He stood there with a calm expression, fully aware of his worth. Regardless of which faction purchased him, he knew they would treat him well to ensure his efficiency. As long as he worked hard to help nurture plant-type feys, he could expect significant benefits.","The old man preferred to be bought by a faction specializing in plant-type feys, like Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. He knew they would cherish him. Conversely, other factions might not value him as much.","However, as a commodity, he had no say in who would buy him. If the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall knew of his existence, they would undoubtedly be willing to spend a considerable amount of money.","Currently, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had the highest bid. Zhao Chen, wanting to secure a good price, had informed several factions in advance about the auction. He had specifically informed Bizarre Plant Demon Hall about this Class 5 Breeder to incite fierce bidding.","Due to their unique bloodlines and resources, the Bizarre Plant Demon Hall experts found reproduction extremely challenging. This Class 5 Breeder was practically a savior for them, arguably more valuable than a Grade 5 Creator.","Despite their conflict with Traveling Dragon Palace, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall pooled all their resources. They even agreed to several unreasonable treaties with Gray Smoke Stronghold and borrowed Honor Absent dollars.","The Bizarre Plant Demon Hall’s representative, Wu Xuan, was one of the faction’s four rulers. Chan Jing, an Elder of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, attended the auction as her follower.","Nervously, he asked, “Madam, do you think the resources we prepared will be enough to secure this Class 5 Breeder?”","Wu Xuan, swinging her long brown braid that resembled a scorpion tail, replied, “Zhao Chen informed us about this Class 5 Breeder deliberately. He must have told Traveling Dragon Palace as well. To maximize this Breeder’s value, Zhao Chen will take many measures. Do you really think Traveling Dragon Palace will let us win the bid so easily?”"]},{"number":3068,"title":"Chapter 3068 So It Was Him!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3068 So It Was Him!","Wu Xuan gritted her teeth at the mention of Traveling Dragon Palace.","....","Traveling Dragon Palace’s suppression of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall over the years had almost caused Bizarre Plant Demon Hall to leave Diverse City. If not for the fact that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had to pay a huge price to move out of Diverse City, Wu Xuan would have probably made the decision to leave.","Wu Xuan originally thought that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would continue to live in Diverse City and that Traveling Dragon Palace’s suppression of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would continue.","Unexpectedly, in order to expand, Traveling Dragon Palace actually went beyond Diverse City to develop in other large cities. In the process of developing their forces, they provoked Extreme Wood City’s major faction, Gray Smoke Stronghold.","The two sides fought to the death in Extreme Wood City. Only then did Bizarre Plant Demon Hall see the light.","If not for that, even if he knew that this Class 5 Breeder was being auctioned, Wu Xuan would not have dared to come here to fight for this Class 5 Breeder.","Even though most of Traveling Dragon Palace’s resources had been transported to Extreme Wood City, Traveling Dragon Palace’s resource trade fair had yet to begin.","However, a starving camel was still bigger than a horse. Under such circumstances, it was very likely that Traveling Dragon Palace would fork out more resources than Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","Chan Jing’s expression darkened when he heard Wu Xuan’s words.","“Palace Master, my cousin has been contacting Extreme Wood City. My cousin said that Gray Smoke Stronghold is about to launch a thunderous attack on Traveling Dragon Palace. Gray Smoke Stronghold has also joined forces with many factions to issue an ultimatum to You Tao.","“You Di should also know the situation in Extreme Wood City. He shouldn’t have any intention of targeting Bizarre Plant Demon Hall anymore, right? I will ask the manager of Diverse Auction House to see if Traveling Dragon Palace has anyone participating in this auction. I just gave Manager Lu two jars of Poison Bee Wine. He will definitely help with such a small favor!”","When Wu Xuan heard this, she wanted to say that the auction for this Class 5 Breeder had already begun. What was the point of asking now? Could it be that there was still time for Bizarre Plant Demon Hall to gather resources?","Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had already begun to resist Traveling Dragon Palace. But because they were suppressed by Traveling Dragon Palace all year round, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall was still very afraid of Traveling Dragon Palace. This fear had basically fused into their bones and was very difficult to eliminate in a short period of time.","Before long, Chan Jing, who had left to look for Manager Lu, returned happily.","“Palace Master, I asked the manager of Diverse Talent Market and he said that Traveling Dragon Palace’s people were not present. Traveling Dragon Palace has always been high-profile so we need to show our hand now.","“Traveling Dragon Palace knows about the news but has given up on suppressing Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. I think Traveling Dragon Palace is already at the end of its rope and can’t take out any extra resources!”","If Traveling Dragon Palace wanted to suppress Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, the competition for resources between the two sides would also determine if Traveling Dragon Palace would truly end up suppressed by Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","Once Traveling Dragon Palace was suppressed by Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, Traveling Dragon Palace’s reputation would completely collapse!","Wu Xuan relaxed and began to bid. However, not long after, she realized that the bidding sounds were once again coming from the VIP room where the two Class 5 professionals had just been bid.","The people in this VIP room had bought no less than 20 talents in this trade fair. There was a bid for every talent.","Even if the premium was more than double, they would not relent. They were like lunatics.","Now, the factions in the VIP room had their eyes on this Class 5 Breeder.","If it was any other auction item, Wu Xuan would most likely give up due to the current conflict between Bizarre Plant Demon Hall and Traveling Dragon Palace. However, this Class 5 Breeder was too important to Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. Even if bidding might offend this resource-rich faction, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had to fight to the end.","What Wu Xuan and Chan Jing did not know was that You Di had made up his mind to bid for this Class 5 Breeder after learning of his existence.","Although this Class 5 Breeder was not very useful to the Wandering Dragon Palace, it did not matter if he was useful or not. This Class 5 Breeder could not be left to Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. If Traveling Dragon Palace let Bizarre Plant Demon Hall win this Class 5 Breeder, it would be equivalent to telling the other factions in Diverse City that Traveling Dragon Palace had been kicked out of the ranks of the top factions in Diverse City.","You Di had not come because he had used Sun Yin to establish connections with a faction with a Grade 6 Creator. You Di no longer cared about Bizarre Plant Demon Hall.","There was naturally no need to deliberately target forces that they did not care about.","As long as he could gain a firm foothold in Extreme Wood City with the help of this faction with a Grade 6 Creator, all the previous resources would be worth it.","Traveling Dragon Palace had become a force that spanned two cities. It was much stronger than the other first-rate factions in Diverse City.","At that time, Traveling Dragon Palace would deal with Bizarre Plant Demon Hall with lightning speed and not give the fiends a chance to secretly move out of Diverse City.","After bidding again and again, Wu Xuan looked at Lin Yuan’s VIP room with a livid expression and cursed.","“Damn it. Who’s the one who’s still targeting this Class 5 Breeder despite the double premium?”","Since the price had doubled, Wu Xuan did not continue bidding.","Bizarre Plant Demon Hall could no longer withstand such a price. The other party did not hesitate to raise the price endlessly.","Wu Xuan could not help but think, Can it be that Zhao Chen is deliberately raising the price because Traveling Dragon Palace did not come?","Thinking of this, Wu Xuan hurriedly shook her head. As the City Lord of Diverse City, there was really no need for Zhao Chen to do this. This did not benefit Zhao Chen at all. Moreover, the situation of the two Class 5 professionals who had been bid for was too bad. Zhao Chen could not let such goods stay in his hands forever.","Wu Xuan said after a while, “Chan Jing, go and find out who’s sitting in this VIP room later. It’s best if you can directly communicate with the faction that bid for this Class 5 Breeder and see if you can spend resources to hire this Breeder to serve Bizarre Plant Demon Hall for a few months every year.”","Chan Jing looked at Wu Xuan awkwardly. This was not a pleasant job.","It was not difficult for him to come into contact with this faction. He could send Manager Lu a few more jars of Poison Bee Wine later and get Manager Lu to help introduce him.","Among the thousand-odd types of bee poison in the Poison Bee Wine, a few had certain addictive and soul-stimulating effects.","This was the key to the Poison Bee Wine that the major factions had been passionate about all these years.","The addictive nature of the Poison Bee Wine secretly increased its value. However, even if he successfully came into contact with this faction, how could he ask this faction to lend this Class 5 Breeder to Bizarre Plant Demon Hall?","What if this faction was not a local faction of Diverse City?","With Zhao Chen’s ability, it was not difficult for him to invite the factions outside of Diverse City to participate in the trade fair.","He knew that this mission was not easy to do. But since Wu Xuan had given the order, Chan Jing could not refuse.","Chan Jing originally thought that it would not be difficult to contact this faction through Manager Lu. But after finding Manager Lu and making his request, Manager Lu actually rejected it without thinking.","He did not even accept the Poison Bee Wine that he had sent over, which made Chan Jing feel a little awkward.","“Old Lu, we’re old friends. I’ve helped you a lot before. Why are you rejecting me now that I’m begging you?”","Seeing Chan Jing’s displeased expression, Manager Lu knew that he had obtained many benefits from Chan Jing, so he smiled apologetically.","“Chan Jing, you’re wronging me! You’ve helped me a lot, but I’ve also helped you a lot! I can’t introduce you this time because the guest you want to see was brought here by Sun Youcai.","“The City Lord specially instructed that this person be treated as an esteemed guest and not be disturbed by any factions. If I help you, the City Lord will be unhappy. I still want to keep my position.”","At this point, Manager Lu’s voice lowered.","“In the past, the City Lord would welcome guests everywhere at such a trade fair, but this time, the City Lord seems to have stayed with this VIP the entire time and accompanied him for two days. Do you want me to introduce you to such a person? Do you think my life is too easy?”","With that, Manager Lu patted Chan Jing’s shoulder and left.","Manager Lu looked calm on the surface but he was extremely dissatisfied with Chan Jing. Who did he think he was? He actually dared to bring up the gifts he had given him previously!","If not for Traveling Dragon Palace’s loss of power and the possibility of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall rising, Manager Lu would have directly fallen out with Chan Jing.","As the manager of the Diverse Talent Market, he was also a top figure in the City Lord Manor.","If the people from Bizarre Plant Demon Hall dared to make trouble for him, the City Lord would naturally stand up for him!","When Chan Jing heard Manager Lu mention Sun Youcai, he subconsciously thought of the young man walking beside Sun Youcai.","Could it be that this young man was personally accompanied by the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen, for two days?","Chan Jing could not help but shiver at the thought.","At this moment, Chan Jing suddenly understood why Sun Youcai was so protective of this young man and even reprimanded him for falling out with him.","Fortunately, Manager Lu did not introduce him to this young man. If Zhao Chen had known about the previous conflict after meeting him, the methods Zhao Chen used to please this young man would definitely not be as gentle as Sun Youcai’s.","This matter had spread to Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. Wu Xuan wanted him to befriend this faction and obtain the qualifications to rent this Class 5 Breeder.","Not only did he not do a good job but had also offended this young man with an extremely powerful background.","Even if he was an Elder of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, his days in Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would definitely not be good!","...","After participating in this trade fair, Lin Yuan was invited by Zhao Chen to the City Lord Manor.","Zhao Chen knew that Lin Yuan had come to Diverse City for the first time and wanted to hold a banquet to entertain him. He had invited the reputable top factions of Diverse City to introduce Lin Yuan, but the latter rejected him.","Lin Yuan had never been prepared to walk to the front of the stage and befriend the top factions in Diverse City.","Traveling Dragon Palace was the one that should be developing in Diverse City.","Traveling Dragon Palace was a top faction and was familiar with the other top factions in Diverse City.","After leaving Diverse City this time, Lin Yuan would probably have fewer chances to revisit Diverse City.","Diverse City was too far from North of the Lonely River. Even if it was winter, it would take a long time to travel. Lin Yuan did not want to spend too much time on the road.","Seeing that Lin Yuan had no intention of getting to know the other factions in Diverse City, not only did Zhao Chen not feel regretful, but he was also very happy.","If Lin Yuan did not interact with the other top factions in the city, he would come to him first if anything happened in the future.","After treating Lin Yuan to the most luxurious banquet, Zhao Chen said softly, “Brother Lin, although my family has a Grade 5 Creator, I didn’t have the chance to use the Grade 5 Creator resources.","“I’m a spirit contractor and several of my contracted feys are stuck at the breakthrough point. I need Grade 5 Creator resources to advance. You have a Class 5 Creator with you. Can you ask him to help me customize a batch of potions according to my feys’ actual situations?","“I’ve accumulated a lot of resources over the years. I should be able to pay you. I’m willing to pay a premium of 1.5 times. You can choose any resources in my treasure vault!”","At this point, Zhao Chen’s tone was basically pleading.","Zhao Chen looked overbearing on the outside. But in fact, Zhao Chen was not overbearing. Zhao Chen’s overbearingness was only the appearance he displayed in front of those who were inferior to him. In fact, Zhao Chen was flexible.","Ever since he found out about Lin Yuan’s means, he had never put on airs around Lin Yuan. Instead, he had always kept a low profile.","Zhao Chen’s attitude was so humble that even Sun Youcai felt inferior.","Lin Yuan was very interested in the resources that Zhao Chen had accumulated over the years. Even if Zhao Chen did not make this request, Lin Yuan would most likely ask Zhao Chen if he was interested in trading spiritual ingredients for Creator resources.","Lin Yuan said casually, “The Grade 5 Creator beside me is good at refining pills with strange flames. Moreover, he has just become a Grade 5 Creator, so his ability is limited.”","Zhao Chen subconsciously thought that Lin Yuan was going to reject him.","“Before I leave Diverse City, I’ll send a rather experienced intermediate Grade 5 Creator over to your residence to help you evolve your feys. If you need anything, you can just tell him.”","Lin Yuan did not intend to publicize his relationship with Sun Yin. Ever since Sun Yin came into contact with the Dragon Plum Family and moved into Traveling Dragon Palace, he was already standing on the surface.","Lin Yuan and Sun Yin had not entered Diverse City together, so no one knew about their relationship.","However, if Lin Yuan allowed Sun Yin to come to the City Lord Manor, his relationship with Sun Yin would be exposed.","Sky City had many Grade 5 Creators, so it was easy for Lin Yuan to assign a Grade 5 Creator to a mission.","Zhao Chen looked at Lin Yuan in shock. Even his father had to plead with Grade 5 Creators to work for him!","Zhao Chen had grown up watching those Grade 5 Creators grow up in an advanced manner. How did an intermediate Grade 5 Creator become a tool that Lin Yuan could use at will?","At that moment, Zhao Chen felt that his worldview had been overturned."]},{"number":3069,"title":"Chapter 3069 The Second Element of Utmost Purity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3069 The Second Element of Utmost Purity!","Among the disciples of the secret aristocratic families that Zhao Chen knew, even the core direct descendants of the aristocratic families could not be nonchalantly assigned Grade 5 Creators.","....","However, Lin Yuan could do it.","Zhao Chen was very curious about Lin Yuan’s identity. He thought, Lin Yuan is most likely the direct bloodline of that Grade 6 Creator. Otherwise, why would those Grade 5 Creators give Lin Yuan such respect?","Zhao Chen had begged for this opportunity. When this Grade 5 Creator arrived at his residence, Zhao Chen would definitely treat this Grade 5 Creator well and strive to improve his feys.","Zhao Chen would not hesitate even if he had to exhaust his resources in the end.","As the City Lord of Diverse City, he had many channels to accumulate resources but there were not many opportunities for Grade 5 Creators to customize potions.","If he spent all his resources, he could still continue to obtain more. If his strength increased, his status and influence in the family would greatly increase.","“Brother Lin, thank you so much. If there’s anything you want me to do in the future, I won’t refuse!”","After saying that, Zhao Chen had his servants move the treasures in his treasury to the banquet hall for Lin Yuan to choose from.","There was no price system for asking Creators to concoct potions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The Creator could choose whatever resources they wanted. The deal would only be sealed after Creator had chosen the resources.","However, when they could obtain the potions depended on the Creator’s mood.","Instead of saying that paying resources first was for the convenience of Creators, it was more like a guarantee for the person who customized the potion. They did not have to be afraid that the Creator they found might give up on their order one day.","Soon, Lin Yuan saw Zhao Chen’s collection. Many of the resources were very versatile and were very helpful to the core members of Sky City in strengthening their feys.","The more resources Lin Yuan chose, the happier Zhao Chen would be.","This meant that he would be able to order more potions from the Grade 5 Creator.","If the Grade 6 Creator in the Sky Beyond the Clouds did not take action, the resources from the Grade 5 Creators would be considered the peak. There was nothing in this world that Grade 5 Creator resources could not trade for.","When Lin Yuan opened a brocade box, his eyes suddenly lit up. Inside the brocade box was a crystal emitting five-colored brilliance.","The crystal seemed to have countless tornadoes that were constantly being created and destroyed. This crystal emitting five-colored brilliance was like a world and the tornadoes were constantly destroying, creating and forming things in this world.","Zhao Chen actually had a pure variant of the wind element, which made Lin Yuan think of his contracted Golden Wings.","Shiny also possessed an extremely pure variant of the wind element called the Sacred Golden Wind.","Any elemental energy-to-pure-element variant had great dominance over that element.","There was more than one purity variant of each element and almost all purity variants of each element’s purity variant were different.","However, these pure elemental variants were able to digest and devour each other, thereby strengthening their own pure elemental variants.","If Shiny absorbed the pure mutation of the wind element known as the Five-Colored Ripping Wind, be it its bloodline or its control over wind elements would both greatly increase.","Shiny had long been able to reach the Holy Spirit level. The reason Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to evolve Shiny was that he had been waiting for an opportunity to evolve Shiny.","Lin Yuan had finally waited for this opportunity.","Among all of Lin Yuan’s feys, Shiny could be considered an extremely special one. Lin Yuan had spent a lot of effort on Shiny which had the Barren bloodline.","In order to provide food for Shiny, Lin Yuan had worked with Long Tao to nurture a large number of dragon species to obtain dragon livers.","It could be said that Shiny’s food was the most difficult to provide among all Lin Yuan’s feys.","Lin Yuan had never mistreated Shiny and had high hopes for it.","This allowed Shiny to absorb utmost pure elements when it reached the Divine Kingdom level.","When Lin Yuan was communicating with Ling Muzhuo, he had deliberately mentioned utmost pure elements in order to find opportunities for Shiny.","Lin Yuan remembered that Ling Muzhuo had said to him very seriously that utmost pure elements were the top elemental resources in this world. Even a Grade 5 Creator might not be able to find utmost pure elements of a certain type.","Utmost pure elements were beneficial to any living being that matched their types. It was difficult for such resources to be obtained by individuals.","Ling Muzhuo’s words let Lin Yuan know how rare utmpst pure elements were. At the same time, he knew very well that even if Fortune Treasure Palace really had a collection of pure elements, Ling Muzhuo would not take them out to trade with him.","Ling Muzhuo cared so much about and valued those resources. It would be impossible to obtain them without some channels.","When Lin Yuan first came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, his biggest channel was the Fortune Treasure Palace.","For a moment, Lin Yuan gave up on the idea of searching for wind-type variants.","To be able to see the Five-Colored Ripping Wind at Zhao Chen’s place today and for him to be willing to use the Five-Colored Ripping Wind to trade was definitely a great opportunity for Shiny.","When Zhao Chen saw that Lin Yuan had been observing the Five-Colored Ripping Wind for a long time, he hurriedly said, “Brother Lin, if it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have taken out this pure wind-type element. The Elders of the family had asked me for this Five-Colored Ripping Wind before, but I didn’t take it out.”","Lin Yuan now had a certain understanding of the secret aristocratic families in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Many factions within the secret aristocratic families had been passed down for countless years, and every faction insisted on their own interests. It was the same for everyone in every faction.","Zhao Chen’s so-called not taking it out was actually because the benefits given by the Elders were not good enough.","He and Zhao Chen had just met and Zhao Chen treated him like this because he had abundant resources.","Lin Yuan had always been a very clear-headed person and would not lose himself in other people’s flattery.","Even so, Lin Yuan still accepted Zhao Chen’s favor.","Lin Yuan continued to choose some resources. After that, he returned to Fortune Treasure Palace and did not stay in the City Lord Manor under Zhao Chen’s hospitality.","Apart from the Five-Colored Ripping Wind, Lin Yuan had also obtained a vine that could evolve the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","The Vine Wood True Essence was as beneficial to vine-species feys as it was to wind-type feys. Furthermore, the Vine Wood True Source was extremely gentle. It was not as dangerous as the Five-Colored Ripping Wind.","After Lin Yuan left, Zhao Chen happily stood in the sky garden of the City Lord Manor and looked at the night scenery below as he let out a happy sigh. He finally had a chance to increase the strength of his feys!","Zhao Chen had contracted a few feys. Once the strength of these feys increased, Zhao Chen would be able to increase his ranking ten years later so that he could obtain more authority and resources.","The moment Lin Yuan returned to Fortune Treasure Palace, he entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone and summoned Shiny.","[Fey Name]: Golden Wings","[Fey Species]: Barren-species/feather-winged-species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wind","[Fey Quality]: Medium","[Divine kingdom grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Snapped Neck Falling Death]: When its sharp claws make contact with a target, the target’s neck will be snapped. At the same moment, the Golden Wings will extract the target’s soul and absorb the soul into its feathers. The soul will imbue the storm patterns on the feathers with intelligence.","[Flowing Wind Claws]: When the wind elements in the Golden Wings’ feathers are released into the environment, it will be able to control the surrounding winds and manipulate it to attack its opponent. The attacked target will feel like it is being slashed by claws. After attacking a target, the Golden Wings will also be able to inject wind elements into its target through explosions and cause double the amount of damage.","[Rapid Wind Whistle]: By flapping its wings to activate wind-elemental energy, it will simultaneously let out a roar that causes both physical and elemental damage to a designated target. A headwind will also lower the target’s speed. Each time a headwind is released, its own speed will be increased.","[Hurricane Added Protection]: A vicious hurricane shield will be added to one’s own body. Every time elemental damage is inflicted on it, the hurricane shield will absorb the damage before reflecting it. The hurricane shield can also absorb wind-elemental energy from the surroundings to replenish the wind-elemental energy in its body.","[Folded Wings Wind Valley]: With the Golden Wings at the center, an environment charged with wind-elemental energy will be formed. Wind-elemental energy will be continuously produced in this environment. When it makes a sacrifice to this territory, the wind-elemental energy will be absorbed into its bloodline and trigger a one-time explosion.","[Disappearing Wind Attack]: Its body will be combined with wind elements. Even a slight breeze will be enough for it to hide within. While it is hiding in the wind, it will be immune to damage as long as the wind remains.","[Revived Seasonal Winds]: The wind elements’ state will be changed. The wind elements will gain powerful healing abilities. Targets will be healed wherever the winds exist. They will continue to heal as long as the wind does not stop moving.","[Swift Wind Death]: The sharpness of wind elements will be activated. The wind elements will change into wild winds that will continuously attack the target until the target has been ground to pieces. The sharpness of the wind elements will have Flowing Wind Claws’ tearing effects and Snapped Neck Falling Death’s bone-breaking effects.","[Elemental Sword Feathers]: All the feathers will be elementalized. The pure elemental traits in the feathers will be activated. When the feathers are attacked and damaged, the wind flowing in the environment will naturally replenish the feathers. The feathers can be shot into the outside world and will have penetrating effects.","[Sacred Golden Wind]: All the wind elements under its control will be transformed into sacred gold wind. The sacred gold wind will go beyond the regular elemental state. The lowest elemental state will have damaging and immunity effects.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Unset State]: When interacting with another fey, the Golden Wings can copy the fey’s exclusive skill and triggered abilities. Unset State will then turn into the copied exclusive skill and triggered ability. The abilities can only be switched out once every lunar cycle.","[Wind’s Descendant]: By placing itself as the heart of all wind elements, it will become the eye of a hurricane and control all of the surrounding wind elements. It will become the master while all other winds will become its disciple.","[Summoning Wind Changing Spirit]: Use wind elements to accommodate other elemental energy and turn them into vassals of the wind elements. In extreme environments, the accommodated elemental energy can change its own attributes and allow it to become better affiliated with the environment as well as use elemental attacks of different elemental types.","[Whirling Wind Compression]: Use the energy in its body to compress and coordinate wind-elemental energy. The wind elements will be tightly locked together and will resonate. Its ability to control wind elements will be stronger than that of the natural environment and it will become stronger at controlling wind elements in different elements. The power of its abilities and exclusive skills related to wind will also be strengthened.","[Golden Wind Enters Body]: The sacred golden wind will be absorbed into the body and be used to change the body. The sacred golden wind will transform into sacred entities that command wind elements and will be able to suppress all inferior wind elements. In the transformed state, it will be able to comprehensively increase its energy and the characteristics it controls.","[Wind Territory Release]: The sacred golden energy will be released into the surrounding environment. The environment filled with the sacred golden wind will be under its control and the wind territory under its control will suppress lifeforms of other types. Each suppressed target will lead to an increase in the wind speed of the sacred golden wind in the wind territory.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Sacred Golden Wind Nest]: A large nest of faith power will be created in the divine kingdom. The sacred golden wind can be released from the body in the nest and condensed into sacred golden wind crystals.","Shiny had already evolved to World Emperor X. In terms of divine kingdom evolution, Shiny was faster than all of Lin Yuan’s feys.","The reason why Shiny’s divine kingdom evolved so quickly was because of the Sacred Golden Wind that Shiny had.","Shiny’s divine kingdom had already produced wind-type lifeforms using Sacred Golden Wind.","Chimey’s divine kingdom was at a disadvantage when compared to Shiny. This made Lin Yuan realize the power of utmost pure elements once again!","When Shiny was by Lin Yuan’s side, it habitually changed its form. However, even when it changed its form, it could not stand on Lin Yuan’s shoulder like Chimey.","If it stood on Lin Yuan’s shoulder, Shiny’ sharp claws would pierce through his shoulder.","“Yuan, you said you have something good for me. What is it? I’ll invite Chimey to evolve the divine kingdom with me later. I want to make my divine kingdom stronger so that I can protect you!”","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, spirit contractors were so noble that some large clans would prioritize disciples with spirit contractor talents.","It was not only because the contracted feys of the spirit contractors were stronger in combat. When the contracted feys reached the Holy Spirit level, the divine kingdoms of these creatures would be located around the contracted divine kingdoms and become the country’s defense. When the divine kingdom was invaded, the defenses would prioritize helping to defend against the invaders.","Shiny had been working hard for this.","Lin Yuan looked at Shiny and thought, Shiny’s temperament is completely different from when it was young!"]},{"number":3070,"title":"Chapter 3070 Vine Bloodline Metamorphosis!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3070 Vine Bloodline Metamorphosis!","When it was young, Shiny was mischievous and playful. Back then, the Spirit Lock spatial zone was still small. All the lifeforms in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls included, were pranked by Shiny. This made Chimey hate Shiny. It did not like to play with it at all.","....","Now that Shiny had grown up, it no longer had the temperament it had when he was young. This made Chimey enjoy increasing its strength with Shiny.","Lin Yuan did not keep Shiny in suspense and took out the brocade box containing the Five-Colored Ripping Wind.","Before Lin Yuan could open the brocade box, Shiny sensed the pure wind elements’ aura inside. Shiny could not help but swoop down excitedly on Lin Yuan’s head and dance around in a circle.","Shiny could directly sense the benefits of the Five-Colored Ripping Wind in the brocade box. It could even use this opportunity to reach the Holy Spirit level.","There were some problems with the evolution of Shiny’s divine kingdom. The main reason for this was that Shiny’s divine kingdom did not have a holy spirit.","Once Shiny’ss divine kingdom had a holy spirit, the situation would be completely different!","With the holy spirit’s support, Shiny’s divine kingdom’s evolution speed would definitely increase greatly from its original foundation.","Furthermore, Shiny who had absorbed the Sacred Golden Wind could easily absorb the Five-Colored Ripping Wind which was also an utmost pure wind element.","With Shiny mastering two utmost pure wind elements, the evolution and breeding speed of the divine kingdom’s lifeforms would increase.","Lin Yuan opened the brocade box so Shiny could eat the crystallized Five-Colored Ripping Wind.","Shiny needed a certain amount of time to absorb the Five-Colored Ripping Wind. It would not take too long for it to fuse with an utmost pure wind element.","Even though Shiny had already grasped an extremely pure wind element, it was still rather difficult for it to absorb the Five-Colored Ripping Wind. Shiny needed to use the Sacred Golden Wind to fuse the Five-Colored Ripping Wind with itself.","While Shiny was absorbing the Five-Colored Ripping Wind, Lin Yuan summoned Green Vine.","Compared to its original body, Green Vine preferred to appear beside Lin Yuan in human form.","The Vine Wood True Source that Lin Yuan had traded with Zhao Chen was not only suitable for Green Vine but also for Red Thorn.","However, compared to this kind of wood-type treasure, Red Thorn paid more attention to improving its fairy bloodline.","Green Vine had always been the strongest among Lin Yuan’s feys.","However, as increasing one’s strength at the Divine Kingdom level required faith power, the speed at which Green Vine increased its strength had slowed down. Until now, Green Vine was still a step away from the Holy Spirit level. This made it a little depressed.","Before stepping into the Divine Kingdom level, Green Vine was a fey that purely fought for a living. After reaching the Divine Kingdom level, it obtained a divine kingdom ability called Bloodline Abundant Harvest.","The power of the divine kingdom’s bloodline made Green Vine an expert at extracting bloodlines. As long as the corpse of any lifeform was placed in Green Vine’s divine kingdom, Green Vine could refine the power of the bloodline by providing it with faith power.","The strength of the bloodline power was also related to the faith power provided by Green Vine.","The transformation of Green Vine from a pure combat-type fey to a functional-type fey was a good thing for Lin Yuan.","After providing Green Vine with the Vine Wood True Source, it was a sure bet that Green Vine would enter the Holy Spirit level.","Compared to Green Vine improving its combat abilities, Lin Yuan hoped that Green Vine could strengthen its functional abilities.","The higher the level he reached, the more Lin Yuan felt that functional abilities were more important than combat abilities.","Of course, a large part of the reason Lin Yuan felt this way was that he had Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter by his side, so he did not have to worry about his own safety.","If Lin Yuan could not even guarantee his own safety, he would definitely not think that way!","Green Vine bowed to Lin Yuan.","“Yuan, it’s been a long time. I realized that even with the large amount of resources you provided for me, the evolution speed of my divine kingdom still can’t increase. The level of the divine kingdom is still miniature and the degree of evolution is less than 2%!”","As it spoke, Green Vine looked at Shiny in admiration. At the Divine Kingdom level, Green Vine found it difficult to move.","Lin Yuan could sense Green Vine’s distress and said seriously, “You’ve just reached the divine kingdom not long ago. Which lifeform in the Sky Beyond the Clouds doesn’t need a long time to evolve from the Divine Kingdom to the Holy Spirit level? You really don’t have to belittle yourself! As long as you continue to work hard to improve like you’re doing now, you will definitely be ahead of the others!","“Moreover, your bloodline is outstanding to begin with. Every vine can absorb something to strengthen itself. Season Cycle gave you the bloodline of a higher faerie After absorbing Season Cycle’s bloodline, even if you haven’t reached the Holy Spirit level, you’re still able to roll grades to fight.”","Lin Yuan could sense Green Vine’s lack of confidence. What he needed to do now was to give it confidence.","Lin Yuan took out the Vine Tree True Source and said, “When you absorb it later, your bloodline should improve according to your current foundation. At that time, the evolution of your divine kingdom will definitely accelerate correspondingly. If you encounter suitable resources in the future, I’ll provide them to you!”","Lin Yuan did not have much contact with Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. But because of Traveling Dragon Palace, Lin Yuan and Bizarre Plant Demon Hall were destined to become mortal enemies!","Lin Yuan did not need to deal with Bizarre Plant Demon Hall personally. Traveling Dragon Palace would most likely be able to deal with them on their own.","Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, a faction formed by plants, definitely had spiritual ingredients that could improve Green Vine and the Jasmine Lily.","Even if they did not, the corpses of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall’s experts would be quite beneficial to Green Vine.","After clearing Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, Lin Yuan would use the resources he obtained to strengthen his feys and increase his strength.","The development of the faith country was already on the right track. Every second, the faith country produced a large amount of faith power that would be stored by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus.","Through this faith power, Lin Yuan could raise the strength of all the core members of the faith country to pinnacle Holy Spirit level.","If one wanted to take another step forward after reaching pinnacle Holy Spirit level, it was not something that could be achieved with just the accumulation of resources. It also depended on opportunities.","When Green Vine saw the Vine Tree True Source in Lin Yuan’s hand, it happily took it and began to absorb it.","When absorbing the Vine Wood True Source, Green Vine transformed into its original form. Green Vine in its true form was huge and strange. The eight vines contained special auras. These eight auras were shocking and each of them surpassed the level of Green Vine.","It was not easy to find items for Green Vine in the main world but it was undoubtedly much easier to find items for Green Vine in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","After continuous changes, Lin Yuan finally confirmed the existence of the eight items that were most compatible with each other. This allowed Green Vines to develop in all aspects without any obvious shortcomings.","The Vine Wood True Source was extremely suitable for plant-type feys. It was not difficult for Green Vine to absorb the Vine Wood True Source.","After Green Vine changed into its original form, its aura began to break through continuously.","The eight vines of Green Vine became visibly thicker.","To Lin Yuan’s surprise, four new vines emerged from the main trunk of Green Vine.","Green Vine had four more vines and could absorb four more advanced items through these four vines, which was equivalent to multiplying the strength of the original Green Vine.","This was the effect of the Vine Wood True Source improving Green Vine’s bloodline.","The moment Green Vine reached the Holy Spirit level and condensed a holy spirit, its size tripled. A fierce and wild aura surged over.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Holy Spirit Green Vine.","[Fey Name]: Perfect Touch Wisteria","[Fey Species]: Strong armor wisteria species/long wisteria species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Forbidden Growth]: After contracting any lifeform, it can break the limit that comes with the contract. As long as it has sufficient energy, it will be able to continuously increase its power. When it has absorbed the maximum amount of energy, it will be able to comprehend a required Willpower Rune.","[Peak Sturdiness]: A large amount of the absorbed energy can be used up to increase the durability of the vines. When injured, the energy can also be used to repair the vines.","[Long Vine Application]: Choose two vines that will be applied to one vine. The vine with the two vines applied on it will be able to gain the two vines’ abilities.","[Paralysizing Vine Sap]: When damage is sustained, the vine sap with paralyzing effects can be sprayed out from the wound.","[Brutally Pushing Out of Soil]: When faced with the opponent’s defenses, the seeds’ sprouting strength can be activated to help to break past the opponent’s defenses.","[Root’s Parasitic Restraints]: Pick a target and the target’s body will become soil where roots will grow. The roots will absorb the target’s vitality to cause harm to the target.","[Splitting Illusionary Spikes]: When the illusionary spikes pierce a target’s body, the illusionary spikes will turn into a seed that will germinate in the target’s body and produce even more illusionary spikes.","[Avoidance Wedge]: Every time the Perfect Touch Wisteria is injured, a wedge will grow over its surface. Every three layers will turn into a sharp spike that will be able to increase the vines’ effects while boosting them.","[Combined Vines Defense]: Pick a target to apply to and help it to defend against external attacks. The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s own vitality will be sacrificed to protect the target it is applied to.","[Climbing Vine Armor Transformation]: Its body will transform into an armor and its body will be linked to the target’s energy source. In its armor state, its bloodline will be boosted and the effects will show after the armor state is removed.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Swallow Same Source]: Every vine will have the same grade and quality but they can be separated to act as individual entities. Every vine can consume something and take control of its attributes. The swallowed entity cannot be spat out but it can be replaced by an even higher level item. (Once it gains attributes, the vine cannot be separated again.)","[Broken Vine Replacement]: When a vine is destroyed during combat, another vine can be picked to take on the damage instead to save the first vine.","[Energy Gather Illusionary Thorn]: The energy within the vines can be gathered at a certain spot. An illusionary thorn comprised of energy will sprout from this spot. The illusionary thorn will be undetectable.","[Tactile Vine Wood World]: All of the wood-type energy and vitality stored within the vines will be released. The wood-type energy and vitality will transform into a large number of vines. The vines will intertwine and form a world of vines. The main body will fuse with this world to attack targets. Before the wooden world is broken, all the damage sustained by the main body will be reduced and shouldered by the wooden world.","[Entire Body Medium]: Sacrifice the item that the vine had absorbed and release the source of the item through a medium. The released source will not have any knowledge but will possess all of its original power. (Compare the proportion of energy that the source comprises of within the item to determine how long the released source will be able to remain outside.)","[Vine Tempering Garrotte]: Use the long vines to garrotte other lifeforms. If the target’s bloodline is more elite than that of the Perfect Touch Wisteria, it can absorb the target’s bloodline to strengthen its own bloodline. This will also strengthen every vine that has absorbed an entity through Swallow Same Source.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Bloodline Abundant Harvest]: When the divine tree growing in the divine kingdom consumes a corpse and its bloodline, fruits bearing the bloodline power will grow on the tree. The concentration of bloodline power in the fruit will be linked to the faith power supplied to the tree by the divine tree. The more faith power is supplied, the stronger the concentration of bloodline power in the fruits.","[Vine Bloodline Metamorphosis]: Separate a portion of its vines and plant them in the divine kingdom. Implant the condensed bloodline fruits into the separated vines. The vines will undergo specialization according to the absorbed bloodline and become a special lifeform that wanders in the divine kingdom. (Although lifeforms that do not grow from the divine kingdom will not be rejected by the divine kingdom and affect the natural evolution of the divine kingdom, their bodies will turn back into nutrients to nourish the divine kingdom after they die.)","The divine kingdom ability that Green Vine had obtained after reaching the Holy Spirit level, Vine Bloodline Metamorphosis, surprised Lin Yuan. This ability was a defensive ability against divine kingdoms.","Lin Yuan had seen many divine kingdoms and holy spirits, but this was his first time seeing such an ability!","Green Vine had always despised the slow evolution of its divine kingdom. However, with Vine Bloodline Metamorphosis, no matter how slow the evolution of Green Vine’s divine kingdom was, its defense would be the strongest for a very long time!","Not only that, but the special lifeforms produced through the vines and bloodline of Green Vine would not affect the subsequent evolution of the divine kingdom.","After these special lifeforms died, they could still create value to nourish the divine kingdom.","From a certain point of view, Vine Bloodline Metamorphosis could also be considered a special functional divine kingdom ability."]},{"number":3071,"title":"Chapter 3071 We Are Already Friends!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3071 We Are Already Friends!","Over the past few days, Lin Yuan had stayed in Fortune Treasure Palace and did not go out again. It was more difficult for Shiny to absorb the Five-Colored Wind Ripping than he had expected.","....","A few days ago, an accident had almost happened during the absorption process. Fortunately, Shiny had sought Lin Yuan’s help in time.","Lin Yuan used a large number of wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to enable Shiny to use the Sacred Metal Wind to suppress the Five-Colored Ripping Wind.","Otherwise, if the Five-Colored Ripping Wind suppressed the Sacred Gold Wind’s absorption, Shiny’s essence would definitely be greatly affected.","Lin Yuan, who had been worried about Shiny for the past few days, was not in the mood to accept Sun Youcai and Zhao Chen’s invitations.","Shiny’s condition had stabilized and the Sacred Golden Wind had completely suppressed the Five-Colored Ripping Wind.","Shiny had already begun absorbing the Sacred Gold Wind’s energy as it began controlling the pure wind element.","Lin Yuan was not even in the mood to participate in Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair. In any case, even if Lin Yuan did not go, Sun Yin would still bid for the resources Lin Yuan needed.","Wan Ying sat in her office with a horrible expression. She knew that Lin Yuan had participated in the high-end talent auction organized by Zhao Chen through Sun Youcai.","Wan Ying also wanted to provide this channel to Lin Yuan but she had not received an invitation from the Diverse Talent Market.","Lin Yuan had not gone out since he came back and he had been rejecting Feng Qian and Ding Tao’s enthusiastic service. Wan Ying could not help but wonder if Lin Yuan was dissatisfied with Fortune Treasure Palace for not doing a good job.","Ling Muzhuo was about to arrive. If Lin Yuan expressed his dissatisfaction with Fortune Treasure Palace in front of him, not only would Feng Qian and Ding Tao suffer, but she would also be implicated.","Today was the day of Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair. Lin Yuan had asked Fortune Treasure Palace for the opportunity to participate in the trade fair.","Wan Ying wondered if she should use this as an excuse to meet Lin Yuan. She could use this opportunity to find out if Lin Yuan had any opinions about Fortune Treasure Palace.","Just as Wan Ying was hesitating, there was a knock on the office door.","Wan Ying nodded at the white tiger licking its claws at the door. The white tiger gently opened the door.","Seeing that it was Feng Qian and Ding Tao standing outside the door, Wan Ying waved at them.","Ding Tao said in fear, “Sister Wan Ying, Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair is about to begin. Young Master Lin has no intention of setting off. Do you think we should remind Young Master Lin?","“If Young Master Lin doesn’t have any intention of going, we can’t really leave the quota we obtained from Traveling Dragon Palace empty. Traveling Dragon Palace is holding this trade fair to sell resources. If we remain idle because of this, Traveling Dragon Palace will definitely have objections.”","Wan Ying did not care if Traveling Dragon Palace had any opinions about her. She was more concerned about Lin Yuan’s attitude.","Wan Ying asked Feng Qian and Ding Tao, “Did you see Young Master Lin when you went to deliver food to him last night?”","Feng Qian was the first to speak. “Sister Wan Ying, we didn’t see Young Master Lin but we saw Young Master Lin’s guard. That guard didn’t want the food we sent over but he asked us to prepare some dragon liver and phoenix blood. I think Young Master Lin must have been hindered by something these few days and doesn’t really have any objections about us!","“If Young Master Lin really has any objections about us, he won’t take resources from Fortune Treasure Palace anymore! I think we need to invite Young Master Lin. If we really did something wrong, we can find out from Young Master Lin and correct it in time!”","Feng Qian had never been afraid of anything happening. The first thing she would do when something happened was to think of a solution. She was not as flustered as Ding Tao.","Wan Ying stood up.","“Let’s go and meet Young Master Lin together. Coincidentally, Fortune Treasure Palace has just received a new batch of resources. If Young Master Lin is interested, we can trade this batch of resources.”","Feng Qian once again felt Wan Ying’s cautious attitude toward Lin Yuan.","Feng Qian had thought of currying favor with Lin Yuan, which meant she would seduce him.","As a receptionist of Fortune Treasure Palace, she had obtained an extraordinary friendship with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was very young and the lifeforms who had lived for less than a hundred years had limited experience, especially those who came from wealthy families. It was rare for them to develop feelings at such a young age.","However, Feng Qian quickly gave up on this evil thought.","Firstly, Lin Yuan’s status was too noble and he had guards by his side. Secondly, once she did this, the impact would be too great. Since she represented Fortune Treasure Palace, Wan Ying would not spare her!","After thinking about it, Feng Qian did not have any strange thoughts about Lin Yuan.","Her and Ding Tao’s looks could be said to be the best, but Lin Yuan did not seem to be enthusiastic about their looks. His attitude was polite and distant. At that time, even if she really took action, she would most likely end up in failure.","Wan Ying had just arrived at Lin Yuan’s residence with Feng Qian and Ding Tao when she saw Lin Yuan walking out with his guards.","Wan Ying immediately went forward and said warmly, “Young Master Lin, I’ve seen that you haven’t gone out for the past few days. I wonder if it’s because Fortune Treasure Palace has done something wrong. If there’s really anything that we didn’t do well, we will definitely correct it seriously so that you won’t have any bad feelings in the future!","“In addition, I just received a batch of supplies two days ago. These supplies are qualified to be displayed as exhibits. If you’re interested, I can take you to see this batch of supplies after you participate in the trade fair.”","Wan Ying did not play any tricks on Lin Yuan because she knew that being sincere to Lin Yuan was her ultimate move.","For someone like Lin Yuan who even Ling Muzhuo cared so much about, there was no need for her to care about her pride in front of Lin Yuan.","Zhan Lu, the person in charge who was far away in Treasure City, had made two consecutive jumps in his rating because he had gotten close to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan raised his eyes and looked at Wan Ying seriously. He could sense Wan Ying’s fawning and enthusiasm toward him, so much so that Wan Ying was willing to trade the resources she had just received with him.","Lin Yuan had always been kind to such people.","The news of him sending a Grade 5 Creator to Diverse City to help Zhao Chen concoct potions would definitely spread. It could not be hidden from Wan Ying.","Lin Yuan had already passed down the order. The intermediate Grade 5 Creator heading to Diverse City was Zhuo Yan, who was familiar with Sun Yin.","Although Zhuo Yan did not become a Class 5 Creator naturally because of her talent and had used some special methods, her ability was definitely one of the best among the intermediate Grade 5 Creators.","“Many thanks to Manager Wan for thinking of me immediately after obtaining the resources. In a few days, an intermediate Grade 5 Creator will head to Diverse City. At that time, I can introduce this intermediate Grade 5 Creator to you. If you need any Grade 5 potions, you can trade with her directly.”","Wan Ying’s heart skipped a beat. Although Lin Yuan did not say what his relationship with this intermediate Grade 5 Creator was, Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to making decisions for the Grade 5 Creator.","Wan Ying’s serious reception of Lin Yuan was to help Ling Muzhuo and fight for some opportunities for herself.","At first, Wan Ying thought that the opportunity she wanted could only be given to her by Ling Muzhuo. However, she did not expect Lin Yuan to be willing to provide her with an opportunity so that she could obtain the help of an intermediate Grade 5 Creator.","At a time like this, Wan Ying naturally could not pretend to be polite and reject Lin Yuan. She hurriedly bowed to express her gratitude.","“Young Master Lin, thank you for your appreciation and favor. Thank you for being willing to help me get to know this intermediate Grade 5 Creator and trade with them. From now on, if you come to me about Fortune Treasure Palace’s internal affairs, I will definitely help you! Even if it’s something outside of my duty, I will help you privately!”","Feng Qian and Ding Tao were very envious. Both of them were surprised that Lin Yuan would use a resource like a Grade 5 Creator to repay Wan Ying.","This could no longer be described as generosity.","As a high-level manager of Fortune Treasure Palace, Wan Ying had a chance to come into contact with Grade 5 Creators.","However, Wan Ying needed the honor points of Fortune Treasure Palace to ask these Grade 5 Creators for help.","Honor points could only be obtained by contributing to Fortune Treasure Palace.","Honor points were too precious and were accumulated very slowly. It would take thousands of years to accumulate enough honor points to find a Grade 5 Creator to help. Moreover, it was only to gain a Grade 5 Creator’s help. When a Class 5 Creator helped, they had to give additional resources.","Wan Ying had always criticized Fortune Treasure Palace for treating Grade 5 Creators too well. These Grade 5 Creators had joined Fortune Treasure Palace to receive the faction’s support. But in fact, they had not given much back to Fortune Treasure Palace.","Of course, Wan Ying only dared to complain in her heart and did not dare to say these words out loud. If those Grade 5 Creators heard this and were offended, Wan Ying would not be able to bear the consequences even though she was a senior member of Fortune Treasure Palace!","In any faction, the Creators were the highest-level members.","Lin Yuan said, “Manager Wan, I’ve always liked to make friends. If you’re willing to treat me like this, I think we can be considered friends now. I’ve always been generous to my friends. If you have any problems in the future, you can look for me.”","Lin Yuan had never said this to Zhan Lu.","Firstly, Zhan Lu had his own selfish motives when he interacted with Lin Yuan, and the latter could clearly sense it.","Secondly, Zhan Lu did not have the ability and qualifications to be friends with Lin Yuan.","However, Wan Ying was different. Wan Ying could already hold sway in Fortune Treasure Palace. There was not much difference between her and Ling Muzhuo, a Palace Lord of Fortune Treasure Palace.","There were many things that Lin Yuan could not ask Ling Muzhuo for help, but he could trouble Wan Ying.","When Wan Ying communicated with him, she mentioned Ling Muzhuo more than once. This meant that Wan Ying was on Ling Muzhuo’s side.","Ling Muzhuo had nothing to worry about when Lin Yuan communicated with Wan Ying in the future.","Wan Ying wanted to befriend Lin Yuan but she had never thought that she could become friends with him. She was too lucky to be friends with him!","There was no need for Lin Yuan to lie to her about such matters. She would have another way out in the future.","Wan Ying did not forget about Feng Qian and Ding Tao as she said, “Young Master Lin, I’ve been arranging for Feng Qian and Ding Tao to serve you for the past few days. What do you think of them? It won’t be long before Feng Qian and Ding Tao head to other cities to be managers of Fortune Treasure Palace there. When you reach the city where Feng Qian and Ding Tao are, you can arrange for them to receive you.”","Feng Qian and Ding Tao revealed grateful expressions when they heard Wan Ying’s words. The two of them were very glad that they could follow Wan Ying. Wan Ying could still think of them at a time like this!","Winter looked at Wan Ying and thought. Wan Ying is a very smart person. She’s able to help her subordinates at the same time without making Young Master annoyed.","This was because Wan Ying’s words were all for Lin Yuan’s sake.","Lin Yuan looked at Feng Qian and Ding Tao, causing their chests to tighten.","“The two of them are very attentive and considerate. If I have the chance in the future to go to the city where the two of them are, I will definitely stay in Fortune Treasure Palace.","Feng Qian and Ding Tao were overjoyed. They were not happy because Lin Yuan said that he wanted to settle down in their city, but they were happy because of Lin Yuan’s evaluation of them. Lin Yuan’s evaluation of the two of them guaranteed an increase in their rankings.","Feng Qian and Ding Tao did not care if Lin Yuan would come to their cities after this because it was a distant matter.","...","Zhao Chen did not know that Lin Yuan was preparing to go to Traveling Dragon Palace to participate in this trade fair, so he had a lot of opinions about Traveling Dragon Palace.","Traveling Dragon Palace was a local faction in Diverse City—they represented the power of city.","In order to develop Traveling Dragon Palace, Zhao Chen secretly invested a lot of resources into it.","If not for this, Traveling Dragon Palace would not have developed so quickly in these years.","Zhao Chen had invested so much effort into Traveling Dragon Palace. While Traveling Dragon Palace appreciated it, they did not follow Zhao Chen’s wishes to cultivate in Diverse City. Instead, they stubbornly wanted to develop in Extreme Wood City.","Developing a faction in Extreme Wood City would be equivalent to transferring a large number of resources from Diverse City to Extreme Wood City!","Zhao Chen had sought out Traveling Dragon Palace’s First Palace Master, You Tao, several times.","You Tao’s attitude toward him was very good, but what was the use of having a good attitude?","You Tao was unwilling to give up on his plan to develop in Extreme Wood City. In order to deal with the trouble he encountered in Extreme Wood City, he had basically sent most of the foundation of Diverse City to Extreme Wood City.","The more Zhao Chen thought about it, the angrier he became.","If not for Traveling Dragon Palace’s influence, Zhao Chen would not have been able to resist attacking it.","Now, Traveling Dragon Palace was not holding this trade fair to sell resources to promote the development of Diverse City but to use the city’s resources to fill the hole in Extreme Wood City and fight Gray Smoke Stronghold to the death."]},{"number":3072,"title":"Chapter 3072: Traveling Dragon Palace’s Message!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3072: Traveling Dragon Palace’s Message!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Gray Smoke Stronghold had been cultivating in Extreme Wood City for so many years. It was also a veteran faction and had existed for much longer than Traveling Dragon Palace.","This was not the first time Zhao Chen suspected that the City Lord of Extreme Wood City was involved in the battle between Gray Smoke Stronghold and Traveling Dragon Palace.","The origins of the City Lord of Extreme Wood City were very mysterious, and he had a high status in the Honor Absent Parliament.","Zhao Chen had very little contact with the City Lord of Extreme Wood City. He had no enmity with the City Lord and did not think that the City Lord would do such a thing.","However, the current situation of resources flowing out of Diverse City was too serious. Zhao Chen had no choice but to think about it. As the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen had to be responsible for the factions under him. If the faction behind him knew about the outflow of resources from Diverse City, he would more or less be questioned.","Under such circumstances, Zhao Chen naturally would not attend Traveling Dragon Palace’s trade fair.","Fortune Treasure Palace did not reveal that Lin Yuan was going to participate in the trade fair.","With Sun Yin’s permission, Traveling Dragon Palace only released the news two hours before the trade fair began. He revealed that a Grade 5 Creator would participate in the trade fair.","In the future, this Grade 5 Creator would stay in Traveling Dragon Palace as a sponsor.","You Di, the Second Palace Master of the Wandering Dragon Palace, did not deliberately publicize this news after releasing it. This news quickly spread throughout Diverse City.","The factions that had been qualified to attend this trade fair were overjoyed. They were all hoping to get a chance to come into contact with this Grade 5 Creator.","Those factions that had not intended to participate in the trade fair started to have ideas. In order to meet this Grade 5 Creator, they began to use their connections to fight for the right to participate in the trade fair.","Ding Tao and Feng Qian had already left with Lin Yuan.","Wan Ying had just heaved a sigh of relief when she received this news. Many factions were asking Fortune Treasure Palace for a spot.","There were only five spots in Fortune Treasure Palace, and more than half of them had been given to Lin Yuan. Even if those factions promised them great benefits, Wan Ying could not reduce Lin Yuan’s quota.","Wan Ying thought for a moment and sent a message to Feng Qian and Ding Tao, asking them to carefully serve Lin Yuan and see if they could get in touch with this Grade 5 Creator and strive to foster their relationship with this Grade 5 Creator to turn her into a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace.","Feng Qian and Ding Tao often did this kind of thing. The two of them had always been very good at it.","Otherwise, Feng Qian and Ding Tao would not have become subordinates that Wan Ying valued so much. She would not even hesitate to use her own favors to help the two of them.","Zhao Chen was surprised when he received the news.","According to Zhao Chen’s information, Traveling Dragon Palace was already at the end of its rope. All the resources that could be mobilized had been used up.","In the end, Traveling Dragon Palace played the Grade 5 Creator card. This was something Zhao Chen did not expect.","Traveling Dragon Palace had brought out a Grade 5 Creator. With this Grade 5 Creator helping them, regardless of whether Traveling Dragon Palace could gain a place in Extreme Wood City while being targeted by Gray Smoke Stronghold. Factions like Bizarre Plant Demon Hall in Diverse City would definitely not dare to target Traveling Dragon Palace.","If Zhao Chen were to become enemies with Traveling Dragon Palace, after knowing that a Grade 5 Creator was on Traveling Dragon Palace’s side, Zhao Chen would think of a way to repair his relationship with Traveling Dragon Palace.","The old man beside Zhao Chen asked softly after reporting the news, “Lord, do you think we should go to Traveling Dragon Palace? They sent us three invitations, but you have yet to respond to them!”","The old man was very clear about Zhao Chen’s attitude toward Traveling Dragon Palace. It could be described as disgust, but he also knew that Zhao Chen would definitely go to Traveling Dragon Palace after news of a Grade 5 Creator presiding over it spread.","A Grade 5 Creator had appeared in Diverse City. Be it friend or foe, the City Lord had to come into contact with him.","“Uncle Fu, let’s go to Traveling Dragon Palace. When we reach Traveling Dragon Palace, inform You Di to introduce this Grade 5 Creator to us. Tell him that as long as he introduces us to this Grade 5 Creator, I’ll forget everything that happened before!”","Traveling Dragon Palace had contacted him many times when they were transferring resources, You Di had been explaining to him, hoping he would not misunderstand them.","Traveling Dragon Palace had no intention of transferring resources outside.","No matter how well Traveling Dragon Palace developed, if it wanted to develop in Diverse City, they would have to rely on him.","Because Zhao Chen had to serve Lin Yuan for the past few days, he was thinking about how to receive the Grade 5","Creator that Lin Yuan had sent over. Thus, he had temporarily put off his response to Traveling Dragon Palace.","You Di had sent three invitations without his explicit statement. Two of them were personally sent by You Di, which was enough to show You Di’s attitude.","Zhao Chen felt that You Di had no reason to refuse just introducing him to this Grade 5 Creator.","The old man called Uncle Fu bowed and said, “I’ll definitely relay the City Lord’s words, but it’s hard to say if You Di will agree to it. After all, when Traveling Dragon Palace was in a predicament, we did not help them. It’s only to be expected that Traveling Dragon Palace is going to make a move now.”","Zhao Chen heard the old man’s words and said firmly, “You Di is a smart person. He wouldn’t do such a thing. Uncle Fu, you’ve been with me for more than 6,000 years. If you can befriend the Grade 5 Creator who presides over Fortune Treasure Palace and give me a chance to trade Creator resources with them, I’ll give you a share of the Creator resources I’ve traded and help your two feys’ bloodlines improve.”","The old man called Uncle Fu’s full name was Chen Fu. He was the one Zhao Chen valued the most among all his subordinates in the past few thousand years. Chen Fu was the most considerate when it came to handling matters, which made Zhao Chen feel very comfortable.","Chen Fu was not a member of Zhao Chen’s family. He was a member of the mercenary group that Zhao Chen had saved during a training session.","When this mercenary group was attacked by the star pirates, Chen Fu was the only one left.","Seeing that Chen Fu was quite capable, Zhao Chen kept him by his side.","In the end, Chen Fu took a blow for him during one of his trips and got seriously injured.","Zhao Chen started to train Chen Fu after that incident. During the training process, Zhao Chen found that Chen Fu was very capable. He was not a reckless man who only knew how to fight.","Zhao Chen and Chen Fu signed a master-servant contract and he controlled Chen Fu’s holy spirit.","Zhao Chen trusted Chen Fu completely, otherwise he would not have promised to give Chen Fu Grade 5 Creator resources.","Of course, there was another reason why Zhao Chen would make such a decision. The intermediate Grade 5 Creator that Lin Yuan was about to send over would provide Zhao Chen with sufficient Creator resources.","If Zhao Chen wanted to obtain Grade 5 Creator resources, he could just speak to the Grade 5 Creator that Lin Yuan had sent over. He did not need to think of a way to persuade the Grade 5 Creator in Traveling Dragon Palace.","Hearing Zhao Chen’s words, Chen Fu got very excited.","Zhao Chen had saved his life and had always treated him generously, so Chen Fu was both respectful and grateful to Zhao Chen. But now Zhao Chen was willing to provide him with Class 5 Creator resources, which made Chen Fu feel that he was willing to die with him.","Being able to follow Zhao Chen was his own good fortune!","“City Lord, thank you for nurturing me. After my two feys’ bloodlines improve, I will definitely share your worries!”","Many factions were suspicious of the news that Traveling Dragon Palace had spread two hours before the trade fair began.","They had a feeling that Traveling Dragon Palace did not want more people to come and support them so they deliberately released fake news!","Especially factions like Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, who had a grudge against Traveling Dragon Palace, were most unwilling to believe that Traveling Dragon Palace had such ability. If the domineering Traveling Dragon Palace really had such ability, how could they give Bizarre Plant Demon Hall a chance to rise? They would have probably suppressed Bizarre Plant Demon Hall long before they showed signs of rising.","As their opponent, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall knew Traveling Dragon Palace very well. Coupled with their cooperation with Gray Smoke Stronghold, they clearly knew the predicament of Traveling Dragon Palace.","Thus, Bizarre Plant Demon Hall felt that Traveling Dragon Palace was lying.","However, after Zhao Chen arrived, You Di personally received him. When he received Zhao Chen, You Di did not show any abnormal behavior.","This made the various factions led by Bizarre Plant Demon Hall doubt the authenticity of the news.","Traveling Dragon Palace definitely did not dare to lie to Diverse City’s City Lord. Ever since Traveling Dragon Palace wanted to develop in another city, Zhao Chen’s attitude towards Traveling Dragon Palace was not good at all.","Zhao Chen could not help Traveling Dragon Palace.","Zhao Chen came and even entered Traveling Dragon Palace. He participated in this trade fair very respectfully, causing the situation to become confusing.","The first thing You Di said when he saw Zhao Chen was, “Brother Zhao, I am really sorry Traveling Dragon Palace has been troubling you for the past few decades.”","When You Di said this, his tone was extremely sincere and his expression was filled with guilt.","Unlike You Tao who had always been at odds with Zhao Chen, You Di had always been on good terms with Zhao Chen. Zhao Chen had always treated You Di as sort of a younger brother.","In the early years, he had given a large amount of resources to Traveling Dragon Palace because of You Di.","When Traveling Dragon Palace decided to develop their influence in Extreme Wood City, Zhao Chen immediately went to You Di to dissuade him.","But Traveling Dragon Palace’s leader was not You Di but You Tao.","You Di could not dissuade his brother in terms of decision-making, so Traveling Dragon Palace still developed in Extreme Wood City.","It was precisely because of this that the relationship between Zhao Chen and You Di started to become distant.","You Di really hoped to ease his relationship with Zhao Chen.","If not for the fact that his brother You Tao was not in Diverse City, You Di would not have had the chance to say this.","Zhao Chen looked at You Di and sighed softly as he said, “Now that Traveling Dragon Palace has its own fortuitous opportunity, you might have a chance to establish yourselves in Extreme Wood City in the future. Even if you want to talk about what happened before, it shouldn’t be you mentioning it to me. It should be your brother! Ah Di, I have something to ask you. Is it true that Traveling Dragon Palace has a Grade 5 Creator?”","You Di hurriedly said, “How can Traveling Dragon Palace send fake news at a time like this? If we upload fake news on this matter, Traveling Dragon Palace’s reputation in Diverse City will be completely ruined! I will not do such a thing! Traveling Dragon Palace has indeed gained a Grade 5 Creator as a guest and this Grade 5 Creator will appear at the trade fair.”","Zhao Chen nodded and waved at You Di, indicating that there was no need to keep him company. Then he walked in with Chen Fu and a few other servants.","Zhao Chen had not expected You Di to greet him at the door. However, he did not ask You Di to introduce him to this Class 5 Creator. He still wanted Chen Fu to contact You Di.","Zhao Chen could sense that You Di wanted to improve their relationship but Traveling Dragon Palace’s actions had seriously infringed on his interests, even affecting his status in the family. Under such circumstances, Zhao Chen had no reason to forgive You Di.","Furthermore, when You Tao returned, the person in charge of Traveling Dragon Palace would still be You Tao and not You Di. You Tao might even command Traveling Dragon Palace to do something that would go against his interests.","Although Zhao Chen was still angry at Traveling Dragon Palace, there was a Grade 5 Creator holding down Traveling Dragon Palace. As long as Traveling Dragon Palace was still a faction in Diverse City, Zhao Chen was prepared to disregard the past and cooperate with Traveling Dragon Palace.","However, the cooperation between the two sides would no longer be one-sided nurturing by Zhao Chen. Instead, it would be a mutually beneficial choice.","In order to make the bidding between Traveling Dragon Palaces more intense, it was not an auction like the Diverse Talent Market where every distinguished guest had their own private room. Instead, there was an open-air auction.","Zhao Chen hated this kind of environment. There were always people around him who wanted to greet and chat with him. Zhao Chen hated useless socializing the most. Chen Fu knew what Zhao Chen was thinking. So whenever someone wanted to talk with Zhao Chen, Chen Fu would stop them for him.","Zhao Chen’s purpose in coming to this auction was to meet the Grade 5 Creator who had become a guest of Traveling Dragon Palace. He was not interested in anything else.","When Zhao Chen saw Lin Yuan, who was sitting diagonally behind him, he immediately revealed a warm smile. He quickly walked in front of Lin Yuan and found a seat beside him to sit down and chat with him.","At this moment, Zhao Chen was no longer as stern as before. Instead, he became extremely lively.","Everyone vaguely felt that Zhao Chen was deliberately trying to curry favor with the young man in front of him.","Two reception officers of the Fortune Treasure Palace sat beside this young man, indicating that he was a guest of Fortune Treasure Palace.","When did such a big shot come to Diverse City?","Moreover, Zhao Chen and this young man obviously knew each other, so many people began to guess Lin Yuan’s identity."]},{"number":3073,"title":"Chapter 3073 The Feeling of Being Protected!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3073 The Feeling of Being Protected!","However, compared to Lin Yuan’s identity, everyone was more concerned about the Grade 5 Creator who was presiding over Traveling Dragon Palace.","....","Since Traveling Dragon Palace had made this Grade 5 Creator famous, they would most likely show up later.","Among the present factions, those with power were interested in establishing connections with this Grade 5 Creator. On the other hand, those without power were motivated by the idea of admiring the charisma of this Grade 5 Creator. Indeed, even witnessing their charisma would be worthwhile.","“Brother Lin, are you here to meet this Grade 5 Creator of Traveling Dragon Palace or to exchange resources here?”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “I’m not very interested in this Grade 5 Creator from Traveling Dragon Palace. Compared to this Grade 5 Creator, I’m more interested in the foundational resources that Traveling Dragon Palace is selling. I have plans to acquire all of these blessed lands.”","To others, Lin Yuan’s words would likely come off as boastful and insincere, as who wouldn’t want to make connections with a Grade 5 Creator in this world?","However, Lin Yuan maintained such an attitude toward Grade 5 Creators. Moreover, with so many factions present, Lin Yuan actually expressed his intentions to acquire all the blessed lands.","Lin Yuan’s words sounded very pretentious, but Zhao Chen was extremely convinced by them.","Zhao Chen was well aware of Lin Yuan’s power and foundation. Since Lin Yuan could easily dispatch a Grade 5 Creator, he naturally wouldn’t be too interested in this Grade 5 Creator from Traveling Dragon Palace as he did not lack Grade 5 Creator resources at all.","When You Di revealed the identity of this Grade 5 Creator, he did not emphasize the level of this Grade 5 Creator. Most likely, the Grade 5 Creator from Traveling Dragon Palace was a beginner Grade 5 Creator.","“Brother Lin, there are many factions here who have their eyes on these blessed lands. At that time, you will have to compete with other factions and spend a lot of resources to outbid them.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan replied indifferently, “I don’t mind investing these resources. With Creators in place, the Creator resources can be obtained endlessly. Acquiring the blessed lands is all that matters!”","Traveling Dragon Palace was now a faction supported by Lin Yuan. No matter how much Lin Yuan spent to obtain these blessed lands from Traveling Dragon Palace, he wouldn’t suffer any losses.","Since Lin Yuan already planned to invest resources into Traveling Dragon Palace, even if the final transaction price negotiated by other factions was higher, it wouldn’t have any impact on Lin Yuan.","As soon as Lin Yuan arrived at Traveling Dragon Palace, Sun Yin noticed Lin Yuan and asked for instructions. Lin Yuan gestured for Sun Yin to act on his own and not ask for his opinion.","Sun Yin had previously appeared in Diverse City, so it was inevitable that some people would recognize him when he appeared in the public building this time.","The fact that a Creator like Sun Yin, who had previously appeared in Diverse City, had suddenly become a guest of Traveling Dragon Palace was unlikely to arouse the suspicion of the various factions.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Zhao Chen looked envious. Given Zhao Chen’s background, he rarely envied others. However, Zhao Chen was indeed envious of Lin Yuan now.","Among all the people Zhao Chen knew, Lin Yuan was the most generous. Zhao Chen had also interacted with disciples of secret elite families whose power far exceeded his own.","While they may behave arrogantly, none of them treated Creator resources with the same indifference and used Grade 4 Creator resources as recklessly as Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan were to use Grade 4 Creator resources as he did when bidding for talents, there wouldn’t be any faction in Diverse City qualified to compete with him.","Zhao Chen would not let go of any opportunity to please Lin Yuan.","“Brother Lin, I have some connections with Traveling Dragon Palace. I wonder if you’re interested in meeting the new guardian of Traveling Dragon Palace after the trading session ends? If you have such thoughts, I can help introduce you!”","Zhao Chen’s main reason for saying this to Lin Yuan was to hopefully have Lin Yuan owe him a favor.","Lin Yuan wasn’t accustomed to casually owing people favors, and he also didn’t see the need to meet with Sun Yin, who was one of his subordinates. There was a high chance that Sun Yin might reveal a flaw in his attitude during their encounter and thus revealed the depth of their relationship to others. For Lin Yuan, this situation would bring him no benefits and leave him owing Zhao Chen a favor for no reason.","“Brother Zhao, I don’t plan to stay in Diverse City for too long. so I won’t be getting acquainted with this guardian of Traveling Dragon Palace anymore. After I leave Diverse City, I won’t have much chance to interact with this Grade 5 Creator.","“However, when the Grade 5 Creator I dispatch to Diverse City arrives, I can arrange for her to interact with Traveling Dragon Palace. Perhaps, the two of them can form a good friendship.”","Grade 5 Creators were typically very arrogant. If they did not feel that the other party had a status that was comparable to theirs, they wouldn’t even consider the idea of forming any sort of relationship with the other party.","Zhuo Yan and Sun Yin had a good relationship, so when Zhuo Yan arrived in Diverse City, they were bound to interact with each other. By mentioning it now, even if it was observed that Zhuo Yan and Sun Yin interact, it wouldn’t seem strange.","Upon hearing this, Zhao Chen couldn’t help but feel a bit disappointed, realizing that he couldn’t fulfill his intention of extending a favor to Lin Yuan. It was too difficult to get a favor from Lin Yuan.","Based on Zhao Chen’s understanding of Grade 5 Creators, they were indeed as arrogant as Lin Yuan had said.","Zhao Chen planned to meet this Grade 5 Creator of Traveling Dragon Palace through Sun Yin, but he was not certain that this Grade 5 Creator would even pay attention to him.","However, since he had the chance to meet a Grade 5 Creator, Zhao Chen would not give up no matter what. Befriending another Grade 5 Creator would give him a channel to obtain Grade 5 Creators’ resources. It would be enough for him to go further along the path to success in the future.","During Zhao Chen’s conversation with Lin Yuan, the entire room suddenly fell silent, and Lin Yuan looked up to see You Di stepping forward.","You Di walked in front with an extremely humble posture while Sun Yin followed behind him.","With the way You Di, the Second Palace Master of the Traveling Dragon Palace, was treating this person, it was obvious who this person was.","Without waiting for You Di to introduce himself, Sun Yin said loudly, “Everyone, your presence at the trading event held at Traveling Dragon Palace is a great honor for us. Allow me to express my gratitude to each of you for gracing this occasion with your presence. Thank you all for your willingness to attend and support this event.","“In order to express our gratitude, we will auction off 20 more pills that I personally refined at the end of this trade fair. Each of these pills has a different effect. I hope that they can be of practical help to everyone during the process of increasing your strength!”","Sun Yin’s words caused many people to gasp. At the same time, Zhao Chen’s face revealed a surprised expression. Zhao Chen thought that Traveling Dragon Palace had somehow gotten a Grade 5 Creator and paid a huge price to invite him to stand up for them. However now, it seemed that that was not the case.","This Grade 5 Creator was sincerely helping Traveling Dragon Palace. He was even willing to use Grade 5 Creator resources to help Traveling Dragon Palace.","Many factions in Diverse City had intentions of attacking Traveling Dragon Palace. However, after the Grade 5 Creator had spoken those words, it was likely that no one would dare to do so anymore.","Zhao Chen looked at the seats of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall. The expressions of the two masters of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall were exceptionally ugly.","The plan of Bizarre Plant Demon Hall to target Traveling Dragon Palace simply could not proceed any further.","Zhao Chen had already made up his mind. After this trade fair ended, he would take the initiative to suppress Bizarre Plant Demon Hall, which could be considered as doing a favor for Traveling Dragon Palace.","With this Grade 5 Creator expressing support for Traveling Dragon Palace, giving them a favor would be equivalent to giving this Grade 5 Creator a favor.","Sun Yin didn’t give You Di a heads-up before saying these words. When You Di heard Sun Yin’s statement, he was pleasantly surprised and couldn’t help but feel a sense of admiration. It felt so good to have someone protecting him!","Traveling Dragon Palace used to be a faction that was controlled by You Di and his brother, You Tao. With Traveling Dragon Palace under someone else’s control, You Di couldn’t help but feel uneasy despite knowing that Traveling Dragon Palace was controlled by a faction with a Grade 6 Creator presiding over and it was a huge opportunity for them.","However, You Di no longer had such thoughts now.","Upon sensing the attitudes of the various factions present, Sun Yin could not help but reveal a look of enjoyment. Sun Yin’s biggest fear by Lin Yuan’s side was losing his freedom. However, the reality proved that being by Lin Yuan’s side not only didn’t strip him of his freedom but also granted him more opportunities.","You Di took charge of the trade fair, and while doing so, he hosted it with great enthusiasm and felt no pressure whatsoever.","Even though Traveling Dragon Palace had gotten out of their predicament, the resources that Traveling Dragon Palace had invested in Extreme Wood City had been completely wasted.","At present, Traveling Dragon Palace was facing a shortage of resources. If Traveling Dragon Palace wanted to quickly develop again, they needed to raise their resources. Obviously, these resources couldn’t be obtained by simply asking Sun Yin. Not only that, if Sun Yin stayed in Diverse City in the future, Traveling Dragon Palace would have to fork out resources to support Sun Yin.","Under You Di’s instigation, the trade fair hosted by Traveling Dragon Palace was exceptionally successful. Part of the reason for this success was that various factions were deliberately inflating prices as a gesture of goodwill toward Traveling Dragon Palace.","The other reason was that Lin Yuan’s bid was too high. As long as someone made a bid, Lin Yuan would raise the price even higher!","If not for the fact that Zhao Chen was sitting beside Lin Yuan and seemed to be very familiar with him, You Di would not be able to help but wonder if Lin Yuan would be able to afford such a crazy bid.","Although it was difficult to find a blessed land and opportunities were needed to obtain one, it was not to the extent of overpricing all the low-grade and mid-grade blessed lands.","It was worth noting that the bidding conditions for the blessed lands of Traveling Dragon Palace required the use of resources from Grade 3 Creators or higher and bidding with Honor Absent dollars was not allowed.","Sun Yin saw the doubt in You Di’s eyes as Lin Yuan continued to bid. He wondered what You Di’s expression would be if he knew that Lin Yuan was the one who had taken Traveling Dragon Palace under his wing.","As Lin Yuan did not want to appear in public, Sun Yin did not reveal Lin Yuan’s identity to You Di.","After completing the trading fair, Lin Yuan chose not to remain in Diverse City. Instead, Sun Yin was temporarily left behind in Diverse City by Lin Yuan. He would help Lin Yuan deal with the remaining matters in Diverse City.","Lin Yuan had a large number of talents that he had purchased. He planned to bring these talents to the North of the Lonely River and put them to use as soon as possible.","Lin Yuan met up with Ling Muzhuo, who had come to Diverse City after the trade fair. Ling Muzhuo wanted to invite Lin Yuan to travel in the North Universe, but Lin Yuan rejected him.","Lin Yuan, who had not developed well in the East Universe, did not want to take such a big step.","At the moment, it was most important to focus on developing in the East Universe!","Moreover, Lin Yuan had been away for such a long time that the Astronomical Parliament had been delayed.","Lin Yuan was in a hurry to return to Sky City to hold the next Astronomical Parliament meeting. The three members who had just joined the Astronomical Parliament, be it Jing Bai, Zhou Yu, or Ru Yi, had already experienced earth-shattering changes in their lives.","The three of them had fulfilled their wishes by joining the Astronomical Parliament.","Jing Bai had already become the actual controller of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. As Kong Huan had firmly controlled a Snow-Covered Fox Sir through his emotions, the status of the Alluring Foxes had greatly increased among the members of the Snow-Covered Foxes.","Kong Huan’s ability to assist Jing Bai has been increasing steadily. The first thing Jing Bai did after controlling the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes was to develop and increase the overall strength of the younger generation.","Members of the Snow-Covered Fox had the ability to transform individuals from other species outside the fox species into members of their own species.","In order to allow the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes to better survive in the territory of the Snow-Covered Foxes, Jing Bai discussed with Kong Huan to make the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes as a dependent species of the Alluring Foxes.","Kong Huan valued the potential of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes and was willing to do Jing Bai a favor.","Every time Lin Yuan communicated with her, he would ask about Jing Bai’s situation, which meant that he cared about him a lot.","Hence, Kong Huan was very willing to extend this favor to Jing Bai.","After the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes became a dependent species of the Alluring Foxes, they could be considered to have completely integrated into the territory of the Snow-Covered Foxes. They would even have the opportunity to engage in trade with other dependent species of the Snow-Covered Foxes within their territory.","Out of respect for the Alluring Foxes’ reputation, other dependent species of the Snow-Covered Foxes refrained from taking advantage of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes during their trading cooperation. This allowed the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes to develop rapidly.","Although Jing Bai was young, he was extremely talented in the ways of the world. Jing Bai gave a large portion of the resources obtained from the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes to the Alluring Foxes, who were not good at trade.","This was not only to express his gratitude to Kong Huan but also to let her introduce more trading channels to the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes so that both sides could achieve a win-win situation.","Kong Huan’s greatest fear was that despite doing so much for Jing Bai and investing her own resources to support him, Jing Bai would show no gratitude or reciprocation. This was undoubtedly something that Kong Huan was unwilling to accept."]},{"number":3074,"title":"Chapter 3074: Li Hen and Li Cheng!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3074: Li Hen and Li Cheng!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Jing Bai’s subsequent actions made Kong Huan realize that she had been overthinking. Jing Bai was a very clever person and was very grateful to her. If Jing Bai was successful in the future, he would definitely not forget the effort she put into nurturing him today.","Kong Huan had personally intervened using the reputation of the Alluring Foxes to help establish channels for the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes and allowed them to fully utilize the trade talent of their species and conduct large-scale trade with the other fox-species. As a result, Jing Bai was also able to quickly bring prosperity to the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes shortly after taking control of it and completely ended those rumors that were unfavorable to Jing Bai.","Zhou Yu had obtained pinnacle Holy Spirit war weapon from Lin Yuan which allowed his tribe to eliminate all the enemies that threatened their safety, thus saving his sister from being defiled by that cursed elder from the Tail Bind Tribe.","Zhou Yu had communicated with Su Yiren before the end of the last Astronomical Parliament. Su Yiren had always had the habit of leading newcomers to the Astronomical Parliament.","Su Yiren told Zhou Yu in all seriousness that a pinnacle Holy Spirit war weapon could only ensure the safety of the tribe for a short period. However, if he wanted the tribe to achieve significant development, the best approach was to strengthen the tribe. Without any resources, the best way to strengthen the tribe was to seek support from a formidable tribe and use their strength as a platform for their own development.","Zhou Yu listened to Su Yiren’s words and discussed with his father about leading their tribe to move far away. Eventually, they chose to align with another tribe that had experts at pinnacle Holy Spirit level presiding over it.","There were three Spirit Territory experts in the tribe, and only one of the three experts had reached the pinnacle of Holy Spirit level. With the presence of a war weapon at the pinnacle of the Holy Spirit level in their possession, this tribe posed no threat to the one Zhou Yu belonged to. In case of a conflict, Zhou Yu’s tribe possessed the capability to contend with them.","This powerful tribe was said to be the dependent species of another powerful species. If they temporarily attached themselves to them, there would undoubtedly be more opportunities in the future. If this tribe was not influential enough to accommodate Zhou Yu’s tribe, they could still align with the faction behind them and gradually develop their tribe from there.","Zhou Yu had obtained a lot of resources from Lin Yuan and could use them to develop quickly. However, the foundation of his tribe was too shallow. It would be very difficult to develop it in a short period of time. Hence, it was best to restrain their sharpness and slowly develop.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, it was best to avoid giving the impression that their tribe relied on others unless absolutely necessary. Otherwise, if they were targeted by some expert or faction, it would be dangerous if the other faction’s influence exceeded the pinnacle of the Holy Spirit level!","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Zhou Yu was just a minor character. He had no chance of rising in the established life trajectory and development path. There were too many insignificant characters like Zhou Yu. Even after all this time, Zhou Yu remained deeply grateful to Lin Yuan. He felt fortunate to have been chosen by that organization hidden among the constellations and to have become a part of it.","Ever since Zhou Yu destroyed the Tail Bind Tribe with that pinnacle Holy Spirit level war weapon, Zhou Yu had become the leader and decision maker. Even Zhou Yu’s father, the chief of the tribe, had to take the initiative to discuss with Zhou Yu when something happened.","“Little Yu, our tribe doesn’t have much accumulation to begin with. We thought that we would be able to gather a large amount of resources from the Tail Bind Tribe’s spoils of war, but we didn’t expect that their resources would be used to increase that old thing’s strength.","“He didn’t hesitate to spend a lot of money to hire a Grade 3 Creator to help concoct the targeted spirit fluid and spent all his resources! We have finally arrived here after a long journey. Our entire tribe can only maintain a basic standard of living, and we are at our wits’ end.","“With the guard your master arranged for you, it should be relatively easy to seize this mine from their hands. Securing this mine means we won’t have to worry about resources for at least 50 years.”","Upon hearing his father’s words, Zhou Yu could not help but sigh, “Father, you mean that our Forbidden Feather Tribe has to snatch this mine? Apart from fire copper, we have already discovered derivative lifeform fire spirit crystal copper in this fire copper mine. There were powerful factions that were all eager to lay their hands on this mine. Both the Frost Rat Tribe and the Spirit Serpent Tribe had declared their intentions to claim it.","“Our Forbidden Feather Tribe is ultimately outsiders. Even if we are under the protection of the Terrifying Turtle Tribe, none of the local factions have any affinity towards us. If we forcefully fight for this mine, not only will our Forbidden Feather Tribe’s trump card be exposed, but it will also attract the attention and criticism of other factions. I don’t see the need to facilitate that.","“Moreover, my master arranged for the guards to be by my side to protect my safety, not for me to use the guards to snatch resources. During the journey, you and the tribe have basically exhausted the few resources in the tribe, but you have already established a foothold here. As long as the people of the tribe are more diligent, they won’t have to worry about earning resources!","“In the future, if there are any high-profile matters, I’ll seek assistance from the guards my master arranged for me. Moreover, my master mentioned that I have the potential to become a Creator and he will stimulate my talent as a Creator.”","Zhou Yu had no choice but to come up with the same lie as Ta Lei in order to justify the presence of the war weapon Lin Yuan arranged for him and to make the existence of this pinnacle Holy Spirit level war weapon reasonable in his possession.","Zhou Yu had always thought that his father was a very wise and farsighted person, but after he revealed that he had a guard at the pinnacle of the divine kingdom by his side and had used this guard to annihilate the Tail Bind Tribe, his father began to become obsessed with the power of this guard. When he encountered problems, he always wanted him to rely on this guard to resolve them. Hence, Zhou Yu knew that he could not rely on his father to develop his tribe in the future.","Zhou Yu needed to identify and cultivate one or two right-hand individuals from within the tribe. Fortunately, his sister was smart enough to give him some advice on many things. However, Zhou Yu did not let his sister interfere in the affairs of the tribe. Instead, he let her focus on improving her strength.","Perhaps Zhou Yu’s father was feeling impatient due to years of suppression within the tribe, but in Zhou Yu’s heart, the Forbidden Feather Tribe was already developing very quickly.","In a gorgeous palace, a young girl was reading a thick book.","Smoke curled up in the palace, and a few carps of various colors raised in the palace pool jumped out of the water from time to time, emitting waves of spirit qi.","The two maids beside Ru Yi were afraid of disturbing Ru Yi from reading. They even tried their best to make their breathing sound softer. However, Ru Yi’s mind was not on the book in her hand at all. A week ago, Ru Yi had already confirmed that her body had completely recovered.","Now that Ru Yi could successfully mobilize her bloodline and had become a normal individual, she could focus on enhancing her own strength. Previously, she had already revealed to her mother and father that her body was gradually recovering, but she was recovering too quickly.","Ru Yi planned to delay informing her family about her true condition until later. When the time came, she intended to involve her family in putting on a show together. There were too many people in the Carp Mystic Palace. If she did not let her parents accompany her to put on a show, it would inevitably cause some trouble. Ru Yi’s curse had always troubled her and made her even want to give up her life. However, after the curse was completely removed, Ru Yi realized that both her spirit and soul had improved after resisting the curse for a long time.","The few carp growing in his bedroom were all lifeforms that she would use to contract spirits in the future.","In the past, Ru Yi could not activate her bloodline to increase her strength. Now that she had obtained this opportunity again, she was prepared to spend most of her energy on increasing her strength in the future. Only when her strength reached a certain level could she seek other things.","Under normal circumstances, disciples from large factions were often obsessed with relying on their family clans. They liked to rely on their family clan’s prestige and believed that the family clan’s strength was their own strength.","However, Ru Yi, who had suffered before, did not think this way. No matter how strong her parents were, there would be times when they could not protect her. For example, the Carp Mystic Palace had not helped her much in the matter of breaking the curse and restoring her body. Instead, she relied on Lin Yuan to give her a new life.","Now that her body had recovered, the collateral descendants who usually pretended to care for her would definitely be very angry. Ru Yi did not think that they would have any true feelings for her.","Ru Yi forced herself to calm down and finish reading the book in her hand. After reading it, she told the two maidservants standing beside her, “Go and prepare dinner. After dinner, I’m going to the carp pool to pick a few more carp. The two of you will accompany me.”","After sending her two maidservants away, Ru Yi stretched her back in satisfaction. She was looking forward to the next meeting among the constellations. Ru Yi really wanted to thank the majestic figures sitting on the golden seats in person.","In a room with a luxurious frame but simple furnishings, a thin woman was applying medicine to a middle-aged man lying on the bed while crying.","The middle-aged man’s back was crisscrossed with scars. A few new wounds filled the scars, completely moistening the clothes on his back.","Dark red blood could be seen seeping out from the cracks of the armor.","Such a serious injury caused the middle-aged man’s breathing to become a little weak.","“Ah Ru, don’t cry. I’m from a collateral family. This is my fate!”","“It’s just that you haven’t had a good life since you followed me.”","The thin woman named Ah Ru bit her lower lip and tried her best to suppress her emotions, but she could not help but lose control of her emotions.","“It doesn’t matter to me whether you can live a good life with Li Hen or not. You know I’ve never been someone with great ambitions coveting anything. However, their direct descendants are too much of a bully. They don’t want us to live at all!”","Upon hearing her words, Li Hen’s eyes darkened, but he still tried to explain, “Ah Ru, Young Master Li Qianzhe is indeed a little naughty by nature. He likes to cause trouble. As his guards, we have been punished for him many times. However, Young Master Li Qianzhe will give some compensation every time he’s punished.","“Give Little Cheng the potions Young Master rewarded this time. It should be enough to help Little Cheng strengthen the few wolf beasts he contracted! Little Cheng is a spirit contractor. He will definitely be more promising than me in the future. Now that I’m suffering, it’s equivalent to paving the way for Little Cheng!”","When Li Hen said this, he deliberately made himself appear more relaxed.","Ah Ru had always thought that Li Hen was a person who only knew how to be loyal to his species, but in reality, Li Hen was not like that. Li Hen also had his own selfishness and bottom line.","It wasn’t easy for Li Hen and Ru to get this child. In the bloodline of the Shadow Heavenly Wolves, only those who had made contributions were allowed to have children.","Li Hen and Ah Ru were able to have this child because Li Hen risked his life to exchange for it.","Because of his damaged roots, Li Hen could no longer go to the abyss to help the Myriad Shadow Wolves search for resources.","However, Li Hen was acutely aware that if he wanted to raise offspring and ensure they had the strength to not become dispensable logistics personnel within the clan, they must earn resources through their own abilities. That was why Li Hen had chosen to be a follower of those Young Masters of the direct descendant, and he had been one for decades!","In the past few decades, he had been injured as a follower of Li Qianzhe, the ninth Young Master of the direct descendant of the family. In fact, the injuries he had suffered were no less than the injuries he had suffered during his years of exploration.","If it weren’t for the fact that he couldn’t explore the abyss and the medical resources in the family weren’t provided to him for free, Li Hen wouldn’t have asked Ah Ru to help him bandage his wounds and make her worry for nothing.","No one knew better than Li Hen how difficult it was to be by the Young Masters’ side.","When Ah Ru heard Li Hen’s words, her eyes were filled with sorrow. She reached out and gently stroked the scar on Li Hen’s back, then said to Li Hen in a sorrowful tone.","“Li Hen, you’ve been unconscious for two days. You probably don’t know that Little Cheng has been chosen by the Sixth Young Master. He’s preparing to let Little Cheng study with him when school starts next month.”","“Sixth Young Master is one of the most valued direct descendants in the family. When the Sixth Young Master mentioned the name of the small town, the family issued a decree directly. We didn’t even have the chance to refuse.”","At this point, Ah Ru was already sobbing uncontrollably.","Among all the direct bloodline Young Masters of this generation of the Myriad Shadow Wolves, the Sixth Young Master, Li Qianlie, was a direct bloodline Young Master who did not take the collateral bloodline seriously.","Every holiday, Li Qianlie would pick a suitable age follower from the family’s collateral relatives to bring to Holy Feather Academy to work as a study companion.","At first, the collateral relatives thought that this was an excellent opportunity, but gradually, Li Qianlie would bring a few followers with him every time he took a break. Then, news of the deaths of those followers came one after another. This made the collateral descendants no longer view it as an opportunity.","Seeing that no one from the collateral branches volunteered to serve as attendants, Li Qianlie took the initiative to select individuals himself. The collateral branches had no right to refuse."]},{"number":3075,"title":"Chapter 3075 Yuan Qi’s Ambition!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3075 Yuan Qi’s Ambition!","Ah Ru could already imagine what would happen to Li Cheng. She regarded Li Cheng as her life. In order to earn resources for Li Cheng, Ah Ru had worked as hard as Li Hen. However, once the direct descendants gave the order, there was no way to refuse.","....","Ah Ru knew that she couldn’t protect Li Cheng. If it weren’t for the fact that she had to heal Li Hen’s injuries, she would most likely have fallen into a zombie-like state.","Upon hearing her words, Li Hen was stunned. He ignored the pain in his back and stood up. Li Hen asked excitedly with reddened eyes, “The clan really gave such an order!?”","Ah Ru knew that it wasn’t that Li Hen didn’t believe her, but that Li Hen was also in a state of uncontrollable emotions like her. She threw herself into Li Hen’s arms and said with tears in her eyes, “Li Hen, we’re about to lose Little Cheng. Little Cheng doesn’t know about the clan’s orders yet, but I think the news will reach his ears soon. What do you think we should do?”","Li Hen comforted Ah Ru briefly and came to the area where the members of the direct descendants lived with red eyes.","What Ah Ru saw was Li Hen, who was critically injured and barely clinging to life, she knew what Li Hen had done.","Li Hen had gone to look for the direct descendants, hoping that they could retract their order and not let Little Cheng be the Sixth Young Master’s study companion. Looking at the current situation, not only did the direct descendants of the clan reject Li Hen, but they also punished him with martial force.","Ah Ru bandaged the wounds on Li Hen’s body again and felt sad. If news of Little Cheng’s death spread in the future, Ah Ru was not prepared to continue living in such a clan. It was just that Ah Ru was a little reluctant and worried about Li Cheng.","It was dark in the house late at night, and Li Cheng already knew the news. Ah Ru left to accompany Li Cheng. When Li Hen, a man who used to brush off even severe injuries during explorations in the abyss, woke up, tears of warmth streamed down his face involuntarily.","In the darkness, Li Hen extended his hand and gazed at his scarred palm. He felt overwhelmed by a profound sense of helplessness. At this moment, Li Hen, who was most loyal to his clan, actually had the thought of abandoning his clan.","Li Hen wanted to rebel against his clan and take Li Cheng and Ah Ru far away. Even if he had to join a mercenary group and become one of those precarious mercenaries, it would still be much better than now. However, such thoughts were just wishful thinking for Li Hen. For the clan, disciples from collateral branches were seen more as tools than lives. After all, tools didn’t have the right to rebel, did they? If Li Hen were to truly act on his rebellious thoughts, the clan might just kill him, Ah Ru, and Little Cheng.","At this moment, Li Hen really wanted to endure the pain in his body and meet his only son, Li Cheng. However, as a father, Li Hen only felt deep sorrow for his own incompetence. He lost the courage to see Li Cheng as he was afraid that he would see Li Cheng’s terrified and disappointed expression.","It was said that men did not cry easily. Li Hen, who had always hated tears, cried extremely sadly as a father. After crying for a long time, Li Hen made a wish in his heart. If he could leave the Myriad Shadow Wolves and stop Li Cheng from becoming the follower of the cruel Sixth Young Master, he was willing to exchange everything.","Thinking of this, Li Hen couldn’t help but laugh at himself. It didn’t seem like everything he had was anything. His cheap life was simply worthless!","...","Under the dim night sky, there were five young men and women sitting by a river. Behind the young men and women, elemental phantoms of different postures appeared.","Four of the five elemental phantoms looked rather condensed, but one was extremely illusory. This illusory elemental phantom belonged to an ordinary-looking woman.","The expressions of the other four people were normal when they manifested these elemental phantoms of different postures, but the expression on this woman’s face was extremely difficult.","Large drops of sweat fell from their foreheads. The other figures sensed the woman’s state and looked at her with contempt and mockery.","A coquettish laugh sounded. “Ah Meng, your talent is really too poor. With your talent, it’s meaningless even if you practice behind us every day. If I were you, I wouldn’t persevere anymore.","“If I continue like this, I’ll only embarrass myself. Although you’re a direct descendant, your bloodline power is so weak. I really don’t know how you were born and raised! If the clan hadn’t carried out the test, I wouldn’t have been able to help but wonder if your bloodline is impure!”","This woman with a coquettish voice looked very sweet, but her words were filled with an unconcealable viciousness. It could be said to be an extremely vicious act to openly question the bloodline of any species that valued bloodlines. Those whose bloodline was questioned in such a clan would be mocked and isolated.","Closely following this charming female voice was a clear male voice, “Third Sister, don’t say that. Before Yuan Qi condensed the elemental shadow, she was a genius valued by the clan’s elders. It’s said that the elemental shadow that might awaken contains two elements! By that time, who in our generation could compare to Yuan Qi?”","“It’s just the way the wind blows. The same elders who were once thrilled are now furious. Yuan Qi’s elemental awakening is already so late, and even condensing the Elemental Shadow is extremely difficult for her. How could someone like her possibly bear the clan’s high expectations?”","“Speaking of which, among the talents in our clan’s generation, Third Sister, you are undoubtedly the most outstanding one!”","This clear male voice was very pleasant to the ear, but the words he said were filled with flattery. His words were filled with flattery towards the charming female voice and contempt for Yuan Qi.","It was unknown if it was because of the young man’s admiration or his instinct to curry favor with the powerful, but every time they came to the elemental river to cultivate together, such evil words would always sound.","“Alright, we’re all from the same generation. Yuan Qi’s poor talent didn’t hinder your matters, nor did she snatch your resources.”","This rough voice seemed to be helping Yuan Qi out of the predicament, but the topic quickly turned back to Yuan Qi.","“Yuan Qi, you know your own talents best. I advise you not to force yourself any further. It’s a waste of the clan’s resources for you to come to the elemental river to absorb the elements. Among the nine main lineages, our lineage is the weakest.","“Don’t you feel guilty for occupying these resources without any value? If you don’t tell the clan yourself, I will report it to the clan.”","Upon hearing this rough voice, the ordinary-looking Yuan Qi pursed her lips tightly, “Yuan Meng, I know that you’ve already reported to the clan more than once that you want to deprive me of the opportunity to absorb elemental energy here. The reason the clan didn’t agree with you is because the clan hasn’t given up on me. As a direct descendant, I should enjoy these resources. Why should I give these resources to others? You can say whatever you want about me, but I’ll never miss a single session of our cultivation here!”","After saying that, Yuan Qi stood up and left the place, not letting herself continue to be entangled in trouble. By the time she left, blood had already seeped out of Yuan Qi’s tightly clenched fists.","Yuan Qi felt that her elemental body, which seemed to never be full, had fallen into a deep sense of powerlessness. Her body absorbed elemental energy at an extremely fast rate, far surpassing the few fellow clan members who recently advanced in strength alongside her. However, when the elemental energy was absorbed into her body, it was as if it had disappeared out of thin air.","Yuan Qi was sure that she had absorbed the elemental energy into his body. With such a massive amount of elemental energy, it wouldn’t simply vanish into thin air. Yuan Qi was understandably perplexed by this. Although she didn’t understand his situation, Yuan Qi didn’t tell the clan about this.","Her water-type lineage was the weakest among the nine main lineages. Due to some historical reasons, it had always been suppressed by the other main lineages.","There was only one elemental river suitable for the younger generation left, and Yuan Qi felt like she was wasting the clan’s resources with his current situation.","Originally, those few individuals who were against Yuan Qi didn’t harbor such strong opinions about her. It was because she had absorbed the elemental energy in the elemental river too quickly recently that these individuals were dissatisfied and thought that she was snatching resources.","In Yuan Qi’s heart, she had never taken his clan seriously. What Yuan Qi cared more about was the improvement of her personal strength. Only by improving her own strength could she obtain everything.","Her grandfather, father, and mother had contributed everything to the clan, but in the end, they did not receive anything. She also did not receive much preferential treatment either.","The clan was still providing her with resources because they were unwilling to give up on her talent. Once she made the clan feel that she was worthless, the clan would definitely abandon her without hesitation. Just like how they had abandoned her father back then.","When she thought of this, Yuan Qi felt a chill in her heart, and at the same time, she also felt a wave of hatred. However, Yuan Qi felt a deep sense of helplessness in her heart.","She was indeed very ambitious, but her strength was clearly not worthy of her ambition. She wondered how many more times she could come to the elemental river. If the clan saw that Yuan Qi hadn’t made any progress or achievements, they might soon stop allowing her access to the elemental river. Yuan Qi’s expression darkened when she thought of this.","Yuan Qi silently thought to himself that if this world could provide an opportunity for her to rise and have enough strength to dominate everything, she would be willing to exchange everything for it!","Yuan Qi had always admitted to being an extremely ambitious person. However, having ambition without strength was equivalent to being a joke.","Because Yuan Qi’s parents and grandfather were already dead, she had not received much care from her aunt’s clan when he was young.","However, she had received a lot of eye-rolling. Her aunt had always wanted her to give up on going to the elemental river to train because if she had voluntarily given up, her younger brother would have a chance to go to the elemental river to train.","Regardless of how Yuan Qi’s aunt persuaded her, she refused to give up this opportunity. As a result, Yuan Qi had been beaten multiple times by her aunt and uncle. Even her younger brother would openly target her.","Yuan Qi quietly let the elders in the clan discover the truth of his abuse. Only then was she able to break away from her aunt’s clan and return to the old house where she had lived with her parents when she was young.","As soon as Yuan Qi returned home, she found that her aunt had come to look for her. Yuan Qi’s aunt could only be visiting her for one reason, as Yuan Qi suspected. She listened as her aunt spoke in a commanding tone.","“Little Qi, your unyielding personality is exactly the same as your big brother, but you’ve already tried everything you need to try. With your condition, there’s no point in you going to the elemental river.","“Little Dong has already awakened his elemental veins, and you haven’t even condensed the elemental shadow yet. Even if you occupy this opportunity, the elders of the clan won’t let you occupy it for long.”","Upon hearing her aunt’s words, Yuan Qi felt a chill in her heart for no reason. Was this her so-called relative?","Yuan Qi suddenly felt that her aunt didn’t seem to be from the same species as her. She was more like a Bloodian who was ready to suck on her at any time. There were many rules in the clan, and the most taboo one was to contradict one’s elders.","Yuan Qi took a deep breath and said softly, “Aunt, my opportunity was obtained for me by my father and mother. It is also related to my own talent. Even if I forcefully give up the opportunity, I don’t believe that Yuan Dong’s talent is worthy of it! Aunt, we’re the closest blood relatives in the clan. Why can’t you see me doing well? Not only have you mistreated me for so many years, but you’ve also been depriving me of opportunities. You’ve also snatched so many things my parents left me.”","Yuan Qi calmly asked the one thing that she had wanted to know the most in all these years. When the woman standing in front of Yuan Qi heard this, she directly cursed loudly, “If it weren’t for the fact that your father, mother, and that old man loved you so much when you were born and had been collecting supplies for you everywhere, they wouldn’t have died! If the two of them hadn’t died, how could our lineage be suppressed so badly?","“This is all your doing, you cunning little girl! You even begged the elders to reclaim some of the resources left by your parents. If it weren’t for you taking away those resources, Little Dong wouldn’t have taken so long to awaken his elemental veins!”","Upon hearing her aunt’s words, the last bit of hope in Yuan Qi’s heart was completely cut off. It turned out that her aunt had always hated her father, who was known as the guardian of the lineage, and her mother, who had saved her aunt and uncle’s lives more than once.","In her aunt’s eyes, taking back the resources her parents had left for her was like doing something outrageous. To think that when she had been treated coldly by her aunt and uncle, she had been reflecting on what she had done wrong. Now, it seemed that she had been too stupid.","“Aunt, I’m tired. You can go back. No matter what, I’m still one of the five people chosen and nurtured by the clan. You’re affecting my advancement and slowing down the speed at which I condense the elemental shadow. I don’t think you want me to get an elder from my clan to chase you away, right?!”"]},{"number":3076,"title":"Chapter 3076 Breeder Han Qin!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3076 Breeder Han Qin!","After saying this, Yuan Qi looked at her aunt with a smile. She scolded him in front of the small house where her parents used to live before leaving.","....","The smile in Yuan Qi’s eyes was ice-cold, but soon, Yuan Qi sighed deeply. No matter how much she hated her aunt, there seemed to be nothing she could do. Without strength, she could only submit to the clan.","Once the clan gave up on her and prevented her from coming to the elemental river to absorb energy, the first person who would not let her off would most likely be his aunt. How ironic was this!?","Yuan Qi, who didn’t have the ability to resist, could only place all her hopes on the wishes she had made. However, she was unaware that the wishes she had made one after another were like butterflies, gently flapping their wings and affecting her fate.","...","On the way back, Lin Yuan interacted with the people he had bought. Although Lin Yuan had bought these individuals, he realized he only controlled their destinies and couldn’t completely change their hearts.","However, it was not difficult to get these people to calm down. Most of the talent roots that Lin Yuan had purchased had been damaged, and many of them had been severely injured. As long as Lin Yuan healed their injured roots and promised them a future, they would be able to serve him obediently.","Not only did Lin Yuan heal their injured roots, but he also displayed his strength. Apart from that, he also promised them a bright future. At the same time, he promised these talents many resources. As the saying went, “kindness and power were the best way to win people’s hearts”.","Lin Yuan would have to rely on these people to work for him in the future.","These people could be considered the backbone of Sky City. The resources Lin Yuan promised to these talents were the very resources he intended to provide to them. Only by providing resources to allow these people to grow as quickly as possible could they contribute more to Sky City.","There were no troublemakers among these talents, so they saved Lin Yuan the trouble of making an example out of them.","These talents had previously belonged to various factions. They became captives after their factions were defeated and were sold as commodities, tamed for resale. Even the most arrogant individuals had their pride ground down through this process. As for those who had not lost their pride, most of them had already been dealt with during the taming process. Those with unyielding pride didn’t need enemies to act against them. They would sabotage their own future paths.","Building the Floating Island Whales was more important than building the Spirit Lock spatial zone. In the future, the construction of the Spirit Lock spatial zone would definitely not be handed over to Hu Quan anymore.","Although there were no Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen among the Spirit Craftsmen that Lin Yuan had purchased, there was a high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman.","The high Class 4 Spirit Craftsman was Zhu Shoudan, whose body was incomplete. Lin Yuan had already used the Jasmine Lily to restore Zhu Shoudan’s broken legs and arm.","Apart from Zhu Shoudan, Wang Xuan, the early-stage Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen who had a lifespan of less than 600 years was also extremely outstanding. Wang Xuan’s lifespan issue had also been resolved by Lin Yuan.","Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan knelt in front of Lin Yuan gratefully and thanked him for giving them a new life.","Not only did Lin Yuan let Wang Xuan contract a Lifespan Mouse, but he also let Zhu Shoudan contract one. This was both a gift from Lin Yuan and a way for him to control the two of them so that they could not betray him.","“Master, I will use my long lifespan to repay your kindness. The two of us are lucky to be in this blessed land. We will definitely do our best to build this blessed land.","“If you have any requests or thoughts, you can tell us directly. The two of us will try our best to fulfill them.”","Apart from thanking Lin Yuan, Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan were also very excited that Lin Yuan valued them and entrusted them with such an important task.","The job of a Spirit Craftsman was to build facilities and decorate the environment. The fact that Lin Yuan was willing to provide the two of them with such an environment where the spirit qi was extremely dense meant that he recognized their abilities.","As Spirit Craftsmen, it was a blessing to be recognized by their master when everything was not under their control. Moreover, in such an environment, be it strength, potential, or bloodline, they could all be imperceptibly improved.","“I only know your Spirit Craftsman level now, but I don’t know your style. How about this? We’ll build two botanical gardens here to plant high-end spirit plants. The two of you will build the botanical gardens separately to let me understand your style first before entrusting you with different responsibilities. You can choose from the other Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen. Each of you can choose 100 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen to be your assistants.”","Although Lin Yuan had made Zhu Shoudan the leader and Wang Xuan as his support, Lin Yuan still gave them a chance to compete to allow the two of them to promote each other in the competition.","Wang Xuan was someone who cared a lot about reputation. Lin Yuan could let Hu Quan communicate more with Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan regarding the abilities of the Spirit Craftsman.","However, even if Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan did not say anything, it would still be difficult for Hu Quan to lead Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan.","Be it the Sky City outside or the Spirit Lock spatial zone, they both needed a Spirit Craftsman to preside over. Hence, there was no harm in separating Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan and letting them be in charge of different parts.","Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan heaved a sigh of relief. This was their first time working under Lin Yuan, and they were afraid that he would ask them to do something too difficult.","It was not that Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan were not confident in their abilities. Their abilities were very solid. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have obtained the corresponding rating from Sun Youcai.","However, styles had always been based on wisdom. No matter how confident Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan were in their abilities, they could not guarantee that Lin Yuan would take a fancy to their styles.","In their eyes, Lin Yuan was definitely from a powerful species. With such a background, Lin Yuan had seen countless styles. If Lin Yuan really looked down on their designs, would they still be able to receive such good treatment from him in the future?","Furthermore, the two of them did not have any emotional foundation with Lin Yuan and had been bought by Lin Yuan with money. If Lin Yuan did not like their performance, he could spend some resources on this so-called talent market and buy another Spirit Craftsmen.","Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan were prepared to do their best to meet Lin Yuan’s requirements.","This was especially true for Wang Xuan. He felt particularly anxious because his level as a Spirit Craftsman didn’t compare to Zhu Shoudan’s, even though Lin Yuan might prefer his style. In comparison, he would likely still appear inferior to Zhu Shoudan.","Lin Yuan could tell that they were nervous, but he did not say anything. It was a good thing for the two of them to maintain their nervousness because Lin Yuan wanted to see their full strength.","If Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan’s Spirit Craftsman abilities were not up to Lin Yuan’s standards, Lin Yuan would not have given such an important place like the Spirit Lock spatial zone to them to forge.","Lin Yuan knew very well that with his friendship with Sun Youcai and Zhao Chen, it would not be difficult for him to obtain talents in the future.","After arranging Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan, Lin Yuan called the Class 5 Breeder over.","The moment Lin Yuan won the bid for Han Qin, he knew that as long as this young man did not sell him in the future, his honor and humiliation would all be on this young man.","Although Bizarre Plant Demon Hall had not won the bid for him on the auction stage, Han Qin couldn’t help but feel a bit disappointed. He knew very well that Bizarre Plant Demon Hall would only give him the best treatment if they bid for him.","However, after entering the Spirit Lock spatial zone and learning about Lin Yuan’s foundation, he immediately changed his mind.","Breeders were extremely close to nature. It was a blessing for plant-type feys to have Breeders nurturing them. Similarly, every Breeder was proud of nurturing an outstanding plant-type fey.","Han Qin had a special bloodline. Every time he nurtured an outstanding plant-type fey, he would receive feedback from them, allowing his affinity with the plant to increase.","The environment he was in now could easily nurture all kinds of outstanding plant-type feys. In such an environment, he could even nurture those rare plant-type feys that he could not nurture previously!","Under the enhancement of such an environment, his value was actually not inferior to a true Grade 5 Creator. To be able to be in such an environment, it was needless to say what kind of foundation Lin Yuan had. Anyone with a discerning eye could easily tell.","He bowed respectfully to Lin Yuan, “Hello, Young Master. During this period, I’ve already cultivated a few extremely good plant-type feys. I wonder if Young Master is interested in taking a look?”","Han Qin was just as nervous as Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan. He was afraid that Lin Yuan would not care about him. Since Lin Yuan was in control of his own fate, there was naturally no hope for him in the future if he did not value him.","Lin Yuan did not show any arrogance and spoke politely. “If Elder Han can become a Class 5 professional, even if you are not a Creator, you are still a capable person. You don’t have to be so reserved with me.”","Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan was similar to his attitude toward Han Qin. However, compared to Zhu Shoudan and Wang Xuan, Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Han Qin was much friendlier.","Before Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan became Class 5 Spirit Craftsmen, they could not be considered the true core members of Sky City.","Hu Quan could become a core member of Sky City as a Class 4 Spirit Craftsman because Lin Yuan had brought him to the Sky Beyond the Clouds from the main world.","However, Han Qin was different. Just like how Breeders could not replace Creators, Creators could not replace Breeders either. Regardless of whether it was inside the Spirit Lock spatial zone or in the Sky City’s zone, he was extremely valuable.","Lin Yuan had many plant-type feys that required him to breed.","Regardless of whether it was the Business Flourishing Flower, Green Vine, or the Jasmine Lily, Lin Yuan’s plant-type feys would grow stronger faster with his help, and their bloodlines would mutate more easily. It was even possible that Han Qin could facilitate the inheritance of their excellent bloodlines acquired through continuous mutation when the three of them bred offspring.","When Han Qin sensed Lin Yuan’s attitude toward him, he was pleasantly surprised. Lin Yuan had addressed him as Elder Han, so he knew that Lin Yuan would not treat him badly. Moreover, Lin Yuan had already allowed him to contract the Lifespan Mouse and obtain an endless lifespan. This was a joyous occasion for Han Qin, who didn’t have much lifespan to begin with.","In fact, before he was captured, Han Qin had already begun to search for a way to increase his lifespan. However, methods to extend lifespan were hard to come by, and Han Qin didn’t hold a particularly high status in the South Universe.","As for the spiritual ingredients that could increase one’s lifespan, they were basically all taken by Grade 5 Creators. Hence, Han Qin could only obtain relatively low-end resources to increase his lifespan.","Anyone who felt that their lifespan was about to run out would feel a deep sense of powerlessness and reluctance to part with this world. As a Class 5 Breeder, Han Qin had already achieved great success, so every day he lived was a pleasure. Even if he was caught and sold, Han Qin had never been mistreated.","“Young Master, I’m not reserved, but I have to show you respect in front of you. I hope that I can help you solve your problems and do my best to nurture more outstanding plant-type feys by your side in the future.”","Lin Yuan said in a very serious tone, “If you work hard for me in the future, I won’t treat you badly! In the future, whether it’s nurturing plant-type feys or breeding again, you can tell me directly if you need anything. Perhaps I can help you improve one day!”","If he gave the resources of Grade 6 Creator to Han Qin, it would be difficult for Han Qin not to improve!","Lin Yuan did not call him over to assign him a mission. Instead, he wanted to know the situation at the border between the South Universe and the East Universe, which was the so-called South Universe battlefield.","“Han Qin, do you have any relatives or relatives in the South Universe?”","Upon hearing this, Han Qin shook his head, “Young Master, my clan was destroyed more than 30,000 years ago. I no longer have any relatives. I have been alone for over 30,000 years.","“Later on, I joined a faction called Hundred Herb Cliff. It provoked an expert in the process of actively attacking other factions. This expert joined forces with many factions to destroy Hundred Herb Cliff.","“I came here after dealing with two factions in succession. The faction that sold me wasn’t the faction that captured me directly. There are many such opportunistic factions at the intersection of the four universes. This faction that has the ability to buy and sell me is quite capable. They have some power in the South Universe battlefield!”"]},{"number":3077,"title":"Chapter 3077: Five-Colored Cut!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3077: Five-Colored Cut!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At this point, Han Qin’s face revealed a humiliated expression.","“If not for the fact that I was not strong enough and couldn’t resist, as a lifestyle-class professional with the ability to breed, I definitely wouldn’t let these people trample on me like this!”","However, Han Qin immediately shut his mouth. Fortunately, he was not strong enough to resist. Otherwise, he would not have only suffered such light injuries. Like the other two Class 5 Gourmets who were auctioned together with him, because they were stronger than him, they resisted fiercely and suffered extremely serious injuries to their roots.","Lin Yuan did not know much about the faction behind Zhao Chen, as he did not tell him much. However, Lin Yuan had a certain understanding of the faction behind Zhao Chen now. Since Han Qin said that the faction behind Zhao Chen had considerable power in the South Universe battlefield, Lin Yuan began to value his cooperation with Zhao Chen.","Upon seeing that Lin Yuan was so interested in the South Universe battlefield, Han Qin said, “Young Master, the intense battle in the South Universe battlefield is like a meat grinder. There are many factions around. These factions relied on the South Universe battlefield to make a fortune. In the end, most of them died on the battlefield.","“Those factions that have endured and survived for a long time have now become giants. They have long spread their influence outside the South Universe battlefield.","“Young Master, if you have enough powerful martial force in your hands, you will definitely be able to gain a lot from the South Universe battlefield!”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan shook his head lightly. Lin Yuan’s business was very big now. As a faction that was holed up in North of the Lonely River, Sky City had already spread its business to Diverse City. The new members of the Astronomical Parliament in the four universes were also considered Sky City’s extensions.","Under such circumstances, Sky City didn’t need to expand its influence further. The gains from the South Universe battlefield could be obtained by Lin Yuan through the consumption of Creator resources. There was really no need for Lin Yuan to spend any more effort on the South Universe battlefield.","“Developing in the South Universe battlefield may not be viable. However, if there’s an opportunity in the future, we can support a faction located there.”","Lin Yuan let Han Qin stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for the time being. When they reached North of the Lonely River, he would let him report to Sun Ningxiang first.","Compared to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Sun Ningxiang undoubtedly needed Han Qin’s help more.","Lin Yuan communicated with the other two Class 5 Gourmets after helping them recover from their injuries. Among all the lifestyle-class professionals, Gourmets undoubtedly had the lowest status. However, Lin Yuan still gave the two Class 5 Gourmets the respect they deserved and made them contract Lifespan Mouses. The two Gourmets were extremely grateful to Lin Yuan.","While Lin Yuan was in Diverse City, Autumn had already taken care of all the subsequent matters in the Scarlet Territory. Autumn had always been very direct and preferred to tackle problems with a swift and decisive approach. If not for that, the situation in the Scarlet Territory would not have been resolved so quickly.","Naturally, Autumn had resolved the matter so quickly because he wanted to meet Lin Yuan after knowing his schedule. After all, after the matter was resolved, Autumn still had to lead the hunting team to hunt star pirates.","Lin Yuan decided to rest in Treasure City. Before he could return to North of the Lonely River, Shiny had successfully absorbed the pure wind elemental Five-Colored Ripping Wind and stepped into the Holy Spirit level.","Lin Yuan summoned Shiny. Although its feathers were still golden, they were already circulating with five-colored light.","Upon closer inspection, one could see that the flowing five-colored light was actually a layer of wind that was moving at high speed. The rapidly flowing wind was none other than the Five-Colored Ripping Wind that Shiny had just absorbed.","The Sacred Golden Wind, which was also a pure wind element, evolved from Shiny’s roots during his evolution. While Shiny had indeed grasped the Five-Colored Wind Ripping during the digestion process, it was mostly to strengthen the root power of the Sacred Gold Wind.","The Five-Colored Wind Ripping that circulated around the feathers would eventually converge in the holy golden wind that appeared between Shiny’s claws.","Shiny didn’t enter a mimicry state. At that moment, its body could be described as covering the sky.","It was unknown if it was because it had absorbed the two pure wind elements, but the baneful aura that suffused Shiny’ss body was no longer as obvious as before. Instead, it had the unique agility of an elemental holy spirit.","Shiny was not used to its doubled body size, so it quickly transformed into its human form and stood beside Lin Yuan.","“Yuan, my newly obtained divine kingdom is especially powerful. I’ve always wanted to improve my combat strength, and I’ve finally done it!”","Shiny had a mischievous personality when it was young, but after it grew up, it had become extremely composed.","The divine kingdom ability obtained from stepping into the Holy Spirit level could make Shiny so excited. It was enough to show that the divine kingdom ability was not simple.","Lin Yuan wanted Shiny to obtain a functional divine kingdom ability. However, compared to functional divine kingdom abilities, Shiny loved combat more.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to probe Shiny.","[Fey Name]: Golden Wings","[Fey Species]: Barren-species/feather-winged-species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wind","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine kingdom grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Snapped Neck Falling Death]: When its sharp claws make contact with a target, the target’s neck will be snapped. At the same moment, the Golden Wings will extract the target’s soul and absorb the soul into its feathers. The soul will imbue the storm patterns on the feathers with intelligence.","[Flowing Wind Claws]: When the wind elements in the Golden Wings’ feathers are released into the environment, it will be able to control the surrounding winds and manipulate it to attack its opponent. The attacked target will feel like it is being slashed by claws. After attacking a target, the Golden Wings will also be able to inject wind elements into its target through explosions and cause double the amount of damage.","[Rapid Wind Whistle]: By flapping its wings to activate wind-elemental energy, it will simultaneously let out a roar that causes both physical and elemental damage to a designated target. A headwind will also lower the target’s speed. Each time a headwind is released, its own speed will be increased.","[Hurricane Added Protection]: A vicious hurricane shield will be added to one’s own body. Every time elemental damage is inflicted on it, the hurricane shield will absorb the damage before reflecting it. The hurricane shield can also absorb wind-elemental energy from the surroundings to replenish the wind-elemental energy in its body.","[Folded Wings Wind Valley]: With the Golden Wings at the center, an environment charged with wind-elemental energy will be formed. Wind-elemental energy will be continuously produced in this environment. When it makes a sacrifice to this territory, the wind-elemental energy will be absorbed into its bloodline and trigger a one-time explosion.","[Disappearing Wind Attack]: Its body will be combined with wind elements. Even a slight breeze will be enough for it to hide within. While it is hiding in the wind, it will be immune to damage as long as the wind remains.","[Revived Seasonal Winds]: The wind elements’ state will be changed. The wind elements will gain powerful healing abilities. Targets will be healed wherever the winds exist. They will continue to heal as long as the wind does not stop moving.","[Swift Wind Death]: The sharpness of wind elements will be activated. The wind elements will change into wild winds that will continuously attack the target until the target has been ground to pieces. The sharpness of the wind elements will have Flowing Wind Claws’ tearing effects and Snapped Neck Falling Death’s bone-breaking effects.","[Elemental Sword Feathers]: All the feathers will be elementalized. The pure elemental traits in the feathers will be activated. When the feathers are attacked and damaged, the wind flowing in the environment will naturally replenish the feathers. The feathers can be shot into the outside world and will have penetrating effects.","[Sacred Golden Wind]: All the wind elements under its control will be transformed into sacred gold wind. The sacred gold wind will go beyond the regular elemental state. The lowest elemental state will have damaging and immunity effects.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Unset State]: When interacting with another fey, the Golden Wings can copy the fey’s exclusive skill and triggered abilities. Unset State will then turn into the copied exclusive skill and triggered ability. The abilities can only be switched out once every lunar cycle.","[Wind’s Descendant]: By placing itself as the heart of all wind elements, it will become the eye of a hurricane and control all of the surrounding wind elements. It will become the master while all other winds will become its disciple.","[Summoning Wind Changing Spirit]: Use wind elements to accommodate other elemental energy and turn them into vassals of the wind elements. In extreme environments, the accommodated elemental energy can change its own attributes and allow it to become better affiliated with the environment as well as use elemental attacks of different elemental types.","[Whirling Wind Compression]: Use the energy in its body to compress and coordinate wind-elemental energy. The wind elements will be tightly locked together and will resonate. Its ability to control wind elements will be stronger than that of the natural environment and it will become stronger at controlling wind elements in different elements. The power of its abilities and exclusive skills related to wind will also be strengthened.","[Golden Wind Enters Body]: The sacred golden wind will be absorbed into the body and be used to change the body. The sacred golden wind will transform into sacred entities that command wind elements and will be able to suppress all inferior wind elements. In the transformed state, it will be able to comprehensively increase its energy and the characteristics it controls.","[Wind Territory Release]: The sacred golden energy will be released into the surrounding environment. The environment filled with the sacred golden wind will be under its control and the wind territory under its control will suppress lifeforms of other types. Each suppressed target will lead to an increase in the wind speed of the sacred golden wind in the wind territory.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Sacred Golden Wind Nest]: A large nest of faith power will be created in the divine kingdom. The sacred golden wind can be released from the body in the nest and condensed into sacred golden wind crystals.","[Five-Colored Cut]: Contains the Sacred Golden Wind in the body in the divine kingdom and gathers the power of the body through faith power. It adds a cut-off skill to all attacks. When the target’s defense is greater than the target’s attack, the Five-Colored Wind Ripping can break through the defense and cut off the energy in the target’s body, spiritual energy, and even soul. (The target’s elemental energy is weaker than the target’s own, so it can’t defend against the target’s attack.)","Upon seeing Shiny’s newly obtained divine kingdom ability, Five-Colored Cut, Lin Yuan knew why Shiny was so excited.","The Five-Colored Ripping Wind was the purest wind element. Elements of the same level must also be pure to match it. There were many lifeforms in the world with stronger wind-elemental abilities than Shiny’s, but how many of them had pure elements?","The Five-Colored Wind Ripping had completely fused into Shiny’s body. Shiny’s body was already able to produce Five-Colored Wind Ripping like it produced Sacred Golden Wind. Therefore, even if it consumed the Five-Colored Wind Ripping, it wouldn’t affect Shiny’s much.","As Lin Yuan observed its abilities, Shiny revealed a conflicted expression in its human form.","Lin Yuan said when he saw its hesitant look, “Shiny’s, if you have any thoughts or concerns in your heart, there’s no need to hide them from me. Just tell me directly.”","Lin Yuan originally thought that Shiny’s conflicted expression was because it had a need for resources after stepping into the Holy Spirit level.","Shiny’s was no longer conflicted when it heard Lin Yuan’s words.","“Yuan, compared to staying in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to increase my strength or in a nest like North of the Lonely River, I want to hunt star pirates by Autumn’s side and train myself during the battle! Don’t worry, I’ll definitely listen to Autumn when I’m outside!”","When Shiny said that, it wore a look of longing and pleading. As a barren bloodline fey, Shiny’s was extremely ferocious due to its bloodline. Lin Yuan had been suppressing Shiny’s ferocity for the sake of its safety. Now with Shiny’s request and Autumn’s presence ensuring its safety, there was no reason for Lin Yuan to refuse Goldwing’s request.","Apart from Shiny, Lin Yuan also summoned Green Vine and the other feys that had stepped into the Holy Spirit level. He wanted to see if the Green Vine, Jasmine Lily, and Rememberling had any thoughts of training outside.","If any of Lin Yuan’s feys had such thoughts, letting them accompany Autumn under Autumn’s care would reassure Lin Yuan. However, in the end, only Shiny wanted to go out to train. The other fellows did not have such thoughts.","Compared to fighting outside, Lin Yuan’s other feys actually hoped that he could accompany them more. Chimey, Genius, and the Jasmine Lily hated fighting.","When Lin Yuan left Treasure City, he handed Shiny to Autumn and asked him to take care of it.","“Young Master, don’t worry. If you hand over your contracted fey to me, I will definitely take good care of its safety and not let anything happen to it!”"]},{"number":3078,"title":"Chapter 3078 Astronomical Parliament Parliamentary Meeting Convenes Again!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3078 Astronomical Parliament Parliamentary Meeting Convenes Again!","Lin Yuan could sense Autumn’s cautiousness from his words, but he did not want him to overly protect Shiny.","....","Being overly protective of Shiny made it difficult for it to engage in life-and-death battles. This went against Shiny’s goal of going out to train.","“Autumn, you just have to ensure that Shiny doesn’t die during the battle with the star pirates. Shiny has two utmost pure elements. Even if its roots become damaged, it can quickly recover as long as it has enough pure spiritual energy and elemental pearls. I hope that Shiny can obtain the growth it wants before it returns.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan reached out and stroked Shiny’s head. As he looked at the determined Shiny, Lin Yuan suddenly felt like his son had grown up!","Autumn nodded seriously when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. He understood what he meant.","“Young Master, if you trust me, I can also train Shiny to support its growth other than helping it to fight the star pirates. However, if I were to train Shiny, it would suffer to some extent.”","Before Lin Yuan could say anything, Shiny said in an extremely serious tone, “Uncle Autumn, just train me well. I won’t complain! I fought those people who were brought into the Spirit Lock spatial zone previously and realized that I couldn’t defeat them at all. It’s not that I’m lacking in ability, but I’m indeed not as skilled as them in combat, nor do I have the opportunity to fight often.”","Autumn knew that Lin Yuan would definitely agree to him training Shiny. Autumn was afraid that Shiny would not be able to withstand the pain. Now that Shiny had spoken, Autumn was completely relieved.","...","After returning to North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan went to his master, the Moon Empress, as usual.","The Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan was coming back and did not go into seclusion. She deliberately prepared to meet him.","When the Moon Empress communicated with Lin Yuan through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, she knew that Lin Yuan had benefited greatly and obtained many talents for Sky City.","The Moon Empress was not surprised at all.","Previously, Lin Yuan had already recruited many Creators for Sky City, and they were at least Grade 4. Dozens of Creators arrived at Sky City, instantly solving Sky City’s shortage of Creators.","Resources like spirit qi and elemental energy were indeed not lacking in Sky City but high-grade Creator resources were definitely not limited to this.","The potions concocted by Grade 4 and 5 Creators often had special effects.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have been in such a hurry to recruit Creators for Sky City.","The Moon Empress said with a sigh, “Little Yuan, you bring great benefits to Sky City every time you come back. Do you still remember the last time when you brought Zhi Ling back?","“With Zhi Ling ruling over the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, not only Wen Yu and I but even Su Yiren and Luo Lan have been freed up. The Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies perfectly bears the burden of the operation of the faith country.”","As a Creator, the Moon Empress could see the uniqueness of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies with just her eyesight.","However, after the Moon Empress truly came into contact with the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, she realized that the value created by the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies through their own abilities far exceeded her imagination.","Otherwise, with the Moon Empress’ personality, she would not have praised the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies in front of Lin Yuan.","“Master, I came back this time to provide Zhi Ling with resources so that she can produce more Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. How has the growth rate of faith country been?”","The Moon Empress said with a smile, “The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons are completely under our control now. These two species are doing their best to help develop the faith country.","“The two tribes on the spirit land of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons spontaneously gathered. While you were gone, the population of the faith country nearly doubled. The development in the past two months was even faster than the previous six months!","“However, even if there are demon insects maintaining order in the faith country, there are still many conflicts. Now that the faith country has reached a certain scale, it’s impossible to maintain the stability of the faith country with martial force alone. I think we need to think of a way to maintain the stability of the faith country!”","The Moon Empress was very happy that the faith country could develop so quickly. However, the Moon Empress could see the problems that arose from the development of the faith country.","As the saying went, a thousand-mile dam was destroyed by an ant’s nest. If this matter was not handled perfectly, Sky City would sooner or later be in trouble.","Lin Yuan was delighted. The faster the faith country developed, the faster he would accumulate capital.","Lin Yuan had already anticipated that there would definitely be problems if so many tribes integrated into the faith country and directly multiplied the population of the faith country. It was normal that even the demon insects would be unable to solve such a problem.","If it were in the past, Lin Yuan would definitely be worried if he knew about this situation. However, since the Jasmine Lily had absorbed enough energy and attained bloodline metamorphosis in the blood pool, its newly obtained divine kingdom ability could easily solve this problem.","When the Jasmine Lily turned most of the people in the faith country into its believers or even fanatics, the faith country would become unified under the guarantee of firm faith. At that time, even without those demon insects, there would not be any safety hazards!","“Master, it won’t take long for the internal order problems of the faith country to be resolved. No matter how many tribes the faith country suddenly integrates in the future, there won’t be any problems even without targeted planning and incitement. I’ve found a solution. You can rest assured about that.","“This time, I’ve brought back a lot of talents for construction and development. With these people in Sky City, Sky City won’t have a problem of slow development due to the lack of high-end talents for a long time.","“This time, I won’t leave until the Creator’s Creation Conference in the East Universe begins. During this period, I plan to help all the core members of Sky City increase their strength and enable everyone to reach the Holy Spirit level. When that time comes, Sky City will have sufficient capital and there will be no need to remain in this state of seclusion.”","Lin Yuan had always been the kind of person who liked to keep a low profile and make a fortune in silence. However, he kept a low profile only because of his personality. It was not that he could not keep a high profile. In an environment like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was necessary to be high-profile at times.","Lin Yuan headed to the Sky Beyond the Clouds with the intention of developing Sky City into a true overlord faction.","When the Moon Empress heard Lin Yuan’s plan, a smile appeared on her face. Lin Yuan had always been an extremely steady and sensible person.","As a master, the Moon Empress had never worried about such matters.","“Little Yuan, once the other core members of Sky City have reached pinnacle Holy Spirit level, it will indeed be time for Sky City to make a name for itself in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.”","After the Moon Empress arrived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, she had been helping Lin Yuan manage Sky City. No matter how powerful Wen Yu was, it would be difficult for her to make decisions without the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress’ understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds came partly from the information she had received from Lin Yuan and partly from the local members of the Sky Beyond the Clouds that Lin Yuan had taken into Sky City.","The Moon Empress basically called over a Creator every day. Be it a Grade 4 or 5 Creator, the Moon Empress liked to communicate with them. This was because communicating with them was a process for the Moon Empress to absorb knowledge and broaden her horizons.","Creators had always been extremely arrogant. They only communicated with people they thought highly of and did not like to share the knowledge they had.","The Moon Empress had only interacted with these Creators as a core member of Sky City and did not reveal that she was Lin Yuan’s master.","However, regardless of gender, these Creators fell into a state of shock the moment they saw the Moon Empress.","This was not because of the Moon Empress’ appearance but because of her ability.","The Moon Empress was the most senior person in Sky City but only had a lifespan of less than 120 years. To these Creators, the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan were both newborns.","She had become a Grade 4 Creator before reaching the age of 100. What kind of talent was this?","Sun Yin’s talent was already considered excellent. But at the age of 140 years, Sun Yin was not even a Grade 3 Creator, much less Grade 4.","The Creator circle would usually talk about talent. Creators were a group that valued talent very much.","Whether it was the Moon Empress’ talent or her status as a core member of Sky City, these people all wanted to curry favor with the Moon Empress.","Especially Zhong Zhiyu. Every time he communicated with the Moon Empress, he would tell her many of his insights as a Grade 5 Creator. The Creators who joined Sky City later did not know the Moon Empress’ status but Zhong Zhiyu did. When Zhong Zhiyu had just joined Sky City, he had been in time for the internal meeting of Sky City’s members and knew the identity of the Moon Empress, Lin Yuan’s master.","All the core members of Sky City respected the Moon Empress.","Zhong Zhiyu saw Lin Yuan’s attitude toward the Moon Empress. Yi He brought several Grade 5 Creators to Sky City. The Grade 5 Creators were all weaker than him, but Yi He still felt immense pressure. Although they were inferior to him now, it did not mean that they would continue to be inferior to him in the future.","Especially when Yi He heard that Lin Yuan had taken Sun Yin under his wing.","Zhong Zhiyu was a person who was extremely good at poaching. He would use any method to improve his status in Sky City.","Communicating with these Creators allowed the Moon Empress to grow rapidly.","The Moon Empress also felt that she should display her strength when Sky City was strong enough and advance bravely in the subsequent eras.","With the existence of the faith country, Sky City’s development and the strength of its core members would not be delayed even if she remained hidden backstage.","However, living in such a peaceful nest would inevitably change one’s temperament.","Once one’s temperament changed, there would be a huge problem.","The Moon Empress sent out the members of Sky City’s combat sequence and reserve sequence to the area where the faith country was expanding to ensure its stability.","Some of Sky City’s core members had indeed been injured during the few conflicts and their roots had been damaged.","However, the Moon Empress still did not cancel this order.","The Moon Empress’ goal was to ensure that the core members of Sky City would not become weaklings when something really happened to Sky City in the future.","After chatting with the Moon Empress for a while, Lin Yuan ate at her place and went to look for Wen Yu.","As Lin Yuan had been away for a long time, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings had been delayed.","Fortunately, the Astronomical Parliament did not have a clear rule on how often it would be held. Otherwise, it would be equivalent to breaking their promise to the new members who had joined Sky City.","Lin Yuan had informed Wen Yu in advance and she was already prepared when he arrived.","As the crystal-like eye on Wen Yu’s forehead lit up, the banquet among the stars resumed.","Apart from Ruyi, all the members immediately entered the Astronomical Parliament.","The moment Zhou Yu and Jing Bo appeared, they thanked Wen Yu, Lin Yuan, and Liu Jie excitedly.","Among all the Astronomical Parliament members that Lin Yuan had brought from the main world, Bei Xu was the furthest away. Lin Yuan let Bei Xu manage the Lonely River while the others stayed by his side.","It could be said that the Astronomical Parliament was held mainly for new members like Zhou Yu and Jing Bai.","Lin Yuan asked the two of them, “Have the two of you encountered any trouble recently?”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s concern, Jing Bo explained the situation of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Actually, Kong Huan had already told Lin Yuan everything that Jing Bo had told him.","In the beginning, Kong Huan helped Jing Bo because it was Lin Yuan’s arrangement. However, the relationship between the Alluring Foxes and Purifying Water Illusion Snakes gradually changed from relying on each other to a win-win situation. The Alluring Foxes did not have any talent in business, but the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were extremely good at trading and mining.","Kong Huan was deeply doted on by the Snow-Covered Fox leader and was pregnant with his son.","The territory bestowed by this Snow-Covered Fox leader contained rich mineral resources. Under the cooperation of both sides, the Alluring Foxes became increasingly richer.","The lives of the members became better and better.","“Leo, I’m fine now. It’s just that the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes need time to develop. The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes have been servile for too long. The members have lost their courage. What I have to do now is think of a way to stimulate their courage again.”","While saying this, Jing Bo’s eyes were filled with humiliation and helplessness.","Regardless of how far he could lead the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes after joining the Astronomical Parliament, the fact that the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had been enslaved and oppressed by other branches of the Illusion Snakes for hundreds of thousands of years would forever become a humiliating history for the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes."]},{"number":3079,"title":"Chapter 3079 The Opportunity Gained!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3079 The Opportunity Gained!","Lin Yuan listened to Jing Bo’s narration of the recent situation. He recalled what Kong Huan had told him and asked, “Jing Bo, I heard that although the Snow-Covered Foxes only accept the fox-species as their dependent species and are very cold to all species other than foxes, they treat the Creators of other species extremely well. If you become a Grade 2 Creator, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes should be able to develop faster, right?”","....","Jing Bo’s heart trembled when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. He knew very well what kind of ability he had.","He did not seem to have the talent to become a Creator nor had he learned anything about Creators before.","Why did Lin Yuan suddenly say that he could become a Grade 2 Creator? Could it be that Lin Yuan had the ability to make him a Grade 2 Creator?","Jing Bo had always regarded Lin Yuan as a god, but he still found it hard to believe.","Jing Bo said after careful consideration, “Leo, the Snow-covered Foxes does indeed treat Creators of other species extremely well. Once a Creator of another species is willing to join the Snow-covered Foxes, the Snow-Covered Fox leaders will treat the Creator’s species more seriously than the other fox species.","“There was once a member of the Snow-covered Foxes who relied on the fact that one of their women was doted on by a leader and foolishly offended a Creator. Although this Creator who was slighted was only beginner Grade 3, this Snow-Covered Fox leader still executed this dependent species. Although Grade 2 Creators are nothing to the Snow-covered Foxes, if I can become a Class 2 Creator and join the Snow-Covered Foxes, the treatment of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes will still be superior to that of ordinary dependent species.”","Creators were indeed noble, but Grade 2 Creators were really lacking.","In fact, to a powerful species like the Snow-Covered Foxes, Grade 3 Creators were nothing either.","The reason why the Snow-Covered Fox leader executed this favored dependent species after a conflict with the Grade 3 Creator was because he needed to express his attitude towards the other Creators.","If he had not been bothered or sided with his dependent species, the Creators from other species would never join him again in the future!","There were several Snow-Covered Fox leaders. Even if they did not join him, they could join the others.","Therefore, every Snow-Covered Fox leader expressed their love and respect for Creators.","Lin Yuan said this because he wanted to help the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes and Alluring Foxes to develop in the North Universe.","Just like how Lin Yuan had nurtured Ta Lei into a Creator through Genius, Lin Yuan could also nurture Jing Bo into a Creator.","Even though letting Genius use Connected Tails to transfer a huge amount of Creator knowledge to Jing Bo required a large amount of willpower and laws, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s body had accumulated a sufficient volume.","As the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen continued to extract and absorb the bodies of the star pirates, the power of law and wills would continue to accumulate and increase.","Just the infusion of knowledge could only allow Jing Bo to become a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator. If he wanted to advance further to Grade 3, Jing Bo needed to concoct more potions and study them.","Kong Huan would provide resources to help Jing Bo. Jing Bo would become a Grade 2 Creator at such a young age and be willing to submit to the leader who Kong Huan served.","As long as he was not a fool, this leader would definitely focus on nurturing Jing Bo. The younger the Creator, the more valuable they were and the higher the upper limit they might reach in the future. Moreover, Jing Bo had Kong Huan’s help and Kong Huan’s recommendation.","“In that case, I’ll bestow you with an opportunity. When you return to the real world to digest this opportunity, you can become a true pinnacle Grade 2 Creator. After becoming a Grade 2 Creator, the subsequent improvements will depend on you!”","Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and the others were not surprised by Lin Yuan’s ability because he had helped Ta Lei and Bu Po become Creators.","However, to Jing Bo and Zhou Yu, Lin Yuan’s ability was superior to even that of gods.","Creators had an extremely high status in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but Lin Yuan was able to create a Creator, allowing a fellow who had never come into contact with Creator knowledge to reach the heavens in a single step.","In Lin Yuan’s eyes, a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator was a nobody. But in Jing Bo and Zhou Yu’s eyes, a Grade 2 Creator was a supreme figure.","This was especially so for Zhou Yu. No matter how down and out the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were now, they had still been glorious in the past, unlike her species that had always been at the bottom.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s reward for Jing Bo, Zhou Yu could not help but reveal a look of admiration.","However, when it came to Lin Yuan, Zhou Yu also had her own opportunities. Lin Yuan rewarded Zhou Yu with a war weapon that Jing Bo did not have.","Zhou Yu knew that she should not take the initiative to ask for resources from Lin Yuan. It was very likely that he would think that she was too greedy.","However, Zhou Yu really wanted to become a Creator.","Zhou Yu wanted to become a Creator not because Creators had a high status and could obtain any power but because the development of the Forbidden Feather Tribe had already fallen into a predicament.","Zhou Yu could not lead the Forbidden Feather Tribe to glory just by relying on that pinnacle Spirit Territory war weapon.","Even though Zhou Yu knew that it was not good to ask Lin Yuan for such a reward, she could not help but say after much consideration, “Leo, is it possible for me to become a Creator as well? The current Forbidden Feather Tribe is attached to a powerful tribe. Apart from my sister, the Forbidden Feather Tribe basically doesn’t have any acceptable prodigies. However, my sister reveals her talent, it’s very likely that we won’t obtain the recognition of this large tribe but will be tainted by their experts. Previously, the Forbidden Feather Tribe was targeted by Tail Bind Tribe because the leader of Tail Bind Tribe took a fancy to my sister.”","Wen Yu looked at Zhou Yu who was asking Lin Yuan for an opportunity. Not only did she not feel that there was anything wrong with her, but she also felt that she was very smart.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, not only did Zhou Yu not have a strong background, but her talent was also not outstanding. If one wanted opportunities, one had to fight for them. If Zhou Yu did not fight for the opportunity, she would soon be marginalized in the Astronomical Parliament and become a dispensable existence.","Although the Astronomical Parliament was a faction formed by elites, there were not many people in the entire faction.","However, this did not mean that Lin Yuan could take care of everyone in the Astronomical Parliament.","Wen Yu felt that Lin Yuan was willing to pull Zhou Yu into the Astronomical Parliament because of Zhou Yu’s attitude toward her sister.","For the sake of her sister, Zhou Yu was willing to use everything she had to make a deal. Wen Yu felt that this was the reason why Lin Yuan was willing to give Zhou Yu a chance. Otherwise, Zhou Yu would definitely not be qualified to join the Astronomical Parliament.","Since Lin Yuan had chosen Zhou Yu, he would be willing to help her. Moreover, Lin Yuan had always liked people who knew how to take the initiative to fight for their opportunities.","Zhou Yu joining the Astronomical Parliament was definitely the greatest opportunity in Zhou Yu’s life.","Lin Yuan looked up at Zhou Yu. He saw the excited and conflicted expression on her face and said with a smile, “Indeed, with the current situation of the Forbidden Feather Tribe, only by becoming a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator will you have a chance to help the Forbidden Feather Tribe open up a new future. When you return to the real world, I will also bestow this opportunity to you.”","Lin Yuan was a little surprised by Zhou Yu’s initiative to fight for this opportunity. In fact, even if Zhou Yu did not take the initiative to fight for it, he was willing to give this opportunity to Zhou Yu.","Just as Wen Yu had thought, Lin Yuan had chosen Zhou Yu because there was a certain similarity between them. It was this closeness that made Lin Yuan feel compassionate towards her.","Zhou Yu hurriedly thanked Lin Yuan as she said, “Leo, If I become a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator, I can join this large tribe and help the Forbidden Feather Tribe integrate into this large tribe as a dependent species. I can also ensure that the Forbidden Feather Tribe will not be persecuted.”","When she said this, Zhou Yu’s tone was extremely firm.","This was because Zhou Yu knew very well that no matter how talented her sister was, she would not be more attractive to a faction than a Grade Creator as young as her. Her father was inexperienced and could not help her in the development of the Forbidden Feather Tribe. It was solely on her to find ways to develop the Forbidden Feather Tribe and integrating into a large tribe was undoubtedly the best way to find opportunities.","Zhou Yu did not tell Lin Yuan about her arrangements and thoughts because she was not sure if it was right or wrong for her to be indecisive about integrating into this large tribe.","It had to be known that joining this tribe as a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator was completely different from relying on this tribe. However, only by joining this tribe could they better use this tribe as a springboard.","The Astronomical Parliament was already halfway done when Ruyi finally arrived.","When Ruyi arrived, she immediately apologized to Lin Yuan. “I’m really sorry. I was with my mother before the meeting started and couldn’t find a reason to leave immediately.”","Wen Yu’s furrowed brows relaxed. If that was the case, there was really nothing to blame Ruyi for.","If Ruyi forcefully participated in the meeting when she was with her mother, the Astronomical Parliament would most likely be exposed.","Ruyi came from a powerful faction. Ruyi’s parents were definitely experts. When Ruyi joined the Astronomical Parliament, they could feel a trace of energy unique to sacred source lifeforms guiding Ruyi.","The Astronomical Parliament was held at the last minute, and there was a time difference between the four universes.","If Ruyi did not want to expose the existence of the Astronomical Parliament, she had to pay more attention.","Ruyi heaved a sigh of relief when Wen Yu, Lin Yuan and Liu Jie understood her.","However, when she thought about how similar situations might happen in the future, Ruyi could not help but say, “Leo, as a member of the Astronomical Parliament, I will definitely participate in the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings many times in the future. However, I can’t act like a thief every time I participate. This won’t work forever. I have to find a suitable reason without exposing the organization. Moreover, once they find out about my recovery, they will definitely dig into the root of the problem. I won’t be able to hide it even if I want to.”","Ruyi was very nervous when he said this. She was afraid that she would be kicked out of the Astronomical Parliament after saying this.","Ruyi’s body had indeed recovered because of the Astronomical Parliament. She had already fulfilled her wish.","However, if she was kicked out of the Astronomical Parliament, who knew if this health would be retracted?","Furthermore, Ruyi knew very well what kind of opportunity the Astronomical Parliament was Once such an opportunity was missed, it would probably be difficult to encounter it again in this lifetime.","Wen Yu did not speak immediately but looked at Lin Yuan.","She wanted to see what intentions Lin Yuan had.","When Lin Yuan was in the main world, he did not allow the Astronomical Parliament’s information to leak out because he was inexperienced at that time.","From Lin Yuan’s point of view, the Astronomical Parliament’s existence was too mystical. Once outsiders knew of its existence, it was very likely that they would have crooked thoughts.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan did not have much power at that time. He could only rely on the Moon Empress.","Unlike now, when Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were by his side, Lin Yuan had blocked the Astronomical Parliament’s information to prevent its members from revealing information that would affect Lin Yuan’s safety and attract unnecessary trouble.","However, the current situation was completely different from before. As long as Ruyi did not reveal the specific situation of the Astronomical Parliament and only saied that she had joined a mysterious organization, Ruyi’s parents and the others from the Myriad Carp Palace would not have too many objections even if they knew.","After all, this faction had not done nothing. Instead, they had removed Ruyi’s curse that had left them helpless.","Even if the factions behind Ruyi wanted to use Ruyi to reach the Astronomical Parliament, they definitely would not be able to reach North of the Lonely River.","Moreover, Wen Yu would be able to sense if this faction wanted to use this opportunity to investigate the Astronomical Parliament. At most, she would just cut off their connection with Ruyi. Other than that, there would be no other losses.","Lin Yuan said to Wen Yu after some thought, “You can find a suitable reason. As long as you don’t reveal the specific situation of the Astronomical Parliament and don’t let it be affected, you can make up any other reason.”","When Ruyi heard Lin Yuan’s words, she felt relieved.","“Leo, thank you for your understanding. I just need to find a reason that can convince my parents. As for the others from the Myriad Carp Palace, they won’t ask about me. If any of them dares to have any ideas about me, they won’t be able to stay in Carp Mystic Palace anymore! My parents will definitely thank the person who broke my curse. I hope you can give me a chance to thank you!”","Ruyi came from a powerful faction. Even though Lin Yuan was her benefactor, she still had her own pride and confidence when she spoke.","This was completely different from Zhou Yu and Jing Bo."]},{"number":3080,"title":"Chapter 3080 Ru Yi’s Reason!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3080 Ru Yi’s Reason!","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, Ru Yi’s appropriate pride and confidence were not a bad thing.","....","Lin Yuan was not interested in Ru Yi’s parents’ thank-you gift but he felt that he could try to work with the Carp Mystic Palace through Ru Yi.","However, even if they wanted to cooperate, it was not because Lin Yuan took the initiative to contact the Carp Mystic Palace through Ru Yi. Instead, it would be because the people in the Carp Mystic Palace knew of Lin Yuan’s existence and took the initiative to contact him.","Ru Yi’s parents were so concerned about their daughter’s health that they would definitely try to come into contact with people or factions who would help her recover. Ru Yi’s parents should know very well what kind of abilities the person or faction that could help Ru Yi remove the curse had.","“Ru Yι, there’s no need for you to be grateful. If your parents have the intention of interacting with the person who helped you break the curse, you’ll be the messenger! The distance between us is too far. I can’t meet your parents, nor can I bring them into the Astronomical Parliament.”","Ru Yi hurriedly said, “Leo, just have to let me find a reason. As for the rest, I can arrange it so that the organization won’t be exposed!”","After talking to Jing Bai, Zhou Yu, and Ru Yi, Lin Yuan nodded at Wen Yu. It was time for the Astronomical Parliament to accept new members.","Wen Yu began to use the power of the stars to search for those wishes. Soon, two figures were pulled into the place where the stars gathered.","The two of them had passed Wen Yu’s preliminaries. The moment they were pulled into the gathering place of the stars, Wen Yu, Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Su Yiren who just took her seat on the golden chair not long ago received detailed information about them.","One of them came from the West Universe and the other was actually close to the abyssal world.","The two of them joining the Astronomical Parliament allowed the Astronomical Parliament to have members all over the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","These two people were called Li Hen and Yuan Qi.","Li Hen was a very tragic character. Most of the people who joined the Astronomical Parliament were filled with tragedy. One would only use everything they had to pray when one was in despair.","A collateral member like Li Hen, who had been oppressed by the direct descendants for most of his life, had sacrificed his life for them. In the end, he could not even protect his own son.","The scars left by the punishments doled out to collateral descendants did not push Li Hen into despair.","Li Hen’s son, Li Cheng, was Li Hen’s hope. The reason why Li Hen would use everything he had to pray was very simple. That was because Li Cheng, whom Li Hen regarded as his hope, was about to become a plaything because of the willfulness of the Young Master of the family clan’s direct descendants. In the end, he would die.","This was the reason why Li Hen no longer regarded the glory of his family as his responsibility. He would not hesitate to betray his family.","Li Hen happened to be at the intersection of the four universes and Lin Yuan was very interested in the abyssal world.","The lifeforms from the four universes were enemies with the lifeforms from the abyssal world. Every time the abyssal lifeforms invaded the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there would be a disaster. To abyssal world lifeforms, the lifeforms from the four universes were also enemies.","This was because people from the four dimensions would plunder the resources in the abyssal world when they entered. At the same time, they would kill and enslave those abyssal lifeforms.","Advanced abyssal lifeforms were extremely intelligent. There were also many local factions in the abyssal world.","Entering the abyssal world was a very dangerous thing. Once one was targeted by those powerful abyssal lifeforms, their bones would be buried in the abyssal world.","However, Lin Yuan did not mind.","Firstly, it was because Sky City had high-end combat power like Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. Secondly, the passageway controlled by Li Hen’s faction was extremely low in danger. Otherwise, this family would not have relied on this abyssal world passageway to exist and develop for millions of years!","If Lin Yuan wanted Li Hen to join the Astronomical Parliament, it was not a single choice. Lin Yuan also needed to satisfy Li Hen’s needs and save Li Cheng, who had already been chosen by the Li family’s Young Master to become a page boy.","It was not an easy task to save Li Cheng.","The clan that Li Hen was from was very powerful and had experts above the Holy Spirit Realm.","The only way to let Li Hen, a collateral descendant of the family, gain the right to speak was to let Li Hen’s value exceed the requirements of the Young Master.","The difference in status between the direct and collateral descendants of Li Hen’s faction was huge. If not for the fact that Li Hen’s bloodline was on the verge of awakening and Lin Yuan could use the Class 5 Creator resources to awaken Li Hen’s bloodline, he would not have accepted Li Hen.","However, even if he helped Li Hen awaken his bloodline and increased Li Hen’s value in the clan, Lin Yuan still was unsure if Li Hen’s clan would cherish him.","Once Li Hen awakened the bloodline in his body, his combat strength and potential would greatly increase.","A clan cared about the status between a collateral relative and a direct descendant. In essence, it was a concern for the bloodline.","In Li Hen’s clan, it was very difficult for the direct descendants to awaken their bloodlines. Although the collateral descendants who awakened their bloodlines were still inferior to the direct descendants who were highly valued by the clan, they were still considered top figures in the clan.","As long as Li Hen tried his best, Lin Yuan felt that Li Hen would be able to protect his son from becoming the Young Master’s plaything.","After all, the bigger the clan, the more they cared about the warriors who could increase the clan’s foundation.","If Lin Yuan helped Li Hen awaken his bloodline and Li Hen still could not protect his son Li Cheng, there was nothing else that Lin Yuan could do.","It was impossible for Lin Yuan to ask Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter to go to the intersection of the four universes to save Li Cheng.","Li Hen’s value lay in his position and the clan he was in. Once Li Hen left this tribe, he would be of no use.","Yuan Qi and Li Hen had suffered the same fate. Although Yuan Qi was a direct descendant of the family and was valued by the family, after Yuan Qi’s parents died, she suffered more from the persecution of her relatives.","In Lin Yuan’s eyes, Yuan Qi’s aunt’s family was a family of vampires. The fact that Yuan Qi had been looked down upon and discriminated against by so many other prodigies had a lot to do with Yuan Qi’s aunt stealing Yuan Qi’s resources.","If Yuan Qi had not been robbed of so many resources by her aunt’s family, she would not still be unable to awaken her extremely special elemental sacred body.","Yuan Qi’s parents had not disclosed the condition of Yuan Qi’s physique to the outside world. They had been desperately searching for resources outside to prepare resources for Yuan Qi to awaken her body composition.","Yuan Qi’s aunt probably knew about this as well. Otherwise, she would not have kept hiding Yuan Qi’s talent during the family clan’s aptitude test for the younger generation. She wanted to transfer everything that belonged to Yuan Qi to her own child.","However, unlike those ordinary victims, Yuan Qi’s heart was filled with ambition. This kind of ambition was not nurtured by circumstance. It was something that had been in Yuan Qi’s heart since the beginning.","An ambitious person was more likely to succeed than an unambitious person. Lin Yuan valued Yuan Qi’s ambition very much.","It was much easier to help Yuan Qi than Li Hen.","Yuan Qi was a direct descendant who had high hopes in the clan. As long as he helped Yuan Qi awaken her physique, Yuan Qi’s family lineage would definitely attach great importance to her.","Yuan Qi’s lineage was the weakest among the few lineages in the clan. It was very necessary for a prodigy like Yuan Qi to appear to change the state of her lineage.","What an ambitious person like Yuan Qi needed the most was a platform that allowed her to fully display her ambitions. Once Yuan Qi displayed her elemental sacred body, even the elemental clans she belonged to would treat her as a pillar of support and nurture her, let alone her own lineage.","The elemental species had offended the Faerie Institution in the West Universe. The Faerie Institution had always been suppressing the elemental species.","The elemental species was originally extremely powerful, but because of a huge battle with the Faerie Institution hundreds of millions of years ago, the strongest expert in the species was killed by the Faerie Institution and was trapped in a place like the Abyss of Doom where elemental energy was scarce.","If not for the fact that the elemental species had a way to make Elemental Rivers, they could also make Elemental Rivers in places where there were few elements.","The Elemental Clan’s legacy in the Abyss of the Last Days was probably about to wither completely.","Previously, Lin Yuan had only heard about the Faerie Institution’s domineering behavior from others but he had never seen it with his own eyes.","The elemental species’ experience allowed Lin Yuan to fully understand how domineering the Faerie Institution was.","Yuan Qi’s elemental holy body was related to water. Lin Yuan only needed to provide Yuan Qi with large amounts of water elemental heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls and pure spirit qi and Yuan Qi’s elemental sacred body would naturally awaken.","Once Yuan Qi awakened her elemental sacred body, she would become the pride of the entire elemental species. The discrimination of Yuan Qi’s aunt’s family against geniuses of the same age, as well as Yuan Qi’s difficult situation in the clan, would be completely resolved.","Li Hen and Yuan Qi were both extremely surprised by the space they were in.","Wen Yu had already communicated with the two of them and let them know why they were here.","When Yuan Qi heard Wen Yu’s words, she subconsciously revealed a wary expression. People like Yuan Qi, who was full of ambition, were usually very vigilant.","Li Hen asked excitedly, “Can you really save my son Little Cheng? If you can save Little Cheng, I’ll do anything!”","Li Hen’s words were very humble. But no one present, including Yuan Qi, looked down on Li Hen.","Li Hen’s actions reminded Yuan Qi of her father. Her father had risked his life to obtain resources and finally died because of this. She was also risking his life to fight for a future!","Lin Yuan looked at Li Hen and said in an extremely serious tone, “Helping you save your son was your wish when you came here. We will naturally have to do our best to help you achieve it. However, you should know very well what kind of attitude your faction has towards the direct descendants.","“If I want to help you get your son back from the Young Master of the direct descendants, at the very least, I have to make your family feel that you are more valuable than the Sixth Young Master! This is the only way to help you save your son. You should know how difficult it is.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Li Hen’s ecstatic expression freeze.","How could he enable his value to surpass Sixth Young Master in the eyes of the family? The Sixth Young Master was studying at Sacred Feather Academy. Among all the Young Masters of the direct descendants, he was the one who was highly valued. Meanwhile, he was just a collateral relative.","As he understood the family clan’s situation, the hope that had been ignited in Li Hen’s heart was instantly extinguished by more than half.","Lin Yuan could not help but say when he sensed the change in Li Hen’s emotions, “You don’t have to be too pessimistic. If there was no way to satisfy your wish, you wouldn’t be here. If your bloodline crosses from the pinnacle Bronze Helmet to Silver Helmet and reach Golden Helmet, how do you think your authority in the family will be?”","Lin Yuan’s understanding of the bloodline of Li Hen’s race came entirely from Li Hen’s memories. This kind of understanding was extremely one-sided. Therefore, he still had to ask Li Hen himself to determine what kind of change would happen to his status in the family after his bloodline improved.","When Li Hen heard Lin Yuan’s words, he could not help but feel incredulous. What? He could directly upgrade his bloodline from Bronze Helmet to Golden Helmet!","The hurdle of the Silver Helmet basically stopped most of the collateral members of the family clan. He had only been a member of the exploration team previously.","09:25","Once they reached Silver Helmet, they could become the captain of a small team.","Those members who had reached pinnacle Silver Helmet could already be treated as direct descendants in the clan.","If one reached Golden Helmet and received the family’s honor, their status would be comparable to a core member.","The offspring of a branch family member with a Golden Helmet bloodline could even use the clan’s resources to study in a large school.","If his bloodline reached pinnacle Silver Helmet, he might not be able to save Little Cheng from the Sixth Young Master.","However, if he reached Golden Helmet, no matter how unwilling Sixth Young Master was to let Little Cheng go, the elders in the family would definitely not allow such a thing to happen.","“Lord, if my bloodline can reach Golden Helmet, Little Cheng’s safety will definitely be resolved! After ensuring Little Cheng’s safety, I’m willing to do whatever you want me to do, Even if you want me to expose the landmark of my family’s abyssal world passageway!”","Li Hen gritted his teeth as he said this. Compared to being disheartened by his family, Li Hen actually hated his family more.","No matter how big the difference in status between the direct and collateral branches was, Li Hen could accept it in such an environment. What Li Hen could not accept was the persecution of his son by the members of the direct branch.","Li Hen was certain that he had fulfilled his duty as a collateral member of the family. For this, he had been on the brink of death many times. But what did all of this do for him?","Lin Yuan replied calmly, “This kind of gathering happens every once in a while. This gathering will solve your problem first. As for the rest, we’ll talk about it at the next gathering.”","Lin Yuan turned to Yuan Qi and said with a faint smile, “The wish you made is to have shocking power and achieve true power in the clan, right?”","Yuan Qi’s ambition had been exposed by Lin Yuan so she did not feel ashamed at all.","Not only did Yuan Qi not feel ashamed, but she also admitted it very frankly, “That’s right. If I have to use everything I have to exchange for something, what I want most is power! Without power, everything will be taken away.”"]},{"number":3081,"title":"Chapter 3081 Yuan Qi’s Body Composition!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3081 Yuan Qi’s Body Composition!","Yuan Qi’s words were definitely not spoken casually. They came from the bottom of her heart.","....","Yuan Qi used to have the wealth left behind by her parents, but because her aunt had the right to raise her, the wealth left behind by her parents was taken away from her and she was helpless.","Yuan Qi’s elemental clan also had distinctions between the direct descendants and collateral relatives. Although the direct descendants of the clan could not take the lives of the collateral relatives as they pleased, dangerous tasks were all done by the collateral relatives. A decision made by a clan, or even a casual order, would cause a collateral branch to pay with their lives.","Since her life and wealth could be deprived of power, power became what Yuan Qi wanted the most.","As for her strength, Yuan Qi had already given up on her body composition which was like a bottomless pit that only knew how to absorb elemental energy without any feedback.","Yuan Qi could not understand why those elements seemed to disappear into thin air when they entered her body.","If this elemental energy had been absorbed into her body and reacted, she would not have been so passive in the family.","Yuan Qi did not think that Lin Yuan could give her unparalleled power in the clan, so she was very pessimistic about her situation.","All investments had to seek a return. With her situation, she could not give any useful feedback to the organization among the stars.","Yuan Qi was ambitious but not arrogant. She could see through herself.","Yuan Qi still had a sliver of hope because she had learned from Lin Yuan and Li Hen’s conversation that Li Hen was not as valuable as she was. However, Lin Yuan was willing to help Li Hen improve his bloodline.","Yuan Qi looked at Lin Yuan apprehensively, not knowing if she would be able to receive his pity.","Thinking that her request was a little too greedy, Yuan Qi hurriedly changed her words. “Even if I don’t have supreme authority, it’s fine as long as I can maintain my position in the clan and be nurtured by the family!”","Keeping her clan’s position to nurture her was Yuan Qi’s bottom line. Once she failed to keep this position, she would end up in the hands of her aunt’s family. Her ending would definitely not be good!","When Lin Yuan heard Yuan Qi’s words, he could not help but feel a little amused. Yuan Qi was looking down on the Astronomical Parliament’s ability and had no choice but to lower her requirements.","Compared to Yuan Qi’s cowardly appearance, Lin Yuan preferred Yuan Qi’s ambitious appearance.","In Yuan Qi’s elemental species, as long as Lin Yuan helped Yuan Qi awaken her body composition, her talent would definitely match Yuan Qi’s ambition.","The elemental sacred body could be said to be the supreme foundation of the species where vitality was located.","The elemental species had been suppressed for so many years and had always been in a difficult situation. In the face of such a body composition that could allow the species to rise, as long as the ruler of the elemental species was not too muddle-headed, they would know to nurture and take good care of Yuan Qi.","When the entire elemental species placed their future on Yuan Qi, she would naturally have supreme power in the family.","“Protecting your position in the family won’t make things easier for you in the family, right? After all, you’re using everything you have to exchange for an opportunity. At this time, I hope that you can choose to fight for it with all your might rather than give up the opportunity.","“If you’re not greedy enough, how can you match your ambition? It’s not a bad thing to be ambitious, as long as your ambition isn’t targeted at our organization.”","Yuan Qi was stunned when she heard Lin Yuan’s words. For a moment, she did not understand what he meant.","But very quickly, Yuan Qi came back to her senses. The purpose of this existence sitting on the golden chair in front of her saying these words was to fulfill her ambition and give her supreme power in the clan.","Although Yuan Qi did not know what Lin Yuan was going to do, he had clearly become her last straw to clutch at.","Yuan Qi expressed her gratitude to Lin Yuan and waited for him to make further arrangements. She did not ask Lin Yuan how he could fulfill her ambitions and obtain power in the clan.","From this incident, it could be seen that Yuan Qi was extremely shrewd.","It was no wonder. Yuan Qi had grown up in such an environment. If she was not shrewd, she would have been eaten up by her aunt’s family long ago. She would not have been able to find an opportunity to escape her aunt’s family’s control.","Lin Yuan valued Yuan Qi’s shrewdness. He could not help Yuan Qi obtain shrewdness with resources. The shrewder Yuan Qi was, the easier it would be for her to help Lin Yuan in the future.","Lin Yuan asked, “Ever since you started absorbing elemental energy, you should have discovered what is special about your body composition, right? Do you know why the elemental energy that you absorbed with great difficulty disappeared into thin air after entering your body and didn’t help your strength at all?”","Lin Yuan’s question hit deep in Yuan Qi’s heart. She had no idea why and this had always been Yuan Qi’s secret. Yuan Qi did not know how Lin Yuan knew her secret so quickly and it seemed like Lin Yuan also knew the reason.","Yuan Qi said in a low voice, “Lord, the condition of my body has been troubling me for a long time. If you know why my body is in this state, I hope you can enlighten me!”","As Yuan Qi spoke, the expression on her face was extremely bitter. At first, Yuan Qi thought that her condition was because her body was extremely special. She absorbed elemental energy very quickly and her conversion rate of elements was also extremely high. With this, her strength would definitely increase extremely quickly. But in the end, Yuan Qi realized that the situation was not what she had imagined.","Although her body absorbed elemental energy quickly, she could not allocate it as she pleased.","This caused the few direct descendants who had been nurtured by the family with her to be filled with hostility toward her.","No matter what the reason was, Yuan Qi wanted to know an answer from the bottom of her heart.","Judging from the expression on Yuan Qi’s face, she did not think that her special physique was a good thing, but a bad thing. This made Yuan Qi feel extremely inferior.","Lin Yuan could not help but think that Yuan Qi’s aunt’s family had really committed a sin. If it was not for the fact that Yuan Qi’s aunt had always wanted to snatch the assets left behind by Yuan Qi’s parents, she would not have suppressed Yuan Qi in many ways and allowed the family to learn about Yuan Qi’s talent.","Even if the elemental species lacked elemental energy, they would have definitely nurture Yuan Qi on account of her talent.","After seeing Yuan Qi’s life experiences, Lin Yuan knew that Yuan Qi was attached to her aunt’s family after her parents died. Moreover, this attachment was very deep.","If Yuan Qi’s aunt and her family treated Yuan Qi well, she would have helped her younger brother after she rose to prominence.","“Not only is it not a bad thing for your body to be in such a state, but it’s also a good thing! As a direct descendant of the elemental species, you should have heard of the elemental sacred body, right? The condition of your body is a sign of the awakening of the elemental sacred body!","“However, because your elemental sacred body could not absorb enough pure elemental energy, someone might have done something to you when you showed that your body composition was extraordinary, causing your body composition to be in such a silent state.","“I have a way to activate your body composition and completely awaken your elemental sacred body. After awakening your elemental sacred body, your status in the clan will definitely rise. At that time, it won’t be an exaggeration to say that you will have supreme authority!”","When Lin Yuan said this, he sensed that Wen Yu’s condition was gradually deteriorating and her spiritual energy was showing signs of overdraft.","Without giving Yuan Qi any time to react, Lin Yuan signaled Wen Yu to transmit all the resources through Star Spirit Seat before ending the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting.","The Astronomical Parliament already gained five new members after Lin Yuan came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","These five new members were all over the Sky Beyond the Clouds, allowing the Astronomical Parliament to have people in various regions.","Lin Yuan had never been stingy with his help to the members of the Astronomical Parliament. Everyone who joined it had fulfilled their value regardless of whether they followed Lin Yuan or not.","Lin Yuan had already done what he needed to do and would continue to provide resources to the new members. However, how far the members of the Astronomical Parliament could go in the end depended on themselves.","...","After the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, Wen Yu recuperated as usual.","Lin Yuan had not seen Blood Love for a long time.","Now that Lin Yuan had the resources, he felt the need to nurture Blood Love first.","Lin Yuan contacted Blood Love through the Thoughts Letter Paper and told her that he had returned to Sky City and asked her to look for him.","However, Blood Love was not at North of the Lonely River. Instead, she had crossed the Lonely River and was hunting south of it.","As a blood-type fey, Blood Love required a large amount of blood as food.","All lifeforms in North of the Lonely River could become citizens of the faith country, so Blood Love did not hunt there.","It would take at least a day for Blood Love to rush back, so Lin Yuan called Endless Summer over.","Endless Summer and Listen had built Sky City’s trade network together and were currently at North of the Lonely River.","Endless Summer was very excited to receive Lin Yuan’s summoning. It had not had the chance to communicate with Lin Yuan for a long time.","In just five minutes, Endless Summer arrived in front of Lin Yuan.","After Endless Summer arrived, Lin Yuan immediately used True Data to check on her.","[Fey Name]: Endless Mystical Dream Summer","[Fey Species]: Bunched-flower species/hydrangea species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood/Mind","[Fey Quality]: Medium","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Shooting Spears of Summer]: The flower vines will become shafts while the flowers will become blades. The spears will be able to pierce armor and pierce targets.","[Flower Sleet]: Every flower petal will be able to cause damage to targets. The flower petals will also be able to absorb blood to replenish energy.","[Three Thousand Shooting Spears]: 3000 spears will shoot out immediately. When one spear makes contact with a target, the other spears will gather at that spot as well.","[Midsummer Cage]: A cage will be created using flowers and vines. Inside the cage will exist a world of its own that Endless Summer will be able to control.","[Mind Halt]: Influence a target’s mind and cause the target to become instantly confused and prevent the target’s mind and soul from working together.","[Flower Tree Execution]: The roots will grow and form a chain around a target. When the roots pierce a target’s body, it will continue to grow and drain the target’s energy. The drained energy will be stored as fruits.","[Willow Flower Sky Cover]: Release all the energy and vitality inside the body and allow it to grow freely. Willow flowers will grow all over the area. The more flowers that grow, the stronger one will be. The willow flowers will also be able to drain energy from targets.","[Blooming Summer Link]: The targets in contact with its flower petals would be nourished by its blooming summer energy. All of the flora and fauna lifeforms will begin germinating and their injuries will be naturally healed. Boosting and healing the flora and fauna will also increase its own energy and recovery.","[Magical Dream Finger]: The energy in the blooming flora and fauna will be transformed into mind energy and gathered in its finger through which to supply the energy to targets. The mind energy’s attack on the target will put the target’s mind and soul in a dream state. The target can only be awakened through a special method.","[Dream-Stealing Forced Change]: It will enter the mind of the affected target and read the target’s past to forcefully change the target’s circumstances. This will alter the target’s present. After changing the target’s circumstances, it will experience backlash once the target leaves the dream state.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Flourishing Flowers]: As powers increase, the number of flowers will also multiply. The flowers will also be able to cause more damage.","[Thousand Openings of the Mind]: The heart will open a thousand times and increase control over spiritual power.","[End of Summer]: Change its body into summer and concentrate all the power of summer into one point before finally releasing the attack.","[Lifeform Shrivel]: The flower vines will be able to absorb energy from other lifeforms. When the energy absorbed reaches its limit, it will present itself as a vest that can defend against attacks.","[Tree Core Cycle]: Let its body contain as much of the tree core as possible and form a cycle in its body. The cycle of the tree core will provide it with a huge amount of energy and speed up its energy recovery.","[Thriving Summer Territory]: Regardless of the environment, its own energy will be used to trigger and bring forth a thriving summer. Its surroundings will form a thriving summer territory where it will be protected. All targets in the territory will be nourished and boosted by the thriving summer.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Embroidered Flowers Form Hearts]: Its body will take root in the divine kingdom. Faith power will be used to trigger the main body and cause flowers to bloom on the main body. The faith power will combine with the flowers to form flower jades that contain tree cores. The tree cores are able to revive plant-type lifeforms. The revived plant-type lifeforms will go on to provide it with energy and faith power."]},{"number":3082,"title":"Chapter 3082: Guilt Toward Blood Love!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3082: Guilt Toward Blood Love!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Endless Summer reached the Divine Kingdom level, her bloodline underwent a metamorphosis and evolved into Endless Absolute Dream Summer. The divine kingdom ability, Embroidered Flowers Form Hearts, was highly valued by Lin Yuan.","Embroidered Flowers Form Hearts had great strategic significance in reviving other plant creatures through the condensation of faith power. Furthermore, these creatures, once nourished by Endless Summer, would provide a portion of their faith power to her.","Endless Summer used faith power to form a flower domain, which was not a significant consumption for her.","With the help of Breeder Han Qin, Endless Summer and Han Qin could breed and save many endangered plant-type creatures, creating a paradise for them in Sky City.","These endangered plant lifeforms were a considerable resource for Lin Yuan.","When Endless Summer saw Lin Yuan, she bowed. “Long time no see, Young Master!”","Looking at the handsome young man before her, Endless Summer couldn’t help but think of the first time she saw Lin Yuan. Back then, she had been on the verge of breaking through to Myth III and transforming into a human, but she had been plotted against by a stinky crow and nearly lost her life.","Blood Love had coincidentally brought Lin Yuan to save her.","During that battle, Blood Love had just reached Myth Breed and couldn’t do much. Lin Yuan was the one who had truly saved her.","Since then, her fate had changed. She had even stepped into a realm she could not previously understand.","It had only been a few decades since she first met Lin Yuan. If she had not encountered Lin Yuan in the Endless Forest and faced danger, she would still be at Myth III and not even close to reaching Creation Breed.","Endless Summer did not underestimate herself but saw reality clearly and remembered her origins.","In the early years, it was exceedingly dangerous for her to reach Myth Breed.","Everyone who joined Sky City could be described as extremely lucky. None of Sky City’s members had to worry about the tribulations they would face during their grade advancement.","“Auntie Summer, it has indeed been a while since we last met. Looking at your current state, your improvement in strength has been very stable!”","Even with Embroidered Flowers Form Hearts, it would not be easy for her divine kingdom to reach intermediate.","Endless Summer smiled and said, “Isn’t it all thanks to you, Young Master? Ever since you brought Zhi Ling back, everyone now has plenty of time. Although the 20-odd Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies you arranged for Listen and I have some problems with their decision-making, they do not make any mistakes in execution and can perfectly resolve small problems.”","Lin Yuan did not meet many people when he returned to Sky City this time. Almost everyone he met praised Zhi Ling and the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. They had indeed brought many conveniences to Sky City’s development.","Lin Yuan was definitely lucky to have the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies under his command. To a certain extent, this was a small probability that could not be replicated.","The Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, nurtured in an intermediate blessed land, had a certain uniqueness. They were not easily encountered or subdued.","Until now, Lin Yuan had never seen a species comparable to the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies.","“Auntie Summer, it’s been some time since you and Listen built the faith country’s trade system. Is its current development going smoothly?”","Endless Summer replied quickly, “Young Master, the faith country’s trade system is mainly built by Listen. You know how capable he is. The trade system has been almost fully constructed without any accidents. Once we arrange the recently expanded parts, Listen and I will be basically done with our work. After that, I just need to deepen the business network and develop the economy vigorously so that the social system in the faith country can be completely formed!”","Endless Summer played a huge role in the construction of the trade system. In front of Lin Yuan, she did not take the credit but gave more credit to Listen because he had indeed played a leading role in its construction and development. She had been supporting Listen alongside Gu Lang.","When talking about the development of the faith country’s trade system, Endless Summer even praised Gu Lang. He was a young man with many ideas. Initially, Gu Lang was inferior, but now he had grown to a level comparable to her!","Lin Yuan had heard from Wen Yu that Listen, Endless Summer, and Gu Lang had enabled the faith country’s trade system to develop extremely quickly and steadily.","Listen, Gu Lang, and Endless Summer may not have seemed to do much, but they were key contributors to the rapid and stable production of faith power in the faith country.","Lin Yuan spoke to Endless Summer after chatting for a while.","“Auntie Summer, you’ve been at the Divine Kingdom level for quite some time. As long as you have enough faith power, you can reach the Holy Spirit level.","“Previously, I was training in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and didn’t stay in Sky City much. Now, I’ll be staying in Sky City for a long time. Apart from asking you about the development of the faith country, I also have plans to help you reach the Holy Spirit level.”","Endless Summer could not help but tremble when she heard Lin Yuan’s words. Was it finally her turn to obtain this opportunity?","The last time Lin Yuan had returned to Sky City, he had held an internal meeting with the core members. During this meeting, Lin Yuan had said that he wanted to help the core members of Sky City reach the Holy Spirit level one after another.","Endless Summer did not expect that it would be her turn so soon!","Endless Summer hurriedly thanked Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan took out the tree cores condensed from the Holy Spirit trees he had traded in Fortune Treasure Palace and handed them to Endless Summer as he said, “Auntie Summer, before I provide you with faith power to produce holy spirits in your divine kingdom, I plan to let you absorb these tree cores to strengthen your foundation. Even if it’s very difficult for you to advance your bloodline after reaching the Holy Spirit level, this will still be extremely beneficial to you.”","Endless Summer was Lin Yuan’s true ally. She was one of the first people to follow Lin Yuan and was a senior figure in Sky City.","When Endless Summer first joined Lin Yuan, Sky City had not been established, and she had been the number one expert by Lin Yuan’s side. Although her strength had been marginalized, her importance in Lin Yuan’s heart had not diminished at all.","Endless Summer was extremely sensitive. When she saw Lin Yuan take out the tree cores, she understood what he meant.","Endless Summer was extremely touched.","When she reached the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom level, she had already obtained a powerful divine kingdom ability. She really hoped that she could obtain another powerful divine kingdom ability because this would enable her to create more value for Sky City in the future!","Endless Summer would need quite some time to absorb the tree cores, which were the core of tree-type feys’ energy. These tree cores were Holy Spirit plant lifeforms, and their levels were higher than Endless Summer’s. It would take at least a month for Endless Summer to absorb the six tree cores completely.","Before Endless Summer could finish absorbing the first tree core, Blood Love rushed back.","Blood Love hurriedly greeted Endless Summer. The two were sisters who had experienced life and death together. Their relationship could no longer be described as just friends. Even though Blood Love had awakened her bloodline and become the little princess of Heavenly Family Cottage, the relationship between Endless Summer and Blood Love had not changed.","Blood Love’s blood energy was extremely dense. It was obvious that she had eaten a hearty meal before returning.","In the past, Lin Yuan would have felt uncomfortable when he sensed Blood Love’s blood energy. But now, he completely understood the rules of this world. Blood Love was a carnivorous creature, so it was normal for her to hunt for food.","Lin Yuan felt a little guilty toward Blood Love because all lifeforms in North of the Lonely River had become citizens of the faith country. In the faith country, Blood Love did not have a chance to eat her fill. Even getting a normal meal required her to cross the Lonely River to the south. As a blood-type fey, eating large amounts of food was a way for Blood Love to increase her strength.","After greeting Endless Summer, Blood Love turned to look at Lin Yuan, and a beautiful smile appeared on her evil and beautiful face. Blood Love had not seen Lin Yuan for a while and missed him very much.","“Lin Yuan, it’s been too long!”","After saying that, Blood Love handed over more than 20 precious instruments to Lin Yuan. These precious instruments had been forged by Blood Love through her divine kingdom ability, Day Forging Furnace. The quality of these precious instruments was extremely high because there were sufficient spiritual ingredients in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. In addition, Blood Love’s divine kingdom could promote the fusion of spiritual ingredients and refine spiritual ingredients through the energy of celestial bodies. This allowed Blood Love to maximize the value of these spiritual ingredients.","Blood Love’s ability to create spirit qi with Day Forging Furnace was comparable to a beginner Grade 5 Creator. As Blood Love’s strength continued to increase, her ability to forge precious instruments through Day Forging Furnace would also increase.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and said, “Blood Love, we haven’t seen each other for a while. It’s been hard on you. You even have to cross the Lonely River to eat.”","Blood Love hurriedly said, “Lin Yuan, you’re being too polite. I’ll just go and eat once every month or so. Even if I use the Day Forging Furnace to forge a precious instrument, I won’t be delayed at all!”","Lin Yuan already felt a little guilty. But after hearing what Blood Love said, he felt even more guilty. Using Day Forging Furnace to forge a precious instrument would also consume a large amount of energy. Blood Love only satisfied her energy needs and no longer considered increasing her strength.","In Lin Yuan’s understanding, Blood Love had always been a person who valued the improvement of her strength.","“Blood Love, you usually need a lot of blood for food. I didn’t think this through. Recently, I have arranged for people to hunt star pirates. Everything is going smoothly. These evil star pirates are all very strong. Their flesh and blood can be the best source of energy for you!","“In the future, after capturing the star pirates, I will assign a portion of them to you so they can be your food. In addition, I can also provide you with a large number of blood-type spiritual ingredients to absorb so that you can increase your strength as soon as possible.","“I obtained these blood-type spiritual ingredients from the Bloodians. Their grade is extremely high. With these blood-type spiritual ingredients, you’ll be able to make up for my previous debt very soon!”","When Blood Love heard that Lin Yuan could help her solve her food problem, she was extremely happy. However, when she heard Lin Yuan say that he owed her, the smile on her face could not help but disappear.","“Lin Yuan, ever since I became your Path Protector, you have never owed me anything. To be honest, I owe you and have not fulfilled my duties of being a good Path Protector. My achievements today, including finding my parents and resolving the knot in my heart, are all because of you!","“If you insist on saying that you owe me something, I should be the one feeling guilty. All the core members of Sky City are doing their jobs and contributing to the development of Sky City.","“I don’t have the talent or brains to do those things, so I haven’t been of much help. If I hadn’t obtained this divine kingdom ability to help me forge some precious instruments, I really don’t know what other uses I would have!”","Blood Love’s words were extremely serious. Previously, she had felt that way. Now, Day Forging Furnace could help to forge precious instruments, making Blood Love very happy.","Lin Yuan did not say anything else, but the guilt in his heart did not decrease much. Indeed, Blood Love could not help Lin Yuan as much now compared to the past.","However, it was undeniable that Blood Love had indeed saved Lin Yuan’s life more than once. If he had to say it, Blood Love was definitely part of the most important group of people in Lin Yuan’s heart.","“Alright, alright, alright. I won’t say such things again! On the other hand, if you have any needs in the future, you must tell me. Otherwise, I will inevitably have things I fail to consider.”","Lin Yuan took out the blood-type spiritual ingredients he had obtained from the Land of Bloodian Ancestors so","that Blood Love and Endless Summer could absorb them first.","Unlike Endless Summer, Blood Love did not need to slowly absorb the tree cores and digest their energy. She could directly absorb the blood-type energy from these spiritual ingredients."]},{"number":3083,"title":"Chapter 3083 Changes Caused by the Astronomical Parliament!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3083 Changes Caused by the Astronomical Parliament!","The purer the blood-type energy in these spiritual ingredients, the faster Blood Love would absorb them.","....","When she saw the spiritual ingredients that Lin Yuan took out, Blood Love could not help but ask in surprise, “Lin Yuan, where did you get these blood-type spiritual ingredients? These are too high-end. Based on the energy in these blood-type spiritual ingredients, I’m certain that my bloodline can improve further on its current foundation. I originally thought that it would take a long time for my bloodline to improve!”","Upon sensing Blood Love’s surprise, Lin Yuan could not help but smile.","There were also Heavenly Family Feys in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but they were not as rare as in the main world.","Apart from species, there were also individual lifeforms born in the blessed land. These individual lifeforms were benchmarked against the Heavenly Family Feys.","The Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies were bred by Zhi Ling, the Insect Queen. Initially, only Zhi Ling was born in this blessed land, and she could be considered one of the Heavenly Family Feys.","The reason the Heavenly Family Feys in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were not as mystical as those in the main world had a lot to do with the world’s level. The level of the Sky Beyond the Clouds was so advanced that it was impossible for the Heavenly Family Feys to control the celestial bodies there to represent natural phenomena.","Heavenly Family Feys born in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, such as the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly, possessed the ability to represent a natural phenomenon when they descended to a small world.","“Obtaining these blood-type spiritual ingredients can be considered a huge opportunity for me this time. Apart from the blood-type spiritual ingredients I gave you, I still have many more. In the future, you will have access to these blood-type spiritual ingredients for your use.","“You and Endless Summer can stay here to enhance your strength during this time. I’ll take care of the rest of Sky City after I help the two of you increase your strength.”","Blood Love looked up at Lin Yuan. When she was in the main world, she had relied on Lin Yuan to obtain many resources. In the end, it was the same in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","Blood Love was very eager to increase her strength. When she did, she would have the chance to go out with Lin Yuan to train in the future.","...","While Lin Yuan was helping Blood Love and Endless Summer increase their strength, the core members of the Astronomical Parliament had completely digested the benefits they had obtained from Lin Yuan.","Both Jing Bai and Zhou Yu had now become genuine pinnacle Grade 2 Creators. They had undergone a complete transformation in their level compared to before.","Lin Yuan had nurtured Jing Bai and Zhou Yu into pinnacle Grade 2 Creators through Genius, essentially allowing them to turn the tide and use their status as pinnacle Grade 2 Creators to seek development.","Apart from Li Hen, who had just joined the Astronomical Parliament, the other members of the Astronomical Parliament were not very old.","Becoming a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator at such a young age was impressive no matter where it was, even among the Snow-Covered Fox Clan.","...","Jing Bai sensed the Creator knowledge that appeared out of thin air in his mind. After confirming that he had become a genuine pinnacle Grade 2 Creator, he immediately contacted Kong Huan. He hoped that he could establish a relationship with the Snow-Covered Fox leader through Kong Huan.","Kong Huan was giving Jing Bai some face. Firstly, Kong Huan had the intention to befriend Jing Bai. Secondly, Lin Yuan had used some unknown method to turn Jing Bai into a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator, which showed how much Lin Yuan valued him. As a result, Kong Huan’s desire to befriend Jing Bai grew even stronger.","Introducing a young pinnacle Grade 2 Creator and recommending talents to the Snow-Covered Fox leader whom he served was an act that could please this leader.","In the past, Kong Huan had been helping Jing Bai because of Lin Yuan. Now, Jing Bai could actually repay her to a certain extent. As long as Jing Bai could improve his abilities as a Creator in the future and reach Grade 3, Jing Bai would be able to help her in some matters.","...","Zhou Yu relied on his identity as a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator to easily join the tribe. The tribe leader did not receive him personally, but an elder of the tribe had been helping him.","The Forbidden Feather Tribe went from a dispensable existence that merely attached themselves to the super tribe to becoming their core dependent species. Thus, the Forbidden Feather Tribe believed that they could rely on this super tribe as a springboard so they could quickly develop.","Upon sensing that many members of the tribe had become somewhat arrogant and domineering due to their awareness of the tribe’s rise, Zhou Yu quickly asked his father to put a stop to this trend.","The Forbidden Feather Tribe was only doing well because of the war weapon that Lin Yuan had provided and the fact that he had helped him become a pinnacle Grade 2 Creator. Internally, they did not possess formidable strength.","Even if the Forbidden Feather Tribe really became stronger, their members should not become arrogant and domineering as such behavior was very likely to bring disaster to the Forbidden Feather Tribe.","Zhou Yu had already vaguely guessed why Lin Yuan would spend so many resources to nurture him. It was impossible for Lin Yuan to nurture him for altruistic purposes. Rather, it was because Lin Yuan wanted to uncover his value.","...","Ru Yi was born into a powerful faction, the Carp Mystic Palace in the South Universe, which meant she never had to struggle for her own development.","At that moment, Ru Yi’s thoughts were as complex as Zhou Yu’s and Jing Bai’s. She was contemplating how to deceive her parents and explain that her body had completely recovered.","Sensing that Lin Yuan might interact with the Carp Mystic Palace in the future, Ru Yi decided she could tell her parents that she had accidentally joined a secret faction, and it was this faction that helped her get rid of the curse. As long as she didn’t reveal the existence of Sky City, she believed it would be fine.","If she provided other reasons, her parents would not be fooled. To make them believe her and even facilitate a collaboration with Sky City, Ru Yi had to be convincing. Regardless of what happened, her parents would not blame her.","With some trepidation, Ru Yi told her mother, Lan Xiang, that she had completely recovered.","During this period, Ru Yi had already subtly hinted to her mother that her health was improving.","Lan Xiang’s eyes widened in surprise when she heard Ru Yi say that her body had completely recovered—she found it unbelievable. After all, Ru Yi had nearly died a some time ago because of her condition. Even now, Lan Xiang still had lingering fears when she thought about it.","Recently, Ru Yi’s treatment had not been much different from before. After so many years of using this method to heal Ru Yi’s body, how could she suddenly recover?","Ru Yi told Lan Xiang the reason she had just thought of, “Mother, I was chosen by an organization by chance and joined it. They have already helped me remove the curse from my body. If you don’t believe me, you can use your spiritual energy to sense the condition of my body. You can tell at a glance that I’m not lying!”","With that, Ru Yi reached out to her mother.","Lan Xiang was usually afraid that her spiritual energy would wash over Ru Yi’s body and make her feel uncomfortable.","Upon hearing Ru Yi’s words, Lan Xiang really couldn’t care less anymore and immediately used her spiritual energy to investigate Ru Yi’s body.","After probing, Lan Xiang realized that Ru Yi’s situation was really as she had said. The curse in her body had completely disappeared.","As a mother, Lan Xiang did not immediately think about why this faction wanted her daughter to join them. Regardless of whether this faction had good or bad intentions, this faction had saved Ru Yi’s life and allowed her to have a healthy life. In fact, even if the faction really had evil intentions, Lan Xiang would accept it.","Lan Xiang hugged Ru Yi tightly. When she thought about how much she owed Ru Yi all these years and how difficult it had been for Ru Yi, she could not help but cry.","Upon feeling her mother’s warm embrace, Ru Yi reached out and hugged Lan Xiang. “In the future, I can also cultivate to increase my strength. I don’t know if I can still keep up with the standards of my peers in the palace after starting so late!”","At this point, a stern expression flashed across Ru Yi’s teary face.","As the daughter of the leader of Carp Mystic Palace, it was not that she did not have any peers, but that these peers were all collateral relatives.","As everyone in the Carp Mystic Palace knew that she had been cursed from a very young age and that she couldn’t cure herself, many of her peers showed respect on the surface. However, behind her back, they didn’t hesitate to play tricks.","If she hadn’t recovered, Ru Yi wouldn’t have bothered with these collateral relatives because the huge Carp Mystic Palace had to be passed down.","Even though Ru Yi had recovered, she would not suppress the development of these collateral relatives. On the contrary, she would provide more resources to them.","However, the premise was that they did not harbor any disloyalty toward her. Otherwise, Ru Yi did not mind letting these collateral relatives know how powerful she was.","Lan Xiang tried her best to calm down after her excitement and joy. Then, she asked, “Daughter, I wonder if I can make contact with the faction you joined? They removed the curse from your body and helped you to regain your health. It’s only right and proper for us to express our gratitude.”","Ru Yi had already expected Lan Xiang to say that.","“Mother, the faction is extremely mysterious and the leader doesn’t like to be disturbed. If you and Father are planning to thank the organization I joined, why not prepare the gratitude gift and hand it over to me? I’ll take care of passing it on.”","Ru Yi knew very well that Lin Yuan did not care about the gratitude gift from her parents. Additionally, two more members had joined the Astronomical Parliament, and Lin Yuan was able to help them activate their bloodlines and awaken their body composition.","As someone born in the Myriad Carp Palace, Ru Yi admitted that she was knowledgeable, but she was still shocked by Lin Yuan’s handiwork.","Ru Yi got her parents to prepare a gratitude gift purely to express her gratitude to the members sitting on the golden seats in the Astronomical Parliament. She wanted to convey that although she had just joined the Astronomical Parliament recently, she already had a sense of belonging to it.","Upon hearing Ru Yi’s words, Lan Xiang did not ask about the situation of Ru Yi’s faction.She could sense that Ru Yi actually knew about it and had no intention of telling her.","Whether it was because Ru Yi had her own little secrets or harbored some truths that were difficult to share, Lan Xiang could understand. Lan Xiang would observe Ru Yi’s condition in the future. She only needed to confirm that this faction did not have any ill intentions towards Ru Yi.","The faction had easily done something that the Carp Mystic Palace had not been able to do for so many years. From this, it was enough to prove that the faction was extraordinary. By joining this faction, Ru Yi might even be able to bring some resources to the Carp Mystic Palace in the future.","...","To help Li Hen activate and upgrade his bloodline from pinnacle Bronze Helmet to Golden Helmet, Lin Yuan provided him with a large amount of resources.","Li Hen’s son, Li Cheng, was chosen to follow the Sixth Young Master of Li Hen’s faction a few months later.","Even with Lin Yuan’s best resources, it would still take some time for Li Hen’s bloodline to evolve from pinnacle Bronze Helmet to Golden Helmet.","When Li Hen saw the supplies Lin Yuan provided, he couldn’t help but excitedly kowtow to the stars in the sky through the window.","Li Hen had never dared to imagine that Lin Yuan would provide him with these resources.","Having just joined the Astronomical Parliament, Li Hen still harbored some doubts about Lin Yuan’s words. He didn’t believe Lin Yuan could help his bloodline advance to Golden Helmet.","Looking at the resources now, Li Hen believed they could definitely help his bloodline improve. Once his bloodline was upgraded to Golden Helmet, he would be able to request his clan to keep Li Cheng by his side.","This mysterious faction among the constellations was not only saving his son but also his wife.","Li Hen knew very well that he currently didn’t have the ability to protect the resources on hand. He needed to find an opportunity to take over the mission of the clan’s exploration team to enter the abyss and then enhance his strength within it. This way, he could find a perfect reason for his sudden breakthrough to the Golden Helmet bloodline.","Staying within the clan while his bloodline evolved to Golden Helmet would attract too much attention and inevitably invite covetous glances. Having planned everything, Li Hen fell into a deep sleep.","...","The first thing Yuan Qi did after waking up was to make sure that what she had just experienced among the stars was real.","Yuan Qi saw a ring with a blue gem embedded in it and felt the spatial fluctuations coming from it. She knew the ring was a piece of spatial equipment. Moreover, it did not belong to her as she had never owned such an exquisite thing!"]},{"number":3084,"title":"Chapter 3084 Spider Sundial Protection!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3084 Spider Sundial Protection!","After using her spiritual energy to check the internal space of the ring and seeing the resources inside, Yuan Qi confirmed that everything she had experienced among the constellations was real and that the parliament truly existed.","....","The elemental species were suppressed by Faerie Institution. The entire elemental species could not produce such high-quality resources as the spatial ring.","Yuan Qi remembered that the man sitting on the golden seat had said her body composition was an elemental sacred body. If this meeting among the constellations was real, then what this person said was most likely true. Could the resources stored in the ring allow her to awaken her elemental sacred body?","When the elemental species absorbed pure elemental energy and spirit qi of the same attribute, they could easily refine it. Yuan Qi took out a pearl that sparkled with a beautiful luster and tried to absorb the pure and abundant water-element energy contained within it. When the pure water-element energy entered her body, Yuan Qi felt a sense of comfort she had never felt before.","Due to Yuan Qi’s special body composition, one-fifth of the resources were absorbed in just a few hours while Yuan Qi was absorbing the water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls and spirit qi crystals with all her might.","During the process of absorbing the pure water-element energy and spirit qi, Yuan Qi felt her composition absorbing these energies faster.","Just as Yuan Qi was about to continue absorbing, she heard the hurried sound of someone knocking on the door of her old residence. Yuan Qi couldn’t help but frown fiercely. There was no way such impolite knocking could be anyone else. It could only be the aunt who wanted her dead.","In the past, her aunt would come every few days to find trouble with her. Her aunt was extremely petty. After deciding that Yuan Qi shouldn’t enjoy the resources left by her parents, her aunt had been racking her brains to get them back.","Yuan Qi frowned. Deep down, she didn’t want to engage with her aunt. Nevertheless, her aunt had already sought her out, and it wouldn’t be appropriate for Yuan Qi to decline the meeting.","The elemental species still placed considerable emphasis on blood relations and inheritance. Yuan Qi didn’t want her aunt to use this to attack her in the future. Hence, she reluctantly walked out of the old residence and opened the door.","Yuan Qi was surprised to see not only her aunt but also her uncle and younger brother present. The three of them still wore evident disdain towards her, but alongside the disdain, there was also a hint of delight. However, they didn’t immediately broach the subject of her relinquishing her opportunity. Their abnormal behavior made Yuan Qi frown even more.","“Yuan Qi, you insolent brat, this morning you were still so smug toward me. You probably don’t know that the clan intends to strip you of your qualification to train at the elemental river. Let’s see how long you can remain smug. Once you lose the chance to head to the elemental river to increase your strength, you will no longer be valued by the clan. When the time comes, watch how I deal with you!”","Upon seeing the woman’s mean and arrogant look, Yuan Qi’s heart tightened.","Yuan Qi didn’t doubt the authenticity of the words at all. Once her clan gave up and no longer allowed her to train at the elemental river, her aunt would be able to use some connections to regain custody over her.","By then, not only would the resources left by her parents no longer belong to her, but even her safety would be at the mercy of her aunt. Fortunately, she had joined that faction. She would soon be able to awaken her elemental sacred body and shock the clan.","At that moment, Yuan Qi’s gratitude towards the Astronomical Parliament intensified.","Her aunt’s family came here for a simple reason. They were here to give her an ultimatum and used intimidation to make her hand over all the resources she had. Moreover, even if she did not hand them over, they would not care too much because she would soon be abandoned by her clan.","At that moment, Yuan Qi no longer had the slightest bit of restraint toward her aunt.","“Heh, why are you here again after leaving this morning? I remember that the Seventh Elder said not to let you bother me again. If you keep coming here and delay my cultivation to increase my strength, I’ll contact the Seventh Elder and get him to chase you away!”","As soon as Yuan Qi finished speaking, the strong-looking young man standing at the door said disdainfully, “Sister, why are you still looking for the Seventh Elder? Back then, the Seventh Elder discovered your talent and nurtured you to become a direct descendant of the clan. Based on your recent performance, the Seventh Elder will probably regret it to death. My talent is better than yours. It’s too selfish of you to stand there and not give me a chance to improve.”","Yuan Qi really didn’t want to argue with her aunt’s family anymore. Selfish? Was it selfish to use the resources left behind by her parents to increase her strength? Moreover, most of the resources had actually been snatched away by her aunt. It was also truly despicable that her brother, who benefited from her resources, would speak such heartless words!","“If that’s what you want to say, leave quickly. Who knows what will happen tomorrow? If the clan really wants to give up on me, the clan’s elders will inform me. There’s no need for you to worry!”","“Little Qi, we are all family. Why do you have to be so hostile toward us? You’re really breaking your aunt’s heart with this behavior. For so many years, with our older brother and sister-in-law gone, no one has properly educated you. Once we become your guardians again, we’ll make sure you get back on the right path!”","Yuan Qi knew her uncle was skilled at saying grandiose things, but in reality, many of the bad ideas were actually his. Her aunt was not very shrewd.","If she hadn’t joined the Astronomical Parliament and become a member, Yuan Qi would have definitely been very afraid of these threats. But now, Yuan Qi didn’t take the visit of her aunt’s family seriously at all.","Even if she could not awaken her elemental sacred body before heading to the elemental river tomorrow morning, she could definitely do it the next day. By then, she would become the hope of the clan, and the resources of the elemental species would be poured into her. Yuan Qi would then have the power that she had always wanted.","As long as her strength continued to grow and she gained more recognition from the elemental species, Yuan Qi was confident she could eventually gain control over her aunt’s family. Since they explicitly expressed a desire for her demise, Yuan Qi wouldn’t hesitate to reciprocate.","...","With Lin Yuan’s help, the new members of the Astronomical Parliament fulfilled their wishes and changed their fates. They were progressing in a positive direction.","The better these members developed, the greater the benefits for the Astronomical Parliament.","Although Sky City was currently holed up in the North of the Lonely River, the Astronomical Parliament had enabled Sky City’s factions to encroach on the border between the four universes and the abyss.","Half a month later, Lin Yuan looked at Blood Love, which was resonating with the main celestial body and absorbing energy from it. He could not help but exclaim.","As Blood Love absorbed blood-type energy and strengthened its blood-type bloodline, its light-type bloodline as a heavenly family fey also increased simultaneously.","Lin Yuan had provided Blood Love with faith power, allowing it to successfully step into the Holy Spirit level. It had condensed a holy spirit in the divine kingdom and obtained a new divine kingdom ability.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate Blood Love.","[Fey Name]: Mother of Bloodbath","[Fey Species]: Tarantulas/jade-spider-species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural (Light)/Blood","Fey quality: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Execution Sting]: Through the eight sharp chelicerae, the blood and light energy will be injected into the target to control their blood while simultaneously purifying them.","[Eyes of Senluo]: The spider eyes look directly at the core of the blood inside the target and anticipate the target’s next movements based on the blood flow. At the same time, the spider eyes can look through the target to a certain extent.","[Funeral of Light]: After killing a target with a strong enough soul, the target’s soul can be momentarily controlled by light energy. Once the light dries up with soul energy, the target can become a temporary controllable zombie.","[Spider Form Attachment]: Condense its own blood energy into a blood core which can overload the attacks from the outside world. When the spider core is shattered, the light energy within can restrain a target.","[Blood Control]: Call down belts of sunlight from the sun to restrain and attack targets while activating the blood energy in the target’s body. The flow of fresh blood in the target’s body can be momentarily controlled.","[Hug of Dawn’s Light]: Take in energy from the sun and swallow it to temporarily increase its power. The light energy can also be used to slowly heal injuries.","[Sun Light Drapery]: Activate the stored energy in the body during combat. A jade sundial with the carving of a sun on it will appear behind the Mother of Bloodbath. Every time the energy in its body is used, half of the energy will be taken from the sun. The jade sundial will defend against damage caused by the outside world.","[Hanging Sun Net]: With the sun at the center, its energy will be used up to activate the sun’s energy. The energy from both entities will form a net. The target trapped in the sun net will be restrained temporarily before being released to the surface of the sun.","[Foundry Day Falling Attack]: Use the energy in its body to communicate with celestial bodies and obtain their support. When the energy supplied by the celestial bodies is activated, the target can be attacked from a long-distance away. The attacked target will be cleansed and free of impurities.","[Beautiful Day Condensed Essence]:","Exclusive Skill:","[Desire Spider Form]: Increase its affinity for light energy so that the body will not reject excessive light energy, but will transform it into hair that can store the light energy. After the devoured light energy tempers inside the body, light energy can be absorbed directly into the body.","[Concealed Spider Shadow]: Stop the flow of its own blood energy, conceal its aura, and transform it into the form of ‘nothing’. It can then use the sun as its eyes to survey the surrounding environment.","[External Blood Bone]: The chelicerae will be fused into other young feys’ bodies so they can become its blood bones. The strength of the external blood bone cannot be higher than the strength of the target being pierced. The dark-type curses or negative soul-type effects of the target can be purified.","[Rich Light Trial]: When causing damage to a target, the target will also be injected with light element that will have a deadly purging effect.","[Sundial Sage]: Its bloodline will be used to change other spider-species lifeforms. All spider-species feys aside from dark-type ones will be protected by the sun. When these spider-species feys provide it with faith power, its bloodline power will be extraordinarily boosted.","[Application Support]: It will be applied to other lifeforms and its energy will support the target’s attacks and defenses. Its support will not affect the application abilities of other lifeforms. After the application, the target will gain its bloodline and will be boosted by celestial bodies.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Day Forging Furnace]: The spiritual ingredients will be absorbed into its body and the energy from the celestial bodies will temper the spiritual ingredients. The spiritual ingredients will be transformed into precious instruments through the most appropriate techniques. When flesh lifeforms are being tempered, the lifeform’s physique will improve rapidly as long as it is able to handle the energy from the furnace.","[Spider Sundial Protection]: Spider-type feys that have been transformed by their own bloodlines will release a special light-type energy after being specially transformed in the divine kingdom. This energy can affect other feys to become their believers. While providing faith power to themselves, it will also expel the other faiths of the target and make the target their a fanatic believer.","Lin Yuan was very surprised by the divine kingdom ability that Blood Love had obtained after reaching the Holy Spirit level.","Spider Sundial Protection had the same effect as Immortal Spirit Jump that the Jasmine Lily had obtained after reaching the Holy Spirit level. Both abilities aimed to turn the feys that believed in them into fanatical followers, providing significant faith power.","The Jasmine Lily and Blood Love were both considered targets by the official factions of the four universes. Ironically, this ability was exactly what Lin Yuan needed.","Spider Sundial Protection was linked to Blood Love’s exclusive skill, Sundial Sage. It was very easy for Blood Love to transform a spider-species fey with her bloodline. Blood Love used her Sundial Sage to modify spider-species lifeforms and obtain faith power from them."]},{"number":3085,"title":"Chapter 3085 A Rune Suitable for the Enlightenment Cicada!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3085 A Rune Suitable for the Enlightenment Cicada!","Blood Love had modified more than 1,000 spider-species lifeforms with her sundial bloodline.","....","After obtaining their divine kingdom ability, these spider-species lifeforms would soon be able to enter the divine kingdom and transform it, allowing a large number of lifeforms in the faith country to become fanatics of Blood Love and produce a significant amount of faith power.","Jasmine Lily alone struggled to produce a large number of fanatics in a short period, but with Blood Love’s help, it became feasible.","Blood Love, who had reached the Holy Spirit level, brought Lin Yuan an unexpected surprise.","Since Blood Love had already learned a lot about the Sky Beyond the Clouds from Lin Yuan, she realized that her newly obtained divine kingdom ability had made her a wanted criminal there. However, Blood Love still liked her new divine kingdom ability. This was because her ability, Spider Sundial Protection, could help Lin Yuan significantly.","“Lin Yuan, with my new divine kingdom ability, I can only stay in North of the Lonely River from now on. If I go out and let others discover my divine kingdom ability, I will become a wanted criminal. Many people will surely be eager to cause trouble for me!”","Just as Creation Masters could see through feys’ abilities and exclusive skills in the main world, high-grade Creators could see through other feys’ divine kingdom abilities. Even if they were not Creators, it was very likely that some feys’ exclusive skills, abilities, and even divine kingdom abilities had a certain level of detection ability.","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan nodded. This divine kingdom ability, extremely useful to the faith country, was indeed a huge restriction for Blood Love and deprived her of the opportunity to show her face.","Lin Yuan knew that Blood Love had a very adventurous spirit. He thought for a moment and said to her, “Blood Love, you’re currently operating across the four universes. Once you’re discovered, it will immediately attract fatal consequences. From now on, I will provide you with sufficient food. Don’t cross the Lonely River to look for food at the other end. When we explore the abyss later, I’ll bring you along!”","Blood Love did not care much about this. Although she could only stay in North of the Lonely River in the future, all her restraints in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were here. More importantly, being in North of the Lonely River would not hinder her strength improvement and she could still be of help to Lin Yuan.","“Lin Yuan, my Spider Sundial Protection requires a large number of high-quality spider-species feys. I can transform them very quickly, so I need you to help me prepare more. From now on, I’ll help you convert more lifeforms in the faith country into fanatics.”","Lin Yuan had stored many high-quality feys from various species while conducting trades, and there were many spider-species feys among them.","“Later, I’ll sort out all the spider-species feys I have. There will be at least 10,000 of them, enough for you to use for a while. I’ll help you find spider-species feys with potential in the future.”","Blood Love looked at Endless Summer, who was still absorbing the tree cores, and did not stay there any longer. Instead, she went to look for Wen Yu.","Blood Love planned to have Wen Yu find the members of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly and spread these spider-species feys that she had modified throughout the faith country to ensure their safety.","As soon as Lin Yuan returned to Sky City, he asked Liu Jie to bring the 3,000 Spirit Craftsmen he had brought back to report to Hu Quan. Previously, Hu Quan had been complaining that he did not have enough manpower. Now that Lin Yuan had filled Hu Quan’s manpower needs, the number of Spirit Craftsmen that Hu Quan could manage had increased nearly tenfold.","Not long after Blood Love left, Hu Quan came to see Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was not surprised by Hu Quan’s visit; in fact, he had expected it sooner. As Hu Quan looked at Lin Yuan, who sat there with a thoughtful expression, his face showed a complex mix of emotions—excitement and anticipation mingled with a sense of heaviness.","Previously, with only three to four hundred Spirit Craftsmen under his supervision, Hu Quan had often felt that their number was insufficient, leading to inefficiency. Tasks that should have taken a month dragged on for half a year.","Despite his constant complaints about the lack of manpower, Hu Quan did not feel pressured in the previous environment. But now, with Lin Yuan replenishing Sky City with thousands of Spirit Craftsmen—the weakest of whom were Class 3—the situation had changed drastically.","The Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were different from those in the main world. If a Class 3 Spirit Craftsman from here were placed in the main world, they could already reach the level of a Class 4 or even Class 5 Spirit Craftsman.","When Hu Quan first joined Lin Yuan, he was barely considered a Class 3 Spirit Craftsman by the standards of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Now, Hu Quan was at the early stage of Class 4, still a certain gap away from an intermediate Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. Among the new Spirit Craftsmen Lin Yuan had added, some were even stronger than Hu Quan, making his position as a leader seem somewhat forced.","While Hu Quan was pleased that Sky City had so many Spirit Craftsmen to develop rapidly, he also felt immense pressure.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Hu Quan bowed and said, “Young Master, I’ve already settled the Spirit Craftsmen you brought over. They’ve integrated into Sky City and can start working at any time.”","Gritting his teeth, Hu Quan continued in a serious tone. “I’ve divided Young Master’s Spirit Craftsmen into 14 teams, each with more than 300 people. This structure is most suitable for large-scale projects. I’ve selected 13 leaders for these teams, and I’ll continue to lead the Spirit Craftsmen under me as the team leader of Team 14. What do you think—”","Before Hu Quan could finish, Lin Yuan interrupted, “Uncle Hu, if I wanted to make such arrangements, I wouldn’t have asked them to look for you. I guess you don’t really understand what I mean. The reason I got these Spirit Craftsmen to look for you is so you could manage them. Uncle Hu, do you think you can’t manage these Spirit Craftsmen well?”","Hu Quan sensed Lin Yuan’s deep trust in him. However, there was a significant gap between him, a Spirit Craftsman from a small world, and the local Spirit Craftsmen from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Hu Quan had experienced this gap when communicating with the new Spirit Craftsmen.","“Young Master, I have no problem managing these few thousand Spirit Craftsmen, but in terms of ability, I can’t compare to a few Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen. If I manage them, it will be very difficult for them to trust me. I’m afraid this will cause the entire team to disband. If I’m just leading one of the teams, then I might barely be able to win their trust.”","In Lin Yuan’s heart, Hu Quan had always been a confident person, so he was somewhat surprised to hear him express these concerns.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Uncle Hu, I bought these Spirit Craftsmen from the talent market in Diverse City. They will guarantee absolute loyalty here. Even if your abilities are not as good as theirs, they can only harbor thoughts in their hearts and not dare to show them openly.","“Uncle Hu, didn’t you always say you wanted to learn the Spirit Craftsman techniques of the Sky Beyond the Clouds? From my understanding, Spirit Craftsmen here are usually closely related to bloodlines.","“Some species are very suitable to work as Spirit Craftsmen because of their bloodline, but there are still many special methods for you to learn. You might not be as capable as them now, but you can grow. You’re all Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen. Are you going to continue being inferior to them in the future?”","Lin Yuan’s words made Hu Quan extremely excited. He knew that Lin Yuan valued him and intended for him to oversee all the Spirit Craftsmen, even though Lin Yuan’s current ability was inferior to theirs. Otherwise, Lin Yuan wouldn’t have been so resolute in affirming him when he had taken the initiative to relinquish his authority.","Lin Yuan secretly thanked himself for not letting Wang Xuan and Zhu Shoudan accompany him to find Hu Quan. Otherwise, encountering Zhu Shoudan, a pinnacle Class 4 Spirit Craftsman, might have truly shattered Hu Quan’s morale.","Previously, Hu Quan didn’t know the origins of these Spirit Craftsmen. Now that he did, his heart was much more at ease. If these Spirit Craftsmen were under Lin Yuan’s control, at the very least, it ensured that when managing them, they wouldn’t act against his intentions and impede progress!","Hu Quan was very confident in his learning ability. He had never had a master to guide him, but after following Lin Yuan, Night Leaning Moon was the only one who had taught him.","Hu Quan had no understanding of mechanics initially, but he had mastered Night Leaning Moon’s mechanics in just a few months. Even Night Leaning Moon was surprised by his learning ability.","Now that he had come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he had access to more Spirit Craftsman knowledge. These Spirit Craftsmen of various species, even those with lower levels than him, could become his teachers and help him acquire more knowledge.","Originally, Hu Quan was depressed, but now he realized this was a huge opportunity. Since Lin Yuan trusted him so much, he had to respond to that trust.","“Young Master, I certainly won’t be inferior to them. It won’t take long for me to master their abilities and improve my Spirit Craftsman skills.”","The improvement of a Spirit Craftsman’s abilities didn’t have a clear dividing line like that of a Creator, where the degree reached and the potions concocted could lead to grade advancement.","The grading of a Spirit Craftsman was extremely complicated, involving many different systems.","Hu Quan believed he was qualified to become a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan smiled and asked, “Uncle Hu, do you still have the confidence to lead the entire Spirit Craftsman team?”","Hu Quan pounded his chest. “Young Master, since you trust me so much, I certainly won’t disappoint you!","“I would like to recommend Liu Tong as the manager of Team 14’s Spirit Craftsmen. I brought Liu Tong up from the main world. Among all my disciples, Liu Tong is the most talented. Team 14 is filled with seniors I brought from the main world. As the team leader, Liu Tong will definitely be able to convince the masses. As the commander-in-chief, I will definitely lead these 14 Spirit Craftsman teams well!”","Hu Quan then told Lin Yuan about his future plans for the Spirit Craftsmen’s work.","Due to the previous lack of manpower, Hu Quan couldn’t implement many of his plans. Now that he had these Spirit Craftsmen, he was extremely excited to carry them out.","Many of Hu Quan’s plans were developed in collaboration with Zhong Zhiyu, and Lin Yuan didn’t interfere too much in this regard.","After Hu Quan left, Lin Yuan was contemplating which fey to strengthen when he suddenly entered a mysterious state.","A Willpower Rune appeared in Lin Yuan’s sea of spiritual energy. The rune carried a sense of transparency, imbued with an enlightening essence that applied to all things.","Ever since he had contracted the Enlightenment Cicada, Lin Yuan had comprehended three Willpower Runes. Comprehending the Willpower Rune was now as easy as drinking water for him.","Lin Yuan looked at the Willpower Rune he had just comprehended with joy. It was the most special one yet and very compatible with the Enlightenment Cicada that Morbius had just spirit-locked.","Lin Yuan summoned the Enlightenment Cicada and used Morbius’ True Data to investigate it.","[Fey Name]: Enlightenment Cicada","[Fey Species]: Transparent-winged species/Spotted-winged species","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Comprehension Enlightenment]: Through the smell emitted by the target and its cry, it can temporarily increase the target’s comprehension of nature and the target’s own comprehension ability, greatly increasing the target’s comprehension.","[Enlightenment Protection]: During the process of enlightenment, the target can be prevented from suffering the backlash of external forces.","Exclusive Skill:","[Indestructible Cicada]: When your body is damaged by external forces and dies, its antenna will integrate into the natural environment and become a part of it. After a period of time, it can be reborn in this environment.","The moment, the Enlightenment Cicada could absorb Lin Yuan’s Willpower Rune at any time. In fact, Lin Yuan had previously comprehended a Willpower Rune that was suitable for the Enlightenment Cicada. However, it was much inferior to this transparent rune.","Ever since the Enlightenment Cicada had been spirit-locked by Morbius, it had become closer to Lin Yuan. Upon sensing the existence of Lin Yuan’s newly comprehended transparent rune, the Enlightenment Cicada danced around Lin Yuan’s finger. It clearly wanted to absorb this Willpower Rune so that its life level could undergo a transformation."]},{"number":3086,"title":"Chapter 3086 Genius’ Last Piece of the Puzzle!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3086 Genius’ Last Piece of the Puzzle!","Lin Yuan stretched out his hand, and the Enlightenment Cicada landed on his fingertip. The frequent flapping of the Enlightenment Cicada’s wings made Lin Yuan’s fingers tingle.","....","Lin Yuan looked at the Enlightenment Cicada’s anxious expression and smiled, “Little fella, the Willpower Rune I comprehended was prepared for you. You can absorb it at any time. When I bring you to absorb this Willpower Rune to advance to Fantasy Breed, I will provide you with the other energy you need.”","When it saw that Lin Yuan allowed it to absorb the Willpower Rune, the Enlightenment Cicada welcomed the Willpower Rune and merged with it.","The sound of cicadas chirping echoed from time to time. Lin Yuan crushed a large number of spirit qi crystals to provide the Enlightenment Cicada with a large amount of pure spirit qi.","It did not take long for the Enlightenment Cicada to complete its transformation. The appearance of the Enlightenment Cicada that had stepped into Fantasy Breed mostly stayed the same from before. The name of the Enlightenment Cicada also mostly stayed the same in True Data.","The bloodline of feys like the Enlightenment Cicada was extremely high. It was very difficult for their bloodline to undergo mutations when they stepped into Fantasy Breed.","Enlightenment Cicada obtained a new exclusive skill after stepping into Fantasy Breed. It was called Cicada Epiphany Molting.","[Cicada Epiphany Molting]: When it sheds its shell, a portion of its enlightenment power will condense on the shell. The enlightenment power on the shell can be directly absorbed by other feys. There are no side effects to increase the epiphany power of other feys in a short period of time.","Cicada Epiphany Molting had the same effect as Comprehension Enlightenment. In terms of ability, Cicada Epiphany Molting was an enhanced version of Comprehension Enlightenment.","Comprehension Enlightenment required the Enlightenment Cicada to personally cast it on the target, but Cicada Epiphany Molting was a product of the Enlightenment Cicada.","The Enlightenment Cicada could be produced every once in a while.","When the Enlightenment Cicada used Comprehension Enlightenment on a target, the increase in the target’s epiphany power would continuously decrease. However, Cicada Epiphany Molting did not have such side effects.","Apart from using the Cicada Epiphany Molting, Lin Yuan would also give a portion to Sky City’s core members.","With the help of the Cicada Epiphany Molting, not only could his master, the Moon Empress, comprehend more Willpower Runes and contract more feys according to her combat system, but she could also improve her path as a Creator.","At Grade 4, the improvement of a Creator’s ability could be said to be closely related to their comprehension.","Previously, Lin Yuan had suppressed the Enlightenment Cicada’s grade. Now that it had become a Fantasy Breed, Lin Yuan could let it increase its strength as it pleased.","The Enlightenment Cicada’s grade continued to rise as it absorbed the pure spirit qi provided by Lin Yuan.","When it reached Diamond X/Fantasy V, the Enlightenment Cicada’s advancement speed slowed down.","Even other feys at the Enlightenment Cicada’s level would need some time to settle down if they wanted to charge towards the Myth Breed.","Lin Yuan investigated the Diamond X/Fantasy V Enlightenment Cicada.","[Fey Name]: Enlightenment Cicada","[Fey Species]: Transparent-winged species/Spotted-winged species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy V","Abilities:","[Comprehension Enlightenment]: Through the smell emitted by the target and its cry, it can temporarily increase the target’s comprehension of nature and the target’s own comprehension ability, greatly increasing the target’s comprehension.","[Enlightenment Protection]: During the process of enlightenment, the target can be prevented from suffering the backlash of external forces.","[Barrier Breaking Cicada Chirp]: When protecting a target through enlightenment, if the target is stuck at a certain level and can’t advance, it can help the target break through the limitation by consuming its own roots power.","[Contract Symbiosis]: Contracts with a lifeform. When contracted with this lifeform, it will be able to obtain the growth speed of the lifeform. The lifeform contracted with it can also obtain a similar level of comprehension.","[Cicada Artifact Body Transformation]: Allows oneself to enter a dormant state and transform into an artifact. When there is enough energy to nourish the body that has turned into an artifact, it can speed up the formation of the cicada molt.","[Comprehension Curse]: Uses one’s own comprehension ability to restrict the target. When the target’s comprehension ability is weaker than one’s own, it will restrict the target’s comprehension ability, causing the target to lose all comprehension.","Exclusive Skill:","[Indestructible Cicada]: When your body is damaged by external forces and dies, its antenna will integrate into the natural environment and become a part of it. After a period of time, it can be reborn in this environment.","[Cicada Epiphany Molting]: When one sheds their shell, a portion of their enlightenment power will condense on the shell. The enlightenment power on the shell can be directly absorbed by other Holy Spirit Realm cultivators. There are no side effects to increase the enlightenment power of other living beings in a short period of time.","From Bronze X/Fantasy V to Diamond X/Fantasy V, the Enlightenment Cicada had obtained a total of four abilities. In Lin Yuan’s opinion, each of these four abilities appeared more important to Lin Yuan than the last.","The Silver ability, Barrier Breaking Cicada Chirp, and the Elite ability, Enlightenment Protection, were linked abilities.","Since each fey’s epiphany power varied, so did the things they sought to comprehend. This often caused the final outcome of the epiphany to be different. Enlightenment Cicada might not necessarily be able to comprehend what it wanted through the enhancement of Comprehension Enlightenment.","However, Barrier Breaking Cicada Chirp could forcefully break through the barrier at the cost of one of the Enlightenment Cicada’s roots, allowing the target to comprehend what they wanted to comprehend.","Lin Yuan would use this ability carefully because he did not want it to affect the Enlightenment Cicada’s safety. Once the Enlightenment Cicada’s roots were damaged, it would probably be very difficult to recover.","Lin Yuan would only ask the Enlightenment Cicada to spend a large amount of roots power to help him break through the barrier if he had no other choice. Of course, not every use of the Enlightenment Cicada’s Barrier Breaking Cicada Chirp required a significant expenditure of roots power. It was possible that there were many times when one was just a step away, they could successfully achieve comprehension with the help of the Enlightenment Cicada.","The Gold ability, Contract Symbiosis, was the Enlightenment Cicada’s own opportunity. At the same time, it could also bring opportunities to other lifeforms. The speed at which the Enlightenment Cicada increased its strength was extremely slow. This was very related to the advanced bloodline level of the Enlightenment Cicada. However, with the Contract Symbiosis, the Enlightenment Cicada could increase its growth speed through other lifeforms. Similarly, it could bestow profound comprehension upon other lifeforms.","The moment Lin Yuan saw the Enlightenment Cicada Gold ability, he subconsciously thought of Genius. Genius’ strength had originally increased extremely quickly. The reason it was stuck at the Myth Breed and could not step into the Holy Spirit level was that Genius’ comprehension was limited. It could be said that comprehension was Genius’ greatest limitation!","If Genius became the contracted object of the Enlightenment Cicada’s Contract Symbiosis, Genius would provide growth speed, and the Enlightenment Cicada would provide comprehension for Genius.","Genius would be able to completely break free from the shackles of its bloodline and truly soar into the sky. By then, Genius, who had sufficient comprehension, achieving the status of a Grade 5 creator was not only feasible, but it might even become a Grade 6 Creator.","Lin Yuan continued to look at the Enlightenment Cicada’s Platinum ability, Cicada Artifact Body Transformation, which was different from the exclusive skill of ordinary feys.","The Enlightenment Cicada transformed itself into an artifact that could not become a contractor’s weapon. Instead, it made it easier for the Enlightenment Cicada to absorb the surrounding energy faster and let it produce the cicada molt.","Cicada Epiphany Molting had a great effect. Even a true Grade 6 Creator would go crazy over this effect.","The Enlightenment Cicada had obtained a skill that could quickly produce Cicada Epiphany Molting, which was very meaningful to Lin Yuan. It greatly increased the value of the Enlightenment Cicada.","During normal days, Lin Yuan would let the Enlightenment Cicada spend most of its time in the Cicada Artifact Body Transformation state.","The Diamond ability, Comprehension Curse of the Enlightenment Cicada was equivalent to a curse. The Enlightenment Cicada could use its astonishing comprehension ability to suppress the target and restrict the target’s comprehension ability.","The Enlightenment Cicada may not be formidable as many lifeforms of the same level could defeat it. However, in terms of comprehension, there were probably very few lifeforms in the world that could compare to it.","With Lin Yuan’s help, the Enlightenment Cicada had become more intimate with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan said, “You’ve already reached Diamond X/Fantasy V. Even if there are enough resources for you in the future, it will be extremely difficult for you to increase your strength because of your bloodline. You can choose a partner with Contract Symbiosis. I’ll recommend one to you later. This partner can definitely increase your strength quickly. At the same time, it also needs the comprehension you provide for it.”","As Lin Yuan’s contracted object, the Enlightenment Cicada would not reject Lin Yuan’s words. Lin Yuan’s discussion with the Enlightenment Cicada stemmed from his respect for the Enlightenment Cicada, so the Enlightenment Cicada wouldn’t refuse Lin Yuan’s suggestions.","To be honest, Enlightenment Cicada was looking forward to Lin Yuan arranging a companion for it. Once the Enlightenment Cicada chose a partner through Contract Symbiosis, it could no longer change the partner it chose. The Enlightenment Cicada had complete trust in Lin Yuan and was certain that he would not trick it.","Lin Yuan summoned Genius and was about to introduce Genius to the Enlightenment Cicada when he realized that Genius was already playing very well with it.","Genius could be considered a social expert among all Lin Yuan’s feys.","Lin Yuan did not expect the Enlightenment Cicada to be so familiar with Genius during the time it was in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After Lin Yuan told the Enlightenment Cicada that Genius was the companion he had chosen for it, the Enlightenment Cicada happily signed a contract with Genius.","Without needing Lin Yuan to explain too much to Genius, the latter understood the deeper meaning behind Lin Yuan’s decision to let the Enlightenment Cicada form a contract with it.","Upon sensing the astonishing comprehension it had suddenly obtained, Genius said excitedly, “Yuan, I wasn’t confident in your high expectations. I was afraid that I wouldn’t be able to reach your expectations. Now I can finally pick up the confidence I lost. I can confirm that with such comprehension, I will be able to successfully step into the Holy Spirit level soon.”","Among all Lin Yuan’s feys, Genius had the softest voice, but it was indeed the most mature and stable one. Lin Yuan had rarely seen Genius so excited.","“Genius, from now on, you and the Enlightenment Cicada will become the closest partners because of the contract. The Enlightenment Cicada is a new addition to our family. In the future, you have to take care of it in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.”","Lin Yuan let Genius and the Enlightenment Cicada return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Genius had to get used to his sudden increase in comprehension ability, and the Enlightenment Cicada had to consolidate its realm.","After Genius contracted with the Enlightenment Cicada through Contract Symbiosis, its growth speed had increased greatly from its original foundation. It wouldn’t be long before it could advance to Myth Breed and successfully increase its strength.","...","After another half a month, Endless Summer finally finished absorbing the tree cores and successfully reached the Holy Spirit level. Endless Summer’s Holy Spirit bloodline did not transform as she wished, but she obtained a very special divine kingdom ability.","Clustering Heart Aperture activated the target’s life potential. Without opening an additional heart aperture, when activating the target’s life potential, it could allow the target to grow many times faster. Without sufficient energy supply, excessively increasing the target’s growth speed would cause damage to the target’s roots (only effective against plant-type feys).","The divine kingdom ability that Endless Summer had obtained after reaching the Holy Spirit level was linked to the abilities and exclusive skills related to the heart aperture that Endless Summer had obtained previously.","Endless Summer had opened more than 1,000 heart apertures, which could increase the growth speed of plant-type feys a thousand times faster. Moreover, it was not just limited to one at a time. Instead, it could increase the growth speed of plant-type feys in an area.","Many arrangements in Sky City required the growth of plant lifeforms. For example, the Thriving Summer Rising Cloud that Summer planted around the Lonely River required a period of growth.","With Clustering Heart Aperture, Endless Summer was able to help Summer upgrade the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds and allowed her to completely protect North of the Lonely River as soon as possible and make it a true top secret place.","Compared to offensive divine kingdom abilities, Endless Summer preferred functional divine kingdom abilities. Now, Endless Summer had obtained the functional divine kingdom ability as she wished.","Although this divine kingdom ability could not improve her combat abilities, it was very useful in Sky City.","Endless Summer said softly, “Young Master, I’ve absorbed a portion of the tree core’s energy and fed it to my Barren River Orchid Bud. The Barren River Orchid Bud has also reached 12 stars!”"]},{"number":3087,"title":"Chapter 3087: Orchid Soul Tribute and Arakawa Assistant!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3087: Orchid Soul Tribute and Arakawa Assistant!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After saying that, Endless Summer summoned its sacred source lifeform, the Barren River Orchid Bud, in front of Lin Yuan.","[Sacred Source Name]: Barren River Orchid Bud","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 12 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Wood/Life","Abilities:","[Adjacent Flowers on an Orchid Branch]: When the Barren River Orchid Bud is grown in fertilized earth, its roots will spread far and wide to absorb all the nutrients from the earth. The nutrients will be turned into vitality that is stored in the Barren River Orchid Bud’s body. Eventually, orchid flowers will sprout, followed by fruits. After the Barren River Orchid Bud produces fruits, it will activate its roots to grow a new body. The Barren River Orchid Bud will trap the energy in the soil in its roots and multiply it. The Barren River Orchid Bud can use the vitality stored in its body to replenish the energy of its contractor.","1. Orchid Leaf State: The vitality in the orchid leaves is very tough. When the vitality is injected into its contractor, the contractor’s defense will be raised.","1. Orchid Flower State: The petals of the orchid petal will be able to extract vitality from the soil that can be injected into the bodies of others to heal their injuries.","3. Orchid Fruit State: Every fruit produced will have the contractor’s soul aura embedded in it. When the contractor’s soul is injured, the orchid fruit can use the soul aura embedded to heal the contractor.","[Barren River Heal]: Absorbs all the energy in the environment, causing the environment to enter a desert state. The energy in the environment can be enhanced by the orchid leaf state, orchid flower state, and orchid fruit state.","[Blessing of the Orchid Soul]: Sacrifice a portion of its body during its growth process, turning its body into an orchid soul in the area. The orchid soul can protect the lifeforms in the area and replace the lifeforms in the area to withstand the baptism of bad luck and the negative changes in its body.","[Barren River Guide]: By channeling one’s own energy into the environment, one can anchor three types of energy in advance. When changing the environment, these three types of energy will become the final energy that forms the environment.","When Endless Summer summoned the Barren River Orchid Bud, Lin Yuan investigated it.","The Barren River Orchid Bud’s first ability was the most complex among all the sacred source lifeforms Lin Yuan had seen. However, whether in its orchid leaf state, orchid flower state, or orchid fruit state, all of its abilities were extremely clear.","The orchid leaf state increased defense, the orchid flower state healed any lifeform’s physical injuries, and the orchid fruit state healed soul-level damage. Sacred source lifeforms with healing abilities were extremely rare in any environment.","Lin Yuan had not explored the Barren River Orchid Bud for long before upgrading it to the ability of the Sacred Source 12 Stars. Barren River Heal maximized the activation of the Barren River Orchid Bud’s three states.","To use the Barren River Heal ability, the surrounding environment had to be sacrificed. The more energy contained in the surrounding environment, the stronger the Barren River Heal ability.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, the Barren River Orchid Bud would rarely have a chance to use this ability, especially in North of the Lonely River. If they encountered danger, even if Lin Yuan was not there, Spring and Summer could still resolve all the problems. There was no need for Endless Summer to use Barren River Heal.","Moreover, the price of using this ability was too high. Lin Yuan could not allow the environment to change drastically, as he had spent a lot of effort creating the environment of North of the Lonely River.","If Endless Summer used the Barren River Orchid Bud’s second ability, Barren River Heal, it would turn North of the Lonely River into a desert. However, under certain circumstances, if Endless Summer left North of the Lonely River, the Barren River Orchid Bud could still protect an area by using Barren River Heal.","The Barren River Orchid Bud’s third function, Blessing of the Orchid Soul, was a protective ability. When the Barren River Orchid Bud sacrificed its body to form an orchid soul, the orchid soul would become the guardian of the lifeforms in the area, preventing them from mutating during the process of increasing their strength and bloodline evolution. It could also help these lifeforms avoid the invasion of bad luck and curses, making it a rather effective protective ability.","The area the Barren River Orchid Bud could cover was extremely vast, with its roots extending nearly 2,000,000 square meters. Hence, all lifeforms in this area could receive its protection.","The area the Barren River Orchid Bud could cover represented the value of Blessing of the Orchid Soul. However, Lin Yuan was more interested in the Barren River Orchid Bud’s fourth function.","The Barren River Orchid Bud’s fourth ability, Barren River Guide, allowed it to anchor three types of energy and then release them into the environment, transforming it to let these types of energy become the final energies that make up the environment.","This ability could be considered a divine skill that could change the environment, easily transforming a harsh environment into one that was needed.","There were many powerful species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. When the abyss lifeforms invaded the four universes, the native lifeforms of the four universes were doing the same thing.","The reason the powerful species of the four universes did not invade the abyss on a large scale and establish their own territories there was that the abyss environment was unsuitable for the survival of all species. Even elemental-type lifeforms could not stay in the abyss for long. Furthermore, the four universes had never found a good way to change the environment of the abyss.","However, Barren River Guide could change the abyss environment to be suitable for lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds by anchoring the spirit qi, elemental energy, and vitality. Just this ability of the Barren River Orchid Bud was enough to prove its value.","In the future, Lin Yuan would definitely explore the abyss. The Barren River Orchid Bud could help him change the environment of the abyss and allow him to establish his foundation.","It was said that there were many resources in the abyss, which was also the reason all the species wanted to explore it.","In Endless Summer’s opinion, the most useful of the Barren River Orchid Bud’s four abilities was Blessing of the Orchid Soul.","“Young Master, my Barren River Orchid Bud has been nurtured into a pure support-type sacred source lifeform. Her Blessing of the Orchid Soul is currently the most useful ability. She should be able to protect the lifeforms north of the Lonely River from now on.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan first acknowledged the Barren River Orchid Bud’s Blessing of the Orchid Soul before speaking to Endless Summer in an extremely serious tone. “Endless Summer, Blessing of the Orchid Soul is indeed extremely powerful, but it is not the strongest among all the Barren River Orchid Bud’s abilities. Her strongest ability is definitely none other than Barren River Guide.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan explained the situation to Endless Summer.","Endless Summer had always been a person with great foresight. After understanding the situation in the abyss, she immediately realized Barren River Guide’s value.","“Young Master, if you want to explore the abyss in the future, you must bring me along.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Of course. If I want to explore the abyss, your sacred source lifeform’s ability is extremely important. Endless Summer, you’ve already stepped into the Holy Spirit level. You are considered to have extraordinary strength in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds. Do you plan to stay north of the Lonely River from now on, or do you plan to go out and develop? With your Barren River Orchid Bud’s ability, you will definitely be valued by any faction in the world.”","Endless Summer was surprised to hear Lin Yuan’s words. Previously, Lin Yuan had always brought people to the Lonely River from the outside, but this was the first time he had sent a core member of Sky City out.","Endless Summer did not reply immediately. Instead, she asked Lin Yuan in an extremely serious tone, “Young Master, do you think that staying north of the Lonely River is beneficial to Sky City’s development, or do you think that I need to go out for a walk? I’m willing to follow your arrangements and act according to your decisions.”","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before he said, “Endless Summer, whether you’re north of the Lonely River or outside, it will be very beneficial to Sky City. It’s up to you to decide what to do.","“If you leave Sky City, I will use my connections to get you to join Honor Absent Palace and become a member. Then, you will use Honor Absent Palace’s power to come into contact with the abyss first and develop there. However, you’ll definitely encounter danger in the abyss, and we can’t rely on the power of Honor Absent Palace to protect you. I’ll give you some protection then.”","Lin Yuan suddenly had this thought after seeing the Barren River Orchid Bud’s functions. Previously, he had never thought of letting Endless Summer leave the Lonely River.","Lin Yuan could not spread his influence extensively to explore the abyss, so borrowing the power of Honor Absent Palace to let Endless Summer shine first was the best choice. Before long, Endless Summer would have an extraordinary status in Honor Absent Palace.","Regardless of whether Lin Yuan wanted to explore the abyss or borrow Honor Absent Palace’s official power in the East Universe, Endless Summer would be of great help to him.","Endless Summer knew very well that much of her and Listen’s work north of the Lonely River had been completed. Whatever remained, even without her presence and with Gu Lang assisting Listen, could still be perfectly accomplished. If she continued to stay north of the Lonely River, she would lose her ability to shine. Regardless of whether it was to repay Lin Yuan or for herself, Endless Summer did not want to be marginalized in Sky City.","Endless Summer said firmly, “Young Master, I’m willing to go to Honor Absent Palace and become a member to explore the abyss for you first.”","It was worth noting that Lin Yuan did not present Endless Summer with a difficult challenge, nor did he send her to Honor Absent Palace to fight alone. Instead, she was allowed to become a member of Honor Absent Palace.","The members of Honor Absent Palace had a very high status there. Endless Summer only needed to follow the path that Lin Yuan had paved for her to achieve her goal. This was equivalent to Lin Yuan giving Endless Summer a wide stage to display her abilities. Others in Sky City did not have such an opportunity. This was an opportunity given to Endless Summer due to her sacred source lifeform.","Lin Yuan smiled. “There’s no hurry. Go back and think about it before making a decision. It will take some time for me to help you become a member of Honor Absent Palace. Before it’s confirmed, you can consider it carefully. If you have any thoughts, just tell me.”","While saying this, Lin Yuan began to ponder. He already had many channels in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The first was to use his Bloodian connections to send Endless Summer to the Honor Absent Parliament to become a member. Fan Lou also took such a path.","The second channel was to use his Grade 5 Creator connections to recommend Endless Summer to the Honor Absent Parliament. These Class 5 Creators were very respected in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The third method was to make use of Fortune Treasure Palace’s connections. Based on Ling Muzhuo’s attitude toward him, Ling Muzhuo would definitely not reject Lin Yuan’s request for help.","The fourth channel was to use the relationship with Diverse City’s City Lord, Zhao Chen, to introduce Endless Summer into the Honor Absent Parliament. Zhao Chen himself held an important position there. Hence, the faction behind Zhao Chen must have an extremely high status in the Honor Absent Parliament. Otherwise, Zhao Chen, a direct descendant of the family clan, would not have been able to become the City Lord of a city like Diverse City.","Lin Yuan had already started to be involved with the faction behind Zhao Chen. As the cooperation between the two sides deepened in the future, the relationship between the two sides was destined to become closer.","Lin Yuan felt that using Zhao Chen’s channel to introduce Endless Summer into the Honor Absent Parliament was a good choice.","Lin Yuan had already made up his mind to deepen his cooperation with the faction behind Zhao Chen and recruit talented individuals from Zhao Chen for Sky City.","At present, Lin Yuan had already revealed his Creation Master resources to the faction behind Zhao Chen. Lin Yuan was sure that the faction behind Zhao Chen would want to be on good terms with him after finding out about his foundation.","If he used the connections of the faction behind Zhao Chen to send Endless Summer to the Honor Absent Parliament, they would have to help solve any problems Endless Summer might encounter in the Honor Absent Parliament in the future. This was equivalent to saving Lin Yuan a lot of trouble, and it could also ensure that Endless Summer would not encounter any hidden dangers.","Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to send Endless Summer to the Honor Absent Parliament. He would patiently wait for Endless Summer to make a decision before mentioning this matter to Zhao Chen.","Now that Zhuo Yan had arrived at Diverse City, she had most likely finished communicating with Zhao Chen. The latter would contact Lin Yuan very soon.","When Zhao Chen contacted him, Lin Yuan would only need to mention this matter to him. Lin Yuan believed that if he mentioned this matter to Zhao Chen, the latter would definitely be very willing to help him.","When meeting the Grade 5 Creator Zhuo Yan, Zhao Chen was already probably thinking about how to improve his relationship with him."]},{"number":3088,"title":"Chapter 3088: Endless Summer’s Abyssal World Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3088: Endless Summer’s Abyssal World Plan","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Endless Summer heard that Lin Yuan wanted her to go back and think before making a decision, she had no intention of doing so.","Endless Summer firmly said, “Young Master, I’ve already thought it through. I’m very willing to go to the Honor Absent Parliament to explore the abyssal world for the sake of Sky City’s development. Please let me go as soon as possible!”","Lin Yuan could tell from Endless Summer’s expression that she was serious about this matter.","“Since you’ve made your decision, I’ll make the arrangements as soon as possible. Don’t worry. Since I’ve arranged for you to go, I can definitely protect you. I’ll also ask Winter to give you some life-saving methods. Even if you encounter danger in the abyss, you’ll be able to deal with it!”","Not long after Endless Summer left, Lin Yuan received Sun Yin’s message.","“Young Master, now that Traveling Dragon Palace has resolved all the problems in Diverse City, I would like to ask if you want to support the development of Traveling Dragon Palace in Extreme Wood City. Traveling Dragon Palace does not have any foundation in Extreme Wood City. It will be very difficult for Traveling Dragon Palace to gain a firm foothold in Extreme Wood City. Not only do we have to invest a large amount of resources in Traveling Dragon Palace, but we also have to provide them with powerful combat power as support. I have already met with Traveling Dragon Palace’s First Palace Master, You Tao. The various factions in Extreme Wood City are treating Traveling Dragon Palace much worse than expected.”","Apart from these reports, Sun Yin also detailed the predicament Traveling Dragon Palace would face if they wanted to develop in Extreme Wood City.","Even You Tao, who wanted Traveling Dragon Palace to expand beyond regions, gave up on this idea.","Lin Yuan thought for a moment and felt that Traveling Dragon Palace still needed to head to Extreme Wood City to develop.","This was because once Traveling Dragon Palace gained a firm foothold in Extreme Wood City and developed in the two giant cities, the significance of Traveling Dragon Palace would be completely different from now.","Furthermore, Traveling Dragon Palace had already invested a lot of resources in Extreme Wood City. If they gave up halfway, the resources they invested would be wasted.","Before he controlled Traveling Dragon Palace, its development in Extreme Wood City involved transferring the resources from Diverse City to Extreme Wood City.","However, after he took control of Traveling Dragon Palace, he cooperated with Zhao Chen and allowed Traveling Dragon Palace to develop in Extreme Wood City. It was equivalent to the power of Diverse City invading Extreme Wood City.","Lin Yuan did not believe that Traveling Dragon Palace had not been suppressed by Extreme Wood City’s City Lord. If not for the City Lord’s suppression, those forces that were enemies with Gray Smoke Stronghold would have taken the initiative to contact Traveling Dragon Palace.","When Lin Yuan asked Sun Yin to negotiate with Traveling Dragon Palace, he had promised You Di that he would help Traveling Dragon Palace gain a firm foothold in Extreme Wood City. No matter the reason, if he retreated now, it would be equivalent to breaking his promise.","Even if You Di and You Tao did not say anything on the surface, it was still very likely that they would fall out with each other.","Lin Yuan replied to Sun Yin.","“Traveling Dragon Palace will continue to develop in Extreme Wood City according to the original plan. Tell You Tao and You Di that it will not change. Previously, I asked you to come into contact with Traveling Dragon Palace because you were the only one by my side who was able to do this. Now, I’ll give you a choice. Do you want to continue staying in Traveling Dragon Palace or return to my side? If you choose to return, I will arrange for a Grade 5 Creator to take your place.”","After Sun Yin sent Lin Yuan a message through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, he had been waiting on the side, hoping that Lin Yuan would contact him immediately.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan’s message, Sun Yin hesitated for a moment before hurriedly replying.","“Young Master, compared to wandering outside, I prefer to stay by your side and accompany you at all times!”","Upon seeing Sun Yin’s message, Lin Yuan prepared to send Si Xue to Diverse City.","Si Xue was an intermediate Grade 5 Creator. In terms of grade, she was a minor grade higher than Sun Yin.","Although it was only a small grade, it made Si Xue and Sun Yin’s statuses look very different to outsiders.","The reason Lin Yuan valued Sun Yin so much was that her potential was the strongest among all the intermediate Creators under him.","Moreover, Lin Yuan preferred people like Sun Yin who had a backbone to those who would lower their heads casually.","Lin Yuan releasing Sun Yin was equivalent to giving Sun Yin power.","Under such circumstances, Sun Yin was still willing to return to his side. Not only did this mean that Sun Yin was worth nurturing, but it also meant that Sun Yin was very smart. This made Lin Yuan even more willing to spend resources to nurture Sun Yin.","The Moon Empress had been evaluating these Creators who had joined Sky City. Among the Grade 5 Creators, Si Xue was the most uneasy. She was clearly not used to living in North of the Lonely River.","This did not mean that Si Xue was not easy to control. After contracting the Lifespan Mouse and having her holy spirit controlled by Lin Yuan, Si Xue had absolute loyalty.","Since Si Xue, an intermediate Grade 5 Creator, was not used to living in Sky City, he would let her go to Diverse City to handle some matters.","Even though Si Xue and Zhuo Yan were not on good terms, Lin Yuan did not intend to let Zhuo Yan stay in Diverse City for long.","After Zhuo Yan helped Zhao Chen evolve his feys, Lin Yuan would let Zhuo Yan return.","It was a good opportunity for Traveling Dragon Palace to get in touch with a new Grade 5 Creator. It would also let Traveling Dragon Palace know what kind of power the faction they joined contained!","After communicating with Sun Yin, Lin Yuan began to think about which fey he should nurture first.","In the end, Lin Yuan chose Purple Afterglow. This was because Purple Afterglow had plans to reproduce with the Kill Food Sky Butterfly. Letting Purple Afterglow’s grade advance further before reproducing would help ensure the strength of the bloodline of Purple Afterglow’s descendants.","Among all of Lin Yuan’s feys, Purple Afterglow was the first to display breeding intentions.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to summon Purple Afterglow, Zhuo Yan sent him a message.","[Zhuo Yan]: Lord, the City Lord of Diverse City has made many requests. None of these were easy to achieve. I spent a lot of effort fulfilling them. However, it will take some time to concoct the spirit fluid. I might only be able to return to the North of the Lonely River in three months.","Zhuo Yan had offended Lin Yuan before she was recruited by him. She feared that Lin Yuan would hold a grudge against her.","On the one hand, Zhuo Yan was trying to claim credit. On the other hand, she was reminding herself that Zhao Chen would have to pay a huge price for this cooperation in the future. Otherwise, it would be too easy on Zhao Chen!","Lin Yuan did not mind Zhuo Yan’s previous conflict with him. At that time, Zhuo Yan had yet to join his ranks.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, it was normal for a Grade 5 Creator to have a temper.","[Lin Yuan]: Zhuo Yan, you’ve worked hard. When you return, whatever resources you need will be given priority. Didn’t you say that you were very interested in Alchemists? I happen to have the complete Alchemist legacy on hand. I can let you read it.","Zhuo Yan was shocked when she saw Lin Yuan’s message. She admired Lin Yuan’s way of doing things from the bottom of her heart. This feeling of being rewarded as long as she contributed to the faction was very satisfying.","After talking to Zhuo Yan, Lin Yuan summoned Purple Afterglow. Among all of Lin Yuan’s feys, Purple Afterglow not only desired to reproduce the most but also preferred to live in human form.","When Lin Yuan saw Purple Afterglow, he realized that it looked better than he remembered. Could it be that the nourishment of love could really improve one’s looks?","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Purple Afterglow.","[Fey Name]: Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly","[Fey Species]: Flash-butterfly species/scaled-butterfly species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (9/10)","[Fey Type]: Spiritual/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Silence Scale Powder]: Special scale powder with the ability to silence is released and any target that comes into contact with the scale powder will be unable to use spiritual power abilities. The scale powder will also be absorbed into the target’s spiritual power. Each time the target uses spirit qi, their spirit qi will end up cracking.","[Flashing Scale Dance]: Its images will be formed from the scale powder released into the air. It will be able to flash back and forth between itself and the formed images. While it is travelling, it can absorb energy from its surroundings to quicken the production of scale powder.","[Scale Light Butterfly Image]: Scale powder in the wings will be used to refract light. When light fills its reflection, its charm will be boosted and it will gain absolute control over butterfly-species feys.","[Beautiful God Hallucination]: When a target is being attracted and sees one as a beautiful god, one will be able to adjust according to the target’s features and pick a lifeform to turn into the target’s definition of unsightliness. If the target and the lifeform have a positive connection, it will disappear momentarily. If they do not have a positive connection, the target will attack the lifeform.","[Species Praised Beauty]: When attracting a target and receiving its worship, the target’s species will also be affected and instinctively feel positively about the Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly.","[Beautiful God Cutting Wings]: Flap its wings to produce sequential cutting attacks. A special Beautiful God Engraving will be formed on the target’s body. Every engraving requires 16 cutting attacks to be formed. The target with a formed Beautiful God Engraving will trigger its own emotions to the greatest extent. Anything related to energy will be prevented from moving in and out of the target’s body.","[Beauty Assessment Plundering]: When one’s beauty stupefies a species and takes over that species’ assessment of beauty, it can set the standard with its own beauty and become the definition of beauty for that species. Besides itself, the species would not see any other lifeform as beautiful. It would not detest and be repulsed by lifeforms that previously met their standards of beauty.","[Beauty Dispersion]: When other feys feel love for it, their amazement and recognition of its beauty will turn into a special scale powder that can be used to increase the power of other butter-species lifeforms. (This is only effective on butterfly-species lifeforms with inferior bloodlines.)","[Feathered Insect Command]: It will have stronger mesmerization effects on insects and lifeforms with wings. Insects and lifeforms with wings will also easily begin worshipping it.","[Beautiful Spirit Transformation]: All other lifeforms’ recognition of its beauty will be sealed in and used to transform its body. It will also use its dreams as a weapon to take control of the faith, spirit, and soul of other species.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Scale Powder Halo]: The scale powder has strong reflective abilities and the target that lays eyes on the scale powder will be affected by the reflection. The target will start to feel dizzy and experience temporary blindness.","[Soul Beauty Goddess]: By activating the power of the spirit and soul, the beauty will be increased to a limitless level. The target will be attracted and fall in love. The target will want everything of its object of its love on its own body and the target will want to collect everything connected to the object of its love.","[Beauty Reaches Every Species]: Each time it receives the recognition of a species and becomes their standard of beauty, its charm would be eternally strengthened.","[Extreme Mesmerization]: When the mesmerizing ability is used on an entity, it can give up its scale powder in exchange for boosting its mesmerizing ability.","[Butterfly Bloodline Gift]: A part of its bloodline will be gifted to other lifeforms and allow them to gain some traits of its bloodline. The bloodlines of other butterfly-species feys will be activated to a greater extent.","[Spirit Arrival Application]: Choose a lifeform that has received its gift. The lifeform’s life will be sacrificed. It will temporarily be able to use the lifeform’s body as a medium to arrive (The duration of arrival is related to the concentration of bloodline in the lifeform’s body).","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Beauty Seal]: Make a judgment about beauty. It will assign a value to every lifeform’s level of beauty. If other lifeforms’ beauty value is lower than its own, it can use its divine kingdom to seal the other lifeform’s divine kingdom (Only a maximum of two entities can be sealed. When sealing the two entities, it will not be able to use any other ability apart from its divine kingdom ability).","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but feel helpless. It seemed that Purple Afterglow hadn’t made any effort to improve its strength during this period.","Not only had the grade of its divine kingdom not changed, but it also hadn’t reached World Emperor X, remaining at World Emperor IX.","It appeared that Purple Afterglow had focused its time solely on its partner.","Lin Yuan didn’t think there was anything wrong with this.","Each of his feys had a different personality. Some were driven to work hard and increase their strength, while others, like Purple Afterglow, were not as enthusiastic about it.","Lin Yuan wouldn’t force Purple Afterglow.","With Lin Yuan’s physique and the faith power accumulated by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus, it would be easy to increase Purple Afterglow’s strength.","If Purple Afterglow could produce offspring with its own bloodline, it would be its way of enriching Sky City’s power."]},{"number":3089,"title":"Chapter 3089: Purple Afterglow Who Is Good At Gnawing!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3089: Purple Afterglow Who Is Good At Gnawing!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Purple Afterglow was not passionate about improving its strength but was extremely close to Lin Yuan.","Purple Afterglow gave Lin Yuan a big bear hug.","“Dad, help me raise my grade and quality so that I can have more children. I love you so much!”","Lin Yuan said in an extremely serious tone, “Apart from helping you increase your strength, I will also help the Kill Food Sky Butterfly increase its grade and quality. However, apart from breeding offspring, you must pay attention to nurturing your offspring in the future. Only then can you ensure that the species you nurture through your bloodline can last for a long time and even participate in the battle of the species!”","Purple Afterglow listened very carefully to Lin Yuan’s teachings. If Purple Afterglow wanted to continue doing the bare minimum, it naturally had to raise its descendants well.","Purple Afterglow had already made up its mind to become a professional nanny in the future.","“Dad, don’t worry. I will be extremely serious when it comes to raising my children. However, nurturing children requires resources. At that time, I will choose the most outstanding ones from all my children and send them to you so that you can nurture them!”","Purple Afterglow could be said to have raised its status to the extreme. When it said this, it did not feel embarrassed at all.","Lin Yuan definitely had to pamper his feys, so he said helplessly, “No problem. In the future, I’ll arrange for special Creators to nurture your talented descendants. Now, I’ll get the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to transfer a large amount of faith power into your body to help your divine kingdom condense holy spirits. Prepare yourself first.”","Lin Yuan summoned the Kill Food Sky Butterfly and said, “You and Purple Afterglow are about to have offspring. You’ve already advanced to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. I’ll help you and Purple Afterglow break through to the Holy Spirit level together. This way, I can guarantee that your descendants’ bloodline will reach a very high level!”","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly thanked Lin Yuan in surprise. The Kill Food Sky Butterfly had inherited its memories from when it was still a Kill Food Worm and clearly remembered how it had joined Lin Yuan’s camp.","It had never been an important figure in Lin Yuan’s camp. But now, it had the chance to reach the Holy Spirit level!","“Father, thank you for your help.”","Lin Yuan waved his hand at the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, indicating that it did not need to be so polite to him.","As Lin Yuan activated the Realm Abyss Red Lotus, the boundless faith power it had gathered poured into the Kill Food Sky Butterfly and Purple Afterglow. Their strength and aura were increasing at a speed visible to the naked eye.","While Lin Yuan was evolving Purple Afterglow and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, Si Xue came to bid Lin Yuan farewell.","When Si Xue knocked on Lin Yuan’s door, she felt relaxed and nervous.","Si Xue and Yi He were old friends. When she first saw Lin Yuan, Si Xue had expressed her desire to become his subordinate.","However, Si Xue really could not stay idle. She felt uncomfortable after staying in North of the Lonely River for a few months.","However, when Lin Yuan really sent her out, she was afraid that Lin Yuan would not value her and that she would be marginalized in Sky City in the future. When Lin Yuan distributed the Grade 6 Creator resources, she would not get her share. If that was the case, it would be awkward!","Apart from bidding farewell to Lin Yuan, Si Xue also wanted Lin Yuan to show that her desire to submit was genuine.","Lin Yuan had control over Si Xue’s life and death after she contracted the Lifespan Mouse. There were many things that Lin Yuan did not need to do behind Si Xue’s back.","He allowed Si Xue to enter his room.","As soon as she entered the room, Si Xue felt the majestic faith power infusing into the Kill Food Sky Butterfly and Purple Afterglow. Even as a Grade 5 Creator, Si Xue was still stunned by Lin Yuan’s method of injecting faith power.","With Lin Yuan’s current abilities, he had the ability to create Holy Spirit experts in batches.","This made Si Xue even more shocked by Lin Yuan’s foundation.","The moment Si Xue saw Lin Yuan, she immediately knelt on one knee and said respectfully, “Lord, it’s been a long time since we last met. It seems like you’ve been well!”","Lin Yuan nodded at Si Xue and said, “Yi He has already told me about your situation in advance. He said that you’ve been traveling around all these years and are not used to living in Sky City. I can understand, and you don’t have to worry about this. Also, the situation in Diverse City is complicated. Don’t let your guard down when you go over!”","Yi He and Si Xue were extremely close friends. Furthermore, Si Xue had joined Sky City because of Yi He.","Yi He had specially come to look for Lin Yuan twice for Si Xue.","Judging from Si Xue’s current state, she probably did not know about this.","Since Yi He wanted to give Si Xue a favor, Lin Yuan would help Yi He and let Si Xue owe Yi He a favor.","Lin Yuan could tell that Yi He was interested in Si Xue, and it most likely had romantic inclinations. However, Yi He did not confess to her.","Si Xue felt relieved. It was good that Lin Yuan did not blame her for this! From the looks of it, even if she left Sky City, she would not be marginalized!","At the same time, Si Xue was extremely grateful to Yi He.","“Lord, don’t worry. I might not be able to guarantee anything else, but going to Diverse City to do those related matters and nurture a faction will definitely result in any mistakes. You can rest assured about this! It’s just that I don’t know if everything should be done according to your specific instructions or according to my own method when we reach Diverse City.","“According to my method, since Sky City’s forces have already spread to Diverse City, all the forces in there will know that Traveling Dragon Palace is supported by a powerful force as long as they are not stupid. Rather than letting those factions make wild guesses, should we directly display our strength and intimidate these factions?","“If you want Traveling Dragon Palace to develop in Extreme Wood City, I can talk to the City Lord of Diverse City directly. I think as long as the City Lord is not stupid, he will definitely be willing to cooperate. He won’t let go of such a rare opportunity!”","Everyone had their own style of doing things. Si Xue’s style of doing things had a sense of ingenuity. At certain times, using such a straightforward method would actually make things easier!","As Sky City’s City Lord, it was impossible for Lin Yuan to take care of everything like he did before. Lin Yuan only needed to make decisions on crucial matters. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would have been exhausted to death from all the work!","“Si Xue, I’ll send you out to Diverse City to handle some matters. Just follow your own style of doing things. However, you have to remember not to cause too much trouble. If you encounter something that you can’t solve yourself, don’t force yourself. Remember to report it immediately!","“Even if I’m busy and can’t reply to you immediately, you can inform Wen Yu and the Moon Empress. They will tell you what to do!”","“Lord, I will report regularly on any problems I encounter. You don’t have to worry about this. When the time comes, no matter what orders Sky City has, you can give them to me immediately, Lord!”","Si Xue bowed to Lin Yuan and left Sky City.","Not long after Si Xue left, Purple Afterglow reached the Holy Spirit level first.","Purple Afterglow’s overall appearance did not change much, but the color on its body became more beautiful than before. At the same time, just this slight change in color made Purple Afterglow’s beauty increase by several folds.","Lin Yuan investigated Holy Spirit Purple Afterglow.","[Fey Name]: Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly","[Fey Species]: Flash-butterfly species/scaled-butterfly species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Spiritual/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Silence Scale Powder]: Special scale powder with the ability to silence is released and any target that comes into contact with the scale powder will be unable to use spiritual power abilities. The scale powder will also be absorbed into the target’s spiritual power. Each time the target uses spirit qi, their spirit qi will end up cracking.","[Flashing Scale Dance]: Its images will be formed from the scale powder released into the air. It will be able to flash back and forth between itself and the formed images. While it is travelling, it can absorb energy from its surroundings to quicken the production of scale powder.","[Scale Light Butterfly Image]: Scale powder in the wings will be used to refract light. When light fills its reflection, its charm will be boosted and it will gain absolute control over butterfly-species feys.","[Beautiful God Hallucination]: When a target is being attracted and sees one as a beautiful god, one will be able to adjust according to the target’s features and pick a lifeform to turn into the target’s definition of unsightliness. If the target and the lifeform have a positive connection, it will disappear momentarily. If they do not have a positive connection, the target will attack the lifeform.","[Species Praised Beauty]: When attracting a target and receiving its worship, the target’s species will also be affected and instinctively feel positively about the Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly.","[Beautiful God Cutting Wings]: Flap its wings to produce sequential cutting attacks. A special Beautiful God Engraving will be formed on the target’s body. Every engraving requires 16 cutting attacks to be formed. The target with a formed Beautiful God Engraving will trigger its own emotions to the greatest extent. Anything related to energy will be prevented from moving in and out of the target’s body.","[Beauty Assessment Plundering]: When one’s beauty stupefies a species and takes over that species’ assessment of beauty, it can set the standard with its own beauty and become the definition of beauty for that species. Besides itself, the species would not see any other lifeform as beautiful. It would not detest and be repulsed by lifeforms that previously met their standards of beauty.","[Beauty Dispersion]: When other feys feel love for it, their amazement and recognition of its beauty will turn into a special scale powder that can be used to increase the power of other butter-species lifeforms. (This is only effective on butterfly-species lifeforms with inferior bloodlines.)","[Feathered Insect Command]: It will have stronger mesmerization effects on insects and lifeforms with wings. Insects and lifeforms with wings will also easily begin worshipping it.","[Beautiful Spirit Transformation]: All other lifeforms’ recognition of its beauty will be sealed in and used to transform its body. It will also use its dreams as a weapon to take control of the faith, spirit, and soul of other species.","Exclusive Skill:","[Scale Powder Halo]: The scale powder has strong reflective abilities and the target that lays eyes on the scale powder will be affected by the reflection. The target will start to feel dizzy and experience temporary blindness.","[Soul Beauty Goddess]: By activating the power of the spirit and soul, the beauty will be increased to a limitless level. The target will be attracted and fall in love. The target will want everything of its object of its love on its own body and the target will want to collect everything connected to the object of its love.","[Beauty Reaches Every Species]: Each time it receives the recognition of a species and becomes their standard of beauty, its charm would be eternally strengthened.","[Extreme Mesmerization]: When the mesmerizing ability is used on an entity, it can give up its scale powder in exchange for boosting its mesmerizing ability.","[Butterfly Bloodline Gift]: A part of its bloodline will be gifted to other lifeforms and allow them to gain some traits of its bloodline. The bloodlines of other butterfly-species feys will be activated to a greater extent.","[Spirit Arrival Application]: Choose a lifeform that has received its gift. The lifeform’s life will be sacrificed. It will temporarily be able to use the lifeform’s body as a medium to arrive (The duration of arrival is related to the concentration of bloodline in the lifeform’s body).","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Beauty Seal]: Make a judgment about beauty. It will assign a value to every lifeform’s level of beauty. If other lifeforms’ beauty value is lower than its own, it can use its divine kingdom to seal the other lifeform’s divine kingdom (Only a maximum of two entities can be sealed. When sealing the two entities, it will not be able to use any other ability apart from its divine kingdom ability).","[Beauty God Worship]: With a target of the same bloodline, grade, and quality as well as a deviating divine kingdom, its grade, quality, and deviation will receive feedback from the target. This will enable its grade, quality, and deviation to improve.","Lin Yuan had always thought that Purple Afterglow was feeding on its elders. Now, it seemed that Purple Afterglow was not simply feeding on its elders. The Holy Spirit Purple Afterglow had already started to eat its unborn descendants.","Relying on the Holy Spirit divine kingdom ability, Purple Afterglow only needed to be a full-time nanny and nurture more offspring with the Kill Food Sky Butterfly and Purple Afterglow’s strength would increase rapidly.","Moreover, the speed at which its strength increased would not be slower than that of Lin Yuan’s other feys!","When Lin Yuan arranged for Grade 4 and 5 Creators to help Purple Afterglow nurture its descendants, Purple Afterglow could even become the one with the fastest increase in strength among all the feys under Lin Yuan.","To a certain extent, nibbling on one’s offspring was not an embarrassing act."]},{"number":3090,"title":"Chapter 3090: Body Summoning Holy Milk!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3090: Body Summoning Holy Milk!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Not long after Purple Afterglow reached the Holy Spirit level, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly also successfully reached the Holy Spirit level.","The new divine kingdom ability that the Kill Food Sky Butterfly obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level was called Divine Power Amplification.","[Divine Power Amplification]: The higher the evolution of the divine kingdom in the divine kingdom, the greater the amplification of its strength. During the battle, when one is attacked by the enemy, the strength it possesses will increase its defense.","The divine kingdom ability Divine Power Amplification that the Kill Food Sky Butterfly obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level looked extremely simple, but it was extremely suitable for the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly was a fey that used its strength to fight.","Although Lin Yuan had brought the Kill Food Sky Butterfly up from the main world, as the owner of one of the three supreme butterfly-species fey bloodlines, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s strength surpassed many feys of the same grade.","It was impossible for the Kill Food Sky Butterfly to use strength to roll grades.","Ever since Lin Yuan had taken the Kill Food Sky Butterfly under his wing, he had never mistreated it. In particular, Lin Yuan had been nurturing the Kill Food Sky Butterfly as his daughter-in-law.","However, the other feys that Lin Yuan had contracted were too stunning which made the Kill Food Sky Butterfly seem somewhat mediocre.","However, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly basically did not have any chance to fight.","Purple Afterglow could not bear to let its wife fight. Regardless of whether it was in the main world or the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Purple Afterglow was very devoted to the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","However, Purple Afterglow needed to enrich the bloodlines of its descendants through the development of the divine kingdom ability Beauty God Worship.","Lin Yuan would not take the initiative to get involved in these matters. He just needed to let Purple Afterglow and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly decide for themselves.","Children and grandchildren had their own blessings. Lin Yuan was aware of this.","After sending Purple Afterglow and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly back to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan was about to summon Blackie to nurture it so that it could reach the Holy Spirit level.","Diverse City’s City Lord, Zhao Chen, sent a message to Lin Yuan.","The communication item that Zhao Chen had given Lin Yuan was more advanced than the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower that he had obtained from Fortune Treasure Palace. It allowed him to communicate with Lin Yuan in a timely manner.","However, Lin Yuan had no intention of trading more communication feys with Zhao Chen to replace the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. This was because the communication fey that Zhao Chen had given Lin Yuan was a pair of Mother Tongue Lizards that could communicate over long distances. They could only communicate one-way and were not suitable for Lin Yuan’s needs.","However, it was indeed much more convenient to communicate this way.","“Brother Lin, thank you for arranging this Grade 5 Creator for me. I’ve already finalized the contents of the deal with her. I’ve deliberately applied for a batch of resources from the family. I wonder what resources you’re interested in. I can pass them to you through the family’s channels!”","Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony with Zhao Chen. Grade 5 Creator resources were enough to trade for Sacred Body Stones.","What all the core members of Sky City needed the most were Sacred Body Stones that could awaken their physiques.","“Brother Zhao, if you say that I need a lot of resources, can you help me get some Sacred Body Stones with your connections? I need some top-notch resources like this that can awaken physiques.”","Zhao Chen was a little surprised when he heard this. Under normal circumstances, the stronger the faction, the more important the awakening of the physique of the members of the faction.","The direct descendants of a faction like Lin Yuan should have awakened their bloodlines.","Could it be because Lin Yuan was too young and had yet to awaken his bloodline?","Zhao Chen had already decided to befriend Lin Yuan. After thinking for a moment, he gritted his teeth and said, “Brother Lin, the Sacred Body Stone isn’t the only resource to awaken physiques. There’s a resource that’s better than the Sacred Body Stone to awaken physiques. That’s the Body Summoning Holy Milk!","“The Body Summoning Holy Milk is a product refined by Demonic Apothecaries. It is refined by refining the bones of those who have successfully awakened their physiques and adding materials like the Sacred Body Stone. The success rate of awakening the physique with the Body Summoning Holy Milk can reach 100%. It’s much better than using the Sacred Body Stones.","“If you want to awaken your physique, I can get you a bottle of Body Summoning Holy Milk from my family. Even if you awaken your physique, you can still do it flawlessly! However, awakening one’s physique is a huge matter.","“Brother Lin, I still suggest that we do it when the elders of the family clan are around because awakening physiques often come with many situations and requires someone to take care of them. Otherwise, even if the physique awakens successfully, there might be some sequelae that will cause irreversible effects on the body!”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Big Brother Zhao, thank you for your concern. In terms of physique, I’ve already awakened it. The Sacred Body Stones are for the people around me. My awakened physique did not require the Sacred Body Stone nor did I use the Body Summoning Holy Milk you mentioned. I lack knowledge in this aspect.","“I want to ask if there’s an obvious difference between using the Body Summoning Holy Milk and the Sacred Body Stone to awaken the physique.”","Zhao Chen said seriously, “Brother Lin, there’s definitely a gap, and it’s not small. A bottle of Body Summoning Holy Milk can only be refined with one Sacred Body Stone. However, if the Body Summoning Holy Milk is sold, the price of a serving of Body Summoning Holy Milk will be at least three times that of the Saint Body Stone.","“This is still a conservative estimate. You should know the difference between the two when I say this! And this is under the condition that the formula for the Body Summoning Holy Milk is revealed.","“Among all Grade 5 Creators, very few can become Demonic Apothecaries. As far as I know, even a Grade 6 Creator can’t concoct the Body Summoning Holy Milk if they are not a Demonic Apothecary.","“In the entire East Universe and South Universe, there are no more than three Demonic Apothecaries who can concoct the Body Summoning Holy Milk. Even if we count the West and North Universes, there will definitely not be more than seven.”","Lin Yuan could not help but think, Wouldn’t these Demonic Apothecaries who can refine the Body Summoning Holy Milk be as rare as Grade 6 Creators?","However, in terms of status, a Grade 5 Creator turned Demonic Apothecary could not be compared to a Grade 6 Creator turned Demonic Apothecary.","Lin Yuan could not help but be curious about the Demonic Apothecaries. But in terms of ability, Demonic Apothecaries were much more popular than Alchemists.","After all, refining the Body Summoning Holy Milk that could help awaken body compositions was much more important than refining puppets.","While Lin Yuan was curious about the change in profession from Creator to Apothecary, Zhao Chen was also shocked by what Lin Yuan had just said.","Zhao Chen knew that there were only two ways to awaken one’s body compositions, but Lin Yuan had actually used a third method to awaken his body composition. It was hard for Zhao Chen not to be surprised.","Could it be that there was another way to awaken one’s body composition that he did not know about? This was the difference in strength!","Moreover, Lin Yuan was only a few decades old. The price to pay for awakening his physique at such a young age was definitely huge.","Zhao Chen had interacted with direct descendants of factions that were stronger than his family clan. However, this was definitely the first time Zhao Chen had experienced such a sense of defeat when it came to resources.","At that moment, Zhao Chen heard Lin Yuan ask, “Brother Zhao, I’m very interested in the Demonic Apothecaries you mentioned. I wonder what it takes for a Grade 5 Creator to become a Demonic Apothecary?”","Zhao Chen was not surprised that Lin Yuan did not know about the Demonic Apothecaries because he was too young. It was impossible to know everything at such an age.","Moreover, the disciples of large factions at this age were usually filled with extremely exuberant curiosity.","“Brother Lin, not all Grade 5 Creators can become Demonic Apothecaries. To become a Demonic Apothecary, you need to have mental strength that far exceeds that of other Grade 5 Creators.","“Moreover, you have an extremely strong affinity with plants. You have to be good at releasing and activating the energy in the plants. The most important thing is to ensure that the fusion rate of the concoction of spiritual ingredients exceeds 90%.","“If there weren’t so many restrictions on becoming a Demonic Apothecary, the number of Demonic Apothecaries wouldn’t be so low.”","Lin Yuan started pondering upon hearing Zhao Chen’s words.","If there were so many requirements and restrictions, then none of the Creators who had joined Sky City had the qualifications to become a Demonic Apothecary. However, this was understandable. If anyone had the qualifications to become a Demonic Apothecary, they would have been eager to become a Demonic Apothecary before joining Sky City.","Although there was no suitable candidate among the Creators who joined Sky City later, Genius, who had merged with the Enlightenment Cicada, had the ability to do so.","The fusion rate of spirit fluids and spiritual ingredients concocted by Genius had always been extremely high. It had already reached 90% a long time ago. As Genius’ comprehension improved, it was not difficult for its fusion to reach 94% during the process of concocting spirit fluids.","Lin Yuan could try to nurture Genius into a Demonic Apothecary. This way, Sky City would have its own Demonic Apothecary.","“Big Brother Zhao, since the secret recipe the Body Summoning Holy Milk is public, where can I obtain the related functions of a Demonic Apothecary?”","Zhao Chen was astounded. Could it be that Lin Yuan had a Grade 5 Creator who could become a Demonic Apothecary? If that was the case, it would be too shocking!","After some thought, Zhao Chen could not help but shake his head. He felt that Lin Yuan had asked him this out of curiosity.","“There are relevant books on the Demonic Apothecary legacy. Brother Lin, if you’re interested, I can help you find a complete set of books related to the Demonic Apothecary legacy. There’s just a lot of prescriptions that I can’t get my hands on.","“Although a portion of the Demonic Apothecary’s prescriptions are public just like the spirit fluids concocted by Creators, many of the potions are unique recipes developed by those Demonic Apothecaries.”","Lin Yuan said in a serious tone, “The complete legacy of the Demonic Apothecary is enough. There’s no hurry for the prescriptions.”","When Zhao Chen heard Lin Yuan’s words, his thoughts became active again.","If Lin Yuan was only interested in the Demonic Apothecary legacy, then apart from the legacy, Lin Yuan should also be curious about the prescriptions. However, Lin Yuan was clearly not interested in the prescriptions at all. Could Lin Yuan really have a chance to create a Demonic Apothecary?","He had just told Lin Yuan what standards he had to meet to become a Demonic Apothecary. From the bottom of his heart, Zhao Chen hoped that Lin Yuan could produce a Demonic Apothecary under his command.","This way, it would be more convenient for him to trade with Lin Yuan in the future.","His family had never had a channel to become a Grade 5 Demonic Apothecary. If it was not for the fact that those Demonic Apothecaries would sell a batch of Body Summoning Holy Milk every once in a while, Zhao Chen’s family would not have been qualified to obtain such a thing.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, even those factions that had the ability to transcend universes were divided into different levels.","As the saying went, even brothers had to settle accounts clearly. Zhao Chen could not possibly owe Lin Yuan anything in the transaction. If Lin Yuan felt that he had taken advantage of him, how would he have the chance to trade in the future?","“Apart from the complete Demonic Apothecary inheritance and the prescriptions I’ve tried my best to gather, do you want a Body Summoning Holy Milk and two Sacred Body Stones or five Sacred Body Stones?”","The Grade 5 Creator that Lin Yuan had sent over had been helping Zhao Chen recently but he had spent all the resources Zhao Chen had provided. So this reward was enough.","Lin Yuan hesitated for a moment before speaking. “I want a portion of Body Summoning Holy Milk and two Sacred Body Stones.”","If Lin Yuan wanted to nurture Genius into a Demonic Apothecary, it would be best if he could have practical potions for Genius to study instead of letting Genius explore everything on its own.","Lin Yuan chatted with Zhao Chen for a while and planned to end the conversation only to hear Zhao Chen say cautiously, “Brother Lin, I’ve received a private invitation to go to the intersection of the North and South Universes to explore a top grade blessed land. I wonder if you’re interested in this top grade blessed land?","“If you’re interested, we can be guests. Perhaps we can take the opportunity to obtain some gains when those terrifying factions and species are fighting for this top grade blessed land. Anything you can get in a top grade blessed land is a treasure.”","Lin Yuan originally did not plan to leave North of the Lonely River in the near future. He wanted to settle down there for a period of time.","However, this top grade blessed land was too tempting for Lin Yuan. He knew very well how much benefits it would bring to Sky City.","Those low and mid grade blessed lands were worlds apart from high grade blessed lands, let alone top grade blessed lands!","Resources could only be obtained by snatching. Zhao Chen had no intention of fighting over this top grade blessed land. He only wanted to join in the fun.","However, Lin Yuan did not think so.","If it was possible that Lin Yuan intended to grab this top grade blessed land.","However, Lin Yuan still needed to discuss with Winter before making a decision on whether or not to fight for this top grade paradise. If Winter was confident, Lin Yuan would fight for it. If Winter did not confirm this matter after finding out and had doubts in his heart, Lin Yuan would not hesitate to give up on snatching this top grade blessed land from other factions.","With Sky City’s current development, there was no need for Lin Yuan to take the risk.","He would use the Morbius to spirit lock a fey to transform the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","As long as they could produce Grade 6 Creator resources, the strength of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter would steadily increase with Lin Yuan’s help.","After raising the upper limit of Sky City’s strength, it would undoubtedly be much easier to fight for resources."]},{"number":3091,"title":"Chapter 3091 The Spirit Clawed True Dragon’s Bloodline Is About to Transform!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3091 The Spirit Clawed True Dragon’s Bloodline Is About to Transform!","“Big Brother Zhao, when will this top grade blessed land open? If we go there, when will we leave?”","....","Zhao Chen laughed and said honestly, “Brother Lin, actually, I didn’t have the chance to obtain such resources in the past. The reason the family gave me this opportunity is actually very related to you. If you hadn’t given me Grade 5 Creator resources and asked me to guarantee to my family that I could obtain a stable channel of Grade 5 Creator resources, my family would most likely have given this opportunity to my other brothers.","“I just received the news. However, in order to prevent this top grade blessed land from opening, we have to leave within two months at the latest. May I know where we can meet? Should we meet in Diverse City or South Face City which is the city closest to the North Universe?”","When he heard that there was still more than a month, he realized that it would be faster to head to South Face City from his current location.","Lin Yuan could strengthen the Patrolling Heart Flame Mushroom and Blackie during this period.","“In that case, let’s meet in South Face City. Are there any restrictions on competing for this blessed land?”","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, since the major factions were going to the intersection of the North and South Universe to get a share of the pie, the powerful factions would fight for the ownership of this top grade paradise while the weaker factions would seek other benefits.","Under such a big rule, each faction would not bring too many people.","Zhao Chen was just about to tell Lin Yuan about his preparations for this top grade paradise. But since Lin Yuan had taken the initiative to ask, Zhao Chen quickly replied, “Brother Lin, my faction has a total of ten spots to go to this top grade blessed land. Excluding you and me, there are still eight spots. Look at how many people you’re going to bring to this blessed land. I will prepare the remaining people. Of course, it won’t be a problem even if you take the remaining eight spots. At that time, I’ll be a guide.”","With Zhuo Yan’s help, all of Zhao Chen’s feys had been evolved. Zhuo Yan, who had helped Zhao Chen enhance his feys, had already given Lin Yuan some feedback.","One Body Summoning Holy Milk and two Sacred Body Stones were enough to pay Zhuo Yan for strengthening his feys.","However, Zhao Chen’s current actions were still equivalent to forcefully giving Lin Yuan a favor so that he could build a better relationship with Lin Yuan and let him know how he felt. This made Lin Yuan very willing to continue trading Creator resources with him in the future.","Zhao Chen knew very well that if he did not give Lin Yuan enough benefits and respect, Lin Yuan would not be willing to trade Creator resources with him in the future. This was especially so for the Grade 6 Creator resources that Lin Yuan was likely to trade in the future.","He had obtained Grade 5 Creator resources for his family. When his family felt that he had grasped a Grade 5 Creator resource channel, his status among his peers in the family had greatly increased.","Previously, it was very difficult for him to obtain high-quality resources. Now, the family was very willing to invest in him.","Zhao Chen had been failing for thousands of years, but he had succeeded after coming into contact with Lin Yuan and completing the transaction. This was the reason why Zhao Chen was so passionate about Lin Yuan.","When he was communicating with Zhao Chen, Lin Yuan had already called Winter over to let him hear his conversation with Zhao Chen.","Winter’s voice transmission sounded in Lin Yuan’s mind right on the heels of that, “Young Master, the appearance of a top grade blessed land can only be chanced upon by luck. We must fight for such an opportunity. I suggest that you call Autumn back and leave one of us to stay in the North of the Lonely River alone to look after Sky City to prevent any accidents from happening.","“The other three will go to South Face City with you to fight for this top grade blessed land. If I’m the only one going to fight for this top-grade blessed land, the chances are not high. However, if there are three of us going together, we really have the right to fight for this top grade blessed land.","“Not only Grade 5 Creators, but even Grade 6 Creators might be attracted by the appearance of a top grade blessed land. This is a stage where Domain Mountain experts will fight!”","Lin Yuan could sense the excitement in Winter’s tone when he spoke to him. It was obvious that he wanted him to fight for this top grade blessed land.","This was the first time Lin Yuan had seen Winter reveal such an expression when facing a certain resource.","Indeed, Summer alone was enough to protect the entire North of the Lonely River without any faction targeting Sky City and sending people to invade it.","Those Thriving Summer Rising Clouds had already reached the critical stage of cultivation. They definitely could not be cut off. Therefore, it was most suitable to let Summer guard the North of the Lonely River while Spring, Autumn, and Winter came to his side.","Winter did not say that he would definitely be able to obtain this top grade blessed land. He only said that he had the qualifications to fight for it. On one hand, it was due to Winter’s caution. On the other hand, it was also because Winter really felt the pressure.","In the past, Lin Yuan had thought of bringing Chu Ci out to see the world. Since the situation was so dangerous this time, Lin Yuan naturally could not bring Chu Ci along.","Zhao Chen only had ten spots in total. Although Zhao Chen said that he could get all the spots, it was not good to get too many.","“Big Brother Zhao, count me in. I’ll take a total of four spots. Let me know when you’re going to South City. We’ll meet there!”","After ending the communication, Lin Yuan continued to chat with Winter for a while before sending a message to Autumn through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. He asked Autumn to return to Sky City after settling the matters at hand.","Autumn had completely resolved the Bloodians’ matters and the Scarlet Territory was now completely under Lin Yuan’s control. The Bloodian queens were very willing for Lin Yuan to clean up the star pirates in the Scarlet Territory.","Eliminating the star pirates in the Scarlet Territory could greatly ensure the smooth flow of resources in the Scarlet Territory.","In the past, when the various Bloodian clans were established, some Bloodians would support the star pirates and let the experts of their families join the star pirates to cooperate with them. They even set up star pirates to plunder the caravans of other clans.","Now that Qin Yu was in charge of the Scarlet Territory, the other Bloodian queens, including Tina, were all Qin Yu’s assistants.","The Scarlet Territory had already entered a state of rapid development. Even without Lin Yuan’s instructions, Qin Yu was still mobilizing the Bloodians to help the hunting team eliminate the star pirates.","Autumn only needed to inform Qin Yu to mobilize more of the Bloodians’ forces to work with the hunting team.","Of course, Autumn would not forget Shiny who he had brought back to the Scarlet Territory. Autumn did not dare leave Shiny in the Scarlet Territory.","If there was any damage, Autumn would not be able to answer to Lin Yuan!","Autumn was extremely happy to be able to return to Lin Yuan’s side and follow him. He was eager to return home.","However, Autumn still did what he had to do without any sloppiness.","...","After ending the communication, Zhao Chen told the old man standing beside him, “Uncle Fu, choose a five-person team from the team I established. Let them travel with me a month later.”","Zhao Chen had thought that Lin Yuan would occupy all the seats after he said that he could give all the seats to him.","Unexpectedly, Lin Yuan did not do so. He only occupied four more spots for himself.","Zhao Chen did not understand Lin Yuan’s intentions. It was unknown if Lin Yuan was too confident and felt that the three of them were enough to fight for it or if there was some other reason. They had only arranged for such few people to go!","One more spot meant one more unit of power. Could it be that Lin Yuan was not prepared to fight for this top grade blessed land?","Even a Grade 6 Creator would be tempted by a top grade blessed land. Zhao Chen’s original intention was for Lin Yuan to tell his Grade 6 Creator about the appearance of this top grade blessed land and do him a favor. He wanted to let this Grade 6 Creator know about him.","While he was conversing with Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan did not pause or say that he wanted to ask for instructions. Instead, he made a decision.","This puzzled Zhao Chen.","Could it be that Lin Yuan actually had such power in his faction?","...","Lin Yuan was not flustered by the news that a top grade blessed land was about to open. He calmly focused on the evolution of his feys.","After thinking about it, Lin Yuan decided to nurture Blackie first.","Blackie had evolved from a Spirit-Siphon Goldfish to a Spirit-Claw Golden Dragon. It had suffered too much along the way. Every time it evolved, its body would basically have to face a reorganization.","After several reorganizations, an ordinary goldfish had evolved into a True Dragon.","This was not only because Lin Yuan had invested a lot of resources but Blackie had also put in a lot of effort.","Lin Yuan summoned Blackie. Blackie’s body was too huge so it was inconvenient for it to reveal its true form.","Blackie, who had revealed its true form, was not as big as the Floating Island Whale but it could already reach the level of an Island Whale embryo.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Blackie.","[Fey Name]: Spirit Clawed True Dragon","[Fey Species]: True dragon species/spirit dragon species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Water","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Spirit Injection]: Restore a huge amount of spiritual power at once and restore the lost spiritual power over a period of time.","[Spirit Roar]: Let out a roar to control the direction of the flow of spiritual power. It can choose to boost or drain the spiritual power of the targets in a given area.","[Endowment Spirit Rain]: The bloodline can be used to gather the clouds and release rain that contains spiritual power. The targets that makes contact with the rain will be able to replenish their lost spiritual power.","[Spirit Channel System]: The spirit qi in the body can be released into the environment. Through the spirit qi, a perfect and invisible channel system will be formed.The channel system will not only recover its own spiritual power but decrease the rate at which its spiritual power was diminished.","[Spirit Judgment Imprisonment]: Pick a target and judge the concentration of spirit qi within the target’s body. If the concentration of spirit qi in the target’s body is higher than its own, all of the spirit qi in its body will be emptied out. If the concentration of spirit qi in the target’s body is lower than its own, the target’s spiritual power will be imprisoned.","[Spirit Wrath]: The dragon aura will be unleashed. The dragon aura will burn off all of the spirit qi in the area and cause the surrounding environment to be empty of spiritual power.","[True Spirit Five Changes]: Release the dragon claws. Every dragon claw will become a clone. The clones will possess all the abilities of the main body. They will not disappear after being attacked and will share spiritual power with the main body.","[Spirit Dragon Guide]: Its bloodline energy will become a guide to boost and influence other dragon species lifeforms. The other dragon species lifeforms will thus evolve towards true dragon species/spirit dragon species. The effects will be magnified when used on a lifeform with the same genes and bloodline.","[Spirit Ability Blessing]: Its bloodline will boost the target which has spiritual power as its root energy. At the same time, the spirit qi capacity and spirit qi activity of multiple targets can be raised.","[True Dragon Spewing Breath]: Dragon breath imbued with its bloodline will be spewed at a target to cause damage to the target. The dragon breath’s attributes will follow that of the Spirit Clawed True Dragon’s pwn. (Water-type True Dragon Spewing Breath effect is obliteration).","Exclusive Skill:`","[Spirit Qi Imprint]: The spirit qi that is constantly released to the environment would be stored within the Spirit Qi Imprint instead. It can also drain a small amount of the spirit qi released from other dragon species feys within the surrounding area that does not exceed the fey’s grade and inject it into the Spirit Qi Imprint. It would be branded on the contractor’s body and the contractor could release spirit qi contained within the Spirit Qi Imprint.","[Spirit Essence Explosion]: Gather the spiritual power into a single point, and explode all the energy. The Spirit Essence Explosion can only be applied on places where there is contact with the Spirit Qi Imprint.","[Emperor Spirit Control]: An Emperor Spirit Inscription will be formed within the dragon claw. There can only be one Emperor Spirit Inscription in each claw. Each Emperor Spirit Inscription will allow the amount of spirit qi in the body to be multiplied.","[Calling All Spirits]: Its own spirit qi will be injected into the environment to trigger all the spirit qi in the surroundings to move towards it. If its spirit qi’s ability to control energy is stronger than that of other feys in the environment, the spirit qi in nearby target lifeforms can be extracted.","[Dragon Breath Support]: The energy in the dragon breath will be used to support a body part, either defensively or for combat. Alternatively, various streams of dragon breath can be compressed to launch a powerful attack at the target!","[True Dragon Concealing Spirit]: In an environment full of spirit qi, its own body will be fully fused with the spirit qi environment. Before the spirit qi in the environment disappears, it can hide its presence. In its hidden state, it can rapidly recover its depleted energy.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Turbid Spirit Cleansing]: Its breath will create a territory in which injured lifeforms will be cleansed by a special spirit qi. The lifeforms’ root energy will be transformed into spirit qi.","Lin Yuan was surprised when he saw Blackie’s data. Lin Yuan did not expect Blackie to be the fastest among all of his feys to advance to such a level. Lin Yuan had always thought that Shiny who had awakened utmost pure elements was walking in front of all the feys. It turned out that it was Blackie was walking in front of all the feys!"]},{"number":3092,"title":"Chapter 3092 Complete Transformation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3092 Complete Transformation!","It seemed that the reason why Blackie’s divine kingdom grade could rise so quickly was related to the Spirit Tide Ink Flood Dragons it controlled. Blackie’s Spirit Tide Ink Flood Dragons had been evolved by Lin Yuan to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. These Spirit Tide Ink Flood Dragons had greatly enhanced Blackie’s divine kingdom.","....","It had been a long time since Lin Yuan had used Blackie’s Spirit Qi Imprint.","During this period, Blackie had been accumulating spiritual power in the Spirit Qi Imprint. Lin Yuan found it hard to imagine what kind of damage he could cause the moment he activated Spirit Qi Imprint.","Even in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, this could still be considered a life-saving method for Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan would not use it unless it was absolutely necessary.","Blackie looked at Lin Yuan gently with its beautiful eyes and said softly, “Yuan, is it my turn to step into the Holy Spirit level now?","“When I step into the Holy Spirit level, I might consume a lot of your spirit qi crystals because I feel that my bloodline has improved on its original foundation after transforming into a Spirit Clawed True Dragon.","“I’m currently stuck at a bottleneck. I have a feeling that as long as I break through this bottleneck, my bloodline will be able to transform again and allow my life level to reach a higher level.”","Lin Yuan was pleasantly surprised.","Every time Blackie’s bloodline transformed, it would bring a brand new improvement to its strength. From Blackie’s current situation, Blackie’s bloodline allowed Blackie to have an extremely high level of control over the root energy and spirit qi of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","It could change the concentration of spirit qi in the environment and even extract the spirit qi in the target’s body.","In the beginning, when Blackie had just stepped into the Divine Kingdom level, Lin Yuan had not been very optimistic about its divine kingdom ability, Turbid Spirit Cleansing.","But now that he knew the situation in the abyssal world, the strategic significance of Turbid Spirit Cleansing had greatly increased.","It was not even inferior to the divine kingdom that Endless Summer had obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level.","The abyssal world was filled with abyssal energy and strange energy. These void energy and strange energy were extremely harmful to lifeforms who used spirit qi as their main source of energy. Once they entered the body, they would often cause the energy in the body to be chaotic and mixed, causing the body to collapse.","It could be said that most species and experts were unwilling to explore the abyssal world. It was the same even though they knew that there were a lot of resources in the abyssal world. This was because any species or expert who was already living a good life usually did not want to take the risk.","If the abyssal energy and strange energy in the abyssal world invaded the body, the damage caused to lifeforms would be extremely difficult to heal. Only those extremely valuable experts had the possibility of obtaining healing.","A potion like the Ruins Breaking Potion that could expel the abyssal energy in the body could only have the effect of removing the abyssal energy and strange energy in the body.","They could not guarantee that the abyssal energy and the strange energy would not change his spiritual qi roots.","However, Blackie could use Turbid Spirit Cleansing to create a spiritual power standpoint with its own aura. Those units that were corroded by the abyssal energy and strange energy would be cleansed by special units, allowing the spiritual roots that were changed by the abyssal energy and strange energy to return to normal.","If Lin Yuan was determined to explore the Sky Beyond the Clouds in the future, he could ensure the safety of his subordinates to the greatest extent.","“Apart from spirit qi crystals, Blackie, do you still need water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls?”","After all, Blackie was a water-type fey. Water elements and spirit qi were both Blackie’s root energy.","Blackie said firmly, “I want to use all the spirit qi crystals for this metamorphosis so that my bloodline will gain full affinity with the spirit qi. This will increase the difficulty of raising my bloodline and even affect the restructuring of my body. However, from a long-term perspective and the development of my bloodline, this is the most powerful method for me!”","Blackie had a gentle personality but he had always had a clear understanding of his own development.","Without Lin Yuan’s guidance, Blackie could determine the path that was most suitable for it.","“Alright, in that case, let’s begin now. I will provide you with a large number of spirit qi crystals. Try your best to absorb these spirit qi crystals. When your body is completely unable to absorb these spirit qi crystals, I will let the level Abyss Red Lotus inhabit your body with faith power to help you reach the Holy Spirit level. As for the rest, it will be entirely up to you!”","After saying that, Lin Yuan brought Blackie outside. Blackie wanted to forcefully change its affinity from water elements to spirit qi. This would cause Blackie’s body to reassemble.","In other words, during the process of evolution, Blackie had to return to its original form.","After Lin Yuan brought Blackie out, Sky Sea flapped its wings and greeted Blackie. Gray, on the other hand, surrounded Blackie with its cloud-like body.","At that moment, Blackie’s beautiful face turned extremely serious. After taking a deep breath, Blackie transformed into its true form. A black-gold dragon with an endless winding body appeared above Sky Sea.","Since Gray had already stepped into the Holy Spirit level, not only could it cover Sky Sea with its cloud-like body, but it could also easily cover Blackie. Otherwise, it would definitely cause a huge commotion in the faith country.","Apart from causing panic, the appearance of Blackie’s main body would also attract the worship of many living beings and make them contribute their faith to Blackie.","However, most of the members of the current faith country could contribute faith power steadily.","Due to certain circumstances, it was not a good choice to change one’s faith. This would cause the total amount of faith power to decrease subtly.","Lin Yuan asked Gray to use its cloud-form body to help him move the boxes of crystals from the Spirit Lock spatial zone. He asked Gray to feed the spirit qi crystals to Blackie bit by bit according to its absorption speed.","...","Five days passed quickly.","Blackie’s body had absorbed at least 30 billion spirit qi crystals. Blackie’s absorption of spirit qi crystals far exceeded Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Lin Yuan had completely realized the purchasing power of the 300-odd spirit qi crystals during his trip to Diverse City.","Thanks to the establishment of the faith country, tens of thousands of living beings broke through their grades.","Moreover, Morbius was constantly absorbing the World Grace in the Pure Land of Bliss. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have been able to produce enough spirit qi crystals for Blackie.","Blackie was only a pinnacle Divine Kingdom lifeform and had yet to step into the Holy Spirit level. Yet, its body could actually absorb so much pure spirit qi like a bottomless pit.","The originally calm spirit qi kept accumulating in Blackie’s body and became extremely violent.","This was the first time Lin Yuan had seen such a change in spirit qi. Astral winds formed from spirit qi flowed on Blackie’s body.","Finally, Blackie could no longer absorb the spirit qi crystal that Gray crushed. In its extreme state, the violent spirit qi in Blackie’s body actually showed signs of disintegrating Blackie’s huge body.","Lin Yuan immediately instructed the level Abyss Red Lotus to inject faith power into Blackie’s body.","The moment Blackie’s body was on the verge of collapse, it successfully reached the Holy Spirit level and began to transform.","At that moment, Lin Yuan seemed to be able to see the process of Blackie transforming from a Spirit-Gather Goldfish into a Spirit Tide Ink Flood Dragon.","All the black and golden scales on its body shattered, and dragon blood splattered into the sky.","Blackie struggled in the air and its body constantly broke and recombined, constantly consuming the spirit qi in Blackie’s body. Blackie’s body was constantly undergoing the process of life and death but the strength of its body would increase with every reconstruction.","Lin Yuan could not help but feel relieved.","Blackie had the bloodline of a True Dragon. It could be considered the highest level among the dragon species.","This bloodline change had caused such a huge change in Blackie’s body. Lin Yuan found it hard to imagine and was very curious about what kind of existence Blackie would transform into.","The commotion caused by Blackie’s evolution attracted the attention of many core members of Sky City, including the Moon Empress.","The elders of Sky City were not too surprised to know that Lin Yuan’s fey was evolving. After all, everyone was already used to this. This especially applied to the Moon Empress who had already seen how mystical her disciple was.","Lin Yuan’s journey could be said to be one that created history. But the Creators who joined Sky City later did not think so.","Zhong Zhiyu, Yi He, and many Grade 4 Creators looked at Blackie whose bloodline was constantly transforming and could not help but open their mouths wide, looking a little comical.","“A fey actually raised its bloodline to the level of True Dragon at World Emperor/Divine Kingdom! Not only that, but this fey is not as simple as a True Dragon. The spirit qi in its body is too dense. This spirit qi is actually changing its roots and improving its bloodline! Heavens, is this the benefit that Grade 6 Creator resources provide to feys?”","No one refuted these exclamations. Those Grade 4 Creators were not qualified to come into contact with the resources of a Grade 6 Creator. Those Grade 5 Creators also had very few chances.","Among these Grade 5 Creators, apart from Zhong Zhiyu who was an intermediate Class 5 Creator and had come into contact with Class 6 Creator resources, the other Class 5 Creators had never come into contact with them.","And that sigh just now was coming from Zhong Zhiyu.","In Zhong Zhiyu’s eyes, only Grade 6 Creator resources could do this. Moreover, it would definitely cost a lot of Grade 6 Creator resources.","Zhong Zhiyu did not know that the resources Lin Yuan had provided Blackie had always been in the Grade 5 Creator category. However, Lin Yuan had provided Blackie with enough Grade 5 Creator resources to an unimaginable extent.","Take Zhong Zhiyu for example. If Zhong Zhiyu were to refine 30 billion spirit qi crystals, it would be difficult for Zhong Zhiyu to even reach 1/10 of the number after working day and night.","Lin Yuan had basically fed the lives of ten Grade 5 Creators to Blackie.","Sometimes, quantitative changes could not only offset the difference in levels, but also transcend them.","If Lin Yuan’s nurturing of Genius and Chimey was a miracle in the history of life, it would not be impossible to replicate such a miracle. It was very likely that such a miracle would happen again.","However, Blackie’s transformation required 30 billion spirit qi crystals as the price. Even if someone wanted to replicate this miracle, even a Grade 6 Creator could not do it.","Zhong Zhiyu was initially skeptical about Lin Yuan’s offer of Grade 6 Creator resources. But now, Zhong Zhiyu no longer had any doubts.","Zhong Zhiyu and the other Grade 5 and 4 Creators had joined Lin Yuan not because they were tempted by the Class 6 Creator resources but because their lives had been in danger at that time. They had no choice but to join.","Many people did not have much hope for Lin Yuan’s Grade 6 Creator resources because these Creators assumed that all of his Grade 6 Creator resources had gone to the few experts under him.","However, after witnessing this scene, no one questioned whether Lin Yuan had Grade 6 Creator resources.","Zhong Zhiyu, Yi He, and the others were filled with motivation. These Creators were already certain that they were not just following Lin Yuan around. There was really a possibility of them advancing further. As long as they performed well, not only would they have a chance to obtain Grade 6 Creator resources but they might also be able to meet this Grade Creator and obtain the opportunity to receive guidance from him.","At that moment, Lin Yuan’s thoughts were all on Blackie. However, if Lin Yuan knew what Zhong Zhiyu and the others were thinking, not only would he not feel embarrassed, but he would also tell them with certainty that there was really a possibility of obtaining this opportunity.","Genius was very special in the main world, and Lin Yuan needed to hide it. However, in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan no longer had to hide Genius but the Hundred Questions Beasts.","In the environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds, humans became extremely rare. All species had the possibility of becoming Creators.","Genius was no longer that special. But once a species like the Hundred Questions Beasts, whose members all had the potential to become Creators, appeared in the eyes of others, it would definitely cause a shocking incident. Any powerful species would fight for the Hundred Questions Beasts.","After forming a contract with the Enlightenment Cicada, Genius who had obtained its comprehension ability, would sooner or later charge toward becoming a Grade 6 Creator.","Apart from having a sea of spiritual power, Genius also had Highest Access Tai that allowed it to seek answers from the world’s will.","When Genius became a Grade 6 Creator, it would naturally be able to guide the Grade 5 Creators and 4 Creators in Sky City.","Blackie’s body began to grow scales as it collapsed and reassembled again and again. At first, the scales that Blackie grew were as smooth and white as a mirror, with a texture like a pearl. It was no longer cold black-gold.","After growing scales, Blackie’s body was still collapsing and reforming. Every time it grew scales, there would be an additional color in the scales on Blackie’s body.","The moment the scales produced nine colors, Blackie’s aura suddenly rose and it successfully reached the Holy Spirit level to condense its own holy spirit.","Lin Yuan looked at the Holy Spirit Blackie and could not see any trace of its past self."]},{"number":3093,"title":"Chapter 3093: True Spirit Ancestral Dragon!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3093: True Spirit Ancestral Dragon!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","If there was anything similar to before, it woud be that the shape of the dragon horns was very similar. However, the dragon’s horns had grown more sinuous than before, exuding an even greater sense of dignity and majesty.","As its grade and bloodline evolved, Blackie’s control over spirit qi had clearly improved greatly.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check on Blackie.","[Fey Name]: True Spirit Ancestral Dragon","[Fey Species]: Ancestral Dragon/Spirit Dragon","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Water","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Small to Medium","Abilities:","[Spirit Injection]: Restore a huge amount of spiritual power at once and restore the lost spiritual power over a period of time.","[Spirit Roar]: Let out a roar to control the direction of the flow of spiritual power. It can choose to boost or drain the spiritual power of the targets in a given area.","[Endowment Spirit Rain]: The bloodline can be used to gather the clouds and release rain that contains spiritual power. The targets that makes contact with the rain will be able to replenish their lost spiritual power.","[Spirit Channel System]: The spirit qi in the body can be released into the environment. Through the spirit qi, a perfect and invisible channel system will be formed.The channel system will not only recover its own spiritual power but decrease the rate at which its spiritual power was diminished.","[Spirit Judgment Imprisonment]: Pick a target and judge the concentration of spirit qi within the target’s body. If the concentration of spirit qi in the target’s body is higher than its own, all of the spirit qi in its body will be emptied out. If the concentration of spirit qi in the target’s body is lower than its own, the target’s spiritual power will be imprisoned.","[Spirit Wrath]: The dragon aura will be unleashed. The dragon aura will burn off all of the spirit qi in the area and cause the surrounding environment to be empty of spiritual power.","[True Spirit Five Changes]: Release the dragon claws. Every dragon claw will become a clone. The clones will possess all the abilities of the main body. They will not disappear after being attacked and will share spiritual power with the main body.","[Spirit Dragon Guide]: Its bloodline energy will become a guide to boost and influence other dragon species lifeforms. The other dragon species lifeforms will thus evolve towards true dragon species/spirit dragon species. The effects will be magnified when used on a lifeform with the same genes and bloodline.","[Spirit Ability Blessing]: Its bloodline will boost the target which has spiritual power as its root energy. At the same time, the spirit qi capacity and spirit qi activity of multiple targets can be raised.","[True Dragon Spewing Breath]: Dragon breath imbued with its bloodline will be spewed at a target to cause damage to the target. The dragon breath’s attributes will follow that of the Spirit Clawed True Dragon’s own. (Water-type True Dragon Spewing Breath effect is obliteration).","Exclusive Skill:","[Spirit Qi Imprint]: The spirit qi that is constantly released to the environment would be stored within the Spirit Qi Imprint instead. It can also drain a small amount of the spirit qi released from other dragon species feys within the surrounding area that does not exceed the fey’s grade and inject it into the Spirit Qi Imprint. It would be branded on the contractor’s body and the contractor could release spirit qi contained within the Spirit Qi Imprint.","[Spirit Essence Explosion]: Gather the spiritual power into a single point, and explode all the energy. The Spirit Essence Explosion can only be applied on places where there is contact with the Spirit Qi Imprint.","[Emperor Spirit Control]: An Emperor Spirit Inscription will be formed within the dragon claw. There can only be one Emperor Spirit Inscription in each claw. Each Emperor Spirit Inscription will allow the amount of spirit qi in the body to be multiplied.","[Calling All Spirits]: Its own spirit qi will be injected into the environment to trigger all the spirit qi in the surroundings to move towards it. If its spirit qi’s ability to control energy is stronger than that of other feys in the environment, the spirit qi in nearby target lifeforms can be extracted.","[Dragon Breath Support]: The energy in the dragon breath will be used to support a body part, either defensively or for combat. Alternatively, various streams of dragon breath can be compressed to launch a powerful attack at the target!","[True Dragon Concealing Spirit]: In an environment full of spirit qi, its own body will be fully fused with the spirit qi environment. Before the spirit qi in the environment disappears, it can hide its presence. In its hidden state, it can rapidly recover its depleted energy.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Turbid Spirit Cleansing]: Its breath will create a territory in which injured lifeforms will be cleansed by a special spirit qi. The lifeforms’ root energy will be transformed into spirit qi.","[Spirit Seed Wall Defense]: Inject a spirit seed into the bodies of multiple hosts. The spirit seed will absorb the faith power in the target’s body and form a spirit sprout. The spirit sprout can prevent energy other than spirit qi from invading the target’s body and causing disturbance to the target. The spirit sprout can absorb enough faith power to grow into a spirit tree and increase the target’s absorption ability of spirit qi.","Lin Yuan discovered that Blackie’s name was no longer the Spirit Claw True Dragon, but it had become the True Spirit Ancestral Dragon. Its species changed from the original True Dragon to Ancestral Dragon.","The Ancestral Dragon was the ancestor of all dragon species and could command all dragon species.","After Blackie’s bloodline improved, to a certain extent, it had reached the pinnacle of the dragon-species fey bloodline.","Although it was still water-type fey, the spirit qi in Blackie’s body was much more advanced than water-type energy. 95% of the energy in its body was already formed by spirit qi. However, Blackie’s ability to control water was still much stronger than before with just 5% of the energy in its body!","Compared to species and type, Lin Yuan was more concerned about Spirit Seed Wall Defense, which Blackie had obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level.","Spirit Seed Wall Defense complemented Turbid Spirit Cleansing. However, while Turbid Spirit Cleansing focused on healing, Spirit Seed Wall Defense leaned toward defense.","If he were to explore the abyss, Lin Yuan would definitely send a large number of people. Without proper protection, people who explored the abyss were easily vulnerable to attacks from feys of the abyss, and their safety was compromised.","If everyone relied on Blackie to heal injuries using Turbid Spirit Cleansing, it simply wouldn’t be able to keep up with the demand. Moreover, it was not a good thing to be injured. Even if the abyssal energy and strange energy intrusions were removed from their body, there was still a possibility that their roots could be damaged.","Before embarking on the exploration, if Blackie could implant spirit seeds within the explorers’ bodies using Spirit Seed Wall Defense and allow the seeds to sprout, they could effectively prevent strange energies from entering the explorers’ bodies when they come under attack. Even if they encountered a powerful enemy that the spirit sprout couldn’t withstand, Blackie could still use the Spiritual Turbid Purification to help heal those who were injured.","While this divine kingdom ability was undoubtedly formidable, for many factions, its strength may appear somewhat redundant or inadequate. This was because the spirit sprout required the absorption of the faith power in the explorer’s body to grow, and faith power was an indispensable source of power for the feys of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","It was a huge burden for explorers to consume faith power to condense a spiritual seed just to explore the abyss. Moreover, according to Lin Yuan’s understanding, Blackie had consumed a lot of faith power by using Spirit Seed Wall Defense, to form spirit seeds in other divine kingdoms.","However, this was not a burden for Lin Yuan. The amount of faith power generated by faith country was simply immense. This faith power could help the spirit seeds grow and even facilitate the growth of spirit trees.","The spirit tree possessed the ability to assist the user in absorbing spirit qi, effectively enhancing the user’s rate of absorption. This essentially increased a fey’s potential at its core.","When Lin Yuan observed Blackie’s divine kingdom ability, the Creators, including Zhong Zhiyu, couldn’t help but exclaim.","It had actually directly awakened the Ancestral Dragon bloodline when it stepped into the Holy Spirit level. Even among those Domain Mountain class fellows in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds, very few had awakened the Ancestral Dragon bloodline.","The reason why the dragons valued bloodlines so much was that high-level dragons had absolute control over low-level dragons.","With this Ancestral Dragon, Lin Yuan could easily command other dragon species that had yet to reach the Ancestral Dragon bloodline.","When he encountered a dragon species without the Ancestral Dragon ruling, he could leverage Blackie’s bloodline to exert control over this species. Even if there was a True Dragon within the species, it would most likely be difficult to resist the control of the Ancestral Dragon.","There were more than 40 dragon species on the Species Ranking, but less than half of them were ruled by an Ancestral Dragon. Lin Yuan could reach the height of the Species Ranking just by relying on this dragon species.","A Grade 5 Creator, who was usually quiet and didn’t like to talk, turned to Yi He and said, “Yi He, I’ve always hated you. I hate you for setting me up to lose my freedom. But now, I have to thank you for letting me join this faction. Otherwise, I would never have the chance to come into contact with a Grade 6 Creator in my entire life!”","These words from the Grade 5 Creator truly spoke for the majority of Creators present there.","Who would willingly give up their freedom to be controlled by others if not under coercion? Even if the price of being controlled was the promise of endless lifespan.","Among the Creators present, there were indeed Creators who were facing a crisis that their lifespan was about to reach its end, but there were not many Creators whose lifespan was in danger. Now that they saw Blackie’s evolution, the Creators all changed their minds.","Upon hearing this, Yi He smiled.","Yi He could feel the hatred from his colleagues, but since everyone was part of the same faction, their resentment wasn’t overly apparent.","Although Yi He had become the deputy team leader of the Creation Master team, his colleagues did not show him much respect. This situation was quite frustrating for Yi He, but he did not regret his decision.","His initial motive was to elevate his status in Lin Yuan’s eyes. He achieved his goal, and he understood that achieving such objectives sometimes entailed certain losses.","However, the Creators he brought into Sky City had since changed their minds, shifting from resentment to gratitude toward him. This shift has significantly boosted his standing within the Creation Master team. Even if he was inferior to Zhong Zhiyu in terms of Creation Master abilities, his status was not much inferior to Zhong Zhiyu.","These Grade 4 and Grade 5 Creators stepped forward to congratulate Lin Yuan, who politely responded and then proceeded to say, “I’m going to be away for a period of time. During this period, all of you can help develop the entire area of North of the Lonely River.","“When I return, I will distribute Grade 6 Creator resources according to your contributions. When the time comes, you can look for Wen Yu to verify and record what you have done.","“Since everyone has already joined Sky City, I hope that everyone can prioritize the development of Sky City in the future and protect Sky City as a big family!”","Lin Yuan’s words sent these Creators into a frenzy.","What? As long as we develop Sky City well while Lord Lin Yuan is away, we will be able to obtain Grade 6 Creator resources?!","Everyone had thought that they would have to join Sky City for a long time before they could obtain the resources of a Grade 6 Creator. They did not expect that the opportunity would be presented to them at the moment.","In particular, the Grade 4 Creators were inexplicably excited. Previously, these Grade 4 Creators believed that only Grade 5 Creators who had joined Sky City were eligible to access resources from Grade 6 Creators, leaving no opportunity for themselves. Now, unexpectedly, this opportunity was also presented to them. In that case, they had to seize such a good opportunity no matter what!","There were indeed many high-end resources in the North of the Lonely River, but the entire North of the Lonely River was still in a state of chaos.","While the number of Creators joining Sky City was indeed considerable, for those from the North of the Silent River at this time, there was an abundance of creative space where everyone could find their own value without the need for contention.","At that moment, the only thought in the minds of the Creators present was that Lin Yuan must not return too soon. The longer Lin Yuan stayed away, the higher the value they could create. When Lin Yuan returned, they would have a greater chance of receiving more Grade 6 Creator resources.","Lin Yuan had already chosen the fey he wanted to contract, but now that he needed to travel to North of the Silent River, he didn’t have much time to contract and nurture this new fey.","Consequently, Lin Yuan decided to abandon the idea of contracting a new fey for now. Perhaps after returning from this top grade blessed land, Lin Yuan would have a new choice.","Lin Yuan would go to this top grade blessed land to fight for resources. Perhaps he could obtain a fey like the Business Flourishing Flower in it. The few feys he had obtained in Diverse City could not be compared to the Business Flourishing Flower.","However, it did not matter if he did not gain anything in the top-notch blessed land. If he really did not gain anything, Lin Yuan could still choose the feys he had obtained in Diverse City.","In short, after returning from this top grade blessed land at the intersection of the North and South Universe, Morbius would definitely be able to produce Grade 6 Creator resources.","Since these Creators had joined Sky City and become its members, Lin Yuan was not planning to be stingy with the Grade 6 Creator resources at his disposal. Instead, he intended to distribute these resources."]},{"number":3094,"title":"Chapter 3094: Flame Empowerment!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3094: Flame Empowerment!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","By extensively utilizing these Grade 6 Creator resources, Lin Yuan could significantly enhance the capabilities of the Grade 4 and 5 Creators, fostering their loyalty and willingness to truly work for Sky City.","Lin Yuan’s journey to the boundary between the North and South Universe to compete for the top-grade blessed land could potentially take a considerable amount of time.","When Lin Yuan found Wen Yu, he explained the task of documenting and recording the achievements of the Grade 4 and 5 Creators to her. He also informed Wen Yu that if his absence was prolonged, there was no need to wait for him to convene the Astronomical Parliament on time. Instead, he advised her to assist the members of the Astronomical Parliament when necessary.","Upon hearing his instructions, Wen Yu hurriedly nodded in agreement. If Lin Yuan left Sky City, Wen Yu would definitely help him take care of the house. However, she was unsure how long Lin Yuan would be gone this time. Wen Yu was worried about him and feared he might encounter trouble or an accident during his journey.","After explaining the situation to Wen Yu, Lin Yuan returned to his room and began nurturing the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom. This fire-type fungus-species fey, which had mutated because of the succubus bloodline, had become increasingly inconspicuous as its grade continued to increase. Unlike other feys that grow larger with evolution, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom became smaller. Once it reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom and evolved from World Emperor I to World Emperor X, Lin Yuan wouldn’t have been able to locate its main body with his naked eyes if he hadn’t been its contractor. This made it very difficult for Lin Yuan to perceive the changes in the mushroom during its evolution.","Among Lin Yuan’s feys, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom was very inconspicuous and rarely appeared. However, its ability to block any phenomenon in the sky and disturb world willpower when other feys sought answers proved its extraordinary nature.","Despite reaching the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom level, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom still had its own consciousness as a fungus-type fey. It was exceptionally happy to learn that Lin Yuan wanted to increase its grade, although it was an extremely introverted little fellow that wasn’t good at expressing its emotions.","Lin Yuan smiled and touched the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom hidden in his collar. He instructed it to channel the faith power provided by the Realm Abyss Red Lotus into the divine kingdom to help it give birth to holy spirits.","After instructing the mushroom, Lin Yuan began to help it transform. He could sense its aura fluctuating violently but could not perceive any visible changes in its appearance. Hence, he stopped paying attention to the mushroom, knowing that it would inform him immediately if it encountered any situation.","Lin Yuan then entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone to tidy up his resources and gain a comprehensive understanding of his wealth. While doing so, Ling Muzhuo contacted him.","Initially, Lin Yuan thought Ling Muzhuo wanted to propose a new resource trade. However, he was surprised to find that Ling Muzhuo’s reason for contacting him was the same as Zhao Chen’s. This surprised Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could understand why Zhao Chen approached him, as Zhao Chen wanted to leverage the resources obtained through trade to elevate his position within his species. Therefore, he would offer such a good opportunity to Lin Yuan.","Although Lin Yuan had known Ling Muzhuo before Zhao Chen, Ling Muzhuo had previously only traded resources with him and had never offered him such an excellent opportunity. Now, Ling Muzhuo’s willingness to provide such an opportunity was likely because he had become aware of Lin Yuan’s significant influence in Diverse City.","Lin Yuan’s relationships with both Fortune Treasure Palace and Zhao Chen were primarily based on mutual interests rather than deep personal bonds. Since their connection was driven by interests, Lin Yuan didn’t mind Ling Muzhuo’s ulterior motives for pleasing him and simply agreed to move forward with Zhao Chen.","Lin Yuan naturally couldn’t move forward with Ling Muzhuo. It wasn’t a secret that Lin Yuan had used Zhao Chen’s connections to participate in the competition for this top-grade blessed land. If Fortune Treasure Palace were to participate in the competition, they would surely be aware of it. Therefore, Lin Yuan didn’t bother hiding it from Ling Muzhuo and honestly told him the truth.","“Brother Ling, I’ve already heard about this top-grade blessed land beforehand. I’m preparing to head to South Face City to see if I can gain anything. It’s fine if I haven’t heard of such an opportunity, but how can I not explore it after hearing about it? It seems like you must be harboring the same thoughts!”","On the one hand, Ling Muzhuo approached Lin Yuan partly to do him a favor and keep him in sync with the information.","On the other hand, he also wanted to use Lin Yuan’s power to fight for the resources in the top-grade blessed land. Even a powerful faction like Fortune Treasure Palace, which spanned across four universes, didn’t dare to have absolute certainty in securing this top-grade blessed land.","Since Lin Yuan had already received the information and made it clear that he wouldn’t go with Fortune Treasure Palace, Ling Muzhuo felt somewhat depressed. It was rumored that Lin Yuan had become very close to Diverse City’s City Lord, Zhao Chen. He had most likely heard the news from Zhao Chen.","Ling Muzhuo reminded Lin Yuan appropriately, “Brother Lin, since you intend to participate in the fight for this top-grade blessed land, I must remind you that the fight is destined to be filled with danger. There are some things that require careful consideration. Don’t let others use you as a pawn just because you have enough power at your disposal.","“If you need any help or cooperation when we reach South Face City, inform me immediately. As long as you make the request, I will certainly not refuse!”","Ling Muzhuo paused and asked, “Brother Lin, do you need information about the various factions? Fortune Treasure Palace also engages in selling intelligence. If you need information, I will provide you with all the intelligence I have. If you purchase information from other factions, their prices will surely not be lower!”","Despite not successfully inviting Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo remained hopeful and still wished that Lin Yuan would owe him a favor.","Lin Yuan was grateful that Ling Muzhuo was willing to provide him with information for free. However, he was going with Zhao Chen this time. Zhao Chen’s faction had a total of ten spots, and Lin Yuan occupied three of them. In fact, more spots were in Zhao Chen’s hands.","Zhao Chen’s faction could be considered a native faction at the boundary between the North and South Universe, so they must have a thorough understanding of the local factions. Even when it came to external factions, they were likely able to thoroughly investigate the situation. Therefore, there was no need for Lin Yuan to owe Ling Muzhuo a favor.","“Brother Ling, to be honest, I’m going to this top-grade blessed land with the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen. Brother Zhao should have the ability to obtain information. If there’s anything I need help with, I won’t hesitate to ask for your assistance!”","Upon hearing this, Ling Muzhuo thought that indeed it was Zhao Chen who approached Lin Yuan. The speed at which Zhao Chen’s faction received information was likely similar to his own. Ling Muzhuo reflected that he was only a step slower than Zhao Chen in this instance, which he found quite regrettable.","Ling Muzhuo laughed dryly. “Brother Lin, just don’t stand on ceremony with me; that’s all I ask!”","After exchanging a few pleasantries, Ling Muzhuo ended the communication. Turning to Wan Ying, who was standing beside him, he remarked, “Lin Yuan chose to explore the resources of this top-grade blessed land with Zhao Chen. Their relationship seems stronger than you guessed. This blessed land presents an opportunity for our Fortune Treasure Palace. Come with me. I’ve already arranged for the assessment of your two subordinates. They can be dispatched within a year.”","Hearing Ling Muzhuo’s words, Wan Ying was overjoyed, but also surprised by the closeness between Lin Yuan and Zhao Chen.","Wan Ying was certain that Lin Yuan had only known Zhao Chen for a short time, yet their relationship had become remarkably close so quickly. It was unclear what kind of agreement or cooperation they had secretly established.","Aside from the conversation with Ling Muzhuo, nothing notable had occurred in the past few days.","The Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom had successfully advanced to the Holy Spirit level recently.","[Fey Name]: Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom","[Fey Species]: Parasitic fungus species/flaming fungus species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Fire","Fey quality: Holy Spirit","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Seeping Flames]: The flames will seep into the target’s mind, spirit, and soul through the heart and brain. The spirit and soul will begin to burn. If the flames begin to die out, it can absorb the energy from the heart and brain to reignite itself.","[Body-Penetrating Flames]: When burning the mind, spirit, and soul, the flames will also burn the body. The damage will be translated from the elemental form to the physical. Before the fire in its mind, spirit, and soul is extinguished, the flames afflicting the body will continue to cause harm.","[Thought-Separating Flames]: When burning the target’s mind, spirit, and soul, if the target’s mind, spirit, and soul has any thoughts or feeling linked to another lifeform, the thoughts would become a guide that allow the flames to extend.","[Strengthened Spores]: The fungi produced will be strengthened and be able to absorb and take control of more energy. The fungi will be deeply rooted in the target’s soul and be more difficult to remove.","[Truth Colony]: When questioning a target, the precise answers given will grow a truth colony. When the colony absorbs energy, it will grow into a truth mushroom. When the truth mushroom is fed to a target, the target will be forced to tell the truth, making it easier to obtain true answers to questions.","[False Colony]: When questioning a target, every lie told by the target will produce a false colony. When the false colony absorbs energy, it will grow into a false mushroom. When the false mushroom is fed to a target, the target will be unable to break while questioning, preventing them from answering questions.","[Interrogation Soul Flames]: After confirming that the target has made more than three false statements, the target can be asked a question and the soul with fungi rooted in it will be sacrificed. The target will have to tell the truth through the voiced spirit form.","[Truth and Lie Temptation]: Each time truth and lie are discerned, it can store the sincerity and falseness. The sincerity can be used to boost its soul and defend it against temptation abilities. The falseness can be used to boost its temptation abilities and strengthen its ability to tempt targets.","[Truth Soil]: The spores will change the soil beneath it and imbue it with truth power. When other plant-type feys are planted in this soil imbued with truth power, they will absorb the energy within and produce truth fruits.","[False Soil]: The spores will change the soil beneath it and imbue it with false power. When other plant-type feys are planted in this soil imbued with false power, they will absorb the energy within and produce false fruits.","Exclusive Skill:","[Honesty Reflects the Heart]: The spores will host themselves deep within the target’s spirit and soul and determine the genuinity of the target’s exterior.","[Crumbled Parasitic Cycle]: The bacterial strain will be sacrificed. After being sacrificed, the energy around it will crumble, along with other energy-containing entities.","[Heart Mushroom Sky Questioning]: When a judgment cannot be made on an issue, one can be staked to question the sky and ask for a positive solution.","[Heart Mushroom Disrupts Heaven]: When other lifeforms use various methods to ask the world wills for answers, it can use its energy to disrupt the world wills and prevent the world wills from answering other lifeforms. Alternatively, it can incite the world wills to give wrong answers.","[Heavenly Will Shield]: It will trigger heavenly will and direct it towards a target. The heavenly will will be used to shield a target’s aura and prevent it from being detected.","[Endless Curse Generation]: When the main body is destroyed, it can be reincarnated through any spore. The imprint in the spore will be used to recover its memories from before its death. At the point of its death, it will place a curse on a target. When the truth is told, the curse will lower the target’s lifespan. But when a lie is told, it will reduce the target’s soul energy.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Reverse Colony]: Truth and false power will join together to create a special colony. Once the colony is fully formed, it will turn into a reverse spirit mushroom. The reverse spirit mushroom will need to absorb spirit qi in order to grow. The purer the spirit qi absorbed, the better the effects of the reverse spirit mushroom. When being interrogated, consuming the reverse spirit mushroom will cause the opposite effect to take place during the interrogation.","[Flame Empowerment]: Through faith power or special fungi, flames can be bred in the divine kingdom. The flames burning in the divine kingdom can help one strengthen all their abilities and exclusive skills. After enhancing their abilities and exclusive skills, the flames in your divine","kingdom will be consumed."]},{"number":3095,"title":"Chapter 3095: Disloyalty!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3095: Disloyalty!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom was a functional fey. Although it had a certain combat ability, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s combat ability targeted feys that were weaker than it. The Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom would not be able to fight against feys of the same level.","Before Sky City made large-scale contact with the other factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s ability to differentiate between real and fake was basically useless.","However, when Sky City came into contact with the various factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds in the future, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s ability to differentiate between real and fake would come in handy.","The Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom obtained Flame Enhancement after stepping into the Holy Spirit level. It used the flames of faith power to enhance all its abilities and exclusive skills. Compared to obtaining a brand new ability, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom was the best choice for Lin Yuan to strengthen his current ability!","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s new divine kingdom ability.","Upon sensing Lin Yuan’s satisfied expression, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom was very happy.","After strengthening the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom, Lin Yuan was about to set off for South Face City. Before leaving, Lin Yuan deliberately gave instructions to the other core members of Sky City.","The Moon Empress was used to Lin Yuan going out often, but she still deliberately reminded him.","With the help of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to oversee most of the matters in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Moon Empress had become significantly more proficient in managing Sky City than before!","Wen Yu recalled that Su Yiren had been looking for her recently because of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory. Wen Yu felt that making a decision on this matter was beyond her authority.","Before Lin Yuan left, Wen Yu called Su Yiren over and told her to talk to Lin Yuan about it. They were all family, so it was extremely convenient for them to talk without outsiders around.","Even with the help of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, Su Yiren and Luo Lan were still in charge of managing Sky City.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons had indeed submitted to Sky City and their attitude toward submission had been relatively favorable. However, although they submitted, the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons still followed the orders they issued.","These Crimson Heaven Falcons had indeed followed Wen Yu’s instructions and joined the faith country. However, after joining the faith country, they acted domineeringly and often caused trouble. If that was all, Su Yiren would have tolerated it. After all, the Crimson Heaven Falcons were more powerful overall and looked down on the exiled members of species.","However, recently, there had been a conflict between the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons and the managing demon insect species, which had caused an extremely bad impact.","As the manager of the faith country, Su Yiren wanted to deal with the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcon. However, the Crimson Heaven Falcons actually helped dependent species plead for mercy which made things very difficult for Su Yiren.","She was aware that Lin Yuan valued the Crimson Heaven Falcons, which was indeed the strongest native faction in the North of the Lonely River. It made the situation become more complex.","However, the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ attitude made Su Yiren feel that they were not easy to manage. If this went on for a long time, there would inevitably be chaos!","The Crimson Heaven Falcons’ attitude toward handling matters had already vaguely revealed this.","Su Yiren believed that if a faction couldn’t be completely obedient, it would be better to destroy it. At the very least, the Crimson Heaven Falcons should understand who held power in North of the Lonely River.","Su Yiren knew Lin Yuan quite well and was confident that he would take action to resolve the situation once he became aware of it.","When Su Yiren saw Lin Yuan, she explained the situation to Lin Yuan without any falsehood, “Young Master, the Crimson Heaven Falcons are becoming more and more arrogant because of their strength. They do have enough respect for the core members of Sky City, but apart from core members like us, they have nothing to fear. A few species that had already been incorporated into the faith country were annihilated by the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“Although the Crimson Heaven Falcons did not participate directly, their higher-ups must have participated directly in this matter. This incident is affecting mine and Luo Lan’s credibility. I think we should take action to deal with the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Otherwise, they will become increasingly lawless under the protection of the Crimson Heaven Falcons!”","Su Yiren gritted her teeth as she spoke. The anger in her heart had reached its peak. Back in the main world, Su Yiren was born at the pinnacle of the Seven States of Darkness. Despite enduring a prolonged period of fleeing under the oppression of Seventh Page War, she still possessed the mentality of a superior at heart. As a superior, her dignity and authority were not to be trampled upon in the slightest.","The actions of the Crimson Heaven Falcons could be lightly described as leveraging their strength to avoid being disciplined for their lax behavior. More seriously, their actions were akin to trampling on the dignity of Su Yiren and Luo Lan as authorities.","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan’s brow furrowed, followed by a smirk creeping onto his face.","Lin Yuan had annihilated hundreds of factions in Coiling Dragon Mountain and made even more factions submit to him. Many species had already migrated to North of the Lonely River, which caused the desolate place to become a little crowded.","Lin Yuan had no intention of eliminating any species, yet there were actually species causing trouble in North of the Lonely River. Furthermore, the Spinning Wings White Falcons, who were promised generous treatment by Lin Yuan, were also protecting these species.","Previously, those dependent species were completely under the control of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, which held the power to decide their fate. How could these species dare to defy the wishes of the Crimson Heaven Falcons?","Lin Yuan had no doubts that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were challenging Sky City’s authority.","“As you said, it seems we should do more than just warn the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Inform the leader of the Crimson Heaven Falcons to gather those troublemakers and immediately head to the temple built outside the territory of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. I’ll only give him an hour. If he’s late, they’ll bear the consequences!”","Lin Yuan said in all seriousness, “Yiren, you’ve been in power before. You should know very well what the Crimson Heaven Falcons are thinking. The next time you encounter such a thing, just look for Summer and let her use martial force to resolve it!”","Lin Yuan would never tolerate such things, especially since he was just about to leave.","Lin Yuan was a little worried about the safety of Sky City and the stability of the faith country. He clearly remembered the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ attitude when they submitted to Lin Yuan.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons assured that they would manage their dependent species well, so Lin Yuan decided to continue entrusting the command of the dependent species.","It hadn’t been long since the Crimson Heaven Falcons submitted to him. It was only a few months at most. In just a few months, the Crimson Heaven Falcons had already shown such cunning schemes.","While Lin Yuan used the Faith Tree to control the faith of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, there was a fundamental difference between controlling a species through the Faith Tree and controlling their life and death.","Lin Yuan felt that he shouldn’t blame the Crimson Heaven Falcons for being too audacious, but rather blame himself for being too lenient with them in the past. Otherwise, the Crimson Heaven Falcons wouldn’t have dared to be so bold!","When Su Yiren heard Lin Yuan’s words, she was delighted. Compared to Lin Yuan’s gentleness, Su Yiren preferred the decisive Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, I’ll remember this. I also know how to deal with any disobedient species in the future. I’ll send someone to inform the Crimson Heaven Falcons and then head to the temple to wait for your arrival!”","After Su Yiren left, Wen Yu could not help but say, “Young Master, I also think that the Crimson Heaven Falcons should be dealt with. However, our approach to dealing with them should be more subtle, rather than openly confronting them in front of everyone.”","Lin Yuan shook his head at Wen Yu. “Wen Yu, many of your management ideas are more applicable to the main world and may not be entirely suitable for the Sky Beyond the Clouds. You need to adjust your perspective.","“Being too merciful in the Sky Beyond the Clouds only makes people feel that you’re weak, and the attitude of the Crimson Heaven Falcons is the best example of this.","“There has always been a drawback of faith countries. If it develops too quickly, there will inevitably be problems internally. Once an unstable factor appears and we can’t immediately have them under control, the consequences can very likely cause all our previous efforts to be in vain.","“When I come back this time, I’ll arrange for Winter to bring you and Brother Liu out to train for a period and see the real environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","Lin Yuan’s thoughts had changed because he had experienced and gained insights of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. If Lin Yuan had not gone out to train, he would not have changed his mindset so quickly.","After all, when Wen Yu was in the main world, she was in the Radiance Federation and not those small federations with excellent but turbulent environments. Lin Yuan believed that both Wen Yu and Liu Jie would change their minds after seeing the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Upon hearing this, Wen Yu nodded seriously and took Lin Yuan’s words to heart. She decided to take a good look at how Lin Yuan would handle this matter. Then, she would know what she should do","according to Lin Yuan’s way of handling things.","Wen Yu had always been someone who was willing to humbly accept her own problems, especially since this issue was personally raised by Lin Yuan.","After receiving the news, the leader of the Crimson Heaven Falcons did not immediately mobilize the manpower of his dependent species. Instead, he convened an internal meeting, which made the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcon, Chi Zhentian, extremely anxious.","“Big Brother, what we should do now is to mobilize our dependent species to wait in the temple as soon as possible, and not hold this so-called internal meeting here. Defying Lord Lin Yuan’s orders in such a manner will surely doom the Crimson Heaven Falcons to irreversible destruction!”","Chi Qingtian looked at the anxious Chi Zhentian and said coldly, “I think you’ve been scared out of your wits by Sky City. The Crimson Heaven Falcons are the rulers of the North of the Lonely River. Now that the Crimson Heaven Falcons have pledged allegiance to Sky City, Sky City has to give us some respect . We are only protecting our dependent species who had long pledged allegiance to Crimson Heaven Falcons. Even if Sky City is domineering, can they really hold us accountable for","that!?","“It’s all because of you that our Crimson Heaven Falcons has ended up in this situation. If not for you, why would our faith be controlled!? Now that you’re no longer suitable to manage the family matters, just go to the side and wait for the results of our discussion. From now on, everything in the species will be managed by me alone.”","Chi Zhentian laughed bitterly when he heard that. He understood the reason for such a situation. The reason for this situation was actually quite simple. His elder brother had achieved a breakthrough using a natural treasure that he had awaited for thousands of years.","However, it seemed his elder brother had forgotten that the natural treasure was something Lin Yuan hadn’t even paid attention to and intentionally left in the possession of the Crimson Heaven Falcons at the time. Otherwise, how could his elder brother have the chance to break through his strength as he wished!? If Lin Yuan had believed that this treasure was useful, how could he have left it in the Crimson Heaven Falcons?","His elder brother had never seen the Sky City experts display their strength with his own eyes, so he did not know how terrifying their auras were. Back then, the other party had relied on his aura to firmly suppress him, making him not even dare to have the thought of resisting.","Even though Chi Qingtian had increased his strength, the aura he emitted was still far inferior compared to the experts who had followed Lin Yuan previously!","However, most of the members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons blamed him and Chi Zhentian knew this very well. Even if Chi Zhentian had the intention to bring his members to the temple, he did not have the ability.","Just as Chi Zhentian was thinking about what to do, Chi Jue and Chi Ling found him, “Second Elder, it looks like this internal meeting will definitely be held. Once this meeting is held, it will delay our departure to the temple.","“You’ve seen Sky City’s methods. Chi Ling and I are looking for you to ask if you want to go to the temple with us now? It’s up to the other members of the species whether they go to the temple or not. As for dealing with Sky City, both Chi Ling and I believe we should show the appropriate attitude.","“At the very least, our attitude shows that we do not intend to become enemies with Sky City. The leader clearly wants to go against Sky City. Chi Ling and I can see that. I’m sure you can see more clearly than the two of us!”","Chi Zhentian had never liked Chi Jue, but he felt that what Chi Jue said made sense. However, as the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, going to the temple regardless of the consequences would indeed show loyalty to Sky City. But then, how would he maintain his standing within the species afterward?","Originally, Chi Ling had a close relationship with Chi Jue. It was only after Chi Jue was denounced and ostracized from the species that Chi Ling’s interactions with him diminished.","In Chi Ling’s heart, Chi Jue had always been very smart. After thinking about it, Chi Ling finally felt that going to the temple was the right choice.","Chi Ling remembered the fear of having his life controlled when Sky City previously took action against the Crimson Heaven Falcon. They were clearly showing intent to kill."]},{"number":3096,"title":"Chapter 3096: The Chaotic South Face City!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3096: The Chaotic South Face City!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","This time, Sky City seemed intent on coming to exact punishment. If they did not reach the temple at the specified time, Chi Ling felt that he would lose his life.","Chi Ling had always believed that his senses were very accurate. Rather than following the family clan’s directives, Chi Ling preferred to follow his own instincts.","Chi Ling persuaded, “The Second Elder has issued an order to the entire species, but only core members like us know about Lord Lin Yuan’s request. The leader has never met Lord Lin Yuan, so he doesn’t know the power he wields. Explaining it to him is futile. If you have such thoughts, then Chi Jue and I will head to the temple first.","“Second Elder, I have a feeling that if we don’t go to the temple, it will definitely cause a huge commotion. We seem to be free now, but everything is under Sky City’s control. Is this not clear to you, even if the Leader doesn’t understand it?”","Upon hearing Chi Ling’s words, Chi Zhentian’s heart wavered even more.","At that moment, Chi Zhentian heard Chi Ling continue, “Second Elder, I know that some of my past actions have caused you to be dissatisfied with me, but the choices I made were indeed what I thought were right at the time. That’s why I have never apologized to you. Just like I now believe that you are more suited to lead our Crimson Heaven Falcons forward!","“Sky City needs obedient managers, but the manager of the Crimson Heaven Falcons can’t meet Sky City’s requirements.","“I’ve already warned the leader in advance, but he doesn’t take my words seriously at all. He’s still stubborn. You have always felt that I do not prioritize the interests of the Crimson Heaven Falcons in my actions.","“However, if I truly disregarded the species’ interests entirely, I would not be discussing this with you now. I want you to lead the development of the Crimson Heaven Falcons and guide it to rise!","“If I report what the Crimson Heaven Falcons are planning to Sky City, I think Sky City will be willing to give me a managerial position. However, I didn’t do that as I also don’t want to witness the Crimson Heaven Falcons embark on a path of no return!”","At this point, Chi Jue calculated the time. If he really couldn’t persuade Chi Zhentian, Chi Ling could only bring Chi Jue along.","Chi Zhentian took a deep breath and looked in the direction of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’s meeting hall before making his decision, “Alright, I’ll go to the temple with you. I hope the leader’s decision won’t cause the Crimson Heaven Falcons to fall into eternal damnation!”","Upon hearing this, a mocking expression appeared on Chi Jue’s face, “Second Elder, I have always regarded you as the wisest advisor to the leader. When I say this, I have no intention of flattering you.","“What I mean is, if you were in charge of Sky City, how would you deal with the disobedient dependent species? I believe your approach would probably be the same as Sky City’s last resort.”","As soon as Chi Zhentian imagined it, he couldn’t help but shiver, and then a look of struggle appeared on his face.","Chi Zhentian then said to Chi Jue and Chi Ling in a serious tone, “Before going to the temple, I have to return to the meeting hall and bring as many people as possible to Sky City’s temple. At the very least, we must ensure that our Crimson Heaven Falcons retain enough of a spark to survive!”","Upon hearing this, Chi Jue felt a great deal of admiration for Chi Zhentian, but he immediately stated that he would not accompany Chi Zhentian in this endeavor.","Chi Ling was about to agree when Chi Jue stopped him. “Second Elder, if your current ability is on par with the leader, I’m willing to help. However, you don’t have that ability now.","“If the leader finds out that while he’s gathering and mobilizing all members of the species, you’re planning to go to the temple, do you think he’ll still allow you to go? If we go with you to do this, you might have a chance to leave, but Chi Ling and I don’t have the ability to resist.","“Do you believe that besides the three of us, there are definitely other members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons who will go to the temple?","“Chi Ling and I have no choice but to take care of ourselves first. I hope you can forgive us. Whether or not you want to return to the meeting hall to be a savior, Chi Ling and I will not interfere with you. So please don’t interfere with us.”","After saying that, Chi Jue bowed to Chi Zhentian and returned to his original form before flying toward the temple.","Chi Ling glanced at Chi Zhentian and then at the direction Chi Jue had left in. Then, he bowed to Chi Zhentian as if he was apologizing and left to chase after Chi Jue.","Lin Yuan brought Autumn to the temple at exactly one hour and saw that there were only eight members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons inside. These eight individuals happened to be the first few members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons who initially pledged allegiance to Sky City.","Lin Yuan’s smile grew increasingly colder.","At that moment, a long-haired female Crimson Heaven Falcon reported, “Lord, the leader is having an internal meeting. Most of the members are in the meeting room. I believe that following your orders is far more important than attending an internal meeting, so I came to the temple first. Among these people, I’m the first to arrive!”","Even though this long-haired female Crimson Heaven Falcon was just a minor figure within the species, even the smallest figure knew to seize opportunities for themselves.","Lin Yuan ignored her and asked Chi Zhentian coldly when he saw him in the temple, “Are the Crimson Heaven Falcons preparing to rebel against Sky City? Even after being given an hour’s notice in advance, they remained indifferent. Chi Zhentian, you’re the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Shouldn’t you give me an explanation?”","Chi Zhentian lowered his head and said, “Lord Lin Yuan, the one who truly holds power in the Crimson Heaven Falcons is the leader. My authority has been taken over by the leader. If I were in charge of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, I could guarantee that every living member of the species would be present at the temple without a single one missing.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan snorted coldly. “Since the Crimson Heaven Falcons are no longer under Sky City’s leadership, there’s no point in keeping them alive. Your Crimson Heaven Falcons are a native of North of the Lonely River.","“In the beginning, you coveted our faith country and wanted to attack it. Not only did I not blame you, but after the Crimson Heaven Falcons pledged allegiance to me, I even let you keep the treasure you’ve been guarding all along and did not seize the opportunity from your species. Is this how your species repays me?","“In that case, I think there’s no need for your Crimson Heaven Falcons to continue existing! Autumn, go and destroy the Crimson Heaven Falcons. They are now reduced to just a few of you and hardly constitute a species anymore. Join the Spinning Wings White Falcons as members of their species!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Bai Yunzong, who had brought the Spinning Wings White Falcons to the temple, looked excited.","Lin Yuan’s words not only strengthened the power of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, but it also made the Spinning Wings White Falcons, which had always been a dependent species, to completely step on the heads of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Out of over 5,000 dependent species of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, only fewer than 80 had come to wait outside the temple alongside the members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Autumn said with a cold expression, “Young Master, you were too kind to them previously, making them forget their identities. When we deal with the Crimson Heaven Falcons later, I will also take care of their dependent species who did not show up.","“As the species you brought back from the Coiling Dragon Mountain have arrived at North of the Lonely River, this area has become increasingly crowded. It’s time to eliminate some disobedient species before you leave to avoid the unstable factors.”","After speaking, Autumn didn’t leave Lin Yuan’s side. Instead, he shook his hand and scattered a handful of fallen leaves. These leaves flew into the distance with Autumn’s movement.","Chi Zhentian was so frightened that he knelt on the ground and hurriedly pleaded with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan looked at Chi Zhentian prostrating on the ground and asked calmly, “Back then, when you ruled North of the Lonely River, there should be many species pleading with you, right? Did you give them a chance?","“You know very well how the Crimson Heaven Falcons joined under the banner of Sky City. Instead of feeling grateful, they have become rebellious. In the future, the few of you should focus on developing within the Spinning Wings White Falcons. If I find out that any of you caused trouble in the Spinning Wings White Falcons, I won’t be so benevolent as to spare your bloodline!”","Lin Yuan’s words left no room for rebuttal, causing Chi Zhentian’s body to immediately collapse to the ground. In contrast, Chi Jue remained calm and showed no sign of feeling that Lin Yuan’s destruction of the Crimson Heaven Falcons was inappropriate in any way.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons’ attempt to rebel against the rule of Sky City was an act that could shake the foundations of Sky City. If such behavior could be forgiven, how could Sky City manage the vast North of the Lonely River?","After issuing the order, Lin Yuan turned to Su Yiren and said, “Yiren, you can arrange for some powerful species to take over the territories of the Crimson Heaven Falcons for development. Although this area has not been transformed by blessed lands and is somewhat barren, its large size can accommodate many species.”","It was rare for Su Yiren to see Lin Yuan so decisive. Lin Yuan’s decisiveness made Su Yiren feel that he had become even more charming.","On the other hand, Wen Yu’s expression was solemn. Having witnessed Autumn’s methods many times before, Wen Yu knew that when Autumn waved his hand and scattered those few leaves, most of the Crimson Heaven Falcons and their absent dependent species were likely already completely annihilated.","However, Wen Yu did not find Lin Yuan’s actions cruel at all. The Crimson Heaven Falcons’s attacks on Sky City had inflicted lasting damage on the faith country, which remained vivid in her memory to this day.","However, Wen Yu needed some time to change her mindset. Wen Yu had a strong adaptability and learning ability. At the same time, she was looking forward to the training that Lin Yuan would arrange for her and Liu Jie.","After dealing with this matter, Lin Yuan had Spring, Autumn, and Winter resolve the other unstable factors in the faith country.","After dealing with all these unstable factors, Lin Yuan brought Spring, Autumn, and Winter to South Face City.","Lin Yuan liked to plan ahead and ensured there was ample time along the way. When he encountered the star pirates, Lin Yuan made a deliberate effort to eliminate them.","The closer he got to South Face City, the more Lin Yuan could sense the gathering of various factions. At this time, tens of thousands of factions were rushing to South Face City and it was most likely related to the top grade blessed land that had suddenly appeared.","However, the vast majority of these factions were not particularly strong. They struggled even to contend for a mid-grade blessed land, let alone have any chance of seizing the treasures produced by this top grade blessed land.","With many factions gathered in South Face City, the entire city was in chaos.","The majority of these factions were akin to those that gathered outside the Coiling Dragon Mountain when the mid-tier blessed land appeared. They were prepared to take advantage of the chaos and engage in underhanded dealings to profit at the expense of other factions!","These weak factions were constantly playing the role of hunters and prey. Regardless of which top factions ultimately owned this top grade blessed land, many factions would suffer fatalities. At the same time, many factions would seize this opportunity to rise up.","Before they reached South Face City, Lin Yuan and his group had already been targeted by a few factions with a large number of people.","Spring, Autumn, and Winter followed beside Lin Yuan and did not reveal any aura. They appeared to be ordinary beings without any apparent power.","Autumn had gotten rid of all the factions that wanted to rob Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had also obtained a lot of information through the intelligent Connected Tails and the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s interrogation ability.","These relatively weaker factions did not have the capability for long-distance travel, so they were inherently located near South Face City. They could help Lin Yuan gain some understanding of South Face City.","Located at the border between the East and the South Universe, South Face City’s most noteworthy aspect was its martial force.","South Face City itself did not produce any resources, but the business in the city was exceptionally developed. Apart from the supplies produced in South Universe, they also sold captives seized on the battlefield.","Most of these captives were members of the factions in the South Universe, but there were also some members of the factions from the East Universe who were sold as captives in the South Universe.","The star pirates liked places with weak management like South Face City the most.","The City Lord of South Face City spent all his time on expanding the combat power system and did not care about the lives of the weak factions and species at all. He even collaborated with the star pirates and used them as a means to achieve his own ends.","After learning about this, Lin Yuan’s impression of the City Lord of South Face City had reached an extremely low point.","Summer said at the side, “Young Master, the environment in South Face City has improved a lot compared to before. Previously, the environment was undoubtedly much more chaotic.","“In a large city located at the border between universes, it’s impossible to achieve complete stability under the rule of the City Lord. In such a place, the City Lord, who is the spokesperson of Honor","Absent Palace, actually doesn’t have much authority.”"]},{"number":3097,"title":"Chapter 3097 The Eating Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3097 The Eating Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake!","“On the contrary, if the City Lord wants to gain a foothold here, he needs to cooperate with many powerful local factions.","....","“However, the current City Lord of South Face City has not been replaced for tens of thousands of years. Hence, he must have already established himself in South Face City.","“If Zhao Chen possessed the influential network similar to that of the City Lord of South Face City, it would be considerably easier for him to secure the top grade blessed land. Moreover, if our intention is to vie for ownership of this top grade blessed land, relying solely on intelligence from Zhao Chen’s faction would be insufficient.","“Before the blessed land opens, I suggest that Winter and I split up and let Autumn guard you.","“Winter and I will use our own methods to help you gather more information about South Face City.","“When the time comes, the two of us will contact the City Lord of South Face City. It’s best if we can learn about the strength of the factions participating in the competition for this top grade blessed land from him.”","It had been a while since Spring had been by Lin Yuan’s side. Now that she had the chance to travel with Lin Yuan, she could not help but want to show off.","Autumn and Winter nodded at Spring’s suggestion. Winter nodded because he approved of Spring’s suggestion, while Autumn nodded because he was very satisfied with Spring’s suggestion that he could continue to stay by Lin Yuan’s side and protect him.","Lin Yuan knew very well that he could not rely on Zhao Chen for everything. He and Zhao Chen had a cooperative and competitive relationship. Lin Yuan could not be certain that Zhao Chen would have any bad intentions after he obtained a large amount of resources from this top grade blessed land.","Lin Yuan wouldn’t automatically assume that Zhao Chen would always remain supportive just because of Zhao Chen’s warm demeanor towards him.","“It’s good that Autumn is by my side. Spring, when you and Winter are in action, you should be a little more high-profile and let Winter maintain a low-profile.","“Even if one party engages with a faction, the other party can still establish contact with the same faction.","“It’s unlikely that this top grade blessed land will open up so quickly. We’ll probably need to stay in South Face City for quite some time, which provides us with ample opportunity to strategize.”","Upon hearing this, Spring and Winter nodded seriously. Even experts like Spring and Winter still felt some pressure when exploring this top grade blessed land.","If this news spread, even the factions of the East and the North Universes would also head to South Face City to fight for it.","The opening of this top grade blessed land could be said to have drawn together all the powerful factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","In addition to competing for this top grade blessed land, both Spring and Autumn, as well as Winter, were determined to do everything in their power to ensure Lin Yuan’s safety and spared no effort to prevent any harm from befalling him.","Just as the three of them were discussing, trouble had already come knocking on their door.","This place was less than 500 kilometers away from South Face City. With Lin Yuan and the others’ speed, they could reach the city’s entrance in the blink of an eye. In theory, a radius of 500 kilometers surrounding a major city would typically be considered within the jurisdiction of that city.","Generally speaking, the official factions of the various cities in this area needed to maintain the security of this area. Even if this area wasn’t entirely peaceful, the presence of a star pirate group alliance shouldn’t be expected.","This star pirate group alliance formed by the coalition of five or six star pirate groups possessed the capability to plunder the vast majority of factions. There were more than three Holy Spirit experts in this star pirate group alliance, and such a configuration was rare.","Upon witnessing these star pirate groups targeting Lin Yuan, Autumn was prepared to intervene, but he was halted by Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan said loudly to the manager of the star pirate group alliance, “We’ve just arrived and don’t want to cause trouble in our lives, but you took the initiative to surround us. It seems that we’ve been treated as prey. It’s just that there’s a price to pay for treating others as prey.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, the leading man with gray hair and vertical-slit pupils laughed out loud, “Why? Is this because you’re afraid of threatening us? If you kneel and beg me for mercy, I might consider teaching you a gentle lesson later. An outstanding little fellow like you can fetch a handsome price. If you end up being kept as a plaything in the future, don’t blame me. Blame yourself for venturing into a place like this.”","After saying that, the black-haired man with vertical-slit pupils let out a hiss, and right on the heels of that, all the members of this star pirate group alliance responded to the man with a hiss.","Spring sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, I didn’t expect this star pirate group alliance to be entirely made up of snake-species feys. Under normal circumstances, pirate groups are composed of feys of various species and hence such a situation rarely happens.","“This star pirate group alliance is most likely formed by one or more snake species. A pirate group operating near South Face City undoubtedly holds a wealth of information about happenings within the city itself.","“Compared to killing them all, Young Master, you can first obtain more information from them. If we can gather more information about South Face City, we can enter the city and portray ourselves as a faction expanding from the surrounding areas.","“Knowing the secrets of South Face City will also facilitate our communication with the local factions within the city. Otherwise, if the local factions in South Face City are not sure of our identities, they’re unlikely to feel comfortable engaging in communication or cooperation with us.”","During Lin Yuan’s time in North of the Lonely River, apart from strengthening Blackie, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom, and Purple Afterglow, he had also nurtured the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","Under Lin Yuan’s nurturing, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake had also successfully stepped into the Holy Spirit level. Even if the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was still at the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, its abilities alone could influence this star pirate group alliance formed by snake-species feys.","Lin Yuan had never used the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake in battle before.","During this period, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake had been transforming those star pirates into sub-snakes before devouring them as its nutrients.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake harbored some resentment in its heart for continuously consuming these sub-snakes that had their bloodline forcefully transformed without having the opportunity to consume the outstanding snake-type bloodlines.","In Lin Yuan’s care, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake behaved like a pampered noble who was unable to suffer any grievances.","Especially in the Scarlet Territory, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake had taken a fancy to the Vine Snake and Ancient Water Python experts.","However, because these two species were related to the Bloodians and were partners of the Bloodians, and there was a faction behind the Ancient Water Pythons that was eyeing the Bloodians covetously. Lin Yuan would not share the Vine Snake and Ancient Water Python experts with the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake as food.","Now, with over 400 members in this star pirate group alliance, all possessing snake-species bloodlines, they could conveniently serve as sustenance for the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","Apart from eating them, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could also control these snake-species feys from their bodies to their minds, souls, and bloodlines through Snake Eyes. There was no need to even interrogate these snake-species feys that had joined forces with the star pirates.","With the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s ability to control snake-species feys, this star pirate group alliance would tell Lin Yuan all the information they had.","Lin Yuan did not waste his breath on these star pirates. These star pirates treated Lin Yuan and the others as prey and were preparing to attack Lin Yuan, but then the situation suddenly took a surprising turn. The identities of prey and hunters were swapped in an instant, not giving the members of the star pirate group alliance a chance.","Lin Yuan summoned the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake that was less than half a meter long.","Seeing that there were so many outstanding snake-species feys, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake let out a happy roar. It immediately used its Snake Eye ability, and began to control the members of the star pirate group alliance one by one.","During this process, Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","[Fey Name]: Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake","[Fey Species]: Snake Pupils/Illusion Snake","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Soul","[Fey Quality]: Holy Spirit","[Divine kingdom grade]: Medium","Abilities:","[Snake Eyes]: Controls other snake-species feys through its eyes. When its soul energy is enough to suppress other snake-species feys, it can induce them to contract or sacrifice it (Contract allows control over the snake-type lifeforms. As long as the targeted snake-type lifeforms’ spiritual power does not exceed its own, it will not escape its control. When sacrificing the targeted snake-type lifeforms, it can obtain the energy from its body and use its flesh to strengthen its own physical fitness).","[Snake Coiling Defense]: Coiled its body together, allowing the entire snake body to become one. When it is attacked, it can shrink its body and increase its defense to the greatest extent.","[Soul Forging Armor]: When the soul energy is combined with the snake-species fey’s bloodline, it will form an armor that interweaves with the bloodline on the surface of the body. Not only can it resist physical attacks, but it also has a certain resistance to elemental damage.","[Life Prolonging Shedding]: Under the circumstances of using the Snake Coiling Defense, if the target pierces through the defense and poses a threat to its life, it will instinctively undergo a snake shedding to avoid fatal damage. Each snake shedding weakens the body and diminishes a certain amount of soul strength.","[Swift Snake Shadow]: Increases the snake-species feys under its control, allowing them to react and attack more quickly.","[Violent Venom Burst]: Activate the snake venom in the target’s body, causing the slow-acting snake venom to instantly activate its poison effect and cause timely damage to the target. The poison damage to the target will be converted into healing energy to heal the army of snakes.","[Snake Devouring Rampage]: The snake-type feys under its control will devour each other and increase the strength of the main body in a superimposed manner. It will also cause the devouring main body to enter a berserk state and sacrifice itself to attack the enemy. At the end of its life, its body will explode, and the damage will be equivalent to its full strength attack at its peak.","[Fearless Snake Heart]: All the targets in the snake group will be fearless. The snake heart is as tough as iron and has a certain chance of being immune to mental, soul, and mind abilities. When facing a powerful enemy, even if the enemy uses bloodline deterrence, it can still reveal 100% of its strength.","[Snake Swarm Soul Lock]: In battle, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake transfers its soul into the body of one or several snake-type creatures it controls. When these snake-type lifeforms stare at the target, if the target’s soul is stronger than their own, they can interfere with the target’s soul and restrict the target’s movements. If the target’s soul is weaker than theirs, they will directly freeze the target’s soul and put the target in a state of suspended animation (Locking the soul consumes a lot of their soul energy. Every time they use it, their soul will be in a weakened state for a period of time).","[Soul Box of the Ancestral Snake]: Use its soul energy to weave the soul box and separate a portion of its soul to place in the soul box. When the enemy attacks and causes its own death, the silent soul in the soul box will revive and develop into a new individual.","Exclusive Skill:","[Six Flowers Curse]: Through the Six Flowers Curse in the eye, whenever the target’s body is invaded by poison related to the target, a snake flower will grow from the wound. When the number of snake flowers reaches six, the target’s bloodline will be forcefully changed, turning the target into a sub-snake.","[Control Strengthening]: When contracting a snake-species fey, the contract will be bound to the target’s soul. Once bound to the target’s soul, if the contract is shaken by external influences, the contract will spontaneously sacrifice the target to prevent it from breaking free from its control.","[Brahma Snake Totem]: Transform the totem into a copy on the contractor’s body. The contractor will share the worship of the snake creatures. It can perfectly control the snake creatures it controls and obtain the faith power of these snake creatures.","[Totem Snake Transformation]: Every time a snake-type lifeform undergoes a metamorphosis, a portion of the snake-type lifeform’s subsequent metamorphosis potential will be transferred to the contractor, helping the contractor’s physique and bloodline to undergo a metamorphosis.","[Banner Snake Enlightenment]: Specify a snake-type lifeform that you control and turn this snake-type lifeform into a snake-type banner. The snake-type banner will be enhanced by the snake-type lifeforms in the range. It will increase the attack defense speed, energy recovery, and some unique abilities of the snake-type lifeform. Moreover, the snake-type banner will absorb the vitality of the dead and injured creatures in the range and then heal the snake-type lifeforms.","[Poisonous Wave]: When the target has more than three types of snake venom, ignore the target’s resistance to poison and directly detonate the effect of the snake venom, disintegrating the target’s body.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Snake House Spirit Tamer]: When the snake-type lifeform it controls reaches a certain level of strength, a snake spirit fruit will condense in the soul of the snake-type lifeform it controls. The snake-type lifeform that condenses the snake spirit fruit can contract and control other snake-type lifeforms, causing both sides to become symbiotic.","[Toxin Spirit Control]: The more toxins a snake-species fey contains, the stronger its defense. The units that condense the snake spirit fruit can increase its defense in terms of mind, spirit, and soul. At the same time, it can enhance its poison-related abilities and increase the durability and lethality of the snake-species feys’ toxin."]},{"number":3098,"title":"Chapter 3098 The Livid Xie Lin!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3098 The Livid Xie Lin!","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the divine kingdom ability Toxin Spirit Control that the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake had obtained after reaching the Holy Spirit level.","....","Toxin Spirit Control could be regarded as a defense-type and amplification-type divine kingdom ability. Apart from Snake Coiling Defense and Soul Forging Armor, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s current defensive abilities were only Life Prolonging Shedding and Soul Box of the Ancestral Snake.","No matter how strong the snakes controlled by the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake were, it was the core of the snakes. If the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was in danger, the entire snake group would be destroyed.","Among these four defensive abilities, Life Prolonging Shedding could indeed save one’s life. But every time it was used, it would cause the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake to enter a weakened state.","Soul Box of the Ancestral Snake could be said to be the strongest life-saving ability. It allowed the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake to revive even if it died in battle.","However, the price of using Soul Box of the Ancestral Snake was too high. Every time he used it, it would consume all the accumulation of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","In terms of combat, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake relied on the snakes it controlled. Its methods were enough.","Compared to fighting techniques, Lin Yuan hoped that the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could obtain defensive techniques. Relying on the toxins controlled by the snakes and the condensed Spirit Snake Fruits to strengthen the defense of its body, mind, spirit, and soul was equivalent to an unlimited strengthening of its body.","There were many types of snake creatures in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and the toxins contained in each snake creature were different. Even if the same snake creature lived in the same area, there would be varying degrees of difference after a long period of evolution.","After controlling all the snake creatures in the star pirate groups, the defense of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake would increase by at least three times.","As the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake controlled more and more snake-type creatures through its ability, creatures of the same grade and level would probably find it difficult to break through its defense even if they caught the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake when it was hidden among the snakes.","Apart from increasing defense, it could also enhance its poison-related abilities.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s poison-related abilities were Violent Venom Burst and its exclusive skill was Poisonous Waves.","This could be considered the best way for creatures with poison.","Moreover, Violent Venom Burst also had a certain healing ability. It could heal snake creatures that were injured in the snake group by exploding the poison in the target’s body for a moment. Moreover, Toxin Spirit Control increased the durability and lethality of poison, targeting the entire snake group.","Through the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, Lin Yuan had a clear understanding of the importance of bloodlines.","Apart from Lin Yuan’s meticulous nurturing, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s strength was mostly due to its supreme snake-species fey bloodline.","Under the effect of Snake Eye, the snake creatures that were being controlled by the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake would be controlled one after another.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake would choose the snake-type creatures it liked to control first. Apart from strength, what the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake saw was bloodline.","It was not that the members of this joint star pirate group had never thought of resisting. As a Holy Spirit snake-type lifeform, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was not strong enough to restrict the movements of all the members of this joint star pirate group.","The Snake Eyes controlled snake-type creatures one after another.","The reason these star pirates were obediently under the control of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was that when Lin Yuan summoned the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, Autumn had already taken the initiative to use his aura to control all the members of this joint star pirate group.","It did not take long for this alliance of hundreds of star pirates to be completely controlled.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake let out a satisfied sigh and said, “Father, it’s been a long time since I obtained so much outstanding blood food! I’ll eat some of those with mediocre aptitudes as food to improve myself. I’ll keep those with the potential for targeted training. These few fellows whose strength has reached the Holy Spirit level can directly condense Snake Spirit Fruits for me!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he saw the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s satisfied expression. Then, he said seriously, “If you control all the members of this joint star pirate gang, you will be able to clearly understand the secrets of these star pirate gang members. Sort out the information they know about South Face City and explain the situation to Genius.”","Lin Yuan summoned Genius and hugged it.","When the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake heard Lin Yuan’s command, it immediately began to move. Soon, Lin Yuan learned about the situation in South Face City from Genius’ exclusive skill, Connected Tails.","Lin Yuan also asked Genius to inform Spring, Autumn, and Winter.","“Young Master, I didn’t expect this joint star pirate group to be personally controlled by South Face City’s City Lord, Xie Lin! Furthermore, the number of star pirates under Xie Lin’s control exceeds 50. These years, relying on these joint star pirates to plunder everywhere in South Face City is enough to maintain the expenses of the city lord’s mansion.”","Xie Lin also nurtured mercenary forces in South Face City and led the establishment of a mercenary hiring center.","Merchant groups that hired mercenaries in the mercenary hiring center would be able to avoid the pursuit of star pirates. Those forces that did not go to the mercenary hiring center to seek protection from mercenaries would not only be robbed of their resources, but they would also suffer heavy casualties.","This caused many chambers of commerce to flee from South Face City. Those chambers of commerce that did not flee South Face City were accepted their fate of hiring mercenaries to protect their safety.","Xie Lin had earned all the resources inside and out.","It would be fine if it was just a straightforward plan. But the key was that even if they hired mercenaries, they could not guarantee their safety.","If the value of the resources transported was too high and the mercenaries found out, they would become coordinates to attract the star pirates to plunder.","Lin Yuan sighed.","It was indeed a little difficult to manage and develop forces in a chaotic place like South Face City.","It was also because a large city like South Face City, which was at the intersection of the North and South Universes, often had a large number of people constantly replenishing the forces in the city.","If it was another City Lord obtained resources in this way, this city would probably have long been exhausted. As the factions continued to move, the city would have become poorer and poorer.","As soon as Spring finished speaking, Winter could not help but say, “This City Lord of South Face City is either very strong or possesses extraordinary means. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have done such a thing.","“I don’t recommend contacting the City Lord of South Face City now. It’s easy to cause trouble if we interact with him. Maybe he’ll use our interaction to target us instead. This kind of trick makes everyone his prey.","“Zhao Chen’s faction has a rather high status in South Face City. He must be familiar with the City Lord of South Face City. Just ask Zhao Chen if there’s any information.”","Lin Yuan shook his head with a cold expression.","“As long as we want to move in South Face City, we can’t avoid the eyes of the City Lord unless we hide and don’t make any big moves. Therefore, we still have to make contact with the City Lord of South Face City.","“I hope he doesn’t take the initiative to cause trouble. Otherwise, we’ll teach the City Lord of South Face City an unforgettable lesson and let him know that not just anyone can be provoked!","“If not for the fact that this top-notch blessed land is about to be opened and I don’t want to complicate matters, I would have wanted to deal with the City Lord of South Face City.”","Autumn laughed when he heard Lin Yuan’s words.","“Winter, you’re just worried too much. How much trouble can a mere City Lord of South Face City cause? It’s beneficial for us to know that the City Lord Manor is monopolizing all the local forces in South Face City so that we don’t have to trouble ourselves to come into contact with the other local forces in South Face City.","“I need to stay by Young Master’s side. Only the two of you can really move. Rather than setting up a big stall, it’s better to spend all your strength and effort on the most important goal. Even if we really get rid of this City Lord of South Face City, it won’t affect our goal.”","Autumn had never been like Spring and Winter who liked to consider the consequences. Most of the time, as long as one’s fist was big enough, there was no need to worry too much about the consequences.","Spring and Winter both knew that Autumn’s personality was flawed, so it was more suitable for him to stay by Lin Yuan’s side and be responsible for protecting him.","“Spring and Winter, since you already have a goal and plan, why don’t the two of you take action now? These joint star pirate groups have ways to communicate with each other. Autumn and I can eliminate the other forty or so joint star pirate groups outside the city in the next few days.","“The City Lord of South Face City would never have thought that someone would dare to attack his star pirates. It’s easier to facilitate your cooperation with him by weakening his strength at such a time.","“From the information we just received, we can confirm that most of the star pirates are snake-type lifeforms. There aren’t many opportunities for the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake to obtain resources like now. If it encounters them, it will definitely cherish them. It will also prevent these star pirates from harming others.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s command, Spring and Winter signaled to Autumn with their eyes that he must take good care of Lin Yuan and protect him. He must not let anything happen to him. Then, the two of them set off for South Face City.","Autumn accompanied Lin Yuan to deal with the joint star pirates who were wreaking havoc everywhere. In less than three days, more than 30 joint star pirates were annihilated by Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not pity these star pirates who were plundering and hunting everywhere. When Lin Yuan found these star pirates, several of them were plundering caravans. Lin Yuan felt helpless and could not bear to see this. These factions that were making a living in South Face City were really living a little too hard.","These chambers of commerce definitely did not know the reason why there were frequent casualties when they sent out caravans. If they did not have enough strength in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, this would be the result. There was no such thing as luck.","According to Lin Yuan’s information, South Face City was a large-scale meat grinder. Many factions that had no choice but to move to South Face City for various reasons had died out in the past hundreds of years.","A few hundred years was a long time in the main world but a few hundred years in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was just a blink of an eye.","Most of these forces that were forced to settle in South Face City were bullied by other factions and were forced to hide. Otherwise, if there was no reason, which faction would be willing to leave their hometown?","Unfortunately, these factions were not treated well in South Face City.","While Lin Yuan was dealing with these joint star pirates, South Face City’s City Lord, Xie Lin, already knew that the joint star pirate groups under his command had been obstructed. This was because the leaders of these star pirates would report their gains to Xie Lin every two days, rain or shine.","These joint star pirate groups were controlled by Xie Lin in a special way. Every few days, they would get a potion from Xie Lin.","If nothing happened to the captains of these star pirate groups, there was no way they would not be in danger.","...","Xie Lin was determined to have the unaffected star pirate groups investigate the matter immediately. However, he soon lost contact with the pirate groups he had previously been able to reach.","This was a critical moment for Xie Lin, as the members of these star pirate groups were closely tied to his own power base.","In a fit of anger, Xie Lin killed the adjutant standing beside him.","“Damn it! Who’s causing trouble in my territory?”","With the opening of the top grade blessed land, various factions had gathered in South Face City.","Xie Lin had specifically instructed the joint star pirate groups to avoid provoking powerful factions and to target only the weaker ones.","These factions saw the top grade blessed land as a significant resource and hoped to capitalize on it. This strategy allowed Xie Lin to capture numerous victims.","Initially, Xie Lin considered recalling these joint star pirate groups at a crucial moment. However, he ultimately decided against it, as he did not want to forgo the potential prey.","The loss of these 50 star pirate groups was substantial, even for Xie Lin, making it difficult for him to bear.","More importantly, Xie Lin did not know which faction was responsible. It was clear that this force was specifically targeting the joint star pirate groups.","These groups had limited resources, and since the members were snake-species feys—most of them venomous—defeating them would not typically lead to an attack on the factions.","Xie Lin had placed three Holy Spirit experts in each joint star pirate group. It was evident to him that the destruction of these 50 groups was a deliberate act by a force aiming to undermine him at this critical moment.","When asked how many factions in South Face City held grudges against him, Xie Lin could only admit that there were countless.","The sheer number of factions with grievances against him made it challenging for Xie Lin to pinpoint the one targeting him.","Many factions had intended to visit City Lord Xie Lin upon arriving in South Face City.","Initially, Xie Lin had no plans to engage with these factions. However, with the disappearance of the 50 star pirate groups and the 150 Holy Spirit experts, he found himself with no choice but to reconsider."]},{"number":3099,"title":"Chapter 3099 A Chessboard Opens!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3099 A Chessboard Opens!","Xie Lin started to contact those factions that came to visit him, wondering if he could rope them in. Then, these factions who had rushed over from other places and did not know each other well would form an alliance with him as the core.","....","His family members would have to wait for a while before arriving. Even if they arrived, they would not reveal their relationship to the outside world.","Before this, he could build a cannon fodder army for his family to explore this top grade blessed land. It would be best if there were some powerful experts in this cannon fodder army. Otherwise, Xie Lin would not be able to explain such losses to his family.","Previously, although Xie Lin did not think much of those forces that took the initiative to visit him, he still had people register these factions.","Xie Lin started to contact the factions on the list one by one.","After knowing Xie Lin’s purpose, some factions directly rejected Xie Lin’s invitation, saying that they had no intention of forming an alliance to act together with Xie Lin.","However, there were still some forces who felt that Xie Lin, the City Lord of South Face City, not only understood the situation in South Face City, but also had an extraordinary prestige there.","Compared to the resources produced in a top grade blessed lands, it was better to accept the recruitment of the City Lord of South Face City.","When Xie Lin recruited more and more factions, the alliance became stronger and stronger.","Not only did the safety factor increase greatly, but there was also a chance to get a share of the resources in the top grade blessed land.","...","Spring and Winter came into contact with Xie Lin. Spring displayed the battle prowess of pinnacle Holy Spirit level. On the other hand, the combat strength Winter displayed had surpassed the Holy Spirit level and reached a level above it.","Spring and Winter were both solo experts with no one following them.","Xie Lin’s goal was to build a cannon fodder army. He did not think highly of these solo powerhouses.","Although these solo experts were alone, they were often used to being free.","Xie Lin acted indifferently toward Spring and did not try his best to persuade Spring to join this alliance.","However, his attitude toward Winter and Spring were worlds apart.","After confirming that Winter’s strength had surpassed the Holy Spirit level, Xie Lin not only personally received Winter but also treated him as a distinguished guest.","Just like the gap between the Divine Kingdom level and the Holy Spirit level, there was also a gap between the Holy Spirit level and the level above it. Moreover, it was even more difficult to break through this hurdle.","Xie Lin’s attitude toward Winter was not fake at all. When he met a powerhouse above the Holy Spirit level, Xie Lin really wanted to recruit Winter.","However, Xie Lin did not know Winter’s background, so he could not invite him.","Winter agreed to join the alliance formed by Xie Lin, which made Xie Lin very excited.","Winter had completely integrated into Xie Lin’s side, immediately getting information from Xie Lin.","Xie Lin did not think there was anything wrong with that. It was very normal for a few lone travelers who had rushed over from outside to understand the information about South Face City and that top grade blessed land.","In order to successfully win Winter over, Xie Lin very generously shared a lot of information with him.","...","Winter told Lin Yuan the information he had obtained from Xie Lin through the Thoughts Letter Paper. There were many pieces of information that Winter was suspicious of. When he told Lin Yuan, he had specially labeled these pieces of information.","Lin Yuan’s understanding of the situation in South Face City became clearer. There was a lot of information that Lin Yuan could verify easily. He only needed to wait for Zhao Chen to arrive and ask him.","No matter what, Zhao Chen would not lie to him. Even if he lied to him, he probably would not go against Xie Lin’s account. This was unless Zhao Chen’s faction was also deceived by Xie Lin.","Lin Yuan, who had already entered South Face City, could not help but think, As more and more people gather in the city, at least half of the people in South Face City will disappear before that top grade blessed land opens.","Lin Yuan was sure that not only could he see this, but the other factions that came and went from South Face City were also clear about it.","However, no matter how much risk there was, it was difficult to stop those forces from coming here. It was very normal for the major factions of the Sky Beyond the Clouds to risk their lives just for a small opportunity.","Qin Yu, who was in the Scarlet Territory, had contacted Lin Yuan not long ago and told him about this top grade blessed land that was about to be opened in South Face City.","Qin Yu had the intention to bring people to South Face City to fight for an opportunity to obtain benefits.","After knowing that Lin Yuan had already gone to South Face City to fight for this top grade blessed land, Qin Yu gave up on the idea of going there.","The Scarlet Territory was extremely far from South Face City. Recently, the factions in the Scarlet Territory had been constantly reorganizing and basically did not communicate with the outside world.","However, the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory had received news of the opening of this top grade paradise.","Diverse City was indeed not close to South Face City. Yet, Zhao Chen had obtained the information through his family that had taken root at the intersection of the North and South Universes.","Lin Yuan asked Qin Yu in detail how she knew the information. Qin Yu said that the Ancient Water Pythons had taken the initiative to send the information over.","The Bloodians did not have the means to receive this information.","The bloodline of pythons and snakes was extremely similar. For example, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could control most python-type creatures with Snake Eye.","Lin Yuan could not help but think of the joint 50 star pirates formed by South Face City’s City Lord. The power behind the Ancient Water Pythons could not be related to the power behind Xie Lin, right?","However, the Ancient Water Pythons were probably unaware of such a huge change in the Bloodians.","This was because the Bloodian Queen who was on good terms with the Ancient Water Pythons had already been dealt with. There was no chance to send a message to the Ancient Water Pythons.","The Ancient Water Pythons sold to the Bloodians, and under such circumstances, they chose to cooperate with the Bloodians with great fanfare.","Rather than saying that they were cooperating, it would be more accurate to say that the Ancient Water Pythons wanted to inform the Bloodians so that they could set off for South Face City.","Lin Yuan had two guesses. If the faction behind the Ancient Water Pythons was related to the faction behind Xie Lin, the Ancient Water Pythons hoped that more factions would gather in South Face City when they spread the news, causing the waters in South Face City to become muddier and muddier.","However, this way, more and more powerful factions would gather, and it would be even harder to obtain resources from this top grade blessed land!","If that was the case, the hands that pushed the various factions to head to South Face City must not only be after this top grade blessed land itself.","Spring had already investigated the energy fluctuations coming from the island 2,000 kilometers west of South Face City. It was indeed the energy fluctuations of a top grade blessed land before it was about to open. Therefore, the opening of this top grade blessed land was not a scam.","Another conjecture was that the Ancient Water Pythons had received the news and wanted to use it to take away a portion of the Bloodians’ power before attacking the Scarlet Territory.","Previously, Lin Yuan had left the Scarlet Territory’s matters to Autumn to help the Bloodians deal with the trouble.","After telling Autumn about this, Lin Yuan had not asked about it.","“Autumn, have you investigated the forces behind the Ancient Water Pythons?”","Autumn shook his head gently when he heard Lin Yuan’s question.","“Young Master, the Ancient Water Pythons are just a small fry. I dug out the faction behind them and it’s the Falling Water Vipers. However, the factions behind the Falling Water Vipers are intertwined. There are as many as five factions. Moreover, there are other factions behind these five factions.","“After discovering this, I did not alert the enemy. Instead, I thought that the power behind Falling Water Vipers would appear sooner or later. I left an autumn leaf clone in the Scarlet Territory. This autumn leaf clone can support the Bloodians in terms of martial force and help them solve their problems.","“Judging from the number of factions gathered in South Face City, Young Master, there are too many of them. Moreover, these factions are still increasing. When the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace, Ling Muzhuo, arrives here, he should give you an answer.","“Following the factions behind Zhao Chen in such a complicated situation can’t help us much. Fortune Treasure Palace is more suitable than Zhao Chen.”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before rejecting Autumn’s suggestion. Even if he did not join Fortune Treasure Palace, Ling Muzhuo would definitely tell him if he wanted to know.","It was not a good thing to be too high-profile when so many factions were gathered. As the saying went, the hunter will shoot the bird that sticks out. If he was too high-profile, he would easily become the target of other factions and the target of many factions.","Observing the situation on Zhao Chen’s side and interacting with the factions around him was the best choice now. In a situation where he did not know how to act, he could only respond to the changes with inaction!","Zhao Chen contacted Lin Yuan as soon as he arrived in South Face City.","Zhao Chen said in a heavy tone, “Brother Lin, I received news from my family that the situation in South Face City is not right. Do you still want to participate in the fight for this top grade blessed land?","“After the family’s evaluation, they felt that the risk factor was too high. They even had the intention to terminate the operation. I heard from Father that the family has already moved two of the direct bloodlines out of the range of South Face City.”","Zhao Chen felt very upset when he said this.","It was not easy for him to obtain high-quality resources from his family. Yet, these resources had changed in his hands.","The family’s evaluation of the risk was too high. They even transferred two of the direct bloodlines away.","This had never happened before. Could it be that the family was afraid of being destroyed and was deliberately preserving their bloodline? If that was the case, it would be equivalent to being abandoned by his family!","Zhao Chen genuinely wanted to befriend Lin Yuan. In Zhao Chen’s eyes, Lin Yuan was warm and charitable.","After promising him Grade 5 Creator resources, he immediately sent an intermediate Grade 5 Creator over without any hesitation.","Lin Yuan had generously provided him with resources that his family had never provided him with before.","Zhao Chen was afraid that Lin Yuan would suffer too many losses in this operation and sever ties with him or even become his enemy.","Hence, Zhao Chen informed Lin Yuan of the situation as soon as they met, and Lin Yuan made his own decision.","Otherwise, under normal circumstances, Zhao Chen would not have directly revealed his family’s arrangements.","Lin Yuan smiled when he heard Zhao Chen’s words. Since Zhao Chen could say such things to him, it meant that Zhao Chen really treated him as a friend.","“Brother Zhao, you’re right. The situation in South Face City is indeed abnormal. I originally thought that the news of the opening of this top grade blessed land was protected by the local factions in South Face City to prevent other factions from fighting over it. I didn’t expect this news to spread like wildfire. Many factions have already received the news and are rushing towards South Face City. Brother Zhao, which faction do you think spread the news?”","Zhao Chen heaved a sigh of relief when he saw that Lin Yuan did not blame him for the change in the situation in South Face City.","However, Zhao Chen laughed bitterly.","“I’ve always been developing in Diverse City. In the past tens of thousands of years, I’ve rarely returned to my family. I don’t know much about the situation in South Face City. The people I brought this time are all my trusted aides who have always been in Diverse City with me.","“Brother Lin, you’ve asked the wrong person. If you want to know the situation, I can contact my friends who have always been in South Face City and obtain information from them. At that time, no matter what they say, we can judge for ourselves whether they believe us or not.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","“Brother Zhao, I don’t have any channels to obtain information in South Face City. I’ll have to trouble you to do this! I think it’s very necessary for us to understand more information about South Face City so that we can make a decision later.”","Lin Yuan actually had his own channels to obtain information in South Face City.","Winter had taken root in the City Lord Manor of South Face City. With Winter’s intention, his relationship with Xie Lin quickly warmed up. Xie Lin had already begun to have the intention of trying to recruit Winter.","As for Spring, she joined an alliance of factions as a pinnacle Holy Spirit expert. There were many people in this alliance.","Although the strength of each faction was not too strong and some factions only had experts at beginner Holy Spirit level, there were enough factions in this alliance, including the local factions in South Face City. This allowed Spring to receive all kinds of real and fake information every day.","Many of the messages were conflicting, so it was difficult to tell if they were real or fake.","After sorting out the information, Spring told Lin Yuan that it was very important to grasp the information at this time.","Lin Yuan received multiple information for comparison, which was beneficial for making the right choice.","The various factions in South Face City were inevitably nervous in the chaos.","However, Lin Yuan did not feel nervous because he was sure that Spring, Autumn, and Winter would definitely be able to protect him.","The reason he was acting a little timid now was that he did not want to become the target of public criticism before the blessed land opened.","Zhao Chen had already told Lin Yuan about the situation in South Face City. Zhao Chen did not expect Lin Yuan to not change his mind even after knowing the situation in South Face City.","Lin Yuan had asked for four spots, which meant that apart from Lin Yuan, there were very likely only three people following him."]},{"number":3100,"title":"Chapter 3100 Lin Yuan’s Trade Fair!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3100 Lin Yuan’s Trade Fair!","Lin Yuan, this little fellow who had only lived for a few decades, did not have any strength to speak of.","....","Zhao Chen did not understand how confident Lin Yuan was to be sure that the three people he had brought with him could fight for this top grade blessed land while protecting him.","The faction behind Zhao Chen was powerful enough. Moreover, many of the people Zhao Chen had hired had grown up with him.","If Zhao Chen asked these people for resources or asked them to send people to help him, these people would more or less hesitate. If it was just asking these people for information, these people had no reason to reject Zhao Chen.","“Brother Lin, then I’ll find my friends in South Face City and ask them for information. Brother Lin, do you know what you’re going to say to them? If you’re willing to interact with them, I’m sure they’ll be very happy!”","Zhao Chen was willing to use his connections because of Lin Yuan’s words but using connections also required a favor.","Zhao Chen wanted to introduce Lin Yuan to his friends.","Firstly, it was to help Lin Yuan. Secondly, knowing that Lin Yuan had Grade 5 Creator resources, his friends would thank him and owe him a favor.","Lin Yuan knew what Zhao Chen was up to, so he did not reject him.","It was a good thing for Lin Yuan to get to know more of South Face City’s local faction members.","After coming to South Face City, Lin Yuan had kept a low profile because he did not want to complicate matters, but he was not afraid that trouble would take the initiative to find him. With Winter around, there was no problem that could not be solved.","Lin Yuan did not have Sun Yin by his side or another Grade 5 Creator available. This did not prevent Lin Yuan from cooperating with the local factions in South Face City.","After this storm ended, Lin Yuan could send Grade 5 Creators over at any time. At the same time, he had a large number of Grade 4 Creator resources.","These Grade 4 Creator resources could be used at will.","“Brother Zhao, I’m naturally willing to interact with the friends you introduce to me. Now that the situation in South Face City is changing, we need to have a precise understanding of the situation as soon as possible. So, Brother Zhao, you need to act as soon as possible!”","Lin Yuan’s reply was equivalent to Lin Yuan agreeing to use him to gain favors.","However, Zhao Chen became nervous after a few seconds of happiness.","Zhao Chen was afraid that Lin Yuan would have a better relationship with the people he introduced to him. If Lin Yuan were to cooperate with others, the value that Lin Yuan could bring to him would be greatly reduced.","It had to be known that there was basically no local faction in South Face City that did not trade talents. The outstanding talent resources that he could bring to Lin Yuan could also be brought to Lin Yuan by others, and they could even bring more to Lin Yuan.","However, he had already told Lin Yuan and Lin Yuan had agreed. It would not be good for him to go back on his word.","Moreover, if Lin Yuan released the news that he had Grade 5 Creator resources, many factions would be willing to contact him. He could not stop him even if he wanted to.","It was already the best choice for Zhao Chen to use this opportunity to earn some favors.","Zhao Chen contacted his old friends with mixed feelings. Only when he contacted them did he know that half of his old friends had already left South Face City. This made Zhao Chen realize the danger of South Face City again.","Zhao Chen could sense that his old friends in South Face City were more or less flustered. When he said that he wanted to get together, only a few people responded. Most people chose to reject him.","However, when Zhao Chen said that he wanted to introduce Lin Yuan, who had Grade 5 Creator resources, the few old friends who had already declined changed the topic and expressed that they could gather at any time. Their attitudes toward Zhao Chen were much more enthusiastic than before.","This made Zhao Chen speechless. The relationship between these old friends and him was simply too fake. Those who rejected him had completely disregarded their childhood friendship.","However, this was normal. All these years, he had not been developing in South Face City. To his old friends, he had already become a so-called useless person.","On the contrary, because of Lin Yuan, his cold old friends had chosen to curry favor with him again.","Zhao Chen did his best to gather everyone he could and arranged to meet at Water Pavilion.","The Water Pavilion was the Zhao family’s business in South Face City. It was more convenient to meet old friends in their own business and it was also safer.","Since Lin Yuan had asked him to set up a trap, Zhao Chen did not want any accidents to make Lin Yuan question his ability.","Zhao Chen and Lin Yuan had been waiting in Water Pavilion for a long time. Zhao Chen had thought that his old friends would be very slow. After all, there were too many things to do in South Face City.","Most of the people who stayed in South Face City had to fight for the resources produced in this top grade blessed land.","Zhao Chen originally thought that it would be good enough if these people could reach the Water Pavilion in two days. But he did not expect them to reach the Water Pavilion in less than half a day.","Zhao Chen did not think that he had such face. These people had gathered at the Water Pavilion so quickly because of Lin Yuan, who had Grade 5 Creator resources.","...","“Brother Lin, try the special delicacies of South Face City here first. I’ll go see them first. I’ll explain the situation to them first. It won’t be good if I contradict you when I see you later. Most of them are here for the Grade 5 Creator resources you have. I won’t let them negotiate with you as soon as they’re here.”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows and replied, “Since these people are all your friends and have been gathered by you, there’s nothing wrong with giving them some practical benefits right off the bat. This way, after I get the information I want to know, I can make the decision to hold a trade fair.","“At this trade fair, I’ll take out spirit qi crystals with a higher concentration of spirit qi than before to exchange for others’ resources. These spirit qi crystals are all equivalent to pinnacle Grade 4 Creators.","“If everyone wants to obtain Creator resources, they can take out more resources on hand. This will also increase everyone’s cohesion. When the time comes, I’ll have to trouble Brother Zhao to host this trade fair!”","Zhao Chen was pleasantly surprised when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. Zhao Chen did not expect Lin Yuan to say this. Lin Yuan’s actions were equivalent to revealing the resources in his hands.","Although Lin Yuan did not take out Grade 5 Creator resources, pinnacle Grade 4 Creator resources would still cause people to fight over them.","The resources of a pinnacle Grade 4 Creator were completely different from those of an ordinary Grade 4 Creator.","More importantly, Lin Yuan had allowed him to oversee this matter, which directly increased his importance in the eyes of others. It also showed the closeness of his relationship with Lin Yuan. It seemed that he had a rather high status in Lin Yuan’s heart. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have given him such an important task.","“Brother Lin, I’ll get them to prepare more supplies later. Leave this trade fair to me. I can guarantee that nothing will go wrong. At that time, I’ll help you check the price of the materials they take out according to the market price in South Face City. I definitely won’t let you suffer at this trade fair!”","In Zhao Chen’s heart, Lin Yuan had roped in these people to win their hearts and facilitate future operations.","However, Lin Yuan did not think so. Instead, he hoped to use this opportunity to obtain more resources for himself. It would be best if he could bring in a batch of high-end talents for Sky City.","Winter told Lin Yuan after Zhao Chen left, “Young Master, you made the right choice to use Zhao Chen’s connections to gather these people. However, it’s inevitable that some people will pay attention to the gathering of the local factions in South Face City.","“If the target is too big, he will definitely be targeted. At that time, don’t be in a hurry to attack. You can take this opportunity to see the trump cards of these local factions in South Face City. I’ll also see if they’re willing to contribute to this alliance for the sake of Creator resources.","“If we can expand this alliance before this top grade blessed land opens, it will be very beneficial for us in fighting for this top grade blessed land. The opening of top grade blessed lands is too grand of an affair and there are many entrances. The number of people who can pass through these entrances at once is limited. Without enough manpower, it’s very difficult to enter the top grade blessed land in time.","“I think Xie Lin won’t ignore this alliance formed by the local forces of South Face City. Young Master, you’ll have the chance to meet Xie Lin personally! If you can get a chance to trade with Xie Lin, you will definitely gain a lot!","“Xie Lin has nurtured so many joint star pirates. Most of the rare resources near South Face City have been collected by Xie Lin in various ways. I have a feeling that the power behind Xie Lin is definitely at the level of Fortune Treasure Palace, maybe even stronger than Fortune Treasure Palace!”","Lin Yuan nodded.","Lin Yuan did not approve of Xie Lin’s actions but he could not deny that it was cruel in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Getting in touch with the faction behind Xie Lin would help Lin Yuan understand the Sky Beyond the Clouds better.","The factions behind Xie Lin dared to do this, yet Honor Absent Palace had never pursued them. The power behind Xie Lin must also have an extraordinary position in Honor Absent Palace.","...","Looking at these old friends gathered together, Zhao Chen did not feel any sense of closeness because Zhao Chen had just been rejected by these old friends.","However, these old friends did not seem to remember what they did. There was no awkwardness on their faces.","The woman with red hair, eyebrows, and hair was the first to speak. “Zhao Chen, I haven’t seen you for a long time. You’re really getting more and more popular. You actually have Grade 5 Creator resources! All of us are here to support you. You must introduce us properly later so that our years of friendship will not be in vain!”","With that, the woman took out a brocade box and handed it to Zhao Chen.","The thing in the brocade box was obviously a gift that this woman had prepared for Zhao Chen.","After this woman spoke, most people’s expressions turned a little ugly because these people did not prepare gifts for Zhao Chen like this woman did.","As for those who prepared the gifts, they handed them to Zhao Chen with warm smiles.","A few of them gave Zhao Chen captives they had captured in the southern battlefield.","Zhao Chen accepted these gifts happily. He had never received so many gifts from these people since he was born.","Zhao Chen did not plan to keep these gifts for himself. When he saw Lin Yuan later, he would give them all to him. This was because Zhao Chen knew very well why these people would give him gifts.","Although these gifts would not end up in Zhao Chen’s own pocket, Zhao Chen could already feel the feeling of being flattered.","“We’re all friends. There’s really no need to be so polite! Young Master Lin wants me to hold a trade fair. This trade fair might be a little special compared to the trade fairs you participated in previously. In the past, you were the ones who went to buy things with money. This time, you will use all kinds of resources to exchange for Grade 4 Creator resources from Young Master Lin.","“In order not to waste time, you can go back and prepare now. Any kind of resources is fine. As for whether we can negotiate a deal in the end, it depends on whether Young Master Lin likes the resources you’re offering.","“I advise you to bring as many high-quality resources as possible. This deal is not for you to take advantage of. With such thoughts, not only will you not get anything but you will also waste such a good opportunity. If you can satisfy Young Master Lin this time, there might be a chance to continue trading in the future!”","Everyone was from a powerful faction and was a direct descendant of their family. They hated Zhao Chen’s behavior of using his words to intimidate others.","However, Zhao Chen’s words moved everyone present.","Was there such a good opportunity to exchange for Grade 4 Creator resources?","It had to be known that converting various resources into Grade 4 Creator resources usually required begging those Grade 4 Creators for help.","All the members present had access to Grade 4 Creators. At the level of Grade 4 Creators, they had such an advanced status. Very few people would really invest their time in the production of resources. Compared to producing a large amount of supplies, these Grade 4 Creators were more willing to enjoy life in various ways.","This was also the main reason the major factions had more than one Grade 4 Creator but Creator resources were still so expensive.","The red-haired woman who had given the gift to Zhao Chen first asked with a gentle smile, “Brother Zhao, there are a lot of Grade 4 Creator resources. What kind of Grade 4 Creator resources does Young Master Lin intend to trade?","“If it’s those potions that target the evolution of the bloodline of special species, although they’re precious, they’re not very useful to us. Even though we can sell it to others in the future, there will always be another layer of trouble. Tell us the details of the Grade 4 Creator resources that Young Master Lin will use to trade for supplies. It will be easier for us to obtain resources from the family.”"]}]);
